he carried the alligator to his truck and drove away . mia and leo waved goodbye to him and the alligator . they were happy that the pond was safe again . they decided to play somewhere else and leave the ducks and the fish alone . tom and sue like to play with their net . they use it to catch bugs and fish in the pond . one day , they see a big frog on a rock . they want to catch it with their net .

