they both go to sleep . the mouse snuggles next to tom and rubs his nose against his fur . tom feels warm and cozy . he thinks , " maybe being lazy is not so bad . maybe having a friend is nice . " he purrs and closes his eyes . lily was a little girl who loved to play with her robot . her robot was mighty and could do many things . it could run , jump , dance , and sing . lily and her robot had fun every day .

