the moral of the story is : listen to your robot . sleep is good for you . it makes you grow and learn and dream . if you sleep , tomorrow you can play more . spike was a dog who lived with a boy and a girl . the boy and the girl loved spike very much . they gave him a name , a bed , a bowl , and many toys . they also gave him hugs and kisses and treats . spike was a very happy dog .

