mom carried lily to her bed and tucked her in . she kissed her again and said , " good night , lily . sweet dreams . "

lily said , " good night , mom . sweet dreams . "

mom turned off the light and left the room . lily closed her eyes and felt happy and safe in her bed . she did not miss her crib anymore . she had learned a lesson . she had revealed her mistake and faced her shame . she had received love and forgiveness . she had grown a little bit more . she was a big girl now . lila and tom were playing on the beach . they liked to create things with sand and shells . they made a big castle with a tower and a flag . they made a bridge with sticks and stones . they made a boat with a shell and a leaf .

" look at our boat ! " lila said . " it can sail on the water ! "

" let 's try it ! " tom said . they put the boat on the edge of the water and watched it float .

but then a big wave came and took the boat away . lila and tom ran after it , but they could not catch it . the boat was too fast and too far .

" help ! help ! " they cried . " our boat is gone ! "

but no one heard them . their mom and dad were busy talking to their friends . they did not see lila and tom running into the water .

the water was deep and cold . lila and tom could not swim . they felt helpless and scared . they tried to hold on to each other , but the wave pulled them apart .

they sank under the water and did not come up again .

the moral of the story is : do not go into the water without an adult . it is dangerous and you can drown . anna and ben like to watch films . they have a big tv in their living room . sometimes they watch films about animals , or princesses , or cars . they laugh and clap when they see something funny or exciting .

one night , anna and ben watch a film about a dragon . the dragon is big and green and has wings . he can fly and breathe fire . he is angry at the people who want to take his treasure . he roars and chases them away . anna and ben are scared , but they also think the dragon is cool .

when the film is over , anna and ben go to bed . they brush their teeth and put on their pajamas . they hug their mom and dad and say good night . they go to their rooms and turn off the lights .

anna falls asleep quickly . she dreams about the dragon . she dreams that she is his friend . she rides on his back and flies in the sky . she sees the stars and the moon . she feels happy and free .

ben also falls asleep , but he has a different dream . he dreams that he is one of the people who want to take the dragon 's treasure . he sneaks into the dragon 's cave and finds a pile of gold and jewels . he tries to grab some , but the dragon wakes up . he sees ben and gets very angry . he roars and breathes fire at him . ben feels afraid and runs away .

anna and ben wake up in the morning . they go to the kitchen and have breakfast . they tell their mom and dad about their dreams .

" i dreamed about the dragon , " anna says . " he was my friend and we flew together . it was fun . "

" i dreamed about the dragon , too , " ben says . " but he was not my friend . he was angry and tried to burn me . it was scary . "

anna and ben look at each other . they wonder why they had such different dreams . they decide to watch another film tonight . maybe they will have the same dream then . ben and jen are twins . they like to play with their toys and eat snacks . one day , they find a bag of black beans in the kitchen . they think they are small balls .

" look , ben , black balls ! " jen says . she takes some beans and throws them in the air .

" black balls , black balls ! " ben repeats . he catches some beans and puts them in his pocket .

mom sees them and gets angry . " no , no , no , ben and jen ! those are not balls , those are beans ! beans are for eating , not for playing ! " she says . she takes the bag of beans and puts it on the shelf .

" beans , beans ! " ben and jen repeat . they want to play with the beans again .

they wait until mom is busy . then they climb on a chair and reach for the bag of beans . but the chair is wobbly and they fall down . the bag of beans rips and the beans spill all over the floor .

" oh , no , ben and jen ! what have you done ? " mom says . she comes and sees the mess . she is very mad .

" sorry , mom , sorry ! " ben and jen repeat . they help mom clean up the beans . they promise not to play with the beans again .

mom hugs them and forgives them . she says , " next time , ask me before you take something from the kitchen . and remember , beans are for eating , not for playing ! "

ben and jen nod and say , " okay , mom , okay ! "

they eat some beans for lunch . they think they are yummy . they do not want to play with them anymore . they play with their toys and eat snacks . they are happy . anna and ben were best friends . they liked to play outside and look at the sky . one day , they saw a big , bright star . it was shining more than the other stars . they wanted to see it better .

" let 's go closer to the star , " anna said . " maybe it has a wonder for us . "

" ok , " ben said . " but how do we get there ? "

they found a big hill near their house . they climbed up the hill . it was hard and tiring , but they did not give up . they reached the top of the hill . they looked at the star . it was very impressive .

" wow , " anna said . " it is so beautiful . i wish we could touch it . "

" me too , " ben said . " maybe we can fly to it . let 's jump and flap our arms . "

they jumped and flapped their arms . but they did not fly . they fell down the hill . they rolled and bumped and hurt themselves . they cried and screamed . their parents heard them and ran to help them . they took them to the doctor . the doctor gave them bandages and medicine .

" you were very foolish , " the doctor said . " you can not fly to the star . it is very far and hot . you could have burned or died . you should be happy with what you have and not chase after things you can not reach . "

anna and ben felt sorry and ashamed . they learned their lesson . they never tried to fly to the star again . they still liked to play outside and look at the sky , but they did not jump and flap their arms . they knew that the star was not a wonder for them , but a danger . they were more careful and grateful . lily and ben were on the same team for the game . they had to find and collect as many rare stones as they could . the team with the most stones would win a prize .

lily and ben saw a big hill with many stones on it . they ran to the hill and started to dig . they found some red stones , some blue stones , and some shiny stones . they were very happy .

but then they heard a loud noise . it was a horn . it meant the game was over . they had to go back to the teacher and show their stones .

lily and ben looked at each other . they had a problem . they had dug so much that they had made a big hole . they could not get out of the hole . they tried to climb , but the dirt was too loose . they tried to call , but no one heard them .

they were stuck in the hole . they missed the prize . they missed their team . they missed their teacher . they were scared and sad .

they regretted digging so much . they regretted not listening to the horn . they regretted being on the same team . they wished they had played differently . lily was a little girl who liked to draw with ink . she had many colors of ink and many papers to make pictures . she was happy when she drew .

one day , she saw a new boy in her class . his name was tom . he looked sad and lonely . lily wanted to be his friend . she went to him and said , " hi , i am lily . do you want to draw with me ? i have many colors of ink . you can use them . "

tom smiled and said , " yes , thank you . i like to draw too . you are very nice . what is your favorite color of ink ? "

lily said , " i like pink . it is pretty . what is yours ? "

tom said , " i like black . it is cool . can i see your pink ink ? "

lily said , " sure , here it is . you can use it . but be careful , it can make a mess . "

tom took the pink ink and opened it . he looked at lily and said , " i have a surprise for you . do you want to see it ? "

lily said , " yes , what is it ? "

tom said , " this ! " and he threw the pink ink all over lily . he laughed and said , " you look funny . you are not nice . you are silly . "

lily was shocked and sad . she was covered in pink ink . she felt wet and cold . she cried and said , " why did you do that ? that was mean . you are not my friend . you are bad . "

tom ran away and said , " i do n't care . i do n't like you . i do n't like pink . i like black . bye bye , pinky . "

lily was alone and hurt . she did not understand why tom was so mean . she wanted to be his friend . she wanted to welcome him . but he did not want to be her friend . he wanted to hurt her . she did not like him . she did not like black . she did not like ink . she did not like to draw . she was unhappy . lily and tom are twins . they like to play with their toys . but sometimes they tease each other . they make fun of each other 's toys and say mean things .

one day , lily and tom find a big ball of wool in their mom 's closet . they think it is a fun toy . they take it to their room and start to roll it and toss it . the wool is soft and fluffy .

but soon , they start to tease each other with the wool . lily wraps some wool around tom 's head and says , " you look like a sheep , baa baa ! " tom pulls the wool off his head and throws it at lily . he says , " you look like a spider , eek eek ! "

they keep teasing each other with the wool . they make a lot of noise . they laugh and shout and scream .

their mom hears the noise . she comes to their room and sees the mess . the wool is everywhere . it is on the floor , on the bed , on the toys , on the twins . their mom is not happy . she says , " what are you doing ? you made a big mess with my wool . and you are teasing each other . that is not nice . you have to stop and say sorry . "

lily and tom feel bad . they know they did something wrong . they say sorry to their mom and to each other . they help their mom clean up the wool . they hug and make up . they decide not to tease each other anymore . they say , " we love each other . we are twins . " tom and lily were twins who liked to play outside . they had a big yard with a swing , a slide and a sandbox . they also had a toy jeep that they could drive around . they liked to pretend they were going on adventures in the jeep .

one day , they saw a real jeep parked on the street . it was green and shiny , with big wheels and a flag . they ran to the fence and looked at it . they wondered who owned it and where it came from .

" hello , kids ! " a voice said . they turned and saw a man in a uniform . he had a hat , a badge and a smile . he was holding a big bag . " do you like my jeep ? "

" yes ! " tom and lily said . they were curious and excited . they had never seen a jeep like that before .

" i 'm a soldier , " the man said . " i just came back from a faraway place . this is my jeep . i use it to help people and keep them safe . do you want to see what 's in my bag ? "

" yes , please ! " tom and lily said . they nodded and smiled .

the man opened his bag and took out some things . he showed them a map , a compass , a medal and a picture . he told them stories about his jeep , his friends and his mission . tom and lily listened and asked questions . they learned a lot of new things .

the man also gave them a gift . he took out two small flags and handed them to tom and lily . they were the same as the one on his jeep . they had red , white and blue colors and stars and stripes .

" these are for you , " the man said . " they are flags of our country . they mean freedom , courage and hope . you can wave them and be proud . "

" thank you ! " tom and lily said . they took the flags and waved them . they felt happy and grateful .

the man looked at his watch and said , " i have to go now . i have to see my family . they are waiting for me . it 's been a long time since i saw them . "

" bye ! " tom and lily said . they hugged the man and thanked him again . they wished him well .

the man got in his jeep and started the engine . it was loud and rumbling . he waved to tom and lily and drove away . tom and lily waved back and watched him go . they saw the flag fluttering in the wind .

they went back to their yard and played with their toy jeep and their flags . they pretended they were soldiers too . they had a new friend and a new adventure . they never forgot the man and his jeep . tom and sam are friends . they like to play with boats in the pond . they have cheap boats made of wood and paper . they make them go fast with the wind .

one day , they see a big boat in the pond . it is not cheap . it is shiny and red . it has a motor and a horn . it goes very fast and makes a lot of noise .

" wow , look at that boat ! " tom says . " it is so cool ! "

