they go back to their boats . they put them in the pond . they make them go with the wind . they have fun . they race and chase and pass each other . they laugh and shout and cheer .

they forget about the big boat . they are happy with their cheap boats . they are happy with their friend . they are happy with their game . ben and mia are twins . they like to play with their toys in their room . but ben is messy and mia is organized . mia puts her toys in boxes and labels them . ben throws his toys everywhere and does not care .

one day , mom gives them new vests . they are blue and warm and soft . mia loves her vest and puts it on a hanger in her closet . ben likes his vest too , but he forgets to put it away . he leaves it on the floor with his toys .

the next day , it is cold and windy . mom says they can go to the park , but they need to wear their vests . mia runs to her closet and gets her vest . ben runs to his room and looks for his vest . but he can not find it . he sees mia 's vest on the hanger , but not his .

" where is my vest ? " he asks mia .

" i do n't know . did you put it away ? " mia asks .

" no , i did not . i left it here , " ben says .

" well , you should have been more organized . maybe it is under your toys . you have too many toys and they are all over the place , " mia says .

ben gets angry and starts to cry . he does not want to look for his vest . he wants to go to the park . he calls mom and tells her that mia took his vest .

" mia , did you take ben 's vest ? " mom asks .

" no , mom . i have my own vest . ben left his vest on the floor and now he can not find it , " mia says .

mom sighs and goes to ben 's room . she helps him look for his vest . they move the toys and the books and the pillows . finally , they find the vest . it is under the bed , dirty and wrinkled .

" here is your vest , ben . but it is not clean or nice . you should have taken care of it like mia did . next time , be more organized and put your things away . then you will not lose them or make them dirty , " mom says .

ben feels sorry and says sorry to mom and mia . he puts on his vest and goes to the park with them . he learns his lesson and tries to be more organized from then on . he and mia have fun playing with their toys and their vests . lily and ben were playing with their toys in the living room . they had a lot of fun making noises and pretending to be animals . lily was a lion and ben was a monkey . they roared and jumped and swung around the couch .

" let 's play something else ! " lily said . she was very enthusiastic and always wanted to try new things .

" like what ? " ben asked . he was getting a little tired and bored .

" let 's play hide and seek ! " lily suggested . " you count to ten and i 'll hide . then you have to find me ! "

" okay , okay , " ben agreed . he yawned and rubbed his eyes . he was not very enthusiastic , but he did not want to upset lily . he closed his eyes and started to count . " one , two , three ... "

lily ran to find a good hiding spot . she looked around the living room and saw a big pile of pillows on the couch . she thought it was a perfect place to hide . she crawled under the pillows and giggled . she was sure ben would never find her there .

ben finished counting and opened his eyes . he looked around the living room and tried to guess where lily was hiding . he checked behind the curtains , under the table , in the closet , but he could not find her . he started to feel frustrated and bored . he yawned again and wished he could take a nap .

he walked to the couch and saw the pile of pillows . he wondered if lily was hiding there . he decided to check . he lifted one of the pillows and saw lily 's face . she smiled and said , " boo ! "

ben was startled and dropped the pillow . he fell back on the couch and sighed . he was not amused . he said , " lily , that 's not fair . you scared me . "

lily laughed and said , " i 'm sorry , ben . i was just playing . did you have fun ? "

ben shook his head and said , " no , i did not . i 'm tired and i want to rest . can we stop playing now ? "

lily frowned and said , " but i 'm not tired . i want to play more . can we play something else ? "

ben shook his head again and said , " no , i do n't want to play anything else . i want to sleep . please , lily , let me sleep . "

lily saw that ben was serious and felt sorry for him . she said , " okay , ben , i 'm sorry . you can sleep . i 'll be quiet . "

she moved the pillows and cuddled next to ben on the couch . she yawned and closed her eyes . she realized that she was tired too . she said , " good night , ben . "

ben smiled and said , " good night , lily . "

they both fell asleep on the couch , dreaming of their next adventure . tim and sue like to act . they act like animals , like people , like things . they have fun and make noise . one day , they find a big loop in the yard . it is made of rope and hangs from a tree .

" look , a loop ! " tim says . " let 's act like we are in a circus ! "

" ok ! " sue says . " i will be a lion and you will be a clown ! "

they run to the loop and take turns . tim puts his head inside the loop and makes funny faces . sue roars and pretends to bite him . they laugh and clap .

but then , tim has an idea . he wants to act like he can fly . he grabs the loop and swings on it . he goes high and low , fast and slow . he feels like a bird .

" look at me , sue ! " he shouts . " i can fly ! "

sue watches him and smiles . she is glad that he is happy . but she also sees something that he does not . she sees a big rock under the loop . she sees that tim is going too fast and too high . she sees that he will hit the rock if he does not stop .

" tim , stop ! " she yells . " there is a rock ! you will get hurt ! "

but tim does not hear her . he is too busy flying . he does not see the rock . he does not see the danger . he only sees the sky .

he swings one more time . he goes very high . he lets go of the loop . he flies in the air . he feels free .

but then , he falls . he falls fast . he falls hard . he falls on the rock .

he cries . he cries loud . he cries a lot .

sue runs to him . she hugs him . she says sorry . she says she loves him .

