they go inside . they get a band - aid . they get a kiss . they get a hug .

they are still glad . they are still friends . they still like to act .

but they do not act like they can fly anymore . they know that flying is not for them . they know that flying is for birds . they know that they are not birds .

they are tim and sue . and they are happy . lily and ben were hungry . they wanted to eat soup for lunch . mom said she had some soup available in the pot . she told them to wait at the table while she got some bowls and spoons .

but lily and ben did not wait . they were too curious . they wanted to see the soup . they climbed on the chairs and looked inside the pot . the soup was hot and steamy . it smelled good . they saw some carrots and noodles and chicken in the soup .

" can we have some now ? " lily asked .

