they wave to tom and rex . they go home with their toys .

they have a sweet lunch . they have sandwiches , apples and cookies . they are yummy .

they think about tom and rex . they are their friends . they are nice .

they belong together . sara and ben were best friends . they liked to play together in the park . one day , they decided to play marriage . sara wore a white dress and ben wore a black suit . they held hands and skipped to the big tree .

" ben , do you want to be my husband ? " sara asked .

" yes , sara , i do . do you want to be my wife ? " ben answered .

" yes , ben , i do . you are very nice and funny , " sara said .

they smiled and kissed each other on the cheek . they were very happy .

but then , a grumpy boy came to the park . he saw sara and ben playing marriage . he did not like it . he wanted to play with sara . he ran to them and pushed ben away .

" hey , stop that ! she is my wife ! " ben shouted .

" no , she is not ! she is my friend ! go away ! " the grumpy boy yelled .

he grabbed sara 's hand and tried to pull her away . sara did not like it . she did not want to go with the grumpy boy . she wanted to stay with ben .

" let me go ! you are mean and rude ! " sara cried .

she kicked the grumpy boy in the leg . he let go of her hand and fell to the ground . he started to cry .

sara ran back to ben . they hugged each other . they were not scared of the grumpy boy . they were brave and strong .

" are you okay , sara ? " ben asked .

" yes , ben , i am . thank you for being my husband , " sara said .

" thank you for being my wife , sara , " ben said .

they kissed each other on the cheek again . they were very happy . they skipped away from the grumpy boy . they played marriage until it was time to go home . ben likes to balance things on his head . he thinks it is fun and funny . he can balance a book , a hat , a ball , and even a spoon . he likes to show his mom and dad how good he is at balancing .

one day , he finds a big box in the living room . it is a new television for the family . ben wants to see what is inside the box . he opens it and sees the television . it is shiny and black and has a lot of buttons . ben thinks it looks like a toy .

he takes the television out of the box and puts it on the floor . he tries to turn it on , but nothing happens . he thinks maybe it needs batteries . he looks for batteries in the kitchen , but he can not find any . he sees a banana on the table . he thinks maybe the banana can make the television work . he peels the banana and puts it in the back of the television .

he goes back to the living room and tries to turn on the television again . still nothing happens . he is disappointed . he thinks maybe the television is broken . he decides to balance it on his head instead . he lifts the television and puts it on his head . it is very heavy and hard to balance . he walks around the living room , trying to keep the television on his head .

he does not see his mom coming in the door . she sees ben with the television on his head and the banana in the back . she is shocked and angry . she yells at ben to put the television down . ben is scared and loses his balance . the television falls off his head and crashes on the floor . it breaks into pieces . ben starts to cry . his mom is very upset . she tells ben he is in big trouble . he has to go to his room and think about what he did . he can not play with the television anymore . he is very sorry . he wishes he did not balance the television on his head . he wishes he did not put the banana in the back . he wishes he listened to his mom and dad . he learns a hard lesson . balancing is fun , but not with a television . anna and ben are friends . they like to play together . one day , anna 's mom says , " we are going to visit grandma today . do you want to come , ben ? "

