soon , they see grandma 's house . it is yellow and has a red door . grandma is waiting for them . she is cheerful . she says , " hello , anna and ben ! i 'm so happy to see you . come in , come in ! "

anna and ben hug grandma . they go inside . they see the funny cat . it is sleeping on the sofa . they pet the cat gently . the cat purrs .

grandma says , " do you want some cookies and milk ? i baked them for you . "

anna and ben say , " yes , please ! thank you , grandma ! "

they sit at the table and eat the cookies and milk . they talk and laugh with grandma . they have a lot of fun . they love to visit grandma . lily and ben were twins who lived on a big ranch with many animals . they liked to play with the horses , the cows , the chickens and the dogs . they also liked to help their mom and dad with the chores , like feeding the animals , collecting the eggs and watering the plants .

one day , they saw a new animal on the ranch . it was big and brown and had a long nose and big ears . it made a loud noise like " hee - haw " . lily and ben were curious and ran to see it .

" mom , what is that ? " lily asked .

" that is a donkey , sweetie . his name is jack . he is our new friend . he can help us carry things and pull the cart , " mom said .

" can we play with him ? " ben asked .

" sure , but be gentle and careful . he is not used to children yet . he might be shy or scared , " mom said .

