lily and tom cheered . they jumped in the leaves again and had more fun . they were happy . they loved playing in the leaves with dad . sara liked to collect makeup . she had many colors of lipstick , eye shadow , and nail polish . she kept them in a big box under her bed . sometimes , she played with them and made herself look pretty .

