one day , their mom told them to clean their room before they could go to the park . lily and ben did not want to clean their room . they wanted to play with the parrot . they said to the parrot , " can you help us clean our room ? "

the parrot said , " no , i ca n't . i want to play with you . cleaning is boring . let 's have fun . " lily and ben agreed with the parrot . they decided to delay cleaning their room and play with the parrot instead .

they had fun with the parrot , but they also made a big mess . they threw their toys everywhere , they spilled their juice , and they tore their books . the parrot laughed and said , " this is fun . you are the best friends ever . "

soon , their mom came to check on them . she was very angry when she saw their room . she said , " what have you done ? this is a disaster . you did not listen to me . you did not clean your room . now you ca n't go to the park . you have to stay here and clean up . "

lily and ben were very sad . they realized they made a mistake . they said to their mom , " we are sorry , mom . we were bad . we listened to the parrot . he told us to delay cleaning our room and play with him . he was very noisy and funny , but he was also very bad . "

their mom said , " the parrot is not your friend . he is a toy . he does not care about you . he only repeats what he hears . you should not listen to him . you should listen to me . i care about you . i want you to be good and happy . cleaning your room is good for you . it teaches you to be responsible and organized . it also makes more space for you to play . if you had cleaned your room , you could have gone to the park and had more fun . "

lily and ben understood their mom . they said , " you are right , mom . we are sorry . we will clean our room now . we will not listen to the parrot anymore . he is not our friend . he is just a toy . you are our friend . you are our mom . we love you . "

their mom smiled and hugged them . she said , " i love you too . i forgive you . but you have to clean your room first . then we can go to the park later . and next time , do not delay doing what i tell you . it is better to do it right away . "

lily and ben nodded and started to clean their room . they put away their toys , they wiped their juice , and they taped their books . they also put the parrot in a box and closed it . they did not want to hear him anymore . they learned their lesson . they learned to listen to their mom and not to delay doing what is good . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to ride their bikes on the path . lily had a pink helmet and ben had a blue helmet . they always wore their helmets to be safe .

one day , they saw a big hill . ben wanted to go down the hill very fast . he said to lily , " come on , let 's try it . it will be fun . " lily was scared . she said , " no , ben , it looks too steep . what if we fall ? " ben said , " do n't be a baby . it 's easy . just follow me . " he pedaled hard and zoomed down the hill .

lily watched him go . she felt helpless . she wanted to be brave like ben , but she also wanted to be careful . she prayed in her heart , " please , god , keep ben safe . do n't let him get hurt . " she waited for him to come back up .

but ben did not come back up . lily heard a loud crash . she saw ben 's bike lying on the ground . she saw ben lying next to it . he was not moving . he was bleeding . lily screamed . she ran down the hill . she cried , " ben , ben , are you okay ? "

