she hides under the table . she hopes mom will not see her . she hopes mom will not see the cake . she hopes mom will not hear ben snoring .

she is quiet . she waits . she hears silence . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to run and chase each other . sometimes they pretended to be pirates or superheroes . they had a lot of fun .

but the sun was going down and it was time to go home . tom 's mom called him from the bench . " tom , it 's time to go . come on , let 's go . "

tom did not want to go . he wanted to play more . he said to lily , " let 's hide from my mom . she ca n't find us . we can play more . "

lily was nervous . she knew they had to go home . she said to tom , " no , tom . we ca n't hide . that 's not nice . your mom will be sad and angry . and it 's getting dark . we have to go . "

tom did not listen . he ran behind a big tree . he said , " you ca n't catch me . i 'm a pirate . you have to surrender . "

lily sighed . she ran after tom . she saw him behind the tree . she said , " tom , please . come out . do n't be silly . look , the sun is almost gone . it 's a pretty sunset . let 's go see it with your mom . "

tom peeked from behind the tree . he saw the sky was orange and pink . he saw his mom was waiting for him . he felt sorry . he said , " okay , lily . you win . i surrender . let 's go . "

tom and lily came out from behind the tree . they ran to tom 's mom . she hugged them and smiled . she said , " i 'm glad you 're here . did you have fun ? "

tom and lily nodded . they said , " yes , we did . but we 're sorry we hid from you . that was not nice . "

tom 's mom said , " it 's okay . i forgive you . but next time , listen to me when i call you . okay ? "

tom and lily said , " okay . "

they all walked to the car . they looked at the sunset . it was beautiful . they were happy . lily and ben are friends . they like to play with blocks . they have many blocks of different colors and shapes . they can make towers , houses , cars and animals with the blocks .

one day , they decide to make a big castle with the blocks . they work hard and use many blocks . they make walls , windows , doors and a flag . the castle is very impressive . it is taller than lily and ben .

" look at our castle ! " lily says . " it is so big and pretty ! "

" yes , it is ! " ben says . " we are good at making castles ! "

they are happy and proud of their castle . they want to show it to their teacher and their friends .

but then , max comes . max is a boy who does not like to share . he sees the castle and wants to play with it . he does not ask lily and ben . he just takes some blocks from the castle and makes his own tower .

" hey , stop ! " lily says . " those are our blocks ! we made the castle ! "

" give them back ! " ben says . " you are ruining our castle ! "

but max does not listen . he takes more blocks and makes his tower bigger . he does not care about lily and ben 's feelings . he is selfish and rude .

lily and ben are sad and angry . they do not like max . they want to protect their castle . they try to take the blocks back from max . but max pushes them away . he is stronger than lily and ben .

they start to fight . they pull and tug and shout . the blocks fall and break . the castle and the tower are destroyed . the blocks are scattered everywhere .

the teacher hears the noise and comes . she sees the mess and the fight . she is not happy . she scolds max , lily and ben . she tells them to stop fighting and to share the blocks . she tells them to say sorry to each other and to help clean up the blocks .

max , lily and ben feel ashamed . they know they did wrong . they say sorry to each other and to the teacher . they share the blocks and help clean up . they learn to be more respectful and kind .

they decide to make a new castle together . they use all the blocks and cooperate . they make a bigger and better castle than before . it is more impressive than ever . they are happy and proud of their castle . they show it to their teacher and their friends . they have fun playing with it .

the end . lily and tom were friends . they liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big slide . lily wanted to try it . she said , " let 's go on the slide , tom . it looks fun . "

tom was scared . he said , " no , lily . the slide is too high . i do n't want to go . "

lily said , " do n't be scared , tom . i will go first . you can watch me . then you can go after me . it will be easy . "

lily ran to the slide . she climbed the steps . she sat on the top . she said , " look , tom . i 'm not scared . i 'm ready to go . " she pushed herself down the slide . she went very fast . she laughed and shouted , " whee ! "

tom watched lily . he saw her smile . he saw her have fun . he wanted to have fun too . he said , " maybe i can try it . maybe it 's not so bad . " he walked to the slide . he climbed the steps . he sat on the top . he said , " ok , lily . i will go now . i hope i do n't fall . "

lily said , " you wo n't fall , tom . you will be fine . just hold on and enjoy the ride . " she cheered for him . she said , " you can do it , tom . you are brave . "

tom took a deep breath . he pushed himself down the slide . he went very fast . he felt the wind in his hair . he felt a thrill in his stomach . he smiled and shouted , " whee ! "

lily and tom met at the bottom . they hugged each other . they said , " that was awesome . that was fun . let 's do it again . "

they ran to the slide . they climbed the steps . they sat on the top . they pushed themselves down the slide . they went very fast . they laughed and shouted , " whee ! "

lily and tom gained a new start . they were not scared of the slide anymore . they were happy and proud . they were friends . sara and ben like to play with paper and crayons . they draw pictures of animals , flowers and cars . sometimes they cut out their pictures and make cards for their mom and dad .

one day , sara and ben find a big box of paper in the garage . it is different from the paper they usually use . it is thick and rough and has lines on it . sara and ben wonder what it is .

they ask their dad , who is working on his computer . he says , " that is lumber paper . it is made from trees . i use it to print my work . "

sara and ben are curious . they ask , " what is print ? "

dad says , " print is when you make words and pictures on paper with a machine . like this . " he shows them his printer , which is black and noisy . he presses a button and a paper comes out . it has words and graphs on it .

sara and ben think it is boring . they say , " can we print our pictures on the lumber paper ? "

dad says , " sure , why not ? but be careful , the lumber paper is not very smooth . it might jam the printer . "

sara and ben take some lumber paper and some crayons . they draw their favorite things on it . sara draws a rainbow and a unicorn . ben draws a rocket and a dinosaur . they are very proud of their pictures .

they go to the printer and put their lumber paper in it . they press the button and wait . but nothing happens . the printer makes a loud sound and stops . sara and ben are scared . they look at the printer and see a red light flashing .

dad hears the noise and comes to see what is wrong . he sees the lumber paper stuck in the printer . he says , " oh no , what have you done ? you jammed the printer with the lumber paper . now i have to fix it . "

sara and ben are sorry . they say , " we are sorry , dad . we wanted to print our pictures on the lumber paper . we did not know it would jam the printer . "

dad is not angry . he says , " it 's okay , i understand . you were curious and creative . but next time , ask me before you use the printer . and use regular paper , not lumber paper . lumber paper is not good for printing . "

he takes out the lumber paper and the pictures . he says , " these are very nice pictures . you are good artists . why do n't you hang them on the wall ? "

sara and ben are happy . they say , " thank you , dad . we love you . "

they hug their dad and hang their pictures on the wall . they look at them and smile . they like their lumber paper art . tom and lily liked to play in the woods . they liked to find new things and have fun . one day , they saw a big hole in the hill . it was a cave . they wanted to see what was inside .

they went into the cave . it was dark and cold . they used a flashlight to look around . they saw rocks and bats and spiders . they heard water and wind . they were not scared . they were brave .

they walked deeper into the cave . they saw two paths . one path went left and one path went right . they had to choose . tom wanted to go left . he said it looked more interesting . lily wanted to go right . she said it looked safer .

they argued for a while . they did not agree . they did not listen to each other . they were deaf to each other 's words . they got angry and sad . they decided to go their own way .

they split up . tom went left and lily went right . they walked alone in the dark . they did not see or hear each other . they did not have fun . they missed each other . they wished they had stayed together . they learned a lesson . they should have been kind and respectful . they should have worked together and compromised . they should have chosen to be friends . lily and ben are twins . they like to play in their house . one day , they hear a loud noise from the hall . they want to see what it is .

" come on , ben . let 's follow the noise , " lily says .

" ok , lily . but be careful . it might be tough , " ben says .

they hold hands and walk to the hall . they see a big box with a bow . it is a gift from their grandma . they are happy .

" wow , look at that . it is a big box . what is inside ? " lily asks .

" i do n't know . let 's open it and see , " ben says .

they pull the bow and tear the paper . they find a big teddy bear and a book . they hug the teddy bear and look at the book . it has pictures and words . they like it .

" thank you , grandma . this is a nice gift . we love you , " they say .

they take the teddy bear and the book to their room . they play and read . they are happy . they followed the noise and found a surprise . tom and sue were friends who liked to play with toys . one day , they found a big book with many words in it . they wanted to learn the words , so they opened the book and looked at the pages .

but the words were not like the words they knew . they were from a different language that they did not understand . they tried to say the words , but they sounded funny and hard . they laughed at the words and made fun of them .

a man saw them and heard them . he was not happy . he came to them and said , " why are you laughing at the language ? it is the language of my home . it is a beautiful and old language . you should not laugh at it , you should respect it . "

tom and sue felt bad . they did not know the man or his language . they did not mean to hurt him . they said , " we are sorry , sir . we did not know . we were just curious and silly . we regret laughing at your language . please forgive us . "

the man saw that they were humble and sorry . he smiled and said , " it is okay , children . i forgive you . you are young and curious . it is good to learn new things , but it is also good to be kind and respectful . do you want to learn some words from my language ? "

tom and sue nodded and said , " yes , please . we want to learn . " the man sat with them and taught them some words from his language . they listened and repeated the words . they learned and had fun . they thanked the man and said goodbye . they were happy and proud . they had made a new friend and learned a new language . tim and sue liked to play in the woods . they liked to run , jump , and hide . one day , they saw a big hole in the ground . it was a well . they went near it and looked down . it was very dark and deep .

" let 's throw a stone and see how long it takes to splash , " tim said . he picked up a small stone and threw it in the well . they waited and waited , but they did not hear a splash . " maybe it 's too far , " sue said . " let 's try a bigger stone . "

they looked around and found a big stone . it was heavy and hard . tim lifted it with both hands and threw it in the well . they waited and waited , but they did not hear a splash . " maybe it 's too quiet , " sue said . " let 's try a louder thing . "

they looked around and found a metal can . it was shiny and noisy . tim kicked it with his foot and it rolled to the well . he pushed it in with his stick . they waited and waited , but they did not hear a splash . they heard a loud bark .

they looked at each other and felt scared . they had thrown the can on a dog . the dog was in the well . the dog was angry and troubled . it wanted to get out . it barked and barked and barked .

tim and sue ran away from the well . they ran to their home . they told their mom and dad what they had done . their mom and dad were not happy . they called the fireman . the fireman came and got the dog out of the well . the dog was wet and dirty , but it was not hurt . the dog 's owner came and thanked the fireman . he was not happy with tim and sue . he told them to never play near the well again . tim and sue said they were sorry . they learned their lesson . they never played near the well again . tom and sam were brothers who liked to play by the river . one day , they saw a big raft made of wood and rope . they wanted to ride on it and have fun .

" let 's go on the raft , sam ! " tom said . " it looks like a boat ! "

" ok , tom , but be careful . the water is fast and deep , " sam said . he was older and wise .

they climbed on the raft and pushed it into the water . the raft moved with the current and they laughed and waved . they felt like pirates .

but soon , the raft went too far and they could not see the shore . they tried to paddle with their hands , but it was hard . the water was cold and strong .

" help ! help ! " tom and sam shouted . " we want to go back ! "

but no one heard them . the raft gained speed and went towards a big rock . it hit the rock and broke into pieces . tom and sam fell into the water and sank . they did not know how to swim .

the end . lily was very enthusiastic about her birthday . she wanted to have a big cake , lots of balloons and many friends to play with . she helped her mom and dad decorate the house and make the invitations .

the next day , lily woke up early and put on her favorite dress . she ran downstairs and saw the cake on the table . it was pink and white , with candles and sprinkles . lily clapped her hands and smiled .

" happy birthday , lily ! " her mom and dad said , and gave her a hug and a kiss . " do you like your cake ? "

" i love it ! thank you , mom and dad ! " lily said . " can i try a piece ? "

" not yet , sweetie . you have to wait for your friends to come . they will be here soon . why do n't you open your presents first ? " her dad said , and pointed to a pile of wrapped boxes .

lily nodded and ran to the presents . she tore the paper and saw many wonderful things . she got a doll , a book , a puzzle , a hat and a ball . she thanked her mom and dad for each one and hugged them .

soon , the doorbell rang and lily 's friends arrived . they all wished her a happy birthday and gave her more presents . lily was so happy and excited . she invited them to play with her toys and games .

after a while , her mom called them to the table . she lit the candles and sang " happy birthday " to lily . lily blew out the candles and made a wish . then , she cut the cake and gave everyone a slice .

" wow , this cake is delicious ! " lily 's friend ben said .

" yes , it is ! thank you , lily , for sharing it with us ! " lily 's friend anna said .

" you 're welcome ! i 'm glad you like it ! " lily said . " this is the best birthday ever ! " lily and ben are playing hide and seek in the park . lily is the seeker and ben is the hider . lily counts to ten and then looks for ben .

she sees a big tree with many leaves . she thinks ben might be hidden behind the tree . she runs to the tree and says , " i found you , ben ! "

but ben is not there . she only sees a dog with a red collar . the dog wags its tail and licks lily 's face . lily laughs and pets the dog .

" hello , dog . what is your name ? do you have a friend ? " lily asks .

the dog barks and points its nose to a bush . lily looks at the bush and sees ben 's shoes sticking out . she smiles and says , " i see you , ben ! you are not very good at hiding ! "

ben comes out of the bush and says , " you are too smart , lily ! and you have a new friend . can i pet the dog too ? "

lily nods and says , " yes , you can . the dog is very nice . maybe he is lost . we should look for his owner . "

they look at the dog 's collar and see a tag with a phone number . they call the number and a man answers . he says he is the dog 's owner and he is looking for him . he thanks lily and ben for finding his dog and says he will come to the park soon .

lily and ben are happy . they play with the dog until the man arrives . he gives them a hug and a treat . he says his dog 's name is spot and he ran away from home . he is very glad they found him .

lily and ben say goodbye to spot and his owner . they decide to play hide and seek again . but this time , they will hide together . they think it will be more fun . tom and lily are brother and sister . they like to play with their toys in the living room . they have a big box of toys with cars , dolls , balls and books . sometimes they share their toys , and sometimes they fight over them .

one day , tom finds a long string in the box . he has an idea . he ties one end of the string to his car , and the other end to lily 's doll . he pulls the string and makes the car and the doll move together . he thinks it is funny .

lily does not think it is funny . she does not like tom to touch her doll . she wants to play with her doll by herself . she tries to untie the string , but it is too tight . she gets angry and cries .

" tom , stop it ! give me back my doll ! " she shouts .

" no , it is my car ! i want to play with it ! " tom shouts back .

they pull the string and make the car and the doll crash into each other . they make a lot of noise .

mom hears the noise and comes to the living room . she sees tom and lily fighting over the string . she is not happy .

" tom , lily , what are you doing ? you are making a mess ! and you are hurting your toys ! " she says .

she takes the string from them and unties the car and the doll . she puts them back in the box .

" time for dinner , kids . come to the kitchen and wash your hands . and no more fighting , please . you need to be nice to each other and to your toys , " she says .

tom and lily follow mom to the kitchen . they are hungry and sorry . they say sorry to each other and to their toys . they promise to be more playful and less mean . they hug and smile . they enjoy their dinner and have a good night . lily and ben are twins . they like to play pretend . today , they pretend to be kangaroos . they hop around the living room and make funny noises .

" look at me , lily ! " ben says . " i can hop very high and fast . i am a strong kangaroo ! "

" you are good , ben ! " lily says . " but i can do something else . i can perform a modern dance . i am a creative kangaroo ! "

lily starts to move her arms and legs in different ways . she spins and jumps and bends . she makes her own music with her mouth .

ben watches her and claps . he thinks she is amazing . he wants to join her .

" can i perform with you , lily ? " he asks . " i want to learn your modern dance . it looks fun ! "

" of course , ben ! " lily says . " you are my brother and my friend . we can perform together . come , i will teach you ! "

lily and ben hold hands and start to dance . they copy each other and make up new moves . they laugh and smile . they are happy kangaroos . tom and mia are friends . they like to play together . today is tom 's birthday . mia has a gift for him . she puts it in a big box with a bow .

" happy birthday , tom ! " mia says . she gives him the box . " this is for you ! "

tom is excited . he wonders what is inside the box . he shakes it a little . he hears something rattle . he smiles .

" thank you , mia ! " tom says . he pulls the bow . he opens the box . he reveals the gift . it is a toy car . it is red and shiny . it has four wheels and a horn .

" wow , a car ! " tom says . he picks it up . he presses the horn . it makes a loud beep . he laughs . " this is awesome ! "

mia is happy . she sees tom likes the car . she claps her hands . she says , " i 'm glad you like it , tom . i know you love cars . we can play with it together ! "

tom and mia hug . they are good friends . they are excited . they play with the car . they have fun . it is a good birthday . sara and tom love to play with their kayak . it is brown and has two seats . they like to paddle on the lake and see the fish and the ducks . sometimes they race with each other and laugh .

one day , they see a big boat on the lake . it is white and has a loud horn . sara and tom are curious and want to get closer . they paddle faster and faster .

" be careful ! " their mom shouts from the shore . " the big boat is not for playing . it can hurt you and your kayak . stay away from it ! "

sara and tom hear their mom and slow down . they remember that the big boat is not friendly . they turn around and paddle back to the shore .

" sorry , mom , " sara says . " we just wanted to see the big boat . "

" i know , sweetie , " their mom says . " but you have to be safe . the big boat is for grown - ups . your kayak is for fun . i 'm glad you came back . "

she hugs them and gives them a snack . sara and tom smile and thank their mom . they love their kayak and their mom . they remind each other to listen to her and to be careful on the lake . lily and ben were friends . they liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big nest in a tree . they wanted to see what was inside .

" let 's climb the tree and look at the nest , " said ben .

" ok , but be careful , " said lily .

they climbed the tree and reached the nest . they saw four blue eggs inside . they were very pretty .

" wow , look at the eggs ! " said ben . " i wonder what kind of birds they are . "

" maybe they are robins , or bluebirds , or jays , " said lily .

" can i touch one ? " asked ben .

" no , do n't touch them ! " said lily . " you might break them , or make the mother bird angry . "

but ben did not listen . he reached out his hand and touched one of the eggs . he felt it was warm and smooth . he wanted to hold it .

he tried to pick up the egg , but it was slippery . he dropped it . the egg fell to the ground and broke . they heard a loud crack .

" oh no ! " said lily . " you broke the egg ! "

ben felt bad . he looked at the broken egg . he saw a baby bird inside . it was wet and still . it did not move or make a sound .

" i 'm sorry , i 'm sorry , " said ben . " i did n't mean to break it . "

but it was too late . the egg was broken , and the baby bird was gone .

they heard a loud squawk . they looked up and saw the mother bird . she was big and angry . she had sharp claws and a long beak . she saw them and flew towards them .

" run ! " said lily . " she 's coming ! "

they jumped down from the tree and ran away . the mother bird chased them . she pecked at their heads and scratched their backs . they cried and screamed .

they ran to the gate of the park and got out . the mother bird stopped at the gate and glared at them . she made a loud noise and flew back to her nest .

lily and ben were hurt and scared . they had blood and feathers on their clothes . they felt sorry for the broken egg and the baby bird . they wished they had not climbed the tree and touched the nest .

they learned a hard lesson . they should have been brave and left the eggs alone . they should have respected the mother bird and her nest . they should have listened to lily . tim and lily were twins who liked to play in the forest . they had a dog named max who was loyal and brave . max always followed them and protected them from danger .

one day , they saw a big wolf in the forest . the wolf was hungry and angry . it wanted to eat tim and lily . the twins were scared and ran away . but the wolf was fast and chased them .

" max , help us ! " tim shouted .

max heard tim and ran to him . he barked loudly and jumped on the wolf . the wolf was surprised and scared . it tried to bite max , but max was stronger and smarter . he bit the wolf 's tail and made it run away .

" good boy , max ! " lily said . she hugged max and gave him a kiss .

" thank you , max . you are the best dog ever ! " tim said . he patted max and gave him a treat .

max wagged his tail and licked their faces . he was happy and proud .

tim and lily learned a lesson that day . they learned to order their dog to help them when they were in trouble . they also learned to be loyal to their dog and love him always . they never went to the forest without max again . tom and mia are busy . they have to clean their room . mom said so . they put their toys in the box . they make their bed . they throw away the trash .

but tom has a problem . he has an itch on his nose . he rubs it with his hand . but it does not help . the itch is still there .

" ow , ow , ow ! " tom says . " my nose is itchy ! "

mia looks at him . she sees a red spot on his nose . she knows what it is . it is a mosquito bite .

" tom , you have a bite ! " mia says . " a mosquito bit you ! "

tom does not like mosquitoes . they are mean . they make him itch .

" how can i make it stop ? " tom asks .

mia thinks . she remembers what mom does when she has a bite . she gets a wet cloth . she puts it on the bite . she says it makes it cool and better .

" mia , can you help me ? " tom says .

mia nods . she goes to the bathroom . she gets a wet cloth . she comes back to the room . she puts the cloth on tom 's nose .

" does it feel better ? " mia asks .

tom nods . he feels the cloth on his nose . it is cool and nice . the itch is gone .

" thank you , mia ! " tom says .

" you 're welcome , tom ! " mia says .

they hug . they are happy . they finish cleaning their room . they are good . mom is proud . tim and kim are twins . they like to play with their toys and books . but they do not like to clean their room . they are lazy .

one day , mom comes to their room . she sees a big mess . she is angry . she says , " tim and kim , you need to clean your room now . it is not nice to leave your toys and books everywhere . you will lose them or break them . and you will have no space to play . you are big enough to help me . do not be lazy . "

tim and kim do not want to clean their room . they want to play . they say , " mom , we are tired . we do not want to clean . can we do it later ? "

mom says , " no , you can not do it later . you need to do it now . if you do not clean your room , you will not get any dessert . and you will have to listen to a lecture from me . do you want that ? "

tim and kim do not want to miss dessert . and they do not want to listen to a lecture . they know mom is serious . they say , " ok , mom , we will clean our room . but can you help us ? "

mom says , " i will help you a little bit . but you have to do most of the work . it is your room . and you have to learn to be responsible . now , let 's start . first , we will weigh your toys and books . we will put the heavy ones in the big box . and we will put the light ones in the small box . then , we will put the boxes on the shelf . do you understand ? "

tim and kim nod . they say , " yes , mom , we understand . we will weigh our toys and books . and we will put them in the boxes . and we will put the boxes on the shelf . we will make our room clean and nice . and we will not be lazy anymore . "

mom smiles . she says , " that 's good . i am proud of you . now , let 's get to work . and when we are done , we will have some dessert . and we will read a story . how does that sound ? "

tim and kim smile . they say , " that sounds great . thank you , mom . we love you . "

mom says , " i love you too . now , let 's go . " jenny and max were best friends . they liked to play in the park every day . they enjoyed the swings , the slide and the sandbox . but their favorite thing was the zip line . it was a long rope with a handle that they could hold and fly across the air .

one day , they saw a new kid in the park . he had a red hat and a blue bike . he looked sad and lonely . jenny and max wanted to be nice , so they said hello to him .

" hi , i 'm jenny and this is max . what 's your name ? " jenny asked .

" i 'm leo . i just moved here . i do n't have any friends , " leo said .

" do you want to play with us ? we can show you the zip line . it 's very fun , " max said .

leo nodded and smiled . he followed jenny and max to the zip line . they took turns holding the handle and flying across the air . leo was a little scared at first , but he soon liked it . he laughed and shouted with joy .

jenny and max were happy to see leo having fun . they thought he was adorable with his red hat and his blue bike . they decided to invite him to their next play date .

" leo , do you want to come to our house tomorrow ? we have more toys and games . we can be friends , " jenny said .

" yes , please . i would love that . thank you , jenny and max . you are very kind , " leo said .

they hugged and said goodbye . they looked forward to seeing each other again . they enjoyed their new friendship . tim and sam were brothers who liked to play outside . they had a cart that they could ride in . sometimes , tim would pull sam in the cart , and sometimes , sam would pull tim . they had fun taking turns and going fast .

one day , they saw a big hill near their house . they wanted to ride down the hill in their cart . tim said , " i will pull you first , sam . then you pull me . " sam agreed . tim pulled sam to the top of the hill and helped him get in the cart . then he let go of the cart and watched sam zoom down the hill .

sam felt the wind in his hair and the sun on his face . he laughed and shouted , " this is so fun ! i love riding in the cart ! " he felt very comfortable and happy . he reached the bottom of the hill and waited for tim to come down .

but tim did not come down . he was still at the top of the hill . he felt tired and bored . he did not want to pull the cart up the hill again . he did not want to give sam another turn . he wanted to ride in the cart himself . he thought , " sam had enough fun . it is my turn now . " he got in the cart and started to ride down the hill .

but he did not feel the same as sam . he felt the cart shake and rattle . he felt the stones and bumps on the road . he felt scared and nervous . he did not laugh or shout . he cried and screamed , " this is not fun ! i hate riding in the cart ! " he did not feel comfortable or happy . he reached the bottom of the hill and saw sam waiting for him .

sam saw tim crying and asked , " what is wrong , tim ? why are you sad ? " tim said , " i did not like riding in the cart . it was hard and scary . i want to go home . " sam said , " but you did not give me another turn . you were not fair . you were selfish . " tim said , " i am sorry , sam . i was wrong . i should have shared with you . can you forgive me ? " sam said , " yes , i can forgive you . but next time , you have to be kind and take turns . that is how we have fun and be happy . " tim said , " you are right , sam . that is how we have fun and be happy . thank you for being my brother . " they hugged and went home together .

the moral of the story is : sharing is caring . taking turns is fair . being kind is fun . lily and max were playing in the park with their dog , spot . spot was a big , brown dog with a red collar . he liked to run and chase balls and sticks . lily and max liked to throw them for him .

one day , they saw a pond in the park . it had ducks and fish and frogs in it . it looked very cool and fun . lily and max wanted to go near the pond and see the animals . they asked their mom if they could .

