tim and jen say goodbye to the lady . they hold hands . they walk home . they are friends . they learned a lesson . they will not play with the ashtray again . they will listen to each other . they will be safe and happy . ben and lily like to play in the park . they like to run , jump , and slide . they also like to sing and dance . sometimes they perform for the birds and the squirrels . they think they are very good .

