they all hug and laugh . they play in the stream . they sing and dance . they perform for the birds and the squirrels . they have a lot of fun . tim and mia are friends . they live in a big city with many cars and people . they like to play in the park near their home . one day , they see a new slide in the park . it is very big and shiny . they want to try it .

