they hold hands . they walk to the nurse . they are still friends . they learned a lesson . they will resist their bad wants . they will listen to each other . they will have fun . the end . lila liked to play the flute . she had a flexible flute that she could bend and twist . she made funny sounds with it . she played the flute for her mom and dad , and they clapped and smiled .

