lila was angry . she did not like the man . she thought he was mean and greedy . she said , " you are a bad man . you do n't share . you do n't care . you are not nice . i do n't like you . " she took her flexible flute and ran away . she played her flute loud and proud . she did not need his flute . she liked her flute better . she had fun with her flute . she was happy . mia and leo were twins who liked to play together . but sometimes they fought over their toys and games . mia was bossy and wanted to do everything her way . leo was quiet and did not like to argue .

