they hugged mom and ran to the bathroom . they learned that playing nicely was more fun than fighting , and that potatoes were good for many things . lily was a little girl who liked to play with her dolls . she had many dolls , but her favorite one was anna . anna had long hair , a pink dress and a big smile . lily loved to brush anna 's hair and make her talk .

