they walked home , holding hands . they learned a lesson that day . they learned to respect the rules and to be careful of strangers . they also learned to listen to their sister and brother , who loved them and wanted them to be happy . anna and ben were twins who liked to play in their room . they had many toys , books and games , but their favorite thing was the lamp . the lamp was old and had a colorful shade with animals on it . the lamp made their room bright and cozy .

