they plugged in the lamp and turned it on . the lamp made lily 's room bright and cozy . they all smiled and felt warm in their hearts . they learned that sharing is caring and that valuing others is more important than valuing things . they became good friends and had a good night 's sleep . tom and lily were squirrels who lived in a big tree . they liked to find nuts and store them in their hole . one day , they saw a very big nut on the ground . it was shiny and round and looked very tasty .

