sara and ben were very scared . they knew they had done something bad . they dropped their forks and looked at their mom . they said , " we are sorry , mom . we were hungry and curious . we saw the key and unlocked the fridge . we just wanted to taste the cake . please do n't be mad at us . "

their mom sighed . she was still angry , but she also loved sara and ben . she said , " sara and ben , you should not have taken the cake and ice cream . that was not nice or polite . you should have waited until i said it was time for dessert . and you should not have used the key . that was not the key to the fridge . that was the key to the car . now i have to find another key to drive the car . you have made a big mess and a big problem . "

sara and ben felt very sorry and sad . they said , " we are very sorry , mom . we did not know that was the key to the car . we did not mean to make a mess and a problem . we will help you clean up and find another key . we will not do it again . we love you , mom . "

their mom smiled . she said , " i love you too , sara and ben . but you still have to learn to listen and follow the rules . and you have to eat your dinner before you have dessert . now come on , let 's go to the living room and talk about what you did and how you can make it better . " lily and ben like to watch films on the large tv . they sit on the sofa with their snacks and blankets and choose a film . today they want to watch a film about animals .

" look , ben , there is a lion ! " lily says , pointing at the screen . " he is very large and has a big mane . he can roar very loud . "

" yes , he is the king of the animals , " ben says . " but i like the monkey better . he is funny and can swing on the trees . he can also make funny faces . "

they watch the film and laugh and learn about the animals . they see elephants , giraffes , zebras , and more . they also see a bird that can talk .

" hello , hello , i am a parrot , " the bird says on the film . " i can call your name . what is your name ? "

lily and ben are surprised and excited . they want to talk to the bird .

" my name is lily , " lily says to the tv .

" my name is ben , " ben says to the tv .

the bird repeats their names and says hello again . lily and ben clap and giggle .

" wow , he can call our names ! " lily says . " he is very smart and colorful . i wish we had a parrot like him . "

" me too , " ben says . " maybe we can ask mom and dad if we can get one . "

they finish the film and hug each other . they had a lot of fun watching the film about animals . they hope they can watch another one soon . lily and ben were playing in the park with their mom . they liked to run , slide , swing and climb . they saw a big truck with a loud siren and flashing lights . it was a fire truck . they wanted to see it up close .

" can we go , mom ? " lily asked .

