they wave to the truck driver . he waves back . he drives away with his truck . he honks his horn .

anna and ben run to the slide . they take turns going down . they laugh and shout . they have fun . they like the new slide . they like the truck driver . they like the bow . they are happy . tom and lily were playing in the garden . they liked to dig in the dirt and make mud pies . they had a big bucket of water to make the mud wet . but the bucket had a leak . water dripped out of the hole and made a puddle on the grass .

" look , tom , the bucket is broken ! " lily said . " we need more water for our pies ! "

tom frowned . he did not like the leak . he wanted to fix the bucket . he ran to the shed and looked for some tape . he found a roll of tape and brought it back to the bucket . he tried to stick the tape over the hole , but it did not work . the water was too wet and the tape was too sticky . the tape fell off and the water kept dripping .

" this is a bad bucket ! " tom said . " we need a new bucket ! "

lily nodded . she agreed with tom . they needed a new bucket . but they did not have any money to buy a new bucket . they only had some coins that they found in the sofa . they wondered if that was enough .

" maybe we can ask mom for some money , " lily said . " she is rich . she has a lot of money in her purse . "

tom liked that idea . he thought mom would give them some money for a new bucket . he and lily ran to the house and looked for mom . they found her in the kitchen , making lunch .

" mom , mom , can we have some money ? " tom asked . " we need a new bucket . our bucket has a leak and we ca n't make mud pies . "

mom smiled . she saw the dirt on their faces and clothes . she saw the tape in tom 's hand and the coins in lily 's hand . she knew they had been playing in the garden .

" you do n't need money for a new bucket , " mom said . " you can use this old pot instead . it has no leak and it can hold water . you can make mud pies with this pot . "

she gave them a big pot that she did not use anymore . it was shiny and clean . tom and lily thanked mom and took the pot to the garden . they filled it with water and poured it on the dirt . they made big and round mud pies . they were happy . they did not frown anymore . they smiled and laughed . they did not need a rich bucket . they had a good pot . anna and ben like to play with blocks . they make big buildings with the blocks . they put windows and doors and roofs on the buildings . they pretend the buildings are houses or shops or schools .

one day , anna and ben have a fight . anna wants to make a pink building . ben wants to make a blue building . they do not want to share the blocks . they say mean words to each other .

