" i 'm sorry , anna . i was mean to you , " ben says .

they hug each other . they forgive each other . they decide to play together . they pick up the blocks . they make a new building . they make a regular building . they make a building with pink and blue blocks . they make a building for them and for the dog . they are happy . they are friends . lily and ben are playing in the park . they like to run and jump and slide . lily sees a big swing . she wants to try it . she runs to the swing and sits on it .

