lily nods . she says , " yes , please . let 's play something else . something safe and fun . "

they hold hands and walk to the sandbox . they play with the sand and the toys . they forget about the fall . they have fun . they are happy . tom and mia are friends . they like to play together at the gym . the gym has many things to do . there are balls , mats , ropes , swings and slides . tom and mia have fun at the gym .

one day , tom and mia want to learn something new . they see a big hoop on the wall . it looks like a ring . they want to try it . they ask the teacher for help . the teacher is nice . she shows them how to hold the hoop and swing on it .

tom goes first . he holds the hoop with both hands . he swings his legs and lifts his body . he feels like a bird . he says , " whee ! this is fun ! " mia claps for him . she says , " you are good , tom ! "

then mia goes . she holds the hoop with both hands . she swings her legs and lifts her body . she feels like a star . she says , " wow ! this is cool ! " tom cheers for her . he says , " you are good , mia ! "

tom and mia are glad . they learned something new . they hug the teacher and thank her . they say , " thank you , teacher ! you are nice ! " the teacher smiles and says , " you are welcome , tom and mia ! you are brave and smart ! " tom and mia are happy . they love the gym . anna and ben were very happy . they were going to visit their grandma and grandpa . they loved their grandma and grandpa very much . they always had fun with them .

they got in the car with their mom and dad . they drove for a long time . they saw many things on the way . they saw cows and horses and trees and flowers . they sang songs and played games .

when they got to grandma and grandpa 's house , they jumped out of the car . they ran to the door and knocked . grandma and grandpa opened the door and hugged them .

