anna and ben were very happy . they played with spot in the yard . they threw a ball and he fetched it . they gave him treats and he did tricks . they cuddled him and he snuggled them .

they had an enormous smile on their faces . they loved their grandma and grandpa and their new puppy . they had a wonderful visit . tim and mia were playing in the park with their bikes . they liked to go fast and make turns and jumps . they had fun and laughed a lot .

but then tim saw a big hole in the fence . he wanted to see what was behind it . he told mia to follow him . he pushed his bike through the hole and went to the other side .

mia was scared . she did not want to go to the other side . she saw a lot of smoke and noise and big machines . she thought it was a bad place . she shouted to tim , " come back , tim ! come back ! "

tim did not listen . he was curious . he rode his bike closer to the machines . he saw a big pipe that was spitting out fire . he thought it was cool . he wanted to touch it .

but then he felt very hot and dizzy . he could not breathe well . he realized that the fire was taking away the oxygen . the oxygen was the air that he needed to live . he started to cough and cry . he wanted to go back to the park .

he turned his bike around and tried to ride back to the fence . but it was hard . he was very tired and sick . he fell off his bike and lay on the ground .

mia saw him fall . she was very worried . she ran to the hole and called for help . she saw a man who was wearing a big hat and a coat . he was a firefighter . he had a hose that could spray water .

the firefighter saw mia and tim . he understood what happened . he ran to tim and picked him up . he put a mask on his face that gave him oxygen . he said , " do n't worry , tim . i will restore you . i will make you better . "

he carried tim to his truck and drove him to the hospital . mia followed him on her bike . she was glad that the firefighter was there . she hoped that tim would be okay . she learned a lesson . she would never go to the bad place again . she would stay in the park with her bike . lily and ben are twins . they like to help mom and dad with jobs . today , they have a big job . they have to pick apples from the tree .

lily and ben put on their hats and boots . they take a basket and go to the tree . they see many red apples . they are happy .

