lily and ben pick more apples . they fill the basket . they are proud . they take the basket to mom and dad . mom and dad are happy . they say " well done , lily and ben ! you are very helpful . we love you . "

lily and ben hug mom and dad . they say " we love you too . we like to do jobs with you . "

they eat some apples . they are sweet and juicy . they are happy . anna and ben were twins who loved christmas . they wanted to see santa claus and get many gifts . they wrote letters to santa and put them in a big red sock . they hung the sock on the chimney in the living room .

on christmas eve , they lay in their beds and tried to sleep . but they were too excited and curious . they wanted to sneak out and peek at the chimney . maybe they would see santa or hear his sleigh .

