they saw a flash of red and white and a big black boot . then they heard a jolly voice .

" ho ho ho ! merry christmas , anna and ben ! i 'm glad you liked my gifts . and thank you for the cookies and milk . they were delicious . now , go back to bed and have sweet dreams . i have to go and visit more children . bye bye ! " santa said .

anna and ben were amazed and happy . they saw santa ! he was real and kind . they ran back to their beds and hugged their teddy bears . they fell asleep with smiles on their faces . they had the best christmas ever . tom and lily were having lunch with their mom . they liked to eat sandwiches and fruit . mom gave them each a napkin to wipe their mouths . tom saw that his napkin had a picture of a hairy dog on it . he liked dogs , but he did not like hairy ones . he wanted a napkin with a smooth cat on it .

