they swapped their napkins and finished their lunch . mom was proud of them for being kind and sharing . she gave them each a hug and a kiss and said , " now it is time for a nap . you both did a good job today . " one day , lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . but then , lily fell down and hurt her knee . she cried and showed ben her skin . it was red and had a little blood .

