her mom said , " of course , we can . he will be so proud of you . you are a great poet , lily . " they hugged and waited for dad to come home . tim and sam were friends who liked to play with toys . they had many cars , planes , and trains , but they wanted something new . they decided to build a missile with some boxes , tubes , and tape . they worked hard and made a big missile that looked like a rocket .

