they hugged and smiled . they were still friends and they still liked to play . they did not need a missile or a rich man to have fun . sara loves to play with her toy plane . it has two big wings and a long nose . it is a modern plane , not like the old ones in the books . sara likes to make it fly in the air and zoom around the room .

one day , sara takes her plane outside to the park . she wants to see how high it can go . she throws it up in the sky and watches it soar . she feels happy and proud . but then , a strong wind blows and takes her plane away . sara runs after it , but it is too fast . she loses sight of it and feels sad and scared .

