they become friends and play with the plane together . they make it fly and zoom and do tricks . they have a lot of fun . mommy watches them and smiles . she is happy that sara found her plane and made a new friend . she thinks it is a good day . lila and sam were playing in the garden . they liked to look for bugs and flowers . they saw a big green caterpillar on a leaf . it had yellow and black stripes .

