lily and tom look at each other . they are surprised . they have the same number of matches . they have tied the game .

they laugh . they are happy . they hug each other . they say good game .

they close the cards and put them away . they go to play something else . they are friends . lily and ben were very hungry . they wanted to eat pizza for lunch . mom said they could help her make pizza in the kitchen . lily and ben were happy .

