tommy and his mom thanked the man and left the tent . tommy was happy to be with his mom and to zoom around the park again . he learned a new word , lecture , but he decided he liked zooming better . jill and ben like to play pretend . they have a big box of dress - up clothes and toys . jill likes to be a princess and ben likes to be a knight . they have a crown , a sword , a cape and a necklace .

