tom and lily did not answer . they were too afraid . they wished they had not opened the cube . they wished they had listened to lily . they learned a lesson . they did not dare to touch the cube again . lily liked to write in her journal . she wrote about her family , her friends , and her dreams . she wrote with a purple pen and drew pictures with crayons . she kept her journal in a secret place under her bed .

