one day , she saw her grandma sewing with a needle and thread . she wanted to try too . she asked her grandma , " can i sew with you ? "

her grandma smiled and said , " yes , you can , but you have to be careful . the needle is sharp and the thread is thin . you have to hold them right and not poke yourself . "

she gave lila a piece of cloth , a needle and some thread . she showed her how to fold the cloth and make a stitch . lila tried to copy her , but it was hard . the needle slipped and the thread tangled . she felt frustrated and said , " i ca n't do it . it 's too hard . "

her grandma hugged her and said , " do n't give up , lila . sewing is a skill that takes time and practice . you are doing well for your first time . you just have to be patient and keep trying . you are a wise girl and you can learn anything you want . "

lila felt better and thanked her grandma . she decided to try again and again until she could sew a nice seam . she learned how to make a button , a pocket and a flower . she used many colors of thread and put them on her cloth . she was proud of her sewing things . lily and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they find a shiny stone on the ground . it is red and sparkly .

" wow , look at this ! " lily says . " it is so pretty ! "

ben nods . he likes the stone too . he wants to keep it . he asks lily , " can i have it , please ? "

lily thinks for a moment . she likes the stone too , but she likes ben more . she smiles and says , " okay , you can have it . but you have to share it with me sometimes . "

ben agrees . he is happy . he says , " thank you , lily . you are very kind . i will share it with you always . "

he puts the stone in his pocket . he feels it is warm and smooth . he thinks it is a charming stone . he hugs lily and says , " you are my best friend . "

lily hugs him back . she says , " you are my best friend too . "

they hold hands and run to the swings . they play and laugh . they are happy . they have a shiny stone and a good friend . tom and lily were playing pirates in the garden . they had a big box that was their ship . they put a stick in the box for a mast and a sheet for a sail . they had hats and swords and a map .

" ahoy , matey ! " tom said . " we are looking for treasure on a faraway island . are you ready , lily ? "

" aye , aye , captain ! " lily said . " but i am hungry . can we have a snack first ? "

tom looked at the map . he saw a red x. " no , lily , we have to find the treasure first . it is right here , under the big tree . come on , let 's go ! "

they jumped out of the box and ran to the tree . they dug a hole with their hands and found a tin box . they opened it and saw shiny coins and jewels .

" wow , we are rich ! " tom said . " we can buy anything we want ! "

" look , tom , there is a chocolate bar in the box too ! " lily said . " can we share it ? "

" of course , lily , you are my best mate ! " tom said . he broke the chocolate bar in half and gave one piece to lily . they ate the chocolate and smiled .

suddenly , they heard a loud noise . it was their mom . she was calling them from the house .

" tom , lily , come inside ! it is getting cold and dark . you have to wash up and get ready for dinner ! "

tom and lily looked at each other . they did not want to leave their ship and their treasure .

" can we play a little more , mom ? " tom asked .

" no , tom , you have to come inside now . it is going to freeze tonight . you do n't want to catch a cold , do you ? " mom said .

tom and lily sighed . they put the tin box back in the hole and covered it with dirt . they took their hats and swords and ran to the house .

" bye , bye , ship ! " lily said . " we will come back tomorrow and play more pirates ! "

" bye , bye , ship ! " tom said . " you are the best ship ever ! " anna and ben are twins . they like to help their mom in the kitchen . mom is very wise . she knows how to make yummy meals for the family .

one day , mom is busy with work . she asks anna and ben to prepare a meal for dinner . she gives them some bread , cheese , ham , eggs , and salad . she tells them to be careful and not make a mess .

anna and ben are excited . they put on their aprons and wash their hands . they cut the bread and cheese with a knife . they put ham and cheese on the bread . they make four sandwiches . they crack the eggs and whisk them with a fork . they pour them into a pan and cook them on the stove . they make scrambled eggs . they wash the salad and put it in a bowl . they add some dressing and toss it with a spoon . they make a salad .

they set the table with plates , forks , knives , and napkins . they put the sandwiches , eggs , and salad on the table . they call mom to come and eat . mom is very happy and proud . she hugs anna and ben and thanks them for their help . she says they are very wise and good cooks . they all enjoy the meal together . they smile and laugh . they are a happy family . lila and tom are friends . they like to play with toys and books . one day , they find a big box in the yard . they open the box and see a lot of shiny things inside . they are happy and curious .

" what are these ? " lila asks , picking up a small thing with buttons and a screen .

" i think it is a cell , " tom says , looking at another thing that looks like a cell . " my mom has one . she talks to it and it talks back . "

" wow , can we talk to them too ? " lila wonders , pressing some buttons .

" maybe , let 's try , " tom says , pressing some buttons too .

they hold the cells to their ears and wait . nothing happens . they try again and again , but the cells are silent .

" these cells are not good , " lila says , feeling sad . " they do not talk to us . "

" maybe they need something , " tom says , thinking hard . " maybe they need power . "

" power ? what is power ? " lila asks , confused .

" power is what makes things work , " tom explains . " like the light and the tv and the fan . they need power from the wall . "

" oh , i see , " lila says , nodding . " but how do we give power to the cells ? "

tom looks around and sees a long thing with a plug at the end . he remembers that his mom uses it to charge her cell .

" look , lila , i found something , " he says , holding the long thing . " this can give power to the cells . we just need to find a hole in the wall . "

they look for a hole in the wall and find one near the door . tom puts the plug in the hole and the long thing lights up . he feels happy and smart .

" good job , tom , you are dependable , " lila says , smiling . " now let 's set the cells on the long thing and see if they work . "

they set the cells on the long thing and wait . after a while , the cells beep and show some words on the screen .

" hello , this is a test message . please reply if you receive it , " the words say .

lila and tom are amazed and excited . they type some letters on the screen and press send .

" hi , we are lila and tom . we are playing with your cells . who are you ? " they write .

they wait for an answer , hoping to hear from someone new . they do not know that the cells belong to their dad , who is at work and very surprised to get their message . he smiles and writes back .

" hi , lila and tom . i am your dad . i am glad you are having fun with my cells . but please be careful and do not touch anything else in the box . i will be home soon and tell you more about them . i love you . " ben and mia like to play in the park . they run and jump and slide and swing . they have fun with their friends and their toys .

one day , ben and mia are playing tag . ben is it and he tries to catch mia . mia runs fast and tries to hide behind a tree . but ben is faster and he tags mia on her back .

" got you ! " ben says . " you are it now ! "

mia laughs and chases ben . she runs after him and tries to tag him on his arm . but ben is clever and he dodges mia . he runs to the slide and slides down .

mia follows him and slides down too . but she slides too fast and she bumps her knee on the ground . she feels a sharp pain and she cries .

" ow , ow , ow ! " mia says . " my knee hurts ! "

ben hears mia and he stops . he runs to mia and he sees her knee . it has a red scratch and a little blood .

" oh no , mia ! " ben says . " are you okay ? "

he hugs mia and he tries to make her feel better . he looks around and he sees a clear bottle on a bench . it has water and a spray . he remembers that his mom uses it to clean his cuts .

he gets the bottle and he sprays some water on mia 's knee . it stings a little but it also cools the pain . he finds a band - aid in his pocket and he sticks it on mia 's knee .

" there , mia , " ben says . " your knee is clean and safe now . does it still hurt ? "

mia stops crying and she looks at her knee . she sees the band - aid and she smiles .

" thank you , ben , " mia says . " you are a good friend . my knee feels better now . "

she hugs ben and he hugs her back . they are happy and they go back to play . they run and jump and slide and swing . they have fun with their friends and their toys . lily and ben are playing in the backyard . they have a big ball and a small ball . they throw the balls to each other and catch them . they laugh and have fun .

but then , a loud noise makes them stop . they hear a bark and a growl . they see a big dog running towards them . the dog is angry and scary . lily and ben are afraid .

" run , lily , run ! " ben shouts . he grabs the small ball and throws it at the dog . the dog chases the ball and leaves them alone . lily and ben run to the house . they slam the door and lock it .

they are safe now . they hug each other and breathe hard . they are still scared , but they are also brave . they rub their arms and legs . they have some scratches and bruises from the dog .

" are you okay , lily ? " ben asks .

" i 'm okay , ben . you are a good brother . you saved me from the dog , " lily says .

they smile and hug again . they are happy to have each other . they go to the kitchen and ask mom for some cookies and milk . they tell mom what happened . mom is proud of them and gives them a kiss . she also rubs their backs and makes them feel better . she says she will call the dog 's owner and tell him to keep his dog in his yard .

lily and ben eat their cookies and drink their milk . they are not afraid anymore . they are still friends with the balls . they decide to play with them inside the house . they are careful not to break anything . they have fun again . lily and ben were playing with their toy animals in the garden . they liked to pretend they were in the jungle and make noises like the animals . lily had a lion and ben had a monkey .

" roar ! " lily said , making her lion jump on the grass . " i am the king of the jungle . i have the most power . all the animals are afraid of me . "

" ooh - ooh - ah - ah ! " ben said , making his monkey swing from a branch . " you are not the king of the jungle . you are mean and scary . you make the animals cry . "

lily and ben started to argue . they both wanted to be the best and have the most power . they did not want to share or be nice to each other .

suddenly , they heard a loud noise from behind the fence . it sounded like a real lion . they stopped arguing and looked at each other with fear . they hugged their toy animals and ran to the house .

" mommy , mommy , there is a lion in the garden ! " they cried .

mommy came out and saw what was making the noise . it was not a lion . it was a big dog . the dog had escaped from the neighbor 's yard and was barking at the fence .

mommy smiled and said , " do n't be afraid , children . that is not a lion . that is max , the neighbor 's dog . he is very friendly and compassionate . he likes to play and have fun . he is not mean or scary . he just wants to say hello . "

lily and ben looked at the dog and saw that he was wagging his tail and licking his nose . he did not look like a lion at all . he looked like a nice dog .

they felt silly and ashamed . they had been mean and scary to each other , like the lion they thought they heard . they had not been friendly and compassionate , like the dog they saw .

they said sorry to each other and hugged . they decided to share their toy animals and be nice to each other . they learned that having power is not as important as having compassion . they also learned that sometimes things are not what they seem . they thanked mommy and went back to the garden . they invited max to join their jungle game . they all had fun and made happy noises . lila liked to play soccer with her friends . she was very good at kicking the ball and making goals . she was independent and did not need help from anyone . she always wanted to win and have the highest score .

one day , she was playing soccer with ben and sam . they were on the same team and they were winning . lila scored three goals and was very happy . but then , she saw that her ball had a hole in it . it was losing air and becoming flat . she was very sad and angry .

" who did this to my ball ? " she asked . " it was my favorite ball ! "

ben and sam looked at the ball and felt sorry for lila . they did not know who made the hole , but they wanted to help .

" maybe we can repair it , " ben said . " we can use some tape and glue and make it round again . "

" or maybe we can share our ball with you , " sam said . " we have another ball that is good and bouncy . you can use it and we can still play together . "

lila thought about what ben and sam said . she liked their ideas , but she also liked her own ball . she did not want to give it up or use another one . she wanted to fix it and keep playing with it .

" thank you , but no thank you , " she said . " i can repair my ball by myself . i do n't need your help or your ball . i am independent and i can do it alone . "

she took her ball and walked away . she found some tape and glue and tried to repair the hole . but it was not easy . the tape did not stick and the glue did not dry . the ball was still flat and useless .

she looked at ben and sam . they were playing with their ball and having fun . they were still winning and scoring goals . they smiled and waved at her . they invited her to join them .

lila felt lonely and silly . she realized that she was not independent . she needed her friends and their ball . she wanted to play and have fun with them . she wanted to share and be nice .

she picked up her ball and walked back to them . she apologized and asked if she could play with them .

" of course you can , " ben and sam said . " we are happy to share our ball with you . we are your friends and we want to play with you . "

they gave her a hug and handed her the ball . lila smiled and thanked them . she kicked the ball and scored a goal . they cheered and clapped for her . they played together and had a great time . lila learned that being independent is good , but being friendly is better . once upon a time , there was a little mouse named tim . tim was very dirty because he played in the mud all day . he lived in a tiny house near a big tree .

one day , tim woke up very early . he saw a yummy cheese outside his house . he wanted to eat it , but he did not know it was a trap set by the farmer . the farmer wanted to catch tim because he was tired of tim eating his food .

as tim got closer to the cheese , he saw a big stick next to it . he remembered his mom told him to be careful of traps . tim knew it was a trap and did not eat the cheese . he went back to his house and told his friends about the trap . they were all very happy that tim was safe . once upon a time , there was a boy named mark . mark was a thoughtful boy who liked to help others . one day , he saw a small bird with a hurt wing . mark wanted to help the bird , so he took it home .

at home , mark made a soft bed for the bird to rest . he gave it food and water . the bird was happy and nodded its head to say thank you . mark felt good that he could help the bird .

after a few days , the bird felt better . mark knew it was time to let the bird go . he took the bird outside and opened his hands . the bird flew away , but it looked back and nodded to mark one more time . mark smiled and waved goodbye . once upon a time , there was a funny bunny named bob . bob loved to eat carrots and play games with his friends . one sunny day , bob and his friends decided to play a game of tag . they were all very excited .

