then , the boy had an idea . he sang to the rock . the rock liked the song . it opened up . the prize came out . the boy was happy . the rock was happy too . they were friends forever . once upon a time , in a small village , there was a girl named lily . lily loved to find pretty rocks . one day , she found a shiny gem . it was so beautiful ! she showed it to her friend , sam .

