his mom said , " let 's find the original tree with the best pears ! " they looked around and found the perfect tree . tim 's mom picked a big , juicy pear for him .

tim took a bite and said , " yummy ! this is the best pear ever ! " they shared the pear and had a fun day at the park . once upon a time , there was a big tree with many roots . a small boy named tom lived near the tree . tom was a fearful boy . he was scared of the big tree and its roots .

