the roots picked up the ball and took it away . tom cried and went back to his mom . he never got a new toy to replace his old one , and he stayed fearful of the big tree and its roots . once upon a time , there was a little cat named kitty . kitty loved to lie down in the sun . it made her feel warm and happy . one day , it was very hot outside . kitty went to lie down in her favorite sunny spot .

