soon , kitty got tired from playing . she lay down next to the brush in the hot sun . kitty closed her eyes and took a nap . she had a good day playing with her new toy . one day , a helpful dog named buddy saw a big red wagon . buddy wanted to play with the wagon . he went to his friend , a little girl named lily . lily was tired and let out a big yawn .

