as the sun began to set , buddy and lily were very tired . they both yawned and smiled at each other . they knew they had a great day together with the big red wagon . they could n't wait to play again the next day . once upon a time , in a small house , there was a little girl named sue . she loved to help her mom . today , sue wanted to help her mom clean the house . sue 's mom said , " thank you for helping , sue ! "

