later , sue 's mom was looking for the matches to light a candle . she could n't find them . sue said , " i put them on the high shelf , so my brother ca n't get them . " her mom smiled and said , " good job , sue ! you helped keep your brother safe and our house clean . " sue felt happy that she could help her mom . once upon a time , in a big jungle , there lived a little monkey named max . max loved to play all day long . he had many friends , like birds , bugs , and other monkeys .

