they played all day long and had so much fun . max and leo loved their new friendship . from that day on , max and leo played together in the jungle every day . they were the best of friends , and everyone in the jungle loved to watch them play . once upon a time , there was a large fish named fin . fin loved to surf in the big blue sea . one day , while fin was surfing , he saw a small fish named gill . gill was sad and lost .

