gill and his mom were happy . " thank you , fin , " said gill 's mom . " you are a good friend . " fin smiled and said , " we all need friends to help us when we are lost . " the moral of the story is that friends can help us when we need them . once upon a time , there was a little boy named tim . one day , tim went for a walk and saw a big wall . he wanted to see what was behind the wall , so he found a way to climb it . when he got to the top , he saw a big , spicy pepper .

