tim smiled and thanked the bird . he took the spicy pepper home and shared it with his friends . they all had fun eating the spicy pepper together , and tim was n't scared anymore . once upon a time , there was a sweet little girl named lily . she loved to spread jam on her bread every morning . one day , she decided to go to the station with her mom . lily was very excited because she had never been to the station before .

at the station , lily saw a big train . it was so big and noisy that it made her jump . she held her mom 's hand very tight . while they waited for their train , lily saw a man selling jam . she wanted to buy some jam to spread on her bread at home .

lily let go of her mom 's hand and went to the man to buy the jam . but when she turned around , her mom was gone . lily was scared and started to cry . she looked everywhere , but she could not find her mom . a nice lady saw lily crying and tried to help her , but they could not find her mom . in the end , lily was very sad and learned a big lesson about staying close to her mom . one day , a large dog named max was playing in the park . he saw a glass on the ground . max wanted to play with the glass , so he picked it up with his mouth .

max saw his friend , a small cat named lily . lily said , " max , you should not play with the glass . it can break and hurt you . " max listened to lily and put the glass down .

max and lily played catch with a ball . max missed the ball , but he did not care . he was happy to be playing with his friend and not the glass . they played all day and had fun together . once upon a time , there was a little boy named tim . tim had a big blue ball . he loved to play with his blue ball every day . one day , he met a girl named sue . sue wanted to play with the blue ball too .

