as they played , tim and sue learned to share the blue ball . they became good friends . they raised the ball high in the air and caught it together . they played happily ever after , and the blue ball brought them lots of wonder and fun . once upon a time , there was a heavy rock . the rock could not move , but it had a voice . it could talk to the animals in the forest . the rock liked to spend time with the animals .

one day , a bird came to visit the heavy rock . the rock said , " hello , bird ! i like your voice . " the bird was happy and sang a song for the rock . they spent the day talking and singing .

as the sun went down , more animals came to see the heavy rock . the rock spent the night talking and laughing with all its friends . the animals loved the rock 's voice , and they all had a fun time together . one day , a little cat named tim saw a big truck outside his house . the truck had lots of furniture in it . tim was very excited . he wanted to try sitting on the new furniture . he thought it would be great fun .

tim went inside the house and saw a big chair . he tried to jump on it , but it was too high . " i will try again , " he said to himself . this time , he jumped higher and finally sat on the chair . " wow , this is great ! " tim said .

just then , tim 's friend , a little dog named max , came into the house . max saw the big chair and wanted to try sitting on it too . max said , " can i try sitting on the chair , tim ? " tim said , " yes , max , you can try . " max tried and tried , but he could not jump high enough . tim helped max by giving him a little push . together , they both sat on the chair and had a great time . once upon a time , there was a big rhinoceros named remy . remy loved to paint . he would paint all day long . his favorite thing to paint was the sun . he painted the sun with red , yellow , and orange colors .

