but max was naughty . instead of painting the sun , max painted on remy 's face ! remy was sad and said , " max , that 's not nice ! " max felt bad and said , " i 'm sorry , remy . i will be good now . " then , max and remy painted a big , beautiful sun together . they became good friends and painted many more pictures together . once upon a time , there was a fearful duck named ducky . ducky lived in a small pond with his friends . they liked to play and swim all day . but ducky was always scared of new things .

one day , ducky saw a long , green thing in the water . he did n't know what it was . " what is that ? " he asked his friend , froggy . froggy said , " that is grass . do not be scared , ducky . i will help you cut it . "

ducky and froggy swam to the grass . froggy showed ducky how to cut the grass with his beak . they cut and cut until the pond was clean . ducky was not fearful anymore . he was happy and thanked froggy for helping him . from that day on , ducky and froggy became best friends , and they played happily in the pond . one day , a famous bird named bob lived in a big tree . bob was very happy . he liked to sing and play with his friends . but bob had a big problem . he could not scream like a bird . when he tried to scream , it sounded like a cat .

one day , bob met a new friend named tim . tim was a little bug . tim wanted to play with bob . " let 's play war , " said tim . " i will be the good bug and you will be the bad bird . when i say ' go ' , you scream . " bob was scared , but he wanted to try .

they started to play . tim said , " go ! " and bob tried to scream like a bird . at first , it sounded like a cat . but then , something changed . bob 's scream became loud and strong like a real bird . bob was so happy that he could scream like a bird . he thanked tim for helping him . from that day on , bob and tim played war every day , and bob became famous for his big , strong scream . once upon a time , in a small house , there was a gloomy kitchen . in the kitchen , there was a yummy sausage . the sausage was hanging on a hook .

