lily and ben laugh as they watch the ducks eat the bread . they feel the cool breeze on their faces and the sun on their hair . they row the boat around the pond , waving to mom on the shore . they have a lot of fun on the boat . they love the park . tim and kim were twins who loved dinosaurs . they had many dinosaur toys and books in their room . they liked to pretend they were dinosaur explorers and find new kinds of dinosaurs .

