tom nodded and said sorry . he felt bad for being naughty and hurting himself and the glass ball . he hugged mom and lily and said he loved them . he learned his lesson . he would not climb the tree again . he would play with lily and have fun . sara and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys and watch tv . one day , they see a big truck on tv . the truck has a lot of letters and pictures on it . it is a news truck . the news truck goes to different places and tells people what is happening .

