they hug and hold hands . they are happy . they have learned a lesson . they will never go near a bad dog again . they will always listen to each other . they will always be friends . lily was a furry cat who liked to play and nap in her home . she had a big place with many rooms and toys . she also had a family who loved her and gave her food and cuddles . lily was happy most of the time , but sometimes she felt worry .

one day , lily heard a loud noise outside . she looked out the window and saw a big truck . the truck had a big box on it . lily saw her family put some of their things in the box . she saw her bed , her bowl , her ball and her mouse . lily did not like this . she did not want to lose her things . she did not want to leave her place . she felt worry .

she ran to her family and meowed . she tried to tell them to stop . she tried to get her things back . but they did not listen . they picked her up and put her in a small cage . they put the cage in the car . they drove away from her place . lily felt more worry .

she did not know where they were going . she did not like the car . she did not like the cage . she did not like the noise . she felt scared . she meowed louder . she scratched the cage . she wanted to go back to her place .

after a long time , the car stopped . lily saw a new place . it was different from her old place . it had a different color , a different shape , a different smell . she saw her family take her cage out of the car . they opened the cage and let her out . they smiled and said , " lily , this is our new home . we moved here because we got a new job . we brought all your things with us . do n't worry , you will like it here . we love you , lily . "

