she decided to give the new place a chance . she decided to play with her toys , nap on the sofa , look out the window , climb the tree . she decided to be happy . she still missed her old place , but she liked her new place too . she liked her family more . she felt no worry . lily loved her pony , max . he was brown and soft and had a long tail . lily liked to brush his hair and feed him carrots . sometimes , she rode on his back and he took her around the farm .

but max was also stubborn . he did not like to do what lily said . he wanted to go where he liked and eat what he liked . he did not listen to lily or her dad . he made lily angry and sad .

