lily and max smiled and got back on . they followed lily 's dad to the pond and the apple tree . they shared the water and the apples . they were nice to each other . they were friends . sara and ben are friends . they like to play outside in the sun . one day , they find a big hill with green grass and yellow flowers . they want to go to the top of the hill .

