they hold hands again and start to skip . they skip slow and careful . they skip to the tip of the hill . they see the sun and the sky and the world . they feel happy and free . they are friends . lily liked to look at the books on the bookcase . she liked the pictures and the colors . she wanted to read the words , but they were too hard . she asked her mom to read to her .

