the bald man smiled . he was glad he could find a way to share the jelly . in the end , everyone was happy ! once upon a time there was a young girl . she walked through the forest and saw a big tree . she decided to climb it and when she got to the top , she saw a magical wrap . it floated in the air and she watched it turn around and around . she reached out and grabbed it in her hands . the wrap sparkled so brightly and it felt very special .

