the young girl was so happy that she had found the magical wrap . she held it close and knew it would stay special to her forever . once there was a little girl who loved to play outside . one day , she discovered a mysterious lawn that she had never seen before . she decided to explore it . as she stepped onto the lawn , she felt something strange . suddenly , the grass began to stand up on its own ! the little girl was scared and tried to run away . but no matter how fast she ran , the tall grass kept following her .

