tom laughed and hugged his cats . he was glad that they had come over , despite the fact that it was hot outside . once upon a time there was a wide race . the racers wanted to win , but no one knew how . suddenly , one of the racers had an idea . she said , " let 's release the racers , and the first one to the finish line wins ! " the other racers agreed and so they released the racers . the racers ran quickly and the race was on ! along the way , the racers had to jump over obstacles and go around tight corners , but in the end the fastest racer showed everyone the way to the finish line . everyone cheered when the fastest racer crossed the finish line first and won the race ! once upon a time , there was a chicken who appeared . she was very excited to explore the world . she clucked and flapped her wings around , trying to find something fun to do . but everywhere she went was so boring . the fields were dull and nothing ever happened .

