the chicken hopped inside and joined the party . she clucked along with the other animals and they had a lot of fun . even though it was boring outside , the chicken made the best of it and had a great time inside the barn . mary was a 3 - year - old girl who loved the beach and she loved to sign in the sand . every day after school , mary would go down to the beach and every day she would sign her name in the sand .

