that night , as alex lay in bed , he thought about brand - new pillow he had made . he thought of how his aunt had taken her time to explain and guide him , and he realised how important it was to mind his parents too .

with this in mind , alex felt glad he had a special aunt to look up to , and he drifted off to sleep with a warm , happy feeling in his heart . once there was a little bird named walter . he was very dependable and never worried about anything . he lived in a small tree by the river .

