walter wanted to share it with his friends , so he hopped around and told every bird he could find , " never worry and always be dependable ! "

one of his friends , a little sparrow named sarah , was a bit scared . she asked walter , " what if something bad happens ? how can i not worry ? "

walter smiled and took out the notebook . he said , " just remember what it says in here . if you stay dependable and do n't worry , everything will be okay . "

sarah smiled too and understood . walter had given her the best advice . from that day forward , she stopped worrying and stayed dependable . once upon a time , there was a girl called jane who lived in a country . one day , she heard a rumour that something bad was happening in another country . jane wanted to know more and asked her friend : " is it true what they said ? " her friend sadly replied " yes , it is true " . jane was sad to hear the bad news and replied : " that 's not nice " .

