mommy smiled , " you had so much fun balancing . good job ! " once there was a nosy little girl named anne . she wanted to buy a basketball , but she did n't have any money . she walked up to a man and asked him , " can i sell something to you ? " the man was curious , so he asked anne to show him what she had to sell .

anne showed him a toy car . the man said he would n't buy the car but he knew someone who would . he took anne to meet his friend and told him about the toy car that anne had to sell . the friend bought it from anne and she got enough money to buy the basketball she wanted !

when anne got home with her basketball , her mom was very happy for her . now anne and her mom could play together outside in the yard . anne was so happy that she sold her toy car for the basketball . she had a lot of fun every day playing with her mom . once upon a time , there was a huge tree in the forest . every day , the tree would gain bigger and bigger and its roots went deeper and deeper in the ground . soon enough , the tree was so huge , it was the biggest in the whole forest .

