the kids climbed it every day and even used the big roots to play games . they would slide down them , swing from them and even touch them .

the tree stayed in the forest for many years and the kids were so happy when the huge tree was around . but one day , the tree blew down in a big storm and the kids were sad . nonetheless , they still held fond memories of the huge tree in the forest forever . once there was a boy who was walking on the road . he wanted to get home but he could n't find it . he kept on walking for hours . he got so tired that he decided to take a rest .

suddenly , he found a big sign on the road . it was his home ! he was so happy that he thanked the sign .

