the nosy cat nodded and the two animals started to move around the garden together . they chatted and laughed while they moved around the garden , sniffing the flowers and bushes .

at the end of the day , the two friends said goodbye and promised to meet again soon . once upon a time , there lived an old man by the ocean . every day , he would take a boat out to sea and stare curiously at the horizon .

one day , it happened to be the most beautiful day yet - the sky was a brilliant blue and the sun shone in all its glory . as the old man gazed out across the endless ocean , he saw a graceful ship coming his way .

he quickly grabbed his binoculars and called out to the ship , " ahoy ! what brings you here ? "

the ship slowly pulled up alongside the old man 's boat , and a voice boomed out , " we are here to pour some grace on the ocean " .

the old man was confused - why would they be pouring grace on the ocean ? he watched with awe as the crew on the ship began to pour sparkling liquid into the ocean , making the waters glimmer and shine brightly .

the old man smiled . what a wonderful sight ! he thanked the crew for their kind efforts , and he knew that his boat was now surrounded by grace - so much it was spilling over into the ocean of the world .

the old man waved goodbye and set sail back to shore with a feeling of contentment . jake had a busy day . he was busy lifting things . suddenly , he heard a noise . he looked around and saw a small rail . jake went to it and tried to lift it with all his might , but it was too heavy .

