they look around . they see the sky and the sun and the clouds . they see the trees and the fields and the river . they see their home and their families and their friends .

they wave and shout . they are proud and joyful . they are on the top of the world . tom and sue are friends . they like to play with cars and trucks . one day , they find a big , old truck in the yard . it is red and rusty . they want to drive it .

