tom and sue nod . they agree . they learned their lesson . they will not play with the old truck again . they will play with their own cars and trucks . they are smaller and safer . and they do not have teeth . anna loves to sing and dance . she likes to perform for her family and friends . she has a big red curtain in her room that she uses as a stage . she pretends that she is a star and that everyone is watching her .

one day , she invites her best friend lily to come and see her show . lily is very excited and brings a basket of lemons as a gift . anna says thank you and puts the basket on a table . she tells lily to sit on the bed and wait for the show to start .

