anna and lily go behind the curtain and choose some costumes and props . they decide to do a funny skit about two sisters who make lemonade . they come out from behind the curtain and act out their skit . they pretend to squeeze the lemons , pour the water and sugar , and taste the lemonade . they make funny faces and say , " yuck ! this lemonade is too sour ! " they laugh and try to fix the lemonade by adding more sugar and water . they taste it again and say , " mmm , this lemonade is very good . do you want some ? " they offer the lemonade to their stuffed animals and dolls .

anna and lily have a lot of fun performing together . they make each other laugh and smile . they finish their show and bow to their audience . they say , " thank you for watching our show . we hope you liked it . goodbye ! " they close the curtain and hug each other . they are very happy and proud of their show . they share the real lemonade and cookies that lily brought . they say , " cheers ! " and drink to their friendship . lily and tom were playing in the park . they liked to admire the flowers and the birds . they saw a big black dog with a shiny collar . the dog was barking and running around .

