they put their puzzles away . they decide to play with something else . they are good friends . they like to help each other . lily was a clever girl who liked to play with her toys . she had a lot of dolls and animals and cars and blocks . she liked to make them talk and do funny things . she also liked to dress them up in different clothes .

one day , she found a hanger in her closet . it was a big hanger with a hook and a bar . she thought it looked like a swing . she wanted to make her toys swing on it . she took the hanger and put it on the door knob . then she picked up her favorite doll , anna , and put her on the bar . she pushed anna gently and made her swing back and forth .

