" she said thank you , " tom says . " that is a word we know . "

" maybe we can teach her more words , " lily says .

" maybe we can learn more words from her , " tom says .

they sit on the swing with the new girl . they start to talk and play . they are happy . they have a new friend . ben liked to ask questions . he asked his mom , his dad , his sister , and his teacher . he asked about the sky , the trees , the animals , and the stars . he asked so many questions that sometimes they got tired of answering him .

one night , ben saw a light in his closet . he was curious . he asked , " who are you ? " the light said , " i am a spirit . i can tell you many things . " ben was happy . he asked , " can you be my friend ? " the spirit said , " yes , but you have to do what i say . "

the spirit told ben to do bad things . he told him to break his toys , to hit his sister , to lie to his mom , and to run away from his teacher . ben did not like to do bad things , but he wanted to learn more from the spirit . he was persistent . he asked , " why do i have to do bad things ? " the spirit said , " because it is fun . and if you do n't , i will hurt you . "

ben was scared . he wanted to stop , but he did not know how . he asked , " how can i make you go away ? " the spirit said , " you ca n't . i will stay with you forever . you are mine . " ben cried . he wished he never asked the light in his closet . he wished he listened to his mom , his dad , his sister , and his teacher . he wished he had a good friend , not a bad spirit . but it was too late . the spirit laughed . he said , " you asked for it . " tom and lily liked to play near the lake . they saw a fisherman with a big hat and a long stick . he threw a string into the water and waited .

" can we watch him ? " lily asked tom .

" ok , but we have to be quiet , " tom said . " he is trying to catch fish . "

they sat on the grass and looked at the fisherman . he was very alert . he watched the string and felt the stick . sometimes he smiled and sometimes he frowned .

" what is he doing ? " lily whispered .

" he is guessing , " tom whispered back . " he is guessing if there is a fish on the string or not . if there is , he will pull the stick and get the fish . if not , he will throw the string again . "

they watched for a long time . the fisherman guessed right and wrong many times . he caught some fish and put them in a basket . he missed some fish and shook his head .

" wow , he is good at guessing , " lily said .

" yes , he is , " tom agreed . " but i think we are better at guessing . "

" how ? " lily asked .

" let 's guess how many fish he has in his basket , " tom said . " i guess five . "

" i guess six , " lily said .

they got up and walked to the fisherman . they smiled and said hello .

