one day , she saw something new in the park . it was shiny and big and had a star on top . it was a trophy . lily wondered who it belonged to . she wanted to touch it and see how it felt . she ran to the trophy and reached for it .

but before she could touch it , a boy came and shouted at her . he said , " hey , that 's mine ! do n't touch it ! i won it in a race ! " he grabbed the trophy and held it tight . he looked angry and mean .

lily felt sad and scared . she did not mean to make the boy mad . she just wanted to see the trophy . she ran back to her mom and hugged her . she told her what happened .

her mom said , " i 'm sorry , lily . that was not nice of him . he should have shared his trophy with you . but you know what ? you do n't need a trophy to be special . you are special because you are kind , curious , and brave . you are my trophy , and i love you very much . "

lily felt glad and warm . she smiled and said , " i love you too , mom . you are my trophy too . " she kissed her mom and hugged her again . she forgot about the boy and the trophy . she was happy in the park with her mom . lily was a naughty girl . she liked to play with things that were not hers . one day , she saw a shiny key on the table . she wanted to see what it could unlock . she took the key and ran to the basement .

in the basement , there was a big metal box . it had a lock on it . lily put the key in the lock and turned it . the box opened with a click . inside , there were many old papers and books . they looked dusty and brown . lily was curious . she took out some papers and books and threw them on the floor .

" look what i found ! " she shouted . she did not hear her mom coming down the stairs .

" lily , what are you doing ? " her mom asked . she was angry and scared . she saw the papers and books on the floor . she smelled something burning . she looked at the box and saw a small flame .

" lily , you have to get out of here ! the box has ash in it ! it is from a fire that happened a long time ago . it is very dangerous ! " her mom said . she grabbed lily and ran to the door .

but the door was locked . lily had locked it with the key . she had left the key in the box . the flame was getting bigger and bigger . the papers and books were catching fire . the smoke was filling the air .

" help ! help ! " lily and her mom cried . they banged on the door . they hoped someone would hear them and unlock the door . they learned a hard lesson . lily should not have been naughty . she should not have played with things that were not hers . sara and ben are at the beach with their mom and dad . they like to play in the sand and splash in the water . they have a big bucket and a small shovel . they want to make a sand castle .

" look , sara , i have a whale ! " ben says . he shows sara his shovel . he has filled it with wet sand and shaped it like a whale . he has made a tail and a fin and a mouth .

" that is a good whale , ben . but it is not pink . whales are not pink , " sara says . she has a pink hat and a pink dress . she likes pink very much .

" yes , they are . some whales are pink . like this one , " ben says . he points to the water . sara and ben see a big splash . they see something pink and shiny . it is a whale !

" wow , ben , you are right ! there is a pink whale ! " sara says . she and ben run to the water . they wave at the whale . the whale waves back with its tail . it makes a loud noise . sara and ben laugh .

