" you are welcome , pink whale . you are very pretty . we are happy to meet you , " sara says . she and ben smile . they are happy too .

the pink whale smiles back . it says goodbye . it swims away . sara and ben wave . they go back to their mom and dad . they tell them about the pink whale . mom and dad are amazed . they hug sara and ben . they have a wonderful day at the beach . lily and ben liked to play in the garden . they had many toys , but their favorite was the big box of blocks . they could build anything they wanted with the blocks : houses , towers , bridges , and more .

one day , they decided to build a path with the blocks . they wanted to make a path from the door to the swing . they worked hard and used many blocks . they were happy with their path . it was fine and long and colorful .

but then , max came . max was lily 's big brother . he was not nice . he saw the path and laughed . " what is this ? a path for ants ? this is silly . i want to play soccer here . move your blocks , or i will kick them away ! "

