but then , the red ball went too far . it went over the fence and into the neighbor 's yard . tim was sad . he asked his mom , " can i get my red ball back ? " his mom said , " no , it is too late now . we can try tomorrow . " tim went to bed sad because he lost his red ball . one day , a little girl named mia went to the park with her mom . they sat on the grass and watched the birds in the sky . mia loved to watch the birds fly and sing . she saw a small , upset bird sitting on a branch . the bird looked sad and did n't sing like the other birds .

