mia walked closer to the tree and said , " do n't be upset , little bird . i have some food for you . " she threw the pieces of bread on the ground near the bird . the bird hopped down from the branch and started to eat the bread . it looked happier now .

soon , the bird started to sing a beautiful song . mia and her mom smiled as they watched the happy bird . they knew they had made a new friend at the park . and from that day on , every time they went to the park , they brought some bread for their little bird friend . one day , a little cat with soft fur went to the shop . the cat wanted to buy a toy . the cat saw many interesting toys on the shelf . there were balls , dolls , and cars . the cat picked a ball and went to the shopkeeper .

" can i pay for this ball ? " asked the cat with the soft fur .

