from that day on , bob and tim became the best of friends . they continued to travel and explore the world together , making many more memories and friends along the way . once upon a time , there was a small , humble bird named billy . billy was very shy and did not like to talk much . one day , he was flying in the park and saw a big stone . he thought it would be fun to sit on the stone and watch the other animals play .

