from that day on , billy was not so shy anymore . he played with sammy and the other animals every day . they all had lots of fun together , and billy was happy to have such good friends . and the big stone in the park became their favorite place to meet and play . once upon a time , there was a unique soldier . he was very tall and strong . he had a big hat and shiny boots . he lived in a small house with his friend , a tiny mouse .

