later , they found out that a sneaky cat took the cheese . the soldier and the mouse said sorry to each other . they became best friends again . they got the cheese back and shared it . they lived happily ever after . once upon a time , there was a boy named tim . tim was eager to sail on the big blue sea . one day , he got a gift from his mom . it was a small boat .

