tim 's small boat tipped over and he fell into the water . the waves took his boat away , and tim was sad . he wished he had waited for someone to help him sail . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play with her makeup . one day , she saw a big red box in her room . it was full of delicious cookies . she wanted to eat them all , but she knew she should not .

