tim thought it was a good idea . he said , " yes , we can share the sandwich . " the bird flew down and gave the sandwich back to tim . they all sat together and enjoyed the sandwich . tim was happy that he could solve the problem and make a new friend . one day , a little girl named amy was playing in her yard . she loved to dig in the ground and look for bugs . her mom watched her from the window to make sure she was safe .

