tim and his mom went around the house looking for things to lock . they tried to lock the toy box , but the key did n't fit . they tried to lock the door , but the key did n't fit there either . finally , they found a little treasure box that the key fit perfectly . tim locked the box and put the key back in his pocket . he was very proud of his new treasure box and key . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lucy . she had a sister named lily . lucy was brave and loved to play outside . lily was a bit shy and liked to play inside .

