the broken glass made amy and tim feel bad . they learned that they must be careful with things they love , or they might break them . once upon a time , there was a little monkey named momo . momo lived in a big tree with lots of vines . he loved to swing from vine to vine , playing with his friends all day long . momo was always very happy .

