after they picked the blueberries , the bunny , the squirrel , and the snake sat under the tree . they ate the blueberries and laughed . they were all friends now . they learned that sharing was good and made everyone happy . one day , a little bird named tim was very fearful . he was scared to get food because there was a big cat near his nest . tim 's nest was high up in a tree , safe from the cat . but tim needed to fly down to the ground to find food .

