this story teaches us to value friendship and helping others . when we are loyal and kind , we make many friends . friends are important and make us happy . once upon a time , there was a girl named lily . she had a doll with only one leg . lily loved her doll very much . one day , lily met a boy named tim . tim had a toy car that was icy blue . they played together every day .

