dad told mia a story about a kind king and a brave queen from long , long ago . mia listened and her eyes grew big . she loved the story and wanted to know more about history .

from that day on , mia and her dad read more history stories together . mia 's love for history grew bigger and bigger . she knew that history could teach her many things about the world . once upon a time , there was a lovely cat named kitty . kitty loved to play outside with her friends . one day , it rained a lot and everything was wet . kitty wanted to play with her friends , but they were all inside their homes .

kitty saw a big truck nearby . the truck was loading some boxes . kitty had an idea . she said to the truck driver , " can you help me play with my friends ? " the truck driver said , " sure , i will load you into the truck and take you to your friends . "

