tim stood by the couch in his house . he looked at a distant wall and thought it was a good place to throw the ball . he threw the ball as hard as he could .

the ball hit the wall and bounced back . tim was happy that he could throw the ball so far . he played with the ball all day , throwing it near the couch and the distant wall . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she lived in a normal house with her mom and dad . one day , lily saw the mailman coming down the street . he had a big bag of mail for everyone .

