the wide moon smiled and said , " do n't be sad , little star . you are special just the way you are . " the little star smiled and felt happy . from that day on , the little star shined brightly in the sky , next to the wide moon . once upon a time , there was a little train . the train had a big engine . it was very strong . but the train thought its job was boring . it went up and down the same track every day . the train wanted to do something new and fun .

one day , the train saw a big tree . the tree had a long branch . the train had an idea . it poked the branch with its engine . the branch moved a little . the train poked it again . this time , the branch moved a lot . the train was happy . it was not bored anymore .

but then , the tree branch fell on the track . the train could not go up and down the track anymore . the train was sad . it learned that its job was important . the train promised to do its job and not poke trees anymore . the train learned that even if something seems boring , it can still be important . one day , a big truck was driving down the road . the truck was incredible because it could talk . the truck 's name was tim .

