sam 's mom saw the mess and was not happy . she told tim and sam to clean up the water . they were sad , but they knew they had to fix it . so , they got a mop and cleaned the floor . after that , they played with their toys and had a fun day . once upon a time , in a big garden , there was a playful mole . the mole liked to dig holes and play in the dirt all day . one day , the mole met a little boy named tim . they became good friends and played together every day .

