tim looked and looked , but the mole seemed to vanish . he felt very sad and cried . tim never saw the playful mole again . the garden was quiet , and tim missed his friend very much . one day , a smart little fish named tim swam in the sea . he saw an oyster on the sea floor . the oyster was sad because he could not open his shell . tim wanted to help the oyster .

