the little girl smiled and hugged her mom . she was so happy and she knew that taking good care of her sunny comb was the best thing she could do . anna liked to dress up her toys . she had a bear , a doll , a frog and a seal . she put hats and scarves and dresses on them . she thought they looked very attractive .

