anna felt a little better , but she still missed her seal . she hoped the dog would not hurt it . she hoped she would see it again . she learned to be more careful with her toys . she learned that some animals might not know they were toys . she learned that attractive things might attract trouble . lila and ben were twins who liked to play in the farm . they had many animals to see and feed , but their favorite was molly , the old mule . molly was gentle and friendly , and she let them ride on her back sometimes .

