one day , tom went to the lake with his mom and dad . he was very happy . he put on his swimsuit and ran to the water . he dived in and felt the cool water on his skin . he swam and splashed and had fun . he dived under the water and saw a big frog . he wanted to touch it , but the frog was too fast . he chased the frog until he ran out of air . he came up and took a big breath .

