tom was sad . he did not want to get out of the water . he wanted to dive and play . but his leg was too itchy . he had to do what his mom said . he got out of the water and dried off . his mom put some cream on his leg and gave him a hug . she said , " do n't worry , tom . the itch will go away soon . you can dive and play another day . for now , you need to rest and let the cream work . "

