they hugged and smiled . they decided to make a new castle , but this time , farther from the ocean . they also decided to share their bucket and shovel and have more fun . lila and ben like to play at the beach . they have a big surf that they can ride on the waves . lila is strong and can carry the surf by herself . ben is not so strong , but he is fast and can run to the water .

one day , they see a big rock near the shore . it has sharp edges and looks scary . lila says , " let 's stay away from that rock . it can cut us if we touch it . " ben says , " ok , but i want to see how close i can get to it . it looks fun . "

lila and ben take their surf and go to the water . they wait for a big wave and then jump on their surf . they glide on the water and feel happy . but ben is not careful . he goes too close to the rock and his surf hits it . he falls off and feels a pain in his leg . he looks and sees blood . the rock cut him .

lila hears ben cry and goes to help him . she sees his leg and says , " oh no , ben , you are hurt . come , i will take you to mom and dad . they will make you better . " she helps him get out of the water and carries him to their parents . they put a bandage on his leg and hug him . they say , " you were brave , ben , but you have to be careful . the rock is dangerous . next time , listen to lila and stay away from it . "

ben says , " i 'm sorry , lila . i was silly . i wo n't go near the rock again . thank you for helping me . you are a good sister . " lila says , " you 're welcome , ben . i love you . you are a good brother . " they smile and hug . they still like to play at the beach , but they never go near the rock again . they have fun with their surf and their friends . they are happy . tim and lily liked to ride their bikes in the park . they had big bikes with two wheels and pedals . they wore helmets and gloves to be safe . one day , they saw a new sign in the park . it had a picture of a bike and an arrow . it said " bike trail " .

