" ok ! " lily said . " but be careful . we do n't know what 's ahead . "

they followed the sign and the arrow . they rode on a dirt path that went up and down and around . they saw trees and flowers and birds . they had fun .

but then , they came to a big hill . the sign said " caution " . it had a picture of a bike and a line . it said " no bikes " .

" what does that mean ? " tim asked .

" it means we ca n't ride our bikes here , " lily said . " we have to stop and walk . "

" why ? " tim asked .

" maybe because it 's too steep or too rocky or too dangerous , " lily said .

but tim did not listen . he wanted to ride his bike down the hill . he thought it would be fun . he did not stop . he did not walk . he pedaled faster and faster .

" tim , wait ! " lily shouted . " stop ! it 's not safe ! "

but tim did not hear her . he zoomed down the hill . he did not see the big hole in the ground . he did not see the ancient bones that were buried there . he did not see the skull that looked like a dinosaur .

he only saw them when it was too late . he crashed into the hole . he fell off his bike . he landed on the bones . he hurt his arm and his leg and his head . he cried .

lily ran down the hill . she saw tim and his bike and the bones and the skull . she was scared . she called for help .

soon , a man came . he was a park ranger . he had a radio and a first aid kit . he helped tim . he bandaged his wounds . he called an ambulance .

he also looked at the bones and the skull . he was amazed . he said they were very old and very rare . he said they were fossils . he said they were from a time when dinosaurs lived .

he said tim and lily had made a big discovery . he said they were very lucky .

but tim and lily did not feel lucky . they felt sorry . they wished they had followed the sign . they wished they had stopped and walked . they learned their lesson . they never rode their bikes where they were not supposed to again . anna liked to play in the pond near her house . she liked to look at the fish , the ducks and the frogs . one day , she saw a frog that was hurt . it had a cut on its leg and it could not hop well .

