she put the frog in a bowl with some water and leaves . she found a band - aid and wrapped it around the frog 's leg . she gave the frog some flies to eat . she said to the frog , " you are my friend . i will make you better . "

the frog felt happy and safe with anna . it croaked to say thank you . anna smiled and stroked the frog 's head . she said to the frog , " you are welcome . i love you . "

