she carried the frog to the pond and gently put it down . she said to the frog , " goodbye , my friend . i will miss you . but you belong here . be happy and free . "

the frog croaked to say goodbye and thank you . it hopped into the water and joined the other frogs . anna waved and blew a kiss . she said to the frog , " i will always remember you . you are a special frog . " lila was a compassionate daughter . she loved her mommy and daddy very much . she liked to help them with chores and make them happy . sometimes , she would give them hugs and kisses and say " i love you " .

one day , mommy was not feeling well . she had a headache and a sore throat . she stayed in bed and drank some tea . lila wanted to make mommy feel better . she asked daddy what she could do .

