lila climbed on the bed and gave mommy the picture and the book . she leaned on mommy and hugged her . mommy kissed her and said , " i love you , lila . you make me feel better . " they read the book together and looked at the pictures . lila felt happy and proud . she was a compassionate daughter . ben and lily liked to watch tv after dinner . they watched funny shows with animals and songs . they laughed and clapped their hands . mom and dad watched with them and smiled .

one day , the tv made a loud noise and stopped working . ben and lily were sad and confused . they wanted to watch more tv . mom and dad looked at the tv and shook their heads . they said the tv was broken and they had to get a new one .

