then , ben had an idea . he saw a big box in the corner . it was the box that the tv came in . he ran to the box and opened it . he found some bubble wrap and some paper inside . he took them out and started to pop the bubbles and tear the paper . he made a lot of noise and mess .

lily saw what ben was doing and joined him . she also popped the bubbles and tore the paper . she threw them in the air and watched them fall . they scattered all over the floor and the couch . they made a bigger noise and mess .

mom and dad heard the noise and came to see what was going on . they saw ben and lily having fun with the box and the stuff inside . they saw the floor and the couch covered with bubbles and paper . they were not happy . they told ben and lily to stop and clean up . they said they were making too much noise and mess .

ben and lily did not want to stop and clean up . they wanted to keep playing with the box and the stuff inside . they said they were having fun and they did not care about the noise and mess . they did not listen to mom and dad .

mom and dad were angry . they took the box and the stuff away from ben and lily . they said they were being naughty and rude . they said they had to go to bed without a story . they said they would not get a new tv until they learned to behave .

ben and lily were very sad and sorry . they realized they had made a mistake . they wished they had listened to mom and dad . they wished they had been more quiet and tidy . they wished they had been more peaceful . they said they were sorry and hugged mom and dad . they said they would be good and help with the cleaning . they said they would not play with the box and the stuff again .

mom and dad forgave ben and lily . they said they loved them and they were proud of them . they said they would get a new tv soon and they would watch it together . they said they would also read them a story before bed . they said they were happy and they hugged ben and lily . they said they were peaceful . tom and jen were twins who liked to play with toys . they had many toys in their room , but they did not take care of them . they left them on the floor , in the closet , under the bed , and in the drawers . they did not share their toys with each other or with their friends . they always wanted more toys .

one day , their mom said , " tom and jen , your room is full of junk . you have too many toys that you do not use or love . you need to clean your room and give away some of your toys to other kids who need them . "

tom and jen did not like this idea . they said , " no , mom , we love all our toys . we do not want to give them away . they are not junk , they are rare and special . "

mom said , " if you love your toys , you should show it by keeping them neat and tidy . and if they are rare and special , you should share them with others who would appreciate them . you have more than enough toys , and some kids have none . think about how you would feel if you had no toys to play with . "

tom and jen thought about it . they realized that mom was right . they did not need so many toys , and they could make other kids happy by giving them some of their toys . they decided to clean their room and sort out their toys . they kept the ones that they really liked and played with , and put the ones that they did not use or care for in a big box . they asked mom to take them to a charity shop , where they could donate their toys to other kids .

mom was proud of tom and jen . she said , " well done , tom and jen . you have learned a valuable lesson today . you have learned that having too many things does not make you happy , but giving to others does . you have learned that some things are not junk , but rare and precious , like kindness and generosity . and you have learned that things do not fit in your room , but in your heart . " lily and ben were playing in the kitchen . they liked to pretend they were spies and had guns made of spoons . they hid behind the table and the chairs and shot at each other . " bang , bang , you 're dead ! " they shouted .

but then lily saw something scary . the faucet was dripping water on the floor . it made a loud noise like a snake . lily was fearful of snakes . she screamed and ran away from the faucet .

ben heard lily scream and saw the water . he was not fearful of water . he thought it was fun . he ran to the faucet and turned it on . the water came out fast and strong . he grabbed a spoon and shot the water at lily . " bang , bang , you 're wet ! " he laughed .

lily was angry and wet . she did not like ben 's joke . she grabbed a towel and threw it at ben . the towel hit ben 's face and made him fall . he hit his head on the floor . he cried and held his head .

