" one dollar for the balloon , two dollars for the ice cream , " the vendor said .

lily and ben did not have any money . they looked at mom and dad . mom and dad smiled and gave them some money . lily and ben were happy . they thanked the vendor and took their things .

" let 's go back to mom and dad , " lily said .

but ben did not want to go . he saw a toy car that he liked . he wanted to have it too .

