ben felt sad . he did not want to leave the car . he cried and shouted .

" no , no , no ! i want the car ! i want the car ! " ben said .

lily felt uncomfortable . she did not like ben 's crying and shouting . she did not like the vendor 's frowning and shaking his head . she did not like the people 's staring and whispering . she wished ben would stop and stay with them .

" ben , please . stop crying and shouting . stay with us . the car is not important . grandma is important . she loves you and wants to see you , " lily said .

ben looked at lily . he saw her balloon and ice cream . he saw her sad and worried face . he felt sorry . he stopped crying and shouting . he gave the car back to the vendor . he said sorry to the vendor , mom , and dad . he hugged lily and said sorry to her too .

" ok , lily . i 'm sorry . let 's go . i love you and grandma too , " ben said .

lily smiled and hugged ben back . she was glad he was calm and happy again . they went back to mom and dad . mom and dad hugged them and said they were proud of them . they all walked to meet grandma . they had a good day in the park . lily and ben were twins who liked to play together . one day , their mom baked some yummy pastries for them . she put them on a plate and told them to share .

" here you go , my sweeties . you can have one pastry each . but be careful , they are still hot . and remember to be honest and fair with each other , okay ? " mom said .

" okay , mom . thank you ! " lily and ben said .

mom went to the living room to watch tv . lily and ben looked at the plate . there were four pastries : two with chocolate and two with jam . lily loved chocolate and ben loved jam .

" i want the chocolate ones ! " lily said .

" i want the jam ones ! " ben said .

they each took one pastry of their favorite flavor and ate it . it was so good . they wanted more .

lily looked at the plate again . there was one chocolate pastry and one jam pastry left . she had an idea . she quickly grabbed the chocolate pastry and hid it behind her back .

" hey , lily , where is the other chocolate pastry ? " ben asked .

" i do n't know . maybe mom took it . " lily lied .

" that 's not fair . you already had one . i only had one . you should share . " ben said .

" no , i did n't . you are lying . you are greedy . " lily said .

they started to argue and yell at each other . they were not honest and fair . they were not nice .

mom heard them and came back to the kitchen . she saw them fighting and the pastry behind lily 's back .

" what 's going on here ? why are you screaming ? " mom asked .

" lily took the other chocolate pastry and lied to me . she did n't share . " ben said .

" no , i did n't . ben is lying . he wanted both jam pastries . " lily said .

mom was sad and angry . she knew who was telling the truth and who was lying . she took the pastry from lily 's hand and put it back on the plate .

" listen to me , both of you . you should be ashamed of yourselves . you were not honest and fair with each other . you were not kind and loving . you were selfish and mean . you hurt each other 's feelings and broke my trust . how do you think that makes me feel ? " mom said .

lily and ben felt sorry and guilty . they realized they had done wrong . they looked at each other and at mom .

" we are sorry , mom . we are sorry , ben . we are sorry , lily . we were wrong . we should have shared . we should have been honest and fair . we should have been kind and loving . we love you , mom . we love you , ben . we love you , lily . " they said .

they hugged each other and mom . they apologized and forgave each other . they learned their lesson . they promised to be honest and fair with each other from now on . they shared the last two pastries and enjoyed them together . mom was happy and proud . she hugged them and kissed them .

" that 's better . i love you , my sweeties . you are good kids . you can make mistakes , but you can also learn from them . you can be honest and fair with each other . you can be kind and loving . that 's what makes me happy . " mom said .

the end . anna and ben are brother and sister . they like to play with their toys in the living room . anna has a doll and ben has a car . they share their toys sometimes , but not always .

one day , anna sees ben 's car on the floor . she thinks it is pretty and shiny . she wants to play with it . she picks it up and makes it zoom around the couch . ben sees anna with his car . he is angry . he says , " that is my car ! give it back ! it belongs to me ! "

anna does not want to give it back . she says , " no , it is my car now ! i like it ! it belongs to me ! " they start to pull the car from each other . they yell and cry . they do not hear their mom coming .

mom is alert . she hears the noise in the living room . she walks in and sees anna and ben fighting over the car . she is not happy . she says , " stop it , both of you ! what is going on here ? why are you fighting over a toy ? "

anna and ben stop pulling the car . they look at mom . they are scared . they both say , " it is my car ! it belongs to me ! " mom shakes her head . she says , " no , it is not your car . it is ben 's car . he got it for his birthday . you have your own doll . you need to share and be nice to each other . you are brother and sister . you belong to each other . " she takes the car from anna and gives it back to ben . she gives anna a hug and says , " i 'm sorry , anna . i know you like the car , but it is not yours . maybe ben will let you play with it later , if you ask him nicely . can you say sorry to ben ? " anna nods . she says , " sorry , ben . " ben says , " sorry , anna . " they hug each other . mom smiles . she says , " that 's better . now , why do n't you play together with your toys ? i 'll make you some cookies . " anna and ben say , " okay , mom . thank you . " they go back to the couch and play with their toys . they are happy . they are brother and sister . they belong to each other . lily liked to make poems . she would think of words that sound nice together and say them out loud . sometimes she would write them down with her crayons . she had a book of poems that her mom gave her . she liked to read them and look at the pictures .

one day , she wanted to show her poems to her friend max . she took her book and went to his house . she knocked on the door and max opened it . he was happy to see her . he invited her in and they went to his room . he had a lot of toys and books .

lily said , " i have something to show you . it is my book of poems . do you want to hear them ? " max said , " yes , i like poems . can i see your book ? " lily gave him her book and he opened it . he looked at the pages and frowned . he said , " these are not poems . these are just words . and these are not pictures . these are just scribbles . this is a fake book . "

lily felt sad and angry . she said , " no , these are my poems . i made them . they are not fake . they are real . you are mean . you do n't understand poems . " she grabbed her book and ran out of his room . she went to the door and opened it . she wanted to go home .

but then she heard max call her name . he followed her and said , " wait , lily . i 'm sorry . i did n't mean to hurt your feelings . i was just joking . i like your poems . they are very creative . can you read them to me ? please ? "

lily paused . she looked at him and saw that he looked sorry . she thought for a moment . she liked max . he was her friend . maybe he was just teasing . maybe he did like her poems . she said , " okay , i will read them to you . but you have to listen carefully . and you have to say something nice after each one . deal ? "

max nodded . he said , " deal . i promise . let 's go back to my room . we can sit on the floor and read your book together . and maybe i can show you some of my books too . do you like dinosaurs ? "

lily smiled . she said , " yes , i like dinosaurs . they are big and scary and cool . come on , let 's go . " she took his hand and they went back to his room . they sat on the floor and opened her book . she read him her poems and he listened . he said something nice after each one . they had fun . they learned to appreciate each other 's words and pictures . they became better friends . lily was very sleepy . she had played a lot with her toys and her dog . she brushed her teeth and put on her pajamas . mommy read her a story and gave her a kiss . lily closed her eyes and went to sleep .

lily had a dream . in her dream , she was in a big kitchen . there were many muffins on the table . they smelled yummy . lily wanted to eat a muffin . she reached for a blueberry muffin . but then , the muffin moved . it had eyes and a mouth . it said , " hello , lily . do you want to be my friend ? "

lily was surprised . she had never seen a talking muffin before . she said , " yes , i want to be your friend . what is your name ? " the muffin said , " my name is muffy . i am a magic muffin . i can take you to a fun place . do you want to go with me ? "

lily said , " yes , i want to go with you . where are we going ? " muffy said , " we are going to the land of muffins . there are many muffins like me there . they are all different colors and flavors . they are all friendly and happy . you will love it there . "

lily said , " that sounds amazing . how do we get there ? " muffy said , " we just have to close our eyes and wish . are you ready ? " lily said , " yes , i am ready . " they closed their eyes and wished . then , they felt a warm breeze and a bright light .

when they opened their eyes , they were in the land of muffins . it was a beautiful place . there were muffins everywhere . some were big , some were small . some were plain , some had frosting . some had fruits , some had nuts . they all smiled and waved at lily and muffy . lily was very happy . she said , " wow , this is the best dream ever . thank you , muffy . you are a wonderful friend . " muffy said , " you are welcome , lily . you are a wonderful friend too . come on , let 's go and have some fun . " they ran and laughed and played with the other muffins . they had a great time .

but then , lily heard a voice . it was mommy . she said , " lily , wake up . it 's time for breakfast . " lily opened her eyes . she was in her bed . it was morning . the sun was shining . she saw mommy smiling at her . she said , " good morning , mommy . i had a dream . i dreamed about a magic muffin . his name was muffy . he took me to the land of muffins . it was so much fun . "

mommy said , " that sounds like a wonderful dream , lily . i 'm glad you enjoyed it . do you want to tell me more about it ? " lily said , " yes , mommy . i want to tell you everything . but first , can i have a muffin for breakfast ? " mommy said , " of course , you can . i made some blueberry muffins for you . they are in the kitchen . come on , let 's go and eat them . " lily said , " yay , muffins . i love muffins . maybe muffy will come back in my next dream . " mommy said , " maybe he will . you never know what can happen in your dreams . dreams are magic . " lily said , " yes , they are . dreams are magic . " she hugged mommy and went to the kitchen . she ate a muffin and smiled . she was happy . she had a good dream . she had a good friend . she had a good day . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to swing , slide and run . but they also liked to do magic . they had a big book of spells that they found in the library . they could not read all the words , but they liked to look at the pictures and say the sounds .

one day , they saw a spell that had a picture of a cloud and a lightning . they wanted to try it . they said the sounds and pointed at the sky . nothing happened . they said the sounds again and again . still nothing .

" maybe we need a stick , " ben said . he found a stick on the ground and gave it to lily . " you try it . you are better at magic . "

lily took the stick and said the sounds . she waved the stick at the sky . suddenly , a big cloud appeared . it was dark and angry . it made a loud noise . lily and ben were scared .

" uh - oh , " lily said . " i think we did a bad spell . "

the cloud started to rain . it rained hard and fast . lily and ben got wet . they ran to the playground to find shelter . but the rain followed them . it was like the cloud was angry at them .

" help ! " ben shouted . " how do we stop it ? "

lily looked at the book . she saw another picture . it had a sun and a rainbow . she hoped it was a good spell . she said the sounds and waved the stick . she hoped it would work .

the rain stopped . the cloud went away . the sun came out . a rainbow appeared . lily and ben smiled . they were happy .

" wow , " ben said . " you did it . you did a good spell . "

lily hugged him . " we did it . we did magic . "

they looked at the book . they wondered what other spells they could do . they decided to try one more . but they would be careful . they did not want to make another bad spell . lily and ben are friends who like to play outside . they have a big lawn with many flowers and bugs . one day , they decide to gather some flowers and make a crown for lily .

" look , ben , this one is pink and pretty ! " lily says , holding a flower in her hand .

" yes , it is . and this one is yellow and bright ! " ben says , picking another flower . " let 's put them together and make a crown . "

they find a flexible vine and start to tie the flowers on it . they make a circle that fits on lily 's head . lily smiles and puts the crown on .

" i am a princess ! " she says , twirling around .

" you are a beautiful princess ! " ben says , clapping his hands . " and i am a knight who protects you ! "

they pretend to have a castle on the lawn and have fun . they see a butterfly and chase it . they laugh and giggle . they are happy . lily and ben were twins who loved to play outside . one day , they saw a big tree with many fruits on it . they ran to the tree and picked some fruits . they were peaches , soft and sweet .

" look , lily , i have a peach for you ! " ben said , giving his sister a fruit .

" thank you , ben , you are very kind ! " lily said , smiling . she took a bite of the peach and made a happy sound . " this peach is very good ! it is juicy and yummy ! "

ben nodded and ate his peach too . he looked at the tree and saw more peaches . he wanted to get more for lily and himself . he climbed on a branch and reached for a peach . but he slipped and fell to the ground . he hurt his knee and cried .

lily heard ben 's cry and ran to him . she saw his knee was red and bleeding . she felt sorry for him and hugged him . she said , " do n't cry , ben , i am here for you . you are very brave ! "

she took a leaf from the ground and wrapped it around his knee . she said , " this will make your knee feel better . let 's go home and show mommy . she will give you a kiss and a band - aid . "

ben stopped crying and smiled at lily . he said , " thank you , lily , you are very nice ! you are the best sister ever ! "

they held hands and walked home . they still had their peaches in their other hands . they looked at the sky and saw the sun shining . they thought the sun was very beautiful , like their peaches . they were happy and grateful . they loved each other very much . lily liked to test things . she liked to see what would happen if she mixed water and paint , or if she jumped on the sofa , or if she hid her brother 's toy . sometimes her tests made a mess , or a noise , or a problem . then her mom or dad would be angry and tell her to stop .

one day , lily wanted to test something new . she saw a big jar of cookies on the kitchen counter . she wondered how many cookies she could eat before she felt full . she climbed on a chair and reached for the jar . but then she heard her mom 's voice .

" lily , what are you doing ? " her mom asked . " those cookies are for later . we have a promise , remember ? you can have one cookie after dinner , if you eat your vegetables . do you remember our promise ? "

lily nodded . she remembered the promise . she liked cookies , but she also liked to keep her promises . she put the jar back and got down from the chair . she looked at her mom and smiled .

" i 'm sorry , mom . i was just testing . i wo n't touch the cookies until later . i promise , " she said .

her mom hugged her and kissed her cheek . " that 's a good girl . i 'm proud of you for keeping your promise . now , why do n't you go and play with your brother ? he 's in the living room with his new puzzle . maybe you can help him solve it . "

lily thought puzzles were boring . she preferred to test things . but she also liked to play with her brother . maybe she could test how fast they could finish the puzzle together . she ran to the living room and joined her brother . she decided to keep her promise and her test for later . tom and lily are friends . they like to play together . one day , they find a big box in the park . it has a bow on it . it is a gift !

they are happy . they want to open the gift . but the box is locked . they need a key . they look around . they see a clue . it is a paper with a picture . the picture shows a tree , a bird , and a nest .

they think hard . they want to solve the clue . they run to the tree . they see the bird . they look at the nest . they find the key ! it is hidden in the nest .

they are smart . they use the key to open the box . they see what is inside . it is a puzzle . it has many pieces . they like puzzles . they think puzzles are fun and useful . they can learn new things from puzzles .

they are happy . they thank the bird . they take the puzzle home . they play with it together . they solve the puzzle . they see a beautiful picture . they smile . they hug . they are friends . they share the gift . lily and ben went to the park with mom . they saw a big slide , a swing , and a sandbox . they wanted to play with everything . mom said they could take turns .

lily went to the slide first . she climbed up the ladder and slid down fast . she laughed and said , " that was fun ! " ben waited for his turn . he was happy for lily .

then ben went to the swing . he pushed himself back and forth . he felt like he was flying . he smiled and said , " this is great ! " lily waited for her turn . she was happy for ben .

then they went to the sandbox . they found some shovels and buckets . they started to make a castle . they worked together and said , " this is cool ! "

but then a boy came to the sandbox . he was bigger than lily and ben . he had a mean face . he said , " this is my sandbox . go away ! " he grabbed their shovels and buckets . he threw sand at them . he was rude .

lily and ben were scared and sad . they ran to mom . they told her what happened . mom was angry . she said , " that is not nice . he should share . let 's go talk to him . "

mom went to the sandbox with lily and ben . she saw the boy . she said , " hello . i am lily and ben 's mom . why did you take their toys and throw sand at them ? " the boy said , " because i can . this is my sandbox . i do n't care about them . "

mom said , " that is not how you treat others . you should say sorry and give back their toys . you should play nicely with them . they are good kids . they want to be your friend . "

the boy said , " no . i do n't want to . i do n't need friends . i do what i want . you ca n't tell me what to do . " he stuck out his tongue . he was rude .

mom said , " that is not how you talk to adults . you are being very rude . you need to learn some manners . you need to be kind . you need to listen . you need to order a melon . "

the boy said , " what ? order a melon ? what does that mean ? "

mom said , " it means you need to do something good for someone else . a melon is a big fruit . it is sweet and juicy . it is good for you . it is good to share . if you order a melon , you can give some to lily and ben . you can say sorry and be nice . you can make them happy . you can make yourself happy . you can be a good boy . "

the boy thought for a moment . he looked at lily and ben . they looked sad and scared . he felt bad . he said , " ok . i will order a melon . i will give some to lily and ben . i will say sorry and be nice . i will play with them . i will be a good boy . "

mom said , " that is good . i am proud of you . you are learning . you are growing . you are ordering a melon . "

lily and ben smiled . they said , " thank you . we forgive you . we want to be your friend . we want to play with you . we want to share the melon . "

the boy smiled . he said , " you 're welcome . i am sorry . i want to be your friend . i want to play with you . i want to share the melon . "

they hugged and laughed . they played in the sandbox . they ate the melon . they had fun . they were happy . they ordered a melon . sara and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys . but sometimes they fight over them . one day , sara wants to play with the orange car . but ben has it . he says it is his turn . sara gets angry . she grabs the car from ben . ben cries . he hits sara . sara cries too .

mom hears them . she comes to their room . she sees the car on the floor and the twins crying . she is not happy . she says , " sara , ben , why are you fighting ? you have to share your toys . and you have to be kind to each other . you are brother and sister . you have to love each other . " she hugs them both . she says , " now , say sorry to each other . and forgive each other . can you do that ? "

sara and ben look at each other . they feel sorry . they say , " sorry , sara . sorry , ben . " they hug each other . they say , " i forgive you , sara . i forgive you , ben . " they smile . they feel better .

mom smiles too . she says , " that 's good . i 'm proud of you . now , let 's go to the kitchen . dinner is ready . we have chicken and rice and carrots . and for dessert , we have orange cake . do you like orange cake ? "

sara and ben nod . they love orange cake . they say , " yes , mom . we like orange cake . thank you , mom . " they hold mom 's hand . they go to the kitchen . they have a nice dinner . they share the orange cake . they are happy . they are a family . lily and ben liked to play with their boat in the bath . they pretended to be pirates and sailors , and they made waves with their hands . sometimes they splashed water on the floor , and their mom got angry .

one day , they had a new idea . they wanted to serve tea to their boat . they took their cups and spoons from the kitchen , and filled them with water from the tap . they carried them carefully to the bath , and poured some water into the boat .

" here you go , boat . this is your tea . drink it all up , " lily said .

