" we wanted to serve tea to our boat , " ben said .

mom shook her head , and took the cups and spoons away . she drained the bath , and dried the boat . she told lily and ben to clean up the floor , and to be more careful next time .

lily and ben said sorry again , and did what their mom said . they still liked their boat , but they decided not to serve tea to it anymore . they learned their lesson . lily and ben are playing in the park . they see a big swing with a long rope . lily wants to try it , but ben is scared .

" come on , ben , it is fun ! " lily urges him . " you just hold the rope and jump . "

ben shakes his head . " no , lily , it is too high . i might fall . "

lily rolls her eyes . " you are a baby , ben . i will show you how to do it . " she runs to the swing and grabs the rope . she jumps and swings in the air . she laughs and shouts . " see , ben , it is easy ! "

ben watches her . he feels a little brave . he walks to the swing and reaches for the rope . he holds it tight and jumps . he swings like lily , but he goes too fast . he feels dizzy and scared . he wants to stop .

" lily , help me ! " he cries . " i do n't like it ! "

lily hears him . she stops swinging and runs to him . she pulls the rope and slows him down . she helps him get off the swing .

" are you okay , ben ? " she asks .

ben nods . he is glad to be on the ground . he hugs lily and says , " thank you , lily . you are a good friend . "

lily smiles and says , " you are welcome , ben . you are brave to try the swing . "

they walk to the bench and sit down . they see a lemonade stand nearby . they decide to buy some lemonade with their coins . they drink the lemonade and make faces .

" yuck , it is sour ! " they say .

they laugh and share their lemonade . they are happy to play together . ben and lily like to play hide and seek . they take turns to hide and seek in the house . one day , ben has a good idea . he sees a big coat with a zipper in the closet . he thinks he can hide inside the coat and zip it up . lily will never find him there .

he runs to the closet and puts on the coat . it is very big and warm . he zips it up to his chin and sits on the floor . he waits for lily to come and look for him . he feels happy and clever .

lily starts to seek . she looks under the bed , behind the sofa , in the bathroom , but she can not find ben . she wonders where he is . she thinks he is very good at hiding . she goes to the closet and opens the door . she sees a lot of clothes and shoes , but no ben .

she is about to close the door , when she hears a small sound . it sounds like a sneeze . she looks again and sees a big coat with a zipper . she thinks it is strange . she pulls the zipper down and sees ben 's face . he looks surprised and sad .

" found you ! " lily says . she laughs and hugs ben . " that was a good hiding place , but not good enough . you should not hide in a coat with a zipper . it is not safe . you could get stuck or hurt . "

ben nods and says sorry . he did not know it was not safe . he thought it was harmless . he hugs lily back and says she is a good seeker . they take off the coat and put it back in the closet . they decide to play something else . they are still friends . tom and lily were playing with their blocks . they wanted to build a big tower . tom had many red blocks and lily had many blue blocks . they put their blocks together and made a tall tower .

but then , ben came . ben was angry . he did not like to share . he wanted all the blocks for himself . he pushed the tower and made it fall . the blocks went everywhere . tom and lily were sad . they cried .

