ben did not listen . he grabbed some blocks and ran away . tom and lily followed him . they wanted their blocks back .

they saw ben trying to build his own tower . but he could not do it . he had too many blocks and they did not fit . his tower was wobbly and weak . he was frustrated .

tom and lily had an idea . they decided to help ben . they showed him how to use the blocks . they helped him make a strong and stable tower . they used red and blue blocks and made a beautiful tower .

ben was surprised . he did not expect tom and lily to help him . he felt sorry for what he did . he realized he was wrong .

" thank you , tom and lily , " ben said . " you are very kind . i am sorry i pushed your tower and took your blocks . that was mean . can we be friends ? "

" yes , we can , " tom and lily said . " we are happy to help you . we can play together and share . that is fun . "

they hugged and smiled . they felt happy . they had a victory . they learned to share and to help . they learned to be good friends . lila had a dog named spot . spot was big and brown and very dependable . he always came when lila called him and played with her in the yard . lila loved spot very much .

one day , lila noticed that spot was scratching a lot . she looked at his fur and saw tiny black dots . they were fleas . fleas are bad bugs that bite dogs and make them itch . lila did not like fleas . she wanted to help spot .

lila asked her mom for a flea comb . a flea comb is a tool that can catch fleas and send them away . lila 's mom gave her the comb and showed her how to use it . lila combed spot 's fur carefully and gently . she saw many fleas on the comb . she put them in a jar and closed the lid . she did not want them to escape .

lila combed spot until she could not find any more fleas . she threw the jar in the trash . she hugged spot and told him he was a good boy . spot licked her face and wagged his tail . he felt much better . lila felt happy . she and spot went back to playing in the yard . they had fun . lily wanted to come to the party with her big sister , anna . but she did not have a dress to wear . she looked at her closet and saw only pants and shirts . she felt sad and worried .

she went to anna 's room and knocked on the door . " anna , can i come to the party with you ? " she asked .

anna opened the door and smiled . she was wearing a pretty pink dress with flowers . " of course you can , lily . but you need a dress , too . let me see what i have for you . "

she took lily 's hand and led her to her closet . she looked for a dress that would fit lily . she found a blue dress with stars . " how about this one ? " she said . " it was my favorite dress when i was your age . you can borrow it for the party . "

lily 's eyes lit up . she loved the blue dress with stars . she tried it on and twirled around . " thank you , anna . you are the best sister ever . i love this dress . can we go to the party now ? "

anna hugged lily and said , " you 're welcome , lily . you are the cutest sister ever . i love you . yes , we can go to the party now . come on , let 's go . " lily liked to sort her toys . she had a big box of toys , and she liked to make piles of them . she had a pile of dolls , a pile of cars , a pile of blocks , and a pile of animals . she liked to play with each pile and make stories with them .

one day , her aunt came to visit . her aunt was very nice and brought her a new toy . it was a mighty dragon . it was green and had wings and teeth and a long tail . lily was very happy and thanked her aunt . she wanted to play with the dragon right away .

she took the dragon to her box of toys and looked for a pile to put it in . she thought it was not a doll , because it was not soft and pretty . she thought it was not a car , because it did not have wheels and go vroom . she thought it was not a block , because it was not square and smooth . she thought it was not an animal , because it was not real and furry .

she did not know where to put the dragon . she asked her aunt for help . her aunt smiled and said , " why do n't you make a new pile for the dragon ? you can call it the pile of mighty things . you can put anything that is mighty in it , like the dragon , or a superhero , or a rocket , or a lion . "

lily liked that idea . she made a new pile for the mighty things and put the dragon in it . she also found a superhero , a rocket , and a lion in her box and put them in the pile . she was very proud of her new pile and showed it to her aunt . her aunt was very proud of her too and gave her a hug . they played with the mighty things and had a lot of fun . tom and mia liked to make music with their pots and spoons . they would bang and stir and shake and sing . they had a lot of fun making loud noises and silly songs .

one day , they decided to make a special music show for their mom and dad . they put on their hats and scarves and got their pots and spoons ready . they went to the living room and set up their stage .

mom and dad came to watch and clapped their hands . tom and mia started their show . they banged and stirred and shook and sang . they made a jolly rhythm with their pots and spoons . they smiled and laughed and danced .

mom and dad loved their show . they cheered and hugged and kissed them . they said they were very proud of their music makers . tom and mia felt happy and warm . they thanked their mom and dad and gave them their pots and spoons as a gift . they all cuddled on the couch and listened to some more music . lila and sam were friends who liked to play in the snow . they wanted to make an igloo , a big house of snow . they worked hard to roll snowballs and stack them together . they made a door and a window and crawled inside . they felt warm and cozy in their igloo .

but they were also hungry . they wished they had something to eat . they remembered that lila 's mom had baked some cookies for them . they were in a tin on the kitchen table . they decided to go back to lila 's house and get some cookies . they put on their hats and gloves and left their igloo .

on their way , they saw a little bird . the bird was shivering and looked sad . it had no food and no shelter . lila and sam felt sorry for the bird . they wanted to help it . they had an idea . they took one cookie from the tin and broke it into small pieces . they sprinkled the pieces around the igloo . they hoped the bird would find them and eat them .

then they went to lila 's house and shared the rest of the cookies . they drank some hot chocolate and told lila 's mom about their igloo and the bird . lila 's mom was proud of them . she said they were kind and generous . she said they had learned a valuable lesson . she said that it is better to give than to receive . she said that by helping the bird , they had made themselves and the bird happy .

lila and sam agreed . they felt grateful for their cookies , their igloo , and their friendship . they also felt grateful for the bird , who had taught them how to be compassionate . they smiled and hugged each other . they knew they had done a good thing . they hoped the bird was warm and full in their igloo . they decided to visit their igloo and the bird again the next day . ben and mia were playing in the park with their ball . they liked to kick the ball to each other and run after it . sometimes they would yell , " catch ! " or " got it ! " or " missed ! " they had a lot of fun .

but then a big dog came out of nowhere and ran towards them . it was black and hairy and had sharp teeth . it wanted their ball . it barked loudly and jumped on the ball , making it pop . ben and mia were in shock . they were scared of the dog and did not know what to do .

they ran to their mom , who was sitting on a bench nearby . they yelled , " mom , mom , help ! a big dog popped our ball ! " their mom saw the dog and got up quickly . she shouted at the dog , " go away , bad dog ! leave my kids alone ! " the dog heard her and ran away , dropping the ball .

ben and mia hugged their mom and thanked her . she hugged them back and said , " it 's okay , my loves . you are safe now . i 'm sorry about your ball . we can get a new one later . " she picked up the ball and threw it in the trash . it was bitter to lose their ball , but they were happy to have their mom . they decided to play on the swings instead . they still had a lot of fun . sara liked to play with her toys in the living room . she had a doll , a bear , a ball and a mug . the mug was dull and brown , but sara liked to pretend it was full of tea or juice . she would offer some to her doll and her bear , and sip from the mug herself .

