she went back to the living room and played with her doll , her bear and her ball . she did not miss the mug . she had fun with her other toys . the mug was dull and brown , but her toys were bright and colorful . anna liked to help her mom in the kitchen . she liked to stir and pour and taste . one day , her mom said they were going to make a new dish with cauliflower . anna did not know what cauliflower was . she asked her mom to show her .

her mom took out a big white thing that looked like a flower . she said it was cauliflower and it was good for you . she cut it into small pieces and put them in a pot with water . she said they had to boil it until it was soft . anna watched the pot and saw the water bubble and steam .

when the cauliflower was done , her mom drained the water and put the pieces in a bowl . she added some butter and cheese and mashed them with a fork . she said it was cauliflower mash and it was yummy . she gave anna a spoon and told her to try it .

anna was curious . she took a small bite of the mash . it was warm and creamy and cheesy . she liked it . she took another bite and smiled . she said it was good . her mom smiled too and said she was glad . she said she had a surprise for anna .

she took out a small plate and put a cookie on it . it was anna 's favorite cookie . it was chocolate chip and it had a rough surface with lots of bumps . her mom said it was a thank you cookie for helping her in the kitchen . anna was happy . she thanked her mom and gave her a hug . she ate the cookie and the cauliflower mash and felt full and cozy . she thought it was a good day . tom and lily were playing in the garden . they liked to dig with their shovels and make piles of dirt . sometimes they found worms or stones or shiny things .

