lily ran over to see the hole . she was curious and brave . she bent down and put her hand in the hole . she felt something soft and furry . she smiled and pulled it out .

" it 's a hat ! " she said , holding up a red hat with a pom - pom . " someone must have lost it . it 's so pretty and warm . "

she tried to put the hat on her head , but it was too small . it was very tight and made her hair stick out . she frowned and took it off .

" this hat is not for me , " she said . " it 's too tight . it makes my head hurt . maybe it 's for a baby or a doll . "

tom looked at the hat and had an idea . he took the hat from lily and put it on his shovel . he made the shovel stand up in the dirt . he gave it a face with two stones and a twig .

" look , lily , now we have a friend ! " he said . " he can play with us . he has a nice hat . what should we call him ? "

