" let 's call him bob , " she said . " hello , bob . do you like your hat ? "

bob did not answer , but he seemed happy . he nodded his head with the wind . tom and lily smiled and hugged him . they were happy too . they had a new friend and a new game . tom and lily were playing in the park with their mom . they liked to run , slide , swing and climb . they had a lot of fun and made new friends . tom wore a red cap that his dad gave him . he was very proud of his cap and showed it to everyone .

but then , something bad happened . tom felt very tired and yawned . he wanted to nap , but he did not want to leave the park . he saw a big tree with a lot of shade . he thought it was a good place to nap . he ran to the tree and lay down on the grass . he put his cap over his eyes and fell asleep .

lily saw tom napping under the tree . she thought it was funny . she wanted to play a trick on him . she tiptoed to the tree and took his cap . she ran away with it and hid behind a bench . she giggled and waited for tom to wake up .

tom woke up after a while . he felt the sun on his face . he reached for his cap , but it was gone . he looked around and saw lily holding his cap and laughing . he felt very embarrassed . he did not like that lily took his cap . he did not like that everyone saw him napping . he got up and ran to lily . he shouted , " give me back my cap ! that 's not nice ! "

lily saw tom coming and stopped laughing . she felt sorry for tom . she did not mean to make him embarrassed . she just wanted to have fun . she gave him back his cap and said , " i 'm sorry , tom . i was just joking . do n't be mad at me . "

tom took his cap and put it on his head . he was still embarrassed , but he was not mad at lily . he knew she was his sister and she loved him . he said , " it 's okay , lily . i forgive you . but do n't do that again . i like my cap . "

lily nodded and hugged tom . she said , " i like your cap too . it 's very cool . can i try it on ? "

