they put the cap on lily 's head and laughed . they went back to playing with their mom and their friends . they had a good day at the park . anna and ben are curious children . they like to explore new things and learn how they work . one day , they find a big box in the garage . it has a switch and a cord . they wonder what it is .

" maybe it is a toy , " anna says . " let 's try it . "

