" sure , lily , let 's see more pictures . maybe you can guess some more , " tom says .

they turn the pages and see more pictures . they see a green frog , a blue whale , a brown bear , and a pink pig . lily guesses some of them and tom tells her the ones she does n't know . they have fun and learn new words . they like playing the guessing game . tom and sam are friends . they like to play sport . they have a ball and a net . they play a sport called soccer . they kick the ball with their feet and try to score in the net .

one day , they go to the park to play soccer . they see a big sign . the sign says : " display of art . come and see . " tom and sam are curious . they want to see the art .

they walk to the sign . they see many pictures and sculptures . some are colorful , some are funny , some are scary . tom and sam look at them and talk .

