" yes , i like dogs . but i like cats more . look , this is a sculpture of a cat . it is white and smooth . it has a long tail and green eyes . it looks like my cat , snowy . " sam says .

they see more art . they see a picture of a flower , a sculpture of a car , a picture of a house , a sculpture of a star . they like them all . they are warm and happy .

they see a lady . she is smiling . she has a badge . the badge says : " artist " . she made the art . she sees tom and sam .

" hello , boys . do you like my art ? " she asks .

" yes , we like your art . it is very nice . you are very good . " tom and sam say .

