she takes them to a table . she gives them paper and crayons . tom and sam draw . they draw their sport . they draw a ball and a net . they draw themselves playing soccer . they are happy .

they show their art to the lady . she likes it . she says : " you are very good too . you have made a nice display of your sport . can i hang it on the wall ? "

" yes , you can . thank you . " tom and sam say .

she hangs their art on the wall . they see their art next to her art . they are proud . they smile . they have fun . tom was a thin cat who liked to chase mice . he saw a mouse run under a chair and ran after it . but the mouse was too fast and hid in a hole . tom could not fit in the hole because he was too big .

" please , come out , little mouse , " tom said . " i just want to play with you . "

" no , no , you want to eat me , " the mouse said . " you are a bad cat . go away . "

tom felt sad . he did not have any friends to play with . he wished he could be friends with the mouse .

" please , little mouse , i do not want to eat you , " tom said . " i just want to be your friend . can you lend me your toy ? i will give it back to you . "

the mouse peeked out of the hole . he saw a toy car that tom had brought with him . he liked cars . he wanted to play with the toy car .

" okay , i will lend you my toy , " the mouse said . " but you have to promise not to hurt me or chase me . "

" i promise , i promise , " tom said . " thank you , little mouse . you are very kind . "

the mouse came out of the hole and gave tom his toy . tom gave the mouse his toy car . they played together for a while . they had fun . they became friends . tom was happy . he learned that he could be nice to mice and share his toys . the mouse was happy . he learned that he could trust some cats and lend his toys . they both learned that they could be friends . tom and jen are twins . they like to play with toys and eat snacks . but they do not like to share . one day , mom gives them a big piece of bread with butter . she says , " you can cut it in half and each have some . but be fair and nice to each other . "

tom and jen nod , but they both want more butter . they get a knife and try to cut the bread . but they do not cut it in half . they cut it in a way that one piece has more butter than the other . they both want the piece with more butter . they start to fight and pull the bread .

mom hears them and comes back . she sees the bread and the knife . she is angry and sad . she says , " why did you not do what i told you ? why did you not share ? why did you lie to me ? "

tom and jen feel bad . they know they did wrong . they say , " we are sorry , mom . we were greedy and selfish . we wanted more butter . we did not think of the other . we lied to you and to ourselves . "

mom says , " you should always be honest and kind . butter is not worth fighting over . you have each other , and that is more important . you should be happy with what you have , and not want what you do not need . you should love each other , and not hurt each other . "

tom and jen hug mom and say , " we love you , mom . we love each other . we will share and be fair . we will not lie again . "

mom smiles and says , " that is good . i am proud of you . now , let me fix the bread for you . i have some jam and cheese too . you can have some of each , if you like . "

tom and jen say , " yes , please . thank you , mom . you are the best . "

they eat the bread and enjoy it . they learn their lesson . they do not fight over butter anymore . they share and care . they are happy and good . lily and ben were twins who liked to play with their toy cars . they had many cars of different colors and sizes , but their favorite was a big red truck that could drive fast and make loud noises . they pretended to be drivers who had to deliver important things to different places .

one day , they decided to play a game where they had to drive the truck to the park and back . they took turns to be the driver and the helper . lily went first . she put on her hat and sunglasses and said , " i am a successful driver . i can drive the truck very well . ben , you are my helper . you have to watch the road and tell me if there are any problems . "

ben nodded and climbed into the truck . he held a map and a walkie - talkie . he said , " ok , lily . i am your helper . i will help you get to the park and back . let 's go ! "

lily started the truck and drove out of the driveway . she followed the map that ben gave her and listened to his instructions . she drove carefully and avoided the bumps and holes on the road . she felt happy and proud . she said , " we are doing great , ben . we are almost at the park . we are the best drivers ever ! "

ben smiled and said , " yes , lily . we are the best drivers ever . but look , there is a big dog on the road . he is barking and running towards us . what should we do ? "

lily saw the dog and felt scared . she did not like dogs . they had sharp teeth and rough skin . she said , " oh no , ben . a dog ! i do n't like dogs . they are scary and mean . what should we do ? "

ben thought quickly and said , " do n't worry , lily . i have an idea . we can use the horn on the truck . it will make a loud noise and scare the dog away . then we can drive past him and get to the park . are you ready ? "

lily nodded and said , " ok , ben . i trust you . let 's do it ! "

ben pressed the button on the walkie - talkie and said , " horn , horn , horn ! " lily pressed the horn on the truck and made a loud noise . the dog heard the noise and stopped barking . he looked at the truck and ran away . he did not like loud noises . he had sensitive ears and soft skin .

lily and ben cheered and said , " we did it , we did it ! we scared the dog away ! we are the best drivers ever ! "

they drove past the dog and got to the park . they parked the truck and got out . they played on the swings and slides and had a lot of fun . they were happy and proud . they had completed their mission . they were successful drivers . lily and tom are friends . they like to play outside . one day , they plan to go to the river . they want to see the fish and the ducks .

they walk to the river with their mom . they hold hands and look both ways . they are careful and happy . they see the river . it is big and blue . they hear the water and the birds .

lily and tom run to the river . they want to touch the water . but they do not see the rock . lily trips on the rock . she falls down . she hurts her knee . she cries .

tom stops and runs back to lily . he sees her knee . it is red and wet . he feels sorry for lily . he hugs her and says , " it 's okay , lily . i 'm here . mom will help you . "

mom hears lily and tom . she comes to them . she sees lily 's knee . she says , " oh , lily . you hurt your knee . let me see . " she takes out a band - aid and a wipe . she cleans lily 's knee and puts on the band - aid . she kisses lily and says , " there , there . you 're brave , lily . the band - aid will make it better . "

lily stops crying . she smiles and says , " thank you , mom . thank you , tom . you 're good friends . " she hugs them and says , " can we still see the fish and the ducks ? "

mom says , " of course , lily . let 's go to the river . but be careful of the rocks . they can hurt you . "

lily and tom nod and say , " okay , mom . we will be careful . " they go to the river with mom . they see the fish and the ducks . they are happy again . they have fun . they forget about the hurt . lily and ben were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they saw a big pond with many fish and frogs . they wanted to catch some and take them home .

" look , lily , a shiny fish ! " ben said , pointing to a silver fish in the water . he had a net and a bucket . he tried to scoop the fish with his net , but it was too fast .

" let me try , ben ! " lily said . she had a pair of scissors and a plastic bag . she thought she could cut the fish with her scissors and put it in the bag . she leaned over the pond and reached for the fish with her scissors .

but the scissors were too sharp and the pond was too deep . lily slipped and fell into the pond . she dropped the scissors and the bag . the water was cold and dirty . she screamed and cried .

" help , help ! " ben shouted . he dropped the net and the bucket . he ran to get their mom and dad . they were inside the house . they had bought an expensive cake for the twins ' birthday . they were happy and proud .

but when they heard ben 's voice , they were scared and worried . they ran outside and saw lily in the pond . they pulled her out and hugged her . they were angry and sad .

" lily , what were you doing ? " mom asked . " why did you have scissors and a bag ? "

" we wanted to catch fish , mom , " lily said . " i 'm sorry , i 'm sorry . "

" that was very naughty and dangerous , lily , " dad said . " you could have hurt yourself or the fish . scissors are not for cutting fish . they are for cutting paper or cloth . and fish belong in the pond , not in a bag . they need water and air to live . "

lily and ben felt ashamed and sorry . they realized they had done a bad thing . they had wasted their net and bucket , their scissors and bag , and their cake . they had ruined their birthday .

the moral of the story is : do not take what is not yours . do not use things in the wrong way . do not play near water without an adult . do not be greedy and selfish . be careful and respectful . sara likes to play with her dolls . she has many dolls , but her favorite is lily . lily has a pink dress and a shiny necklace . sara thinks the necklace is a diamond . she likes to see how it sparkles in the sun .

one day , sara and lily go to the park with mommy . sara sees a big slide and wants to try it . she puts lily on the bench and runs to the slide . she climbs up the ladder and slides down fast . she feels happy and laughs .

but when she goes back to the bench , she sees a boy holding lily . he is pulling on the necklace and trying to take it off . sara feels angry and scared . she runs to the boy and shouts , " stop ! that 's my doll ! give her back ! "

the boy looks at sara and laughs . he says , " no , this is my doll now . and this is my diamond . it 's pretty and shiny . you are too weak to stop me . "

sara feels sad and cries . she wants her doll and her diamond back . she looks around and sees mommy . she calls , " mommy , help me ! he took my doll and my diamond ! "

mommy hears sara and sees the boy . she walks to the bench and says , " what are you doing , young man ? that 's not your doll or your diamond . that 's sara 's . you need to give them back right now . "

the boy sees mommy and feels afraid . he knows he did something bad . he drops lily and the necklace and runs away . mommy picks up lily and the necklace and gives them to sara . she hugs sara and says , " it 's okay , sweetie . you have your doll and your diamond back . you are brave and strong . i 'm proud of you . "

sara feels happy and safe . she hugs mommy and says , " thank you , mommy . i love you . and i love lily and my diamond . " she sees how they sparkle in the sun . she smiles and plays with them . lila liked to polish her sunflower . she had a yellow cloth and some water . she would wet the cloth and rub it on the sunflower . she wanted it to shine like the sun .

one day , she saw a bee on the sunflower . she thought the bee was dirty . she tried to polish the bee with her cloth . the bee did not like that . it buzzed and stung her hand . lila cried out loud .

her mom heard her and came to see . she saw the bee and the cloth and the sunflower . she hugged lila and took her inside . she put some ice on her hand and gave her some juice . she said , " lila , you are foolish . you can not polish a bee . bees are not dirty . they help the sunflowers grow . you should leave them alone . "

lila felt sorry and said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i did not know . i just wanted to polish my sunflower . " her mom smiled and said , " i know , lila . you love your sunflower . but you have to be careful . some things are not for polishing . they are for looking and learning . "

lila nodded and said , " ok , mom . i will look and learn . and i will not polish bees anymore . " her mom kissed her and said , " that 's good , lila . now , let 's go and see your sunflower . maybe it has a new friend . " they went outside and saw a butterfly on the sunflower . lila smiled and said , " look , mom . a butterfly . it is pretty . can i polish it ? " her mom laughed and said , " no , lila . you can not polish a butterfly . but you can watch it and enjoy it . " lila agreed and said , " ok , mom . i will watch and enjoy . and i will not be foolish . " they sat down and watched the butterfly and the sunflower . they were happy . lily was a spoiled girl . she had many toys and clothes , but she always wanted more . she did not like to share or say thank you . she was rude to her parents and her friends .

one day , lily saw a phone on the table . it was her mom 's phone . lily wanted to play with it . she did not ask her mom . she just grabbed the phone and ran to her room . she pressed the buttons and made noises . she thought it was fun .

but her mom was angry . she needed her phone for work . she followed lily to her room and saw her playing with the phone . she said , " lily , give me back my phone . that is not a toy . you are being naughty . "

lily did not listen . she said , " no , it is mine . i want it . go away . " she stuck out her tongue and turned away .

her mom was very angry . she reached for the phone , but lily slapped her hand . she said , " ow , that hurts . do n't slap me . that is very bad . you are in big trouble . "

lily was scared . she knew she did something wrong . she dropped the phone and started to cry . she said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i 'm sorry . please do n't be mad at me . "

her mom picked up the phone and checked if it was okay . she was glad it was not broken . she hugged lily and said , " i 'm not mad at you , but you have to learn to be good . you ca n't take things that are not yours . you ca n't slap people . you have to say sorry and mean it . do you understand ? "

lily nodded and said , " i understand , mom . i 'm sorry . i love you . "

her mom said , " i love you too , lily . but you have to be a better girl . you have to be kind and polite and grateful . you have to share and say thank you . you have to listen and obey . can you do that ? "

lily said , " i can do that , mom . i will try to be a better girl . can we play with the phone together ? "

her mom smiled and said , " maybe later . but first , you have to clean up your room and say sorry to your dad . and then we can play with something else . how about a book or a puzzle ? "

lily said , " okay , mom . i like books and puzzles . thank you for being nice to me . "

her mom said , " you 're welcome , lily . i 'm proud of you for saying sorry and thank you . now let 's go and make up with your dad . " once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to draw and always used her favorite markers . one day , her little brother , max , took her markers without asking . lily got very upset and told max that he should have asked first . max said sorry and gave the markers back .

