timmy was so grateful to his mom . he ate his spaghetti with a big smile on his face . he knew his mom loved him very much . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved lollipops and always had one in her pocket . one day , while walking in the park , she saw a boy staring at her . she felt a little scared but then realized he was just looking at her lollipop . she smiled and offered him one . he took it and said it was delicious . from that day on , they became best friends and shared their lollipops every time they met in the park . once upon a time , there was an old man . he lived in a house near a busy road with lots of traffic . the old man liked to sit on his porch and watch the cars and trucks go by . one day , a little boy came to visit him . the boy asked the old man what he liked to do . the old man said he liked to study things . the little boy asked what he was studying , and the old man said he was studying the traffic . the little boy thought that was very interesting and sat with the old man to watch the traffic too . they sat there for a long time , watching the cars and trucks go by . the little boy had fun spending time with the old man and learning about traffic . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to pretend she was a princess and wear pretty dresses . one day , lily 's mom took her on the subway to go to the park . the subway was big and fast , but lily felt peaceful because she held her mom 's hand .

