it was an amazing experience for the children . they 'd never seen anything like it ! the next day they came back to the wild , ready to explore and prepare again . once upon a time , there was a bunny . bunny liked to explore the world . one day , he decided to explore the edge of the forest . he scurried through the grass , hopping around until he arrived at the edge of the forest . suddenly , he heard a loud voice . the voice said " bunny , be careful ! there is a cut near the edge of the forest . "

