in the end , bear and mouse were so full that they could barely move . they quickly fell asleep in their bedroom and dreamt about the next day 's cooking adventure . once upon a time there was a little boy named tom . tom loved looking up into the night sky . one night he saw a star that was twinkling just for him . as it shone , tom wished that he could pick the star right off the sky . suddenly , he heard a ' plop ' and the star dropped onto the ground in front of him . tom bent down to pick up the star . he was surprised by its shape and how sparkly it was . when he looked closer he saw that the star was really a delicious cookie . he ate it and it tasted so yummy . tom was so pleased . what a special night it had been- he had seen a twinkling star and got a delicious cookie !   tom promised to go outside late at night and wish on the stars , because you never know- one of your wishes might drop right in front of you ! once upon a time there was a man who worked very hard on his farm . one day he decided to make something special to make his family happy . he decided to make a fruit feast for them !

