the man made a nice big platter of fruit and brought it to the family . but when his family tried to take a bite of the fruit , it was n't sweet at all . it was too harsh . they were so surprised and confused .

the man had forgotten to add sugar to the fruit . he knew he had made a mistake and apologised to his family . he promised that next time he would make sure to add a generous amount of sugar to sweeten the fruit . once there was an ordinary little girl . she loved to catch things with her hands . one day , she saw a special bracelet in the garden . she had never seen one like it before . she reached out and tried to catch it with her hands . but it twinkled in the sunlight and danced away from her .

