she slip the shining bracelet onto her wrist . it sparkled in the sunlight , like stars in the night sky . the little girl smiled , feeling special and proud that she had caught the bracelet . she would never forget the ordinary moment when she caught the extraordinary bracelet . once , there was a furry hose that lived in a garden . he loved to pass through the tall grass , feeling the warm sun on his back . one day , he was passing along when he saw a big , shining lake . he wanted to go in , so he passed through the water and it felt so cool and wonderful ! he spent the whole day passing around the lake , and then he went back to the garden feeling very happy and refreshed . once upon a time there was a loop . it was a small loop and it was all alone . the loop was scared . it was too scared to move .

