but , timmy still loved to visit the farm . he would run around and play in the grass , or watch the chickens as they pecked for food . he also liked to pick flowers and find worms in the ground . visiting the farm always made him happy . once upon a time , there was a brave little star . she lived in the night sky , but longed to come down to earth . she was curious to see what earth was like .

