but then a friendly frog came by . it hopped into the pond and found the little football . it picked the football up and hopped back to the edge of the pond . then it laid the football on the ground and watched it roll away .

the little football was happy to be back on dry land . it was even happier that a kind frog had saved it from the deep , cold water .

the end . once upon a time there was a little girl who was very ashamed . she had done something bad and wanted to hide away .

