the harbor was a special place . as the hours passed , she began to feel peace and happiness returning to her heart . soon enough , she was no longer ashamed of what she had done and was happy to be back at home .

the harbor was a special place that had dried her tears and given her peace and happiness . from then on she was no longer ashamed and could go about her life with a smile on her face . once there was a little boy named jack . he had green eyes and was three years old . each day , jack played in the garden with his friends . but today , something unknown was about to happen .

