he went back inside and lay down for a nap . when he woke up , he took out the scissors and went back to the garden . but nothing felt the same , it felt unknown to him now . he decided not to cut anything anymore , and just enjoy the garden with his friends instead . once upon a time there was a little girl named jessie . she was very happy , and her stomach laughed all day long . one day , jessie saw something very new - a sparkly red balloon . she wanted the balloon so badly , so she ran to get it .

