and then , the little girl and her special balloon danced and laughed through the whole afternoon ! it started to rain outside . it was a cold , wet rain . mommy grabbed some tape and opened the closet door . inside were two umbrellas - one big , one small . the big one was blue , and it opened with a click . the little one had a flower pattern and opened with a pop .

mommy gave the little umbrella to her bald friend . they both laughed and walked outside . the rain was falling softly and the sky was grey . they opened their umbrellas and ran around in the rain . it was so much fun ! the bald friend was spinning and spinning in circles . finally , they both were so tired they just stood there in the rain until it was time to go home . once upon a time there was a little girl . she was three years old and she called her bed her very own . every night she would climb into it and climb under the covers , ready for a cosy sleep .

but one night , no matter what the little girl did , she could not get to sleep . she tried counting sheep , but it did n't work . she tried yawning , but that did n't help either .

the little girl climbed out of her bed . she began to repeat her favourite poem and it helped her realise what she needed to do . she decided to try something else to help her sleep - something special !

she walked over to her chest of drawers and opened them one by one . inside of each one were plenty of things , but none of them were the thing she was looking for .

she looked a bit closer and suddenly saw what she was looking for - a white pillow ! she quickly retrieved it and placed it beside her bed . she could n't believe it was still available .

then , she climbed back in her bed and lay her head on the pillow . after a few minutes , the little girl closed her eyes and soon fell asleep . now , she always brings the white pillow with her whenever she goes to bed , just in case she ca n't sleep .

the end . once upon a time there was a boy . he was playing with a big box . he had a lot of fun with it . one day , he decided to show it to his friend . he held it tight as he ran to his friend 's house . but when the boy got there , he slipped . his box dropped to the ground . it made a big sound !

the boy was sad . he now had to find a way to get his box back . then , he had an idea . he took his box to a deep pond . he dropped it in the water . he could still see it way down in the bottom .

after a few seconds , something amazing happened . a fish swam right up to the box . it opened the lid and the box floated back up to the surface . the fish had saved the boy 's box !

the boy was so happy that his box was back . he thanked the fish and he thanked the deep pond . then , he ran back home to play with the box again . the end . one day , there was a little baby . she was feeling very sad and unhappy . her mommy saw how sad she was and wanted to comfort her .

she looked around the room and found a big , long bookcase . she opened the doors of the bookcase , knelt down , and hugged her baby tight .

