when the sun went down , the little girl put away her toy and hung up her dress . she knew she would have lots of fun wearing her new orange dress the next day . once upon a time , there was a bright yellow sun . his job was to make the sky warm and shiny . one day , he was feeling lazy , so he threw a bone up in the air . he then made a fire and watched as the bone started to burn . the bone was small and soon burned up completely . it made the sun feel hot , so he waved his hands in front of his face to cool down .

