the end . once upon a time there were two kids , jack and ben . they went outside to play . jack found a baseball and he wanted to keep it . but ben said no . then jack said , " why not - it 's clean ! " ben told jack that it was n't his baseball , so jack should leave it for the person who lost it . so jack decided to wander around and look for the owner . after a while he saw a boy playing alone . jack asked the boy if he was looking for a baseball . the boy said yes , he had lost it earlier ! jack gave the ball back to the boy and he was happy to have it back .

