the old man and his grandson walked home , smiling and happy . once upon a time there was a little boy called tom . tom loved to play games with his toys and today he wanted to play a matching game . he lined up all his toys in a row and tried to match each toy to the same one . he became very frustrated as he could n't find his matches .

