just as tom was about to give up , he spotted the matching shoes tucked away under his bed . he quickly grabbed them and ran outside to explore the great wave . tom had reached his goal and was so excited ! once upon a time , there were two best friends , judy and eddie . they were always together and they loved playing in the park . one day , they spotted a twig on the ground . they both wanted the twig and argued over who should get to keep it .

