judy agreed , so they both decided to leave the dead twig behind and start looking for something else to do in the park . once upon a time , there was a girl who was feeling very helpless . she was walking and noticed a structure , and decided to go over to it . when she got closer , she saw that it was a box . when she opened it , she saw a puppy , who was looking very sad and helpless . the girl decided to hold the puppy and was so happy that it made her feel better .

