the girl and the puppy were best friends from then on , and they explored much of the world together . they held each other and stayed happy . once upon a time , there was a small girl . she was playing by herself on a sunny day . she saw something shiny , and it was an elevator ! she was excited and ran to it . when she got to the elevator , she tried to reach the buttons , but they were too high . the girl started to cry .

