the two friends spun and jumped , having the best time . they recorded the whole show and watched it afterwards , laughing at the funny poses they had made . from then on , the two friends shared many â€œspicyâ€ adventures together . once upon a time , a stubborn little bird was sitting on a tree . he was whistling a happy tune and enjoying the sunshine on his wings . suddenly , he heard a loud noise coming from below . it was a small boy struggling with a rock that was stuck in a knee - high bush .

