from that day on , tim and sam became good friends . they played and shared things with each other . the other kids at camp learned from tim and started sharing too . everyone was happy and had a great time at camp . the moral of the story is that sharing is caring , and it can make everyone happy . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she had a toy thermometer that she liked to play with . one day , lily was feeling very hungry . she wanted to eat a snack , but she did n't know what to eat .

