so , lily went to the kitchen and found a big , red apple . she took a big bite and felt very happy . from then on , whenever lily was hungry , she would ask her toy thermometer what to eat . and even though it did n't really talk , lily always found the perfect snack . one day , a driver was driving a big bus . he was feeling miserable because it was raining outside . the rain made everything wet and he did not like it . he wished he could be at home with his family .

