the parent saw the cat was scared . the parent climbed the tree too . they helped the cat down from the split branch . the cat and her parent were safe . they went home and played more . the cat was happy and loved her parent . once upon a time , in a big forest , there was a little rabbit named remy . remy was a happy rabbit who liked to hop and play all day . one day , remy felt uncomfortable because it was very hot . he did n't like the hot sun on his fur . remy wanted to find a cool place to rest .

remy 's friend , tim the turtle , saw him feeling hot . tim warned remy , " you should not play in the sun all day . you need to find some shade to stay cool . " remy listened to his friend and they both went to look for a big tree with lots of shade .

after a year , remy and tim were still friends . they played in the shade when it was hot and stayed warm in their homes when it was cold . remy learned to listen to his friend 's warning and always felt comfortable . they were happy friends and had fun every day . one day , a little bunny named ben went to a big mountain . he wanted to play with his friends . but ben forgot his toy at home . he felt sad and silly .

ben saw his friend , a bird named bella . he asked her , " can i borrow your toy , please ? " bella said , " yes , you can borrow my toy . let 's play together ! "

they played all day on the mountain . they laughed and had fun . ben was happy he could borrow bella 's toy . they were not silly anymore . they were the best of friends . once upon a time , in a big forest , a wolf appeared . this wolf was not like other wolves . he was important because he was the leader of all the wolves in the forest . he had a big job to do , and he was very good at it .

one day , the important wolf met a little girl in the forest . she was lost and scared . the wolf knew he had to help her find her way back home . so , he took her hand and they walked together through the forest .

as they walked , the important wolf and the little girl became good friends . they found the girl 's house and her family was so happy to see her . the wolf knew he had done a good job helping his new friend . the little girl hugged the important wolf and said , " thank you ! " the wolf smiled and went back to the forest , knowing he had made a new friend . once upon a time , there was a pale snake named sam . sam was not like other snakes . he was not scary . he was nice . sam had a friend named tim . tim was a small bird . they played together every day .

one day , a big snake came to their home . the big snake was mean . he said , " i do n't believe a snake and a bird can be friends ! " he wanted to make sam leave . sam was sad . tim was sad too . but they had a plan .

the next day , sam and tim showed the big snake how they played . they were so happy together . the big snake saw this and felt bad . he said , " i believe you now . a snake and a bird can be friends . " the big snake was not mean anymore . they all played together and were happy . once upon a time , there was a silly duck named ducky . ducky loved to walk to the beach every day . he liked to look at the surf and watch the waves .

one day , while ducky was walking , he saw a big surf . he thought it would be fun to play in the water . ducky jumped into the surf and splashed around .

but then , the surf got bigger and bigger . ducky got scared and tried to walk back to the beach . the big surf was too strong , and ducky could not walk back . he was not able to get back to the beach , and the big surf took him away . once upon a time , there was a penguin named pippin . pippin was not very smart , and his friends sometimes called him " stupid . " this made pippin very sad .

one day , pippin 's friend timmy said , " pippin , you need to gain more smarts . let 's ask the wise old owl for help . " pippin agreed , and they went to see the owl .

the wise old owl said , " pippin , to gain smarts , you must listen and learn from others . " pippin listened to the owl and started to learn from his friends . he became smarter and smarter .

pippin 's friends stopped calling him " stupid , " and they were proud of him . pippin was happy , and he thanked timmy and the wise old owl .

the moral of the story is : if you listen and learn from others , you can gain knowledge and become smarter . once upon a time , a little girl named lily found a big box of pastel colors . she thought they were very interesting . she wanted to draw a big picture on the wall with them . so , she started to draw .

lily 's friend , tom , came to visit her . he saw her drawing on the wall and said , " wow , that 's a big and interesting picture ! can i help you ? " lily smiled and said , " yes , you can . we can make it even bigger together ! "

as they drew , a kind lady walked by and saw their picture . she stopped and bowed to them . " what a beautiful picture you have made , " she said . " but remember , it is important to ask for permission before drawing on someone else 's wall . "

