the baby kangaroo was very grateful . he learned a lesson . he learned to stay close to his mom and dad . he learned to love his kangaroo family . he learned to be graceful like the big kangaroo . he was happy and proud to be a kangaroo . lily liked to ride the bus with her mom . she liked to look out the window and see the cars and the trees and the people . she liked to say hello to the driver , who always smiled and gave her a sticker .

one day , lily and her mom got on the bus , but the driver was not the same . he was a new driver , with a red hat and a big beard . he did not smile or give lily a sticker . lily felt sad and scared . she did not recognize the new driver .

lily 's mom saw that lily was unhappy . she hugged her and said , " do n't worry , sweetie . the original driver is on vacation . he will be back soon . the new driver is nice too . he is just shy . why do n't we say hello to him and make him feel welcome ? "

lily 's mom took lily 's hand and walked to the front of the bus . she said to the new driver , " hello , sir . we are lily and her mom . we ride this bus every day . what is your name ? "

the new driver looked at lily and her mom . he saw that they were friendly and kind . he smiled and said , " hello , lily and her mom . my name is bob . i am the new driver . i am sorry i did not give you a sticker . i forgot to bring them today . but i have something else for you . here , take this balloon . it is red , like my hat . "

lily took the balloon and said , " thank you , bob . i like your hat and your beard . and i like your balloon . it is very pretty . "

bob said , " you 're welcome , lily . i like your dress and your hair . and i like your smile . it is very bright . "

lily and bob became friends . lily was not sad or scared anymore . she recognized that the new driver was nice too . she liked to ride the bus with him and her mom . she hoped that the original driver would come back soon , but she also hoped that bob would stay . she liked them both . anna and ben are friends . they like to play outside . one day , they go to the river . the river is big and fast . anna and ben see some ducks on the water . they want to feed the ducks .

anna has some bread in her bag . she breaks the bread into small pieces . she throws the pieces to the ducks . the ducks come closer and eat the bread . anna is happy . she likes the ducks .

ben has no bread . he is sad . he wants to feed the ducks too . he looks around . he sees some rocks on the ground . he picks up a rock . he throws the rock to the ducks . the rock makes a splash . the ducks get scared . they fly away .

anna is angry . she says to ben , " that was silly . you scared the ducks . rocks are not food . ducks do not like rocks . you should not throw rocks at the ducks . "

ben is sorry . he says to anna , " i am sorry . i did not know . i wanted to feed the ducks too . i thought they would like the rocks . i was silly . i will not throw rocks at the ducks again . "

anna and ben hug . they are friends again . they learn a lesson . they learn that ducks like bread , not rocks . they learn to be kind to the ducks . they learn to share . they go home . they are happy . ben likes to play basketball with his dad . they have a big orange ball that bounces and a hoop on the wall . ben tries to throw the ball in the hoop , but it is too high for him . his dad helps him and says , " good job , ben ! "

one day , ben sees a shiny new ball in the store . it is red and blue and has stars on it . ben wants the ball very much . he asks his dad , " can we buy this ball , please ? " his dad looks at the price tag and shakes his head . he says , " no , ben , this ball is too expensive . we already have a good ball at home . "

ben feels sad and angry . he does not want the old ball . he wants the new ball . he starts to cry and kick his feet . his dad picks him up and carries him out of the store . he says , " ben , you need to calm down . throwing a tantrum is not nice . you should be happy with what you have . "

ben stops crying and looks at his dad . he sees that his dad is not happy either . he says , " i 'm sorry , dad . i love you and i love our ball . " his dad smiles and hugs him . he says , " i love you too , ben . and i 'm proud of you for saying sorry . how about we go home and play some basketball ? "

ben nods and smiles . he and his dad go home and play with their big orange ball . ben has fun and forgets about the new ball . he learns that expensive things are not always better than simple things . he also learns to sit and listen to his dad when he says no . lily liked to follow her big brother tom everywhere . he was fun and smart and knew many things . sometimes he let her play with his toys and read her stories . but sometimes he said she was too little and told her to go away .

one morning , lily woke up early and saw tom sneaking out of his room . he had a big bag and a flashlight . lily wanted to know where he was going . she put on her shoes and coat and followed him quietly . she hoped he would not see her .

tom walked for a long time . he crossed the street , went through the park , and climbed over a fence . lily was tired and scared , but she did not give up . she followed him until he reached a big , old house . it was dark and smelly and had broken windows . lily did not like it at all .

tom opened the door and went inside . lily waited for a moment , then followed him . she wished she had a flashlight too . it was very dark and smelly inside the house . she heard tom 's footsteps and tried to catch up with him . but she did not see the hole in the floor . she stepped on it and fell down with a loud scream .

tom heard her scream and ran back to find her . he saw her lying on the floor , crying and bleeding . he felt sorry and scared . he dropped his bag and flashlight and ran to help her . he hugged her and said he was sorry . he told her he was looking for treasure in the house , but he did not find any . he said he was stupid and selfish and he should have taken care of her .

lily stopped crying and hugged him back . she said she was sorry too . she said she just wanted to be with him and see what he was doing . she said he was not stupid or selfish , he was just curious and brave . she said she loved him .

tom and lily got up and looked for a way out . they found a window and climbed through it . they ran back to their home , holding hands . they decided to never go to the smelly house again . they also decided to share their toys and stories more often . they learned that following each other was not always a good idea , but loving each other was . tim and kim are twins . they like to play with their toys . they have a lot of toys . some are big and some are small . some make noise and some are quiet .

one day , tim and kim find a hammer in the garage . they think it is a toy . they want to play with it . they take it to their room . they use the hammer to hit their toys . they hit the blocks , the cars , the dolls , and the books . they make a lot of noise . they make a big mess .

mom hears the noise . she goes to their room . she sees the hammer and the mess . she is not happy . she says , " tim and kim , what are you doing ? this is not a toy . this is a tool . you can hurt yourself or break your toys . you have to stop and clean up . and then you have to take a nap . "

tim and kim are sorry . they say , " we are sorry , mom . we did not know . we thought it was a toy . we will clean up and take a nap . " they put the hammer back in the garage . they pick up their toys and put them away . they make their bed and lie down . they close their eyes and take a nap . mom is happy . she says , " good job , tim and kim . you are good twins . i love you . " she kisses them and leaves the room . tim and kim sleep and dream of nice toys . ben and lily were best friends . they liked to play in the park with their toys . they had a lot of fun together . one day , they found a brilliant ball . it was shiny and colorful and bounced very high . they took turns to throw it and catch it .

they wanted to see how high the ball could go . ben threw it as hard as he could . the ball flew up in the air . it went higher and higher . it went so high that they could not see it anymore . it vanished . ben and lily looked around . they could not find the ball . they were sad .

they asked the other kids in the park if they saw the ball . they said no . they asked the birds and the squirrels if they saw the ball . they said no . they asked the sun and the clouds if they saw the ball . they said no . they asked the moon and the stars if they saw the ball . they said no . the ball was gone .

ben and lily cried . they lost their brilliant ball . they lost their fun . they went home with their toys . they did not play anymore . they were not best friends anymore . they were lonely . the end . lily and tom were playing in the garden . they saw a big bird with a red head and a yellow beak . it was a hen . the hen had a nest with many eggs . lily and tom wanted to see the eggs .

they went near the nest and looked at the eggs . they were white and smooth . lily touched one egg with her finger . it was warm . tom wanted to touch one too . he reached for an egg , but the hen saw him . the hen was angry . she did not want lily and tom to touch her eggs . she pecked at tom 's hand . tom cried out . he pulled his hand back . the hen had pinched him .

lily and tom ran away from the nest . they were scared and hurt . they did not understand why the hen was so mean . they were confused . they went to their mom and told her what happened . mom hugged them and gave them a band - aid for tom 's hand . she explained that the hen was protecting her eggs . she said that the eggs were her babies and she loved them very much . she said that lily and tom should not touch the eggs or bother the hen . she said that they should be kind and gentle to all animals .

lily and tom nodded . they said they were sorry . they learned their lesson . they decided to play with their own toys instead . they left the hen and her eggs alone . they were happy and safe . the hen was happy and safe too . the end . lily and sam liked to play with their toys . they had many toys , but their favorite was a big gorilla . the gorilla was soft and brown and had a funny face . they hugged the gorilla and made it talk and jump .

one day , they went to the store with their mom . the store had many things , like food and clothes and books . but lily and sam only wanted to see the toys . they ran to the toy aisle and looked at all the colorful and shiny toys .

there , they saw a new gorilla . the new gorilla was bigger and blacker and had a scary face . it made loud noises and moved its arms and legs . lily and sam wanted the new gorilla . they asked their mom to buy it for them .

but their mom said no . she said they already had a gorilla at home , and they did not need another one . she said the new gorilla was too expensive and too noisy . she said they had to be happy with what they had .

lily and sam were sad and angry . they did not want to leave the store . they did not want to go back to their old gorilla . they were jealous of the new gorilla . they cried and kicked and screamed .

their mom was not happy . she took them by the hand and dragged them out of the store . she said they were being naughty and rude . she said they had to say sorry and be nice to their old gorilla .

lily and sam did not say anything . they pouted and looked at the ground . they did not want to say sorry . they did not want to be nice . they wanted the new gorilla . they wished they had the new gorilla . tom and mia liked to play pretend at school . they had a big box of costumes and toys to dress up and act out stories . one day , they found a folder with pictures of animals in it . they decided to pretend they were in the jungle .

tom put on a brown hat and a green shirt . he said he was a explorer . mia put on a yellow dress and a flower crown . she said she was a princess . they took the folder and went to the play area . they saw a rug with spots on it . they said it was a leopard . they saw a stuffed toy with stripes on it . they said it was a tiger . they saw a pillow with a mane on it . they said it was a lion .

they opened the folder and looked at the pictures . they saw a picture of a lion . they said it was the king of the jungle . they saw a picture of a tiger . they said it was the queen of the jungle . they saw a picture of a leopard . they said it was the prince of the jungle . they saw a picture of a bear . they said it was the friend of the jungle .

they wanted to make the animals talk . they used their voices to make sounds . tom made a roar for the lion . mia made a roar for the tiger . they made a roar for the leopard . they made a growl for the bear . they had fun making noises and telling stories .

but then , they heard a real roar . it was loud and scary . they looked around and saw a big dog . it had a collar and a leash , but it had escaped from its owner . it was barking and running towards them . they were afraid . they dropped the folder and ran to their teacher . the teacher saw the dog and called for help . she hugged tom and mia and told them they were safe .

the dog 's owner came and caught the dog . he said he was sorry . he said the dog was not mean , but playful . he said the dog liked to chase things . he said the dog 's name was rover . he said he was a modest dog , but sometimes he forgot his manners . he said he would keep him on a leash from now on .

tom and mia were still scared , but they were also curious . they asked the teacher if they could pet the dog . the teacher said yes , but only if the owner said it was okay . the owner said it was okay , but only if they were gentle . tom and mia went to the dog and touched his fur . it was soft and warm . the dog licked their hands and wagged his tail . it was friendly and happy . tom and mia smiled and said hello to rover . they said he was a good dog , but he should not roar like a lion . they said they liked him better when he was modest . rover barked and nodded . he agreed . tim and sam were friends who liked to play in the garden . one day , they saw a big , old bean plant that had many green beans on it . they wanted to pick some beans and eat them .

" look , sam , beans ! " tim said . " let 's get some . "

" ok , tim , but we have to be careful . this is not our bean plant . it belongs to mrs. lee , the old lady who lives next door . she might get angry if we take her beans , " sam said .

but tim did not listen to sam . he ran to the bean plant and started to pull some beans . sam followed him , but he felt scared .

" tim , stop ! we should not do this . it is not nice to take things that are not ours . mrs. lee works hard to grow her beans . she might need them for her food , " sam said .

but tim did not stop . he pulled more and more beans , until he had a big pile of them . he laughed and said , " look , sam , we have so many beans ! we can eat them all . who cares about mrs. lee ? she is old and mean . she never smiles or talks to us . "

sam felt sad and sorry for mrs. lee . he did not want to eat the beans . he wanted to put them back . but before he could say anything , he heard a loud voice .

" hey , you two ! what are you doing with my beans ? " it was mrs. lee . she had seen them from her window . she came out of her house and walked to the bean plant . she looked angry and sad .

tim and sam were scared . they dropped the beans and tried to run away . but mrs. lee was faster . she caught them and said , " you naughty boys ! how dare you steal my beans ? do you know how much i love my beans ? they are my only joy in life . i have no family or friends . i grow my beans with care and water them every day . they make me happy and healthy . and you just came and took them without asking . how would you feel if someone did that to you ? "

tim and sam felt ashamed and sorry . they realized they had done a very bad thing . they looked at mrs. lee and said , " we are sorry , mrs. lee . we were wrong . we did not think about how you feel . we were selfish and greedy . please forgive us . we will not do it again . we will help you put the beans back and water them . we will also be your friends and talk to you . you are not old and mean . you are kind and good . "

mrs. lee smiled and said , " thank you , boys . i appreciate your apology and your offer . i forgive you . you are not naughty and bad . you are young and curious . you made a mistake , but you learned from it . you can be my friends and help me with my beans . you can also have some beans to eat , but only if you ask me first . and i will also smile and talk to you more . you are not strangers . you are my neighbors . "

tim and sam smiled and said , " thank you , mrs. lee . we are happy to be your friends and neighbors . we will respect you and your beans . we will also share and care for others . we learned a valuable lesson today . "

the end .

moral value : the story teaches the moral value of respecting other people 's property and feelings , as well as the value of apologizing , forgiving , and making friends . lily and ben like to play store . they have a big box , some toys , and some paper money . lily is the store lady and ben is the customer . they take turns to buy and sell things .

one day , they play store for a long time . they have a lot of fun . but then , lily sees that ben has more money than her . she thinks that is not fair . she wants more money too . she says to ben , " give me some of your money . you have too much . "

ben says , " no , this is my money . i worked hard to get it . you ca n't have it . " he holds his money tight . lily gets mad . she tries to grab his money . ben pulls it away . they start to fight .

mom hears them fighting . she comes to see what is wrong . she sees them pulling and pushing and yelling . she says , " stop it , both of you . what are you doing ? why are you fighting ? "

lily and ben tell mom what happened . mom says , " playing store is fun , but fighting is not . money is not the most important thing . sharing and being kind are more important . you need to say sorry to each other and make up . "

lily and ben feel bad . they know mom is right . they say sorry to each other and hug . they decide to share their money and their toys . they play store again , but this time , they are nice and fair . playing store is fun , but being friends is more fun . tom and lily were playing with their toys in the living room . they had a lot of fun making noises and pretending to be animals . tom had a toy lion and lily had a toy giraffe .

" roar ! " tom said , making his lion jump on lily 's giraffe . " i am the king of the jungle ! "

" no , you are not ! " lily said , making her giraffe kick the lion away . " i am the tallest and the prettiest ! "

they laughed and continued to play . but then , tom felt a tickle in his nose . he tried to ignore it , but it got worse and worse . he felt a big sneeze coming .

" ah ... ah ... ah ... " tom said , holding his nose .

" what 's wrong , tom ? " lily asked , looking at him .

" i have to sneeze ! " tom said , letting go of his nose .

" then sneeze ! " lily said , moving away from him .

" ah ... ah ... ah ... choo ! " tom sneezed , spraying saliva and snot all over his lion and lily 's giraffe .

" ew ! " lily said , covering her mouth . " that 's disgusting , tom ! "

" i 'm sorry , lily ! " tom said , wiping his nose . " i did n't mean to ! "

lily looked at her giraffe , which was wet and sticky . she felt angry and sad . she loved her giraffe and she did n't want it to be dirty .

" look what you did , tom ! " lily said , pointing at her giraffe . " you ruined my giraffe ! "

" no , i did n't ! " tom said , picking up his lion . " it 's just a little sneeze . it will dry soon . "

" i do n't care ! " lily said , snatching her giraffe from him . " you are a bad friend , tom ! i do n't want to play with you anymore ! "

she ran to the other side of the living room , where her mom was reading a book . she hugged her mom and cried .

" mommy , tom sneezed on my giraffe and made it disgusting ! " lily said , sobbing .

" oh , honey , i 'm sorry to hear that , " her mom said , stroking her hair . " but maybe tom did n't do it on purpose . maybe he was sick or allergic to something . maybe you should forgive him and share your toys again . "

lily looked at her mom , then at tom , who was sitting on the floor with his lion . he looked sad and sorry . he wanted to play with lily again , but he did n't know how to say it .

lily thought for a moment . she remembered that tom was her friend and that they had a lot of fun together . she also remembered that sometimes she sneezed too , and that it was not nice to be mad at someone for sneezing .

she wiped her tears and smiled . she got up and walked to tom . she held out her giraffe to him .

" here , tom , " she said , softly . " you can play with my giraffe . i will play with your lion . and we can be friends again . "

tom 's eyes lit up . he took the giraffe and gave lily the lion . he hugged her and said , " thank you , lily . you are a good friend , lily . i 'm sorry i sneezed on your giraffe . "

" it 's okay , tom , " lily said , hugging him back . " i 'm sorry i yelled at you . let 's play some more . "

they smiled and went back to their toys . they made noises and pretended to be animals . they had a lot of fun . and they did n't sneeze anymore . tom and lily liked to play with their toy boats . they had a big tub of water in the garden , and they pretended it was the sea . they made waves with their hands , and they sailed their boats across the water .

one day , tom and lily decided to make a port for their boats . they used some blocks and sticks to build a wall and a dock . they put their boats inside the port , and they said it was a safe and fine place for them .

but then , a big wind came and blew their port away . the blocks and sticks fell into the water , and some of their boats floated away too . tom and lily were very sad . they cried and cried .

mum and dad heard them crying , and they came to see what was wrong . they saw the broken port and the lost boats , and they hugged tom and lily . they said they were sorry , and they helped them to find their boats and to fix their port .

tom and lily thanked mum and dad , and they said they loved them . they said they valued their boats , but they valued their family more . they said they would always take care of their port , and their boats , and each other . they smiled and played again , and they were happy . lily likes to look at magazines . she likes the pictures of animals and people and things . she has a lot of magazines in her room . she keeps them in a big box .

one day , lily finds a new magazine in the box . it is different from the others . it has a shiny cover and a lot of colors . it says " unique " on the top . lily thinks it is a special magazine . she wants to see what is inside .

she opens the magazine and sees more pictures . she sees a picture of a snake . it is long and green and has a forked tongue . lily is curious . she touches the snake with her finger . it feels smooth and cold .

she moves her finger closer to the snake 's mouth . she wonders what it would do . she does not know that the snake is not real . it is a sticker . it has a spring inside . it can bite .

the snake bites lily 's finger . it makes a snapping sound . lily feels a pinch . she is scared and surprised . she drops the magazine and cries . she runs to her mom .

mom hears lily 's cry and comes to her room . she sees the magazine on the floor and the snake sticker on lily 's finger . she understands what happened . she hugs lily and takes off the sticker . she kisses lily 's finger and makes it better .

she tells lily that the snake is not real . it is a toy . it is meant to be funny , not scary . she tells lily that she is brave and smart . she tells lily that she is unique , just like the magazine . lily smiles and hugs her mom . she feels better . she still likes magazines , but she does not like snakes . sam liked to play with his toy plane . he pretended he was a pilot and flew it around the room . he made noises like zoom and vroom and beep . he had a lot of fun with his toy plane .

one day , sam saw a real plane in the sky . it was big and shiny and loud . he wanted to see it up close . he ran outside and followed it with his eyes . he did not see the road or the cars or the people . he only saw the plane .

the plane flew over a big building . it had a lot of windows and smoke . sam thought it was a cloud . he did not know it was a fire . he did not know the plane was in trouble . he did not know the pilot was scared .

the plane got lower and lower . it was very fast and very hot . it hit the building with a boom . it made a big hole and a lot of flames . it burned the building and the plane and the pilot . sam saw it all . he was very sad and very scared .

he dropped his toy plane and ran back to his house . he hugged his mom and cried . he did not want to play with his toy plane anymore . he did not want to be a pilot anymore . he wanted to be an ordinary boy . he wanted to be safe . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play in the park , share snacks , and make funny faces . one day , they found a small ring in the grass . it was shiny and had a crack in it .

" look , a ring ! " lily said . " maybe it is magic . "

" maybe we can marry with it , " ben said . " like mommy and daddy . "

lily and ben put the ring on their fingers . they held hands and said , " i marry you , you marry me . we are happy as can be . "

then they kissed each other on the cheek and giggled . they felt a warm and fuzzy feeling in their hearts .

but then , a big dog came running towards them . it barked and jumped and wanted to play . lily and ben got scared and ran away . the ring fell off their fingers and got lost in the grass .

they did not see the ring again . but they did not mind . they still had each other . and they knew they were married in their hearts . anna liked to play with her silver ball . it was shiny and round and made a nice sound when she rolled it . she took it with her to the park , where she saw some other kids playing with their toys .

one of them was ben , who had a big red truck . he saw anna 's silver ball and wanted it . he ran over to her and tried to grab it . anna did not like that . she held on to her ball and said , " no , this is mine ! "

ben was not friendly . he pushed anna and made her fall . he took her silver ball and laughed . anna was sad and angry . she wanted her ball back .

she got up and ran after ben . she was faster than him and caught up with him . she reached for her ball , but ben held it high above his head . he was taller than anna and thought she could not get it .

but anna was smart . she saw a big rock near them . she climbed on it and jumped . she grabbed her ball from ben 's hand and landed on the ground . she smiled and hugged her ball . she had succeeded .

ben was surprised and mad . he wanted to get the ball back , but anna was not afraid of him anymore . she said , " you are mean . you ca n't have my ball . go play with your truck . "

she ran away from ben and found a friendly girl who had a yellow doll . she asked her if she wanted to play with her silver ball . the girl said yes and they became friends . they shared their toys and had fun . anna was happy . lily liked to go to school . she had many friends and a nice teacher . she learned new things every day . she liked to draw and sing and play .

one day , it was very cold and snowy . lily 's mom said she had to wear a big coat and a hat and a scarf . lily did not like them . they were itchy and heavy and made her look silly . she wanted to wear her pink dress and her shiny shoes .

when lily got to school , she saw some kids laughing at her . they said she looked like a snowman . they threw snowballs at her and made her cry . lily ran away and hid behind a tree . she was sad and cold and wet .

she saw a big dog coming . it was black and furry and had sharp teeth . it barked and growled and ran towards her . lily was scared and screamed . she tried to cover herself with her coat , but it was too late . the dog bit her and dragged her away . no one heard her or helped her . lily 's mom was not reliable . she did not keep her safe . lily wished she had listened to her mom and worn her warm clothes . anna liked to dress up in her mom 's clothes . she liked to wear her mom 's hats , shoes , and necklaces . she thought she looked very pretty and grown - up . sometimes , she would sneak into her mom 's closet when her mom was not home and try on different outfits .

one day , anna saw a big red dress in her mom 's closet . it had shiny buttons and a long skirt . anna wanted to wear it very much . she took it off the hanger and put it on . it was too big for her , but she did not care . she looked at herself in the mirror and smiled .

she decided to show her dad how pretty she was . she walked down the stairs , holding the skirt of the dress . she was anxious to see her dad 's face . she thought he would be very happy and proud of her .

but when she got to the living room , she saw her mom sitting on the couch with her dad . her mom was wearing the same red dress as anna . her mom looked very angry and surprised . her dad looked very confused and shocked .

anna realized she had made a big mistake . she had taken her mom 's dress without asking . she had ruined her mom 's surprise for her dad . she felt very bad and scared . she wanted to run away and hide .

she started to cry and say sorry . her mom got up and hugged her . she told her it was okay , and that she loved her . she told her she should not take things that were not hers , and that she should always ask before dressing up . she said she was not mad , but she was sad that anna did not respect her things .

anna said she was sorry again , and that she loved her mom . she said she wanted to be like her mom , and that she thought the dress was very pretty . she said she would never do it again .

her mom smiled and kissed her . she said she was glad that anna wanted to be like her , and that she was very pretty too . she said she would let her wear the dress sometimes , if she asked nicely . she said she had another surprise for her dad , and that they could all share it together .

her dad smiled and hugged them both . he said he loved them very much , and that they were the best surprises ever . he said he did not mind the dress , but he liked them better without it . he said they should all go to the kitchen and have some cake .

anna was happy and relieved . she learned a lesson , and she still had her mom 's love . she took off the dress and gave it back to her mom . she followed her parents to the kitchen , where a big chocolate cake was waiting for them . she thought it was the best day ever . tom and mia liked to play with their toys . they had many toys , but their favorite was a laser . the laser was a small stick that made a red light . they could point the laser at things and make them look red .

one day , they decided to play with the laser in the garden . they pointed the laser at the flowers , the grass , the bugs , and the birds . they laughed and had fun . but they did not see that their cat , luna , was watching them . luna liked to chase red things . she thought the laser was a toy for her .

luna jumped and ran after the laser . she tried to catch it with her paws and her mouth . but the laser was too fast and too small . she could not catch it . she got angry and frustrated . she meowed and hissed .

tom and mia heard luna and turned to see her . they saw that she was very upset . they felt sorry for her . they realized that they were not being nice to luna . they were teasing her with the laser . they decided to stop playing with the laser and play with luna instead .

they put the laser away and took out a ball . they threw the ball for luna to chase . luna was happy . she caught the ball and brought it back . she purred and rubbed against tom and mia . they petted her and hugged her . they learned that it was not good to tease others with the laser . they learned that it was better to share and be kind .

the moral of the story is : do not tease others with the laser . share and be kind . lily and ben were playing in the living room . they had many toys and books to choose from . but they wanted to do something new and fun .

" let 's make a cabinet ! " lily said . she had seen her dad make one in the garage . " we can use these boxes and tape and paint . "

