mom came to the living room and saw the cabinet . she smiled and hugged lily and ben .

" you did a great job , kids ! " she said . " you made a new and beautiful cabinet . i 'm very proud of you . " lily was a bird who loved to fly . she liked to see the sky , the trees , and the flowers . she had many friends who flew with her . they had fun and sang songs .

one day , lily saw a big flower . it was red and shiny . lily wanted to touch it . she flew to the flower and landed on it . but the flower was not real . it was fake . it was made of plastic and metal . it had a sharp edge that hurt lily 's wing . lily cried out in pain .

her friends heard her and came to help . they saw the fake flower and the blood on lily 's wing . they were angry and sad . they took lily to a safe place and cleaned her wound . they told her to be careful and not to trust things that look too good . they said real flowers are beautiful and gentle , but fake flowers are ugly and mean .

lily learned her lesson . she thanked her friends for saving her . she was sorry for being foolish . she never flew to fake flowers again . she only flew to real flowers that smelled nice and made her happy . she was a good and wise bird . tom and mia are friends . they like to play with a ball . they kick the ball to each other . sometimes they miss the ball . sometimes they catch the ball . they have fun .

one day , they see a big zip on the wall . the zip is shiny and red . they want to see what is behind the zip . they run to the zip . they pull the zip . the zip makes a noise . zzzzz !

behind the zip , there is a room . the room is full of toys . there are cars , dolls , books , puzzles , and more . tom and mia are happy . they want to play with the toys . they are ready to have more fun .

they go into the room . they pick up the toys . they play with the toys . they make noises . vroom ! vroom ! beep ! beep ! they laugh . they share the toys . they are good friends .

they do not see the sign on the door . the sign says : do not enter . this is the toy store . the toys are not for you . the sign is too hard to read . tom and mia do not know . they think the room is for them . they do not hear the footsteps . they do not see the man . the man is angry . he works at the toy store . he sees tom and mia . he shouts . hey ! what are you doing here ? put down the toys ! get out of here ! tom and mia are scared . they drop the toys . they run to the zip . they pull the zip . they go out of the room . they run away . they do not look back . they do not want to play with the ball anymore . they want to go home . they are not happy . they are sorry . lily loved her furry bear . she took him everywhere . she hugged him and kissed him and told him stories . he was her best friend .

