lily and her bear had a good day . they went back home and put him on the shelf . lily said good night to her bear and hugged him . she said she would see him in the morning . he said good night to lily and smiled . he was glad to be her bear . sara and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys . sara has a white car . ben has a red truck . they drive their toys on the floor .

one day , mom is making coffee in the kitchen . she tells sara and ben to be careful and not spill the coffee . sara and ben say yes , mom .

but sara and ben are not careful . they drive their toys too fast and too loud . they bump into the table . the coffee falls down . the coffee is hot and brown . it makes a big mess .

mom hears the noise and comes to see . she is angry and sad . she says , sara and ben , you are naughty . you spilled the coffee . you made a mess . you could have burned yourself . you have to clean up and say sorry .

sara and ben feel bad . they say sorry , mom . they help mom clean up the mess . they hug mom and say , we love you , mom . mom hugs them back and says , i love you , too . but next time , be careful and listen to me . sara and ben nod and say , yes , mom . they drive their toys more slowly and quietly . they are good twins . lily likes to read books . she has many books in her room . she reads them every day . she reads about animals , and colors , and shapes . she learns new words from her books .

today is lily 's birthday . she is very happy . she gets many gifts from her mom and dad , and her friends . she sees many wraps on the gifts . she likes to open the wraps and see what is inside . she says thank you to everyone .

one of the gifts is a big book . it has many pictures and stories . lily loves it . she hugs the book and says , " this is the best gift ever ! " she wants to read it right away . she asks her mom to read it with her .

lily and her mom sit on the couch . they open the book . they read the first story . it is about a good dog who helps a farmer . lily likes the dog . she says , " the dog is good . he is a good friend . " she smiles and turns the page . she wants to read more stories . she is very happy . tom and lily were twins who liked to play with paint . they had many colors of paint and brushes and paper . they liked to make pictures of animals and flowers and cars . one day , they saw an elderly lady walking on the street . she had a big bag of groceries and a cane . she looked tired and sad .

" let 's make her happy , " tom said to lily . " let 's give her one of our pictures . "

" ok , " lily said . " but which one ? "

they looked at their pictures and chose one that had a rainbow and a sun and a bird . they ran to the lady and said , " hello , we made this for you . it is a gift . "

the lady smiled and took the picture . she said , " thank you , children . this is very beautiful . you are very kind . "

tom and lily felt happy . they said , " you 're welcome . we hope you like it . "

they waved goodbye and ran back to their paint . they wanted to make more pictures .

but they did not see a boy who was watching them . he was bigger and meaner than them . he did not like paint or pictures . he liked to kick and break things . he saw the picture that the lady had and he wanted to take it . he ran after the lady and snatched the picture from her hand . he said , " this is mine now . it is ugly and stupid . "

the lady was shocked and scared . she said , " no , please , give it back . it was a gift from the children . they worked hard on it . "

the boy did not listen . he laughed and kicked the picture . he tore it into pieces and threw it on the ground . he said , " there , now it is better . you do n't need this . you are old and ugly and stupid too . "

he kicked the lady 's cane and made her fall . he ran away with his footprints on the picture .

the lady cried and hurt . she could not get up . she called for help , but no one heard her .

tom and lily heard her . they saw what the boy did . they felt angry and sad . they ran to the lady and helped her up . they said , " we are sorry , we are sorry . that boy was bad . he ruined our picture . he hurt you . we will get help . "

they hugged the lady and ran to find a grown - up . they hoped the lady would be ok .

the moral of the story is : be kind and generous to others , especially to the elderly . do not be mean and selfish like the boy who kicked and broke things . he did not make anyone happy , not even himself . he made everyone unhappy , especially himself . tim and lily were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . they saw a big hill with a lot of trees . they wanted to climb the hill and see what was on the other side .

they ran up the hill and pushed through the trees . they saw a big house made of wood and stone . it looked old and dark . they heard a loud noise from inside . it sounded like a roar .

" who is there ? " a deep voice said . tim and lily were scared . they wanted to run away , but they were curious . they peeked through a window and saw a giant . he was very tall and had a long beard and a big nose . he was holding a book and a pen .

" hello , little ones , " the giant said . " do n't be scared . i wo n't hurt you . i 'm just writing a story . do you like stories ? "

tim and lily nodded . they liked stories a lot . they went inside the house and sat on a big chair . the giant smiled and showed them his book . it had many pictures and words . he read them a story about a brave knight and a friendly dragon . tim and lily listened and laughed . they liked the story .

" thank you , mr. giant , " tim and lily said . " you are very nice and your story is very good . can we come back and hear more stories ? "

" of course , you can , " the giant said . " you are very polite and brave . you can come back anytime . but remember , do n't judge a book by its cover . sometimes , things are not what they seem . and sometimes , the biggest and scariest things can be the kindest and friendliest . "

tim and lily hugged the giant and said goodbye . they ran down the hill and back to the park . they told their friends about the giant and his stories . they learned a new lesson that day . they learned to be curious , respectful and open - minded . they learned to thank those who share their gifts and talents . and they learned to not be scared of giants . tom and lily like to play in the sand . they have a spade and a bucket . they make a big castle with the sand . they put shells and stones on the castle . it looks nice .

a man comes to the beach . he has a big bag . he says he sells toys . he shows tom and lily some toys . he has balls , cars , dolls and books . tom and lily want to see the toys .

the man sees the castle . he likes it . he says he wants to buy the castle . he says he will give tom and lily a toy for the castle . tom and lily think about it . they like their castle , but they also like the toys .

tom says he will sell the castle for a ball . lily says she will sell the castle for a doll . the man says ok . he gives tom a ball and lily a doll . he takes the spade and the bucket . he puts some sand in the bag . he says he will take the castle home .

tom and lily are happy with their toys . they play with the ball and the doll . they say thank you to the man . the man is happy with the castle . he says thank you to tom and lily . he goes away with the bag .

tom and lily think the man is funny . they wonder why he wants a sand castle . they laugh and hug . they have fun . lily was a girl who liked to carry her doll everywhere . she loved her doll very much and gave her hugs and kisses . she named her doll anna and pretended she was her sister .

one day , lily went to the park with her mom and anna . she saw another girl who was carrying a bigger doll . the other girl 's doll had long hair and a pretty dress . lily felt jealous . she wanted a bigger doll too .

she walked over to the other girl and said , " can i see your doll ? " the other girl said , " no , this is my doll . go away . " lily felt sad and angry . she tried to grab the other girl 's doll , but the other girl pulled it away . they started to fight .

their moms heard them and came over . they separated the girls and scolded them . they said , " you should not fight over dolls . you should share and be nice to each other . " they made the girls apologize and hug .

lily looked at the other girl 's doll and said , " your doll is very pretty . i 'm sorry i tried to take her . " the other girl looked at lily 's doll and said , " your doll is very cute . i 'm sorry i was mean to you . " they smiled and decided to be friends .

they played together with their dolls and had fun . they learned that it is better to be happy with what you have and to be kind to others . lily liked to rub her doll 's hair . she loved her doll very much . her doll was a gift from her grandma . grandma said the doll was expensive , but lily did not know what that meant . she only knew that the doll was pretty and soft and smelled nice .

one day , lily took her doll to the park . she wanted to show her doll to her friend ben . ben liked to play with cars and trucks . he did not like dolls . he said dolls were silly and boring . he grabbed lily 's doll and threw it in the mud . lily was very sad and angry . she ran to get her doll and shouted at ben .

" give me back my doll ! you are mean and rude ! you do n't know how to be a good friend ! "

ben laughed and said , " your doll is ugly and dirty now . you can have it . i do n't want it . it 's not fun to play with . "

lily picked up her doll and hugged it . she tried to rub the mud off her doll 's hair , but it was hard . she felt tears in her eyes . she wished grandma was here . grandma would know how to clean her doll and make it pretty again .

she looked around and saw a lady sitting on a bench . the lady had a kind face and a big bag . lily walked to the lady and said , " excuse me , can you help me ? my doll is dirty and i do n't know how to clean it . "

the lady smiled and said , " of course , i can help you . i have some wipes and a towel in my bag . let me see your doll . "

the lady took lily 's doll and gently wiped the mud off her hair and face . she dried her with a towel and combed her hair . she said , " there , your doll is clean and beautiful again . what 's her name ? "

lily said , " her name is rose . she is my favorite doll . thank you for helping me . you are very nice . "

the lady said , " you 're welcome , lily . i 'm glad i could help . rose is a lovely doll . she looks very special . where did you get her ? "

lily said , " my grandma gave her to me . she said she was expensive , but i do n't know what that means . "

the lady said , " it means that your grandma paid a lot of money for your doll . she must love you very much . you should take good care of your doll and cherish her . she is a rare and valuable doll . "

lily said , " i do love her very much . and i love my grandma too . she is the best grandma in the world . "

the lady said , " i 'm sure she is . and i 'm sure she would be proud of you for being brave and polite . you are a good girl , lily . and you have a good friend in rose . "

lily smiled and said , " thank you , lady . you are a good friend too . can i give you a hug ? "

the lady said , " of course , you can . i would love a hug . "

lily hugged the lady and said , " thank you for everything . you made me happy . "

the lady hugged lily back and said , " you 're welcome , lily . you made me happy too . " anna liked to examine things . she liked to look at them very closely and see what they were made of . she had a magnifying glass that made things look bigger and more interesting .

one day , she found a piece of paper on the ground . it had some words on it , but she could not read them . she wondered what they said . she took her magnifying glass and examined the paper . she saw some letters and some shapes . she tried to sound out the letters , but they did not make sense .

she decided to ask her mom for help . she ran to the kitchen , where her mom was making lunch . she showed her the paper and said , " mom , what does this say ? i found it outside . it is a message , but i can not read it . "

her mom looked at the paper and smiled . she said , " this is a message from your dad . he wrote it for you before he went to work . he said , ' i love you , anna . you are my independent and smart girl . have a good day . ' "

anna felt happy and proud . she hugged her mom and said , " i love you , too , mom . and i love dad . he is very nice . he knows i like to examine things . can i keep the message ? "

her mom nodded and said , " of course , you can . it is yours . you can put it in your room or in your backpack . it is a special message for a special girl . "

anna thanked her mom and ran to her room . she put the message on her desk , next to her magnifying glass . she looked at it again and smiled . she felt independent and smart , just like her dad said . she was happy . sara liked to write . she had a big book and many colors . she wrote stories and drew pictures . she was very creative .

one day , she wanted to write a story about the sea . she asked her mom for some salt . her mom gave her a little bowl of salt . sara said thank you and went to her room .

she sprinkled some salt on her book . she thought it would make her story look like the sea . but the salt was too much . it made her book wet and sticky . the colors ran and the words faded . sara was sad . she had ruined her book .

she ran to her mom and showed her the book . her mom hugged her and said , " i 'm sorry , sara . i know you wanted to write a nice story . but salt is not for writing . salt is for food . it makes food tasty . but it also makes things dry and hard . it is not good for paper and colors . "

sara nodded . she understood . she said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i was trying to be creative . but i made a mistake . can i have a new book ? "

her mom smiled and said , " of course , sara . you can have a new book . and you can still be creative . but next time , use something else for the sea . maybe some blue or green colors . or some glitter or stickers . or some cotton or wool . there are many things you can use to write and draw . but not salt . "

sara smiled and said , " thank you , mom . you are very kind . and very smart . i will use something else for the sea . and i will write a new story . a better story . "

her mom kissed her and said , " you 're welcome , sara . i love you . and i love your stories . you are very creative . and very brave . you learned from your mistake . and that is a good thing . " tim and jen are brother and sister . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big hill . they want to climb the hill and see what is on the other side . they ask their mom if they can go . mom says yes , but they have to be back before it gets dark . she gives them an order : stay together and be careful .

tim and jen run to the hill . they climb and climb . they have fun . they see flowers and birds and rocks . they forget about the time . they do not see the sun go down . they do not hear their mom call them . they reach the top of the hill . they look at the other side . they see a dark forest . they are curious . they want to explore the forest .

they go down the hill . they enter the forest . they do not see the path . they do not see the light . they only see trees and shadows . they hear strange noises . they are scared . they want to go back . but they do not know the way . they are lost . they call for their mom . but she does not hear them . they cry . they hug each other . they lay on the ground . they hope someone will find them . but no one does . they stay in the dark forest . they are alone . they are cold . they are hungry . they are sad . they are in trouble . the end . ben and lily were going to visit grandma and grandpa . they were very happy . they wanted to pack their toys and books . mom helped them pack a big bag . she said , " we have to pack light . the car is not very big . "

ben and lily packed their favorite things . ben packed his car and his ball . lily packed her doll and her book . they also packed some snacks and water . they zipped the bag and put it by the door . they were ready to go .

mom said , " before we go , we have to turn off the oven . i made a cake for grandma and grandpa . it is very yummy . but it is also very tough . we have to be careful when we cut it . "

ben and lily followed mom to the kitchen . they saw the cake on the table . it was brown and round . it smelled good . mom turned off the oven . she said , " the oven is very hot . do not touch it . it can hurt you . "

ben and lily nodded . they did not touch the oven . they wanted to be safe . they wanted to eat the cake later . they said , " thank you , mom , for the cake . we love you . "

mom smiled . she said , " i love you too . now let 's go . grandma and grandpa are waiting for us . " she took the cake and the bag . she led ben and lily to the car . they buckled up and drove away . they were very excited . they were going to have fun . lily and ben were playing in the park . they saw a big tree with a long trunk . lily said , " let 's pretend the trunk is a rocket . we can shoot to the moon . " ben nodded and ran to the trunk . he climbed on it and held on tight .

lily followed him and sat behind him . she said , " ready , set , go ! " she made a loud noise with her mouth . " boom ! we are shooting to the moon ! " ben laughed and said , " look , there are stars and planets ! " they pretended to see many things in the sky .

but they did not see the big dog that came to the park . the dog was angry and hungry . he saw the children on the tree and barked . he ran to the trunk and bit it hard . the trunk cracked and broke . lily and ben fell down with a thud . they cried and hurt . the dog ran away .

a man and a woman heard the noise and came to help . they were lily and ben 's parents . they saw the broken trunk and the children on the ground . they were scared and sad . they hugged lily and ben and took them to the doctor . the doctor said they had bruises and cuts , but they would be okay . he gave them bandages and ice cream .

lily and ben learned a lesson . they should not play on a trunk that can break . they should be careful and watch out for dogs . they said sorry to their parents and the tree . they hoped the tree would grow a new trunk . they did not want to shoot to the moon anymore . tom loved rockets . he had many rockets in his room . some were big , some were small , some were red , some were blue . he liked to play with them and make them fly in the air . he wished he could go to the moon in a real rocket .

one day , he saw a big rocket in the park . it was shiny and silver , and it had a sign that said " for rich people only " . tom wanted to see the rocket up close , but he was not rich . he was sad . he waited until no one was looking , and then he ran to the rocket . he opened the door and went inside .

the rocket was amazing . it had many buttons and lights and screens . tom touched everything . he did not know what they did , but they made funny noises . he felt happy . he sat in the pilot 's seat and put on a helmet . he felt like a real astronaut .

suddenly , the rocket started to shake . tom heard a loud voice say " countdown to launch : 10 , 9 , 8 , 7 ... " . he was scared . he tried to get out , but the door was locked . he screamed for help , but no one heard him . the rocket lifted off the ground and flew into the sky . tom saw the park , the trees , the houses , and the people get smaller and smaller . he cried . he wanted to go back home .

the rocket went higher and higher , until it reached the clouds . then , it disappeared . no one knew where it went . tom was alone in the rocket , with no one to help him . he did not know what to do . he wished he had never gone inside the rocket . he wished he had stayed with his rockets in his room . he wished he had listened to the sign . he learned a hard lesson : rockets are not for playing . rockets are for rich people only . tim and jen were twins who liked to ride their bikes . they had a big park near their house where they could play and race . but one day , their mom said they had to go to the dentist . tim and jen did not like the dentist . they did not want to go .

mom said they had to leave soon , because there was a lot of traffic on the road . she said traffic was when many cars and trucks and buses were on the road and they had to wait and be careful . she said traffic could make them late for the dentist . she said they should take their raincoats , because it looked like it was going to rain .

tim and jen did not want to take their raincoats . they said they were not cold and they did not mind getting wet . they said they liked the rain . they said they wanted to stay and play . mom said no , they had to go . she said she would recommend they listen to her , because she knew what was best for them . she said recommend was when you tell someone what you think they should do .

tim and jen did not listen to mom . they put on their helmets and got on their bikes . they said they would race to the car and be back soon . mom said no , they had to stay with her . but tim and jen did not hear her . they rode away as fast as they could .

they did not see the traffic . they did not see the big truck that was coming . they did not see the red light that was telling them to stop . they did not see the puddle that was wet and slippery . they only saw each other and the car that was waiting for them .

they crashed . they fell . they hurt . they cried . the truck stopped . the driver got out . he was angry . he yelled . mom ran . she was scared . she hugged . she said sorry . the driver said sorry . he said he did not see them . he said they were lucky . he said they could have been worse .

tim and jen learned a lesson . they learned to listen to mom . they learned to watch the traffic . they learned to obey the light . they learned to wear their raincoats . they learned to be careful . they learned to recommend to each other what was best for them . they learned to say sorry . they learned to be thankful . they learned to be happy . they learned to love . sara liked to go to the park with her mom . she liked to see the flowers that had many colors . she liked to smell them and touch them gently . she liked to hear the bees that buzzed and the birds that sang .

one day , sara saw a flower that was different . it was big and white and had a long stem . it was not open like the other flowers . it was closed like a ball . sara asked her mom what it was .

mom said , " that is a lily . it is a special flower that blooms at night . when it is dark , it opens up and shows its beauty . it also has a sweet smell that fills the air . "

sara wanted to see the lily bloom . she asked her mom if they could stay until night . mom said , " no , honey , we have to go home soon . it is getting late and you are tired . you need to sleep and rest . maybe we can come back another day and see the lily bloom . "

sara was sad . she wanted to see the lily bloom . she wanted to smell its sweet smell . she wanted to hear its silence . she looked at the lily and said , " please , bloom for me . i want to see you . "

but the lily did not bloom . it stayed closed like a ball . sara sighed and followed her mom to the car . she was tired and sleepy . she closed her eyes and dreamed of the lily . she hoped it would bloom for her someday . ben and lily like to play in the garden . they have a lot of fun with the flowers , the bugs and the dirt . one day , they see a big red tomato on a plant . they want to pick it and eat it .

they look at the tomato and smile . they think it is ripe and juicy . they reach for the tomato and pull it hard . but they pull too hard and the tomato falls to the ground . it breaks and splashes everywhere .

they look at the tomato and frown . they think it is wasted and messy . they hear a voice behind them . it is mom . she looks at the tomato and sighs . she thinks it is ruined and sad .

she says to ben and lily , " what did you do ? that was my tomato . i was going to make a salad with it . now it is gone . i am very sorry . "

ben and lily look at mom and feel bad . they think they are naughty and mean . they say to mom , " we are sorry , mom . we wanted to eat the tomato . we did not mean to break it . we love you , mom . "

mom looks at ben and lily and hugs them . she thinks they are sweet and sorry . she says to ben and lily , " it is okay , ben and lily . i love you too . you can eat another tomato later . but next time , ask me first . and be careful with the plants . they are alive and need care . "

ben and lily nod and say , " yes , mom . we will ask you first . and we will be careful with the plants . we are sorry , mom . "

they help mom clean up the tomato and go inside . they have a snack and a drink . they are happy and sorry . they learn a lesson and have a story . lily was going to visit her aunt for the first time . she was very excited , but also a little frightened . she did not know what her aunt looked like , or what she liked to do . she hoped her aunt would be nice and have fun toys .

when they got to the house , lily 's mom knocked on the door . lily held her mom 's hand and gazed at the door . she wondered who would open it . she heard a voice say , " come in , come in ! " it was her aunt . she opened the door and smiled .

lily 's aunt was very tall and had long red hair . she wore a big hat and a colorful dress . she looked different from lily 's mom , but she had the same eyes . she bent down and hugged lily . she said , " hello , lily , i 'm so happy to meet you . you are so cute and smart . come , i have something to show you . "

lily 's aunt took her by the hand and led her to the living room . there , on the couch , was a big fluffy cat . it was white and gray and had green eyes . it looked at lily and meowed . lily 's aunt said , " this is my cat , fluffy . he is very friendly and loves to play . do you want to pet him ? "

lily was not sure . she liked animals , but she had never seen a cat like this . she was a little frightened . she looked at her mom , who nodded and smiled . she looked at her aunt , who stroked the cat and said , " do n't be afraid , lily . fluffy wo n't hurt you . he is very gentle and soft . come , try it . "

lily took a deep breath and moved closer to the couch . she reached out her hand and touched the cat 's fur . it was warm and soft . the cat purred and rubbed his head against her hand . lily felt a tickle and giggled . she liked the cat . she looked at her aunt and smiled . she was not frightened anymore . she was happy . she said , " thank you , aunt . fluffy is very nice . i like him . i like you too . " timmy loved his furry cat , max . he liked to pet him , play with him , and feed him . he made a promise to his mom that he would always take good care of max and never hurt him .

one day , timmy saw a big dog outside his window . the dog was barking and running around . timmy thought the dog looked fun and wanted to play with him . he opened the door and ran outside with max in his arms .

the dog saw timmy and max and ran towards them . he wanted to chase the cat and bite him . timmy was scared and tried to run back to the house , but he tripped and fell . max jumped out of his arms and ran away . the dog followed him and caught him .

timmy heard max cry and saw the dog shake him . he cried too and shouted for help . his mom came out and saw what happened . she was angry and sad . she yelled at the dog and scared him away . she picked up timmy and hugged him . she picked up max and saw that he was hurt and bleeding . she took him to the car and drove to the vet .

the vet tried to help max , but he said it was too late . max was gone . timmy was very sad and sorry . he broke his promise and lost his furry cat . he wished he never saw the dog and never left the house . he learned a hard lesson . he never questioned his mom again . kim and ben were best friends . they liked to play with their toys and share their snacks . they had a purple ball that they both loved . it was big and bouncy and shiny .

