their moms came to see what was wrong . they tried to comfort them and explain that sometimes things get lost or stolen . they said they would buy them a new ball . but kim and ben did not want a new ball . they wanted their purple ball . it was their favorite and most reliable toy . they felt like they had lost their best friend . they wished they had never left it alone . they learned a hard lesson . the end . ben and sam are brothers . they like to play with toy guns and pretend they are soldiers . they have a hut in the backyard , made of wood and blankets . they hide in the hut and shoot at the birds and the squirrels .

