lily and ben hug each other . they are happy and proud . they say they want to go on the slide again . mom and dad say they are very brave and they can go on the slide as many times as they want . they all have a good time in the park . ben loved dinosaurs . he had many dinosaur toys in his room . he liked to play with them and make them roar and stomp . he knew their names and what they ate . he wished he could see a real dinosaur .

one day , he went to the park with his mom . he saw a big sign that said " dinosaur show " . he was very excited . he pulled his mom 's hand and said " mom , mom , can we go ? please , please , please ? " his mom smiled and said " ok , ben , let 's go see the dinosaurs . "

