the show was very fun . ben saw the dinosaurs do many things . they ran and jumped and fought and played . they ate leaves and meat and bones . they made friends and enemies . they included ben in their games . they asked him to join them and help them . ben felt like he was part of their world . he felt like he was not an ordinary boy , but a dinosaur boy . he had the best time ever . tom and sue are friends . they like to travel and see new things . one day , they find a big gray bus . the bus can take them to many places . they want to go on the bus .

but the bus driver says they need to pay . he asks for one lime each . tom and sue do not have any limes . they only have apples and bananas . they think the bus driver is silly . why does he want limes ? they do not want to give him their fruits .

they decide to sneak on the bus when he is not looking . they hide under a seat . they think they are clever . they are happy to travel for free .

