they want to get off the bus . but they do not know where they are . they are scared and sad . they wish they had listened to the bus driver . they learn that limes are not silly . they are important for the bus . they also learn that it is not good to be sneaky and greedy . they should pay for what they want .

they hope the bus driver will forgive them and take them back . they promise to be good and honest . they also promise to try new things and respect others . they hope to find some limes on the way . sara and tom were playing in the park . they liked to pretend they were astronauts , exploring new planets . they had a big cardboard box that they used as a rocket . they painted it with bright colors and stickers .

" ready for take - off ? " tom asked sara .

