the alien reached for tom and sara with its long fingers . tom and sara trembled with fear . they tried to run back to their box , but it was too late . the alien grabbed them and stuffed them into its nose . they felt the boogers closing in on them . they cried and wished they never came to the green planet . it was the worst day ever . the end . anna liked to record her voice on her phone . she liked to sing songs , tell jokes , and make funny noises . she thought her voice was incredible and wanted to share it with everyone .

one day , she found her brother 's phone and decided to record her voice on it . she did not ask him , because she thought he would not mind . she recorded many things on his phone and then left it on the couch .

later , her brother came home and looked for his phone . he found it on the couch and saw that it had many new recordings . he listened to them and heard anna 's voice . he was angry and confused . he did not like that anna used his phone without asking . he did not like that she took up his space and made noise . he went to find anna and ask her a question .

he found anna in her room , playing with her dolls . he said , " anna , why did you use my phone and record your voice on it ? you did not ask me . you made me mad and sad . "

anna looked at him and felt sorry . she did not mean to make him mad and sad . she said , " i 'm sorry , brother . i wanted to record my voice because i think it is incredible . i wanted to share it with you and make you happy . i did not know you would mind . i did not think about your feelings . i was selfish . "

her brother said , " i understand , anna . i know you like to record your voice and share it . but you should always ask before you use someone else 's things . you should respect their space and privacy . you should think about their feelings . that is how you show kindness and love . "

anna nodded and hugged her brother . she said , " you are right , brother . i was wrong . i will ask you next time . i will respect your things and feelings . i will show you kindness and love . i 'm sorry . can you forgive me ? "

her brother smiled and hugged her back . he said , " of course , anna . i forgive you . you are my sister and i love you . and i think your voice is incredible too . but next time , please ask me first . "

anna and her brother learned a lesson that day . they learned to respect each other 's things and feelings . they learned to ask before they use something . they learned to show kindness and love . they learned to record their voice only with permission . lila and ben were friends . they liked to play on the beach . one day , they saw a big boat . the boat had many people and things on it . the people and things were going to the island .

