lila and ben pick up the hat . they look at each other and smile . they have a new toy . a silly hat for a silly game . they number the earth . sara was a little squirrel who loved to play in the forest . she liked to jump from tree to tree , and find acorns to eat . acorns were her favorite food . they were brown and round and crunchy .

