they smile at each other . they learn that lime juice is good , but water is better . they learn that they can have different tastes , but still be friends . they learn to share and be happy . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to dig in the sand and look for shiny things . sometimes they found coins or buttons or shells . but today they found something very special . it was a gem . it was red and sparkly and smooth .

