they all play together . they share their toys and have fun . they are friends . ben and sam were brothers who liked to play with their toys . ben had a drum that he liked to bang very loud . sam had a ball that he liked to throw and catch . one day , their mom said she had to go to the shop and she would be back soon . she told them to be good and not make a mess .

