ben and sam went to their rooms and cried . they wished they had not fought . they wished they had shared the drum and the ball . they wished they had been good . they could smell the cake from their rooms . it smelled very good . but they could not have any . they felt very bad . they heard mom sing a song in the kitchen . it sounded very distant . they felt very alone . lena likes to visit her uncle tom . he has a big house with many toys and books . he is very lively and funny . he makes lena laugh and plays with her a lot .

one day , lena and uncle tom go to the park . they see many birds and flowers and swings . lena wants to swing , but uncle tom says he is too big for the swings . he offers to push lena instead . lena says yes and climbs on the swing .

