their moms see them and shake their heads . they think they are crazy too . but they also smile and take pictures . they are happy to see their kids having fun and making new friends . tom and lily are brother and sister . they like to travel with their mom and dad . they go to different places and see new things . sometimes they travel by car , sometimes by train , sometimes by plane .

one day , they travel to a big lake . mom and dad want to fish . they have rods and hooks and worms . tom and lily are enthusiastic . they want to fish too . they ask mom and dad to teach them how to fish .

mom and dad give them each a rod and a hook . they show them how to put a worm on the hook and how to throw the rod in the water . they tell them to wait and watch for the fish to bite .

tom and lily sit on the shore and hold their rods . they look at the water and the sky and the trees . they see ducks and frogs and dragonflies . they hear birds and crickets and splashes .

