the cake is big and ugly it looks like a mess and smells funny but we do n't care , we love you anyway happy anniversary , mom and dad , hooray !

they pulled the curtain and smiled . their mom and dad looked surprised and happy . they clapped and cheered and hugged anna and ben . they said they were the best singers in the world and they loved their song . they cut the cake and ate it together . it tasted bad , but they did not mind . they were happy . lily was a baby who liked to whistle . she whistled when she was happy , when she was sad , when she was hungry , and when she was sleepy . she whistled so much that her mommy and daddy could not sleep at night . they tried to make her stop , but she did not listen .

one night , lily whistled so loud that she woke up her big brother , ben . ben was very angry . he went to lily 's crib and said , " lily , stop whistling ! you are making too much noise ! you are a bad baby ! "

lily felt hurt by ben 's words . she stopped whistling and started to cry . she cried so much that her mommy and daddy came to her crib and hugged her . they said , " lily , we love you . you are a good baby . but you have to whistle less at night . you have to let us and ben sleep . can you do that ? "

lily nodded and said , " yes , mommy . yes , daddy . i will whistle less at night . i am sorry , ben . i did not mean to make you angry . "

ben felt sorry too . he said , " i am sorry , lily . i was too bitter . you can whistle sometimes , but not too much . you are a good baby . and i love you . "

lily smiled and said , " i love you too , ben . " she gave him a kiss and a hug . then she whistled a little song , but very softly . she fell asleep in her crib , happy and peaceful .

the moral of the story is : whistling is fun , but you have to respect others and be quiet when they need to sleep . you also have to be kind and forgive when someone is bitter and says mean things . ben and lily were playing in the park with their dog spot . spot was a big dog with a long tail . he liked to run and chase balls and birds . ben and lily loved spot very much .

one day , they saw a big pond in the park . it had ducks and fish and frogs in it . ben and lily wanted to see them closer . they ran to the edge of the pond and looked at the water . spot followed them and wagged his tail .

" look , a duck ! " lily said , pointing at a white bird with a yellow beak . " it is so pretty ! "

" can we feed it ? " ben asked , holding a piece of bread .

" maybe . but be careful . do n't fall in the water . it is deep and cold , " lily said .

ben nodded and threw the bread to the duck . the duck quacked and ate the bread . spot barked and jumped . he wanted to play with the duck too . he ran to the water and tried to catch the duck . but he was too fast and slipped . he fell in the pond with a splash .

" spot ! " ben and lily shouted . they were scared . spot was in trouble . he could not swim well . he tried to paddle and reach the shore . but the water was too deep and he was too tired . he whined and cried .

" help ! help ! " ben and lily yelled . they did not know what to do . they could not swim either . they looked around and saw a man with a boat . he was fishing in the pond . he heard their cries and saw spot in the water .

" hey , kids , what 's wrong ? " the man asked .

" our dog ! our dog is in the water ! he ca n't swim ! please help him ! " ben and lily said .

the man saw spot and felt sorry for him . he quickly rowed his boat to spot and reached out his hand . he grabbed spot 's tail and pulled him up . he put him in the boat and wrapped him in a blanket . he rowed back to the shore and gave spot to ben and lily .

" here you go , kids . your dog is safe . he is just wet and tired . he needs some rest and some love , " the man said .

" thank you , thank you , thank you ! " ben and lily said . they hugged the man and hugged spot . they were so happy and relieved . spot licked their faces and wagged his tail . he was happy too .

the man smiled and waved goodbye . he went back to his boat and his fishing . ben and lily took spot home and gave him some food and water . they dried him and cuddled him . they told their mom and dad what happened . they were proud of their dog and grateful to the man . they learned a lesson . they would never let spot near the pond again . they would always watch him and keep him safe . they loved him very much . anna and ben are twins . they like to look at the stars at night . they have a big window in their room . they can see many stars from their window .

one night , anna and ben want to see a shooting star . a shooting star is a star that moves very fast and makes a wish . anna and ben have a wish . they want a new bike .

