anna sees the shooting star . it is bright and beautiful . it moves very fast . anna and ben close their eyes . they make a wish . they wish for a new bike .

they open their eyes . they smile at each other . they hug . they hope their wish will come true . they are happy . they love the stars . tom and lily are twins . they like to play in the bath . they have many toys in the water . they have a duck , a boat , a fish and a frog . they make the toys swim and splash .

one day , tom has a new idea . he wants to see what happens if he puts the toys in the drain . he thinks it will be fun . he takes the duck and pushes it into the hole . the duck is gone . he takes the boat and does the same . the boat is gone too .

lily sees what tom is doing . she is not happy . she likes the toys . she does not want them to go away . she decides to stop tom . she says , " no , tom , no ! do not put the toys in the drain . the drain is bad . it takes the toys away . we will not have them anymore . we will be sad . "

tom does not listen . he takes the fish and tries to put it in the drain . lily is quick . she grabs the fish and pulls it back . she says , " tom , stop ! listen to me . i am wise . i know what is good and what is bad . the drain is bad . the toys are good . we should keep the toys . we should play with them . we should have fun . "

