lily was amazed . she never knew there were so many planets in the sky . she hugged the furry cat and said , " thank you for teaching me about the planets . i love earth too ! " once upon a time , a little girl named lily wanted to go to the park . her mommy was busy , so she decided to take a taxi . she waited for a taxi to come , and finally , one came . she got in and told the driver where she wanted to go .

the taxi driver was very foolish . he drove too fast and did n't listen to lily when she told him to slow down . finally , they arrived at the park . lily paid the driver and got out of the taxi . she was happy to be at the park and play on the swings .

as she was playing , a little boy came up to her and asked if he could play too . lily said yes , and they had fun together . when it was time to go home , lily said goodbye to the little boy and walked to the taxi . she got in and told the driver where she lived . the driver drove slowly this time , and lily was happy . when they arrived , she paid the driver and said thank you . the driver smiled and said , " you 're welcome , little one . have a good day ! " once upon a time , there was a little girl who loved lollipops . one day , she saw a little boy crying because he lost his lollipop . the little girl felt sad for the little boy , so she decided to help him find his lollipop .

the little girl followed the little boy around the park until they found his lost lollipop . the little boy was happy again and thanked the little girl for helping him . the little girl felt happy too because she made a new friend and helped someone in need .

the moral of the story is that it 's always nice to help others , especially if they are feeling sad . once upon a time , there was a boy named timmy . he loved to play by the river with his toy boat . one day , he saw a big raft floating downstream . it was very old and not modern like his toy boat . timmy wanted to remove the raft from the river so it would n't get stuck on the rocks . he asked his dad for help and they used a long stick to move the raft to the shore . timmy was happy that he could help keep the river clean . once upon a time , there was a big , rich king who lived in a castle . he had a lot of toys , but his favorite was a shiny spear . one day , a little bird flew into the castle and got stuck in a room . the bird wanted to escape , but it could n't find a way out .

the king heard the bird chirping and went to investigate . he saw the bird and tried to catch it with his spear , but he could n't . the bird was too quick ! finally , the king opened a window and the bird flew away , happy to escape the castle .

from that day on , the king learned that even though he was rich and had many toys , sometimes the simplest things like opening a window can make someone happy . and he never used his spear to catch birds again ! once upon a time , there was a boy named timmy . he loved to play outside and ride his bicycle . one day , he saw a motorcycle parked on the street . it was very big and shiny . timmy thought it was charming .

he went to point at the motorcycle , but then he saw a man come out of a store . the man looked angry and started yelling at timmy . timmy did n't understand why the man was mad . the man told timmy that he thought he was trying to steal his motorcycle .

timmy was scared and did n't know what to do . he ran away as fast as he could . when he got home , he told his mom what happened . his mom called the police and they talked to the man . they found out that timmy was just pointing at the motorcycle because he thought it was cool .

in the end , the man apologized to timmy and they became friends . timmy learned that it 's important to be careful when pointing at things that do n't belong to you . once upon a time , there was a big , hairy bear named ben . he lived in a forest with his animal friends . one day , ben saw a ship in the river . he was curious and went to see it .

when he got there , he saw a little girl crying . " what 's wrong ? " ben asked . " i lost my mommy and daddy . they went on the ship and left me behind , " the girl said .

ben felt sorry for the girl and wanted to help her . " do n't worry , i 'll hug you and we 'll find your parents , " he said . so , ben hugged the girl and they went on an adventure to find the girl 's parents .

after a long journey , they finally found the ship . the girl 's parents were happy to see her and thanked ben for his help . " you 're a good friend , " the little girl said , hugging ben again . from that day on , ben and the little girl became best friends and went on many more adventures together . once upon a time , there was a happy frog named freddy . freddy lived in a big swamp with many other frogs . the swamp was deep and wet , but freddy enjoyed it very much .

every day , freddy would hop around the swamp and play with his frog friends . they would catch flies and swim in the muddy water . sometimes , they would even sing songs together .

one day , freddy 's friend timmy got stuck in the deep mud . freddy quickly hopped over to help him . he used his strong legs to pull timmy out of the mud . timmy was very grateful and thanked freddy for being such a good friend .

from that day on , freddy and timmy were even closer friends . they continued to enjoy playing in the swamp together and helping each other out whenever they needed it . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she was very restless and could n't sleep at night . her mommy and daddy tried to sing her lullabies and read her stories , but nothing seemed to work .

one day , lily 's friend timmy came to play . he suggested they go outside and play in the sunshine . lily loved that idea ! they played tag and jumped on the trampoline . after a while , they got tired and sat down to rest .

as they rested , timmy pulled out a little notebook and showed lily the notes he had written about their adventures . lily thought it was so cool and wanted to write her own notes too . they spent the rest of the day playing and writing notes in their notebooks . when it was time to go home , lily was so tired that she fell asleep right away . from then on , she slept much better at night knowing she had fun adventures to write about in her notebook . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to imagine things and play all day . one day , she went to the beach with her mom and found a shiny oyster . she picked it up and showed it to her mom .

her mom said , " be careful , lily . that oyster is sharp and can hurt you . "

lily imagined the oyster opening up and revealing a beautiful pearl inside . she wanted to keep it , but she did n't want to get hurt .

so , she decided to throw the oyster back into the ocean , where it could be safe and grow more pearls . her mom was proud of her for making the right choice and not getting hurt .

the moral of the story is that sometimes we have to let go of things we want to keep ourselves safe . once upon a time , there was a little bird . the bird had a special egg that she loved very much . she always kept the egg warm and safe in her nest . one day , the bird had to fly away to find some food . she told the egg to stay in the nest and be a good egg .

the little bird flew for a long time , but when she came back , she saw that her nest was gone ! she was very sad and worried about her loyal egg . but then , she saw that her egg was safe and sound in a new nest with some other birds . they were taking care of her egg just like she did .

the little bird was very happy and grateful to the other birds for being so loyal to her egg . from that day on , she knew that she could always trust her feathered friends to help her out when she needed it . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . lily liked to draw shapes . one day , she drew a triangle . she showed it to her mommy and said , " look mommy , i drew a triangle ! " her mommy smiled and said , " that 's very good , lily . you named the shape correctly . "

later that day , lily 's little brother , tommy , came into her room . he saw the triangle drawing and said , " that 's a foolish shape , lily . it does n't look like anything . " lily felt sad because she thought her drawing was good . but then she remembered what her mommy said about naming the shape correctly .

so lily told tommy , " it 's not foolish , tommy . it 's a triangle . that 's its name . " tommy looked at the drawing again and said , " oh , i see it now . it 's a triangle . good job , lily ! " and lily felt happy again knowing that she named the shape correctly . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she had a favorite doll that she loved to play with every day . one day , lily looked for her doll but she could n't find it anywhere . she looked under the bed , in the closet , and even in the toy box , but her doll was nowhere to be found .

lily started to wonder where her doll could be . she felt sad because she missed playing with it . suddenly , she remembered that she had left her doll outside in the garden . she ran outside and found her doll sitting on a bench . but when she picked it up , she noticed that it was empty . the doll 's dress was still there , but the stuffing inside was gone .

lily was sad that her doll was empty , but she decided to fill it up with new stuffing . she found some cotton balls and carefully put them inside the doll . now her doll was full and she could play with it again . lily was happy that she found her doll and that it was no longer empty . once upon a time , there was a little dog named max . max wanted to go outside and play with his ball . he ran to the door and barked , " let me go , let me go ! " his owner opened the door and max ran outside to play .

while max was playing , he heard a strange noise . he saw that his water bowl had a leak and the water was going everywhere . max was confused and did n't know what to do . he barked for his owner to come and help .

his owner came outside and saw the leak . she quickly got a new water bowl and filled it up for max . max was happy again and went back to playing with his ball . the end . once upon a time , there was a boy named timmy . timmy had a cozy blanket that kept him warm at night . one day , timmy 's mom said they needed to sell some things to make money . timmy did n't want to sell his blanket because it was his favorite thing . but his mom said they needed to .

timmy and his mom went to a big market where people sell things . they put the blanket on a table and waited for someone to buy it . a lady came by and saw the warm blanket . she liked it and bought it from timmy .

timmy was sad at first , but then he realized that selling the blanket helped his family . they were able to buy food and other things they needed . timmy learned that sometimes we have to let go of things we love to help others . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to wear her favorite pink dress every day . she would twirl around and around in it , feeling happy and free .

one day , lily 's mommy decided to teach her how to tie her own shoes . at first , lily felt frustrated and wanted to give up . but her mommy encouraged her to keep trying , and soon lily was able to do it all by herself ! she felt proud and independent .

from that day on , lily wore her pink dress and tied her own shoes all by herself . she felt like a big girl and knew she could do anything she set her mind to . once upon a time , there was a boy named timmy . timmy liked to build things with blocks . he built tall towers and small houses . one day , timmy decided to build a symbol out of his blocks . he did n't know what a symbol was , but his mommy told him it was a special thing that meant something important . timmy made a rare symbol , with lots of different colors . he was very proud of it and showed it to his mommy . she was so happy and told him he was a great builder . timmy felt very happy too . the end . once upon a time , there was a little pink fox that lived in the forest . she loved to play with her friends , but sometimes she would be mean to them . she would take their toys and not share her own .

one day , the little pink fox 's friends decided they did n't want to play with her anymore because she was n't nice . the little pink fox felt sad and alone . she realized that being mean was n't a good way to make friends .

from that day on , the little pink fox decided to be kind and share her toys with her friends . she learned that being nice was much better than being mean . and her friends were happy to play with her again . the little pink fox felt happy too , because she knew she was doing the right thing . anna and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they find a shiny thing on the ground . it is round and brown .

" what is this ? " anna asks .

ben knows . his dad told him . " it is copper . it is a kind of metal . you can make things with it . "

" wow , can you teach me how to make things with copper ? " anna says .

ben nods . he has a hammer and some nails in his backpack . he takes them out and shows anna how to bend and shape the copper . they make a ring , a bracelet , and a necklace .

they are very happy with their copper things . they put them on and show them to the other kids in the park .

" look at our copper things ! we made them ourselves ! " ben says .

the other kids are impressed . they want to learn how to make copper things too .

but one kid is not nice . he is big and mean . he wants to take the copper things from anna and ben .

" give me your copper things ! they are mine now ! " he says . he tries to grab them .

anna and ben are scared . but they are also brave . they do not want to lose their copper things . they worked hard to make them .

they say " no ! these are our copper things ! you can not have them ! "

they hold on to their copper things . they shout for help . they kick and bite the mean kid .

the mean kid is surprised . he did not expect anna and ben to fight back . he is hurt and angry . he runs away .

anna and ben are safe . they hug each other . they are proud of their copper things and their bravery .

they say " we are brave ! we are friends ! we are copper makers ! " sara likes to watch films with her dad . they sit on the sofa and eat popcorn . sara 's favorite film is about a princess and a dragon . she likes the princess because she is brave and kind . she likes the dragon because he is big and funny .

one day , sara 's dad has to work late . he tells sara he will be home soon and they can watch the film together . sara waits and waits , but her dad does not come . she feels sad and bored . she decides to watch the film by herself . she puts the disc in the player and presses play .

the film starts and sara smiles . she sees the princess and the dragon on the screen . she talks to them and sings along with the songs . she is having fun . but then , something bad happens . the film stops and the screen goes black . sara tries to press play again , but nothing happens . she looks at the player and sees a red light . she does not know what it means .

sara gets angry . she wants to watch the film . she thinks the player is broken . she stands up and kicks the player . she yells and cries . she does not hear the door open and her dad come in . he sees sara and the player and the disc . he understands what happened . he is not happy .

he picks up sara and hugs her . he tells her he is sorry he was late . he tells her he loves her . he tells her he will fix the player and the disc . he tells her they can watch the film tomorrow . sara calms down and says she is sorry too . she tells him she loves him . she tells him she wants to watch the film with him . he smiles and kisses her . he tells her they will watch the film together . he tells her it is a good film . he tells her it has a happy ending . ben and lily were friends who liked to play with blocks . they built houses , towers , bridges and cars with their blocks . one day , they decided to make a tunnel with their blocks . they put some blocks on the floor and some blocks on top to make a roof .

" look , we made a tunnel ! " ben said . " we can crawl inside and pretend we are in a cave . "

" that sounds fun ! " lily said . " can i go first ? "

" ok , you can go first . but be careful , do n't knock down the blocks . " ben said .

lily crawled inside the tunnel and smiled . she liked the tunnel . she felt cozy and safe . she did not want to come out .

" can i go now ? " ben asked . " i want to see the tunnel too . "

" no , you ca n't . this is my tunnel . i like it here . you can make your own tunnel . " lily said .

ben felt jealous . he wanted to share the tunnel with lily . he did not like that she was being selfish . he thought of a way to make her come out .

" i have an idea . why do n't we add more blocks to the tunnel ? we can make it longer and wider and more fun . " ben said .

" more blocks ? that sounds good . ok , let 's do that . " lily said . she crawled out of the tunnel and helped ben add more blocks .

they added more blocks until the tunnel was big enough for both of them . they crawled inside and laughed . they had fun in the tunnel . they learned to share and be kind .

the moral of the story is : sharing is caring . it is better to play with your friends than to be selfish . lila likes to spin . she spins in her dress , she spins with her toy , she spins on the grass . she feels happy when she spins . she likes to see the world go round and round .

one day , she finds a frame in the garage . it is big and round and shiny . she wonders what it is for . she asks her dad . he says it is a bike wheel . he says he will fix it for her someday .

lila has an idea . she takes the frame to the backyard . she puts it on the ground . she stands inside it . she holds it with her hands . she starts to spin . she spins faster and faster . she feels like she is flying .

she sees the sun and the sky and the trees and the flowers . they are all bright and beautiful . she hears the birds and the wind and the laughter . they are all sweet and cheerful . she spins and spins and spins .

she is so happy . she thinks this is the best game ever . she does not want to stop . she wants to spin forever . she does not see her dad coming . he smiles and watches her . he thinks she is very clever . he is proud of her . he waits for her to slow down . he wants to hug her and tell her he loves her . he wants to spin with her . tim and sam were friends who liked to play in the park . they had a big box of toys that they shared . one day , they found a sword in the box . it was shiny and long and had a star on the handle .

" wow , look at this sword ! " tim said . " it is so cool ! i want to be a knight and fight dragons ! "

" me too ! " sam said . " can i have a turn with the sword ? "

" no , it is mine ! " tim said . he held the sword tight and ran away .

sam was sad . he wanted to play with the sword too . he looked around and saw a stick on the ground . he picked it up and pretended it was a sword .

" hey , tim ! " sam called . " i have a sword too ! let 's play together ! "

tim turned around and saw sam with the stick . he laughed .

" that is not a sword ! " tim said . " that is a poor stick ! it is not shiny or long or has a star . you are not a knight , you are a frog ! "

tim hopped around and made frog noises . he tried to poke sam with the sword .

sam was angry . he did not like tim being mean . he swung his stick and hit tim 's sword . the sword flew out of tim 's hand and landed in a puddle .

" oh no ! " tim cried . " my sword ! it is wet and dirty ! "

sam felt sorry for tim . he did not want to make him cry . he gave him his stick .

" here , tim , " sam said . " you can have my sword . it is not poor , it is strong and brave . you are a good knight , and i am your friend . "

tim smiled . he took the stick and hugged sam .

" thank you , sam , " tim said . " you are a good friend . i am sorry i was mean . can we share the sword ? "

" yes , we can , " sam said . " and we can share the other sword too , when it is dry . "

they hopped to the puddle and picked up the sword . they cleaned it with a leaf and put it back in the box . then they played together , pretending to be knights and fighting dragons . they had fun and were happy . lily and ben were bored . they wanted to play , but it was raining outside . they looked around the house for something fun to do . they saw a big box of paints and brushes in the closet .

" let 's paint ! " lily said . " we can make pretty pictures on the wall . "

ben nodded . he liked to paint . he took a red paint and a big brush . lily took a blue paint and a small brush . they ran to the living room and started to paint on the white wall .

they painted flowers and stars and cars and cats . they mixed the colors and made new ones . they had a lot of fun . they did not hear mom coming home .

mom opened the door and gasped . she saw the wall covered with paint . she saw lily and ben holding the brushes . she saw the paint dripping on the floor .

" what did you do ? " mom asked . she was angry and sad .

lily and ben felt guilty . they knew they did something bad . they dropped the brushes and looked at mom . they did not know what to say .

" we 're sorry , mom , " lily said . " we wanted to paint . "

mom sighed . she was not happy , but she loved lily and ben . she knew they were young and curious .

" i know you wanted to paint , but you ca n't paint on the wall , " mom said . " that 's not how we take care of our home . you have to paint on paper or canvas . and you have to ask me before you use the paints . do you understand ? "

lily and ben nodded . they understood . they felt sorry for mom .

" can we help you clean the wall ? " ben asked .

mom smiled . she was glad they wanted to help .

" yes , you can help me clean the wall , " mom said . " but first , we have to untie the knot in your hair , lily . how did you get that ? "

lily touched her hair . she had a big knot in her hair from the paint . she did not know how to untie it .

" i do n't know , mom , " lily said . " can you help me ? "

mom nodded . she took lily to the bathroom and helped her untie the knot . she washed her hair and dried it . then she did the same for ben .

after that , they all went to the living room and cleaned the wall . it took a long time , but they did it together . mom taught them how to use the paints properly and gave them some paper and canvas . they painted some more pictures , but this time on the right things .

they hung their pictures on the wall . they looked nice . mom hugged lily and ben .

" i love you , lily and ben , " mom said . " but next time , please do n't paint on the wall . "

" we love you , mom , " lily and ben said . " and we wo n't paint on the wall again . "

they learned their lesson . they were happy . they painted . tom and lily were twins who liked to play outside . they had a big yard with a swing , a slide and a sandbox . they also had a dog named spot who liked to run and bark .

one day , their parent said , " i have to go to the store for a little while . you can play outside , but you have to remain in the yard . do you understand ? "

tom and lily nodded . they knew they had to listen to their parent . they said , " yes , we understand . can we have a yummy snack when you come back ? "

their parent smiled and said , " of course you can . i will be back soon . be good and have fun . " then their parent gave them a hug and a kiss and left .

tom and lily decided to play on the swing . they took turns pushing each other and seeing how high they could go . spot ran around them and barked happily . they had a lot of fun .

but then , they saw something shiny on the other side of the fence . it looked like a big ball of foil . they wondered what it was and how it got there . they wanted to see it closer .

" let 's go and get it , " tom said .

" but we have to remain in the yard , " lily said .

" it 's just over there . it wo n't take long . come on , " tom said .

he climbed over the fence and ran to the shiny thing . lily followed him . she did n't want to be left alone .

they reached the shiny thing and picked it up . it was a balloon that had popped . it had a string and a tag that said , " happy birthday ! "

" wow , look at this , " tom said .

" maybe it 's someone 's birthday today , " lily said .

they played with the balloon for a while . they threw it in the air and caught it . they pretended it was a spaceship or a hat . they forgot about their parent and their yard .

but then , they heard a loud honk . it was their parent 's car . they had come back from the store .

" oh no , we have to go back , " lily said .

they dropped the balloon and ran to the fence . they climbed over it and ran to their yard . they hoped their parent did n't see them .

but their parent did see them . their parent was angry and worried . their parent said , " where were you ? i told you to remain in the yard . you could have gotten lost or hurt . you did n't listen to me . you were very naughty . "

tom and lily felt sorry . they knew they had done something wrong . they said , " we 're sorry . we saw a shiny thing and we wanted to see it . we did n't mean to be naughty . "

their parent sighed and said , " i 'm glad you 're safe , but you have to follow the rules . they are for your own good . you have to stay in the yard when i 'm not here . do you understand ? "

tom and lily nodded . they said , " yes , we understand . we wo n't do it again . we love you . "

their parent hugged them and said , " i love you too . but you still have to go to your room for a time out . you have to think about what you did . "

tom and lily went to their room . they felt sad . they wished they had remained in the yard . they missed their snack . they missed their swing . they missed their dog . they learned their lesson . one day , a girl named lily saw a big pumpkin in the garden . she wanted to make a pie with it . she asked her mom if she could take it . her mom said yes , but she had to share it with her brother max .

lily was happy . she ran to the garden and picked up the pumpkin . it was heavy and round . she started to go back to the house . but on the way , she saw a rabbit . the rabbit was white and fluffy . it looked at lily with big eyes .

lily liked the rabbit . she wanted to play with it . she put the pumpkin down and ran after the rabbit . the rabbit ran away . lily chased it for a long time . she forgot about the pumpkin and the pie .

max saw the pumpkin in the garden . he wondered who left it there . he knew it was rare to find such a big pumpkin . he decided to take it and make a pie with it . he picked up the pumpkin and went to the house . he asked his mom if he could use it . his mom said yes , but he had to share it with lily .

max was happy . he cut the pumpkin and scooped out the seeds . he mixed the pumpkin with sugar and spice . he rolled out the dough and put the pumpkin on it . he made a nice pie and put it in the oven . he waited for it to bake .

lily came back to the garden . she was tired and hungry . she looked for the pumpkin . but she could not find it . she saw a hole where the pumpkin was . she was sad . she wondered what happened to the pumpkin . she went to the house and asked her mom .

her mom told her that max took the pumpkin and made a pie with it . she said that lily should have been more careful with the pumpkin . she said that pumpkins are rare and valuable . she said that lily should have shared it with max .

lily felt sorry . she realized that she was selfish and greedy . she wished she had not chased the rabbit . she wished she had made the pie with max . she went to max and said sorry . she asked him if he would share the pie with her .

max was surprised . he saw that lily was sincere and humble . he felt sorry for her . he remembered that she was his sister and he loved her . he said sorry too . he said that he would share the pie with her . he said that they should have worked together .

lily and max hugged each other . they thanked their mom for the pumpkin . they cut the pie and ate it . it was delicious and sweet . they learned a lesson . they learned that pumpkins are rare and precious . they learned that sharing is caring . they learned that love is more important than pie . jenny loved her pink sweater . it was soft and warm and had a big heart on the front . she wore it every day , even when it was hot outside . she did not want to take it off or wash it .

one day , her mom said , " jenny , your sweater is dirty and smelly . you need to replace it with a clean one . i have a new sweater for you . it is blue and has a star on the front . do you want to try it on ? "

jenny shook her head . she did not want a new sweater . she wanted her pink sweater . she said , " no , thank you , mom . i like my pink sweater . it is my favorite . i do not want a blue sweater . it is not my favorite . "

her mom sighed . she said , " jenny , i know you love your pink sweater , but it is not good for you to wear it all the time . it has holes and stains and it makes you itch . the blue sweater is new and nice and it will keep you cozy . please , give it a chance . you might like it . "

jenny looked at the blue sweater . it was not pink . it did not have a heart . it did not look like her sweater . but it did look soft and warm . and it had a star . jenny liked stars . she wondered how it would feel to wear it . she said , " okay , mom . i will try the blue sweater . but only for a little while . then i want my pink sweater back . "

her mom smiled . she said , " thank you , jenny . you are a good girl . let me help you put on the blue sweater . there you go . how do you feel ? "

jenny felt the blue sweater on her skin . it was not itchy . it was snug and comfy . she looked at the star on her chest . it was shiny and pretty . she felt a warm feeling in her heart . she said , " mom , i like the blue sweater . it is nice . can i keep it ? "

her mom hugged her . she said , " of course , you can keep it , jenny . i am glad you like it . you can still have your pink sweater , too . but you can only wear it sometimes , okay ? and you have to wash it often . deal ? "

jenny nodded . she said , " deal , mom . thank you for the blue sweater . it is my new favorite . but i still love my pink sweater , too . it is my old favorite . can i have both ? "

her mom laughed . she said , " yes , you can have both , jenny . you are a lucky girl . you have two sweaters that make you happy . and you know what ? i have a surprise for you . come with me . i want to show you something . "

jenny followed her mom to her room . there , on her bed , was a mysterious box . it was big and wrapped in colorful paper . it had a bow on top . jenny gasped . she said , " what is that , mom ? is it for me ? "

her mom said , " yes , it is for you , jenny . it is a special gift . do you want to open it ? "

jenny nodded . she said , " yes , please , mom . i want to open it . what is inside ? "

her mom said , " you have to find out for yourself . go ahead . open it . "

jenny tore the paper and opened the box . inside , she saw something that made her eyes sparkle . it was a purple sweater . it was fluffy and warm and had a rainbow on the front . jenny squealed . she said , " wow , mom . it is a purple sweater . it is beautiful . it has a rainbow . i love rainbows . can i wear it ? "

her mom said , " yes , you can wear it , jenny . it is your third sweater . it is a special sweater . it is a magic sweater . do you know why ? "

jenny shook her head . she said , " no , mom . why is it a magic sweater ? "

her mom said , " because it can change colors . watch this . " she pressed a button on the sweater . the purple turned into green . she pressed another button . the green turned into yellow . she pressed another button . the yellow turned into red . she pressed another button . the red turned into pink . she pressed another button . the pink turned into blue . she pressed another button . the blue turned into purple again .

