in the end , lily had to throw away her dough and she was left feeling sad and uncomfortable . she learned that sometimes it 's hard to listen to your parents , but it 's important to do so . she also learned that accidents can happen and it 's okay to make mistakes , but it 's important to try to fix them . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to wear fancy dresses and play with her dolls . one day , her mommy took her to a museum to learn about history . lily saw many old things like paintings and statues . she did n't understand why they were important but her mommy explained that they were from a long time ago and they help us remember what happened before .

at the museum , lily also learned about accepting others who are different from us . she saw a picture of people from different countries holding hands and smiling . her mommy told her that we should be kind to everyone no matter how they look or where they come from . lily thought that was a good idea and promised to always be nice to others .

when they left the museum , lily was excited to tell her daddy all about what she learned . she was proud of herself for understanding new things and accepting others . from that day on , she always wore her fanciest dress to the museum because she knew it was a special place where she could learn about history and how to be a good person . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . one evening , lily was feeling very sad because it was raining outside and she could n't go play . she was sitting on her bed feeling miserable when her mom came in to check on her .

her mom observed that lily was feeling sad and asked her what was wrong . lily told her mom that she wanted to play outside but could n't because of the rain . her mom then told her that sometimes things do n't go the way we want them to , but it 's important to find joy in other things .

lily thought about what her mom said and decided to play a game with her mom instead . they had so much fun playing together that lily forgot all about being sad . from that day on , lily learned that even when things do n't go as planned , there 's always something to be happy about . once upon a time , there was a big yard with lots of trees and flowers . one day , a big storm came and knocked down all the trees . the yard looked very messy and sad . but then , a kind man came and helped restore the yard . he planted new trees and fixed everything that was broken .

the man worked very hard and made the yard look beautiful again . the flowers were colorful and the trees were tall . the man made sure everything was tight and in its place . the animals came back to play in the yard and the children came to have fun too . everyone was happy because the yard was restored . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside and pick flowers . one day , she found a big box on her doorstep . she was so excited to see what was inside ! she opened it up and received a beautiful dress . it was her favorite color , pink !

