at the party , lily 's friend gave her a sweet piece of candy . it was so yummy ! lily said thank you and gave her friend a big hug . she felt so happy and grateful for her new dress and her sweet friend . once upon a time , there was a big , brown dog named max . max had a long tail and four paws . he loved to run and play in the park with his friends . one day , max saw a little girl walking by with an ice cream cone .

