max learned his lesson and promised to be more careful next time . he wagged his long tail and licked the little girl 's hand to say he was sorry . from that day on , max always made sure to keep his paws on the ground when he saw someone with an ice cream cone . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play in the forest behind her house . one day , she went on a walk in the forest with her mom . they saw many trees and animals like birds and squirrels . but then lily saw a butterfly and started chasing it . she ran so fast that she forgot where she was and got lost .

