finally , lily 's mom heard her calling for help and found her near the big tree . they hugged each other and went back home . from that day on , lily never forgot to stay close to a big tree when she went into the forest . once upon a time , there was a little birdie . the birdie was very hungry and wanted to eat some yummy worms . but there were no worms around . the birdie looked up and saw a big tv in the sky . the tv had a picture of a yummy worm on it . the birdie wanted to eat the worm so much that it decided to soar up to the tv . the birdie flapped its wings and flew up , up , up . finally , it reached the tv and pecked at the picture of the worm . but the picture did n't taste like a real worm ! the birdie was still very hungry . once upon a time , there was a big bear who loved to wear a hat . he had a red hat that he wore everywhere he went . one day , he met a little rabbit who did n't have a hat .

