the bear thought for a moment and said , " i have an idea ! i have a big hat that i do n't wear anymore . you can have it ! " the rabbit was so happy and thanked the bear for his kindness .

from that day on , the rabbit wore the big red hat everywhere he went . he felt warm and happy , and he always remembered the kind bear who gave him the hat . once upon a time , there was a little bunny named benny . benny loved to play in the grass all day long . one day , benny saw his friend , a little squirrel named sammy , packing his bags . benny asked sammy where he was going , but sammy did n't answer . benny felt sad and confused .

the next day , benny saw sammy leaving with his bags . benny felt envious and wished he could go on an adventure too . later that day , benny found a map in the grass . the map showed a treasure hidden in a nearby cave . benny knew he had to find the treasure and go on his own adventure .

