they continue to sail on the trail . they are happy . they have a new friend . sara and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys and books . but today , they have to go to the store with mom . mom says they need new pants . sara and ben do not like the store . it is big and loud and boring .

they get in the car and drive to the store . mom parks the car and takes their hands . they walk to the door . sara sees a big sign . it says " sale " . she does not know what it means . she asks mom .

" mom , what is sale ? " she says .

" sale means some things are cheaper . you can save money , " mom says .

" oh , " sara says . she does not care about money . she just wants to go home .

they go inside the store . mom takes them to the pants section . she picks some pants for sara and ben . she tells them to try them on . sara and ben do not want to try them on . they want to play .

" mom , can we play ? " ben says .

" not now , ben . you have to try these pants on . they might be too big or too small , " mom says .

