sara and ben are worried . they do not want to wear these pants . they want to wear their old pants . they want to tell mom . but they do not want to make mom sad . they do not know what to do . they look at each other . they have an idea .

they take off the new pants and put on their old ones . they hide the new pants under a pile of clothes . they run out of the fitting room . they find mom . they hug her .

