mom is surprised . she looks at sara and ben . she sees their old pants . she does not see the new ones . she wonders where they are . she is confused . but she sees sara and ben 's faces . they are smiling and hopeful . she loves them . she decides to let them keep their old pants .

" okay , sara and ben . you can keep your old pants . but you have to promise me something , " mom says .

