mom smiles . she is happy too . she loves sara and ben . she takes their hands . they walk to the car . they leave the store . they do not look back . they do not see the new pants . they are still hidden under the pile of clothes . they do not care . they have their old pants . they are happy . lily and ben are playing with their toys in the living room . lily has a big box of crayons and ben has a small pencil . they are drawing pictures on some paper .

