" look , lily , now i have the best of both . i can make fine lines and colors with my pencil - crayon , " ben says , smiling .

lily is surprised and impressed . she thinks ben is very clever . she wants to make a pencil - crayon too . she asks ben for some tape and a crayon . soon they both have pencil - crayons and they draw more pictures together . they are happy and proud of their creations . lily loved to play in the rain . she put on her yellow boots and her red coat with a zip . she was very enthusiastic . she ran outside and jumped in the puddles . she felt the water splash on her face and legs . she laughed and sang .

she saw a big puddle near the tree . she ran towards it and jumped as high as she could . she landed in the puddle with a big splash . she felt the water soak her coat and boots . she was wet and cold , but she did not mind . she thought it was fun .

she heard her mom call her name . she looked up and saw her mom at the door . her mom had a towel and a smile . she waved at lily and said , " come on , lily , it 's time to go inside and get dry . you can have some hot chocolate and cookies . "

lily ran to her mom and gave her a hug . she felt the towel wrap around her . she felt warm and cozy . she thanked her mom and said , " i love playing in the rain , mom . it 's so much fun . "

her mom smiled and said , " i 'm glad you had fun , lily . but next time , do n't soak your coat and boots so much . they will take a long time to dry . "

