her mom kissed her and said , " i know , lily . you are very enthusiastic . now let 's go inside and have some hot chocolate and cookies . they will make you feel even better . "

lily smiled and said , " yes , mom . i love hot chocolate and cookies . they are my favorite . "

they went inside and enjoyed their treat . lily felt happy and loved . she thought playing in the rain was the best thing ever . lily and max were twins who liked to help their mom with grocery . they had a big list of things to buy , like milk , eggs , bread , and apples . mom gave them each a basket and told them to be careful and stay close .

lily and max were excited to see all the different things in the grocery store . they saw cheese , cookies , juice , and bananas . they wanted to put everything in their baskets , but mom said no . they had to follow the list .

lily and max were not happy . they thought mom was ignorant . she did not know how good cheese and cookies and juice and bananas were . they decided to sneak some things in their baskets when mom was not looking .

but mom was not ignorant . she saw what lily and max were doing . she was angry and sad . she told them to put back the things they did not need . she said they were wasting money and being dishonest .

lily and max felt ashamed . they realized they were wrong . they said sorry to mom and put back the things they did not need . they learned to be more careful and honest with grocery . they hugged mom and said they loved her . mom smiled and said she loved them too . they finished the list and went home . sara and tom are friends . they like to play with toys and share gum . one day , sara has a big gum . she wants to make a big bubble . she puts the gum in her mouth and blows hard .

" look , tom , look at my big bubble ! " sara says .

tom looks at sara 's bubble . he thinks it is very big and pretty . he wants to touch it . he reaches out his hand and pokes the bubble .

pop ! the bubble bursts . the gum sticks to tom 's hand . it is very sticky and icky . tom tries to pull it off , but it does not come off . he tries to rub it on his shirt , but it makes a mess . he tries to wash it with water , but it does not help .

" tom , what did you do ? " sara says . she is angry and sad . she liked her big gum . now it is gone . and tom 's hand is dirty .

" i 'm sorry , sara , i just wanted to see your bubble . i did not mean to attach the gum to my hand . " tom says . he is sorry and scared . he does not like the gum on his hand . and sara is mad at him .

sara does not listen to tom . she is too upset . she takes her toys and goes away . she does not want to play with tom anymore . she does not want to share gum with him anymore .

tom is alone . he still has the gum on his hand . he does not know how to get rid of it . he does not have any friends . he does not have any fun . he is very sad .

the end . lily and tom were playing with their toys on wednesday . they liked to pretend they were in a castle with a king and a queen . lily had a crown and a dress . tom had a sword and a shield . they had fun making up stories and acting them out .

but then tom saw something shiny in the corner . he went to look at it . it was a necklace with a big red stone . he picked it up and put it around his neck . he felt very proud and said , " look , lily , i found a treasure ! i am the king of the castle now ! "

lily looked at the necklace and frowned . she knew it was not a real treasure . it was a fake necklace that her mom had given her for her birthday . she had put it in the corner because she did not like it very much . she said , " that is not a treasure , tom . that is my necklace . it is fake . it does not shine like a real jewel . give it back to me ! "

tom did not want to give it back . he liked the necklace . he thought it shined like a real jewel . he said , " no , lily , it is mine . i found it . it is a treasure . it shines very bright . you are just jealous . you can have your crown and your dress . i have the necklace . "

lily and tom started to argue . they raised their voices and pulled the necklace . they did not play nicely anymore . they did not have fun anymore . they were very angry and sad .

their mom heard them and came to see what was wrong . she saw them fighting over the necklace . she said , " stop , lily and tom . what are you doing ? why are you fighting over a fake necklace ? it is not worth it . you are hurting each other and your toys . you should share and be kind . you should play together and have fun . you should be happy and not angry . can you do that ? "

lily and tom looked at their mom and felt sorry . they knew she was right . they said , " yes , mom , we can do that . we are sorry . we will not fight anymore . we will share and be kind . we will play together and have fun . we will be happy and not angry . "

they hugged their mom and each other . they put the necklace back in the corner . they picked up their toys and went back to their castle . they smiled and laughed . they made up new stories and acted them out . they had fun again . they shined like real jewels . sara and ben are friends . they like to play outside . but today , it is raining . sara and ben are sad . they can not go to the park or ride their bikes .

" let 's play inside , " sara says . " we can draw or read or play with toys . "

" no , i do n't want to play inside , " ben says . " i want to play outside . it is boring inside . "

sara tries to make ben happy . she shows him her new crayons and her favorite book . she tells him a funny joke . but ben is still sad . he does not smile or laugh .

" why are you so sad , ben ? " sara asks . " rain is not bad . rain makes the flowers grow and the birds sing . rain is fun . we can splash in the puddles or make a boat with paper . "

ben looks at sara . he thinks for a moment . he sees that sara is happy . she is not sad about the rain . she is happy to play with him .

" maybe you are right , sara , " ben says . " maybe rain is not so bad . maybe we can have fun inside and outside . thank you for telling me that , sara . you are a good friend . "

sara and ben hug . they are happy . they decide to play inside until the rain stops . then they go outside and splash in the puddles and make a boat with paper . they have fun in the rain .

the moral of the story is : rain is not a reason to be sad . we can find joy in any situation . we can also help our friends to be happy by telling them positive things . ben and lily were twins who liked to play together . one day , they decided to play hide and seek in the house . ben counted to ten and then looked for lily . he checked the living room , the kitchen , and the bathroom , but he could not find her .

he heard a giggle from the closet . he opened the door and saw lily hiding behind a pile of laundry . she smiled and said , " you found me ! "

ben was happy , but he also felt a little angry . he wanted to hide in the closet too , but lily got there first . he said , " that 's not fair ! you took my spot ! "

lily said , " no , i did n't ! i got here first . you can hide somewhere else . "

ben said , " no , i want to hide here . move over ! "

lily said , " no , you move ! "

they started to push and pull each other . the laundry fell on them and made them sneeze . they also tasted some soap and dirt . they spit and said , " yuck ! "

mom heard the noise and came to the closet . she saw ben and lily covered in laundry and looking unhappy . she said , " what are you doing ? this is not how you play hide and seek . this is how you make a mess . "

ben and lily felt sorry . they said , " we 're sorry , mom . we were fighting over the closet . "

mom said , " you do n't have to fight . there are many places to hide in the house . you can take turns or share . fighting is not fun . playing is fun . "

ben and lily nodded . they said , " you 're right , mom . fighting is not fun . playing is fun . can we play again ? "

mom said , " yes , you can play again . but first , you have to help me with the laundry . and then , you have to brush your teeth . you do n't want to have soap and dirt in your mouth . "

ben and lily agreed . they helped mom with the laundry and brushed their teeth . then , they played hide and seek again . this time , they did not fight . they took turns and shared . they had fun and laughed . the house was peaceful . anna and ben are friends . they like to play outside in winter . they make snowmen and snowballs and snow forts . they have fun .

one day , they see a new girl in the park . she has long hair and a red coat . she looks attractive . she is alone . she does not play with anyone .

