anna and ben smile . they say they are friends . they ask lily if she wants to play with them . they say they have a big snow fort . they say they can include her .

lily smiles too . she says yes . she wants to play with them . she says she is new in town . she says she has no friends .

anna and ben say they can be her friends . they take her hand and lead her to their snow fort . they share their snowballs and snowmen . they have fun .

lily is happy . she thanks anna and ben . she says they are nice . she says they are attractive . they are her friends . lily and ben were playing in the kitchen . they liked to pretend they were chefs and make yummy food . they used pots and pans and spoons and bowls . but they had to be careful not to make a mess or break anything .

one day , they found a big pan in the cupboard . it was shiny and round and had a long handle . lily wanted to use it to make a cake . ben wanted to use it to make soup . they both grabbed the pan and pulled hard .

" let go , lily ! it 's my pan ! " ben shouted .

" no , ben ! it 's my pan ! " lily shouted back .

they pulled and pulled and pulled . but the pan was not strong enough . it snapped in the middle and broke into two pieces . lily and ben were shocked and sad . they dropped the broken pan and looked at each other .

" oh no , what have we done ? " lily said .

" we broke the pan ! mommy will be mad ! " ben said .

they heard mommy coming down the stairs . they knew they were in trouble . they decided to surrender and tell the truth .

" mommy , we 're sorry ! " they said together . " we broke the pan ! we were playing and we pulled too hard ! "

mommy saw the broken pan and the sad faces of lily and ben . she was not happy , but she was not too angry either . she knew they were just kids and they made a mistake .

she hugged them and said , " i 'm glad you told me the truth . but you have to be more careful with the kitchen things . they are not toys . they can hurt you or break . next time , you have to ask me before you use them . and you have to share and take turns . ok ? "

lily and ben nodded and said , " ok , mommy . we 're sorry . we love you . "

mommy smiled and said , " i love you too . now , let 's clean up this mess and make some real cake together . how does that sound ? "

lily and ben cheered and said , " yay ! cake ! "

they helped mommy pick up the broken pan and put it in the trash . then they washed their hands and followed mommy to the oven . they learned their lesson and had fun baking a cake . they also learned a new word : surrender . it meant to stop fighting and say sorry . sara and ben are twins . they like to play in the park with their mom . one day , they see a big purple fruit on a tree . they want to try it .

