she picks two plums from the tree and gives them to sara and ben . they wash them with water and take a bite . they smile . the plums are sweet and juicy .

" mmm , this is good . thank you , mom , " sara says .

" i like it too . it is purple and tasty , " ben says .

mom smiles too . she is happy that sara and ben like the plums . she remembers how much she loved them when she was a little girl . she thinks that plums are a good fruit . lily and ben are friends . they like to play together . today is lily 's birthday . she has a party at her house . she invites ben and other friends .

