but when they go outside , it is dark . they can not see very well . they are scared . they want to go back inside . but then they have an idea . they find some flashlights and tape them to their costumes . anna tapes one to her wand and one to her wings . ben tapes one to his box and one to his wires .

now their costumes are light . they can see and be seen . they are not scared anymore . they go to their friends and show them their costumes . their friends think they are cool and clever . they all play dress up together . anna and ben are happy . they had a good plan . sara and ben are best friends . they like to play in the park and share their toys . one day , they find a big box under a tree . they open the box and see many shiny things inside . they see rings , necklaces , bracelets and crowns .

