sara and ben kiss each other on the cheek . they cut the flower and share it as a cake . they are very happy and full of wonder . they do n't care that their clothes are dirty and their hair is messy . they only care that they have each other and their shiny things .

the end . lila loved to sing . she sang every day , in the morning , at noon , and at night . she sang to her dolls , her books , and her furry cat . she sang happy songs , sad songs , and silly songs . she sang so loud that everyone could hear her .

one day , a big storm came . the sky was dark and the wind was strong . lila heard a loud noise outside . she looked out the window and saw a big , scary tornado . it was spinning and roaring and tearing things apart . lila was very afraid . she ran to her mom and dad and hugged them .

" mom , dad , what is that ? " she asked .

" that is a tornado , lila . it is a very dangerous thing . we have to go to the basement and stay safe , " her mom said .

" will it go away ? " lila asked .

" yes , it will go away soon . but we have to be quiet and calm until then , " her dad said .

they went to the basement and waited . lila was still scared . she wanted to cry . she saw her cat hiding under a table . she crawled to her and petted her .

" it 's okay , kitty . i 'm here with you . do n't be scared , " she whispered .

then she had an idea . she remembered how singing made her feel better . she decided to sing a song to her cat and her parents . she sang a soft and sweet song , about the sun , the moon , and the stars . she sang with her heart and her voice .

her cat purred and cuddled with her . her parents smiled and hugged her . they felt less afraid and more hopeful . they listened to her song and joined her .

soon , the storm was over . the tornado was gone . the sky was clear and bright . they went outside and saw that their house was still standing . they were very lucky and grateful .

lila learned that singing can help her and others in hard times . she learned that she had a gift and a power . she learned that she was brave and strong . she sang a song of joy and thanked the sky . lila and sam were playing in the park . they saw a big slide that was smooth and shiny . they wanted to try it .

" let 's go , lila ! " sam said . " it looks fun ! "

" ok , sam ! " lila said . " but i 'm a little scared . it 's so high ! "

they held hands and walked to the slide . they had to step on many stairs to reach the top . they looked down and saw the grass and the flowers .

" wow ! " lila said . " it 's so pretty ! "

" it 's a wonder ! " sam said . " but do n't look too long . we have to slide ! "

they sat on the slide and pushed themselves . they felt the wind in their hair and the sun on their faces . they laughed and screamed as they slid down .

they reached the bottom and jumped off . they hugged each other and smiled .

" that was awesome ! " sam said .

" that was amazing ! " lila said .

they ran back to the stairs and climbed up again . they wanted to slide more and more . they had a lot of fun . sara and ben are twins . they like to play in their room . they have many toys and books . but they do not like to clean up . their room is very messy . there are clothes , papers , and crumbs everywhere .

one night , sara and ben hear a noise under their bed . they are scared . they turn on the light and look . they see a big , hairy monster . the monster has sharp teeth and claws . it is very disgusting .

