" no , you ca n't ! those are ours ! we like them ! " sara and ben say .

" too bad . i will eat them anyway . and then i will eat you ! " the monster says .

sara and ben scream . they run to the door . but the door is locked . the monster laughs . it crawls out of the bed . it moves towards them .

sara and ben are very afraid . they hug each other . they close their eyes . they wish the monster would go away .

suddenly , they hear another noise . it is their mom . she hears their scream . she comes to their room . she opens the door . she sees the monster .

