she picks up the puppet . she shows it to them . it is not a real monster . it is made of fur and cardboard . it has buttons for eyes and a zipper for a mouth .

sara and ben look at the puppet . they feel silly . they laugh .

" it is not a monster . it is a puppet . we made it for halloween . we forgot , " they say .

mom smiles . she hugs them .

" it is okay . you were just dreaming . but you know what ? your room is really disgusting . you need to clean up . or else muck might come back , " she says .

sara and ben nod . they agree . they do not want muck to come back . they say sorry to mom . they promise to clean up . they turn off the light . they go to sleep . they have sweet dreams . anna and ben are playing with their toys in the living room . they have a tea set , a teddy bear , a doll and some blocks . they pretend that they are having a tea party with their toys . they pour some water into the cups and say " cheers " to each other .

