anna and ben are happy . they are having fun with their toys and with each other . they are successful at playing and sharing . they love their tea party . they love their toys . they love each other . ben and lily were twins who loved to play outside . they liked to run , jump , and explore nature . they saw many things , like birds , flowers , and bugs .

one day , they found a big hill with a hole in it . they wondered what was inside . ben said , " let 's go and see ! " lily said , " ok , but be careful . "

they crawled into the hole and saw a dark tunnel . they heard a strange noise . it sounded like a growl . ben and lily became nervous . they did not know what it was . they wanted to go back .

but before they could turn around , they saw two bright eyes staring at them . it was a fox ! the fox was not happy to see them . it bared its teeth and snarled .

ben and lily screamed and ran out of the hole . they did not stop until they reached their home . they hugged their mom and told her what happened . she said , " you are very brave , but you should not go into holes . they are not safe . you might meet a fox or a snake or a spider . next time , stay away from holes and enjoy nature from a distance . "

ben and lily nodded and said , " yes , mom . " they learned their lesson . they still loved nature , but they did not go into holes anymore . they played in the garden and the park instead . they had fun and stayed safe . ben likes to print pictures with his crayons . he prints cars , animals , and stars . he prints many pictures and puts them on his wall . he is proud of his pictures .

