ben picks his favorite pictures and puts them in a folder . he goes with his mom to the meeting . the meeting is in a big room with many chairs and tables . there are many grown - ups who talk and write and look at books . ben feels shy and bored .

he sees a table with some paper and crayons . he asks his mom if he can print some more pictures . his mom says yes , but he has to be quiet and not make a mess . ben goes to the table and starts to print . he prints a big rainbow , a happy sun , and a funny clown .

some of the grown - ups see ben 's pictures and smile . they come to the table and talk to ben . they say that his pictures are very nice and colorful . they ask him his name and what he likes to print . ben feels happy and tells them . they say that he is very talented and creative . they ask him if they can have some of his pictures . ben says yes and gives them some of his pictures . they thank him and say that they will put them on their walls or desks .

ben 's mom sees that ben is having fun and making friends . she is proud of him . she tells him that he is very popular at the meeting . ben smiles and prints some more pictures . he likes the meeting . he likes to print . ben and lily were playing in the garden . they saw a big fly with black and yellow stripes . it was buzzing near a flower .

