" next time , listen to lily , " mom said . " she is a good sister . and leave the bees and the candles alone . they are not for playing . "

ben nodded . he said sorry to mom and lily . he learned his lesson . he did not chase the bees or the candles anymore . he played with other things in the garden . he and lily had fun . they were happy . lila liked to whistle . she learned how to whistle from her dad , who whistled all the time . he said whistling made him happy and calm . lila wanted to be happy and calm too , so she practiced whistling every day .

one day , lila went to the park with her mom . she wore her favorite coat , the one with the colorful buttons and the fluffy hood . she thought her coat was unique , because no one else had one like it . she was proud of her coat and her whistling .

at the park , she saw a boy playing with a ball . he had a blue coat and a red hat . he looked nice , so lila decided to say hello . she walked up to him and whistled a tune . the boy looked at her and smiled .

" hi , i 'm lila . i like your hat . can i play with you ? " she asked .

