they smiled at each other and whistled together . they had fun . they played ball . they became friends . they were happy and calm . and they had unique coats . anna likes to play with her toys in the bathtub . she has a duck , a frog , a boat and a ball . she makes them swim and splash in the water . she pretends the duck and the frog are friends and the boat is their home .

