anna and her mom go to her room and read a story . anna feels happy and sleepy . she snuggles with the duck and falls asleep . the duck is happy too . he dreams of the bathtub and the frog . tim and mia like to play with blocks . they build houses , cars , and towers with the blocks . they pretend to be mechanics and fix the things they build .

