she ran to her room and opened the drawer where she kept her toys . but she could not find the doll . she looked in other drawers , under the bed , in the closet . she could not find it anywhere . she felt sad and angry .

she went to the living room and saw her brother jake . he was holding her doll and laughing . he had taken it from her drawer when she was not looking . he liked to tease her and make her cry .

