tom tries to find something to do . he looks at the books on the shelf . they have too many words . he looks at the toys in the box . they are too babyish . he looks at the clock on the wall . it is too slow . he looks at the window . it is too rainy .

tom sighs . he wishes work was fun again . he wishes his dad was done with the papers . he wishes it was time for dinner . he likes dinner . he likes to eat and talk and laugh with his dad . he hopes dinner will be soon . he hopes dinner will be fun . he hopes work will be fun tomorrow . lily and tom like to play at the shore . they find shells and rocks and sand . they make a big castle with a moat and a flag . they are happy .

but then a big wave comes . it is very fast and loud . it knocks down their castle and takes their flag . lily and tom are sad . they cry .

they look for a place to seat . they see a big log near the water . they run to the log and seat on it . they hug each other and hope the wave will go away .

but the log is not a log . it is a crocodile . it has big teeth and a long tail . it is hungry and angry . it opens its mouth and snaps at lily and tom . they scream .

the crocodile eats them . they are gone . the shore is quiet and cool . the wave comes again and washes away the shells and rocks and sand . the end . sam and ben are brothers . they like to play with cars and trucks . one day , sam finds a big red truck in the garage . he wants to play with it , but it is broken . the wheels are loose and the door is missing .

" look , ben , i found a truck ! " sam says . " but it is poor . it needs to improve . "

ben comes to see the truck . he has an idea . he runs to the kitchen and gets some tape . he comes back and says , " i can help you , sam . we can use tape to fix the truck . "

sam is happy . he gives ben the truck . ben tapes the wheels and the door . he makes the truck look better . he gives it back to sam .

" wow , ben , you are good ! " sam says . " you improved the truck . now we can play with it . "

they take the truck outside and have fun . they make truck noises and pretend to drive . they are happy brothers . jen and ben were twins who liked to play outside . but today , it was raining hard and they had to stay inside . they were bored and sad .

" mom , can we go out ? " jen asked .

" no , sweetie , it 's too wet and cold . you might get sick , " mom said . " why do n't you play with your toys or read a book ? "

jen and ben sighed . they did not want to play with their toys or read a book . they wanted to run and jump and splash in the puddles .

they looked out the window and saw a big gray cloud . it looked angry and mean . they wondered if it would ever stop raining .

then , they saw something bright and colorful in the sky . it was a rainbow ! it had many colors : red , orange , yellow , green , blue , and purple . it looked happy and friendly .

" wow , look at that ! " ben said . " it 's a rainbow ! "

" let 's go see it ! " jen said . " maybe we can find a pot of gold ! "

they ran to the door and put on their boots and coats . they grabbed a blanket from the couch . they wanted to use it as a cape or a tent .

" wait , where are you going ? " mom asked .

" we 're going to see the rainbow ! " jen and ben said .

mom smiled . she knew they were curious and adventurous . she also knew the rain had stopped and the sun was shining .

" ok , but be careful and do n't go too far , " she said . " and take this with you . " she handed them a cute umbrella with stars and moons on it .

" thanks , mom ! " jen and ben said . they opened the umbrella and ran outside .

they saw the rainbow up close . it was even more beautiful than before . they felt happy and excited .

they spread the blanket on the grass and sat under the umbrella . they pretended they were in a magic land . they made up stories and songs and jokes . they laughed and hugged and had fun .

they did not notice the big gray cloud coming back . it was angry and mean . it wanted to ruin their fun . it started to rain again .

but jen and ben did not care . they had their blanket and their umbrella and their rainbow . they had each other . they were happy and safe . tom and sam love to play with their toy cars . they have many cars of different colors and sizes . they like to make noises and pretend they are racing .

one day , they find a big box in the garage . the box has a picture of a stadium on it . a stadium is a place where many people watch cars go fast . tom and sam are very excited . they open the box and see many pieces of plastic and cardboard . they are parts of the stadium .

" let 's build the stadium ! " tom says .

" yes , let 's ! " sam agrees .

they start to put the pieces together . they follow the instructions on the box . they use glue and tape to make the stadium strong . they work hard and have fun . after a while , they finish the stadium . it looks amazing . it has seats , ramps , flags , and signs .

" wow , this is awesome ! " tom says .

" now we can race our cars in the stadium ! " sam says .

they take their toy cars and put them on the ramps . they make noises and pretend they are racing . they cheer and clap for their cars . they have a blast .

but then , something bad happens . tom 's car goes too fast and hits the wall of the stadium . the wall breaks and falls down . the car flies out of the stadium and lands on the floor .

" oh no ! " tom cries .

" look what you did ! " sam yells .

" you broke the stadium ! "

tom feels sad and sorry . he did not mean to break the stadium . he just wanted to play .

" i 'm sorry , sam . i did n't mean to break the stadium . it was an accident . " tom says .

sam is angry and upset . he worked hard to build the stadium . he just wanted to play .

" it 's not fair ! you are crazy ! you ruined our game ! " sam says .

he picks up his car and throws it at tom . tom dodges and the car hits the box . the box breaks and falls down . the pieces of the stadium scatter on the floor .

" stop it ! " tom shouts .

" you stop it ! " sam shouts back .

they start to fight and argue . they push and pull and kick and hit . they make a big mess .

mom hears the noise and comes to the garage . she sees the broken stadium , the broken box , and the fighting boys . she is shocked and angry .

" what is going on here ? " mom asks .

" tom broke the stadium ! " sam says .

" sam threw his car at me ! " tom says .

mom shakes her head and sighs . she is disappointed and tired .

" boys , boys , boys . you are both wrong . you are both crazy . you need to calm down and say sorry . you need to share and play nice . you need to clean up this mess . and you need to go to your rooms . no more cars for today . " mom says .

tom and sam stop fighting and look at mom . they feel ashamed and guilty . they know mom is right . they nod and say sorry . they say sorry to each other . they help mom clean up the mess . they take their cars and go to their rooms . they are quiet and sad .

they wish they did not break the stadium . they wish they did not fight . they wish they could play again . maybe tomorrow . anna and ben are friends . they like to play pretend . today they pretend to be singers on a big stage . they find a big box and put it in the living room . they use a cloth to polish the box . they want the box to shine like a real stage .

" look , our stage is ready ! " anna says . " let 's sing a song for mom and dad ! "

" ok , what song do we sing ? " ben asks .

" how about ' twinkle twinkle little star ' ? " anna suggests .

" good idea , i know that song ! " ben agrees .

they climb on the box and hold a thick book each . the books are their microphones . they start to sing loudly and happily .

" twinkle twinkle little star , how i wonder what you are ... "

mom and dad hear their voices and come to the living room . they see anna and ben on the box , singing and smiling . they clap their hands and cheer for them .

" wow , you two are amazing singers ! " mom says . " you have a beautiful stage ! "

" thank you , mom ! " anna says .

" thank you , dad ! " ben says .

they bow to their audience and hug each other . they are proud of their show . they love to play pretend . lily and max were twins who liked to play in their big building . they had many friends who lived on different floors . sometimes they used the elevator to visit them . the elevator had buttons with numbers and pictures . lily and max knew how to press the buttons to go up and down .

one day , they wanted to play with sam , who lived on the top floor . they pressed the button with the star and the elevator started to move . but then it stopped in the middle and made a loud noise . lily and max were scared . they tried to press other buttons , but nothing happened . they cried for help , but no one heard them .

sam was waiting for them in his room . he had a big puzzle with many pieces . he wanted to unite the pieces with lily and max and make a picture . he heard the loud noise and wondered what it was . he looked out the window and saw the elevator stuck . he saw lily and max inside , crying and waving . he ran to his mom and told her what he saw .

mom called the building manager and told him to fix the elevator . she also called lily and max 's mom and told her what happened . she said they were safe and not to worry . she took sam to the stairs and they went down to the elevator . they knocked on the door and talked to lily and max . they said they were coming to get them and to be brave .

lily and max were happy to hear sam and their moms . they stopped crying and waited . soon , the elevator started to move again and reached the ground floor . the door opened and lily and max ran out . they hugged sam and their moms . they were so glad to be out . mom gave them some juice and cookies . the juice was sour , but they did n't mind . they thanked the building manager for fixing the elevator . they decided to play with the puzzle in sam 's room . they pressed the button with the star and the elevator took them up . they hoped it would n't stop again . they had fun uniting the pieces and making a picture . they were happy to be together . one day , a panda named pao was very hungry . he saw a big tree with many green leaves . he climbed the tree and started to eat the leaves . they were delicious . he ate and ate until he was full .

but he did not see that there was another panda on the other side of the tree . her name was mei . she was also hungry , but she could not find any leaves to eat . she saw pao eating the leaves , but he did not share with her . she felt sad and angry .

she decided to tell pao how she felt . she climbed to his side of the tree and said , " pao , why are you eating all the leaves ? do n't you know that i am hungry too ? you should share with me . sharing is good . "

pao was surprised . he did not know that mei was there . he looked at her and saw that she was thin and hungry . he felt sorry for her . he said , " mei , i am sorry . i did not see you . i was too greedy . you are right . sharing is good . here , you can have some of my leaves . they are delicious . "

mei smiled . she thanked pao and took some of his leaves . they ate together and became friends . they learned that sharing is good and that it makes them happy . lily and ben were playing with their blocks in the living room . they liked to build towers and houses and bridges with the colorful blocks . sometimes they knocked them down and started again .

suddenly , they heard a strange noise from the kitchen . it sounded like a tap , tap , tap on the window . they looked at each other and wondered who it could be . they ran to the kitchen to see .

on the window sill , they saw a little bird . it was blue and yellow and had a long tail . it was tapping on the glass with its beak . it looked at them with bright eyes and chirped .

" hello , bird ! " lily said . " what are you doing here ? "

the bird tilted its head and said , " i 'm looking for a friend . can i play with you ? "

lily and ben smiled . they had never seen a bird like this before . it was very pretty and original . they opened the window and let the bird in .

" sure , you can play with us ! " ben said . " we have blocks and toys and books . what do you like ? "

the bird flew around the kitchen and looked at everything . it landed on the table and picked up a block with its beak . it said , " i like blocks . they are fun and colorful . can we build something together ? "

lily and ben nodded . they took the bird to the living room and showed it their blocks . they started to build a big castle for the bird . the bird helped them by placing blocks on top of each other . they had a lot of fun and became friends .

the bird said , " thank you for playing with me . you are very nice and kind . can i come back tomorrow ? "

lily and ben said , " yes , of course ! we would love to see you again . you are our new friend . "

the bird said , " goodbye for now . i have to go back to my nest . but i will appear again tomorrow . do n't forget me ! "

lily and ben said , " we wo n't forget you . we will wait for you . goodbye , bird ! "

they waved to the bird as it flew out of the window . they looked at their castle and smiled . they had made a new friend and a new toy . they were very happy . sam and anna were twins who loved to visit their grandpa 's ranch . they liked to see the cows , horses , chickens and pigs that lived there . they also liked to help their grandpa with his chores .

one day , their grandpa said , " i have a surprise for you . i want to show you something special . come with me . " he took them to a big barn where he kept his tools and machines . he opened a door and said , " look ! "

sam and anna gasped . inside the barn , there was a shiny red tractor . it had big wheels , a long pipe and a seat for the driver . their grandpa said , " this is my new tractor . i use it to plow the fields and pull the hay . do you want to try it ? "

sam and anna nodded eagerly . their grandpa helped them climb on the seat and showed them how to start the engine , steer the wheel and press the pedals . he said , " be careful and have fun . i 'll be right here if you need me . "

sam and anna took turns driving the tractor around the barn . they felt very happy and proud . they thanked their grandpa for showing them his new tractor . they said , " you are the best grandpa ever . you have a very nice ranch . we want to be helpful and learn more from you . "

their grandpa smiled and hugged them . he said , " you are very good and smart . i love you very much . you make me very happy . you are always welcome at my ranch . " sara loved to go to the zoo with her mom . she liked to see all the different animals and learn their names . her favorite animal was the rhinoceros . she thought it was big and strong and had a funny horn on its nose .

one day , sara and her mom went to the zoo and saw a sign that said " rhinoceros feeding time " . sara was very excited and wanted to see the rhinoceros eat . she asked her mom if they could go closer to the fence . her mom said yes , but told her to be careful and not touch the fence .

sara and her mom walked to the fence and saw a big rhinoceros eating some hay . sara was amazed by how big its mouth was and how loud it chewed . she wanted to say hello to the rhinoceros and make friends with it . she leaned over the fence and waved her hand . she said " hi , rhinoceros ! you are very nice . can i pet you ? "

the rhinoceros heard sara 's voice and looked up . it saw sara 's hand and thought it was food . it opened its mouth and moved its head towards sara . sara did not know what the rhinoceros wanted . she thought it wanted to play with her . she smiled and moved her hand closer .

her mom saw what was happening and got very worried . she knew the rhinoceros could hurt sara with its teeth or horn . she shouted " sara , no ! do n't touch the rhinoceros ! it might bite you ! " she grabbed sara 's arm and pulled her back from the fence .

sara was surprised and scared . she did not understand why her mom was angry and why the rhinoceros was not friendly . she started to cry and said " mom , why did you do that ? i just wanted to pet the rhinoceros . it looked so nice . "

her mom hugged sara and said " i 'm sorry , sara . i know you like the rhinoceros , but it is not a pet . it is a wild animal . it does not know you and it might think you are food . you have to be careful around wild animals . they can be dangerous . i love you and i do n't want you to get hurt . "

sara calmed down and said " i love you too , mom . i 'm sorry i made you worried . i did n't know the rhinoceros was wild . can we still watch it eat ? "

her mom said " yes , we can . but we have to stay away from the fence and not touch it . ok ? "

sara said " ok , mom . thank you for letting me see the rhinoceros . it is still my favorite animal . but i will not try to pet it again . "

her mom said " you 're welcome , sara . i 'm glad you like the rhinoceros . but remember , some animals are better to look at than to touch . " lily liked to help her mom in the kitchen . she put on a pink apron and climbed on a stool . she wanted to weigh the flour for the cake . mom gave her a big spoon and a bowl .

lily scooped some flour from the bag and put it in the bowl . she looked at the scale . it had a red needle and some numbers . mom said the needle had to point to two . lily added more flour . the needle moved . lily added more flour . the needle moved more .

lily was happy . she had weighed the flour . she lifted the bowl to show mom . but the bowl was too heavy for her . it slipped from her hands and fell on the floor . the flour went everywhere . lily felt a pain in her arm . the bowl had hit her . she started to cry .

mom hugged lily and said it was okay . she checked her arm . it was not bad . just a little red . she put a band - aid on it . she said it would not hurt for long . she kissed lily and said she was a good helper .

mom and lily cleaned up the flour . they laughed at the mess . they put more flour in a new bowl . they weighed it again . this time , mom held the bowl . lily watched the needle . it pointed to two . they were ready to make the cake . lily smiled . she liked to help her mom in the kitchen . anna liked to jog with her dad every morning . they would put on their shoes and hats and go outside . they would jog around the park and say hello to the birds and the flowers . anna felt happy and strong when she jogged with her dad .

one day , they saw a man with a big truck in the park . the man was taking out boxes and bags from the truck and putting them on a table . anna was curious and asked her dad , " what is he doing ? "

