anna and her dad jogged to the finish line and waited for the runners to come . they clapped and shouted and smiled as they saw the runners cross the line . anna thought that jogging was a wonderful thing to do , with or without a race . lily liked to play the piano . she had a small piano in her room , with black and white keys . she learned some songs from her mom , who was a good piano teacher . lily wanted to show her dad what she could do .

