they laughed and enjoyed the book . they wondered who left it in the hole and why . they decided to keep it and read it again later . they thanked mom for taking them to the park and finding the book . they were happy and curious . lily and max are twins . they like to play in the living room . there is a big armchair in the living room . the armchair is wide and soft . lily and max both want to sit on the armchair .

lily gets to the armchair first . she jumps on it and says , " this is my armchair ! i got here first ! " max runs after her and says , " no , this is my armchair ! i want to sit on it too ! " they start to push and pull each other on the armchair .

