the car ride was long and hot . tom and lily felt tired and thirsty . they asked their grandma if they could have some water and a snack . their grandma said yes and gave them a bottle of water and a bag of crackers . she also turned on the fan in the car to make them feel cooler . tom and lily thanked their grandma and drank some water and ate some crackers . they felt better and looked out the window .

they saw many trees , houses , cars and animals . they played a game of spotting different things and naming them . they had fun and laughed a lot . their grandma smiled and said they were very smart and sweet . she said they were almost there and she was very excited to show them her new house .

they arrived at their grandma 's new house . it was big and white and had a red door . their grandma parked the car and opened the trunk . she asked tom and lily to help her unpack their bags and bring them inside . tom and lily nodded and got out of the car . they each grabbed a bag and followed their grandma to the door .

but as they walked to the door , they heard a loud bark . a big , black dog ran out of the house and jumped on them . the dog was angry and mean . he bit tom 's arm and lily 's leg . he tore their bags and their clothes . he knocked down their grandma and made her fall . tom and lily screamed and cried . their grandma shouted and tried to push the dog away . but the dog was stronger and faster . he hurt them all very badly . no one came to help them . they wished their mom and dad were there . they wished they never came to their grandma 's new house . they wished they had a dependable fan to make them feel cooler . they wished they were safe and happy . but they were not . they were scared and hurt . the end . sara and tom were playing with their dolls in the garden . they had a tea party with cups and plates and cookies . sara had a pink doll with long hair and a dress . tom had a blue doll with a hat and a coat . they liked their dolls very much .

