the end . once there was a little girl . her name was heidi . she was 3 years old . heidi loved adventures . one day heidi had a big surprise â€ “ her mommy and daddy took her to an opera . it was beautiful . heidi was so happy but the grown - ups around her ignored her . nobody wanted to talk or play with her . heidi was a bit sad but then she noticed a little mouse ! she followed the mouse to a big castle . heidi explored the castle and found a beautiful garden with flowers and birds . heidi smiled . she did not feel ignored anymore . heidi enjoyed the opera and afterwards she went home with the most beautiful memories . once there was a smart princess named joanna . she lived in a big castle , and she had a magical twist . she could twist anything into something else !

