the village people , the children , and all of their friends mixed and played together every day . everyone was so happy that they lived in such an attractive village . they would always be friends and enjoy mixing together . once there was a boy who wanted to fly a kite . he went to the park and saw a beautiful kite in the sky . he said " i want to fly a kite too ! " he asked his dad for help and dad said " ok " . dad gave him a kite and showed him how to shoot it . the boy was so excited he ran and began to shoot the kite . he flew it around in the sky and it made him feel so good . the kite danced in the air , and the boy laughed and laughed . he shouted out " i 'm flying a kite ! " he flew the kite for a long time , until he was too tired to keep shooting . he put the kite away and ran home , happy and smiling . one day , a pale reindeer was walking through the forest . he was very surprised when he heard a loud shout . he had never heard a sound like this before ! he looked around , but he could not see anyone . he waited a little while and then he heard the shout again !

