from then on every summer jack would visit the beach and sit in his orange chair . he would always try a few tastes of sand too . once upon a time there was a boy named pat . he was very independent , and he loved doing things alone . one day he went to a park far away . he began exploring the new area , thrilled to discover all sorts of new things .

