billy was happy to have made a new friend and to have shared his treasure with her . from then on , he was more careful when he flew so he would n't be so clumsy anymore . once upon a time , there was a happy boy named timmy . he loved to play on the swing in his backyard . the swing made him feel like he was flying up in the sky .

