the moral of the story is that it 's important to stay close to your loved ones and not separate from them . even though exploring new places can be fun , it 's important to always stay safe and never wander off alone . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside in the sun . one day , she saw a butterfly and wanted to catch it . she tried to lift her hands , but the butterfly flew away .

