lily was very happy and ate all the strawberries on the way home . when they got home , she told her dad about the strawberries and how much she loved them . dad was glad to see her so happy and said , " i 'm glad you enjoyed them , lily . " once upon a time , there was a happy little boy named timmy . timmy loved to play with his toys and run around outside . one day , timmy 's dad set an alarm for him to wake up early . timmy did n't like the loud noise , but he knew it was time to get up and start his day .

later that day , timmy went to the park with his mom . they had so much fun playing on the swings and going down the slide . timmy 's mom told him a funny joke and he laughed so hard that he fell off the swing !

at dinner time , timmy 's grandma came over to visit . she brought him a present and he was so grateful . they had a yummy dinner together and timmy told his grandma all about the funny joke his mom told him . they laughed and had a great time together . timmy went to bed that night feeling happy and loved . lily and ben were twins who loved to go to the zoo . they liked to see all the different animals and learn their names . but their favorite animal was the panda . the panda was big and black and white and fluffy . he liked to eat bamboo and play with his friends .

