mom and dad smiled . they were glad that lily and ben enjoyed the zoo . they hoped that the pandas would be friends again soon . lily and sam were twins who liked to play with their toys . one day , they found a big bag of mints in the kitchen . they both wanted to eat them , but there were not enough for both of them .

