the lady cleaned the strip off the slide . she said lily and tom could use the slide again . they thanked her and smiled .

they slid down the slide again . they did not need the strip to have fun . they had each other . they were friends . anna and ben like to play knights and dragons . they use old boxes and paper to create shields and swords . they paint them with bright colors and stickers .

