they play knights and dragons and king all afternoon . they have fun . they are friends . tom and lily were playing in the kitchen . they liked to pretend they were chefs and make food with the pots and pans . they also liked to open the cabinet and see what was inside . sometimes they found cookies or crackers , but sometimes they found things they did not like .

