tom and lily hugged mommy and thanked her . they were glad the spider was gone and they could play in the kitchen again . they decided to make mommy a pretend cake with the pots and pans . they put some sprinkles and candles on top and sang " happy spider day " to mommy . mommy laughed and pretended to eat the cake . she was happy to see tom and lily smiling and having fun . she loved them very much . lila and ben were playing with paper . they liked to cut , fold and draw on it . they made paper hats , paper planes and paper animals . they had a lot of fun .

but they also made a lot of mess . they left paper scraps and bits everywhere . they did not care about cleaning up . they did not think about how paper came from trees and how trees were important for the air and the animals .

one day , their mom came to their room and saw the paper mess . she was not happy . she said , " lila and ben , you are wasting paper . do you know how paper is made ? do you know how many trees are cut down to make paper ? do you know how far away some of the trees are ? they are in distant lands , where there are different people and animals . they need the trees to live and be happy . you should not waste paper . you should save paper . you should use it wisely and recycle it when you are done . that way , you can help save the trees and the planet . "

lila and ben felt sorry . they did not know that paper was so precious . they did not want to hurt the trees and the planet . they said , " we are sorry , mom . we did not know . we will save paper from now on . we will use it carefully and recycle it . we will also clean up our mess . can you teach us more about the trees and the distant lands ? "

their mom smiled . she was glad that they learned their lesson . she said , " of course , i will . i am proud of you for wanting to save paper and the planet . come , let 's go to the library and find some books about the trees and the distant lands . you can also make some paper crafts with the paper you have left . but remember , only use what you need and recycle what you do n't . "

lila and ben nodded . they hugged their mom and thanked her . they went to the library and learned more about the trees and the distant lands . they also made some paper crafts with the paper they had left . they used paper clips , glue and scissors to make them . they made paper flowers , paper stars and paper birds . they gave some of them to their mom and some of them to their friends . they told them about the importance of saving paper and the planet . they felt happy and proud . they had a lot of fun . tom and lily were best friends . they liked to play in the park every day . they liked to swing , slide and run . they also liked to look for acorns under the big oak tree . acorns were small and brown and had a funny hat . tom and lily liked to pretend they were squirrels and hide the acorns in the grass .

one day , they found a very big acorn . it was bigger than any acorn they had ever seen . it was shiny and smooth and had a beautiful hat . tom and lily both wanted the big acorn . they both reached for it at the same time .

" mine ! " said tom .

" no , mine ! " said lily .

they pulled and tugged and shouted . the big acorn slipped from their hands and rolled away . tom and lily ran after it . they did not see the dog that was chasing a ball . the dog saw the big acorn and thought it was a toy . he ran faster than tom and lily and caught the big acorn in his mouth . he wagged his tail and ran away .

tom and lily stopped and looked at each other . they were sad and angry . they had lost the big acorn . they had lost their fun . they had lost their friendship . they both frowned and turned away .

a lady saw them and felt sorry for them . she was a famous writer . she wrote stories for children . she had a big bag full of books . she walked over to tom and lily and smiled .

" hello , children . why are you so unhappy ? " she asked .

