" that 's a shame . but you know , acorns are not the most important thing in the world . friends are . friends can share and help and forgive . friends can make you happy . friends can make stories together . would you like to hear a story ? " she said .

tom and lily nodded . they liked stories . they liked the lady . she was kind and friendly . she took out a book from her bag and opened it . it was a story about a squirrel and a rabbit who were friends . they had adventures and learned lessons . they had fun and laughter . they had love and respect .

tom and lily listened to the story . they forgot about the big acorn . they forgot about their fight . they remembered their friendship . they smiled and hugged . they thanked the lady for the story . she gave them each a book to keep . she told them to keep reading and writing and playing and dreaming . she told them to keep being friends .

tom and lily waved goodbye to the lady . they held hands and walked back to the park . they played and shared and forgave . they made stories together . they were happy . they were friends . lily was a very obedient girl . she always listened to her mom and dad , and did what they told her . she liked to help them with chores , and play with her toys nicely .

one day , lily and her mom went to the park . lily saw a big green slide , and wanted to go on it . she asked her mom , " mom , can i go on the slide ? "

mom said , " yes , you can , but be careful . the slide is very high , and you might get hurt . wait for me here , and i will come with you . "

lily nodded , and said , " ok , mom . i will wait for you . " she was very obedient .

but then , lily heard a voice . it was a boy , who was on the slide . he said , " hey , little girl , do you want to go on the slide with me ? it 's fun , and you do n't need your mom . come on , let 's go ! "

lily looked at the boy . he was bigger than her , and had a mean smile . she felt scared , and said , " no , thank you . i have to wait for my mom . she told me to be careful . "

the boy laughed , and said , " you are a baby , and a chicken . you are afraid of the slide . you are not fun at all . you are boring , and obedient . "

lily felt sad , and angry . she wanted to prove the boy wrong . she wanted to show him that she was not a baby , or a chicken . she wanted to have fun , too . she forgot what her mom said , and followed the boy to the slide .

but the slide was too high , and too fast . lily felt dizzy , and scared . she screamed , and tried to stop . but she could n't . she slid down , and hit the ground hard . she hurt her knee , and her elbow . she cried , and cried .

mom heard her cry , and ran to her . she hugged her , and said , " oh , lily , what happened ? are you ok ? "

lily sobbed , and said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i did n't listen to you . i went on the slide with the boy . he said i was a baby , and a chicken . he said i was boring , and obedient . i wanted to have fun , but i got hurt . "

mom said , " oh , lily , i 'm sorry , too . the boy was not nice , or kind . he was rude , and mean . he lied to you , and made you do something dangerous . you do n't have to listen to him , or anyone who says bad things to you . you have to listen to me , and dad , and yourself . you have to be careful , and safe . you have to be obedient , because we love you , and we want the best for you . obedient is not boring , or bad . obedient is good , and smart . do you understand ? "

lily nodded , and said , " yes , mom . i understand . i 'm sorry , i wo n't do it again . i love you , mom . "

mom said , " i love you , too , lily . now , let 's go home , and put some bandages on your wounds . and then , we can play with your toys , and have some fun . ok ? "

lily smiled , and said , " ok , mom . thank you , mom . "

mom smiled , and said , " you 're welcome , lily . you 're a very good girl , and i 'm proud of you . "

the end . lily and ben were friends who liked to play with blocks . they wanted to build a big tower with all the blocks they had . they worked hard and put one block on top of another . they were happy to see their tower grow taller and taller .

