they wanted to make their tower even higher , so they reached for more blocks . but they did not see that their tower was wobbly and shaky . suddenly , the tower fell down with a loud crash . all the blocks scattered on the floor . lily and ben were sad . they had lost their tower .

" oh no , our tower is gone ! " lily cried .

" we worked so hard , and now we have nothing ! " ben said .

they looked at each other and felt sorry . they wanted to have a victory , not a loss . they wanted to be proud , not sad . they wanted to have fun , not cry .

but then , they had an idea . they decided to build something else with the blocks . they decided to build a bridge . they used the blocks to make a long and strong bridge across the floor . they took turns to walk on the bridge and pretend they were crossing a river . they laughed and cheered as they crossed the bridge .

