but tom did not listen . he walked into the chamber and touched a big lever . he heard a voice that said " self - destruct activated . countdown begins . "

tom and amy were scared . they did not know what that meant . they ran out of the chamber and closed the door . they heard a loud boom and saw smoke and fire . they ran away from the big house and never came back . lily and max are friends who like to play with paper . they have many files of paper with different colors , shapes and pictures . one day , they decide to sort their files and make new ones .

lily says , " let 's sort the paper by color . red with red , blue with blue , and so on . " max nods and starts to sort his paper . he puts the red paper in one file , the blue paper in another file , and the yellow paper in a third file .

but then he sees a paper that has red and blue stripes . he is confused . he does not know which file to put it in . he asks lily , " lily , where does this paper go ? it has red and blue . "

lily looks at the paper and says , " that paper is special . it has two colors . we can make a new file for it . we can call it the mixed file . " she takes the paper from max and puts it in a new file . she says , " we can sort the paper by color , but we can also sort it by other things . like shape , or picture , or size . there are many ways to sort paper . "

max smiles and says , " you are right , lily . sorting paper is fun . and we can be creative . we can make our own files and rules . we can sort paper however we like . " he finds another paper that has red and blue stars . he says , " look , lily , another mixed paper . let 's put it in the mixed file . "

lily and max sort their paper and make new files . they have fun and learn new things . they also learn to respect each other 's choices and ideas . they are good friends who sort paper together . sara and ben are playing in the park . they like to swing , slide and run . they see a big gate . they wonder what is behind the gate .

