mommy nodded . she took ben and lily inside . she gave them some juice and cookies . they were not spicy . they were sweet . ben and lily liked them . they forgot about the wasp . they were happy . tom and lily were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they saw a big fence with a sign that said " keep out " . behind the fence , there were many shiny things that looked like toys . tom and lily wanted to see the toys , so they decided to climb the fence .

