as they played , they saw a red button on one of the machines . tom was curious and pushed the button . suddenly , there was a loud noise and a spark flew out of the machine . it hit a pile of papers and started a fire . tom and lily were scared and ran back to the fence . they tried to climb it again , but it was too hot and they burned their hands .

they cried and shouted for help . a man came and saw them . he was angry and called the firemen and the police . he told them that they had trespassed and damaged his property . he said that they had to pay for the expensive things they broke . tom and lily felt very sorry and ashamed . they wished they had listened to the sign and not climbed the fence .

