lila is glad to have her bulb back , but she is still sad . the bulb is not the same as before . it is not shiny and colorful . it does not make sounds and lights . it is not original . she does not want to play with it anymore .

max sees that lila is sad and tries to cheer her up . he says he is sorry too and that he likes her and her bulb . he says they can still have fun with the bulb . they can fix it and make it new . they can use glue and tape and paper and crayons . they can make it original again .

lila smiles and hugs max . she likes him and his idea . she says they can do that and have fun . they go to get the things they need and start to work on the bulb . they are very creative and happy . they make the bulb original again . jill and ben were on a big boat with mom and dad . they wanted to see the reef under the water . the reef had many colors and shapes and fish . jill and ben put on masks and fins and jumped into the water .

" wow , look at that ! " jill said to ben . she pointed at a big fish with stripes and a long nose . " it is like a bird with no wings ! "

ben nodded and swam closer to the fish . he saw a small hole in the reef . he was curious and wanted to peek inside . he stretched his neck and looked into the hole .

" ouch ! " ben cried out . he felt a sharp pain on his nose . he pulled back and saw a red spot on his mask . a crab had pinched his nose with its claw .

" ben , are you okay ? " jill asked . she swam to him and hugged him . she saw the crab in the hole . it waved its claws at them .

" let 's go away from the crab , " jill said . " it is not nice . it is mean . "

ben nodded and held jill 's hand . they swam back to the boat . mom and dad helped them get out of the water . they gave them towels and kisses .

