she put her buttons back in the box and followed her mom to the kitchen . she was still happy , but also hungry . she decided to sort buttons again after lunch , and maybe make a necklace or a bracelet with them . she liked to sort buttons . sam and mia were playing with their toys on the floor . they had cars , dolls , blocks and a big book . sam liked the book because it had pictures of ancient things , like big animals with long necks and sharp teeth , and people who lived in caves and wore fur .

