they ran back to their mom , who hugged them and dried their tears . they said they were sorry and promised to be more kind and grateful . they learned their lesson and never fought over a rainbow again . sam and tom were brothers who liked to play games . one day , they found a big box in the garage . they opened it and saw many wires and buttons . sam said , " let 's see what this does ! " he pressed a button and a loud noise came out of the box . tom was scared and said , " stop it , sam ! that 's not a toy ! "

but sam did not listen . he pressed another button and a bright light flashed from the box . tom was more scared and said , " stop it , sam ! that 's not a toy ! " but sam did not listen . he pressed another button and a strong smell came out of the box . tom was very scared and said , " stop it , sam ! that 's not a toy ! "

but sam did not listen . he pressed another button and a big shock came out of the box . sam and tom both felt the shock and fell to the ground . they were hurt and cried . dad heard them and ran to the garage . he saw the box and was angry . he said , " what are you doing , boys ? that 's not a toy ! that 's a machine for fixing cars ! "

