the end . anna liked to write . she had a big book with many pages . she wrote with a crayon . she wrote her name , and her mom 's name , and her dad 's name . she wrote about her toys , and her cat , and her friends . she wrote every day .

one day , anna 's dad took her to his work . he was a mechanic . he fixed cars and trucks and bikes . he had a big garage with many tools . he showed anna how he worked . he said , " this is a wrench . i use it to tighten the nuts . this is a screwdriver . i use it to turn the screws . this is a hammer . i use it to hit the nails . "

anna was amazed . she wanted to try the tools . she asked her dad , " can i write with them ? " her dad smiled . he said , " no , honey . these are not for writing . these are for fixing . you can write with your crayon at home . but you can watch me work . and you can help me clean the tools . "

anna nodded . she watched her dad work . she saw him fix a car with a flat tire . she saw him fix a bike with a broken chain . she saw him fix a truck with a loud horn . she learned many new words . she wanted to write them in her book .

but soon , anna was hungry . she said , " dad , i 'm hungry . can we eat ? " her dad looked at his watch . he said , " yes , it 's time for lunch . let 's go to the diner . they have good food . you can have a sandwich , and a juice , and a cookie . and then , you can write in your book . you can write about what you saw today . you can write about the mechanic and the tools and the vehicles . "

