sara nods and lets her mom take care of her knee . her mom washes it with water and soap and puts some medicine on it . the medicine is a cream that helps the wound heal . it smells funny and feels cold . sara makes a face and says , " i do n't like the medicine . it 's yucky . "

her mom smiles and says , " i know , sara , but the medicine is good for you . it will make your knee stop hurting and prevent infection . you have to be brave and let it do its work . then you can ride your bike again . "

