mia and leo smile . they love their mom and dad . they love the sea and the sand . they hope the rain will stop soon . they want to play and have fun . they are happy . lily loved books . she had many books in her room . she liked to look at the pictures and hear the stories . sometimes , she tried to read the words by herself .

