tom and mia are happy . they think that is a fun job . they nod and say yes . they thank the bus driver and get on the bus . they sit in the front and wear big smiles . they are ready to help and go to the park . they are also ready to have a lot of fun . tom and lily wanted to go to the park . they liked to play on the swings and the slide . but when they looked out the window , they saw dark clouds and rain . they felt sad .

