the bird is happy . it has stopped the fight . it sings a song and flies back to the tree . the park is peaceful again . lily and ben were at the beach with their mom and dad . they liked to play in the sand and splash in the water . they saw many things in the sea , like fish , crabs , and shells . but they also saw something that scared them : jellyfish .

