they went back to the beach and played in the sand and splash in the water . they did not climb on the rocks or touch the jellyfish . they had fun and were safe . they learned a lesson and were happy . sara loved her doll very much . she called her doll lily and played with her every day . she brushed her hair , dressed her up , and told her stories . sara thought lily was magic , because she always made sara happy .

