one day , they want to make a harbor with the blocks . a harbor is a place where boats can stop and rest . they use blue blocks for the water and brown blocks for the land . they add green blocks for trees and yellow blocks for sand . they make a big harbor with the blocks .

they look for boats to put in the harbor . they find some toy boats in their toy box . they have a red boat , a white boat , and a black boat . they put the boats in the water . they pretend the boats are sailing and fishing and exploring .

the sun is shining and the air is mild . mild means not too hot and not too cold . lily and ben are happy . they like their harbor . they play with the blocks and the boats until it is time for lunch . they clean up the blocks and put them away . they say goodbye to their harbor . they will play with it again another day . one day , a little girl named mia went to the park with her mom . she saw a big slide and wanted to try it . she ran to the slide and climbed up the stairs . she looked down and saw a boy waiting at the bottom . he had black hair and black eyes . he smiled at her and said , " hi , i 'm leo . do you want to slide with me ? "

