they take their bucket and shovel and start to clean the shore . they find some of their shells and some new ones . they make new castles and decorate them with shells . they lean on their castles and smile . they are happy again . lily and sam went to the circus with mom and dad . they saw many animals and people doing funny things . lily liked the horses and sam liked the lions . they also saw a large clown with a red nose and big shoes . he made them laugh with his jokes and tricks .

