the clown took them to a big tent behind the circus . he opened a flap and said : " look inside . " lily and sam peeked inside . they saw many colorful things : hats , wigs , flowers , horns , and more . the clown said : " these are my toys . i use them to make people happy . do you want to try some ? "

lily and sam were excited . they said : " yes , please ! " the clown helped them put on some hats and wigs . he gave them each a horn and a flower . he said : " now you are clowns too . you can make people happy too . but shh , do n't tell anyone . it 's our secret . "

