" timmy , what are you doing ? " his mom came into the room . she looked angry . she saw timmy with the computer . she saw the screen was black . she saw the smoke coming out of the computer . she ran to the table and took the computer from timmy . she tried to turn it on , but nothing happened .

" timmy , you broke the computer ! " she shouted . " you were not supposed to touch it ! you know it is not a toy ! you are a bad boy ! "

timmy felt scared . he felt sad . he did not mean to break the computer . he just wanted to play . he started to cry . he said he was sorry . but his mom did not listen . she said he had to go to his room and stay there . she said he could not play with anything . she said he was in big trouble .

timmy went to his room . he felt alone . he felt sorry . he wished he had not touched the computer . he wished his mom was not angry . he wished he could play . he wished he could have a hug . but he had none of those things . he had a bad ending . tom and sam love to play baseball . they have a big ball and a small bat . they go to the park with their mom and dad . they find a nice spot to play . they take turns to hit the ball and run .

