they pick up the bat and the ball . they go back to the spot . they play baseball again . they have fun . they are not miserable . they are happy . lily and ben like to play pretend . they have a big box of costumes and toys . they make a stage with a blanket and some chairs . they take turns to act out stories and sing songs .

