she gives him a necklace and a ring from the box . they hug and smile . they continue to play pretend on their stage . they have a wonderful time . the end . jill and ben were playing in the park . they liked to dig in the sand and look for treasures . sometimes they found shells , rocks , or coins . but today they found something very unusual .

