they both pulled on the diamond . they both shouted and cried . they both wanted the diamond . they did not want to share or listen or compromise . they did not act like friends .

then , something bad happened . the diamond broke . it split into two pieces . it was not shiny or sparkly anymore . it was dull and cracked and sad . jill and ben were shocked and sorry . they had ruined the diamond . they had ruined their game . they had ruined their day . tom and lily are twins who love music . they have a big piano in their house . sometimes , they play the piano together and make nice sounds . they like to learn new songs and sing along .

one day , their mom brings home a cd of jazz music . she says jazz is a kind of music that is playful and fun . she puts the cd in the player and turns it on . tom and lily listen to the jazz music . they hear the piano , but also other instruments , like the saxophone , the trumpet , and the drums . they hear the jazz musicians play fast and slow , loud and soft , and sometimes make funny noises .

tom and lily think the jazz music is very cool . they want to play jazz on the piano too . they go to the piano and try to copy the sounds they hear . they press the keys and make different rhythms and melodies . they laugh and have fun . they play jazz for a long time .

their mom comes to the piano and smiles . she says she is proud of tom and lily for being creative and curious . she says they are learning to play jazz by listening and experimenting . she says jazz is a music that celebrates freedom and joy . she says playing jazz is a good way to express themselves and have fun .

tom and lily hug their mom and thank her for the jazz cd . they say they love jazz and they want to learn more . they say they also love their mom and each other . they say playing jazz together makes them happy . they play one more song and end with a big clap . lily and sam were twins . they liked to play outside at night . they looked at the stars and the moon . the moon was big and bright . it was a new moon .

