sam followed her . he saw the ladder . he was curious . he wanted to try .

" be careful , lily . the ladder is not very strong . it might break . " sam said .

lily did not listen . she climbed the ladder . she reached the top . she looked at the moon . it was still far away . she stretched her hand . she tried to touch the moon .

" come on , sam ! the moon is so pretty . you can see it better from here . " lily said .

sam climbed the ladder too . he joined lily at the top . he looked at the moon . he agreed . it was pretty . he smiled .

they both tried to touch the moon . they leaned forward . they reached out . they did not see the ladder wobble . they did not hear the fence crack . they did not feel the ladder fall .

they only heard a loud thud . they only felt a hard bump . they only saw the stars spin .

they landed on the grass . they were not hurt . they were just surprised . they looked at each other . they looked at the broken ladder . they looked at the moon .

they laughed . they realized they could not go to the moon . they decided to play something else . they left the ladder and the fence . they ran to the swing . they swung high and low . they still looked at the moon . they still liked the moon . but they knew it was not for them . it was for the sky . tom and lily were playing in the farm . they liked to see the animals and feed them . they saw a big pig with a curly tail . the pig was sleeping in the mud .

