he took the pig away . he gave the children some corn . he told them to be nice to the animals .

tom and lily said sorry . they learned their lesson . they ate the corn and went to see the other animals . they did not touch the pig again . once upon a time , in a little hut , there lived a sad boy named tom . the hut was small and had a door and a window . tom had no friends to play with , so he would sit by the window and watch the birds fly by .

one day , tom saw a big bird outside the hut . the bird looked sad too . it had a hurt wing and could not fly . tom wanted to help the bird , so he went outside and tried to strike the hurt wing gently . he wanted the bird to feel better .

