her mom hugged her and said , " do n't worry , lily . let 's put the scary toy in a pot and hide it away . " so , they found a big pot and put the scary toy inside . they hid the pot in the closet so lily would n't see it anymore .

from that day on , lily was happy and did n't weep . she played with her nice toys and forgot about the scary toy in the pot . and whenever she felt scared , she knew her mom would always be there to help her . once upon a time , there was a little boy named tim . he had a toy missile that he loved to play with . one day , tim went to the park with his mom and took his toy missile with him .

tim met a girl named sue at the park . they both played with the toy missile together . " i like your toy missile , " sue said . " it 's fun to play with ! " tim smiled and said , " thank you , i like it too ! "

as they played , they saw a dead plant near the swings . tim and sue decided to help the plant grow . they took turns giving it water and soon , the plant started to grow . tim and sue were happy that they could help the plant . they played with the toy missile and watched the plant grow all day long . once upon a time , in a small garden , there was a cauliflower . the cauliflower lived with many other plants . the cauliflower wanted to be tall and strong like the trees . it wanted to raise its head high and be tough .

one day , a wise old tree saw the cauliflower trying to grow tall . the tree said , " little cauliflower , you do n't need to be tall like me . you are special just the way you are . " the cauliflower did not listen . it still wanted to raise its head high and be tough .

as time went on , the cauliflower learned that it was good at other things . it made the garden beautiful and gave food to people . the cauliflower was happy . it learned that everyone is special in their own way . the moral of the story is : be happy with who you are and what you can do . once upon a time , there was a big dog named max and a little cat named lily . they lived in a house with a girl named emma . max and lily were friends , but sometimes they got jealous of each other .

