emma said to lily , " you should not take things that are not yours . that is not nice . " emma decided to punish lily by not giving her a big meal for the whole day . lily was sad and hungry . she learned that being jealous and taking things from others can lead to bad things . once upon a time , there was a little boy named tim . tim loved to play with his toy vehicle . it was red and shiny , and he liked to drive it all around his room .

one sunny day , tim took his vehicle outside to play . he met his friend , sue . sue had a fake vehicle that she made from a box . it was painted blue , and she pretended to drive it too .

