they found a new oasis , and they had fun . lisa loved her brother ben , but sometimes he was very smelly . he liked to play in the mud , and he did not like to take a bath . lisa did not like to share a room with him , because he made her bed and toys dirty .

one day , lisa had an idea . she found a big box in the garage , and she put some of ben 's clothes and toys inside . she wrote " ben " on the box with a marker . then she dragged the box to the front door , and put a sign that said " free " on it .

she hoped that someone would take the box and replace her smelly brother with a clean one . she went back to her room and waited .

soon , she heard a knock on the door . she ran to see who it was . it was a man with a truck . he had a big smile on his face .

