one day , sara and ben are playing with the tube . they take turns to go inside and pretend they are in a spaceship . they make noises like " zoom " and " beep " . they have fun .

but then , sara wants to stay inside the tube for a long time . she says , " this is my spaceship . i am the captain . you ca n't come in . "

ben is sad . he says , " but i want to play too . we can share the tube . we can be co - captains . "

sara shakes her head . she says , " no , this is my tube . go away . "

ben feels angry . he says , " fine , i do n't want to play with you . you are mean . " he goes to the couch and picks up a book . he tries to read , but he ca n't . he misses his sister .

sara feels lonely . she says , " ben , where are you ? i want to play with you . i 'm sorry i was mean . "

she crawls out of the tube and looks for ben . she sees him on the couch . she says , " ben , can we play together ? i do n't want to be the captain anymore . i want to be your friend . "

ben smiles . he says , " okay , sara . i forgive you . let 's play together . we can both be in the tube . it is big enough for us . "

sara and ben hug . they go back to the tube and crawl inside . they make noises like " zoom " and " beep " . they have fun .

they settle in the tube and feel comfortable . they are happy . they are twins . they are friends . lily and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big house with many stairs . they want to go inside and look .

" can we go in ? " lily asks tom .

" i do n't know . maybe it is not nice to go in someone 's house , " tom says .

" but it looks so beautiful . maybe they have toys and books and candy , " lily says .

tom thinks for a moment . he likes toys and books and candy too . he says , " ok , let 's go in . but we have to be quiet and careful . "

they walk to the door and open it . it is not locked . they see a big hall with many doors and pictures . they walk up the stairs . they see more doors and pictures . they open one door and see a big bed and a closet . they open another door and see a bathroom with a tub and a sink . they open another door and see a playroom with many toys and books and a big window .

" wow , look at this ! " lily says . she runs to the playroom and picks up a doll . " she is so beautiful . she has a pink dress and a hat and shoes . "

tom follows her and sees a train . he likes trains . he says , " look at this ! it is so cool . it has many cars and tracks and a whistle . "

they play with the toys and books . they forget about the time . they forget about being quiet and careful .

they do not hear the car that stops outside . they do not hear the door that opens downstairs . they do not hear the footsteps that come up the stairs . they do not hear the voice that says , " who is in my house ? " lily and tom were playing with balloons in the park . they liked to blow them up and let them go . the balloons made funny noises as they flew away .

" look , lily , i have a big red balloon ! " tom said . he blew and blew until the balloon was very big .

" wow , tom , that is a big balloon ! " lily said . she had a small yellow balloon . she wanted to make it bigger too . she blew and blew , but the balloon did not grow .

" here , lily , you can have my balloon . i will blow yours up for you , " tom said . he was a kind boy . he gave his big red balloon to lily and took her small yellow one .

" thank you , tom , you are very nice ! " lily said . she was happy to have the big red balloon . she held it tight with both hands .

tom tried to blow up the small yellow balloon , but it was too hard . he puffed and puffed , but nothing happened . he felt a little sad .

" maybe this balloon is broken , " he said . he looked at lily and saw her smiling with the big red balloon .

suddenly , lily let go of the big red balloon . she did not mean to . she was clumsy and her hands slipped . the big red balloon flew up in the air .

" oh no , lily , what did you do ? " tom said . he was shocked . he dropped the small yellow balloon and ran after the big red balloon .

" i 'm sorry , tom , i 'm sorry ! " lily said . she was sorry too . she ran after tom and the big red balloon .

they chased the big red balloon across the park . they jumped and reached , but they could not catch it . the big red balloon went higher and higher , until it was a tiny dot in the sky .

" bye bye , balloon , " lily and tom said . they were sad to lose the big red balloon , but they still had each other .

they hugged and said , " we are still friends . "

they picked up the small yellow balloon and decided to play with something else . they found a ball and a swing and had fun together . they forgot about the big red balloon . they were happy . lily and ben are friends . they like to play on the porch of lily 's house . there is a swing on the porch . lily and ben take turns on the swing . they are polite and share .

one day , lily and ben see a big spider on the porch . the spider has a web . the web is shiny and sticky . the spider hangs from the web . lily and ben are scared of the spider . they run away from the porch .

" mommy , mommy , there is a spider on the porch ! " lily cries . she runs to her mommy in the kitchen . ben follows her .

" where is the spider , lily ? " mommy asks . she is not scared of spiders . she likes spiders . she thinks they are helpful and beautiful .

" on the porch , mommy , on the porch ! " lily points . " it hangs from a web . it is big and scary ! "

mommy smiles . she takes lily and ben by the hand . she walks with them to the porch . she shows them the spider .

" look , lily and ben , this is a spider . it is not scary . it is friendly . it makes a web to catch bugs . bugs are its food . the web is its home . the spider hangs from the web to rest and wait . it is very clever and strong . do you want to say hello to the spider ? "

lily and ben look at the spider . they see its eight legs and its shiny eyes . they see its web sparkle in the sun . they are not scared anymore . they are curious and amazed .

" hello , spider ! " lily and ben say . they wave to the spider . the spider waves back with one leg . lily and ben giggle .

" thank you , mommy , for showing us the spider . it is not scary . it is friendly . it is cool ! " lily and ben say .

" you 're welcome , lily and ben . i 'm glad you like the spider . it is polite to say hello to the spider . it is polite to share the porch with the spider . the spider is our friend . do you want to play on the swing again ? "

" yes , mommy , yes ! " lily and ben say . they run to the swing . they take turns on the swing . they are polite and share . they are happy . the spider is happy too . it hangs from its web and watches them play . lily and ben were adventurous twins who liked to explore new things . one day , they found a big box of magnets in the garage . they opened the box and saw many different shapes and colors of magnets .

" wow , look at these ! " lily said , picking up a round magnet . " they stick to each other ! "

" let me see ! " ben said , grabbing a square magnet . " they stick to the metal too ! "

they had fun sticking the magnets to the box , the car , the bike , and anything else they could find . they made patterns , towers , and bridges with the magnets .

then , lily had an idea . she took two magnets and held them close to each other . she felt them pull and push . she moved them closer and farther , making them snap and click .

" hey , ben , watch this ! " she said . " i can make them shake ! "

she brought the magnets close to ben 's ear and made them shake . ben heard a loud noise and jumped .

" wow , that 's loud ! " he said . " how do you do that ? "

lily showed him how to make the magnets shake . ben tried it too . they laughed and shook the magnets near their ears , their noses , and their mouths .

but then , they heard another noise . it was mom , coming into the garage .

" what are you two doing ? " she asked , seeing the mess of magnets .

" we 're playing with magnets , mom ! " lily and ben said . " they 're fun ! "

mom smiled and shook her head . she was glad they were curious and adventurous , but she also wanted them to be careful and tidy .

" okay , but do n't shake them too hard , or you might hurt your ears , " she said . " and when you 're done , please put them back in the box . "

lily and ben nodded . they agreed to play with the magnets for a little while longer , and then clean up . they thanked mom for letting them use the magnets , and gave her a hug .

the end . anna likes to sit by the window and look at the birds . she has a book with pictures of birds and she tries to find them outside . sometimes she sees a blue bird , or a red bird , or a yellow bird . she likes to say their names out loud .

one day , she sees a big black bird with a shiny beak . she does not know what it is . she looks in her book , but she can not find it . she feels sad and confused . she wants to learn more about the bird .

she calls her mom and shows her the bird . " mom , what is that bird ? " she asks .

her mom smiles and sits next to her . she takes the book and flips the pages . she points to a picture of a crow . " that is a crow , anna . it is a smart and helpful bird . it can make sounds and use tools . sometimes it helps other animals find food or water . "

anna is amazed . she looks at the crow and says , " hello , crow . you are smart and helpful . thank you for visiting me . " the crow caws and nods its head . it flies away , but anna hopes it will come back . she hugs her mom and says , " thank you , mom . you are smart and helpful too . i love you . " her mom hugs her back and says , " i love you too , anna . you are a curious and kind girl . i am proud of you . " tim and sam are brothers . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big dog . the dog is black and brown . it has sharp teeth and a loud bark .

" wow , look at that dog ! " tim says . he wants to pet the dog . he likes animals .

" be careful , tim ! " sam says . he is afraid of the dog . he thinks the dog is mean . he holds tim 's hand .

tim walks to the dog . he says , " hello , doggy . you are so big and furry . can i touch you ? "

the dog growls . it shows its teeth . it barks at tim . tim is scared . he trembles . he runs back to sam .

" let 's go , sam ! " tim says . he does not want to play with the dog anymore .

sam nods . he hugs tim . he says , " it 's okay , tim . the dog is gone . you are brave . "

they go home . they tell their mom what happened . their mom is glad they are safe . she gives them cookies and milk . she says , " you are good boys . you are tidy . you did not make a mess in the park . "

tim and sam smile . they eat their cookies and drink their milk . they are happy . they love their mom . tim and sam were brothers who liked to play with toys . one day , they saw a big box in the living room . it had a tag that said " for mom and dad " . they wondered what was inside .

" let 's open it and see ! " said tim , who was curious and naughty .

" no , we ca n't ! " said sam , who was careful and good . " it is a gift for mom and dad . they will be sad if we spoil it . "

but tim did not listen to sam . he tore the paper and opened the box . inside was a shiny new laptop . tim was happy and wanted to play with it .

" wow , look at this ! " he said . " it has a screen and a keyboard and a mouse . i bet it has games and videos and songs . let 's try it ! "

he turned on the laptop and started to click and type . he did not know what he was doing . he pressed the wrong buttons and deleted some files . he opened some programs and changed some settings . he made a big mess .

sam was scared and worried . he knew that tim was making a mistake . he tried to stop him .

" tim , stop it ! " he said . " you are breaking the laptop . you are hurting mom and dad 's brain . they need the laptop for their work and their study . they will be angry and disappointed . please , turn it off and wrap it back . "

but tim did not listen to sam . he was having too much fun . he ignored sam and kept playing . he did not care about mom and dad .

soon , mom and dad came home . they saw the box and the paper on the floor . they saw the laptop and the screen . they saw what tim had done . they were shocked and upset .

" tim , what have you done ? " they asked . " you have ruined our laptop . you have deleted our files . you have changed our settings . you have wasted our money . you have disobeyed our rules . you have been very bad . "

they scolded tim and punished him . they took away his toys and his tv . they made him go to his room and stay there . they did not talk to him or hug him . they were very mad .

tim felt sorry and ashamed . he realized that he had made a big mistake . he wished he had listened to sam . he wished he had not opened the box . he wished he had not played with the laptop . he wished he had been good .

he learned a lesson . he learned that he should not be curious and naughty . he learned that he should be careful and good . he learned that he should respect mom and dad 's gift . he learned that he should wrap it and leave it alone . he learned that he should use his brain and not hurt it . he learned that he should be mild and not wild . anna loves animals . she likes to pretend she is a veterinarian . she has a toy doctor kit and some stuffed animals . she puts them on her bed and checks them with her tools .

one day , she finds a bird in the garden . the bird is hurt . it has a broken wing and some blood . anna wants to help the bird . she brings it to her room and puts it on her bed . she says , " do n't worry , bird . i am a veterinarian . i will make you better . "

she takes her scissors and tries to cut the wing . she thinks she can make it shorter and fix it . but the bird is scared and in pain . it tries to fly away , but it ca n't . it makes a loud noise and bites anna 's finger . anna cries and drops the scissors . the scissors hit the bird and make more blood .

anna 's mom hears the noise and comes to the room . she sees the bird and the blood and the scissors . she is very angry and sad . she says , " anna , what did you do ? this is very bad . you hurt the bird and yourself . you are not a veterinarian . you are a naughty girl . "

she takes the bird and the scissors and leaves the room . she calls the real veterinarian and hopes they can save the bird . she puts a bandage on anna 's finger and tells her to stay in her room . she says , " you are in big trouble , young lady . you need to learn to be careful and kind with animals . you are not ready to pretend you are a veterinarian . " tom and lily were going to the airport with mom and dad . they were going to see grandma and grandpa , who lived far away . tom and lily were very happy , but also a little scared . they had never been on a plane before .

the airport was very big and noisy . there were many people and bags and cars and planes . tom and lily held mom and dad 's hands tightly . they saw a big sign that said " welcome " . they followed the sign to a place where they had to show their tickets and passports .

" hello , are you tom and lily ? " a nice lady asked them . she looked at their tickets and passports and smiled . " you are going to fly to grandma and grandpa 's house . how exciting ! here are some stickers for you . have a good trip ! "

" thank you ! " tom and lily said . they put the stickers on their shirts . they felt a little less scared . they liked the nice lady .

mom and dad took them to another place where they had to put their bags on a belt . the belt moved and took their bags away . tom and lily wondered where their bags were going .

" do n't worry , they will be on the plane with us , " mom said . " we will get them back when we land . "

then they went to another place where they had to wait for their plane . they saw a big window where they could see the planes outside . they saw one plane that looked like theirs . it had a blue tail and a red nose .

" look , there 's our plane ! " dad said . " it 's almost time to board . are you ready , tom and lily ? "

" yes , we are ready ! " tom and lily said . they were still a little scared , but also very curious . they wanted to see what it was like to fly in the sky . they wanted to see grandma and grandpa . they hoped they would like them and welcome them . they hugged mom and dad and walked to the gate . they were going on an adventure . anna likes to draw with pastels . she has many colors of pastels . she can make pink flowers , blue sky , green grass , and yellow sun . she likes to draw on big paper and hang it on the wall .

one day , anna wants to draw a new picture . she asks her mom to help her . her mom says yes and gives her a big paper . anna says thank you and starts to draw . she draws a big house with a red roof and a brown door . she draws a small dog with a black spot and a curly tail . she draws a happy family with four people and smiles .

but then , anna sees a problem . she has no more white pastel . she needs white to draw the clouds and the windows . she looks in her box of pastels , but she can not find any white . she feels sad and angry . she thinks her picture is ugly without white .

she asks her mom to help her again . her mom says , " do n't worry , anna . i have an idea . you can use this . " her mom gives her a white crayon . anna says , " but this is not a pastel . this is a crayon . " her mom says , " it 's okay . you can use it to draw white things . it will look nice . try it . "

anna tries it . she uses the white crayon to draw clouds and windows . she sees that it works . the white crayon makes white marks on the paper . she likes it . she finishes her picture and shows it to her mom . her mom says , " wow , anna . your picture is beautiful . you did a great job . i 'm proud of you . " anna says , " thank you , mom . you helped me a lot . i love you . " they hug and smile . anna hangs her picture on the wall . she is happy . tom and mia like to play with their toys . they have many toys : cars , dolls , blocks , books , and animals . sometimes they make a mess with their toys and mommy is not happy . she tells them to organize their toys and put them in the right boxes .

one day , tom and mia see a new toy in their room . it is a brown deer with big antlers and soft fur . they are very happy and want to play with it . they take it to the garden and pretend it is a real deer . they run with it , feed it grass , and hug it .

" hello , brown deer . what is your name ? " mia asks .

the deer does not answer . it only looks at them with its big eyes .

" maybe he is shy . let 's be nice to him , " tom says .

they play with the deer for a long time . they forget about their other toys . they forget about mommy .

mommy comes to the garden and sees the deer . she is very surprised . she sees the mess in their room . she is very angry .

" tom ! mia ! what is this ? where did you get this deer ? and why did you not organize your toys ? " mommy shouts .

tom and mia are scared . they do not know what to say . they look at the deer . the deer looks at them . the deer looks at mommy .

the deer speaks .

" hello , mommy . my name is rudy . i am a magic deer . i came to play with tom and mia . they are very nice to me . can i stay with them ? " the deer says .

mommy is very shocked . she does not know what to say . she looks at the deer . she looks at tom and mia . she looks at the mess .

she smiles .

" hello , rudy . you are a very special deer . i am glad you are nice to tom and mia . but you have to follow the rules . you have to help them organize their toys . and you have to be careful in the garden . can you do that ? " mommy says .

the deer nods .

" yes , mommy . i can do that . i want to be a good deer . i want to be a good friend , " the deer says .

tom and mia are very happy . they hug the deer . they hug mommy .

they go to their room and organize their toys . they put the deer in a special box . they say thank you to the deer . they say sorry to mommy .

they are a happy family . anna and ben like to play in the snow . they make a big snowman with a hat and a scarf . they give him a carrot nose and two coal eyes . they are very happy .

but then , a mean dog comes . he runs to the snowman and bites his nose . he pulls and pulls . anna and ben shout at him . " stop ! go away ! that is our snowman ! "

the dog does not listen . he snaps the snowman 's arm . he breaks it in half . he runs away with it . anna and ben are very sad . they cry .

they hug each other . they feel icy . they go inside . mom gives them hot cocoa and cookies . she tells them she is sorry . she says they can make another snowman tomorrow . she kisses them .

anna and ben feel better . they drink their cocoa and eat their cookies . they smile . they love mom . they love snow . they do not love mean dogs . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play in the park and pretend they were kings and queens of a big castle . one day , they found a shiny ring on the grass . it had a red stone that sparkled in the sun .

" wow , look at this ring ! it must be magic ! " lily said .

" maybe it belongs to a fairy or a wizard . let 's try it on ! " ben said .

they took turns to wear the ring and make wishes . lily wished for a pony , ben wished for a rocket . but nothing happened . they were sad and confused .

" maybe the ring is broken . or maybe it only works for someone who is very kind and compassionate , " lily said .

" who is the most compassionate person we know ? " ben asked .

they thought for a while . then they both said at the same time : " mom ! "

they decided to give the ring to their moms as a gift . they ran home and hugged their moms . they told them they found a special ring for them and that they loved them very much .

their moms were surprised and happy . they thanked their children and put on the ring . as soon as they did , they felt a warm and fuzzy feeling in their hearts . they smiled and said : " this is the best gift ever . you are very compassionate and generous , lily and ben . we are so proud of you . "

lily and ben were happy too . they realized that the ring was not magic , but it made their moms feel loved and appreciated . they learned that the best gifts are not the ones that you wish for , but the ones that you give from your heart . lily and ben were friends who liked to play sport . they had a ball and a net in the backyard . they took turns to shoot the ball into the net . they had fun and cheered for each other .

one day , a new boy moved in next door . his name was sam . he had a big toy gun that made loud noises . he saw lily and ben playing sport and wanted to join them . he said , " can i play with you ? i have a gun . we can shoot the ball and make it explode . "

lily and ben did not like the idea . they said , " no , thank you . we like to play sport . we do not like to shoot things . shooting is not a sport . it is dangerous and scary . you can hurt someone or break something . "

sam did not listen . he said , " you are boring . i am adventurous . i like to shoot things . it is fun and exciting . watch me . " he aimed his gun at the ball and pulled the trigger . the gun made a loud bang and the ball popped . lily and ben were shocked and sad . they liked their ball . it was their favorite toy .

sam laughed and said , " see ? i told you it was fun . do you want to try ? " lily and ben shook their heads . they said , " no , we do not . you are not adventurous . you are mean and rude . you ruined our game and our ball . you are not our friend . go away . "

sam felt sorry . he realized he had made a mistake . he said , " i am sorry . i did not mean to hurt you or your ball . i just wanted to play with you . i thought shooting was a sport . i did not know it was bad . can you forgive me ? can we be friends ? "

lily and ben thought for a moment . they said , " we forgive you . but you have to promise to never shoot things again . shooting is not a sport . it is not fun . it is wrong . you have to learn to play nice and respect others . then we can be friends . "

sam nodded . he said , " i promise . i will never shoot things again . i will learn to play nice and respect others . thank you for forgiving me . can we play sport together ? "

lily and ben smiled . they said , " yes , we can . we have another ball . we can share it with you . come on , let 's play sport together . "

they gave sam their ball and their net . they taught him how to shoot the ball into the net . they had fun and cheered for each other . they became friends who liked to play sport . they learned that shooting is not a sport . it is a bad thing . they learned that being adventurous is not about being dangerous . it is about being curious and trying new things . they learned that being friends is about being kind and caring . they learned a valuable lesson . lila and ben were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they saw a huge hill near their house . they wanted to climb it and see the view from the top .

" let 's go , lila ! " ben said . " it will be fun ! "

" ok , ben ! " lila said . " but we have to be careful . mom said not to go too far . "

they ran to the hill and started to climb . it was hard and steep , but they did not give up . they reached the top and looked around . they saw the trees , the flowers , the birds , and the sky . they also saw their house , very small and far away .

" wow , ben ! look at the view ! it is so pretty ! " lila said .

" yes , lila ! it is amazing ! " ben said . " we are so high ! "

they sat on the grass and enjoyed the view . they felt happy and proud . they did not notice the dark clouds that were coming . they did not hear the thunder that was rumbling . they did not see the lightning that was flashing .

suddenly , a loud boom made them jump . they looked up and saw a huge storm . they were scared and wanted to go home .

" ben , we have to go ! it is raining ! " lila said .

" yes , lila ! let 's go ! " ben said .

they got up and ran down the hill . but it was too late . the rain was heavy and the wind was strong . they slipped and fell . they hurt themselves and cried . they could not see the way . they were lost and alone .

they wished they had listened to mom . they wished they had not climbed the hill . they wished they had stayed home . they were sorry and sad . tom and sam were brothers who liked to play outside . one day , they found a big hill near their house . they wanted to climb the hill and see what was on the other side .

" let 's go , tom ! " sam said . " maybe we can find a sail or a treasure or a dragon ! "

tom nodded and followed sam . they ran up the hill , jumping over rocks and grass . they felt the wind in their hair and the sun on their skin . they were happy and curious .

when they reached the top of the hill , they saw a big lake . it was blue and shiny and had many waves . they also saw a boat with a sail on the lake . it was white and red and had people on it .

" wow , look at that sail ! " tom said . " it 's so pretty and fast ! "

sam agreed . he wanted to go on the boat and sail on the lake . he thought it would be fun and exciting .

" let 's go , tom ! " sam said . " maybe we can ask the people to let us sail with them ! "

tom shook his head . he was afraid of the water and the boat . he thought it would be scary and dangerous .

" no , sam , we ca n't go ! " tom said . " the water is deep and cold and the boat is big and loud . we do n't know the people and they do n't know us . they might be mean or angry or ignorant . "

sam frowned . he did n't understand why tom was so scared and worried . he thought tom was silly and boring .

" fine , tom , you stay here ! " sam said . " i 'm going to go and sail on the boat . you can watch me from here and be sad and lonely . "

sam ran down the hill , leaving tom behind . he did n't listen to tom 's calls and cries . he was ignorant and rude .

tom watched sam run away . he felt sad and lonely . he wished sam would come back and play with him . he wished they could find something else to do together . he wished they could be brothers again . ben liked to play with his toy cars . he had many cars of different colors and sizes . he liked to make them zoom and crash on the floor . he also liked to drink hot chocolate from his blue mug . his mug had a picture of a lion on it . ben thought lions were brave and strong .

one day , ben was playing with his cars in the living room . he saw his blue mug on the table . he wanted some hot chocolate . he climbed on the chair and reached for his mug . but he was not careful . he knocked over the mug and spilled hot chocolate all over the table and the floor . he was scared . he thought his mom would be angry .

he heard his mom coming . he hid behind the couch . he hoped his mom would not see the mess . his mom came into the living room . she saw the spilled hot chocolate . she saw the blue mug on the floor . she saw ben 's toy cars . she looked around . she saw ben behind the couch . she smiled .

she went to ben and picked him up . she hugged him and kissed him . she said , " ben , did you spill your hot chocolate ? " ben nodded . he said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i wanted some hot chocolate . i was not careful . i made a mess . " his mom said , " it 's okay , ben . accidents happen . i 'm not angry . i 'm glad you are not hurt . you are brave to tell me the truth . thank you for being honest . i love you . "

she took ben to the kitchen . she cleaned his face and hands . she made him a new mug of hot chocolate . she gave him a cookie . she said , " let 's go back to the living room and clean up the mess together . then we can play with your cars . how does that sound ? " ben smiled . he said , " that sounds good , mom . thank you for being nice . i love you too . " he hugged his mom and drank his hot chocolate . he felt happy . he thought his mom was brave and strong too . lily likes to play with her rag doll . she calls her doll ann . ann has a nice dress and a nice hat . lily hugs ann and talks to her every day .

one day , lily goes to the park with her mom . she brings ann with her . she sees other kids playing with different toys . some have balls , some have cars , some have teddy bears . lily thinks they look fun .

she puts ann on a bench and runs to join the other kids . she plays with a ball for a while , then with a car , then with a teddy bear . she forgets about ann .

ann is alone on the bench . she feels sad . she stares at lily and hopes she will come back soon . she misses her hugs and her talks .

a big dog comes to the bench . he smells ann . he thinks she is a toy . he grabs her with his mouth and runs away . he shakes her and bites her . he rips her dress and her hat . he makes her dirty and torn .

lily hears a loud bark . she looks at the bench . she sees the dog with ann . she screams . she runs to the dog . she tries to get ann back . she cries . she is angry and scared .

the dog drops ann and runs away . lily picks up ann . she hugs her . she says she is sorry . she says she loves her . she says she will never leave her again .

ann is happy . she stares at lily and smiles . she knows lily is her best friend . she knows lily will take care of her . she knows lily will make her nice again . lily and ben were going to the park with their mom . they got in the car and put on their seat belts . lily saw a shiny buckle on ben 's belt . she wanted to touch it .

