they ran to their snowman and gave him a hug . they thanked him for being their friend . they told him they would come back tomorrow .

then they went inside their house . their mom was waiting for them . she gave them some hot cocoa and some cookies . she wrapped them in a warm blanket . she kissed them on their cheeks .

they drank their cocoa by the stove . they felt cozy and happy . they looked out the window and saw their snowman . he was still smiling . sam liked to play with his toys in the sun . he had a lot of toys , but his favorite was a red car . he liked to make the car go fast and make loud noises . he also liked to comb his hair with a blue comb . he thought he looked very cool with his hair combed .

one day , sam took his car and his comb outside . he found a nice spot on the grass and started to play . he made the car zoom and beep and crash . he combed his hair and smiled . he did not notice that the sun was very hot and bright .

after a while , sam felt thirsty . he left his car and his comb on the grass and went to get some water . he drank a big cup and felt better . he decided to play some more . he ran back to the grass and looked for his car and his comb .

but he could not find them . he saw something red and something blue on the grass , but they did not look like his car and his comb . they looked like blobs . sam touched them and they were soft and sticky . he realized that the sun had melted his car and his comb . he felt very sad and angry . he cried and shouted .

his mom heard him and came to see what was wrong . she saw the melted car and comb and understood what had happened . she hugged sam and said , " i 'm sorry , sam . the sun was too hot for your car and your comb . they were not made for the sun . they were made for the shade . next time , you should play with them in the shade or inside . then they will not melt . "

sam nodded and wiped his tears . he said , " ok , mom . i will play with them in the shade or inside . but can i have a new car and a new comb ? i liked them a lot . "

his mom smiled and said , " of course , sam . you can have a new car and a new comb . but you have to be careful with them . and you have to be persistent . you have to keep trying and learning and having fun . that 's what makes you cool , not your car or your comb . "

sam smiled and said , " ok , mom . i will be persistent . i will keep trying and learning and having fun . thank you , mom . i love you . "

his mom said , " i love you too , sam . now let 's go and find you a new car and a new comb . " ben and sam are brothers . they like to play with cars and balls . but they hate to share . they always fight for the same toy .

one day , a man comes to their house . he is their uncle . he brings a big box for them . he says , " hello , ben and sam . i have a surprise for you . do you want to see ? "

ben and sam nod . they are curious . they hope the box has something fun inside . they follow the uncle to the living room . he opens the box . inside , there are two bikes . one is red and one is blue .

" wow ! " ben and sam say . they are very happy . they love bikes . they run to the box and grab a bike each . ben takes the red one and sam takes the blue one .

" thank you , uncle ! " they say . they hug the uncle . he smiles . he is glad to see them happy .

" now , you can ride your bikes outside . but be careful and share the road . and do n't fight , okay ? " the uncle says .

" okay , uncle . we wo n't fight . we will share and be nice , " ben and sam say . they mean it . they do n't hate each other . they are brothers . they love each other .

they take their bikes outside . they ride them around the yard . they have fun . they are glad they have bikes . and they are glad they have an uncle who loves them . ben and sam are brothers . they like to play with cars and trucks . one day , they find a big box in the garage . they think it is a good place to hide and make noises .

they go inside the box and close the lid . they pretend they are driving a fast car . they say " vroom , vroom , beep , beep " . they laugh and have fun . they do not hear their mom calling them for lunch .

their mom looks for them in the house . she does not see them . she gets worried . she goes to the garage . she sees the big box . she thinks it is empty . she wants to move it to the trash . she pushes the box to the left .

the box is heavy . she does not know ben and sam are inside . she hears a loud thud . she opens the lid . she sees ben and sam . they are hurt and crying . they have bumps on their heads . they are scared and sad .

their mom is shocked and sorry . she hugs them and says " i 'm so sorry , i did not know you were in the box . why did you not answer me when i called you ? you should not play in the garage . it is dangerous and noisy . come , let 's go to the doctor . i hope you are okay . " lily and max were playing in the garden . they liked to look at the flowers and smell them . lily saw a big yellow flower with many petals . she ran to it and said , " look , max , a sunflower ! "

max followed her and looked at the flower . he frowned and said , " that 's not a sunflower , lily . that 's a daisy . sunflowers are bigger and have seeds in the middle . "

lily shook her head and said , " no , max , this is a sunflower . i recognize it from the book we read . see , it has a face and it smiles at the sun . "

max was not convinced . he said , " but the book also said that sunflowers grow very tall and have long stems . this flower is short and has a thin stem . and it does n't have a face , lily . that 's just your imagination . "

lily felt uncomfortable . she did not like it when max said she was wrong . she said , " well , maybe this is a baby sunflower . maybe it will grow bigger and have seeds later . and maybe it has a face that only i can see . you are just being mean , max . "

max felt sorry . he did not want to make lily sad . he said , " i 'm sorry , lily . i did n't mean to be mean . maybe you are right . maybe this is a baby sunflower . and maybe it has a face that only you can see . can i see it too ? "

lily smiled and said , " sure , max . come closer and look . maybe the sunflower will smile at you too . "

they both leaned in and looked at the flower . they saw a tiny bee buzzing around it . they laughed and said , " hello , bee . do you like the sunflower too ? " lily and max are friends . they like to play with toys and run in the park . one day , they find a big bell in the park . it is shiny and round . lily wants to ring the bell . she thinks it will be fun .

" let me ring the bell , max ! " lily says . she tries to reach the rope that hangs from the bell .

" no , lily , it is my turn ! " max says . he pulls the rope away from lily . he wants to ring the bell too .

they both tug on the rope . they are angry and sad . they do not share the bell . they do not have fun .

a lady sees them . she is kind and wise . she walks to them and smiles .

" hello , children . why are you fighting over the bell ? " she asks .

" we both want to ring the bell . it is fun ! " lily and max say .

" i see . but do you know what is more fun than ringing the bell ? " the lady asks .

" what ? " lily and max ask .

" ringing the bell together ! " the lady says . she shows them how to hold the rope with both hands and pull it gently . the bell makes a loud and happy sound .

lily and max laugh . they ring the bell together . they take turns and say sorry . they are friends again .

the lady hugs them . she says , " you are very good children . you learned how to share and be kind . that is tough , but it is also fun . now , go and play some more . have a wonderful day ! "

lily and max thank the lady . they run and play in the park . they have fun . they ring the bell again and again . they are happy . lily and ben are friends . they like to play games together . today , they have a new game . it is a game with cards and pictures . they want to learn the game .

" let 's study the rules first , " lily says . she opens the box and takes out a booklet . she looks at the words and the pictures . " we have to match the cards with the same pictures . and we have to say the name of the picture out loud . "

ben nods . he takes some cards and looks at them . he sees a cat , a dog , a ball , and a car . he tries to say the names . " cat , dog , ball , car , " he says slowly . he is proud of himself .

lily smiles . she takes some cards too . she sees a flower , a bird , a hat , and a book . she says the names . " flower , bird , hat , book , " she says clearly . she is happy .

they are ready to play the game . they shuffle the cards and put them face down on the floor . they take turns to flip two cards and see if they match . if they match , they keep them and say the name . if they do n't match , they put them back and try again .

they have fun playing the game . they learn new words and pictures . they help each other and cheer for each other . they are comfortable and cozy on the floor . they are good friends . tim and mia are playing in the park . they have a ball and a string . tim throws the ball and mia tries to catch it . sometimes she does , sometimes she does not . they laugh and have fun .

a big dog comes to the park . he sees the ball and the string . he wants to play too . he runs to tim and mia and barks . he grabs the string with his teeth and pulls . tim and mia are scared . they let go of the string . the dog runs away with the ball and the string .

" hey , that is our ball and string ! " tim shouts . " come back , dog ! "

mia starts to cry . she liked the ball and the string . she is sad and angry . she says to tim , " that dog is bad . he took our things . he is not nice . "

tim hugs mia . he says , " do n't cry , mia . we can find another ball and string . or we can play something else . the dog is not bad . he just wanted to play too . maybe he did not know that the ball and the string were ours . "

mia wipes her tears . she says , " maybe you are right , tim . maybe the dog did not know . but he should ask first . and he should give back our things . the string was my favorite . it was red and shiny . and the ball was yours . it was blue and bouncy . "

tim nods . he says , " maybe we can find the dog and ask him to give back our things . or maybe we can share with him . he might be lonely . he might need a friend . "

mia thinks . she says , " ok , tim . let 's try to find the dog . but if he is mean , we will run away . and if he is nice , we will be nice too . but he has to share . and he has to say sorry . "

tim and mia hold hands . they look for the dog . they hope he is not bitter . they hope he is friendly . they hope they can play together . sara and ben were twins who liked to play in the garden . they had a special spot where they planted some seeds with their mom . every day , they watered the seeds and waited for them to grow .

one morning , they woke up early and ran to the garden . they wanted to see the sunrise and the flowers . they saw a big , bright ball of light in the sky . it made the sky pink and orange and yellow . they said , " wow , look at the sunrise ! it is so pretty ! "

then they looked at their spot and saw something new . some of the seeds had turned into flowers . they had petals of different colors and shapes . they smelled sweet and fresh . they said , " wow , look at the flowers ! they have bloomed ! "

they ran to their mom and dad and told them what they saw . they said , " mom , dad , come and see ! our seeds have bloomed ! they are so beautiful ! "

mom and dad smiled and hugged them . they said , " we are so proud of you ! you have taken good care of your seeds . you have learned about the sunrise and the flowers . you have grown up so much ! "

sara and ben felt happy and warm . they said , " thank you , mom and dad ! we love you ! we love the sunrise and the flowers ! "

they went back to the garden and picked some flowers . they gave them to their mom and dad as a gift . they said , " these are for you ! they are from our spot ! "

mom and dad thanked them and kissed them . they said , " these are the best gifts ever ! they are from your hearts ! "

they all sat in the garden and watched the sunrise and the flowers . they felt the sun on their faces and the breeze on their hair . they said , " this is a wonderful day ! we are a happy family ! " tom and sue are friends . they like to play with toys . one day , they find a laser in the garage . it is shiny and red . they do not know what it does .

" look , a laser ! " tom says . " let 's play with it ! "

" ok ! " sue says . " but be careful . it might be dangerous . "

they take the laser to the backyard . they point it at things . they see a bright light . they hear a zapping sound . they think it is fun .

they see a cat on the fence . it is black and furry . tom points the laser at the cat . he presses the button .

" zap ! " the laser hits the cat . the cat makes a loud noise . it jumps off the fence . it runs away .

" ha ha ! " tom laughs . " that was funny ! "

" no , it was not ! " sue says . " that was mean ! you hurt the cat ! "

sue is angry . she takes the laser from tom . she points it at tom . she presses the button .

" zap ! " the laser hits tom . tom feels a pain . he screams . he falls to the ground .

sue sees what she did . she is scared . she drops the laser . she runs to tom .

" tom , tom , are you ok ? " sue cries . " i 'm sorry , i 'm sorry ! "

but tom does not answer . he does not move . he does not breathe . his skin is smooth . the laser removed his face .

the end . ben and lily were best friends . they liked to play in the park . there was a big slide in the park . it was very old and rusty . ben and lily called it the ancient slide .

one day , they decided to perform a show on the slide . they wore funny hats and scarves . they climbed up the ladder and took turns sliding down . they made silly noises and faces . they pretended to be animals and monsters .

some other kids came to watch . they clapped and laughed . ben and lily felt happy . they bowed and said thank you .

" can we join you ? " one of the kids asked .

" sure ! " ben and lily said . " the more , the merrier ! "

they invited the other kids to the ancient slide . they shared their hats and scarves . they made up new stories and games . they had a lot of fun . they made new friends . they loved the ancient slide . tim and lily were twins who liked to play together . one day , they saw a big package on the porch . it had their names on it . they ran to the door and asked their mom if they could open it .

" sure , but be careful . it 's a gift from your grandma . she made something original for you , " mom said .

tim and lily tore the paper and saw two dolls inside . one was a boy with blue eyes and brown hair , like tim . the other was a girl with green eyes and blond hair , like lily . they were very happy and hugged the dolls .

" thank you , grandma ! " they shouted .

they decided to play with the dolls in their room . tim picked the boy doll and lily picked the girl doll . they pretended they were going on a picnic . they put some toys and snacks in a basket and laid a blanket on the floor .

" let 's go , dollies ! " tim said .

" wait , i want to change my doll 's clothes , " lily said .

she took off the girl doll 's dress and put on a different one . she liked to dress up her dolls .

" no , do n't do that ! " tim said . " that 's not the original dress . grandma made it for her . you have to keep it on . "

" i do n't care . i like this one better . it 's prettier , " lily said .

she put the original dress in the basket .

tim got angry . he grabbed the dress from the basket and tried to put it back on the girl doll .

" give it back ! it 's mine ! " lily said .

she pulled the dress from tim 's hand and tore it .

" hey , stop it ! you ruined it ! " tim said .

he pushed lily and she fell on the floor . she started to cry .

mom heard the noise and came to the room . she saw the torn dress , the crying lily and the angry tim .

" what happened here ? " mom asked .

she was very upset . she took the dolls and the basket away from them .

" you two are very naughty . you do n't appreciate grandma 's gift . you do n't share . you do n't play nice . you have to go to your beds and think about what you did , " mom said .

she sent them to their beds and closed the door .

tim and lily felt very sorry . they wished they had not fought over the dress . they wished they had not hurt each other . they wished they had not made mom and grandma sad . they wished they could say sorry and hug and play again . but it was too late . they had to stay in their beds and be quiet . they had no dolls , no picnic , no fun . they had a bad ending . anna loves her dog , spot . spot is a loyal friend . he always follows anna and plays with her . he likes to fetch the ball and run in the park . he also likes to cuddle with anna at night .

one day , anna and spot go to the pet store . anna wants to buy a new brush for spot . she thinks he needs a soft and shiny brush to make his fur look nice . she sees many brushes on the shelf . she picks one and shows it to spot .

" do you like this brush , spot ? " anna asks . " can you guess what color it is ? "

spot looks at the brush . he sees that it is red . he knows the word red . he barks once .

" good boy , spot ! you guessed right ! it is red ! " anna says . she is proud of spot . she hugs him and puts the brush in the basket .

they go to the cashier and pay for the brush . then they go home . anna brushes spot with the new brush . spot enjoys it . he wags his tail and licks anna 's face .

anna and spot are very happy . they love each other very much . they are the best friends in the world . lily liked to write stories . she had a big book and a red pen . she wrote about animals and fairies and pirates . she wrote every day after school .

one day , she went to the farm with her mom and dad . she saw many animals there . she saw cows and pigs and chickens and horses . she also saw a goat . the goat was white and had horns and a beard . lily wanted to write a story about the goat .

she asked her mom , " can i write a story about the goat ? "

her mom said , " sure , but be careful . the goat might eat your book . "

lily said , " okay , i will be careful . " she went to the goat and said hello . the goat said , " baa . "

lily said , " i like you , goat . you are very nice . can i write a story about you ? "

the goat said , " baa . "

lily said , " thank you , goat . i will write a good story . " she opened her book and started to write . she wrote , " once upon a time , there was a goat who lived on a farm . he was very brave and smart and kind . he liked to eat grass and flowers and hay . he had many friends on the farm . he was happy . "

she looked at the goat and smiled . the goat looked at her and smiled . he was sleepy . he lay down on the grass and closed his eyes . lily said , " you are sleepy , goat . you can take a nap . i will finish the story . "

she wrote , " one day , the goat had a big adventure . he saw a fairy in the woods . the fairy was lost and scared . the goat helped the fairy find her way home . the fairy was grateful and gave the goat a magic wish . the goat wished for more grass and flowers and hay . the fairy made his wish come true . the goat was very happy . he thanked the fairy and went back to the farm . he told his friends about his adventure . they were amazed and proud . he ate his grass and flowers and hay . he was sleepy . he lay down on the grass and closed his eyes . he dreamed of fairies and magic . he was happy . the end . "

lily closed her book and put her pen away . she looked at the goat . he was still sleeping . he looked happy . she said , " goodbye , goat . i hope you like my story . you are a good goat . i will come back and visit you again . "

she went to her mom and dad . they said , " did you write a story about the goat ? "

she said , " yes , i did . it is a good story . do you want to hear it ? "

they said , " yes , we do . we are proud of you . you are a good writer . "

they sat down on a bench and listened to lily 's story . they liked it very much . they clapped and hugged her . she was happy . she was sleepy . she lay down on the bench and closed her eyes . she dreamed of stories . she was happy . the end . tom and mia were playing in the garden . they saw a big orange pumpkin on the ground . tom wanted to touch it , but mia said no .

" why not ? " tom asked .

" because it might be a sneezy pumpkin , " mia said .

" what is a sneezy pumpkin ? " tom wondered .

" a sneezy pumpkin is a pumpkin that makes you sneeze when you touch it . it is very silly and funny , but also very annoying , " mia explained .

tom did not believe mia . he thought she was making it up . he reached out his hand to touch the pumpkin . but as soon as he touched it , he felt a tickle in his nose . he sneezed so hard that he fell backwards .

" achoo ! " tom sneezed .

" see ? i told you it was a sneezy pumpkin , " mia said .

tom rubbed his nose and looked at the pumpkin . he saw that it had a small hole on the side . he realized that it was not a real pumpkin , but a hollow one with some pepper inside . someone had played a trick on them .

" who did this ? " tom asked .

" i do n't know . maybe it was sam . he likes to play jokes on us , " mia guessed .

tom and mia decided to find sam and get him back . they picked up the sneezy pumpkin and carried it to sam 's house . they knocked on the door and waited . when sam opened the door , they threw the sneezy pumpkin at him and ran away .

" surprise ! " tom and mia shouted .

sam caught the sneezy pumpkin and looked at it . he felt a tickle in his nose . he sneezed so hard that he dropped the pumpkin .

" achoo ! " sam sneezed .

tom and mia laughed and hid behind a bush . they thought it was a harmless joke . they did not know that sam was allergic to pepper . he sneezed and sneezed and sneezed until his mom came and took him to the doctor . ben was a big boy who liked to play with his toys . he had a hero doll that he loved very much . he pretended that his hero doll could save the world from bad guys and monsters . he made his hero doll fly and fight and talk .

one day , ben was playing with his hero doll in the garden . he saw a little bird on the ground . the bird looked hurt and scared . it could not fly . ben felt sorry for the bird . he wanted to help it . he picked up the bird gently and put it in a box . he gave it some water and seeds .

ben asked his mom what to do with the bird . his mom said they should take it to the vet . the vet could make the bird better . ben agreed . he took his hero doll and the box with the bird to the car . he held them close to his chest .

on the way to the vet , ben looked at the bird . the bird blinked its eyes at him . ben smiled . he said to the bird , " do n't worry , you will be okay . the vet will help you . you are brave and strong , like my hero doll . "

ben looked at his hero doll . he saw that his hero doll had a smile too . he felt happy . he realized that he was a hero too . he had helped a living thing that needed him . he learned that being a hero was not only about fighting and flying , but also about caring and helping .

the end . anna was a thoughtful girl who liked to help others . she often visited her grandma , who was old and used a cane to walk . anna liked to talk to her grandma and listen to her stories .

one day , anna saw a big bag of apples at the market . she thought they would make a nice gift for her grandma , who loved apples . she asked the seller how much they cost . the seller said they cost one coin for each apple .

anna counted her coins . she had five coins . she could buy five apples , but the bag had more than five apples . she wanted to buy the whole bag for her grandma . she had an idea . she asked the seller if he had a scale to weigh the apples .

the seller nodded and brought out a scale . he put the bag of apples on one side and a weight on the other side . the scale balanced . he said the bag of apples weighed the same as the weight .

anna looked at the weight . it had a number on it . the number was ten . anna thought hard . she remembered that her grandma 's cane also had a number on it . the number was ten . she wondered if her grandma 's cane weighed the same as the bag of apples .

she asked the seller if he would trade the bag of apples for her grandma 's cane . the seller was surprised , but he agreed . he gave anna the bag of apples and took her grandma 's cane .

anna was happy . she ran to her grandma 's house with the bag of apples . she knocked on the door and gave her grandma the bag of apples . she said she traded her grandma 's cane for the apples .

her grandma was shocked . she asked anna why she did that . she said she needed her cane to walk . she said she could not walk without her cane .

anna felt sad . she did not think of that . she wanted to make her grandma happy , but she made her unhappy . she said she was sorry . she said she would get her cane back .

she ran back to the market with the bag of apples . she looked for the seller , but he was gone . he had left with her grandma 's cane . anna cried . she did not know what to do .

a kind man saw anna crying . he asked her what was wrong . anna told him what happened . the kind man felt sorry for anna . he said he had a spare cane at home . he said he would give it to anna if she gave him the bag of apples .

anna was grateful . she thanked the kind man and gave him the bag of apples . he gave her the spare cane . he said it was a good trade . he said he liked apples and he did not need two canes .

anna smiled . she ran back to her grandma 's house with the spare cane . she knocked on the door and gave her grandma the spare cane . she said she got it from a kind man who traded it for the bag of apples .

her grandma was relieved . she hugged anna and thanked her . she said she was proud of her . she said she was a thoughtful girl who learned from her mistake . she said she loved her .

anna was happy . she hugged her grandma and said she loved her too . she said she learned a lesson . she said she would never trade something important for something less important . she said she would always think of the consequences of her actions .

the end . lily and ben went to the park with mom . they saw a big truck with a picture of ice cream on it . mom said they could have one ice cream each .

lily and ben ran to the truck and looked at all the flavors . lily wanted chocolate and ben wanted strawberry . they told the man what they wanted and he gave them ice cream in cones .

" thank you , mister ! " lily and ben said . they licked their ice cream and smiled . it was cold and sweet and yummy .

they walked to a bench and sat down . mom sat with them and watched the birds and the flowers . it was a beautiful day .

lily leaned over to ben and said , " can i try your ice cream ? i like strawberry too . "

ben leaned over to lily and said , " ok , but only a little bit . can i try your ice cream ? i like chocolate too . "

they swapped their cones and took a bite . they liked each other 's ice cream , but they liked their own more .

they gave back their cones and finished their ice cream . they wiped their mouths and hands with a napkin .

" did you enjoy your ice cream ? " mom asked .

" yes , mom , it was delicious ! " lily and ben said .

they hugged mom and said , " we love you , mom ! "

mom hugged them back and said , " i love you too , my sweeties ! " lily liked to play with yarn . she had many colors of yarn in a big box . she made yarn dolls , yarn balls , yarn hats and yarn scarves . she was very happy with her yarn .

but her mom did not like the yarn . she said the yarn was messy . she said the yarn made the floor dirty . she said the yarn was not for playing , but for knitting . she told lily to put the yarn away and rest .

lily did not want to put the yarn away . she wanted to play more . she said no to her mom . she ran to her room with the yarn . she closed the door and locked it .

her mom was angry . she knocked on the door and said , " lily , open the door right now ! you have to listen to me ! you have to rest and clean up the yarn ! "

lily did not open the door . she ignored her mom . she played with the yarn on her bed . she made a big yarn castle . she pretended she was a yarn princess . she was very happy with her yarn .

but then , something bad happened . the yarn castle was too big . it fell down on lily . it covered her head and body . it tangled her hair and arms and legs . it made her itch and sneeze . it was not fun anymore . it was scary .

lily cried for help . she said , " mom , mom , help me ! i 'm sorry ! i 'm stuck in the yarn ! "

her mom heard her cry . she ran to the door and opened it with a key . she saw lily in the yarn . she felt sorry for her . she said , " oh , lily , what have you done ? you made a big mess with the yarn ! "

she helped lily out of the yarn . she hugged her and kissed her . she said , " it 's okay , lily . i 'm not mad at you . i love you . but you have to be careful with the yarn . it 's not a toy . it can hurt you . "

lily said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i love you too . i wo n't play with the yarn anymore . i 'll put it away and rest . "

her mom smiled and said , " that 's a good girl . come on , let 's go to the living room . i 'll show you how to knit with the yarn . it 's fun and easy . you 'll like it . "

lily nodded and said , " okay , mom . let 's go . maybe i can make a yarn doll for you . "

they went to the living room . they sat on the couch . they took some yarn and needles . they started to knit . they were happy with the yarn . tom and sam were best friends . they liked to play with cars and trucks . one day , they saw a big factory near their home . they wanted to see what was inside .

" let 's go in and look , " tom said . " maybe we can find some cool things . "

" no , we ca n't , " sam said . " it is not safe . mom and dad said we should not go near the factory . it is dirty and noisy and dangerous . "

but tom did not listen . he ran to the factory gate and opened it . he saw many machines and pipes and wires . he thought they were fun . he ran inside and touched everything .

sam followed him . he was scared . he tried to stop tom , but tom did not listen . he kept running and touching .

suddenly , a loud alarm went off . the machines started to move and make noise . tom and sam were trapped . they could not find the way out . they were very afraid .

they started to cry . they cried for help , but no one heard them . they cried for mom and dad , but they were not there . they cried for each other , but they could not help .

they cried and cried until they heard a voice . it was a man . he worked at the factory . he heard the alarm and came to see what was wrong . he saw tom and sam and he was angry .

" what are you doing here ? " he shouted . " you should not be here . you could have been hurt or killed . you are very lucky i found you . come with me . i will take you to your parents . they will be very worried and very mad . "

tom and sam stopped crying . they felt ashamed and sorry . they followed the man out of the factory . they saw their parents waiting for them . they were very worried and very mad .

