they felt sad for frosty , but they still had many other toys and books to play with . they decided to read a cheerful story about a snowman who did not melt . they smiled and hugged each other . they loved their room and their bookshelf . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in the park . but they do not like to share . anna wants to swing on the swing . ben wants to slide on the slide . they both think they are right .

they run to the play area . anna gets to the swing first . she sits on it and starts to swing . ben gets to the slide second . he climbs up the ladder and waits . he wants to slide down . but anna is in his way . he says , " move , anna ! i want to slide ! "

