anna and ben stop yelling . they look at the view . they see the trees , the flowers , the birds , the sun . they see the other kids playing . they see the sandbox , the seesaw , the merry - go - round . they think . they feel silly . they say , " sorry , mom . sorry , anna . sorry , ben . you are right . we can share . we can play together . we can have fun . "

mom smiles . she says , " good , anna and ben . i am proud of you . now , go and enjoy the park . but remember , be kind and fair . " anna and ben nod . they hug mom . they hug each other . they run to the play area . they swing and slide . they laugh and sing . they are happy . lily and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys and draw pictures . one day , they find a big box of crayons and paper in the closet . they are very happy and start to make pictures of their family , their pets and their favorite things .

