lily and ben nod . they understand . they say sorry to each other and to mom . they hug and make up . they pick up their pictures and smooth them out . they find two red crayons and other colors . they start to draw again . they share and take turns . they listen to each other . they are obedient .

mom smiles and hugs them . she is proud of them . she likes their pictures . she hangs them on the wall . they are bright and shiny and make everything look nice . anna liked to play with her hair . she had long hair that was brown and soft . she liked to make braids and bows and clips . she liked to look at herself in the mirror and smile .

one day , anna went with her mom to the barber . the barber was a nice man who cut hair . he had scissors and a comb and a cape . he said hello to anna and her mom and asked them to sit down .

" anna , do you want to cut your hair ? " the barber asked .

anna shook her head . she did not want to cut her hair . she liked her long hair .

