anna shook her head again . she did not want to make it shorter and neater . she liked her long hair .

the barber looked at anna 's mom . anna 's mom nodded . she wanted anna to cut her hair . she said it was too hard to wash and comb and dry .

" anna , please listen to your mom . she knows what is best for you . if you cut your hair , you will look very pretty and fresh . and you can still play with your hair and make braids and bows and clips . you will also have more time to do other things , like read and draw and play with your toys . and you know what ? your hair will grow back . it will not stay short forever . it will bloom like a flower in the spring . do you like flowers , anna ? " the barber said .

