anna smiled . she liked her hair . she thanked the barber and gave him a hug . she thanked her mom and gave her a hug . she took her hair that he cut and put it in a bag . she wanted to keep it . she wanted to see if it would bloom like a flower . tom has a parrot . his parrot is playful . he likes to talk and sing and fly . tom loves his parrot very much .

one day , tom and his parrot are playing in the living room . tom has a book . he wants to read the book to his parrot . he opens the book and says , " look , parrot , this is a story about a pirate and a treasure . do you want to hear it ? "

the parrot nods and says , " yes , yes , yes ! i like pirates and treasures . tell me , tell me , tell me ! "

tom starts to read the book . he shows the parrot the pictures . the parrot likes the pictures . he sees a pirate with a hat and a hook and a sword . he sees a ship with a flag and a cannon and a sail . he sees an island with a palm tree and a chest and a map .

the parrot gets excited . he wants to be a pirate too . he jumps on the book and says , " arrr , arrr , arrr ! i am a pirate parrot . i want the treasure . give me the map , give me the map , give me the map ! "

tom is surprised . he tries to pull the book away from the parrot . he says , " no , no , no ! parrot , stop , stop , stop ! this is my book . you ca n't have the map . you ca n't be a pirate . you are a parrot . be nice , be nice , be nice ! "

but the parrot does not listen . he bites the book with his beak . he tears the book with his claws . he rips the book with his wings . he makes a big mess . he says , " ha , ha , ha ! i am a pirate parrot . i have the map . i have the treasure . i am the best , i am the best , i am the best ! "

tom is sad . he sees his book torn and ruined . he says , " parrot , why , why , why ? you are a bad parrot . you are a mean parrot . you are a naughty parrot . you broke my book . you made me cry . you are not my friend , you are not my friend , you are not my friend ! "

the parrot sees tom crying . he feels sorry . he says , " oh , oh , oh ! i am sorry , i am sorry , i am sorry ! i was not a pirate parrot . i was a silly parrot . i was a bad parrot . i was a naughty parrot . i did not mean to break your book . i did not mean to make you cry . i did not mean to be not your friend . please forgive me , please forgive me , please forgive me ! "

tom looks at the parrot . he sees his eyes and his feathers and his beak . he remembers how playful and funny and sweet he is . he says , " parrot , i forgive you , i forgive you , i forgive you ! you are not a bad parrot . you are not a mean parrot . you are not a naughty parrot . you are a playful parrot . you are a funny parrot . you are a sweet parrot . you are my friend , you are my friend , you are my friend ! "

tom hugs the parrot . the parrot hugs tom . they say , " i love you , i love you , i love you ! " they clean up the mess . they find another book . they read another story . they are happy . they are friends . the end . lily and ben are friends . they like to play with blocks . they have many blocks of different colors and shapes . they can make houses , towers , cars and animals with blocks .

one day , they decide to make a big castle with blocks . they work hard and use all the blocks they have . they put blocks on top of blocks , and make walls and windows and doors . they are very jolly and proud of their castle .

