the boy smiles . he wipes his tears and says , " i am sorry . i am nice . my name is sam . "

lily and ben smile too . they say , " hello , sam . we are lily and ben . we are your friends . "

they give sam some blocks and start to make a new castle . they have fun and laugh and talk . they are jolly and happy . they have a new friend . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . they saw a big tree with many leaves . they wanted to climb the tree and see the birds .

they ran to the tree and looked for a way to go up . tom saw a branch that was low and strong . he grabbed it and pulled himself up . he said to lily , " come on , i will help you . "

lily tried to reach the branch , but it was too high for her . she saw a stick that was long and thin . she thought it could help her . she picked up the stick and leaned it on the branch . she said to tom , " i will use this stick to climb . "

tom said , " be careful , the stick might break . " lily said , " no , it is fine . watch me . " she stepped on the stick and pushed herself up . but the stick was not fine . it was broken . it snapped in half and lily fell down .

lily cried out loud . she hurt her knee and her elbow . tom saw her and climbed down quickly . he ran to her and hugged her . he said , " i 'm sorry , lily . are you okay ? "

