he helped her stand up and walk to the bench . he saw a figure coming to them . it was their mom . she had a bag with water and bandages . she said , " what happened , my loves ? why are you crying ? "

tom and lily told her what happened . she said , " oh , my poor babies . you had a bad accident . but i 'm here to help you . let me see your wounds . i will clean them and put bandages on them . then you will feel better . "

she did what she said . she cleaned their wounds and put bandages on them . she gave them water and a hug . she said , " there , there . you are okay now . you are strong and brave . i 'm proud of you . how do you feel ? "

tom and lily felt better . they said , " thank you , mom . we love you . you are the best . " mom said , " i love you too , my loves . you are the best . now , do you want to go home or play some more ? "

