they were very happy . they had an incredible day . they learned how to make pictures with stickers and papers . they also learned how to share and clean up . they thanked the teacher and went home with their pictures . they showed them to their parents and friends . everyone liked their pictures . sam and lily were best friends . they liked to play in the school yard . one day , tom and lily went to the museum with their mom . they liked to see the old things that people made long ago . they saw pots and paintings and clothes and tools . but their favorite thing was the display of spears . the spears were big and sharp and shiny . they looked like they could hurt someone .

" mom , can we touch the spears ? " tom asked .

" no , you ca n't . they are very old and fragile . and they are dangerous . you could cut yourself or break them . you have to stay behind the rope , " mom said .

but tom was adventurous . he wanted to feel the spears . he thought they were cool and fun . he waited until mom and lily were looking at something else . then he sneaked under the rope and reached for a spear .

" tom , do n't ! " lily shouted .

but it was too late . tom grabbed the spear and pulled it . but the spear was heavy and stuck . tom lost his balance and fell . the spear came down with him and poked him in the leg . tom screamed in pain and blood . mom and lily ran to him . the museum guard came too . he was angry and scared .

" what have you done ? you are not supposed to touch the spears . they are very valuable and rare . and you are hurt . you need a doctor . come with me , " the guard said .

he took tom and mom and lily to his office . he called an ambulance and the police . he said tom had to pay for the damage and the trouble . tom was in trouble . he was sorry and sad . he wished he had listened to mom . he learned a hard lesson . he never touched a spear again . lily and max were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . they saw some wild birds on the grass . they had red and blue and yellow feathers . they were very pretty .

