but lily did not listen . she ran to the birds . she tried to hug one . but the bird did not like it . it flapped its wings . it pecked at lily 's hand . it made a loud noise .

" ow ! " lily cried . she let go of the bird . she ran back to max . she had a red mark on her hand . it hurt a lot .

" i told you not to hug them ! " max said . he was angry and worried . he took a napkin from his pocket . he wrapped it around lily 's hand . he hoped it would make it better .

" i 'm sorry , max , " lily said . she was sad and sorry . she hugged max . " you are a good brother . thank you for the napkin . "

max hugged lily back . he was not angry anymore . he was glad she was okay . " you are welcome , lily . you are a good sister . but next time , listen to me , okay ? "

" okay , max , " lily said . they smiled at each other . they went back to playing . they had fun . but they stayed away from the wild birds . tom and lily are twins . they like to play in the garden . there are many flowers and trees and a big hedge . the hedge has a hole that they can crawl through . on the other side , there is a pond with ducks and frogs .

one day , tom and lily decide to go to the pond . they put on their boots and coats and crawl through the hedge . they see the ducks and frogs and want to feed them . they have some bread in their pockets .

" here , duckies , here , froggies , have some bread ! " tom says , throwing some crumbs into the water .

" me too , me too ! " lily says , following him .

but lily is not careful . she steps on a wet stone and slips . she falls into the pond with a splash .

" help , help , i 'm wet ! " lily cries .

tom hears her and runs to her . he reaches out his hand and pulls her out of the pond .

" are you okay , lily ? " tom asks , hugging her .

" i 'm okay , tom , but i 'm cold and wet and muddy , " lily says , shivering .

" let 's go back to the house and get dry and warm , " tom says .

they crawl back through the hedge and run to the house . their mom sees them and smiles .

" what happened to you two ? " she asks , gently .

