" oh , you poor thing , come here , let me dry you off , " mom says , taking lily in her arms .

she wraps her in a towel and gives her a kiss .

" next time , be more careful , okay ? " she says .

" okay , mom , we will , " lily says .

tom and lily are happy . they love their mom and their garden and their pond . they are the best twins ever . sara liked to play with her toy bunny . she called him hoppy and he was very dependable . he always stayed with her when she was sad or scared . he was soft and white and had long ears .

one day , sara and her mom went to the farm . sara wanted to see the animals and the corn . she brought hoppy with her and held him tight . mom said they could walk in the corn field , but they had to stay close . sara nodded and followed mom .

the corn was tall and green and made a rustling sound . sara thought it was fun to run between the rows . she saw a butterfly and chased it . she forgot about mom and hoppy . she reached out to catch the butterfly , but it flew away . sara looked around and realized she was lost . she could n't see mom or the farm . she felt scared and alone .

she remembered hoppy and reached for him . but he was not there . she had dropped him somewhere in the corn . she started to cry . she wanted hoppy and mom . she wanted to go home .

she heard a voice calling her name . it was mom . she ran towards the voice and saw mom 's face . mom hugged her and said she was sorry . she said she had been looking for her and was worried . sara said she was sorry too . she said she had lost hoppy in the corn . she said he was dependable and she missed him .

mom said they would find hoppy . she said he was dependable too and he would not disappear . she said they would look in the corn together . sara smiled and held mom 's hand . they walked back to the corn field and searched for hoppy . after a while , they saw a flash of white . it was hoppy . he was lying on the ground , near a scarecrow . sara ran to him and picked him up . she hugged him and said she was happy . he was soft and white and had long ears .

mom smiled and said they had found hoppy . she said he was a good bunny and a good friend . she said they should go back to the farm and have some lunch . sara nodded and followed mom . she held hoppy tight and said he was dependable . he always stayed with her when she was sad or scared . he was her toy bunny and she loved him . sam and mia are playing in the park . they see a big camera on a tripod . they want to take pictures of each other .

" can i use the camera ? " sam asks .

" ok , but be careful . it is not a toy , " mia says .

sam goes to the camera and looks through the eye part . he sees mia smiling . he pushes the button . the camera makes a click sound .

" wow , you look good ! " sam says .

" let me see ! " mia says .

she runs to the camera and looks at the screen . she sees her face and sam 's hand .

" that is funny ! " mia says .

they laugh and hug .

they take turns to use the camera . they make funny faces and poses . they have fun .

then they see a man coming . he is wearing a hat and a coat . he looks angry .

" hey , what are you doing with my camera ? " he shouts .

he runs to them and grabs the camera . he checks the screen . he sees their pictures .

" these are terrible ! you ruined my work ! " he says .

he deletes their pictures . he puts the camera back on the tripod .

" go away ! this is not a place for kids ! " he says .

sam and mia are scared . they run away . they find their mom and dad .

they tell them what happened . their mom and dad are sorry .

they hug them and say , " do n't worry . it was not your fault . he was a mean man . you did nothing wrong . "

they take them to the ice cream shop . they buy them ice cream cones . they lick them and smile .

they forget about the camera and the man . they are happy . tim and jen were twins who liked to play with their toys . one day , they found a big box in the living room . it had a sticker that said " do not open until your birthday " . tim and jen wondered what was inside the box . they wanted to open it and see .

" let 's open it now , " tim said . " it will be fun . "

" no , we ca n't , " jen said . " mom and dad said we have to wait . it is a surprise for our birthday . we have to resist . "

" but i 'm curious , " tim said . " maybe it is something we really like . maybe it is a bike or a doll or a robot . "

jen shook her head . " it is not nice to open presents before the event . we have to be patient and follow the rules . come on , let 's play with our other toys . "

tim was not happy . he waited until jen was busy with her blocks . then he sneaked to the box and lifted the lid . he saw a big train set with tracks and cars and a remote control . he smiled and took it out of the box . he wanted to try it .

but he was not careful . he dropped the remote control and it broke . he tried to fix it , but he could not . he heard jen coming and he panicked . he put the train set back in the box and closed the lid . he hoped jen would not notice .

but jen did notice . she saw the broken remote control sticking out of the box . she saw the tear in the wrapping paper . she saw tim 's guilty face . she was angry and sad .

" tim , what did you do ? " she asked . " you opened the box . you broke the remote control . you ruined our birthday surprise . "

tim felt bad . he knew he made a mistake . he wished he listened to jen . he wished he resisted his curiosity . he said he was sorry , but jen did not forgive him . she ran to their room and cried .

mom and dad came home and saw the mess . they were disappointed and upset . they explained to tim and jen that the train set was a special gift from their grandparents . they said they had to call them and tell them what happened . they said they had to take the train set back to the store and see if they could exchange it . they said they had to teach tim and jen a lesson about respecting other people 's things and waiting for the right time .

tim and jen felt worse . they realized they hurt their grandparents and their parents . they realized they spoiled their own birthday . they realized they had to learn to resist temptation and be more careful and grateful . they hugged each other and said they were sorry . they hoped they could still have a happy birthday .

the moral of the story is : resist the urge to do something wrong , even if you are curious or bored . it can have bad consequences for yourself and others . be patient and respectful and you will be rewarded . lily and tom were playing in the snow . they made a big snowman with a hat and a scarf . they gave him a carrot nose and two rocks for eyes . they were very happy with their snowman .

but then the sun came out . it was very bright and warm . the snow started to melt . lily and tom saw their snowman getting smaller and smaller . they were very sad . they wanted their snowman to stay .

they ran to their mom and dad . they told them about their snowman . mom and dad said they were sorry . they said they could make another snowman another day . they said they could do something fun inside .

they took lily and tom to the kitchen . they gave them some hot chocolate and cookies . they turned on the radio . it was very noisy . they sang and danced and laughed . they forgot about their snowman . they were very happy again . ben and lily were playing in their room . they had many toys and clothes . they liked to dress up and pretend . but they did not like to clean up . they left their toys and clothes everywhere .

one day , mom came to their room . she saw the mess . she was not happy . she said , " ben and lily , you need to clean up your room . your toys and clothes will rot if you leave them like this . look , this hanger is rusty and this shirt is dirty . you need to put them away or throw them away . "

ben and lily did not want to clean up . they said , " but mom , we are having fun . we do n't want to stop playing . can we do it later ? "

mom said , " no , you need to do it now . it is not polite to make a mess and not clean it up . you need to respect your things and your room . if you clean up now , you can play more later . and i will give you a treat . "

ben and lily thought about it . they liked treats . they also liked their toys and clothes . they did not want them to rot . they decided to listen to mom . they said , " okay , mom , we will clean up . we are sorry for making a mess . we will be polite and respect our things and our room . "

mom smiled . she said , " thank you , ben and lily . you are good children . i am proud of you . now , let 's clean up together . and then we can have some cookies and milk . "

