soon , it was time to go home . lily and max said goodbye to the lake and the animals . they went down the hill and back to the field . they saw lily 's mom waiting for them . she smiled and hugged them . she said they were brave and clever . she gave them a big bow for their adventure . lily and max were proud and tired . they went to the barn and slept well . they dreamed of their next adventure . lily was a little girl who liked to test things . she liked to test how high she could jump , how fast she could run , and how loud she could scream . she also liked to test her family , to see how they would react to her tests . sometimes they would laugh , sometimes they would scold , and sometimes they would ignore her .

one day , lily decided to test her family in a new way . she found a big bottle of paint in the garage , and thought it would be fun to test how it looked on the walls , the furniture , and the clothes . she opened the bottle and started to splash the paint everywhere , making a big mess . she giggled as she saw the bright colors on the gloomy things .

but her family did not giggle when they saw what she had done . they were very angry and sad . they yelled at her and told her she was naughty and mean . they said she had ruined their home and their things . they said they did not want to play with her or hug her anymore . they sent her to her room and locked the door .

