sara is happy and hopeful . she kisses daddy and says " i 'm glad " . she says she will wait for his answers . she says she hopes he is healthy soon . tom was sick . he had a bad cough and a sore throat . he did not want to play or eat . his mom said he needed medicine to feel better . she gave him a spoon with some red liquid . tom did not like the medicine . it was bitter and sticky . he made a face and spat it out .

mom was not happy . she said tom had to take the medicine or he would stay sick . she said she would walk with him to the park if he took the medicine . tom liked the park . he liked the swings and the slide and the sandbox . he wanted to go with mom . but he was nervous about the medicine . he was afraid it would taste bad again .

mom saw that tom was nervous . she hugged him and said she would help him . she said she would take a sip of the medicine first to show him it was not so bad . she took the spoon and put it in her mouth . she smiled and said it was sweet and yummy . she said it was like candy . she gave the spoon to tom and said he could try it .

tom was curious . he looked at the spoon and the red liquid . he wondered if it was really like candy . he decided to try it . he opened his mouth and took a sip . he was surprised . it was not bitter and sticky . it was sweet and yummy . he liked the medicine . he smiled and said it was good . he took another sip and finished the spoon .

mom was proud of tom . she said he was a brave boy . she said he would feel better soon . she said they could walk to the park now . tom was happy . he jumped off the couch and took mom 's hand . he said he wanted to go to the park . he said he wanted to swing and slide and play in the sandbox . he said he loved mom and the medicine . mom said she loved him too . they walked to the park together . lily liked to follow her big brother sam . he knew many things and did fun games . one day , sam found a shiny watch in the park . he put it on his wrist and showed it to lily .

