they went home together . they played more games . they were happy . they were honest . tom and lily were brother and sister . they lived in a small house near a big river . one day , it rained a lot and the river became very big and angry . it broke the wall and came into the house . tom and lily were scared and ran to the roof .

" help , help ! " they shouted . " the water is everywhere ! "

