their parents said , " we love you too , but you have to be more careful and obedient . a flood is very dangerous and you have to stay with us . we are a family and we have to stick together . "

tom and lily learned their lesson . they promised to be more careful and obedient . they thanked the man again and went to a shelter with their parents . they were happy to be alive and together . they realized that a flood is difficult , but family is important . tom was a boy who liked to play in the snow . he made a big snowman with a hat , a scarf and a carrot nose . he was very proud of his snowman and wanted to show it to everyone .

