he left the axe on the snow and went home . he hoped that sam would learn a lesson too . he hoped that sam would see that the snowman was not his enemy . he hoped that sam would see that the snowman was melting away . tom and lily were twins who liked to play in their room . they had many toys and books , but their favorite thing was their blanket . it was long and soft and had many colors . they used it to make forts , capes , tents and more .

one day , they decided to play soldiers . they put on their hats and boots and took their blanket . they wrapped it around their shoulders like a flag and marched around the room . they sang a song and pretended to fight enemies .

but they marched too fast and did not look where they were going . they bumped into a table and knocked over a lamp . the lamp fell on the floor and broke . they heard a loud noise and saw glass everywhere . they were scared and stopped marching .

mom heard the noise and came to see what happened . she saw the mess and was angry . she asked them why they broke the lamp . they said they were playing soldiers and did not mean to . mom said they were not careful and did not respect their things . she said they had to clean up the mess and say sorry . she also said they could not use the blanket for a week .

tom and lily felt bad and did what mom said . they cleaned up the glass and said sorry . they also said sorry to the blanket and hugged it . they learned that playing is fun , but they have to be careful and not break things . they also learned that the blanket was not just a toy , but a gift from grandma . they promised to take good care of it and use it wisely . lisa and tom were friends . they liked to play together in the park . one day , they saw a big cake on a table . it had flowers and candles on it . lisa and tom thought it looked yummy .

