she grabbed a big piece of cake and ran away . tom followed her . he did not want to lose his friend . but he felt bad .

they ate the cake behind a tree . it was sweet and soft . but they did not enjoy it . they felt guilty .

soon , they heard angry voices . they looked and saw a man and a woman in nice clothes . they were the people who had the marriage . they were looking for their cake .

