they looked at each other and then at the man and the woman . they wished they had not taken the cake . they wished they had listened to tom . they wished they had learned what a marriage was . they wished they had been more respectful and kind . tom and lily were playing in the park with their ball . they saw a big hill and wanted to climb it . they left their ball on the grass and started to walk up the hill . but the hill was not a hill . it was a giant !

