tom and lily had fun playing with the giant and his magic trick . they learned that he was not scary , but kind and gentle . they also learned that size does not matter , but friendship does . they became good friends with the giant and visited him often . they always brought their ball and shared it with him . tom and lily liked to watch cartoons on tv . they liked the funny animals and the silly jokes . but sometimes they wanted to watch different cartoons . tom liked the ones with cars and robots . lily liked the ones with princesses and fairies .

