tom and lily thought about it . they did not want to fight anymore . they wanted to be happy and have fun . they said sorry to each other and hugged . they decided to split the time and watch one cartoon each . they also decided to try to watch each other 's cartoons and see if they liked them .

they were very brave and kind . they learned to share and to enjoy different things . they had a lot of fun watching cartoons together . they were happy and mom was proud . tom and lily liked to play on the porch . they had a big box that they pretended was a boat . they used a stick and a sheet to make a sail . they sailed to faraway lands and had many adventures .

