they were brave . they saved their boat . they decided to sail again tomorrow , but only if the dog was not around . they liked their porch . it was their favorite place to play . lily was a famous singer . she sang very well and many people liked her songs . she had a big house , a nice car and many dresses . but she was not happy . she felt lonely and sad .

one day , she went to the park . she saw a little girl crying on a bench . she had a basket of cherries , but some boys had taken them and thrown them away . lily felt sorry for the girl . she went to her and gave her a hug . she said , " do n't cry , i will help you . i have some money , we can buy more cherries . "

the girl looked at lily and smiled . she said , " thank you , you are very kind . what is your name ? " lily said , " my name is lily . i am a singer . do you like music ? " the girl said , " yes , i love music . i want to be a singer too . can you teach me ? " lily said , " of course , i can teach you . come with me , we can go to my house and sing together . "

lily and the girl became friends . they bought more cherries and shared them . they went to lily 's house and sang many songs . they had fun and laughed . lily felt happy and warm . she said , " you are a very good singer . you have a beautiful voice . you make me happy . you are my friend . " the girl said , " you are my friend too . you are a very good singer . you have a famous voice . you make me comfort . "

lily learned that money and fame are not enough to make her happy . she learned that friendship and kindness are more important . she learned to share and care . she learned to comfort and be comforted . she learned to love and be loved . anna likes to work with her dad . he is a landscape man . he makes gardens and parks look pretty . he plants flowers and trees and grass . he cuts and digs and waters .

one day , anna goes with her dad to a big park . he has to work on a new landscape . he shows anna where he will put the flowers and trees and grass . he gives her a small shovel and a bucket . he says she can help him .

anna is happy . she likes to help her dad . she shovels some dirt and puts it in her bucket . she carries it to where her dad needs it . she feels like a big girl .

but then she sees some other kids . they are playing on the swings and slides . they look like they are having fun . anna wants to play with them . but she is shy . she does not know how to talk to them . she stays with her dad and works .

her dad sees that she is looking at the other kids . he smiles and says , " do you want to go and play with them ? " he says he can work by himself for a while . he says he will watch her from here .

anna nods . she wants to try . she puts down her shovel and bucket . she walks slowly to the swings and slides . she sees a girl with a pink dress and a boy with a blue hat . they look nice . she says , " hi . can i play with you ? "

the girl and the boy smile and say , " sure . what is your name ? " they say their names are lily and max . they ask her what she is doing here . she says , " i am helping my dad . he is a landscape man . he makes gardens and parks look pretty . "

lily and max say , " wow . that is cool . we like gardens and parks . they are pretty . " they ask her if she wants to swing or slide . she says , " i want to swing . " they say , " ok . come on . we will push you . "

anna goes to the swing . lily and max push her . she feels the wind in her hair . she laughs and says , " whee ! " she is not shy anymore . she has made new friends . she is happy . tom and sam were brothers who liked to play on the beach . they made sand castles , dug holes , and collected shells . one day , they found a shiny bottle in the sand . they opened it and a big cloud of smoke came out . it was a genie !

the genie said he would give them one wish each . tom and sam were very happy and excited . they thought about what they wanted . tom said he wanted to have a big island with lots of toys and candy . sam said he wanted to have a lot of friends and a cheerful family .

the genie nodded and said he would make their wishes come true . he rubbed his hands and snapped his fingers . then he said goodbye and went back into the bottle .

tom and sam looked around and saw that they were on different islands . tom 's island had a huge castle , a pool , a slide , and a mountain of toys and candy . but he was alone . there was no one to play with or talk to . he felt bored and lonely .

sam 's island had a small hut , a garden , a swing , and a picnic basket . but he was not alone . there were many children and animals who came to visit him . they played games , told stories , and shared food . he felt happy and loved .

tom and sam missed each other very much . they wished they could see each other again . they realized that having things was not as important as having friends and family . they learned that being greedy and selfish was not good . they hoped that the genie would come back and change their wishes .

the next day , the genie came back and saw that tom and sam were sad . he felt sorry for them and decided to give them another chance . he asked them what they wanted . tom and sam said they wanted to go back to their home and be together . the genie smiled and said he was proud of them . he rubbed his hands and snapped his fingers . then he said goodbye and went back into the bottle .

tom and sam found themselves on the beach again . they hugged each other and thanked the genie . they ran to their parents and told them what happened . they said they were sorry for being greedy and selfish . they said they were happy with what they had . their parents were glad and proud of them . they all had a cheerful day on the beach . tom is a big boy who likes to help his mom . every morning , he helps her make coffee for dad , who works hard . he likes to smell the coffee and watch the bubbles . sometimes , he wants to taste it , but mom says no . coffee is for grown - ups , she says . it is too hot and bitter for tom .

one day , mom has to go to the store . she tells tom to stay home and be good . she will return soon , she says . tom says okay and waves goodbye . he watches mom drive away . he feels bored . he sees the coffee pot on the counter . he thinks maybe he can try a sip . he climbs on a chair and reaches for the pot . he does not see the cord .

the pot falls and breaks . the coffee spills everywhere . tom screams . he feels the hot liquid on his skin . it hurts . he cries . he is scared . he wants mom .

mom hears tom 's scream . she returns quickly . she sees the mess and tom 's tears . she runs to him and hugs him . she checks his skin . it is red , but not bad . she puts some cream on it . she tells him he is safe . she is not angry , but worried . she tells him he should never touch the coffee pot . it is dangerous . he could get hurt . he should listen to mom . she knows what is best for him .

tom says sorry . he hugs mom . he says he loves her . he says he will never touch the coffee pot again . he learned his lesson . coffee is for grown - ups . he is happy mom is back . he is safe . lily was a flower who loved to bloom . she liked to show her pink petals to the sun and the bees . she felt happy when they said she was pretty and sweet . she also liked to play with her friends , the other flowers in the garden . they had fun dancing in the wind and singing to the birds .

but sometimes , lily felt tired . she wanted to take a nap and rest her petals . she saw that some of her friends did the same . they closed their petals and slept for a while . they said it was good for them . they said they would wake up more fresh and bright .

lily decided to try it . she closed her petals and took a nap . she dreamed of the sun and the bees and the birds . she felt warm and cozy . she did not know how long she slept , but when she opened her petals , she saw something new . she saw a rainbow in the sky . it had many colors and it was beautiful . she smiled and said , " wow ! "

she wanted to see it better . she stretched her stem and bent her petals . she was flexible . she could move in different ways . she saw that the rainbow had red , orange , yellow , green , blue , and purple . she liked them all . she wondered if she could change her color too .

she asked her friends , the other flowers , if they could change their color . they said they could not . they said they were happy with their color . they said it was what made them special . lily thought about it . she liked her pink color too . she decided she did not want to change it . she was happy with who she was . she was a flower who loved to bloom . lily liked to play in the garden with her mom . she saw many flowers and bugs . she saw a yellow and black bug that flew and made a buzz sound . she asked her mom , " what is that ? "

her mom said , " that is a bee . a bee is a bug that makes honey . honey is sweet and good to eat . but you have to be careful . a bee can sting you if you touch it or make it angry . a sting hurts a lot . "

lily wanted to know more . she asked her mom , " why does a bee make honey ? how does it sting ? "

her mom said , " a bee makes honey by taking nectar from the flowers . nectar is a juice that flowers have . a bee has a tongue that can suck the nectar . then it takes the nectar to its home , which is called a hive . a hive is a house made of wax that many bees live in . in the hive , the bees turn the nectar into honey and store it in cells . cells are small rooms in the hive . the bees use the honey for food when it is cold or dark outside . "

her mom said , " a bee can sting by using a sharp part in its back . this part is called a stinger . a bee only uses its stinger to protect itself or its hive . when a bee stings , it leaves its stinger in your skin . this makes the bee die . that is why a bee does not sting unless it has to . if you get stung by a bee , you have to take out the stinger and put some ice on it . then it will feel better . "

lily said , " thank you , mom . you explain very well . i like bees , but i will not touch them . i will watch them from far away . they are very busy and smart . " tom and sue like to play with their toy boat . they sail it in the pond near their house . they take turns to hold the boat and make it go fast or slow .

one day , a big wind comes and blows their boat away . they run after it , but it is too fast . the boat sails to the other side of the pond , where there is a big tree .

tom and sue are sad . they want their boat back . they see a boy near the tree . he has their boat in his hands . he is laughing .

" hey , that is our boat ! " tom shouts . " give it back ! "

the boy shakes his head . he says , " no , this is my boat now . it is a nice boat . your boat is ugly . "

sue gets angry . she says , " that is not true . our boat is pretty . you are ugly . "

the boy gets angry too . he says , " no , you are ugly . and your boat is ugly . watch this . " he throws the boat at the tree . the boat hits the tree and breaks .

tom and sue cry . they see their boat in pieces . they are very sad . they wish the boy was nice . they wish the wind was calm . they wish they had their boat . there was a king who had a big castle and many things . he liked to eat a lot of food every day , but he did not like to share with anyone . he was very greedy and selfish .

one day , a poor man came to his castle and asked for some bread . he was very hungry and had no home . the king said , " no , this is my food . go away , you are dirty and ugly . " the poor man said , " please , kind king , have mercy on me . i only need a little bit of bread . you have so much , and i have nothing . " the king said , " no , no , no . you are a liar and a thief . if you do not leave , i will call my guards and they will hurt you . "

the poor man was very sad and scared . he turned to leave , but then he saw a big cake on the king 's table . it looked so yummy and sweet . he thought , " maybe i can take a small piece of cake . the king will not notice , and i will not be hungry anymore . " he reached for the cake , but the king saw him and shouted , " stop ! how dare you touch my cake ! you are a bad man and a robber . guards , guards , catch him and throw him in the dungeon ! "

the guards came and grabbed the poor man . they dragged him to the dungeon and locked him up . the poor man cried and prayed . he said , " oh , god , please help me . i only wanted some food . i did not mean to steal . forgive me for my mistake . "

god heard his prayer and felt sorry for him . he decided to teach the king a lesson . he made the king very hungry , but no matter how much he ate , he was never full . he ate and ate and ate , but he still felt empty and weak . he also made the king very lonely , but no matter how many people he called , he was never happy . he quarreled and yelled and scolded , but he still felt angry and sad .

the king realized that he had been very wrong and wicked . he said , " oh , god , please help me . i have been very greedy and selfish . i did not share with anyone . i treated the poor man very badly . forgive me for my sins . "

god heard his prayer and felt sorry for him . he said , " if you want to be forgiven , you must repent and change . you must share your food and your things with the poor and the needy . you must be kind and gentle with everyone . you must free the poor man from the dungeon and ask for his forgiveness . "

the king agreed and did as god said . he shared his food and his things with the poor and the needy . he was kind and gentle with everyone . he freed the poor man from the dungeon and asked for his forgiveness . the poor man forgave him and thanked him . they became friends and ate the cake together .

the king learned his lesson and became a good and generous king . he was never hungry or lonely again . he was always full and happy . he thanked god for his mercy and grace .

the moral of the story is : do not be greedy and selfish , but be generous and kind . share what you have with others , and you will be blessed . do not quarrel and yell , but be gentle and respectful . treat others as you want to be treated , and you will have peace . tom likes to play with his toys . he has a big tank that can roll and shoot . he also has a small camera that can record . he wants to make a movie with his tank and his camera .

he puts his tank on the floor and his camera on a chair . he turns on the camera and says , " action ! " he makes his tank move and shoot at his stuffed animals . he makes noises like " boom ! " and " pow ! " he thinks his tank is very strong and cool .

but then he sees his cat , luna , on the couch . luna is very cute and fluffy . she has big eyes and a pink nose . she looks at tom and his tank . she jumps off the couch and runs to the tank . she tries to catch the tank with her paws . she bites the tank and flips it over . she plays with the tank like it is a mouse .

tom is surprised and laughs . he thinks luna is very funny and silly . he says , " cut ! " he turns off the camera and picks up his tank . he hugs luna and says , " you are a good cat . you are the star of my movie . " he takes his camera and his tank to his mom . he shows her his movie . he says , " look , mom , this is my tank and my cat . they are cute , right ? " mom smiles and says , " yes , they are very cute . you are a good movie maker , tom . " tom is happy and proud . he loves his tank and his cat . tom and lily were playing in the park with their ball . they saw some smoke coming from a big house near the park . they were scared . they ran to the house to see what was wrong .

they saw a man and a woman outside the house . they were crying and shouting . they said their cat was inside the house and they could not get it . the fire was too big and hot .

tom and lily wanted to help . they saw a ladder next to the house . they had an idea . they asked the man and the woman if they could use the ladder . they said yes , but be careful .

tom and lily climbed the ladder to a window . they saw the cat hiding under a bed . they called the cat and tried to make it come out . the cat was scared too . it did not want to move .

tom and lily did not give up . they used their ball to play with the cat . they threw the ball near the window and made some funny noises . the cat was curious . it came out from under the bed and followed the ball . tom and lily grabbed the cat and put it in a bag . they climbed down the ladder and gave the cat to the man and the woman .

the man and the woman were very happy and thankful . they hugged tom and lily and said they were very brave and smart . they said they solved the problem and saved the cat . tom and lily were proud and happy too . they learned that they could help others in trouble and that playing can be useful sometimes . anna liked to be independent . she did not like to listen to her mom or dad . she wanted to do everything by herself . she liked to play with her toys , draw with her crayons , and dress up in her clothes .

one day , anna saw a big jar of salt on the kitchen table . she wondered what it tasted like . she climbed on a chair and reached for the jar . she opened it and put some salt in her mouth .

" yuck ! " she cried . " this is not good ! this is very bad ! "

her mom heard her and came to the kitchen . she saw anna with the jar of salt and the chair .

" anna , what are you doing ? " she asked . " you should not play with the salt . it is not for eating . it is for cooking . it can make you sick if you eat too much . i warned you before not to touch things on the table . "

" i 'm sorry , mom , " anna said . " i wanted to try it . i did not know it was so bad . "

her mom hugged her and took the jar of salt away . she gave anna some water to drink and some cookies to eat .

" next time , listen to me , okay ? " she said . " i only want you to be safe and happy . you can be independent , but you also need to follow some rules . "

" okay , mom , " anna said . " i love you . "

" i love you too , anna , " her mom said . " now , let 's go and play with your toys . " lily and ben were twins who liked to play . one day , they found a big box in the basement . they wanted to see what was inside . they dragged the box to the stair and opened it . they saw many things : a hat , a wig , a dress , a coat , a mask , and more .

" let 's act ! " lily said . " we can be anyone we want ! "

they put on the things and made funny faces and voices . they laughed and had fun . they acted like a pirate , a princess , a clown , a witch , and more .

but they did not see that the stair was old and weak . it had cracks and holes . it could not hold the box and the twins . it made a loud noise and broke . the box and the twins fell down to the basement . they hit the floor hard . they felt pain and fear . they cried and screamed .

mom and dad heard the noise and ran to the basement . they saw the box and the twins on the floor . they saw blood and tears . they were scared and sad . they called for help and hugged the twins .

the twins were hurt and had to go to the hospital . they had cuts and bruises and broken bones . they had to stay in bed for a long time . they could not play or act anymore . they wished they had not found the box . they wished they had not been so weird . they learned a hard lesson . the end . ben and mia are playing in the park . they see a big rock . ben wants to lift the rock . he thinks he has strong muscles .

" look , mia , i can lift this rock ! " ben says . he tries to lift the rock , but it is too heavy . he grunts and pulls , but the rock does not move .

mia laughs . " you are not strong enough , ben . let me try . " she goes to the rock and puts her hands on it . she tries to lift the rock , but it is too heavy for her too . she huffs and pushes , but the rock does not move .

they both sit on the grass . they are tired and sad . they want to lift the rock .

then they see a man walking by . he has big muscles and a warm smile . he sees ben and mia and their rock .

" hello , little ones . do you need some help ? " he asks .

" yes , please . we want to lift this rock , but it is too heavy for us , " ben says .

the man nods . he goes to the rock and puts his hands on it . he lifts the rock with ease . he holds it up high .

" wow , you are so strong ! " mia says .

the man smiles . he puts the rock down gently . he kneels down and talks to ben and mia .

" thank you . i work hard to keep my muscles strong . but you know what ? you are strong too . you have strong hearts and strong minds . and you have each other . that is the best kind of strength , " he says .

ben and mia smile . they feel warm and happy . they hug the man and thank him . they play with the rock and make a game . they have fun . they have strength . anna liked to help her mom in the kitchen . she wanted to be a good cook like her mom . one day , her mom asked her to get some eggs from the fridge . anna nodded and ran to the fridge . she opened the door and saw a big carton of eggs . she reached for it , but it was too heavy for her . she tried to pull it out , but it slipped from her hands and fell on the floor . the eggs cracked and made a big mess .

anna was scared and sad . she started to cry . she thought her mom would be angry with her . she heard her mom coming and hid behind the fridge . her mom saw the mess and said , " oh no , what happened here ? " she looked around and saw anna 's shoes behind the fridge . she walked over and knelt down . she saw anna 's face , wet with tears . she smiled and said , " it 's okay , anna . accidents happen . you do n't have to be afraid . you were trying to help me , and i 'm proud of you for that . "

she hugged anna and wiped her tears . she said , " let 's clean this up together , okay ? " she got a mop and a towel and started to clean the floor . anna helped her with the towel . she said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i wanted to get the eggs for you , but they were too heavy . " her mom said , " it 's okay , anna . next time , you can ask me for help , or use a smaller carton . you 're still learning , and that 's fine . you 're a good helper , and i love you . " anna smiled and said , " i love you too , mom . " they finished cleaning and hugged again . anna felt happy and proud . she had learned a lesson and made her mom happy . lily was a shy girl who liked to draw . she had many crayons of different colors that she used to make pictures of flowers , animals and stars . she was proud of her crayons and kept them in a big box on her desk .

one day , she went to school with her crayons and a new notebook . she wanted to show her teacher and her friends her drawings . but when she got to her classroom , she saw a boy she did not know . he had a mean look on his face and he was holding her box of crayons .

" hey , give me back my crayons ! " lily said . " they are mine ! "

the boy laughed and said , " no , they are mine now . i like them . they are pretty and shiny . you have too many . you do n't need them . "

lily felt sad and angry . she tried to grab her box , but the boy was bigger and stronger . he pushed her away and ran to the other side of the room . he opened the box and started to use her crayons to scribble on the wall .

lily ran after him and shouted , " stop ! you are stealing my crayons and ruining them ! you are bad ! "

the teacher heard the noise and came to see what was going on . she saw the boy with the crayons and the wall with the scribbles . she frowned and said , " what are you doing ? why are you stealing lily 's crayons and making a mess ? "

the boy looked scared and said , " i 'm sorry . i just wanted to draw . i do n't have any crayons at home . "

the teacher said , " that 's no excuse . you should not take things that are not yours . you should ask nicely and share . and you should not damage the wall . you have to apologize to lily and help me clean up . "

the boy said , " i 'm sorry , lily . i was wrong . can i give you back your crayons ? "

lily nodded and said , " yes , you can . but you have to be careful with them . they are special to me . "

the boy gave her back the box and said , " they are very nice . can i borrow one sometimes ? "

lily smiled and said , " yes , you can . but you have to ask me first . and you have to use it nicely . maybe we can draw together . "

the boy smiled and said , " that would be nice . thank you , lily . i 'm sorry i was mean . can we be friends ? "

lily said , " yes , we can . but you have to be nice . and you have to say sorry to the teacher too . "

the boy said , " ok , i will . i 'm sorry , teacher . "

the teacher said , " it 's ok . i 'm glad you learned your lesson . now , let 's go and clean up the wall . and then we can all draw together . "

lily and the boy went with the teacher and helped her wipe the wall . then they sat down with their crayons and notebooks and drew pictures of flowers , animals and stars . they showed each other their drawings and said nice things . they became friends and learned to share . tom and anna are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big bell on a tower . tom has an idea .

" let 's joke with the bell ! " he says . " we can make it ring and run away . "

anna thinks that is funny . she nods and follows tom . they climb the tower and find a rope . tom pulls the rope hard . the bell makes a loud sound .

" ding dong ! ding dong ! " the bell says .

tom and anna laugh . they run down the tower and hide behind a tree . they wait for someone to come and see the bell .

but no one comes . the bell keeps ringing . tom and anna get scared . they think they did something bad .

" maybe we should stop the bell , " anna says .

" but how ? " tom asks . " we ca n't go back to the tower . someone might see us . "

they look around . they see a smart dog . the dog is brown and fluffy . it has a collar with a tag . the tag says " rex " .

" maybe rex can help us , " tom says . " he looks smart . maybe he knows how to stop the bell . "

tom and anna call rex . rex comes to them . he wags his tail . he likes children .

" hi , rex , " tom says . " we need your help . we joked with the bell and now it wo n't stop . can you stop it for us ? "

rex barks . he seems to understand . he runs to the tower . he jumps and bites the rope . he breaks the rope . the bell stops ringing .

" wow , rex , you did it ! " anna says . " you are a smart dog . thank you for helping us . "

rex barks again . he licks tom and anna . he is happy .

tom and anna hug rex . they are sorry for joking with the bell . they learn their lesson . they decide to play with rex instead . they have fun . they are friends . tom and jen are friends . they like to play with toys and books . one day , they find a big zip in the closet . the zip is shiny and long . they want to see what is inside .

they pull the zip and open the closet . inside , they see many things . they see clothes and shoes and hats . they also see a big cake . the cake is pink and white and has candles on it . it smells good .

tom and jen are hungry . they want to eat the cake . they take a big bite . the cake is sweet and soft . they like it . they eat more and more .

but the cake is not for them . the cake is for mom . mom made the cake for her birthday . she is in the kitchen . she hears a noise . she goes to the closet . she sees tom and jen . they have cake on their faces and hands . they look at mom . they are scared .

mom is angry . she says , " what are you doing ? this is my cake ! you are not supposed to eat it ! this is not normal ! you are naughty ! "

tom and jen are sorry . they say , " we are sorry , mom . we did not know . we were hungry . the cake looked good . we like you , mom . happy birthday , mom . "

mom is sad . she says , " thank you , but you ruined my cake . now i have no cake for my birthday . how can we celebrate ? "

tom and jen think . they want to make mom happy . they have an idea . they say , " we can make you a new cake , mom . we can use the toys and books . we can make a zip cake . it will be fun and pretty . we love you , mom . "

mom smiles . she says , " that is very sweet of you . but you have to clean up first . and you have to promise not to eat my cake again . ok ? "

tom and jen nod . they say , " ok , mom . we promise . we will clean up . we will make you a zip cake . we will be good . "

mom hugs them . she says , " i love you , too . you are my children . you are not normal . you are special . " lily was a tall girl who liked to play with her toys . she had a big teddy bear , a small doll , and a yellow ball . she liked to hug her teddy bear , dress up her doll , and bounce her ball .

one day , she saw a new toy in the store . it was a fluffy bunny with long ears and a pink nose . lily wanted the bunny very much . she asked her mom if she could have it . her mom said , " maybe , if you are good and help me with the chores . "

lily nodded and smiled . she helped her mom wash the dishes , fold the clothes , and sweep the floor . she was a good girl and did not make a mess . she hoped her mom would buy her the bunny .

when they finished the chores , her mom took her to the store . she picked up the bunny and gave it to lily . she said , " you have been very good and helpful today . you can have the bunny as a reward . "

lily was very happy . she hugged the bunny and thanked her mom . she named the bunny floppy and took it home . she played with it and her other toys . she liked to stroke its ears and make it nod . she loved her new toy very much . lily liked to march . she marched in the morning , she marched at noon , she marched in the evening . she marched with her feet , she marched with her hands , she marched with her head . she marched when she was happy , she marched when she was sad , she marched when she was bored .

but lily did not like to nap . she thought naps were for babies , not for big girls like her . she wanted to play , to run , to jump , to march . she was impatient when her mom said it was time for a nap . she said no , she said later , she said never .

one day , lily marched too much . she marched in the park , she marched in the store , she marched in the car . she marched so much that she got tired . she got so tired that she could not march anymore . she could only yawn , and rub her eyes , and lean on her mom .

her mom smiled and said , " lily , you need a nap . you marched too much today . you will feel better after a nap . come on , let 's go to your bed . "

lily did not want to go to her bed . she wanted to march some more . but she was too tired to say no , to say later , to say never . she followed her mom to her bed . she lay down on her pillow . she closed her eyes . she fell asleep .

she had a dream . she dreamed that she was marching with her friends . they marched in the sun , they marched in the rain , they marched in the snow . they marched with their feet , they marched with their hands , they marched with their head . they marched when they were happy , they marched when they were sad , they marched when they were bored .

lily woke up . she felt good . she felt rested . she felt ready to march again . she jumped out of her bed . she ran to her mom . she said , " mom , i had a good nap . i had a good dream . can i march some more ? "

her mom hugged her and said , " yes , lily , you can march some more . but only after you eat your snack . you need some energy to march . come on , let 's go to the kitchen . "

lily nodded and said , " ok , mom , let 's go to the kitchen . but after that , can we march some more ? "

her mom laughed and said , " yes , lily , after that , we can march some more . " tom and anna like to play with their cars . they have many cars of different colors and sizes . they make a line of cars on the floor and pretend they are driving on a road .

" beep beep ! move , red car ! " tom says , pushing his blue car forward .

" wait , tom ! you have to pause at the stop sign ! " anna says , holding her red car in place .

" what is a stop sign ? " tom asks , looking at the square paper anna taped to the wall .

" it is a sign that tells you to stop and look before you go . it is red and has four lines that make a shape like this . " anna shows tom with her fingers .

