lily was afraid of the duck . she did not want to splash in the water with the duck . she did not want the duck to bite her or chase her . she hid behind her mom and dad .

her mom and dad saw that lily was anxious . they smiled and said , " do n't worry , lily . the duck is not mean . the duck is just curious . the duck likes to splash in the water too . maybe you can be friends with the duck . "

