one day , sam was playing with his trumpet in the living room . he was ringing his bell and blowing his trumpet . he was having fun . but lily was trying to read her book in the bedroom . she was not having fun . she was angry . she wanted sam to stop . she went to the living room and said , " sam , stop playing with your trumpet ! you are too loud ! you are bothering me ! "

sam did not stop . he said , " no , lily , i like playing with my trumpet ! you are too quiet ! you are boring ! " he rang his bell louder and blew his trumpet harder . he was trying to annoy lily .

