sam and lily went to their room and got their blocks . they started to play with them . they built a castle and a bridge and a tower . they used their imagination and had fun . they were not too loud or too quiet . they were comfortable . they were happy . ben and mia were playing in the park . they saw a big sack on the grass . they ran to the sack and opened it . inside the sack , there were many objects . there were balls , books , dolls , cars , and more .

" wow , look at all these objects ! " ben said . " they are so fun and colorful . can we play with them ? "

" sure , we can play with them . but we have to be careful . maybe someone left the sack here for a reason . maybe they will come back for it , " mia said .

ben and mia took out some objects from the sack and started to play . they threw the balls , read the books , hugged the dolls , and drove the cars . they had a lot of fun .

but then , they heard a loud voice . it was a man . he was walking towards the sack . he looked angry and mean .

" hey , you kids ! what are you doing with my sack ? that 's my sack ! give it back to me right now ! " the man shouted .

ben and mia were scared . they dropped the objects and ran away . they hid behind a tree and watched the man .

the man reached the sack and looked inside . he saw the objects . he was not happy . he wanted something else in the sack . something mighty and valuable . something that he had stolen from a museum .

" where is it ? where is my mighty object ? the golden statue of the lion king ? i put it in this sack . who took it ? who ? " the man yelled .

he did not know that a policeman had seen him steal the mighty object . the policeman had followed him to the park . the policeman had taken the mighty object out of the sack and replaced it with the other objects . the policeman had called for backup . now , he and his friends were ready to catch the man .

" sir , you are under arrest . you stole the mighty object from the museum . we have it here . you ca n't run away . give up and come with us , " the policeman said .

