ben and mia saw everything . they were glad that the man was caught . they were also glad that the mighty object was safe . they learned a lesson . they should not touch things that are not theirs . they should respect other people 's belongings .

they went back to their parents and told them what happened . their parents were proud of them . they hugged them and took them home . they had a nice dinner and a good night 's sleep . they dreamed of the park , the sack , the objects , and the mighty object . they were happy . lily and tom were playing in the park . they liked to slide on the big slide . it was fun and fast . they took turns to go down the slide and then ran back to the top .

one day , they saw something new near the slide . it was a big ball of sticks and mud . it had a hole in it and made a loud buzzing sound . lily and tom were curious . they wanted to see what was inside .

they went closer to the ball and peeked inside . they saw many yellow and black bugs flying around . they were bees . they lived in the ball , which was their hive . they made honey in the hive .

" wow , look at the bees ! " lily said . " they are so busy and noisy ! "

" can we touch them ? " tom asked . " maybe they are friendly . "

lily shook her head . " no , we ca n't touch them . they might sting us . that would hurt a lot . bees are fierce when they protect their hive . "

tom nodded . he did not want to get stung . he backed away from the hive . but he was not careful . he stepped on a twig and made a loud snap . the bees heard the noise and got angry . they thought tom was trying to hurt their hive . they flew out of the hole and chased tom .

