the bees saw that tom and lily were gone . they did not chase them anymore . they flew back to their hive . they were calm again . they did not want to hurt anyone . they just wanted to make honey and live in peace .

tom and lily were safe . they were out of breath and had red faces . they hugged each other . they were glad they were not stung . they learned a lesson . they would not go near the hive again . they would respect the bees and their home . they would play on the slide and have fun . they were happy . lily and sam are friends . they like to play at the park . they run , jump , swing and slide . they have fun .

