" no , ben , lily is mine . you have your cars and trucks . please give lily back to me , " anna says . she is serious and does not want to share .

" but i want to play with lily . she is pretty and soft . please let me have her for a little while , " ben says . he is not serious and wants to tease anna .

" no , ben , lily is not for you . she is for girls , not boys . please put her down now , " anna says . she is angry and tries to grab lily from ben .

ben runs away with lily and laughs . he thinks it is fun to make anna mad . anna chases him and shouts . she thinks it is not fun to lose lily .

they run around the house until they bump into anna 's mom . she sees lily in ben 's hand and anna 's tears .

" what is going on here ? " she asks .

" ben took my doll and he wo n't give her back . he is mean and silly . please make him stop , " anna says .

" ben , is that true ? did you take anna 's doll without asking ? that is not nice . please say sorry to anna and give her back her doll , " anna 's mom says .

ben looks at anna 's mom and feels sorry . he knows he was wrong . he gives lily back to anna and says sorry .

" i 'm sorry , anna . i was just playing . i did n't mean to make you sad . can we still be friends ? " he says .

anna looks at ben and feels happy . she knows he is sorry . she hugs lily and says yes .

" yes , ben , we can still be friends . thank you for giving lily back . do you want to play with my cars and trucks ? " she says .

ben smiles and says yes . they go to play with the cars and trucks . they share and have fun . anna 's mom watches them and smiles . she is glad they are friends again . lily and tom were playing in the woods . they saw a small house made of candy . it looked very pretty and yummy .

" let 's go and eat some candy ! " tom said .

" ok , but be careful . maybe someone lives there . " lily said .

they went to the house and broke off some pieces of candy . they ate them and smiled . they did not see the witch who lived in the house . she was very angry and mean . she came out of the house and saw the children .

" who are you and what are you doing ? " she shouted .

" we are sorry , we just wanted some candy . " lily said .

" well , you will pay for this . you will be my dinner ! " the witch said . she grabbed tom and dragged him into the house . she locked the door and turned on the oven . she wanted to burn tom and eat him .

lily was very scared and sad . she wanted to save tom . she looked around and saw a big stick . she picked it up and ran to the house . she smashed the window with the stick . she saw tom tied up on a table . she saw the witch near the oven .

" help me , lily ! " tom cried .

" let him go , you bad witch ! " lily yelled .

the witch turned around and saw lily . she was very surprised and angry . she threw a pot of hot water at lily . lily dodged the water and threw the stick at the witch . the stick hit the witch on the head . the witch fell down and hit the oven . the oven door opened and the fire came out . the fire burned the witch and she screamed .

lily ran to tom and untied him . they ran out of the house . they saw the fire spreading to the candy . the candy melted and burned . the house was gone .

lily and tom hugged each other . they were happy and safe . they ran back to their home . they told their mom and dad what happened . they said they were sorry for eating the candy . they said they learned their lesson . they said they would never go to the woods again . they said they loved each other . lily was a princess who liked to count . she counted her dolls , her books , her dresses , and her jewels . she counted everything in her big room . she was very good at counting .

one day , a prince came to visit her . his name was ben . he wanted to play with lily , but he did not like to count . he liked to run , jump , and climb . he said counting was boring .

" let 's go outside and have fun , " he said to lily . " there is a big garden with flowers and trees and swings . "

" no , thank you , " lily said . " i want to count my things . counting is fun . "

ben was sad . he wanted to be friends with lily , but they liked different things . he tried to think of something they could both enjoy .

he saw a bowl of red berries on a table . he had an idea .

" look , lily , " he said . " these berries are spicy . they make your mouth hot and your tongue tingle . do you want to try one ? "

lily was curious . she liked new things . she picked up a berry and put it in her mouth .

" ow ! " she cried . " this is too spicy ! it hurts ! "

she spit out the berry and ran to get some water . ben laughed . he thought it was funny .

lily was angry . she did not like ben . he was mean . he made her mouth hurt .

she grabbed the bowl of berries and threw them at ben . they hit his face and his clothes . he stopped laughing . he felt the spicy juice on his skin . it burned .

" ow ! " he cried . " this is too spicy ! it hurts ! "

he ran to get some water . lily laughed . she thought it was funny .

they both learned a lesson . they learned not to play tricks on each other . they learned to be nice and share . they learned to like different things .

they became friends . they played together . sometimes they counted . sometimes they ran , jumped , and climbed . sometimes they ate spicy berries . but only a little bit . lily and tom were playing in the backyard with their toys . they liked to pretend they were explorers and find new things . they saw some smoke coming from behind the fence . they wondered what it was .

" let 's go see ! " tom said . he was nosy and brave .

" no , we ca n't . mom said we have to stay here . it might be dangerous . " lily said . she was careful and scared .

" but i want to know . maybe it 's a fire . maybe someone needs help . " tom said . he did not listen to lily .

he ran to the fence and climbed over it . lily followed him . she did not want him to go alone .

they saw a man sitting on a chair . he had a stick in his mouth . the smoke came from the stick . he looked angry .

" hey , what are you doing here ? get off my lawn ! " the man shouted . he was rude and mean .

tom and lily were shocked . they did not know the man . they did not know the stick . they did not like the smoke .

they ran back to the fence and jumped over it . they ran to their backyard . they dropped their toys . they hugged each other .

they learned a lesson . they should not be nosy . they should listen to mom . they should stay away from smoke . it did not seem fun . it seemed bad . lily and ben were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they saw snow falling from the sky . they wanted to go out and make a snowman .

" can we go out , mom ? " they asked .

" yes , but you have to wear your warm clothes and boots . and do n't stay out too long . it is very cold in winter , " mom said .

lily and ben were obedient . they put on their hats , scarves , gloves and coats . they also wore their boots . they went out and had fun in the snow . they rolled big balls of snow and stacked them up . they gave their snowman a carrot nose , a hat and a smile .

they were so happy that they did not notice the time . the sky became dark and the wind became strong . the snowman looked sad .

" let 's go in , lily . it is getting late and cold , " ben said .

" but i do n't want to leave our snowman . he will be lonely , " lily said .

" do n't worry . he will be fine . we can come back tomorrow and play with him again . mom told us not to stay out too long . we have to be obedient , " ben said .

lily nodded . she gave the snowman a hug and said goodbye . they ran back to their house and entered the warm and cozy living room . mom was waiting for them with hot chocolate and cookies .

" you are back . i 'm glad you had fun . and i 'm proud of you for being obedient and coming back on time , " mom said .

lily and ben smiled . they drank their hot chocolate and ate their cookies . they told mom about their snowman and how much they loved him . they also thanked mom for the warm clothes and the yummy treats .

they learned that winter can be fun , but also cold and dangerous . they learned that being obedient can keep them safe and happy . they learned that mom loves them and cares for them . they hugged mom and said they loved her too . they were a happy family . lily and tom were friends . they liked to play with cars and trucks . one day , tom found a big motor in the garage . he wanted to make his truck go fast . he took the motor and put it in his truck .

lily saw tom 's truck with the motor . she wanted to try it too . she asked tom if she could play with his truck . tom said no . he said it was his motor and his truck . lily was sad . she tried to take the truck from tom . tom got angry . he pushed lily away . lily fell down and hurt her knee . she cried .

tom saw lily crying . he felt sorry . he did not want to hurt lily . he wanted to be friends . he said he was sorry . he asked lily if she was okay . he gave her his truck with the motor . he said she could play with it .

lily stopped crying . she looked at tom . she looked at the truck . she was still sad . she did not want the truck . she wanted tom to be nice . she did not forgive tom . she said she did not want to be friends . she ran away with her knee bleeding . tom was alone with his truck . he was sorry . he was sad . he had no friends . lily and ben were playing with blocks . they wanted to make a big tower . they put one block on top of another , and another , and another . they tried to balance the blocks so they would not fall .

" look , lily , our tower is so high ! " ben said .

" yes , it is ! let 's make it higher ! " lily said .

they found more blocks and added them to the tower . but then , a big wind came and blew on the tower . the blocks started to shake and wobble .

" oh no , our tower is going to fall ! " lily cried .

" quick , hold it ! " ben said .

they both reached out their hands and tried to hold the tower . but it was too late . the blocks fell down with a loud crash . lily and ben were sad . they looked at the mess of blocks on the floor .

" maybe we can make another tower , " ben said .

" but how ? the wind will blow it again , " lily said .

they thought for a moment . then , they had an idea . they ran to the living room and got a big book . they opened the book and found a page with a picture of a castle . it was a nice image of a castle , with towers and walls and flags .

" look , lily , this is a castle . it is like a tower , but stronger , " ben said .

" yes , it is . maybe we can make a castle with our blocks , " lily said .

they took the book and the blocks back to their room . they looked at the image of the castle and tried to copy it with their blocks . they made the walls and the towers and the flags . they used the book as a helpful guide . they worked hard and had fun .

soon , they finished their castle . it was not as high as their tower , but it was more beautiful and stable . they were proud of their castle . they showed it to their mom and dad , who praised them for their creativity and teamwork .

" wow , lily and ben , you made a wonderful castle ! " mom said .

" yes , you did ! how did you do it ? " dad asked .

" we used a book and our blocks . we looked at the image of the castle and tried to make it . we balanced the blocks and made them strong . we helped each other , " lily said .

" that 's very smart and helpful of you . you are great builders , " dad said .

lily and ben smiled . they were happy . they played with their castle and pretended to be kings and queens . they did not mind the wind anymore . they had learned how to balance their blocks and make something amazing . sam and lily were playing with their toys in the garden . they had a lot of fun making noises and pretending to be animals . sam had a big club that he used to hit the ground and make loud booms . lily had a small doll that she hugged and kissed .

" can i play with your club , sam ? " lily asked . " it looks so cool and strong . "

" no , it 's mine ! " sam said . " you have your doll , i have my club . go away ! "

lily felt sad and angry . she wanted to play with the club too . she thought sam was being mean and selfish . she decided to pinch him hard to make him share .

she sneaked behind him and pinched his arm with her fingers . sam yelled and dropped the club . he turned around and saw lily holding his club .

" ow ! that hurt ! give me back my club , lily ! " sam said . " you are a bad sister ! "

lily ran away with the club , laughing . she thought she was clever and brave . she did not care that sam was crying and rubbing his arm .

she ran to the other side of the garden , where there was a big apple tree . she saw some red and juicy apples hanging from the branches . she felt hungry and wanted to eat one . she put the club on the ground and reached for an apple .

but as soon as she touched the apple , she felt a sharp pain in her hand . she looked and saw a big bee stinging her . she screamed and dropped the apple . she ran back to sam , holding her hand .

" ow ! ow ! ow ! a bee stung me , sam ! " lily said . " it hurts so much ! "

sam saw lily crying and holding her hand . he felt sorry for her . he forgot that she pinched him and took his club . he ran to her and hugged her .

" it 's okay , lily . i 'll help you . " sam said . " let me see your hand . "

he gently took her hand and blew on the sting . he picked a leaf and wrapped it around her hand . he kissed her cheek and said , " there , there . it will get better soon . "

lily felt a little better . she looked at sam and said , " thank you , sam . you are a good brother . "

she gave him back his club and said , " i 'm sorry i pinched you and took your club . that was wrong and mean . can you forgive me ? "

sam smiled and said , " of course i forgive you , lily . i 'm sorry i did not share with you . that was wrong and selfish . can we be friends again ? "

lily nodded and said , " yes , we can be friends again . can we play together ? "

sam nodded and said , " yes , we can play together . do you want to share my club ? "

lily smiled and said , " yes , i do . and do you want to share my doll ? "

sam smiled and said , " yes , i do . and do you want to share this tasty apple ? "

he picked up the apple that lily dropped and wiped it on his shirt . he broke it in half and gave one piece to lily . they both took a bite and said , " mmm , yummy ! "

they sat under the tree and ate the apple . they laughed and talked and played . they learned that sharing is caring and that pinching is hurting . they were happy and loved each other . the end . tom and sue live on a big farm with their mom and dad . they like to help with the animals and the plants . one day , they see a big truck come to the farm . the truck has many bags of wheat in it . wheat is a plant that makes bread and cookies .

dad tells tom and sue to help him spread the wheat on the field . he gives them each a small bucket and shows them how to throw the wheat on the ground . tom and sue have fun spreading the wheat . they make patterns and shapes with the wheat . they see birds and bugs and flowers .

but then , the sky becomes gray . gray means rain is coming . dad says they have to hurry and finish spreading the wheat . he says rain is good for the wheat , but too much rain can make it bad . tom and sue run and spread the wheat as fast as they can . they finish just as the rain starts to fall .

they run back to the truck and get inside . dad drives them back to the house . mom is waiting for them with hot cocoa and cookies . she says they did a good job spreading the wheat . she says the wheat will grow and make more bread and cookies . tom and sue are happy and proud . they like to help on the farm . they hope the sun will come back soon . lila and tom were adventurous kids . they liked to explore new places and have fun . one day , they found a big box of polish in the garage . they wondered what it was for .

" let 's polish something ! " lila said .

" like what ? " tom asked .

" maybe the street ! " lila said . " it will make it shiny and pretty ! "

they took the box of polish and ran to the street . they saw a lot of cars and bikes and people . they looked for a spot to polish .

" here ! " lila said , pointing to a patch of pavement . " let 's polish this ! "

they opened the box and took out a cloth and a bottle . they poured some polish on the cloth and rubbed it on the pavement . they worked hard and fast . they wanted to see the street sparkle .

" look ! " tom said . " it 's working ! it 's getting shiny ! "

they smiled and polished some more . they did not see the big truck coming their way . they did not hear the horn . they did not notice the angry driver .

" hey ! " the driver shouted . " what are you doing ? get out of the way ! "

he slammed on the brakes and stopped the truck . he got out and walked towards them . he looked very mad .

lila and tom dropped the cloth and the bottle . they were scared . they did not mean to cause trouble . they just wanted to polish the street .

" sorry , mister ! " lila said .

" we were just playing ! " tom said .

the driver looked at them and then at the pavement . he saw the polish and the cloth and the bottle . he saw the shiny spot . he shook his head .

" you kids are crazy ! " he said . " you ca n't polish the street ! you could have been hurt ! you could have damaged my truck ! you could have caused an accident ! "

he picked up the box of polish and gave it to them .

" take this and go home ! " he said . " and do n't ever do this again ! "

lila and tom nodded . they took the box and ran away . they were sorry and ashamed . they learned their lesson . they decided to never polish the street again . they decided to find a safer way to be adventurous . lila was a girl who liked to skip . she skipped to school , she skipped to the park , she skipped to the shop . she was happy when she skipped , and she made others happy too .

one day , she saw a big sign that said " ice cream " . she loved ice cream , especially with cream on top . she skipped to the sign , and saw a man with a cart . he had many flavors of ice cream , and a big can of cream .

" hello , little girl , " he said . " do you want some ice cream ? "

" yes , please , " lila said . " can i have vanilla with cream ? "

" sure , sure , " the man said . " but it will cost you two coins . "

lila had only one coin in her pocket . she felt sad . she wanted the ice cream so much .

" please , sir , can i have it for one coin ? " she asked .

the man looked around . he saw no one else . he smiled a bad smile .

" okay , okay , " he said . " but you have to do something for me first . you have to skip to that alley over there , and bring me back a bag that you will find there . it is very important . can you do that ? "

lila thought the man was wise . he knew where to find a bag . maybe it had more coins in it . she nodded and took the coin from her pocket . she gave it to the man and ran to the alley . she skipped as fast as she could .

but when she got to the alley , she saw no bag . she saw two big boys . they had mean faces and sharp sticks . they saw lila and laughed .

" look what we have here , " one of them said . " a little girl who likes to skip . let 's have some fun with her . "

they grabbed lila and pushed her to the ground . they took her shoes and her dress . they hit her with their sticks . they made her cry and bleed .

lila wished she had not skipped to the alley . she wished she had not trusted the man . she wished she had not wanted the ice cream . she wished someone would help her . but no one came . she was alone and hurt .

the man with the cart heard her cry . he did not care . he took the coin and the ice cream and the cream . he left the sign and the cart . he ran away . he was not wise . he was bad . he was a thief . he had tricked lila .

lila never skipped again . lily and tom were playing on the beach . they liked to dig in the sand and look for shells . they found many shells of different colors and shapes . some were big and some were small . some were smooth and some were bumpy .

" look , lily , i found a shell with a hole in it ! " tom said . he showed lily his shell . it was white and round , with a small hole on one side .

" wow , that 's a nice shell , tom . can i see it ? " lily asked . she reached out her hand to take the shell .

but tom pulled the shell away . " no , it 's mine . i found it first . you ca n't have it , " he said . he was not very nice .

lily felt sad and angry . she wanted to see the shell too . she thought tom was being mean . she looked around and saw another shell on the sand . it was yellow and long , with a pointy end . she picked it up and said , " fine , i do n't want your shell . i have a better shell . look , it 's yellow and pointy . it 's like a lemon . "

tom looked at lily 's shell . he felt curious and jealous . he wanted to see the yellow shell too . he said , " let me see your shell , lily . maybe we can trade shells . mine has a hole and yours has a point . "

lily thought for a moment . she wanted to be nice , but she also wanted to teach tom a lesson . she said , " ok , tom , you can see my shell . but you have to do something first . you have to lick my shell and tell me how it tastes . "

tom thought that was a strange thing to do , but he agreed . he wanted to see the yellow shell . he gave lily his shell with a hole and took her shell with a point . he put the pointy end in his mouth and licked it .

but as soon as he licked it , he made a face . the shell was sour and bitter . it tasted awful . he spit it out and said , " yuck , lily , your shell is sour . it 's not like a lemon . it 's like a bad lemon . why did you make me lick it ? "

lily smiled and said , " that 's what you get for being mean , tom . you should share your shells with your friends . then they will share their shells with you . and you wo n't have to lick sour shells . "

tom realized that lily was right . he felt sorry and ashamed . he said , " i 'm sorry , lily . you 're right . i was mean . can we be friends again ? can we trade shells back ? "

lily nodded and said , " yes , tom , we can be friends again . and we can trade shells back . but next time , do n't be mean . and do n't lick shells . they are not for eating . they are for looking and playing . "

tom and lily hugged and said sorry . then they traded shells back and played with them . they had fun on the beach . they learned to be nice and to share . and they never licked shells again . sara and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they find a white paper on the grass . it has a message on it . the message says : " be kind to others . share your toys and smiles . "

" wow , this is a nice message , " sara says . " who wrote it ? "

" i do n't know , " ben says . " maybe someone who wants to make people happy . "

sara and ben look around . they see a boy sitting on a bench . he looks sad . he has no toys and no friends .

" maybe we can make him happy , " sara says . " let 's share our toys and smiles with him . "

" ok , " ben says . " that is a kind thing to do . "

sara and ben run to the boy . they smile and say hello . they ask him his name . he says his name is tom . they ask him if he wants to play with them . he nods and smiles .

sara and ben put their toys on the ground . they share them with tom . they play together . they have fun . they laugh and talk .

tom is happy . he says thank you to sara and ben . he says they are very kind and friendly .

sara and ben are happy too . they say you are welcome to tom . they say they are glad to meet him .

they look at the white paper again . they understand the message . they say : " be kind to others . share your toys and smiles . that is a good way to live . " sara liked to play with her zip . it was on her coat and it made a funny sound when she moved it up and down . she could zip her coat by herself and she felt very big .

one day , she went to the park with her mom and dad . they had a lot of fun on the swings , the slide and the sandbox . sara showed them how she could zip her coat . they said she was very clever .

but then , it was time to leave . sara did not want to leave . she wanted to play more . she said no and ran away . she hid behind a tree and zipped her coat .

her mom and dad looked for her . they called her name . they were worried . they did not see her behind the tree .

sara heard them . she felt sorry . she knew they loved her and wanted her to be safe . she came out from behind the tree and said sorry . she hugged them and zipped her coat .

they said it was okay and they loved her too . they said it was difficult to leave sometimes , but they had to go home . they said they would come back to the park another day . sara nodded and smiled . she held their hands and left with them . she still liked her zip . jill and jack were twins who liked to play together . they had many toys , but their favorite was a big box that they pretended was a spaceship . they put stickers and drawings on the box to make it look like a real spaceship .

one day , their mom gave them a letter with a stamp on it . she said it was from their grandma , who lived far away . she said they could mail her a letter back , if they wanted to . jill and jack were very happy . they loved their grandma and wanted to tell her about their spaceship .

they ran to their room and got some paper and crayons . they drew pictures of their spaceship and wrote their names . they also wrote " we love you , grandma ! " they folded their paper and put it in an envelope . they asked their mom for a stamp . she gave them one and said they could mail their letter at the post office .

jill and jack put on their coats and hats and went outside with their mom . they held their letter tightly . they saw a big truck with a sign that said " mail " . they thought it was the post office . they ran to the truck and tried to give their letter to the driver . but the driver was not jolly . he was grumpy . he said " go away , kids ! this is not the post office . this is my truck . i deliver fruits and vegetables . see ? " he opened the back of the truck and showed them many boxes of fruits and vegetables . jill and jack saw apples , oranges , bananas , carrots , lettuce , and something green and round . they did not know what it was .

" what is that ? " jill asked , pointing to the green thing .

" that is an avocado . it is a fruit . it is very good for you . do you want one ? " the driver said , trying to be nice .

" yes , please ! " jack said . he liked to try new things .

the driver gave jack an avocado . jack thanked him and smiled . he gave half of the avocado to jill . they peeled it and tasted it . they liked it . it was creamy and soft .

" yummy ! " jill said .

" yummy ! " jack said .

they finished their avocado and threw away the peel and the seed . they remembered their letter . they asked their mom where the post office was . she said it was across the street . they crossed the street with their mom and mailed their letter . they hoped their grandma would like their pictures and their words .

they learned that day that mail is not only letters , but also fruits and vegetables . they also learned that sometimes people are grumpy , but they can be nice if you are polite and friendly . they learned that trying new things can be fun and tasty . they learned that they loved their grandma and their mom and their spaceship and their avocado . they were very jolly . lily and ben were very excited . they were going on vacation with mom and dad . they packed their bags and toys . they put on their hats and shoes . they were ready to go .

but mom and dad were not ready . they had to do many things . they had to lock the door , check the mail , turn off the lights , and call grandma . they were very busy . they told lily and ben to wait in the car .

lily and ben did not want to wait . they wanted to go now . they were bored and restless . they started to whine and fuss . they said , " hurry up , mom and dad ! we want to go ! we want to go ! "

mom and dad heard them . they felt sad and angry . they said , " lily and ben , stop whining and fussing . we are doing our best . we have to do these things . they are important . you have to be patient and respectful . you have to be grateful . we are going on vacation . that is a special thing . not everyone can go on vacation . you should be happy and thankful . "

lily and ben thought about what mom and dad said . they realized they were being rude and ungrateful . they felt sorry and ashamed . they said , " we are sorry , mom and dad . we love you . we are grateful . we are happy and thankful . we will be patient and respectful . we will wait in the car . "

mom and dad smiled and hugged them . they said , " we love you too , lily and ben . we are grateful for you . we are happy and thankful . we are almost ready . we will go soon . "

they finished their things . they got in the car . they drove away . they had a wonderful vacation . they had fun and learned new things . they were grateful for each other and for their vacation . they never forgot to be patient and respectful . they never forgot to be happy and thankful . tom and sue are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big truck . the truck is fat and loud . it has many colors on it .

" wow , look at the truck ! " tom says . " it is so big and pretty ! "

" yes , it is ! " sue says . " do you think it has toys inside ? "

they run to the truck . they want to see the toys . but the truck is not a toy truck . it is a fire truck . the fire truck is here to help . there is a fire in a house .

tom and sue see the fire . the fire is red and hot . it makes smoke and noise . they are scared .

" fire , fire ! " tom says . " we have to run away ! "

" no , no ! " sue says . " we have to stay here . the fire truck will stop the fire . see , they have a hose . the hose has water . water can put out fire . "

tom and sue see the hose . the hose is long and thin . it sprays water on the fire . the water is strong and wet . it makes the fire smaller and smaller .

tom and sue see the firemen . the firemen are brave and strong . they wear helmets and coats . they go inside the house . they save the people and the pets .

tom and sue see the people and the pets . the people and the pets are happy and safe . they thank the firemen . they hug and kiss .

tom and sue see a spark . the spark is small and bright . it comes from the fire truck . it is a light . the light is green and yellow . it flashes and blinks .

" look , look ! " sue says . " the spark is so pretty ! it is like a star ! "

" yes , it is ! " tom says . " it is a star for the fire truck . the fire truck is a hero ! "

they clap and cheer . they love the fire truck . they love the spark . they love the firemen . they are happy . tim and sue were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they went to the park with their mom . they saw a big tree with many mushrooms under it . tim wanted to look at the mushrooms , but sue thought they were boring .

" look , sue , this mushroom is red and white . it looks like a hat ! " tim said .

" who cares ? mushrooms are yucky and smelly . let 's go on the swings ! " sue said .

" no , i want to stay here . mushrooms are fun and pretty . you can go on the swings by yourself ! " tim said .

