they marched and sang and had fun . they saw the sunrise and felt happy . they were fair and kind to each other . they loved to play outside . tara was a cat who liked to tease . she would hide under the sofa and jump out at the dog , max , when he walked by . she would scratch the curtains and knock over the vase . she would run away when her owner tried to pet her .

