after a while , lucy figured out that being gentle with numbers and counting can be fun . she learned something very valuable on her walk that day . sometimes , it is important to be gentle so that something like learning can be enjoyable . once upon a time there was a little girl named sally . she was full of energy and loved to explore . one day sally was playing near her house and saw something shiny on the ground . she went to take a closer look and it was a big piece of gum ! she was so excited and quickly put it in her pocket .

