the little squirrel and the brown chest were forever friends after that special day . mum and dad were worried . they did n't understand why their little girl was so upset . they asked her why she was sad and she said , " i want cauliflower for dinner " . mum and dad did n't understand , because they had already cooked dinner . so mum asked her to show her where the cauliflower was .

