mum and dad finally understood . they laughed and said that the cauliflower could stay in the garden and that they would have dinner inside . they hugged their little girl and they were no longer worried . once upon a time there was a girl who loved pretty jewelry . she always wanted to have many shiny necklaces and sparkly earrings , so one day she went to a store to buy them . but in the store , all of the jewelry was very expensive and the girl did n't have enough money .

