this story teaches us that if we work hard and aim for something , we can achieve it . rather than try and take shortcuts , it 's better to save up and drive towards our dreams . once there was a girl named jane . she loved to play in the park , but one day the police were there . jane was scared and stayed hidden in a bush . the police officers were fake and mean . they shouted and scared some of the people in the park .

