at the end of the day , blue and momo were very happy . they knew that they had found a new friend who cared for them . and they all lived happily ever after in the big jungle . once upon a time , there was a tidy room . in the room , there was a little girl named sue . sue had a dream . she wanted to find a big , shiny star .

