lily clapped her hands and said , " yes , yes ! i want to eat sandwiches and apples by the lake ! " daddy laughed and said , " okay , let 's go ! " once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she was shy and did n't like to talk to other people . one day , she was playing in the park when she fell and hurt her knee . she started to cry , but then a kind boy came to hug her and make her feel better .

