when they got home , lily realized she had lost her favorite toy . she started to cry and her mom tried to comfort her with a hug . but lily did n't want her mom 's hug . she wanted the boy 's hug from the park .

sadly , lily never saw the boy again and she never found her toy . she learned that sometimes it 's important to speak up and not be too shy . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she had a toy car that she loved to play with every day . one day , she accidentally dropped it and it broke . she felt sad and did n't know what to do .

