from then on , the queen was very careful when picking her fruit . she learned that even fancy queens need to be careful about what they eat . the end . once upon a time , there was a little bunny named benny . benny liked to play in the woods with his friends . one day , while playing hide and seek , benny found a big pile of wood . he was so excited to show his friends what he had found .

