mittens reluctantly got into the bath and her owner gently washed her with soap and water . when they were done , mittens felt soft and clean . she was happy she had taken her bath and could now enjoy the rest of her day . once upon a time , there was a little boy named timmy . timmy loved to play outside and get dirty . he would run around in the mud and grass all day long . but when it was time for dinner , his parent would say , " timmy , it 's time to bathe ! "

