after his bath , timmy 's parent would wrap him up in a nice warm towel and give him a big hug . timmy felt so loved and cared for by his parent . he knew that taking a bath was important to stay clean and healthy . from then on , timmy looked forward to his baths every day . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to walk on the path in the forest near her house . one day , she saw a dead bird on the path . she felt sad for the bird and wanted to bury it .

