lily decided to put the bird in a box and take it to the animal doctor . the doctor told her that the bird was already dead and could n't be saved . lily felt even more sad but knew that she had tried to help . she went back to the path and said a little prayer for the bird . once upon a time , there was a boy named timmy . timmy had a couch in his room where he liked to sit and watch tv . his couch was regular , just like all the other couches .

one day , timmy was sitting on his couch and he saw a bug . the bug was very small and it kept blinking . timmy thought the bug was very funny .

suddenly , the bug flew onto timmyâ€ ™ s nose and he started to blink too . timmy laughed and the bug flew away . from that day on , timmy always looked for the blinking bug whenever he sat on his regular couch . once upon a time , there was a cute little puppy named max . max loved to play with his toys and run around in the yard . one day , max 's owner received a letter in the mail . it was from max 's cousin who lived far away . max 's owner opened the letter and read it out loud to max .

max barked happily and wagged his tail . " i want to speak to my cousin on the phone ! " he said . so , max 's owner called max 's cousin and put the phone on speaker . max barked and whined , trying to speak to his cousin .

max 's cousin said , " you sound adorable , max ! i wish i could see you in person . " max barked even louder , happy to hear his cousin 's voice . after the call , max 's owner gave him a treat for being such a good listener . max was happy and content , dreaming of the day he could meet his cousin in person . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . but they did not like the big dog that lived next to the park . the dog was loud and mean . sometimes it barked and chased them .

