she took them home and gave them cookies and milk . she also called the dog 's owner and told him to keep his dog inside . lily and ben never saw the dog again . they still liked to play in the park , but they always stayed close to their mom . lily and ben were playing with their toys in the living room . lily had a doll with long hair and a dress . ben had a car with wheels and a horn . they liked to share their toys and make stories with them .

