they continued to play with their toys and have fun . they were happy and loved each other . lily loved to read novels . she had many novels in her room . she liked to read them every day . she did not like to share her novels with anyone . she was selfish .

one day , her friend ben came to play with her . ben saw her novels and wanted to read one . he asked lily , " can i read one of your novels , please ? "

