ben left . he did not want to play with lily anymore . he hoped to find a better friend . a friend who was kind and generous . a friend who liked to share .

lily stayed in her room . she read her novels . she was alone . she did not have any friends . she was not happy . she realized that she was wrong . she wished she had shared her novels with ben . she wished she had been his friend . she hoped he would forgive her .

the moral of the story is : do n't be selfish . share what you have with others . friends are more important than things . lily and sam are twins . they like to play outside with their toys . one day , they see a big van on their street . the van is blue and has many pictures on it . lily and sam are curious .

" look , sam , a van ! " lily says . " what is in the van ? "

" i do n't know , lily . maybe it has candy or toys or books , " sam says . " let 's go and see . "

they run to the van and knock on the door . a man opens the door and smiles . he has a hat and a beard . he is the driver of the van .

" hello , kids . do you want to see what i have in my van ? " he asks .

" yes , please ! " lily and sam say .

the man shows them his van . it is full of different things . he has musical instruments , puppets , costumes , and magic tricks . he is a clown . he travels to different places and makes people laugh and happy . he is very successful .

