they take more snow and wrap it around the snowman . they make him bigger and bigger . they do not see that the snowman is not strong . he is too heavy .

suddenly , the snowman falls down . he breaks into many pieces . the hat and the scarf fly away . anna and ben are sad .

" oh no ! our snowman ! he is gone ! " anna cries .

" why did he fall ? we wanted to make him happy ! " ben cries .

they run to their snowman . they try to put him back together . but they can not . the snow is too wet and soft . they hug each other and cry . they are not happy . tom was a boy who liked to make noise . he had a toy drum , a toy guitar and a toy trumpet . he played them all day and all night . his mom and dad did not like the noise . they said , " tom , please play quietly . you are making our ears hurt . "

one day , tom saw a big brown dog in the park . the dog was barking loudly . tom thought the dog was funny . he wanted to play with the dog . he ran to the dog with his toy trumpet . he blew the trumpet in the dog 's face . the dog did not like the trumpet . the dog growled and showed his teeth .

" tom , stop that ! you are making the dog angry ! " his mom shouted . but tom did not listen . he blew the trumpet louder and louder . the dog barked louder and louder . the dog jumped at tom and bit his trumpet . the trumpet broke in half . tom was scared and sad . he dropped the trumpet and ran to his mom .

" mom , the dog broke my trumpet ! " he cried .

" i 'm sorry , tom , but you should have listened to me . you made the dog angry with your noise . you need to be careful and respectful of animals . maybe next time you will play quietly , " his mom said .

tom nodded . he hugged his mom and said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i love you . "

he learned his lesson . he never played his trumpet near a dog again . he still liked to make noise , but he managed to play quietly when he had to . he was a good boy . lily and ben are twins . they like to play in the kitchen . one day , they see a big refrigerator . it has many buttons and lights .

" let 's test the refrigerator , " lily says . " maybe it has something yummy inside . "

" ok , " ben says . " but we have to be alert . mom and dad will be mad if they catch us . "

they open the refrigerator door . they see milk , cheese , eggs , and fruit . they also see a cake with chocolate and cream .

" wow , look at the cake ! " lily says . " it looks so good . can we have some ? "

" i do n't know , " ben says . " it has a note on it . it says ' happy birthday , grandma ' . "

" who cares ? " lily says . " grandma is not here . she lives far away . we can have a little bite . she wo n't notice . "

they take the cake out of the refrigerator . they put it on the table . they grab a knife and a fork . they are about to cut the cake when they hear a loud noise .

" surprise ! " mom and dad shout . they come into the kitchen with grandma . they have balloons and presents . they see lily and ben with the cake .

