mom and dad and grandma look at them . they are not angry . they are smiling .

" it 's ok , " grandma says . " i 'm happy to see you . you do n't have to test the refrigerator . you can have some cake . but first , give me a hug and a kiss . you are my sweet grandchildren . i love you very much . " lily and sam liked to pretend a lot . they pretended to be animals , or pirates , or superheroes . sometimes they pretended to be in a film , and acted out scenes they saw on tv .

one day , they pretended to be in a film about a princess and a knight . lily wore a pink dress and a crown , and sam wore a helmet and a sword . they made a castle out of pillows and blankets , and put some toys inside .

they took turns being the princess and the knight . when lily was the princess , she said , " help me , knight ! a dragon is coming to take me away ! " sam said , " do n't worry , princess ! i will save you ! " he ran outside and pretended to fight the dragon , which was a stuffed animal .

when sam was the princess , he said , " help me , knight ! a witch is coming to turn me into a frog ! " lily said , " do n't worry , princess ! i will save you ! " she ran outside and pretended to fight the witch , which was a doll .

