the bird looked at mia and leo and made a honking sound . it did not sound like a swan , either .

" i am a goose , " the bird said . " i came here to find some food . do you have any bread or seeds for me ? "

mia and leo did not have any bread or seeds . they only had some cookies and juice that their mom had given them for a snack .

" we do n't have any bread or seeds , " leo said . " but we have some cookies and juice . do you want some ? "

the goose nodded and followed mia and leo to their picnic blanket . they broke some cookies and poured some juice into a bowl and gave them to the goose . the goose ate and drank and thanked them .

" you are very kind , " the goose said . " you have supplied me with a good snack . can i stay here and play with you ? "

mia and leo smiled and nodded . they liked the goose . they played with the goose on the lawn until their mom called them for dinner . they said goodbye to the goose and told him to come back soon . the goose honked and waved and flew away . he was happy to have made some new friends . tom and sam are friends . they like to play with cars and trucks . they have many cars and trucks , but they are different . tom 's cars and trucks have motors . they can make noise and move by themselves . sam 's cars and trucks do not have motors . they are quiet and need to be pushed .

one day , tom and sam are playing in the yard . tom shows sam his new truck . it has a big motor and a horn . tom says , " look at my truck . it is big and loud . it can go fast and honk . it is better than your truck . "

sam feels sad . he likes his truck . it is small and red . it has a sticker of a star . he says , " no , my truck is good too . it is pretty and shiny . it has a star . it is better than your truck . "

tom and sam start to argue . they say mean things to each other . they do not want to share their trucks . they do not want to play together .

then , a big dog comes to the yard . it sees the trucks . it thinks they are toys . it runs to them and grabs them with its mouth . it shakes them and bites them . it breaks them .

tom and sam are scared . they see their trucks . they are broken and dirty . they do not look good anymore . they feel sorry . they say , " oh no , our trucks ! the dog broke our trucks ! we are sad . we are sorry . we were mean to each other . we should have been nice . we should have shared our trucks . "

tom and sam hug each other . they are friends again . they say , " we are friends . we like each other . we like our trucks . they are different , but they are both good . we can play with both of them . we can fix them and make them new . "

they go to the house . they ask their moms for help . they get some glue and tape and paint . they fix their trucks . they make them new . they give them new stickers and names . they say , " these are our new trucks . they are special and fun . they are ours . we are happy . we are friends . " anna and ben are twins . they like to play in the woods near their home . one day , they find a yellow cabin in the woods . it looks old and empty .

" let 's go inside and see what 's there , " ben says .

" ok , but be careful , " anna says .

they open the door and go inside . the cabin is dark and dusty . they see a table , a chair , a bed and a fireplace . they also see a big spider web in the corner .

" look , a spider web ! " ben says . he picks up a stick and pokes the web .

" ben , do n't do that ! you might make the spider angry , " anna says .

but it is too late . a big black spider crawls out of the web and hisses at ben . ben drops the stick and screams .

" help ! help ! a spider ! " ben cries .

anna sees the spider and gets scared too . she grabs ben 's hand and runs to the door . but the door is stuck . they can not open it .

" anna , what do we do ? " ben says .

" i do n't know , ben . i do n't know , " anna says .

they hear the spider coming closer and closer . they hug each other and close their eyes .

suddenly , they hear a loud bark . it is their dog , spot . spot has followed them to the cabin . he sees the spider and barks at it . the spider gets scared and runs away .

spot jumps on the door and pushes it with his paws . the door opens and spot runs inside . he licks anna and ben 's faces and wags his tail .

" spot , you saved us ! you saved us ! " anna and ben say .

they hug spot and thank him . then they run out of the cabin and back to their home . they tell their mom and dad what happened . their mom and dad hug them and tell them they are brave . they also tell them not to go to the cabin again .

anna and ben agree . they are happy to be safe and to have spot . they love their dog very much . he is their hero . lily and ben are friends . they like to play outside . one day , they see a big snowman in the park . he has a hat , a scarf , and a carrot nose . he looks happy .

" hello , snowman ! " lily says . " do you want to play with us ? "

the snowman does not answer . he just smiles .

" maybe he is shy , " ben says . " or maybe he is cold . he has no coat . "

lily and ben decide to make a coat for the snowman . they find some leaves , some sticks , and some flowers . they put them on the snowman . he looks funny .

" there , now you are warm , " lily says . " and pretty , too . "

the snowman does not say anything . he just smiles .

lily and ben are proud of their work . they hug the snowman . he feels cold and wet .

" ouch ! " lily says . " he is too cold for me . "

" me , too , " ben says . " let 's go and find something hot to drink . "

they say goodbye to the snowman and run to the cafe . they order hot chocolate and cookies . they sit by the window and watch the snowman .

the sun is shining . it is bright and warm . the snowman starts to melt . his hat falls off . his scarf slides down . his carrot nose drops to the ground .

" oh , no ! " lily says . " the snowman is going away . "

" maybe he is happy , " ben says . " maybe he likes the sun . he is still smiling . "

lily and ben smile , too . they drink their hot chocolate and eat their cookies . they are happy , too . they like the sun . they like the snowman . they like each other . tom and lily are twins . they like to play in the garden . they see a big tree with red fruit . they want to eat the fruit .

" let 's get some fruit ! " tom says .

" ok ! " lily says .

they run to the tree . but the fruit is too high . they can not reach it .

" we need a stick ! " tom says .

he looks for a stick . he finds a small one . he tries to poke the fruit . but the stick is too short . he can not get the fruit .

" this stick is no good ! " tom says .

he throws the stick away . he looks for a bigger one . he finds a hidden one behind a bush . he picks it up . he runs to the tree .

" i have a big stick ! " tom says .

he swings the stick at the fruit . he hits one . it falls to the ground . he picks it up . he smiles .

" i got one ! " tom says .

he bites the fruit . it is sweet and juicy . he likes it .

" can i have one too ? " lily says .

she looks at the tree . she sees more fruit . she wants one .

" sure ! " tom says .

he swings the stick again . he hits another fruit . it falls to the ground . he picks it up . he gives it to lily .

" here you go ! " tom says .

lily takes the fruit . she bites it . it is sweet and juicy . she likes it too .

" thank you ! " lily says .

they eat the fruit . they are happy . they share the stick . they get more fruit . they have fun . sara and ben were playing with their toy cars on the floor . they liked to make noises and pretend they were driving fast . sara had a red car and ben had a blue car .

" look , my car is faster than yours ! " sara said , zooming her car past ben 's .

" no , mine is faster ! " ben said , chasing her car with his .

they raced their cars around the room , until they saw a big box on the table . it had a top on it and a picture of a cake .

" what is that ? " sara asked , pointing to the box .

" maybe it is a surprise for us ! " ben said , running to the table .

he climbed on a chair and reached for the box . he tried to remove the top , but it was stuck .

" help me , sara ! " he said .

sara climbed on another chair and helped him pull the top . they removed the top and saw a big cake inside . it had white frosting and colorful sprinkles .

" wow , a cake ! " sara said , smiling .

" it looks yummy ! " ben said , licking his lips .

he touched the cake with his finger , but quickly pulled it back .

" ow , ow , ow ! " he cried . " the cake is hot ! "

sara looked at the box and saw a note . it said : " happy birthday , sara and ben ! wait for mom and dad to cut the cake . love , grandma and grandpa . "

" oh , no , ben ! " sara said . " we were not supposed to touch the cake ! it is our birthday cake ! "

ben felt sorry and rubbed his finger . he said : " i 'm sorry , sara . i did n't know it was hot . and i did n't know it was our birthday cake . "

sara hugged him and said : " it 's okay , ben . i 'm sorry , too . let 's put the top back on the box and wait for mom and dad . maybe they will let us have some cake later . "

they put the top back on the box and got down from the chairs . they went back to playing with their toy cars , but they also looked at the cake and smiled . they were happy it was their birthday and they had a cake . they hoped it would be cool soon . sara liked to read novels . novels were books with many words and pictures that told stories . sara had many novels in her room . she liked to read them before she slept .

one day , sara found a novel she had never seen before . it was about a bird that could soar in the sky . soar meant to fly very high and fast . sara wanted to soar like the bird . she opened the novel and started to read .

the bird in the novel was very flexible . flexible meant to bend and twist easily . the bird could fly in different ways and do tricks in the air . the bird had many friends who liked to watch him soar . the bird was happy .

but one day , the bird met a hawk . a hawk was a big and strong bird that liked to eat other birds . the hawk saw the bird and wanted to catch him . the bird tried to soar away , but the hawk was faster . the bird was scared .

" help me , please ! " the bird cried . " is anyone there ? "

sara heard the bird 's cry . she felt sorry for the bird . she wanted to help him . she closed her eyes and wished very hard . she wished she could soar like the bird and save him from the hawk .

suddenly , sara felt a strange feeling . she opened her eyes and saw that she was no longer in her room . she was in the sky , next to the bird . she had wings and feathers . she had become a bird !

" wow ! " sara said . " i can soar ! "

" thank you for coming ! " the bird said . " you are very kind . can you help me escape from the hawk ? "

" yes , i can ! " sara said . " follow me ! "

sara and the bird soared together . they used their flexible wings to dodge and weave . they flew higher and lower , faster and slower . they confused the hawk and made him tired . the hawk gave up and flew away .

" yay ! we did it ! " sara and the bird cheered . " we are safe ! "

" you are amazing ! " the bird said . " you can soar better than anyone i know . how did you do it ? "

" i do n't know , " sara said . " i just wished very hard . i wanted to soar like you and help you . i like your novel . it is very exciting . "

" thank you , " the bird said . " you are very brave and generous . you are my friend . do you want to stay with me and soar some more ? "

sara thought for a moment . she liked to soar with the bird . it was fun and beautiful . but she also missed her home and her family . she missed her other novels and her bed . she had to go back .

" i 'm sorry , " sara said . " i ca n't stay . i have to go home . but i will always remember you and our adventure . maybe we can meet again someday . "

" ok , " the bird said . " i understand . i will miss you . but i will always remember you too . you are the best friend i ever had . goodbye , sara . "

" goodbye , bird , " sara said .

sara closed her eyes and wished very hard . she wished she could go back to her room and her normal life . she felt a strange feeling . she opened her eyes and saw that she was in her bed , holding the novel . she was a girl again .

she smiled and hugged the novel . she was happy . she had learned something new . she had learned that reading novels can make you soar in your imagination . she had learned that being flexible can help you overcome challenges . she had learned that being kind and helpful can make you friends . she had learned a lot from the novel .

she put the novel on her shelf and turned off the light . she closed her eyes and fell asleep . she dreamed of soaring with the bird . she dreamed of novels . she dreamed of being flexible , kind and helpful . she dreamed of being happy . lila and tom are playing in the park . they see a big tree with red and yellow leaves . they want to pick some leaves and make a picture .

