" ow , ow , ow ! it hurts ! " lila says , holding her hand . tom runs to help her . he sees the bee flying away .

" bad bee ! go away ! " tom says , waving his arms . he looks at lila 's hand . it is red and swollen . he remembers what his mom told him .

