they walk to the ice cream truck . the man in the truck sees them and smiles .

" hello , kids . what can i get you ? " he asks .

" can we have some ice , please ? lila has a bee sting . " tom says .

" of course , you can . here , take this cup of ice . and here , have some ice cream , too . it 's on the house . " the man says , giving them a cup of ice and two cones of ice cream .

" thank you , sir . you are very nice . " tom says .

" thank you , thank you ! " lila says , smiling through her tears .

they sit on a bench and put the ice on lila 's hand . they also lick their ice cream . it is cold and sweet .

" does your hand feel better , lila ? " tom asks .

" yes , it does . the ice helps . and the ice cream , too . it is yummy . " lila says .

" i 'm glad . you are very brave , lila . i 'm sorry the bee hurt you . " tom says .

" it 's okay , tom . you are a good friend . you helped me . i 'm sorry i took your leaf . " lila says .

" it 's okay , lila . you can have the leaf . i have another one . look , it has a tip like a star . " tom says , showing her his leaf .

" it 's beautiful , tom . let 's make a picture with our leaves . we can use the ice cream cones as the sun . they are hot and bright . " lila says .

