they finish their ice cream and make a picture with their leaves and cones . they are happy and forget about the bee . they hug each other and laugh . they are the best of friends . anna liked to ride her bike with her big sister , lily . lily had a fancy bike with many colors and a bell . anna had a small bike with two wheels and a pedal . anna wanted to be like lily and go fast and far .

one day , they went to the park with their mom . lily rode ahead and anna tried to follow her . but anna 's pedal was hard to push and her legs were tired . she saw a big hill and felt scared . she wanted to stop and rest .

" come on , anna , do n't be slow ! " lily shouted from the top of the hill . " it 's fun to go down the hill ! "

anna did not think it was fun . she thought it was scary . she wanted to tell lily to wait for her , but lily did not hear her . she saw lily zoom down the hill and disappear behind some trees .

anna felt alone and sad . she wished lily would mind her and be nice to her . she wished she had a fancy bike like lily . she wished she could go fast and far like lily .

she heard her mom call her name . she turned around and saw her mom smiling at her . she ran to her mom and hugged her .

