mom kissed anna 's head and said , " i 'm sorry , anna . i know you want to be like lily , but you are still little . you have your own bike and your own speed . and lily does mind you and love you . she just likes to go fast and far . she does n't mean to hurt your feelings . she wants to play with you , too . why do n't we go and find her and have a picnic together ? "

anna nodded and smiled . she felt better . she liked her mom and her bike and her pedal . she liked lily , too , even if she had a fancy bike and a bell . she hoped lily would mind her and be nice to her . she hoped they could play together and have fun . ben and tom are brothers . they like to play with cars and balls . but sometimes they fight . they fight over toys and snacks and tv . mom and dad are not happy when they fight .

