they walked around the park , holding hands and pretending to be married . they saw a big slide and ran to it . they took turns sliding down and laughing . they had a lot of fun .

but then , lily 's mom came to pick her up . she saw the ring on lily 's finger and frowned . " where did you get that , lily ? that 's not yours . you have to give it back . "

lily was sad . she did n't want to give back the ring . she liked it and she liked playing marry with tom . she looked at tom and he looked sad too . they hugged each other and said goodbye .

lily gave the ring to her mom and left with her . tom waved to her and watched her go . he felt lonely and wished she could stay . he hoped they could play marry again soon . tommy likes to play with his trumpet . he likes to make loud noises and pretend he is in a band . he blows his trumpet every day in his room .

but his sister lily does not like his trumpet . she thinks it is too noisy and hurts her ears . she likes to read books and draw pictures in her room . she wants tommy to stop playing his trumpet .

one day , lily has an idea . she takes some black paint and a brush . she sneaks into tommy 's room when he is not there . she paints his trumpet black . she thinks tommy will not like his trumpet anymore and will stop playing it .

but tommy is very angry when he sees his trumpet . he loves his trumpet and does not care what color it is . he runs to lily 's room and yells at her .

