tommy and lily feel sorry for what they did . they hug and say sorry . they clean up their rooms and their trumpet . they decide to play together and take turns . tommy teaches lily how to play the trumpet . lily teaches tommy how to draw . they have fun and make less noise . their mom is happy . lily likes to watch tv with her big brother tom . they watch funny shows and laugh a lot . sometimes tom lets lily hold the remote and choose the show . lily feels happy when tom is nice to her .

one day , lily and tom are watching tv when mom comes home . mom has a big bag of toys for lily . she says they are from her friend who has a baby . lily is excited and runs to see the toys . she sees a pink doll , a yellow ball , a blue car and a green book . she likes them all and says " mine , mine , mine ! "

tom sees the toys and laughs . he says they are for babies and lily is too old for them . he says lily should play with his toys , like his lego and his robot . he says his toys are cool and smart and lily 's toys are silly and dumb . he tries to take the doll from lily and says " give me that , it 's not for you ! "

lily gets angry and holds the doll tight . she says " no , it 's mine , go away ! " she pushes tom and he falls on the floor . the remote falls from his hand and the tv changes to a show for babies . it has songs and colors and animals . tom feels embarrassed and says " eww , what is this ? turn it off , turn it off ! "

