lily and tom say " thank you , mom , we love you . " they hug mom and each other . they decide to play with the toys together and watch a show that is fun for both of them . they feel happy and forget about being embarrassed . lily was a little girl who liked to feed her dolls . she had a pink fork that she used to give them pretend food . she pretended that the fork was a plane and made zooming noises as she moved it to their mouths .

one day , lily saw a real bird outside her window . it was brown and had a yellow beak . it was hopping on the branch of a tree . lily thought it looked hungry . she wanted to feed it with her fork .

she ran to the kitchen and got some bread . she tore it into small pieces and put them on her fork . she opened the window and held out her fork to the bird . she said , " here , birdie , have some food . it is yummy . "

the bird looked at lily and tilted its head . it saw the bread on the fork and flew closer . it pecked at the bread and ate it . it made a happy chirp and flew away .

lily smiled and waved at the bird . she felt proud that she had fed it with her fork . she closed the window and went back to her dolls . she said , " did you see that , dolls ? i fed a bird with my fork . it was fun . " lily and ben were hungry . they wanted to eat some cookies . mom said no . she said they had to eat lunch first . she put some soup and bread on a tray and brought it to the table .

" please , mom , can we have some cookies ? " lily and ben asked . they did not like soup and bread . they liked cookies and milk .

