lily and ben had a bad idea . they decided to take the cookies from the tray . they thought mom would not see them . they reached for the tray . but the tray was hot . the soup was hot . the tray slipped from their hands . the soup spilled on the table and on the floor . the bread fell on the chairs . the cookies broke into pieces .

