lily and ben cried . they were sorry . they wished they had listened to mom . they wished they had eaten their soup and bread . they wished they had waited for the cookies . they learned a hard lesson . they had a bad day . lila and tom are friends . they like to play with blocks and cars . one day , they find a new toy in the playroom . it is a big train with many cars . it has a button that makes it go .

