one day , tom went to a restaurant with his mom and dad . he saw pasta with sauce on the menu and he wanted it . he asked his mom to order it for him . she said yes and told the waiter .

when the pasta came , tom was very happy . he took a big fork and put some pasta in his mouth . but the sauce was very hot and spicy . it made his tongue burn and his eyes water . he spit out the pasta and cried . he wanted water and milk and bread .

the waiter and the other people in the restaurant looked at tom . they saw the sauce on his face and his shirt and his plate . they heard him cry and saw him spit . some of them laughed and some of them said " aww " . tom felt very embarrassed . he wished he had ordered something else .

his mom and dad hugged him and gave him water and milk and bread . they told him it was okay and they were sorry . they asked the waiter to bring him another pasta with a different sauce . they said they would help him clean his face and his shirt and his plate . they said they loved him and he was a good boy .

tom felt a little better . he said he was sorry and he loved them too . he tried the new pasta with a different sauce . it was not hot and spicy . it was sweet and creamy . he liked it and ate it . he was not embarrassed anymore . he was happy and full . ben and lily went to the park with mom . they saw a pond with many ducks . the ducks were light brown and white . they had yellow beaks and feet . ben and lily liked the ducks . they wanted to feed them bread .

" mom , can we give bread to the ducks ? " ben asked .

" sure , but only a little bit . too much bread is not good for them , " mom said . she gave them some bread pieces .

ben and lily threw the bread into the pond . the ducks swam to get the bread . they quacked and splashed . ben and lily laughed . they liked to watch the ducks .

one duck was different from the others . it was bigger and darker . it had a red head and a blue wing . it did not eat the bread . it acted funny . it made loud noises and chased the other ducks . it scared them away .

" look , mom , that duck is acting bad . why is it so mean ? " lily asked .

" that 's not a duck , sweetie . that 's a goose . geese are different from ducks . they are more aggressive and territorial . they do n't like to share , " mom explained .

" can we make it go away ? " ben asked .

" no , we ca n't . we have to respect its space . let 's leave the pond and go to the playground . maybe we can see some nice ducks there , " mom suggested .

ben and lily agreed . they said goodbye to the ducks and the goose . they went to the playground . they had fun on the swings and the slide . they forgot about the mean goose . they were happy . lily and tom were friends . they liked to play in the snow . one day , they saw a big snowman in the park . he had a hat , a scarf , a carrot nose and two eyes made of coal .

" hello , snowman ! " lily said . " do you want to play with us ? "

the snowman did not say anything . he just looked at them with his coal eyes .

" maybe he is hungry , " tom said . " let 's feed him something . "

they looked around and saw a bakery . they ran inside and bought a tasty cake . they brought it back to the snowman .

" here you go , snowman , " tom said . " this is for you . it is very tasty . "

they put the cake in front of the snowman 's mouth . but the snowman did not eat it . he just looked at them with his coal eyes .

" maybe he does not like cake , " lily said . " maybe he likes something else . "

they looked around and saw a bird feeder . they ran to it and took some seeds . they brought them back to the snowman .

" here you go , snowman , " lily said . " this is for you . it is very tasty . "

they put the seeds in front of the snowman 's mouth . but the snowman did not eat them . he just looked at them with his coal eyes .

" maybe he does not like seeds , " tom said . " maybe he likes something else . "

they looked around and saw a pile of coal . they ran to it and took some pieces . they brought them back to the snowman .

" here you go , snowman , " tom said . " this is for you . it is very tasty . "

they put the coal in front of the snowman 's mouth . but the snowman did not eat them . he just looked at them with his coal eyes .

then , he opened his mouth and said , " no , thank you . i do not like coal . i like cake and seeds . but you took them all . that was not nice . now i am angry . "

he took off his hat and scarf and threw them at lily and tom . he took out his carrot nose and his coal eyes and threw them at lily and tom . he started to roll down the hill , chasing lily and tom .

" run , run ! " lily and tom shouted . " the snowman is mad at us ! "

they ran away from the snowman as fast as they could . they learned a lesson . they should not take things that are not theirs . they should share and be kind . lily liked to read books with her mom . she liked books with pictures and words that rhymed . she liked books that made her laugh and think . she liked books that were poems .

one day , she went to the library with her mom . she saw a big book with a colorful cover . it had a picture of a cat and a hat . she wanted to read it . she asked her mom , " can i borrow this book ? "

her mom looked at the book . she smiled and said , " sure , you can borrow this book . it is a very unusual book . it is a book of poems by dr. seuss . he was a funny man who wrote silly poems . do you want to hear one ? "

lily nodded . she was curious . her mom opened the book and read :

" the sun did not shine . it was too wet to play . so we sat in the house . all that cold , cold , wet day .

i sat there with sally . we sat there , we two . and i said , ' how i wish we had something to do ! ' "

lily giggled . she liked the rhyme . she liked the sound of the words . she wanted to hear more . she asked her mom , " can you read another one ? "

her mom said , " of course , i can read another one . how about this one ? "

she turned the page and read :

" one fish , two fish , red fish , blue fish . black fish , blue fish , old fish , new fish .

this one has a little star . this one has a little car . say ! what a lot of fish there are . "

lily clapped her hands . she liked the fish . she liked the colors . she liked the poem . she said , " this is a fun book . i want to borrow it . can we take it home ? "

her mom said , " yes , we can take it home . but we have to return it later . that is what borrowing means . you can use something for a while , but then you have to give it back . do you understand ? "

lily nodded . she understood . she was happy . she hugged the book and said , " thank you , mom . thank you , dr. seuss . you made a very unusual book . a book of poems that i like . " once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she had a delicate toy named mr. bunny . mr. bunny was very special to lily . they played together every day . one day , mr. bunny got a rip in his ear . lily was very sad .

lily 's mom said , " let 's take mr. bunny to the toy doctor . he can fix him . " lily and her mom went to the toy doctor 's house . the doctor looked at mr. bunny and said , " i can fix him . he will be better soon . "

the toy doctor worked on mr. bunny . he sewed up the rip in his ear . when he was done , he gave mr. bunny back to lily . she was so happy to receive her friend back . lily said , " thank you , doctor ! " the toy doctor smiled and said , " you 're welcome . "

lily and mr. bunny went back home . they played together just like before . lily was very careful with her delicate friend . they lived happily ever after . once upon a time , there was a boy named tim . tim loved to play with his toy guitar . he would play it all day long . he also liked to play outside in the sun . one day , he saw a big cloud in the sky . he thought it might rain , but he wanted to play outside with his guitar anyway .

tim went outside with his guitar . he played and played . the sun was hot and made tim and his guitar very dry . but tim did not mind . he was having so much fun . he forgot about the big cloud he saw earlier .

suddenly , it started to rain . tim and his guitar began to soak . he remembered the big cloud and knew he should have listened . tim ran back inside with his wet guitar . he learned to watch for clouds and keep his guitar dry . from that day on , tim always checked the sky before playing outside with his guitar . once upon a time , in a lovely little house , there lived a girl named lucy . she loved playing with her toys and sharing them with her friends . one day , lucy found a big box in her room . she was very excited and wanted to see what was inside .

lucy opened the box and found many toys inside . she thought it would be a good idea to share the toys with her friends . she asked her mom , " can i recommend my friends to come and play with these toys ? " her mom said , " yes , that 's a great idea ! "

lucy invited her friends over , and they all had a fun time playing with the toys from the box . they learned that sharing is caring , and it made everyone happy . the moral of the story is that sharing with others can bring joy and happiness to everyone . once upon a time , there was a powerful lion named leo . leo had soft , golden skin that shone brightly in the sun . he lived in a big forest with many friends , like the birds , the monkeys , and the elephants . they all liked to play and have fun together .

one day , leo 's friends wanted to have a race to see who was the fastest . they asked leo to record the race , so he could tell them who won . the race started , and all the animals ran as fast as they could . leo watched carefully and cheered for his friends .

at the end of the race , the rabbit won . all the animals were happy for the rabbit , and they thanked leo for recording the race . the powerful lion with the golden skin learned that helping his friends was more important than showing off his power . from that day on , leo was always there to help his friends , and they all lived happily together in the big forest . the moral of the story is that helping others is more important than showing off your own strength . once upon a time , in a big tree , there was a little dove . the dove had a small nest with her eggs . the sun was hot , and the dove was very thirsty .

the dove saw a big lake near the tree . she wanted to get a drink of water . so , she opened her wings and flew down to the lake . the water was cool and nice to drink .

the dove drank some water and felt much better . she flew back to her nest and sat on her eggs . soon , the eggs opened , and little baby doves came out . the dove was a happy mommy , and they all lived happily in the big tree . one day , a little girl named lucy found a big closet in her room . she opened the door and saw many delicious treats inside . there were cookies , candies , and cakes . lucy was very happy and wanted to eat them all .

lucy 's mom came into the room and said , " lucy , you can have one treat now , but save the rest for later . if you eat them all , they will vanish and you wo n't have any left . " lucy picked up a cookie and ate it . it was very yummy . she wanted more , but remembered what her mom said .

later , lucy 's friend tommy came over to play . lucy showed tommy the closet with the delicious treats . they both wanted more , but lucy said , " we can only have one now , or they will all vanish . " tommy agreed , and they each had one candy . they played all day , and when it was time for tommy to go home , they were happy that they still had lots of treats left in the closet . they knew they could enjoy them another day . once upon a time , there was a pale boy named tim . tim loved candy more than anything . every day , he would go to the candy store and buy his favorite candy .

one day , tim found a big box . the box had a note on it . the note said , " release the candy inside . " tim was so happy . he opened the box and found lots and lots of candy .

tim shared the candy with his friends . they all ate candy and played together . tim was very happy . he learned that sharing made everyone happy . and they all lived happily ever after . once upon a time , there was a big wardrobe in a small room . it was a fearful wardrobe because it made loud noises at night . the people in the house were scared of the noises .

one day , a brave little girl named lucy decided to find out what was inside the wardrobe . she opened the door and saw many clothes . she looked and looked , but there was nothing that could make the noises . lucy was confused .

then , lucy had an idea . she told her mom to order a soft rug for the wardrobe . they put the rug under the wardrobe . that night , there were no more loud noises . the family was happy , and the wardrobe was not fearful anymore . once upon a time , a little black cat named kitty lived in a big house . kitty loved to play outside in the sun . one hot day , kitty went to the park to play .

