before bedtime , lily asked her uncle to sing a song with her . they sang a happy song together , and it made them both feel good . after they finished singing , lily gave her uncle a big hug , and they said good night . once upon a time , there was a little boy named tim . tim was very proud of his toy car collection . he loved to play with the cars , making them race and crash into each other .

