when they got to the party , mia 's mommy wanted to help her . she said , " mia , let me introduce you to a new friend . " mia saw a girl named lily . lily was wearing a nice dress too . mia and lily said " hi " to each other .

soon , mia and lily were playing together . they laughed and had fun at the party . mia was not worried anymore . she was happy that her mommy introduced her to a new friend . they played all day , and mia could n't wait to see lily again . once upon a time , there was a little boy named tim . tim liked to play with his toys and take the elevator in his house . the elevator was big and smooth . it went up and down , and tim liked to ride it every day .

one day , tim wanted to take his toys with him in the elevator . he put them all in a big bag and went to the elevator . he pushed the button , and the elevator door opened . tim and his toys went inside , and he pushed the button to go up .

