as they painted , their friends in the reef came to watch . they saw the bright colors and were very happy . the rough reef looked beautiful with the new colors . bob and tina were proud of their work , and all the fish and turtles in the reef enjoyed their new , colorful home . once upon a time , in a small town , there lived a girl named emma . emma loved to gather things . she would gather rocks , leaves , and even lemons . emma had a big lemon tree in her yard with big , yellow lemons .

