but when emma got to the top of the tree , she lost her balance and fell down . emma was very sad and hurt . she did not get the unusual lemon , and she could not play with her friends for a long time . once upon a time , there was a boy named tim . tim liked to create things with his toys . one day , tim found a small pill on the floor . he did not know what it was . tim was ignorant about pills . he thought it was a toy .

