in the end , tim 's mom explained to him that the pill was not a toy . she told him it could make him sick . tim understood and gave the pill to his mom . they hugged , and tim went back to creating things with his real toys . once upon a time , there was a big palace . it was very pretty . in the palace , there lived a king , a queen , and a little girl named lily .

