the bird stared back at lily . the bird was envious of the palace . it wanted to live there too . so , lily opened the window and let the bird in . they became best friends and played together every day . once upon a time , in a big zoo , there was a white lion . the white lion was very nice and liked to play with his friends . one day , a little girl named mia went to the zoo with her mom . mia loved lions and was very excited to see them .

