the white lion heard mia and came closer to the fence . mia waved at the lion and the lion seemed to recognize her as a friend . mia giggled and said , " hi , lion ! you are so pretty ! " the white lion roared softly as if saying hello back to mia .

mia and the white lion played together for a while , running along the fence and laughing . when it was time to go , mia said goodbye to the white lion and promised to come back soon . the white lion roared softly again , as if to say , " i 'll be waiting , my friend . " once upon a time , there was a little girl named sue . sue loved to draw with her pencil . one day , she wanted to draw a big , pretty picture . she was very patient and took her time to make it perfect .

