one day , a big man came to the house . he said he could fix the sink . the people were happy . they asked the big man to fix the sink . the big man said they had to pay him first . so , the people gave him some money .

the big man started to work on the sink . but he was not a good fixer . he made the sink worse . the sink broke and water went everywhere . the house was very wet . the big man took the money and left . the people were sad and the sink was still scary and broken . once upon a time , there was a girl named sue . sue was a very reliable friend . every day , she would play with her best friend , tom . they liked to play with toys and share their snacks . they always had fun together .

one day , sue and tom were playing in sue 's room . they noticed a telephone on the table . they had seen their mom and dad use it before . the telephone was big and had lots of buttons on it . sue and tom wanted to try it too .

