mia gave the pepper back to tom , and they both felt happy . they learned that it is good to help friends and share things . from that day on , mia and tom promised to always help each other and share their toys and food . and they became the best of friends . one day , a boy named tim went to the mall with his mom . he liked to observe all the different shops and people there . he saw a toy store and wanted to go inside .

