finally , his mom said , " if you are good and help me with shopping , we can come back next week and get the red ball . " tim agreed and helped his mom . he learned that being patient and helpful can get you what you want . once upon a time , in a small village , there lived a boy named tom . tom was a very ignorant boy , and he did not trust anyone . one day , tom found a pistol in the woods . he did not know what it was , but he thought it was a toy .

