he decided to go to the house too . maybe he could find someone else who liked worms . maybe he could find a book about worms . maybe he could learn more about them . he loved his worms . he thought they were beautiful . lily liked to help her mom in the kitchen . she had a small apron that matched her mom 's big apron . she wore it when she helped to stir , pour , and taste the food .

one day , mom was making a cake for dad 's birthday . she told lily to get some eggs from the fridge . lily ran to the fridge and opened the door . she saw a lot of eggs in a carton . she tried to pick up the carton , but it was too heavy for her . she dropped it on the floor and the eggs broke .

