lily felt happy and proud . she thought that mom and dad were the best parents ever . she thought that making cakes with bananas was fun . she thought that she loved her family very much . tom was a good dog . he was obedient and loved his family . he liked to play fetch and chase squirrels in the park . one day , he went for a walk with his dad . they saw a big truck with a sign that said " oil " . tom was curious and sniffed the truck .

the truck driver did not see tom . he started the truck and drove away . tom was scared and ran after the truck . he barked and barked , but the driver did not hear him . the truck went faster and faster , and tom got tired and thirsty . he did not know where he was .

meanwhile , his dad was looking for him . he asked people if they saw a dog with a red collar . he called tom 's name , but no one answered . he was sad and worried . he hoped tom was safe .

