a man saw tom . he was a worker at the building . he liked animals and felt sorry for tom . he ran to him and picked him up . he wrapped him in a towel and carried him to his car . he drove him to a vet . the vet cleaned tom and checked him . he said tom was brave and lucky . he gave him some medicine and a treat . he called tom 's dad and told him where he was .

