mom and dad see them from the window . they smile and laugh . they think lily and ben are very cute . they say , " they are fine . they are just playing . let them have fun . " they take a picture of lily and ben in their plane . they keep the picture in a frame . they love their children very much . tommy liked to draw with his crayons . he drew many things , like cars , trees , and animals . but he did not like to share his crayons with his sister , lily . he said they were his and only his .

