" what is your medal for ? " ben asked .

" it 's for being brave , " the man said . " i was a soldier and i fought in a war . it was very scary and hot and loud . but i helped my friends and they helped me . and we came back home . "

" wow , you are very brave , " anna said . " can we be brave too ? "

" of course you can , " the man said . " being brave is not only about fighting . it 's about doing the right thing , even when it 's hard . like sharing your toys , or saying sorry , or helping someone who is sad . "

anna and ben nodded . they thought about the times they were brave , like when they went to the dentist , or when they made a new friend , or when they learned to ride a bike .

" thank you for showing us your medal , " ben said . " can we give you a hug ? "

" sure , i would like that , " the man said . he hugged them and put his medal back on . " you are very nice kids . and you are brave too . maybe one day you will get a medal of your own . "

