ben gave him his small magnet and they all went back to the fridge . they made shapes and letters and had fun . they were not scared anymore . ben and sam like to play at the beach . they dig in the sand and look for shells and rocks . one day , they find a big oyster with a shiny pearl inside . they are very happy and excited .

