ben and sam thank the fisherman and hug each other . they are happy and grateful . they promise to share and be nice . they put the pearl in their pocket and run back to their parents . they show them the pearl and tell them the story . their parents are proud and surprised . they say they will pay for ice cream to celebrate . ben and sam smile and cheer . they love the beach and the oyster and the fisherman . they are smart and happy . one day , anna and ben went to the park with their mom . they liked to play on the swings , the slide and the sandbox . they also liked to look at the flowers and the trees .

