they climb up the stairs and sit on the slide . lily turns on the light and holds it in front of them . they see the light shine on the slide and the grass . they smile and slide down . they feel the wind and the sun . they laugh and shout .

" wow , that was easy and fun ! " ben says .

" yes , it was ! " lily says . " and the light made it even better ! "

they hug and run to the slide again . they have a good time . they are happy . sara and ben are playing hide and seek in the park . sara is the seeker and ben is the hider . sara counts to ten and then looks for ben . she sees a big tree with many leaves . she thinks ben might be hiding behind it .

