the cat nods and rubs its head against sara 's hand . sara pets the cat and feels its soft fur . she hears ben giggle from somewhere else . she says , " bye , cat . i have to find ben . maybe i will see you again . "

she leaves the cat and runs to another place . she sees a bench with a red bag on it . she thinks ben might be hiding under the bag . she walks to the bench and peeks under the bag . she sees a tasty sandwich with cheese and ham . she feels hungry and says , " mmm , sandwich . you are not ben . you are very yummy . can i eat you ? "

the sandwich does not answer . sara hears ben laugh from somewhere else . she says , " sorry , sandwich . i have to find ben . maybe i will eat you later . "

she leaves the sandwich and runs to another place . she sees a slide with a blue hat on it . she thinks ben might be hiding under the hat . she walks to the slide and peeks under the hat . she sees ben 's face with a big grin . she says , " aha , ben . i found you . you are very clever . but you are not a cat or a sandwich . you are my friend . "

ben says , " you are right , sara . you are very smart . but you are not a seeker or a finder . you are my friend . "

they hug and laugh . they decide to share the sandwich and play with the cat . they have a lot of fun in the park . they are happy . sara and ben wanted to decorate their room for fall . they liked the colors of the leaves and the pumpkins . they went outside to find some things to use .

