they brought their things inside and put them on a table . they found some paper , scissors , glue and crayons . they cut out some leaf shapes and colored them . they glued some acorns and pine cones on them . they made a garland with a string and some more acorns .

they hung their garland on the wall and put their bowl of acorns and pine cones on the shelf . they looked at their room and smiled .

