" yes , we did , ben ! we are very successful ! " sara said .

they hugged each other and felt happy . they liked their room and their decorations . they were proud of their work . one day , lily and max went to the park with their mom . they saw many flowers and trees and birds . they also saw a big net with many butterflies inside . lily and max wanted to see the butterflies up close , so they asked their mom if they could go inside the net .

