they left the park and went home . they had a nice dinner and a nice bath and a nice bedtime story . they dreamed of butterflies and flowers and trees and birds . they were happy and brave . lily and tom were playing in the park with their ball . they saw a grumpy man sitting on a bench . he had a big hat and a long beard . he looked angry and sad .

