lily was not afraid . she walked to the bench and smiled at the man . " hello , sir . what is your name ? " she asked .

the man did not answer . he looked away and grumbled .

lily did not give up . she whispered in his ear . " do you want to play with us ? we have a ball . it is fun . "

the man was surprised . he turned his head and saw lily 's bright eyes . he felt something warm in his heart . he whispered back . " my name is ben . i do n't have any friends . can i play with you ? "

