the grumpy man was not grumpy anymore . he was happy . he had made new friends . he thanked lily and tom for being kind to him . he gave them his big hat and his long beard as gifts . they put them on and pretended to be grumpy too . they all giggled and hugged . they had a wonderful day in the park . tom and jen are brother and sister . they like to play with their toys in the living room . they have cars , dolls , blocks and books . they make a lot of noise and have fun .

but mom is not happy . she is in the kitchen and she has a lot of work to do . she has to cook , clean and wash . she is tired and she needs some quiet . she comes to the living room and says :

