she kisses them and turns off the light . tom and jen close their eyes and sleep . they dream of fast rabbits and slow turtles . and they are happy . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in their room . but sometimes they do not behave . they make a lot of noise and mess .

one day , their mom tells them to tidy up their toys . she says she will be back soon . anna and ben nod , but they do not listen . they keep playing with their cars and dolls .

they hear a knock on the door . it is their mom . she looks angry . she sees the toys all over the floor . she sees the drawer open and the clothes falling out . she says , " anna and ben , what are you doing ? i told you to tidy up . why did you not behave ? "

