they start to tidy up their toys . they put them in the drawer . they fold their clothes . they make their bed . they work together . they behave . they hope their mom will be happy . they hope they will get dessert . they hope they will still have time to play later . sara and ben are twins . they share a bedroom . sara likes to play with dolls . ben likes to play with cars . sometimes they play together , but sometimes they fight .

