but one night , something bad happened . a rabbit came to the garden . it was hungry and looking for food . it saw the sprout and thought it looked tasty . it bit the sprout and ate it . it left nothing behind . lily 's sunflower was gone .

the next morning , lily went to the garden . she looked for her sunflower , but she could not find it . she saw a hole and some dirt . she saw no sprout , no leaves , no stem . she was very sad . she cried and cried . she said to the garden , " where is my sunflower ? who took it away ? why did they do that ? it was my sunflower ! i wanted to see it bloom ! " sara was a shy girl who liked to read books and draw pictures . she did not like to talk to other kids or try new things . she was happy in her room with her toys and her cat .

one day , her mom told her they had to go on a journey to visit her grandma . sara was scared and did not want to go . she said , " mom , i do n't want to go . i do n't know grandma . i do n't like the car . i want to stay here . "

mom said , " sara , i know you are shy , but you have to go . grandma is very nice and she loves you . the car is safe and fun . you can bring your books and your cat . you will see new things and learn new words . it will be good for you . "

sara was not convinced , but she packed her bag and got in the car . she hugged her cat and looked out the window . she saw trees and flowers and animals and houses . she heard mom sing songs and tell stories . she felt the sun and the wind and the rain . she started to feel curious and excited .

when they arrived at grandma 's house , sara was nervous . she hid behind mom and did not say hello . grandma smiled and said , " hello , sara . i 'm so happy to see you . you are very pretty and smart . come , i have cookies and milk for you . and i have a surprise for you in the garden . "

sara followed grandma to the kitchen and ate the cookies and milk . they were delicious . she said , " thank you , grandma . they are very good . " grandma said , " you 're welcome , sara . i 'm glad you like them . do you want to see the surprise in the garden ? " sara nodded and went with grandma to the garden .

there , she saw a big swing and a slide and a sandbox and a ball and a bike and a puppy . she gasped and said , " wow , grandma . this is amazing . can i play with them ? " grandma said , " of course , sara . they are all for you . you can play with them as much as you want . and the puppy is yours too . he needs a name and a friend . do you want to be his friend ? " sara smiled and said , " yes , grandma . i want to be his friend . i will name him spot . he is very cute and soft . "

