mom hugs them and kisses them . she is happy . she loves them too . she leaves them to play with the blocks . they build a tower and a house . they share and help each other . they are good friends . they forget about the phone . tim and sam were best friends . they liked to play outside and make noise . one day , they saw dark clouds in the sky . they heard a loud wind . they felt rain on their faces .

" what is that ? " tim asked .

" it is a hurricane , " sam said . " it is a big storm that can break things and hurt people . we have to go inside and be safe . "

tim and sam ran to tim 's house . they knocked on the door . tim 's mom opened it . she looked anxious . she hugged them and took them to the basement .

" are you okay ? " she asked .

" yes , we are okay , " tim said .

" thank you for bringing sam here , " she said . " we will wait here until the hurricane is over . "

tim and sam sat on the couch . they played with some toys . they heard the wind howl and the rain pour . they were scared , but they were glad they had each other .

after a while , the storm stopped . tim 's mom said they could go upstairs . she looked outside and saw a lot of mess . trees were down , roofs were gone , cars were smashed .

" oh no , look at all the damage , " she said .

tim and sam looked too . they saw sam 's house across the street . it was still standing , but it had a big hole in the wall . they saw sam 's dad come out . he looked sad and angry .

" sam , come here ! " he shouted .

sam ran to his dad . he hugged him and said he was sorry .

" what happened to our house ? " sam asked .

" a tree fell on it during the hurricane , " his dad said . " it broke the wall and some of our things . we have to fix it . "

sam felt bad . he wished he could help his dad . he looked at tim . he saw tim 's face turn red . he saw tim hide behind his mom .

" what 's wrong , tim ? " sam asked .

tim was embarrassed . he did not want to tell sam . he did not want to lose his friend . but he had to .

" i 'm sorry , sam , " tim said . " it was my fault . i threw a rock at the tree . i wanted to see if it would fall . i did not know it would fall on your house . i did not know there would be a hurricane . i 'm sorry , i 'm sorry , i 'm sorry . "

sam was shocked . he did not know what to say . he looked at his dad . he looked at tim 's mom . he looked at tim . he saw tim 's tears . he felt sorry for him too .

he took a deep breath . he said , " it 's okay , tim . i forgive you . you did not mean to do it . you did not know what would happen . you are still my friend . but please , do n't throw rocks at trees anymore . it 's dangerous . "

tim smiled . he said , " thank you , sam . you are a good friend . i 'm sorry i hurt your house . i will help you and your dad fix it . and i promise , i will never throw rocks at trees again . "

