soon it was time to go home . tom held mummy 's hand and skipped down the path . he still had the screw in his pocket , a reminder of his fun day out . once upon a time there was a girl who lived in a world full of adventure . she was a brave explorer who wanted to see the long and winding river that ran through her village . one day she decided to find out what lay at the other side of the river , so she set off with a few of her friends .

