when the toddler grew older he had to replace the robot with a puppy , but he never forgot his obedient robot friend . once upon a time there was a family who lived on a farm . the family had a little boy who was 3 years old and very spoiled ! he loved playing with the animals on the farm and exploring the outdoors .

