when his grandma received the letter , she was so happy . she could not believe that her grandson had written her a letter all by himself ! once upon a time , a little girl was walking in the forest . she saw something sparkly and she went to take a look . it was a big pile of coal ! she was so happy and excited , she knew she had to plan something special .

