from then on , lily remembered to be careful and always think twice before she explored . max was playing outside in the summer sun . the sky was a bright pastel blue and the trees were full of blooming flowers . he was wearing his favourite red shirt and some comfy blue shorts . suddenly he felt helpless , as he had lost his hat ! he looked all around , but it was no where in sight .

