jane 's dad put his gun away and smiled at her . jane was n't scared anymore . she was happy and excited for another day of playing in the backyard . once upon a time , there lived a young man . his name was max . one day , max went to a restaurant and he saw the menu on the wall . he liked the menu very much and he wanted to take it home with him . so he snuck up to the wall and stole the menu .

