after that , max learned his lesson . he never stole anything again . he knew it was n't nice to steal . once upon a time there was a little girl who lived in a big house . she had a toy box where she kept all her beloved toys . one day , she discovered a mysterious way to go to the toy store . there was a special door in the hallway that she had never noticed before .

