the rich man has a great time in the other town and when he was ready to go back home he called the same taxi again . he was very happy to get back to his home safe and sound . and he was grateful he made the taxi driver his friend . once upon a time there was a kind and brave bear . he lived in a shelter in the forest with his friends . every day , the bear would go and explore the forest .

