the animals went back home to their shelters , all excited about the bear and his amazing work . the pond was now sparkling - it was a beautiful sight . one day , there was a clown in the park . he was smiling and making faces . the 3 year old child wanted to go over and talk to him . his mom said it was ok , as long as he felt safe . so , he walked over to the clown and said hello . the clown was very friendly and asked for the child 's name . he was happy to understand what was said .

