the child thanked the clown and said goodbye . he understood that he was very lucky to have met the clown in the park . he even thought it might be a good idea to come back again and play with the magic wand . once upon a time there was a little girl called amy . she was always curious about the world . one day , amy decided she wanted to open a special box . she asked her mom for it , and she handed it to her . when amy opened the box , she found something amazing inside . it was a pair of lungs !

