at last , the symbol remained in the family but it moved from one home to another . it was passed through the generations , and it still kept them lucky .

the symbol was a reminder to always remain lucky , no matter the situation . the symbol was a lucky symbol and it remained with the family forever . the gray cricket was sitting on a leaf outside . suddenly , it heard a loud roar . it jumped and looked around to see the source of the noise . it saw a big , gray lion across the field . the lion was standing tall and roaring so loudly it could be heard everywhere . the little cricket was very scared and scurried back to its leaf . but it kept watching the lion , mesmerized by its loud roars .

the lion stayed in the same spot and kept roaring . it felt like it was screaming out its loudest roar to the world . after some time , the lion finished and looked around . the cricket was still there , waiting to see what the lion would do next .

the lion started walking and passed the cricket by . but it stopped for a moment , looked at the cricket and roared once more . the cricket jumped in fright and ran to hide under a rock . but it was still watching the lion , as it slowly walked away , roaring and roaring until it was out of sight . one night , matt opened his bedroom door . he was tired , but he had something in his mind . he wanted to explore the world ! he looked out of his bedroom window , but outside everything was dark . he was scared , but he was brave too .

