they both escaped outside and ran away . sam and jack were relieved that they escaped danger . they laughed with excitement and hugged each other . they could have some fun adventures together in their new secret place ! once upon a time , there was a girl called lisa who went on a holiday with her family . they stayed in a hotel . it was very organized with nice people and lots of fun things to do .

