after a while , plop decided he wanted to go home , so he got out of the pond and shook off all the water . then he ran home , happy that he had had such an exciting day . once there was a little girl named zoe . zoe wanted to chat with her mommy , so she called her . zoe asked her mommy if she could have a massage . mommy said yes and zoe felt so happy .

