zoe was so happy after the massage was finished . she said thank you to mommy and gave her a big hug ! once upon a time , a little girl called jane was looking for something special . she looked and looked but could not find it . then one day , she looked under her bed and found a beautiful doll ! she was very happy because she had been looking for it for so long . the doll was wearing a pretty dress with lots of lovely colours . she hugged and hugged the doll and never wanted to let go of it . jane and the doll became very good friends and did lots of fun things together . she took the doll with her everywhere ! jane and the doll were the best of friends . once upon a time , there was a fish . he was swimming in the ocean and it was a fun time ! then , he saw something that he had n't seen before . it was a big , scary shark ! he quickly swam away but the shark followed him . he was scared , but then he remembered something his mommy had said . she said he should pick what was available . he saw some rocks nearby , so he picked them and put them around him . suddenly , the shark disappeared and he was safe ! he was glad that he remembered what his mommy said . he swam away happily and was glad that he was safe . the end . once upon a time , there was a great parrot . it was feathers were red and green and it could talk in many languages . every day , after school , the parrot liked to go for a walk . one day , it thought it would be fun to go to the park .

at the park , the parrot saw many people and other animals , like dogs and cats . it saw swings and slides and decided to have a lot of fun . it flew from tree to tree , singing and chirping . it even landed on some of the kids ' heads ! everyone laughed and had a great time .

after a while , the parrot got tired and flew off to find a place to perch . it found a nice tree branch right near the entrance of the park and perched there to rest . soon enough , the sun was setting and everyone headed home . the parrot said goodbye to the park and flew away . once there was a man who was deaf . he struggled to hear most things , but he loved the sound of birds singing . one day he decided to save the birds by buying them special thread . he wrapped it around the trees so the birds could make their nests and feel safe . the man worked all day long , making sure that each tree was safe and secure with the thread .

when he was done , he sat back and watched the birds come to the trees , singing a sweet song . he smiled as he watched the birds make their nests , safe from the wind and the rain . he could not hear the birds singing , but he knew they were singing for him .

the man was happy to have saved the birds and to have given them a safe , secure place to live . he will never forget the sound of birds singing , even though he is deaf . once upon a time there were two friends . one day they went outside to play . the day was warm and sunny . they ran around and laughed together .

the friends came across an old paper . it was yellow and crinkly . what could it be ?

