the friends smiled , feeling so happy . then they created a special game where they took turns welcoming each other .

and from then on , when the friends went out to play , they always welcomed each other with a smile ! once upon a time , there was a rabbit who lived in a meadow . every day , he loved to hop around the meadow , searching for something tasty to eat .

