the end . once upon a time there was a little red fish who really wanted a job . he swam around the sea asking all his fish friends if they knew of any jobs he could do , but none of them had any work for him to do .

just when he was beginning to feel sad and hopeless , he spotted a bright yellow fish swimming with a towel over its fin . he swam up to it and asked if it had a job for him .

to his surprise , it said yes ! the yellow fish said that it needed help to clean its tidy home every day . the little red fish was so excited that he began swimming around in circles , clapping his fins together .

the yellow fish was so pleased with the little red fish 's enthusiasm that it promised him that he could keep his job forever . from that day onward the little red fish began swimming to the yellow fish 's home every day and helping it tidy up .

the little red fish was very happy to have a job and was thankful to the yellow fish every day . and they both lived happily ever after . once upon a time there was a little duck . she wanted to play outside with her friends . so , she waddled away from her pond to find them . suddenly , an arrow whizzed past her ! she was scared and wanted to escape from the noisy noise .

the arrow flew up in the sky and came back down near her . she started to run away . the arrow followed her , zig - zagging across the meadow . she ran faster and faster until she reached a tall tree . she was so scared that she quickly flew up into the branches . the arrow hit the tree , but it could n't get to her . she had escaped !

the little duck was so happy she had escaped . she flew down from her tree and waddled back to her pond . she told all of her friends about the noisy arrow , and they were glad she was safe .

the friends all hugged the little duck and promised to never let an arrow or any other scary thing hurt her ever again . after that , they all went outside to play together and the noisy arrow was never seen again . once upon a time there was a nice doggy who got lost in the woods . it was a hot day , so the doggy was scared and very thirsty . suddenly , it heard a friendly voice call out , " i will rescue you ! " the doggy felt very happy and turned to see who was talking . it was a kind little boy with a big smile on his face !

