the moral of the story is that sometimes we have to do things that are difficult or we do n't want to do , but it 's important to do them anyway . and even though we may have to put things away for a while , they will remain safe and we can always play with them later . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to wander around her backyard and explore . one day , she saw a picture of a seal in a book and thought it looked funny .

the next day , lily went to the beach with her family . she saw a big , graceful seal swimming in the water . she was so excited and ran to tell her family about it .

later that day , lily and her family went to a restaurant by the beach . they ordered fish for dinner . when the waiter brought out their food , lily saw that the fish had a seal - shaped bone in it . she remembered the seal she saw earlier and felt sad . from that day on , she made a promise to never eat fish again . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to travel with her family . one day , they went on a trip to the beach . lily was so excited to play in the sand and swim in the ocean !

