after drinking his milk , max went outside to play . he met his friend tom who asked him to come over to his house to play . max agreed and they played together for a while . but then , tom accidentally spilled some juice on max 's shirt . max got upset and started to cry .

tom felt bad and said , " i 'm sorry , max . i did n't mean to pour the juice on you . " but max was still upset and decided to go home . when he got home , his mom noticed his stained shirt and asked what happened . max told her and she comforted him , saying that accidents happen and it 's okay .

the next day , max went back to play with tom . but unfortunately , they got into a fight and max got hurt . he went home crying and never played with tom again . the end . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside in the park with her friends . one day , her mommy told her it was time to go home and take a bath . lily did n't want to take a bath , but her mommy said she needed to be clean .

after her bath , lily put on her favorite purple dress and went outside to watch the fireworks with her family . the fireworks were so pretty and made loud noises in the sky . lily was happy to see the purple fireworks because it was her favorite color .

when the fireworks were over , lily went back inside and went to bed . she dreamed of playing in the park with her friends and watching more purple fireworks . the end . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside and explore the world around her . one day , she saw a beautiful butterfly fluttering by and she wanted to catch it . she reached out her finger , but the butterfly flew away .

