at the end of the vacation , timmy was sad to leave the beach and the fair . but he was happy to have found a special seashell and a fun memory to remember his vacation . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play with blocks and build towers . one day , she was playing with her blocks when her friend , timmy , came over .

