after his walk , benny went back to his cabin . he felt tired and decided to take a nap . as he slept , he dreamed of all the things he could weigh and how heavy they might be . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play in the forest near her house . one day , she saw an owl sitting on a tree branch . the owl had big eyes and feathers that were as soft as a blanket . lily felt happy to see the owl .

