red 's friend , blue , saw that red was sad and asked him what was wrong . red told blue that he did n't have enough fuel to take his friends to the park . blue told red not to worry and rushed to the gas station to get some fuel .

when blue came back with the fuel , red was so happy and thanked blue . red filled up his tank and they rushed to the park together . red 's friends were so happy to see him and they all had a great time playing together . from that day on , red knew that his friends were always there to help him when he needed it . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved going to the library with her mom to read books . one day , she found a book she really wanted to read , but it had a high price . she asked her mom to buy it , but her mom said it was too expensive .

