when she finally bought the book , she was so happy . she read it over and over again . her mom was proud of her for working hard and being responsible with her money . the moral of the story is that if you work hard and save your money , you can get the things you want . once upon a time , there was a little boy named timmy who loved to play outside . one day , he went for a walk in the forest and saw a wild rabbit hopping around . timmy tried to catch the rabbit , but it was too fast . he felt restless and sad .

suddenly , he heard a voice saying , " what 's wrong , timmy ? " it was his friend , sally . " i ca n't catch the rabbit , " timmy said with a shrug . " do n't worry , " sally said . " let 's play a game instead . " they played hide - and - seek and had so much fun that timmy forgot all about the rabbit . he felt happy and content . the end . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside and get dirty . one day , she went to the park to play with her friends , but her face got very dirty from all the fun they were having .

