they sit on a bench and enjoy the sun and the breeze . they hear some loud music from a nearby car . they look at each other and laugh . they do n't mind the noise . they have each other and that is enough . sara and ben are playing with blocks . they like to make different shapes with the blocks . sara makes a square , ben makes a triangle , and they show each other their shapes .

