they make more shapes with the blocks . they make a circle , a star , a heart , and a rectangle . they have fun making shapes .

then , they hear a loud noise . it is their dog , max . max is big and furry and friendly . he likes to play with sara and ben . but he also likes to play with the blocks . he runs into the room and knocks over the shapes . the blocks fall on the floor .

