ben and lily put on their shoes and coats , but they were not happy . they wished they could stay and play with the car . they followed mom to the car and got in .

when they got to the store , mom gave them a list of things to find . she said they could help her and make it faster . ben and lily looked at the list . it had words and pictures of things like milk , eggs , bread , and apples .

ben and lily tried to help mom , but they got bored . they saw many other things that looked more fun , like toys , books , and candy . they wanted to look at them and touch them . they ran away from mom and went to different aisles .

