ben and lily heard mom 's voice on the loudspeaker . she said their names and asked them to come to the front of the store . they realized they had made a mistake . they remembered they had to stay with mom and help her . they wished they had not run away . they felt sorry and scared .

they ran to the front of the store and saw mom . she was very angry and sad . she hugged them and said , " where were you ? i was so worried . you have to stay with me and listen to me . you ca n't run away like that . it 's not safe . "

