mom said , " i 'm glad you 're safe , but you have to be more careful and responsible . you ca n't always do what you want . sometimes you have to do what you need . now let 's go home and talk more about this . "

ben and lily nodded and got in the car with mom . they did not play with the big red car that day . they learned a lesson and said they would be better next time . sara and ben are twins . they like to play in the park with their mom and dad . one day , they see a big box under a tree . it has a bow and a tag . it is a gift for someone .

