they all go home . they are happy to be safe and together . they learn a lesson . they never touch a gift that is not theirs . sara and tom like to play in the park . they see many things that they admire . they admire the big trees , the green grass , the blue sky , and the yellow sun .

one day , they see something new in the park . it is a small black cat . the cat has shiny fur and bright eyes . it walks on four legs and makes a soft sound . sara and tom admire the cat . they want to pet it and play with it .

