sara and tom admire the cat . they think the cat is their new friend . they name the cat coco . they visit coco every day in the park . they have fun with coco . they love coco . coco loves them too . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play in the park with their bikes . one day , they saw a big hill with a ramp at the end . ben wanted to try it , but lily was nervous . she thought it was too high and fast .

