one day , sara goes to the stable with her mom . the stable is a big house for horses . there are many horses in the stable . some are brown , some are black , some are white . sara sees a horse that is smaller than the others . it is white with black spots . it has a long mane and a fluffy tail . sara thinks it is amazing .

the horse sees sara too . it comes to the fence and nuzzles her hand . sara giggles and strokes its nose . the horse makes a soft sound and licks her fingers . sara 's mom says the horse is a pony . she says sara can feed the pony some carrots . sara is happy . she gives the pony some carrots and the pony eats them happily . sara says thank you to the pony and hugs its neck . the pony hugs her back . sara and the pony are friends . tim and anna are brother and sister . they like to play with their toys in the living room . but today , they have to wait for their mom and dad to come home . they are very impatient .

" mom and dad said they will give us a surprise when they come home , " tim says . " i wonder what it is . "

" maybe it is a new toy , or a book , or a cake , " anna says . " i hope it is a cake . i like cake . "

they look at the clock on the wall . it is almost evening . the sun is going down . they hear a car in the driveway .

" mom and dad are here ! " tim shouts . he runs to the door . anna follows him .

they open the door and see their mom and dad smiling . they have a big box in their hands .

" hello , tim and anna , " mom says . " we have a surprise for you . do you want to see what it is ? "

" yes , yes , yes ! " tim and anna say . they are very excited .

mom and dad put the box on the floor . they open it and lift something out . it is a puppy . a small , brown , fluffy puppy . it wags its tail and licks their faces .

" wow , a puppy ! " tim and anna say . they hug the puppy and pet it . " thank you , mom and dad . thank you for giving us a puppy . "

" you 're welcome , tim and anna , " mom and dad say . " we love you very much . and we love the puppy too . he is part of our family now . do you want to name him ? "

tim and anna think for a moment . they look at the puppy and smile .

" let 's name him brownie , " tim says .

" brownie , i like that , " anna says .

" brownie , welcome to our home , " mom and dad say .

they all go to the living room and play with brownie . they are very happy . it is a good evening . tom and lily were playing in the backyard . they liked to pretend they were explorers , looking for bugs and plants . they had a flashlight and a magnifying glass to examine their finds .

" look , tom , i found a big ant ! " lily said , holding the magnifying glass over a black ant crawling on a leaf . " it has six legs and two feelers . "

" wow , that 's cool , lily . can i see ? " tom asked , leaning closer . he liked ants , they were so busy and strong .

suddenly , they heard a loud noise from the house . it sounded like a big bang . they saw smoke and sparks coming from the window . they were scared .

" what was that ? " lily cried , dropping the magnifying glass .

" i do n't know , lily . maybe something broke . we should go inside and see if mom and dad are okay . " tom said , grabbing the flashlight .

they ran to the house , holding hands . they saw mom and dad in the kitchen , looking at a burnt toaster . they smelled something bad .

" mom , dad , are you okay ? " tom asked , shining the flashlight on them .

" yes , we 're okay , sweeties . do n't worry . the toaster just exploded . it was old and faulty . we 're sorry we scared you . " mom said , hugging them .

" we 're glad you 're okay , mom . we were playing explorers in the backyard . we found a big ant . " lily said , trying to be calm .

" that 's nice , lily . you 're very brave explorers . how about we go outside and you show us your ant ? maybe we can examine it together . " dad said , smiling .

" okay , dad . come on , tom . let 's go . " lily said , taking tom 's hand .

they went outside , followed by mom and dad . they showed them their ant and their magnifying glass . they examined it together , using the flashlight . they learned more about ants and how they live . they had fun . they were happy . lily loved to play with her trumpet . it was a shiny toy that made loud noises when she blew into it . she liked to pretend she was in a band with her friends , or a soldier in a parade , or a king in a castle . she always took her trumpet with her wherever she went .

one day , lily and her mom went to the park . lily saw a big slide , a swing , a sandbox , and a merry - go - round . she wanted to try them all . she ran to the slide and climbed up the ladder . she put her trumpet on the top of the slide and slid down . whee !

she rushed to the swing and pushed herself back and forth . she felt the wind in her hair and the sun on her face . she left her trumpet on the seat of the swing and jumped off . yay !

she ran to the sandbox and dug a hole with a shovel . she found a shiny rock and a worm . she put them in her pocket . she left her trumpet on the edge of the sandbox and ran to the merry - go - round . wow !

she climbed on the merry - go - round and held on to a horse . she spun around and around , faster and faster . she felt dizzy and happy . she left her trumpet on the horse and got off . hooray !

she looked around and saw a boy holding her trumpet . he was blowing into it and making funny noises . he had a big smile on his face . he liked her trumpet too .

" hey , that 's mine ! " lily shouted . she ran to the boy and tried to grab her trumpet . " give it back ! "

" no , it 's mine now ! " the boy said . he held the trumpet tight and ran away . " it 's a cool toy ! "

lily felt angry and sad . she wanted her trumpet back . she chased the boy across the park . she saw her mom sitting on a bench , reading a book . she saw a big sign that said " modern art exhibit " . she saw a lot of people looking at strange paintings and sculptures . she did n't care . she only wanted her trumpet .

she caught up with the boy and pulled his shirt . he turned around and saw her . he stuck out his tongue and blew a raspberry . he lifted the trumpet to his mouth and blew again . but this time , nothing happened . the trumpet was broken . the boy had blown too hard and cracked it . he looked at the trumpet and saw a hole in it . he felt scared and sorry .

he gave the trumpet back to lily and said " i 'm sorry , i did n't mean to break it . it was an accident . please do n't be mad at me . "

lily looked at her trumpet and saw the hole . she felt sad and disappointed . she loved her trumpet . it was her favorite toy . she did n't want it to be broken . she wanted it to make loud noises again .

she looked at the boy and saw his face . he looked sad and sorry too . he did n't mean to break it . it was an accident . he liked her trumpet too .

she thought for a moment and said " it 's okay , i 'm not mad at you . it was an accident . maybe we can fix it . maybe we can play together . do you want to be my friend ? "

the boy smiled and said " yes , i want to be your friend . i 'm sorry i took your trumpet . maybe we can share it . maybe we can find another toy . do you want to see the modern art exhibit ? it has a lot of cool things . "

lily smiled and said " yes , i want to see the modern art exhibit . maybe it has a lot of loud things . maybe we can make our own music . maybe we can have fun . "

they held hands and walked to the exhibit . they saw a lot of strange paintings and sculptures . they saw a big metal ball that made a clang when they hit it . they saw a colorful tube that made a whistle when they blew into it . they saw a giant flower that made a buzz when they touched it . they laughed and played and made their own music . they forgot about the broken trumpet . they had a new toy . they had a new friend . they were happy . the end . tom and anna liked to play in the park . they liked to slide , swing and climb on the equipment . but they had to be careful , because the equipment was delicate . if they were too rough , they could break it or hurt themselves .

one day , they saw a new boy in the park . his name was sam . he wanted to play with them , but he did not know how to be gentle . he pushed tom off the slide , he swung too high and hit anna , and he climbed on the equipment and made it shake .

" stop it , sam ! " tom and anna said . " you are not nice . you are hurting us and the equipment . you have to be careful and share . "

but sam did not listen . he laughed and said , " i do n't care . i can do what i want . it 's just a park . it 's not mine . "

tom and anna were sad and angry . they did not want to play with sam anymore . they went to tell the park keeper what sam did .

the park keeper was not happy . he saw the equipment was damaged and dirty . he saw tom and anna had bruises and scratches . he said to sam , " you have been very bad . you have to pay for what you did . you have to help me fix the equipment and clean the park . and you have to say sorry to tom and anna . "

sam was scared and ashamed . he realized he was wrong . he said sorry to tom and anna and helped the park keeper . he learned his lesson . he learned to be careful and kind . he learned to respect the equipment and the other children . he became friends with tom and anna . they played together in the park and had fun . sara and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big box under a tree . they go to the box and open it . inside , they find many shiny jewels . they are happy and take some jewels .

" look , sara , i have a red jewel . it is pretty , " tom says .

" i have a blue jewel . it is pretty , too , " sara says .

they put the jewels in their pockets and run to show their moms . but they do not see a sign on the box . the sign says : " do not touch . these jewels belong to the fierce lion . "

the lion lives in the zoo near the park . he likes his jewels . he sees sara and tom with his jewels . he is angry and roars . he jumps over the fence and chases them .

" help , help , a fierce lion ! " sara and tom scream .

they try to run away , but the lion is faster . he catches them and bites them . he takes his jewels back and goes to his box . he is happy and roars .

sara and tom are hurt and sad . they cry and cry . their moms come and see them . they are scared and sad , too . they take them to the hospital . they wish they did not touch the jewels . the end . anna and ben are playing with wool . they have many colors of wool . they like to make things with wool . they can tie wool together and make shapes .

" look , i made a flower with pink wool ! " anna says . she shows ben her wool flower . she ties it to her hair .

" that is pretty , anna . can you make one for me ? " ben asks . he likes flowers too .

" sure , ben . what color do you want ? " anna asks . she has blue , green , yellow , and purple wool .

" i want a blue flower , please . blue is my favorite color . " ben says . he gives anna some blue wool .

anna ties the blue wool together and makes a flower for ben . she ties it to his shirt . " there , now you have a flower too ! " anna says . she smiles at ben .

" thank you , anna . you are very good at making flowers . " ben says . he hugs anna . they are happy .

they hear mom calling them . " anna , ben , come inside . it is time for lunch . i made some delicious soup for you . " mom says .

anna and ben run to the kitchen . they smell the soup . it smells good . they wash their hands and sit at the table . mom gives them each a bowl of soup and a spoon .

" enjoy your soup , my little flowers . " mom says . she kisses them on their heads .

anna and ben eat their soup . it is warm and tasty . they like the soup . they say , " mmm , this is delicious , mom . thank you . "

mom smiles at them . she is proud of them . they are good children . they love wool , flowers , and soup . tim likes to mark on paper with his crayons . he makes many colors and shapes . he is happy when he marks .

one day , he sees a beetle on the grass . the beetle is black and shiny . it has six legs and two wings . tim thinks the beetle is pretty . he wants to mark the beetle on his paper .

he picks up the beetle gently and puts it on his paper . he takes a crayon and tries to mark around the beetle . but the beetle does not stay still . it moves and crawls on the paper . it makes marks of its own . tim is angry . he does not want the beetle to mark on his paper . he wants to mark the beetle .

he tries to hold the beetle still with his hand . but the beetle does not like that . it bites tim 's finger . tim feels a sharp pain . he lets go of the beetle and cries . the beetle flies away .

tim is sad . he has a bite on his finger and a mess on his paper . he does not like the beetle anymore . he wishes he had not tried to mark the beetle . he wishes he had just looked at the beetle and let it be . sara and ben are twins . they like to play in the garden . they have a big tub of water and some toys . they splash and soak each other with the water . they laugh and have fun .

one day , they find a new toy in the tub . it is a shiny buckle . it has a star on it . sara and ben think it is a gift from someone . they wonder who gave it to them .

" maybe it is from mommy or daddy , " sara says .

" maybe it is from grandma or grandpa , " ben says .

" maybe it is from a fairy or an elf , " sara says .

they decide to share the buckle . they take turns wearing it on their belts . they pretend to be superheroes with the star buckle . they run and jump and save the day .

they are very happy with their new toy . they are gifted twins . they thank whoever gave them the buckle . they hope to find more surprises in the tub . they love to play in the garden . lily and sam are in the same class . they like to play with blocks and cars . one day , they have a big test . the teacher gives them some questions and they have to write the answers .

lily works hard and tries to remember what the teacher taught them . sam is lazy and does not want to study . he thinks he knows everything . he looks at lily 's paper and copies her answers .

the teacher collects the papers and grades them . she calls lily and sam to her desk . she says , " lily , you did very well . you got all the questions right . you are a smart and honest girl . sam , you did very poorly . you got all the questions wrong . you are a naughty and dishonest boy . you copied lily 's answers , but you copied them wrong . you lose the test and you lose lily 's trust . how do you feel ? "

lily feels happy and proud . she says , " thank you , teacher . i studied hard and i did my best . i like to learn new things . " sam feels sad and ashamed . he says , " i 'm sorry , teacher . i was lazy and i cheated . i did not learn anything . i do n't like to lose . "

the teacher says , " sam , you made a bad choice . you need to work hard and be honest . you need to respect yourself and others . you need to apologize to lily and ask for her forgiveness . you need to study harder and do better next time . do you understand ? " sam nods and says , " yes , teacher . i understand . i will try to change . i 'm sorry , lily . can you forgive me ? " lily says , " i forgive you , sam . but you have to promise me that you will not cheat again . cheating is wrong and it hurts you and me . we can be friends , but you have to be a good friend . " sam says , " i promise , lily . i will be a good friend . thank you for forgiving me . "

the moral of the story is : cheating is wrong and it leads to losing . working hard and being honest is right and it leads to winning . lily was a young girl who liked to play with her toys . she had a lot of toys , but her favorite was a watch that her dad gave her . the watch was shiny and had a pink strap and a picture of a flower on it . lily liked to wear the watch and pretend she was a grown - up .

one day , lily went to the park with her mom and her brother sam . she brought her watch with her and showed it to her friends . they all said it was very pretty and asked her what time it was . lily smiled and said it was time to have fun .

lily played on the swings , the slide , and the sandbox . she had so much fun that she forgot about her watch . she left it on the bench where she had put her coat . she did not notice when a big wind came and blew her watch away .

when it was time to go home , lily 's mom called her and sam . they put on their coats and got ready to leave . lily reached for her watch , but it was not there . she looked around , but she could not see it . she felt sad and scared .

" mom , mom , where is my watch ? " she cried . " the watch that dad gave me . i ca n't find it . "

lily 's mom hugged her and said , " do n't worry , sweetie . maybe someone found it and will bring it back . or maybe we can look for it tomorrow . i 'm sure your watch is somewhere safe . "

lily hoped her mom was right . she wished she had not forgotten her watch . she missed it very much . she wondered if she would ever see it again . sara and tom were playing in the park . they liked to march like soldiers and pretend they had a big mission . they had a toy key that they said was very important . they had to keep it safe from the bad guys .

" march , march , march ! " sara said . " we have to find a good place to hide the key . "

" ok , sara , you are the boss , " tom said . he followed her as they looked for a spot .

they saw a big tree with a hole in it . sara thought it was perfect . she put the key in the hole and covered it with some leaves .

" there , now the key is safe , " she said . " let 's go and play on the swings . "

they ran to the swings and had fun . they forgot about the key for a while .

but then , a big dog came to the park . he smelled the key in the hole . he dug it out with his paws and ran away with it in his mouth .

sara and tom saw the dog and screamed .

" hey , that 's our key ! " sara said . " we need it for our mission ! "

they chased the dog , but he was too fast . he ran out of the park and disappeared .

sara and tom were very sad . they had lost their key and their mission was ruined .

they went back to the tree and cried . they felt very bad .

the end . lily was a little bird who liked to sing . she lived in a big tree with her family and friends . every morning , she would spring out of her nest and fly to a branch . she would sing a happy song to say hello to the sun and the sky .

one day , lily saw a shiny thing on the ground . she wanted to see what it was , so she flew down to the grass . it was a ring . it was round and sparkly and pretty . lily thought it would be useful to make her nest more cozy . she picked it up with her beak and flew back to the tree .

but when she got to the branch , she saw a big cat . the cat had climbed the tree and was looking for birds to catch . the cat saw lily and jumped at her . lily was scared . she dropped the ring and flew away as fast as she could . the ring fell on the cat 's head and made a loud noise . the cat was surprised and angry . he shook his head and ran away .

lily was safe . she was glad she had escaped the cat . she did not care about the ring anymore . she realized it was not useful at all . she flew to another branch and found her family and friends . they hugged her and told her they were happy she was okay . lily sang a thankful song to say goodbye to the sun and the sky . she learned that the best things in life are not shiny or pretty , but warm and loving . lily liked to draw on the blackboard . she had many colors of chalk and made pictures of flowers , animals and stars . she was very happy when her teacher said she could draw on the blackboard after class .

but one day , a boy named max came and took her chalk . he said he wanted to draw on the blackboard too . lily said no , she was using the chalk . max said he did not care and tried to grab the chalk from her hand . lily held on tight and said no again .

max got angry and pushed lily . lily fell down and hurt her knee . she started to cry . the teacher heard the noise and came to see what was wrong . she saw max holding the chalk and lily on the floor . she asked what happened .

lily told the teacher that max took her chalk and pushed her . max said that lily did not want to share and refused to let him draw . the teacher looked at the blackboard and saw that lily had drawn many nice pictures and max had drawn nothing .

the teacher said that max was wrong to take the chalk and push lily . she said that lily was kind to let him draw on the blackboard , but he had to ask nicely and wait for his turn . she said that max had to say sorry to lily and give back the chalk .

max did not want to say sorry or give back the chalk . he said that he liked the chalk and wanted to keep it . he refused to listen to the teacher . the teacher said that max was being rude and selfish . she said that he had to go to the corner and think about what he did . she said that he could not draw on the blackboard or play with the chalk until he said sorry and shared .

max did not like the corner . he did not like to think . he wanted to draw on the blackboard and play with the chalk . he looked at lily and saw that she was smiling and drawing again . he felt bad and wished he had been nice to her . he decided to say sorry and give back the chalk . he hoped that lily would let him draw with her . he learned that sharing was better than refusing . tom and sam are playing with their toy cars in the yard . they like to make noises and pretend they are racing . tom has a red car and sam has a blue car . they also have a big missile that can shoot from a launcher .

" let 's include the missile in our game , " tom says . " we can pretend it is a rocket that can fly to the moon . "

" ok , but be careful , " sam says . " the missile can hurt if it hits someone . "

tom nods and puts the missile in the launcher . he aims it at the sky and presses the button . the missile makes a loud sound and flies up high . tom and sam watch it with wonder .

but the missile does not go to the moon . it comes down fast and lands on the roof of the house . it makes a big hole and some tiles fall off .

" oh no ! " tom and sam say . " we broke the house ! "

they hear their mom coming out . she looks angry and scared .

" what did you do ? " she asks . " that was a dangerous toy . you could have hurt yourselves or someone else . "

tom and sam feel sorry and scared . they say they are sorry and they did not mean to break the house .

mom hugs them and says she is glad they are not hurt . but she says they have to be more careful and not play with the missile again . she says they have to help fix the house and clean the mess .

tom and sam agree and say they will not play with the missile again . they say they will play with their cars and other toys that are safe and fun . tim and sam are brothers . they like to play with their cars and trucks . one day , they see a big box in the living room . it has a bow and a tag . the tag says " for tim and sam , from grandma and grandpa " .

" what is in the box ? " tim asks .

" i do n't know . let 's open it and see ! " sam says .

they hurry to the box and pull the bow . they rip the paper and lift the lid . inside , they find a chubby teddy bear . it has brown fur and a red bow . it has a smile and two black eyes .

" wow , it 's a teddy bear ! " tim says .

" it 's so soft and cuddly ! " sam says .

they hug the teddy bear and thank grandma and grandpa . they decide to name the teddy bear bob .

" bob is the best teddy bear ever ! " tim says .

" i agree . he is our new friend ! " sam says .

they take bob to their room and play with him . they share their cars and trucks with him . they tell him stories and jokes . they have a lot of fun with bob .

" do you like bob , tim ? " sam asks .

" yes , i do . he is very nice and funny . what about you , sam ? " tim asks .

" i like bob , too . he is very warm and cozy . he makes me happy . what is your opinion , bob ? " sam asks .

bob does not say anything . he just smiles and winks . he likes tim and sam , too . they are his new family . ben and mia liked to play with their toys . they had a big box of cars , trucks , planes and boats . one day , they decided to make a game with their van and their sailboat .

they put the van on the floor and the sailboat on the table . they pretended that the van was driving to the beach and the sailboat was sailing on the water . they made noises like vroom and whoosh .

" look , mia , the van is almost at the beach . let 's park it here and go on the sailboat , " ben said .

" ok , ben , that sounds fun . i 'll be the captain and you 'll be the sailor , " mia said .

they climbed on the chairs and reached for the sailboat . they moved it around the table and imagined that they were on a big adventure . they saw fish , birds , islands and pirates .

" ahoy , matey , there 's a pirate ship ahead . we have to sail faster and escape , " mia said .

" aye , aye , captain , i 'll help you with the sail . we can do it , " ben said .

they were having so much fun that they did not hear their mom calling them for lunch . she came into the room and saw them playing with the sailboat on the table .

" ben , mia , what are you doing ? it 's time for lunch . come down from the chairs and put the sailboat back in the box , " she said .

ben and mia looked at their mom . they were confused . they did not want to stop playing . they liked their game .

" but mom , we 're sailing on the water . we ca n't just leave the sailboat . it will sink , " ben said .

" and we have to get away from the pirates . they 're chasing us . we ca n't just park the van . it will get stolen , " mia said .

their mom smiled . she understood that they had a lot of imagination . she decided to play along .

" ok , ok , i see . how about this ? you can sail the sailboat to the van and park it inside . then you can drive the van to the kitchen and park it there . then you can have lunch with me . how does that sound ? " she said .

ben and mia thought about it . they liked their mom 's idea . they agreed to do it .

" ok , mom , that sounds good . we 'll sail the sailboat to the van and drive the van to the kitchen . then we 'll have lunch with you , " they said .

they did what their mom said . they sailed the sailboat to the van and parked it inside . they drove the van to the kitchen and parked it there . they had lunch with their mom . they told her about their game and their adventure . she listened and smiled . she was happy that they had fun . she loved them very much . anna and ben are brother and sister . they share a room with two beds and a ceiling fan . every night , they say good night to each other and to their toys .

one night , anna is not sleepy . she wants to play with her doll and her teddy bear . she gets out of her bed and turns on the light . she makes her doll and her teddy bear talk and kiss .

ben is sleepy . he wants to sleep and dream . he does not like the light and the noise . he covers his head with his pillow . he says to anna , " anna , please be quiet . i want to sleep . "

anna does not listen . she keeps playing and laughing . she makes her doll and her teddy bear fly and touch the ceiling . she says , " look , ben , they are flying ! they are touching the ceiling ! "

ben is angry . he gets out of his bed and turns off the light . he says , " anna , stop it . it is night time . we have to sleep . "

anna is sad . she does not want to stop playing . she does not want to sleep . she says , " but ben , i am not sleepy . i want to have fun . "

ben feels sorry for anna . he knows she is not sleepy . he knows she wants to have fun . he says , " okay , anna , how about this ? you can play for five more minutes . but then you have to sleep . and you have to be quiet . and you have to kiss me good night . "

anna smiles . she likes ben 's idea . she says , " okay , ben , thank you . you are a good brother . i will play for five more minutes . and then i will sleep . and i will be quiet . and i will kiss you good night . "

anna and ben hug and kiss . they go back to their beds . anna plays with her doll and her teddy bear for five more minutes . she makes them talk and kiss softly . she makes them fly and touch the ceiling gently . she says , " good night , doll . good night , teddy bear . i love you . "

ben watches anna and smiles . he says , " good night , anna . i love you too . "

anna and ben close their eyes . they fall asleep and dream . the ceiling fan spins and cools them . the moon and the stars shine and watch them . they are happy and peaceful . tom and lily are friends . they like to play in the sand . one day , they see a big boat . the boat is going to an island . tom and lily want to go too .

" can we come with you ? " they ask the man on the boat .

" no , you ca n't . this island is not for kids . it is a crazy island . there are wild animals and scary people there . you will be in danger , " the man says .

but tom and lily do not listen . they sneak on the boat when the man is not looking . they hide under a blanket . the boat sails away .

soon , they reach the island . tom and lily get out of the boat . they see a lot of trees and flowers . they think it is beautiful . they run and explore .

but they do not know that the island is crazy . they hear a loud roar . they see a big lion . the lion is hungry . it sees tom and lily . it runs after them .

tom and lily are scared . they scream and run . they look for the boat . but the boat is gone . the man has left . they are alone on the island .

they see a cave . they run inside . they hope the lion will not find them . they hug each other . they cry .

they wish they had listened to the man . they wish they had stayed in the sand . they wish they could go home . tommy loved his furry truck . it was red and soft and had four big wheels . he liked to drive it around the house and make loud noises . he kept his truck in his room , next to his bed .

one day , his cousin lily came to visit . she saw tommy 's truck and wanted to play with it . she grabbed it from his hands and ran away .

" hey , give it back ! " tommy shouted . " that 's my truck ! "

" no , it 's mine now ! " lily said . " it 's so pretty and fluffy ! "

tommy chased lily around the house , but she was faster . she hid behind the sofa and hugged the truck .

tommy was sad and angry . he wanted his truck back . he asked his mom for help .

" mom , lily took my truck and wo n't give it back ! " he cried .

mom came to the sofa and saw lily . she smiled and said , " lily , that 's not your truck . that 's tommy 's truck . he loves it very much . you have to share and be nice . "

lily pouted and said , " but i like it too . it 's so fun and cozy . "

mom said , " i know , but it 's not fair to take something that belongs to someone else . how would you feel if tommy took your doll and ran away ? "

lily thought for a moment . she remembered her doll and how much she loved it . she felt sorry for tommy . she said , " i would feel sad and angry too . "

she gave the truck back to tommy and said , " i 'm sorry , tommy . here 's your truck . can we play together ? "

tommy smiled and said , " thank you , lily . yes , we can play together . you can drive my truck for a while , and i can play with your doll . "

