her mom hugged her . she said she was proud of her too . she said they would go to the pharmacy and get the medicine . she said they would go home and rest . she said she loved her . sara said she loved her too . she felt better . she was happy . sam and lily liked to play with magnets . they had many magnets of different shapes and colors . they liked to stick them on the fridge and make pictures and patterns .

