the seal nodded and made a happy noise . lila and mom walked away . ben followed them , but he was still wet and angry . he learned that being rude and selfish does not make him happy . he wished he had been nice to the seal . anna liked to play with water . she had a big bucket and some cups and spoons . she would gather water from the faucet in the kitchen and pour it into the bucket . then she would take the bucket to the backyard and make a pond for her toys .

