sara says goodbye to the lady and gets on her bike . she waves to the lady as she rides away . she feels happy . she has a new friend and a tasty pear . she hopes to see the lady again soon . tom and sam were friends who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a thin snake on the grass . tom wanted to touch it , but sam was afraid .

