tim and sam laugh . they call max and give him a hug . they tell him that squirrels are not for playing . they are for watching . they throw a ball for max and he chases it . he is happy again . he forgets about the squirrel . lily was a little girl who liked to bite things . she bit her toys , her books , and even her friends . she did not care if they cried or got angry . she thought biting was fun and funny .

