when mr. fox gave lily a sticker for her good work , she bit his hand . mr. fox was very surprised and hurt . he said , " lily , why did you bite me ? that is very rude and mean . biting is not fun or funny . it is disgusting and dangerous . you can hurt yourself and others . you can make them sick or sad . you should say sorry and stop biting . "

