they ran away from the truck and went home . they told their mom what happened . she hugged them and gave them some real ice - cream from the freezer . it was delicious and sweet and did not glow or taste bitter .

they felt better and smiled . they learned a lesson . they learned to be careful of strangers who offer them things that seem too good to be true . they learned to stick together and help each other . they learned to enjoy the simple things in life , like real ice - cream . lily and sam were brother and sister . they liked to play with their toys in the living room . lily had a doll that she loved very much . she gave her doll a name , a dress and a hat . sam had a truck that he liked to zoom around the floor . he gave his truck a horn , a driver and a trailer .

