they gave their toys to each other . they played nicely with the doll and the truck . they had fun . they learned to share and take turns . they were happy . mom was happy too . she gave them a hug and a kiss . she said , " i love you , lily and sam . you are good brother and sister . " lily and tom are friends . they like to play outside . one day , they go to the lake with their moms . the lake is big and blue . there are ducks and fish in the lake .

