they say " one , two , three , go ! " and start to run . they run as fast as they can . they feel the wind in their hair . they hear their moms cheering for them .

lily is faster than tom . she reaches the tree first . she turns around and runs back . she sees tom behind her . he is trying to catch up .

but then , something funny happens . tom trips on a rock . he falls down . he rolls on the grass . he is not hurt . he is laughing .

