" it 's ok , tom . you made me laugh . you are a good friend . " lily says .

they hug each other . they walk back to the lake . they see their moms smiling at them .

they had a fun day at the lake . they are happy . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . they saw a big pond with ducks and fish . they wanted to feed them some bread .

they walked to the pond and saw a man with a rod . he was trying to catch a fish . he looked angry and sad .

" hello , mister , " lily said . " why are you angry and sad ? "

the man looked at lily and ben . he said , " i am angry and sad because i can not catch any fish . my rod is broken and my bait is smelly . i have been here all day and nothing bites . "

lily and ben felt sorry for the man . they wanted to help him . they had an idea .

