the man smiled . he said , " thank you , kids . you are very kind and smart . let 's try your idea . "

lily and ben gave the man some bread . they taped the stick to his rod . they helped him throw the bread into the pond . soon , a big fish came and bit the bread . the man pulled the rod and caught the fish .

