her mom hugged her and said , " it 's okay , anna . i know you did n't mean to . but you have to be careful . you ca n't throw things out of the window . you could hurt someone or yourself . and you ca n't take my things without asking . that scarf was a gift from your grandma . she made it for me . it was very special . "

