ben did not listen to lily . he ran to the edge of the creek and leaned over . he tried to grab a fish with his hand . but he slipped and fell into the water . he was scared and wet . he cried for help .

lily heard ben 's cry . she was scared too . she ran to the creek and saw ben . she grabbed a stick and reached out to him . she told him to hold on to the stick . she pulled him out of the water . she hugged him and said , " are you okay , ben ? "

