their mom smiled and said , " i love you too . but no more running away . now , let 's go and celebrate your birthday with your friends . and no more ambulances , ok ? "

" ok , mom . no more ambulances , " anna and ben said . they went inside and had a happy birthday . they learned their lesson . they were not naughty anymore . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in the park with their toys . anna has a rod that she uses to make bubbles . ben has a ball that he likes to kick and catch .

one day , they go to the park with their mom . anna wants to play with her rod and make bubbles . she says to ben , " give me your ball . i want to play with it too . you can have my rod and make bubbles . "

ben says , " no , anna . i like my ball . you have your rod . we can share and play together . "

anna is bossy . she does not want to share . she tries to grab ben 's ball from his hands . ben holds on to his ball . they pull and tug . the ball flies out of their hands and rolls away .

anna and ben run after the ball . they do not see the puddle on the ground . they both slip and fall into the puddle . they get wet and muddy . they cry and scream .

mom hears them and comes to help . she picks them up and cleans them . she says , " anna and ben , why did you fight over the ball ? you have your own toys . you should share and play nicely . fighting is not good . it makes you and others unhappy . do you understand ? "

anna and ben nod . they say , " we are sorry , mom . we will share and play nicely . we will not be bossy or greedy . "

mom smiles . she says , " that 's good . i love you both . now , let 's go home and change your clothes . then , we can come back and play again . "

anna and ben hug mom . they say , " we love you too , mom . thank you for helping us . "

the end .

moral value : sharing is caring . fighting is not good . ben and lily were very hot and thirsty . they had been walking in the sand for a long time . they wanted to find water and shade . they saw some green trees and a blue pond far away . they ran towards it . they hoped it was an oasis .

when they got there , they saw many animals and birds . they heard them make noises . they saw them drink and play . the oasis was lively . ben and lily smiled . they drank some water and ate some fruits . they felt better .

they saw a big camel lying under a tree . it looked sleepy . ben wanted to touch it . he walked slowly to it . he reached out his hand . he poked the camel 's nose . the camel opened its eyes . it made a loud sound . it stood up . it shook its head . ben was scared . he ran back to lily . lily laughed . she hugged him . the camel looked at them . it did not look angry . it looked curious . it walked to them . it sniffed them . it licked them . ben and lily giggled . they made friends with the camel . they had fun at the oasis . lily likes to lie on her bed and look at her lamp . her lamp has a long cord that goes to the wall . she can turn it on and off with a switch . sometimes she makes shadows with her hands on the wall .

one night , lily hears a noise under her bed . she is scared . she thinks it is a monster . she pulls the covers over her head and holds her teddy bear . she does not want to look under her bed .

she hears the noise again . it sounds like a growl . she wants to call her mom , but she is too afraid to make a sound . she wishes the lamp was on , but she can not reach the switch .

she feels something touch her foot . she screams . she hears her mom run to her room . she turns on the light . she sees what is under her bed .

it is not a monster . it is her cat , max . he was playing with the long cord of the lamp . he was the one who made the noise and touched her foot . he looks at her with his big eyes and purrs .

lily feels silly . she is not scared anymore . she hugs her mom and her cat . she says sorry to max for screaming . she turns off the lamp and lies down with her teddy bear . she falls asleep with a smile . tom likes to read books . he has many books in his room . he reads about cars , animals , and stars . he reads every day before he sleeps .

one day , tom finds a new book on his bed . it is a big book with a red cover . he opens the book and sees many pictures . he sees a picture of a shoe . the shoe is blue and has a star on it . tom likes the shoe . he wants to read more .

he turns the page and sees a word . the word is " shoe " . tom knows this word . he says it out loud . " shoe " . he feels happy . he can read the word . he turns more pages and sees more words . he reads them all . he reads " hat " , " cat " , " bat " , and " rat " . he reads " sun " , " fun " , " run " , and " bun " . he reads " red " , " bed " , " fed " , and " led " . he reads and reads and reads .

tom is very proud . he can read many words . he shows his book to his mom . his mom smiles and hugs him . she says , " you are a fine reader , tom . i am so proud of you . you are a smart boy . " tom feels warm and happy . he loves his mom . he loves his book . he loves to read . tom and mia like to play with their toy trucks . they have a big truck that can load dirt and rocks , and a small truck that can pull a chain . they pretend that they are working on a big road .

one day , they find a big hill of dirt in the park . they decide to load some dirt on their big truck and take it to their road . tom drives the big truck and mia helps him load the dirt with a shovel . they fill the truck with dirt and rocks .

but when they try to drive away , the big truck is too heavy . it can not move . tom and mia are sad . they want to take the dirt to their road . they look around and see their small truck with a chain . they have an idea .

they tie the chain to the big truck and the small truck . mia drives the small truck and tom stays on the big truck . they try to pull the big truck with the chain . the small truck is very powerful . it pulls and pulls and pulls . the big truck starts to move . tom and mia are happy . they cheer and clap .

they drive the big truck and the small truck to their road . they unload the dirt and rocks and make a big pile . they are proud of their work . they play with their trucks on their road . they have fun . they are good friends . ben and mia like to play in the yard . they have a big ball , a swing , and a bike . they are lively and happy . they laugh and run and jump .

one day , they hear a ring . it is the ice cream truck . ben and mia love ice cream . they run to the gate and look for the truck . they see it on the street . it is red and white and has a picture of a cone .

" can we have ice cream , please ? " they ask their mom . their mom is in the house . she is busy . she does not hear them .

ben and mia do not wait . they open the gate and run to the street . they do not look for cars . they do not hear the horn . they only see the ice cream truck .

a big car comes fast . it hits ben and mia . they fall down . they do not get up . they do not laugh or run or jump . they are still and quiet .

the ice cream truck stops . the driver gets out . he is scared and sad . he calls for help . he sees the mom . she comes out of the house . she sees ben and mia . she screams and cries . she runs to them . she hugs them . she does not get ice cream . she does not want ice cream . she only wants ben and mia . but they are gone . anna and ben are playing in the garden . they have a tent , a blanket and some toys . they pretend they are on an adventure in the jungle .

" look , ben , a lion ! " anna says , pointing to a big cat on the fence . " we have to escape ! "

ben nods and grabs a toy gun . he makes a loud noise and scares the cat away . " quick , anna , follow me ! " he runs to the tent and pulls anna inside .

they close the flap and sit on the blanket . they are safe now . they smile at each other .

" we are successful , anna . we escaped the lion ! " ben says .

" yes , we are , ben . we are brave and smart ! " anna says .

they hug and laugh . then they see a basket with some cups and a pot . anna 's mom left it for them .

" look , ben , tea ! " anna says . " let 's have a tea party ! "

ben agrees and pours some tea for both of them . they sip and chat . they enjoy their adventure and their tea . they are happy . lily and max were playing with their toy boats in the bathtub . they liked to pretend they were sailors and go on adventures . sometimes they would race their boats to see who was faster .

" ready , set , go ! " lily shouted , as she pushed her red boat with a yellow sail . max pushed his blue boat with a white sail . the boats zoomed across the water , making waves and splashes .

" i 'm going to win ! " max said , as he watched his boat get ahead of lily 's .

" no , you 're not ! " lily said , as she blew on her sail to make it go faster . she caught up with max 's boat and they were side by side .

they reached the other end of the bathtub at the same time . they both grabbed their boats and cheered .

" it 's a tie ! " lily said , smiling .

" it 's a tie ! " max agreed , smiling too .

they hugged each other and put their boats on the edge of the tub . they were happy and comfortable . they liked to play and race together . they were good sailors and good friends . lily and ben were playing by the river . they liked to make boats from sticks and leaves and watch them float on the water . they also liked to splash each other and laugh .

but then a big boy came . he was mean and rude . he saw lily and ben 's boats and he kicked them . he destroyed them all . he said , " your boats are stupid and ugly . go away , this is my river . "

lily and ben were very sad and angry . they tried to stop the big boy , but he was too strong and fast . he pushed them and threw stones at them . he made them cry .

" stop it , stop it ! " lily shouted . " you are a bad boy . you are not nice . you make us miserable . "

the big boy did not listen . he kept hurting lily and ben . he did not care .

but then he heard a loud noise . he turned around and saw a big wave coming . it was a flood . the river was angry . it did not like the big boy either . it wanted to teach him a lesson .

the big boy was scared . he tried to run away , but it was too late . the wave caught him and carried him away . he screamed and cried for help , but no one helped him .

lily and ben saw the big boy disappear in the water . they felt sorry for him , but they also felt relieved . they hugged each other and thanked the river .

they decided to make new boats and play by the river again . they hoped the big boy would learn to be kind and share . they were happy . mia and ben are playing with their toys . mia has a big doll and ben has a small car . mia wants to dress up her doll with a hat and a coat . she looks for them in her toy box .

" where is my hat and coat ? " mia asks . " i want to make my doll look amazing . "

ben sees a hat and a coat on the floor . they are his dad 's hat and coat . he thinks they are funny . he picks them up and gives them to mia .

" here you go , mia . try these , " ben says .

mia takes the hat and the coat . she tries to put them on her doll . but they are too big . the hat covers the doll 's face and the coat drags on the floor .

" these do n't fit , ben . they are too big for my doll . they are your dad 's hat and coat , " mia says .

ben laughs . he thinks it is funny to see the doll in the big hat and coat . he takes them off the doll and puts them on himself . he looks in the mirror .

" look at me , mia . i look amazing , " ben says .

mia laughs too . she thinks ben looks silly in the big hat and coat . she sees a brush on the table . she picks it up and pretends to brush ben 's hair .

" you need a brush , ben . your hair is messy , " mia says .

ben and mia giggle and play with the hat , the coat and the brush . they have fun dressing up and making each other look amazing . sara and ben like to play in the park . they run and jump and slide and swing . they have fun with their friends . but sometimes they do wild things . they do not listen to the rules . they do not share the toys . they do rough things . they push and pull and shout and cry .

one day , sara and ben do a very wild thing . they climb on the fence . the fence is high and sharp . the fence is not for climbing . the fence is for keeping the park safe . mom and dad tell them to get down . they say , " no , no , no . we want to climb . we are wild . "

but then , sara and ben see something . they see a big dog . the dog is on the other side of the fence . the dog is not friendly . the dog is angry . the dog barks and growls and shows its teeth . the dog wants to bite . sara and ben are scared . they say , " help , help , help . we want to get down . we are not wild . "

mom and dad hear them . they run to the fence . they help sara and ben get down . they hug them and kiss them and say , " are you okay ? you are safe now . but you should not do wild things . you should do good things . you should listen to the rules . you should share the toys . you should do gentle things . you should be kind and nice . "

sara and ben nod and say , " sorry , sorry , sorry . we will not do wild things . we will do good things . we will listen to the rules . we will share the toys . we will do gentle things . we will be kind and nice . " they hug mom and dad and say , " we love you . thank you for saving us . " mom and dad smile and say , " we love you too . you are our good kids . " they go back to the park and play with their friends . they have fun and they are happy . lily was a cheerful girl who liked to play with her dolls and sing songs . she had a big sister , anna , who was very kind and helped her with everything . lily loved anna very much and wanted to be like her .

one day , lily saw anna pack a bag and say goodbye to their mom and dad . lily asked where anna was going . anna said she had to go to the hospital for an operation . lily did not know what an operation was , but she thought it sounded scary . she asked anna if it would hurt . anna said no , it would not hurt , and she would be back soon . she gave lily a hug and a kiss and told her to be a good girl .

lily waited for anna to come back . she played with her dolls and sang songs , but she missed anna a lot . she asked mom and dad when anna would come back . they said they did not know , but they hoped soon . they looked sad and worried . lily did not like to see them sad and worried . she wanted to make them happy . she decided to draw a picture for anna and give it to her when she came back .

lily worked hard on her picture . she used her favorite crayons and drew anna with a big smile and a flower in her hair . she wrote " i love you anna " with her best letters . she was very proud of her picture . she showed it to mom and dad and they smiled and said it was very beautiful . they said they would take it to the hospital and give it to anna .

lily waited for mom and dad to come back . she hoped they would bring anna with them . she hoped anna would like her picture . she hoped anna would be cheerful again . she looked at the clock and saw it was very late . she wondered why mom and dad were not back yet . she felt scared and lonely . she wished anna was with her .

mom and dad did not come back that night . they did not come back the next day . they did not come back the next week . lily did not see anna again . she did not know what happened to her . she did not understand why she had to go for an operation . she did not understand why she did not come back . she did not understand why mom and dad were always crying . she did not understand anything . she only knew she missed anna very much . she only knew she was not cheerful anymore . she only knew she wanted to be close to anna again . lily and sam are twins . they live in a big city with many cars , buses , and people . they like to go to the park with their mom and dad and play on the swings and slides .

one day , they see a new thing in the park . it is a big tent with many colors and pictures . they hear music and laughter from inside . they ask their mom and dad what it is .

mom and dad say it is a circus . a circus is a place where people do funny and amazing things , like juggling , riding bikes , and flying in the air . they say they can go inside and watch if they want .

lily and sam are very curious and excited . they want to see the circus . they say yes , yes , yes to their mom and dad . they hold their hands and walk to the tent .

inside , they see many things they have never seen before . they see clowns with big noses and shoes , making jokes and throwing pies . they see animals with stripes and spots , doing tricks and roaring . they see people with costumes and feathers , dancing and singing . they see a man with a big hat and a whip , telling everyone what to do .

lily and sam are amazed and happy . they clap and cheer and laugh . they understand that the circus is a fun and wonderful place . they thank their mom and dad for taking them . they say they love the circus and want to come again . sam liked to play with his toy sail . it was red and white and had a big stick in the middle . he would make it go on the water in the bath or in the pond . he would say " sail , sail , sail " and pretend he was a captain .

one day , sam 's mom said they were going to the beach . sam was very happy . he wanted to see the big water and the big sails . he packed his toy sail in his bag and got ready to go . he put on his hat and his sun cream and his fit shoes . he said " i am fit for the beach ! "

at the beach , sam saw many things . he saw sand and shells and crabs and birds . he saw big waves and big boats and big sails . he wanted to play with his toy sail on the big water . he asked his mom if he could . she said yes , but he had to be careful and stay close .

sam ran to the water with his toy sail . he put it on the water and watched it go . he said " sail , sail , sail " and smiled . he felt the wind and the sun and the spray . he was having fun .

but then , a big wave came and took his toy sail away . sam was sad . he cried and cried . he wanted his toy sail back . he looked for it on the water , but he could not see it . he said " sail , sail , sail " and hoped it would come back .

his mom came and hugged him . she said she was sorry . she said she knew he loved his toy sail . she said she cared for him very much . she said they would look for another toy sail at the shop . she said they would find one that was fit for the big water . she said they would have fun again .

sam felt better . he hugged his mom back . he said he loved her very much . he said he cared for her too . he said he was ready to go to the shop . he said he wanted to find a new toy sail . he said he wanted to sail , sail , sail again . lily and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big slide . lily wants to go on the slide , but tom is scared .

" come on , tom , it is fun ! " lily says . " you can lean on me , and i will hold your hand . "

tom shakes his head . " no , no , it is too high . i will fall and hurt myself . "

lily smiles . " no , you will not . i will go with you , and we will be safe . trust me , tom , it is a good slide . "

lily takes tom 's hand and leads him to the slide . tom feels nervous , but he leans on lily and lets her help him . they climb up the stairs and sit on the slide . lily counts to three and pushes them down .

" whee ! " lily shouts . " this is fun ! "

tom feels the wind in his hair and the sun on his face . he laughs and enjoys the ride . he leans on lily and squeezes her hand .

" this is fun ! " tom agrees . " thank you , lily , for being my friend . "

they reach the bottom of the slide and hug each other . they are happy and proud . they go on the slide again and again , until it is time to go home .

they wave goodbye to the slide and to each other . they had a good day . timmy was a chubby boy who loved to eat candy . he ate candy every day , even when his mom said no . he did not like to share his candy with anyone , not even his friends . he was very greedy and selfish .

one night , he sneaked into the kitchen and took a big bag of candy from the cupboard . he ran to his room and locked the door . he opened the bag and started to eat the candy . he ate and ate and ate , until he felt sick . he threw the bag on the floor and lay on his bed .

he heard a knock on the door . it was his mom . she said , " timmy , open the door . i know you have candy in there . you have to share with your sister . she has no candy and she is sad . "

timmy did not want to share . he said , " go away , mom . i hate you . i hate my sister . this is my candy and i will eat it all . "

he heard another knock on the door . it was not his mom . it was a scary voice . it said , " timmy , open the door . i know you have candy in there . you have to share with me . i have no candy and i am hungry . "

timmy was afraid . he said , " who are you ? go away . this is my candy and i will eat it all . "

he heard the door break . he saw a skeleton standing in the doorway . it had no skin , no flesh , no hair . it had only bones and teeth . it said , " i am the candy skeleton . i come for greedy children who eat too much candy . i have no candy and i am hungry . you have to share with me . or i will eat you . "

timmy screamed . he threw his candy at the skeleton . he said , " take it , take it . i do n't want it anymore . please do n't eat me . i 'm sorry , i 'm sorry . "

the skeleton laughed . it said , " too late , timmy . you have been very bad . you have not shared your candy with anyone . you have not listened to your mom . you have not loved your sister . you have only loved yourself . and now you will pay . you will become a candy skeleton like me . "

the skeleton grabbed timmy and bit him . timmy felt a sharp pain . he looked at his arm and saw that it was turning into candy . he cried and cried , but no one heard him . the skeleton ate him until there was nothing left but bones and teeth . then it took the bag of candy and left .

the next morning , timmy 's mom and sister came to his room . they saw the broken door and the candy bones on the bed . they were very sad and scared . they wondered what had happened to timmy . they wished he had shared his candy with them . they wished he had loved them more . they wished he had not been so greedy and selfish . they wished he had not met the candy skeleton . ben and mia liked to play pirate in the park . they had a big cardboard box that they pretended was a ship . they used sticks for swords and scarves for flags . they had a lot of fun sailing and fighting .

one day , they saw a new boy in the park . he had a red bike and a black hat . he looked like a pirate too . he rode his bike very fast around the park . he speed past ben and mia and their box .

" hey , you ! " ben shouted . " do you want to play pirate with us ? "

the boy stopped his bike and looked at them . he shook his head .

" no , thank you , " he said . " i am a real pirate . i do n't need a box or a stick . i have a bike and a hat . i am the fastest and the best . "

ben and mia did not like what the boy said . they thought he was rude and stubborn . they did not want to play with him .

" fine , " mia said . " you are not a real pirate . you are a silly bike pirate . you do n't know how to sail or fight . you are afraid of the water and the wind . you are the worst . "

the boy got angry . he did not like what mia said . he wanted to show them that he was a real pirate . he got on his bike and rode towards them . he tried to knock over their box with his bike .

but ben and mia were ready . they grabbed their sticks and scarves and defended their box . they waved their flags and shouted their pirate words . they made the boy stop and turn around .

" ha ! " ben said . " we are the real pirates . we have a ship and swords . we have courage and fun . we are the fastest and the best . "

the boy felt sad . he realized that he was wrong . he wanted to play pirate with ben and mia . he wanted to have fun too .

" can i play with you ? " he asked . " i am sorry for being rude and stubborn . i do n't want to be a silly bike pirate . i want to be a real pirate . "

ben and mia smiled . they liked the boy 's words . they decided to give him a chance .

" okay , " mia said . " you can play with us . but you have to share your bike and your hat . and you have to follow the pirate rules . "

the boy nodded . he agreed to share and follow . he parked his bike and took off his hat . he joined ben and mia in their box . they gave him a stick and a scarf . they welcomed him to their crew .

they played pirate in the park . they had a lot of fun sailing and fighting . they speed around the park together . they were the best pirates ever . sara and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big gray bird on a tree . the bird has a long beak and a shiny feather .

" wow , look at that bird ! " sara says . " it is so pretty ! "

" yes , it is , " ben agrees . " do you know what kind of bird it is ? "

sara shakes her head . she does not know . she wants to get closer to the bird and touch it .

" let 's go and say hello to the bird , " sara suggests . " maybe it will be our friend . "

ben is not sure . he thinks the bird might be scared or angry . he remembers what his mom told him about being careful with animals .

" i do n't think that is a good idea , " ben says . " the bird might bite us or fly away . mom says we should not bother animals that are not our pets . we should be honest and leave them alone . "

sara thinks about what ben says . she knows he is right . she does not want to hurt the bird or make it sad . she wants to be honest and kind .

" ok , you are right , " sara says . " we can just look at the bird and say nice things to it . maybe it will sing for us . "

sara and ben smile at each other . they sit on a bench and watch the bird . the bird looks at them and makes a funny sound . sara and ben laugh . they are happy . they are good friends . one day , ben and lily went to the zoo with mom and dad . they saw many animals , like monkeys , birds , and elephants . but ben and lily wanted to see the tiger most of all . they loved the tiger 's big teeth , long tail , and orange fur .

they walked and walked until they found the tiger 's cage . there was a sign that said " tiger " . ben and lily ran to the fence and looked for the tiger . but they could not see him . he was hiding in the grass .

" where is the tiger ? " ben asked .

" maybe he is sleeping , " lily said .

they waited and waited , but the tiger did not come out . ben and lily felt sad . they wanted to see the tiger so much .

then , they heard a roar . it was the tiger ! he came out of the grass and walked to the fence . he looked at ben and lily with his yellow eyes . he was big and beautiful . he was perfect .

ben and lily were so happy . they smiled and clapped . they pointed at the tiger and said , " look , mom and dad , look ! it 's the tiger ! he is perfect ! "

mom and dad came and saw the tiger too . they took a picture of ben and lily with the tiger . they said , " you are right , he is perfect . and so are you ! "

ben and lily hugged mom and dad . they thanked them for taking them to the zoo . they said , " we love you , and we love the tiger too ! " lily and ben were very excited . today was the day of the big parade . they put on their costumes and hats . lily was a fairy and ben was a pirate . they wanted to join the parade and have fun .

they went outside and saw many people and cars and floats . they heard music and horns and cheers . they saw balloons and flags and flowers . they looked for a place to join the parade . but it was hard . the parade was very long and fast . they tried to run and catch up , but they could not .

they felt sad and tired . they sat on the sidewalk and watched the parade go by . they wished they could be part of it .

then they saw a man with a big smile and a funny hat . he was holding a sign that said " everyone is welcome " . he saw lily and ben and waved at them . he said " hello , little fairy and little pirate . do you want to join the parade ? "

lily and ben nodded and smiled . they got up and ran to the man . he gave them each a candy and a sticker . he said " you are very cute and brave . come with me and we will have fun . "

he took them by the hand and led them to the parade . they followed him and joined a group of other children and adults . they all had costumes and hats and signs . they sang and danced and waved . they felt happy and proud .

lily and ben had succeeded . they had joined the parade and had fun . they thanked the man and hugged him . he said " you are very welcome . you made the parade more fun . i hope you have a wonderful day . "

lily and ben said " we will . thank you for being so kind . you are the best . "

they waved goodbye and went home with their candy and stickers . they told their mom and dad about their adventure . they said " we had the best day ever . we joined the parade and made a new friend . he was very kind and funny . he helped us succeed . "

their mom and dad hugged them and said " we are very proud of you . you are very kind and funny too . you make us happy every day . " lily was sick . she had a sore throat and a cough . mommy gave her a pill to make her feel better . but lily did not like the pill . it was big and bitter .

" come on , lily , you have to take the pill , " mommy said . " it will help you get well soon . "

lily shook her head . she did not want the pill . she hid under the blanket .

mommy sighed . she had an idea . she went to the kitchen and got some juice . she poured some juice in a cup and put the pill in it . she hoped lily would not notice .

she came back to lily 's room and smiled . " look , lily , i have some juice for you . it is yummy and sweet . do you want some ? "

lily peeked out from the blanket . she liked juice . she nodded .

mommy handed her the cup . " here you go , lily . drink it all up . hurry , before it gets cold . "

lily took the cup and sipped the juice . it was hot and tangy . she did not mind . she drank more and more . she did not see the pill .

mommy watched her . she was glad . she hoped the pill would work .

lily finished the juice and gave the cup back to mommy . she smiled . she felt a little better .

" thank you , mommy , " she said .

" you 're welcome , lily , " mommy said . " i love you . "

" i love you too , mommy , " lily said .

they hugged and kissed . lily snuggled in her bed . mommy tucked her in and sang her a lullaby . lily closed her eyes and fell asleep . lisa and tom were moving to a new house with their mom and dad . they had many boxes to unpack and put in their rooms . lisa liked to be organized and put her things in the right places . tom liked to play and make messes .

" can i help you unpack , lisa ? " tom asked .

" sure , but you have to be careful and not break anything , " lisa said .

lisa gave tom a box of books and showed him where to put them on the shelf . tom tried to be helpful , but he was bored . he saw a roll of tape on the floor and had an idea . he took the tape and started to stick it on the books , the shelf , the wall , and even lisa 's hair .

" tom , what are you doing ? " lisa shouted . " you are ruining my books and my room ! "

tom laughed and ran away with the tape . lisa was angry and sad . she tried to pull the tape off , but it was hard and sticky . she cried and called for mom and dad .

mom and dad came and saw the mess . they were not happy . they scolded tom and made him apologize to lisa . they also made him help lisa clean up and unpack the rest of the boxes .

tom learned his lesson . he realized that playing with tape was not fun , but mean and wasteful . he also learned that being organized was important and respectful . he said sorry to lisa and hugged her . lisa forgave him and thanked him for his help . they finished unpacking and made their rooms cozy and neat . they were happy and ready to enjoy their new house . lily and ben liked to swim in the sea . they liked to see the fish and the shells and the coral . coral was like a big rock with many colors and shapes . some coral was soft and some coral was hard . lily and ben wanted to find the best coral in the sea .

one day , they saw a big boat near the shore . the boat had a big net and a big hook . lily and ben were curious . they swam closer to the boat . they heard a loud noise . the boat was pulling the net and the hook out of the water . the net and the hook had many fish and shells and coral . some of the coral was broken .

