they find more things that are beautiful . they see a flower that is soft and yellow . they see a bird that is hard and red . they see a cloud that is fluffy and white .

they are happy to study the things in the park . they learn that many things have different textures , but they are all beautiful . they thank their moms for taking them to the park . they go home and tell their dads what they saw and felt . they have a good day . lily liked to sing . she had a rare toy , a microphone . she could sing into it and hear her voice loud and clear . she liked to sing songs from her favorite show , about animals and colors and shapes .

one day , she was singing in her room , when her brother tom came in . he wanted to play with the microphone too . he said , " give me that , lily . it 's my turn to sing . "

