tom did not listen . he tried to grab the microphone from lily 's hand . lily held on tight . they both pulled hard . the microphone broke in half . they heard a loud snap and a crackle .

lily and tom were shocked . they looked at the broken toy . they felt sad and sorry . they did not know what to do .

they heard their mom coming . they hid the microphone under the bed . they hoped she would not find out . they learned a lesson . they should not fight over toys . they should share and be nice . lily and tom were playing with a big box of toys . they liked to find different things and see if they could fit them together . lily found a yellow egg that was soft and squeaky . she tried to fit it into a hole in a wooden puzzle , but it was too big .

