lily was confused . she looked at the egg and then at tom . she did not see a duck . she only saw a yellow egg with a beak and eyes .

" no , tom , this is an egg . see , it has a shell and a yolk inside , " she said .

she showed him the egg and pointed at the parts . tom shook his head . he thought lily was ignorant . he did not know what a shell and a yolk were . he only knew what a duck was .

" no , lily , this is a duck . see , it has a beak and eyes and it quacks , " he said .

he showed her the egg and made it quack again . lily frowned . she thought tom was ignorant . he did not know what an egg was . she only knew what an egg was .

they argued for a while , each trying to prove their point . they did not listen to each other . they did not learn from each other . they did not have fun with each other . they were both ignorant and stubborn .

then , their mom came in and saw them fighting . she was not happy . she took the egg from them and explained what it was .

" this is not a real egg , lily , and this is not a real duck , tom . this is a toy that looks like both . it is an egg - duck . you can squeeze it and it quacks , or you can open it and see the yolk . it is meant to be fun and silly , not to cause trouble . you should share it and play nicely , not fight over it . do you understand ? " she said .

lily and tom looked at the egg - duck and then at each other . they felt ashamed . they realized they were both wrong and they were both right . they apologized to each other and to their mom . they decided to share the egg - duck and try to fit it into different places . they learned something new and they had fun together . they were not ignorant and stubborn anymore . they were smart and friendly . tom likes to play with his motorcycle . it is red and shiny and makes a loud noise . he likes to ride it around the yard and pretend he is a racer . he wears a helmet and gloves and a jacket .

