aunt lisa says , " sure , why not ? i like motorcycles too . let 's go and have some fun . " anna loved dolphins . she had a big toy dolphin that she hugged every night . she wanted to see real dolphins in the water . one day , her mom and dad took her to the sea park . they said there were dolphins there .

anna was very happy . she ran to the big pool where the dolphins were . she saw them jump and splash and make funny noises . she clapped and laughed . she wanted to get close to them . she saw a gate that led to the pool . she ran to the gate and opened it .

but the gate was not for people . it was for the dolphins . when anna opened the gate , the dolphins saw a way out . they swam fast to the gate and escaped . they left the pool and went to the sea . anna was upset . she did not mean to let the dolphins go . she wanted to play with them .

the sea park people were upset too . they ran to the gate and tried to close it . but it was too late . the dolphins were gone . they looked at anna and were angry . they said she was a bad girl . they said she had to leave .

anna cried . she was sorry . she did not know the gate was for the dolphins . she did not know they would leave . she wanted to say sorry to the dolphins and the sea park people . but they did not listen . they took her away . she hugged her toy dolphin and wished she could see the real dolphins again . lily liked to go to the gym with her mom . she liked to play with the balls and the mats and the ropes . she liked to watch the big people jump and run and lift . she did not like to stay in the playroom with the other kids . she wanted to see everything .

one day , lily saw a shiny thing on a table . it was a phone . it had many colors and buttons and sounds . lily wanted to play with it . she was very nosy . she did not ask anyone . she did not wait for her mom . she took the phone and ran away .

she ran to the other side of the gym . she hid behind a big box . she pressed the buttons and made the phone talk . she laughed and smiled . she did not see the big man coming . he was angry . he was looking for his phone . he saw lily with it . he yelled at her . he took the phone from her . he scolded her . he told her to go back to the playroom . he told her mom what she did .

lily was scared and sad . she cried and cried . she did not want to play anymore . she did not want to go to the gym anymore . she learned that taking things that are not yours is bad . she learned that being nosy can get you in trouble . she wished she had listened to her mom . she wished she had stayed in the playroom . she had a bad day . tim and mia are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they find a big box under a tree . they open the box and see many shiny things . they are gold !

" wow , look at all the gold ! " tim says . " we are rich ! "

