they take some gold out of the box and start to throw it in the air . they laugh and clap when they catch it . they have fun with the gold .

but then , a big dog comes to the park . he sees the gold and wants it . he runs to tim and mia and barks . he scares them .

" go away , dog ! " tim says . " this is our gold ! "

but the dog does not listen . he jumps and grabs some gold in his mouth . he runs away with the gold .

" hey , come back ! " mia says . " that is our gold ! "

they chase the dog , but he is too fast . he runs to a house and goes inside . tim and mia stop at the door . they knock and wait .

a woman opens the door . she sees tim and mia and smiles . she also sees the gold in the dog 's mouth .

