the woman looks surprised . she takes the gold from the dog and looks at it . she sees that it is not real gold . it is chocolate !

" oh , i see , " she says . " this is not gold . this is candy . someone left it in the park for easter . it is yummy , but not good for dogs . "

she gives the gold back to tim and mia . she also gives them some cookies and milk .

" here , you can have this candy , " she says . " but you should share it with other kids . and you should not throw it . you could hurt someone or lose it . and you should not play with things that are not yours . you could get in trouble . "

tim and mia feel sorry . they did not know that the gold was candy . they did not mean to be bad .

