" yes , thank you , " mia says . " and we are sorry for your dog . we hope he is okay . "

the woman smiles and hugs them . she says that the dog is fine . he just needs some water and rest .

she tells them to enjoy the candy and the cookies . she also tells them to be careful and have fun .

tim and mia say goodbye and thank you . they take the candy and the cookies and go back to the park . they see other kids playing there . they decide to share the candy and the cookies with them . they make new friends and have more fun .

they learn that candy is yummy , but friendship is better . and they learn that throwing is not always good , but sharing is . lily and ben are playing in the park . they like to run and jump and slide . lily sees a big dog near the fence . she wants to pet the dog . she runs to the dog and says , " hello , dog . you are nice . can i touch you ? "

the dog is not nice . the dog is angry . the dog barks and growls . the dog bites lily 's leg . lily screams and falls down . ben hears lily and runs to her . he sees the dog and the blood . he is scared .

" go away , dog ! you are bad ! you hurt lily ! " ben shouts . he throws a stick at the dog . the dog runs away . ben helps lily get up . he sees her leg . it is red and sore . he says , " lily , your leg is bad . we need to find mom . she will make it better . "

lily nods and cries . she holds ben 's hand . they walk to the bench where mom is sitting . mom sees them and jumps up . she sees lily 's leg and gasps . she says , " oh , no ! what happened ? who did this ? "

