mom hugs lily and ben . she says , " you are both very brave . i am proud of you . but we need to go to the doctor . he will fix lily 's leg . he will give her a bandage and some medicine . it will hurt a little , but it will heal soon . "

lily and ben nod . they trust mom . they go to the car . mom drives them to the doctor . the doctor is kind . he fixes lily 's leg . he gives her a sticker and a lollipop . he says , " you are a strong girl . you will be fine . just be careful of dogs . some of them are not friendly . "

