" wow , look at all these toys ! " lily said . " let 's take them home and play with them . "

" but maybe they belong to someone else , " ben said . " maybe they are lost or forgotten . we should not take what is not ours . "

lily did not listen to ben . she wanted the toys . she said , " no , they are ours now . we found them . come on , help me carry the sack . "

ben felt bad . he did not want to hurt lily , but he did not want to do something wrong . he said , " no , lily , i do n't want to . it is not fair . let 's leave the sack here and go home . maybe the owner will come back and find it . "

lily got angry . she said , " fine , then i will take the sack by myself . you are not my friend anymore . go away ! "

she grabbed the sack and ran away . ben was sad . he watched lily go . he hoped she would change her mind .

but lily did not change her mind . she took the sack to her house and hid it in her room . she played with the toys all by herself . she did not share them with anyone . she did not talk to ben anymore . she thought she was happy , but she was not . she was lonely and greedy .

one evening , she looked out of her window and saw the sunset . it was very pretty . it had many colors . she remembered how she and ben used to watch the sunset together and say how sweet it was . she missed ben . she realized she had made a mistake . she felt sorry .

she decided to take the sack back to the park and look for ben . she hoped he would forgive her . she hoped they could be friends again . she hoped they could watch the sunset together and say how sweet it was .

the moral of the story is : do not be selfish and take what is not yours . be honest and kind . friendship is more important than toys . ben and sam were friends who liked to play baseball . they had a big baseball that was very special . it could glow in the dark . they liked to throw it and catch it when it was night .

one day , it was very gloomy . the sky was gray and it rained a lot . ben and sam could not go outside to play . they were sad and bored . they wanted to play with their glowing baseball .

" i have an idea , " ben said . " let 's play with the baseball in the basement . it is dark there and we can see it glow . "

sam nodded . he thought it was a good idea . they took the baseball and went to the basement . they turned off the light and threw the baseball to each other . it was fun to see it glow .

but they did not see the window . it was small and high , but it was there . and the baseball hit it . it broke the glass and flew outside . ben and sam heard a loud noise and saw the rain . they were scared and ran to the light .

" oh no , " ben said . " we broke the window and lost the baseball . what will we do ? "

sam felt bad . he said , " we have to tell the truth . we have to say sorry and fix the window . and we have to find the baseball . maybe it is still glowing in the rain . "

ben agreed . he said , " you are right . we made a mistake and we have to fix it . it is not good to play with the baseball inside . it is only for outside . "

they went upstairs and told their parents what happened . their parents were not happy , but they were glad that ben and sam were honest . they helped them fix the window and look for the baseball . they found it in the grass . it was wet and dirty , but it still glowed .

ben and sam learned a lesson . they learned to be careful with their things and to play in the right place . they also learned to be honest and to say sorry when they did something wrong . they hugged their parents and thanked them . they still loved their glowing baseball , but they only played with it outside . tim and sam are friends . they like to play with toys . they have a big box of toys in their room . they have cars , trucks , dolls , balls , and more . but their favorite toy is a jet . the jet is red and shiny . it can fly in the air and make noises .

one day , tim and sam are playing with the jet . they take turns to fly it around the room . they pretend they are pilots and go on adventures . they have fun .

