mom hugs them and says , " it 's okay , boys , accidents happen . do n't worry , we can get the jet back . come with me . "

mom takes them to the garage . she gets a ladder and a broom . she puts the ladder against the wall and climbs up . she uses the broom to push the jet off the roof . the jet falls on the grass .

