mom climbs down and gives the jet to them . she says , " here you go , boys , your jet is safe . be careful next time , okay ? "

" okay , mom , thank you ! " tim and sam say .

they hug mom and say , " you are strong , mom ! "

mom smiles and says , " you are welcome , boys . now , who wants a cookie ? " lila and tom were playing with blocks . they liked to build towers and houses and cars . lila had a big red block that she wanted to put on top of her tower . she reached for it , but tom grabbed it first .

