" no , it 's mine ! " tom said . " i saw it first ! "

they both pulled on the block , but it was too hard . it slipped from their hands and fell on the floor . it bounced and rolled until it stopped near the sofa . lila and tom ran after it .

but they were not the only ones who saw the block . spot , the dog , was lying under the sofa . he was bored and hungry . he saw the block and thought it was a toy . he jumped out and snatched the block with his mouth .

" spot , no ! " lila and tom shouted . " that 's not for you ! "

they tried to get the block from spot , but he was too fast . he ran around the room , wagging his tail and making noises . he liked the block . it was big and red and shiny . he wanted to keep it .

but the block was not a good toy for spot . it was too big for his mouth . it hurt his teeth and gums . it made his mouth dry and sore . he tried to chew it , but it was too hard . it was not fun at all .

he realized that the block was not a toy , but a mistake . he spat it out and looked for something else . he saw his bowl of water and ran to it . he drank and drank until his mouth felt better .

