she took tom 's hand and they climbed the pipe . it was hard and cold and made a loud sound when they stepped on it . they shone the flashlight and saw many things in the pipe . they saw wires and cans and bottles and shoes and toys . they also saw some bugs and rats and birds . they were not afraid . they were curious and excited .

