lily 's mom smiled and shook her head . she was glad they were safe and happy . she knew they were adventurous kids who liked to climb . she also knew they needed to be careful and listen to her . she took their hands and walked them home . she told them they could come back to the park another day , but they had to stay away from the pipe . they agreed , but they also wondered what else they could find in the pipe . they liked to climb . they liked to have adventures . lila was a little girl who liked to help her mom . she helped her mom cook , clean , and take care of her baby brother . lila 's mom was very sick and had to take a lot of pills every day . lila wanted to make her mom feel better , so she decided to give her a special gift .

lila went to her room and looked for something incredible . she found a shiny necklace that her dad gave her for her birthday . it had a big red heart and sparkled in the light . lila thought her mom would love it . she put the necklace in a small box and wrapped it with a pretty ribbon .

she ran to the kitchen , where her mom was sitting on a chair . she gave her the box and said , " mom , this is for you . i love you so much . you are the best mom in the world . "

her mom smiled and hugged her . she opened the box and saw the necklace . she gasped and said , " lila , this is so beautiful . thank you , my sweet girl . this is the most incredible gift i ever got . you are so kind and thoughtful . i love you too . "

lila was happy to see her mom happy . she helped her mom put on the necklace and said , " mom , you look so pretty . the necklace matches your eyes . you are incredible too . "

her mom kissed her and said , " lila , you are my treasure . you are more valuable than any pill or necklace . you make me feel better every day . you are my sunshine . " anna was a very intelligent girl . she liked to read books and learn new things . she also liked to help her mother in the garden . she knew how to water the plants and pull out the weeds .

one day , her mother gave her a mint plant . she said , " this is a special plant . it smells good and tastes good . you can use it to make tea or to flavor your food . but you have to take good care of it . it needs sun and water and a big pot . "

anna was happy . she thanked her mother and put the mint plant in her room . she watered it every day and talked to it . she said , " you are a beautiful plant . i will make tea with you and share it with my friends . "

but anna forgot one thing . she forgot to give the mint plant more space . the mint plant grew very fast and soon it was too big for the pot . it started to look sad and droopy . anna did not notice . she was busy reading her books and learning new things .

one day , her mother came to her room and saw the mint plant . she said , " anna , what happened to your mint plant ? it looks very unhappy . it needs a bigger pot and more soil . you have to transplant it or it will die . "

anna was surprised . she looked at the mint plant and saw that it was true . she felt sorry for the mint plant . she said , " oh , mother , i 'm sorry . i did not know that the mint plant needed more space . i was so busy with my books that i forgot to check on it . can we save it ? "

her mother said , " yes , we can . but you have to learn a lesson . being intelligent is not enough . you also have to be attentive and caring . you have to pay attention to the needs of others , not just your own . books are good , but plants are alive . they need love and respect , too . "

anna nodded . she said , " you are right , mother . i will be more attentive and caring . i will transplant the mint plant and give it more space . i will also spend more time with it and with you . thank you for teaching me this lesson . "

her mother smiled . she said , " you are welcome , anna . i 'm proud of you . you are a very intelligent and kind girl . now , let 's go and save the mint plant together . " sara was very sad . her best friend anna moved to a far place . she missed anna a lot . she wanted to play with anna and talk to her .

one day , sara 's mom gave her a big surprise . she said , " sara , i have something for you . it is a telephone . you can use it to speak to anna . she has a telephone too . do you want to try ? "

