" thank you , sara . you are very kind and sweet . you make me feel better . i will always be your friend too , no matter what . "

sara and anna spoke for a long time . they told each other stories and jokes and secrets . they laughed and cried and smiled . they felt close , even though they were far . they said goodbye and hung up .

sara hugged her mom and said , " thank you , mom , for the telephone . it is the best gift ever . i love you . "

" i love you too , sara . i 'm glad you spoke to anna . she is a good friend . and you are a good friend too . " lily and tom were playing in the garden . they liked to run and jump and chase each other . sometimes they would stumble and fall , but they would get up and laugh .

one day , they saw a big tree with green and yellow fruits . they were pears . lily and tom wanted to taste them , but they were too high to reach .

" let 's get a pear ! " lily said .

" how ? " tom asked .

" maybe we can climb the tree , " lily said .

they tried to climb the tree , but the branches were too slippery and the bark was too rough . they slid down and scratched their hands .

" ouch ! " lily said .

" ow ! " tom said .

they looked at the pears and felt sad . they were so juicy and sweet , but they could not have them .

then they heard a voice .

