she gave them each a pear and smiled .

" thank you , mrs. brown ! " lily and tom said .

they bit into the pears and felt the juice run down their chins . they were the best pears they ever had .

" you 're welcome , children . you are very patient and polite . you did not try to pick the pears without asking . that is very good . you can come back anytime and have more pears , " mrs. brown said .

lily and tom thanked her again and hugged her . they were very happy and grateful . they decided to share their pears with their friends and family . they learned that being patient and kind can bring good things . anna and ben were playing with their toys in the living room . anna had a big doll and ben had a small car . they were having fun until anna saw ben 's car and wanted it .

" give me your car , ben . it is nicer than my doll , " anna said .

" no , anna . this is my car . you have your doll . go away , " ben said .

anna did not listen . she tried to grab ben 's car , but ben held it tight . they started to pull and tug , making loud noises .

" stop it , you two ! " mom said , coming into the room . " why are you fighting over a toy ? you have so many toys to share . you should be kind and humble , not greedy and rude . "

anna and ben felt ashamed . they knew mom was right . they let go of the car and looked at each other .

" i 'm sorry , ben . i was wrong . you can have your car . can i play with you ? " anna said .

" i 'm sorry , anna . i was mean . you can play with me . do you want to trade toys for a while ? " ben said .

anna and ben smiled and nodded . they gave each other a hug and traded toys . they played nicely and happily , and mom was proud of them .

they learned to surrender their toys and be humble friends . sam and mia are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big tap near the pond . the tap is shiny and has a red handle .

" look , a tap ! " sam says . " i want to turn it on and see what happens . "

" me too ! " mia says . " let 's go and try it . "

sam and mia run to the tap . sam gets there first . he grabs the handle and tries to turn it . but it is too hard . he can not move it .

" let me try ! " mia says . she pushes sam away and holds the handle . she pulls and pulls . but she can not move it either .

" it 's not fair ! " sam says . " you pushed me . i want to try again . "

" no , it 's my turn ! " mia says . " you had your chance . i want to try more . "

sam and mia start to argue . they pull and tug at the handle . they shout and cry . they forget to have fun .

a man sees them . he works in the park . he knows how to use the tap . he walks over to them .

" hello , children , " he says . " what are you doing ? "

" we want to turn on the tap , " sam says .

" but we ca n't , " mia says .

the man smiles . he says , " the tap is not for playing . it is for watering the flowers . it is very hard to turn on . you need a special key . i have the key . do you want to see ? "

sam and mia nod . they stop arguing . they are curious .

the man takes out a small key from his pocket . he puts it in a hole on the tap . he turns the key . then he turns the handle . the tap makes a noise . water comes out of the tap . it makes a fountain . the water is cold and clear .

" wow ! " sam and mia say . they clap their hands . they laugh . they run under the water . they get wet and happy .

the man says , " do you want to help me water the flowers ? you can lead the water with this hose . it is like a snake . you can make it go where you want . "

sam and mia say , " yes , please ! " they take the hose . they lead the water to the flowers . the flowers are colorful and pretty . they drink the water . they look happy too .

sam and mia say , " thank you , mister . you are very nice . you showed us something new . we are sorry we fought . we are friends again . "

the man says , " you are welcome , children . i am glad you learned something . and i am glad you are friends . friends should share and be fair . that is how you have fun . " he smiles and waves . he turns off the tap . he takes his key and leaves .

sam and mia hug . they say , " we had fun today . we saw a tap . we watered the flowers . we made a new friend . we learned to be fair . we love the park . " they hold hands and walk home . they are happy . lily and max liked to race each other in the park . they ran as fast as they could , and laughed when they reached the big tree . sometimes they raced their bikes , or their scooters , or their balls .

one day , they saw a stranger in the park . he had a big dog with him , and he looked angry . he shouted at lily and max , and told them to go away . he said they were making too much noise , and they were bothering his dog .

lily and max were scared . they did not like the stranger , or his loud voice , or his big dog . they wanted to go home , but they did not want to pass by the stranger . they did not know what to do .

then they saw their mom . she was walking towards them , with a smile on her face . she saw the stranger , and she did not like him either . she told lily and max to come to her , and she held their hands . she said to the stranger , " leave my children alone . they are not doing anything wrong . they are just having fun . this is a public park , and they have the right to play here . "

the stranger did not say anything . he looked at mom , and he looked at lily and max , and he looked at his dog . he saw that mom was not afraid of him , and that lily and max were not alone . he turned around , and walked away .

lily and max were happy . they hugged their mom , and thanked her for saving them . they said they did not want to race anymore , they just wanted to go home . mom said that was fine , and that she was proud of them . she said they did a good job of staying away from the stranger , and of calling for her . she said they were brave , and smart , and kind .

they went home , and had some cookies and milk . they told their dad what happened , and he said he was proud of them too . he said they should always be careful of strangers , and always stick together . he said they were a great team , and he loved them very much .

the end . sara loved lollipops . she liked the red ones best . they were sweet and sticky and made her tongue red . she always asked her mom for a lollipop when they went to the store .

one day , sara saw a big jar of lollipops at the store . they were all different colors and shapes . she wanted to try them all . she asked her mom for a lollipop , but her mom said no . she said they had to go home and eat lunch first .

sara was sad and angry . she did not want to wait . she wanted a lollipop now . she saw a blue lollipop that looked like a star . she reached for it , but her mom saw her . she grabbed her hand and said , " no , sara , you ca n't have that . that 's not a lollipop . that 's soap . "

sara did not understand . she thought it was a lollipop . she wanted to taste it . she pulled her hand away from her mom and put the blue soap in her mouth . she bit it hard .

it was not sweet . it was not sticky . it was bitter and foamy and made her mouth hurt . she spit it out and yelled , " yuck ! yuck ! yuck ! "

her mom was shocked and scared . she took the soap out of sara 's mouth and threw it in the trash . she gave sara some water to drink and wiped her face . she said , " i 'm sorry , sara , i told you that was not a lollipop . that was soap . soap is for washing , not for eating . you have to listen to me . "

sara was sorry too . she felt sick and silly . she said , " i 'm sorry , mom , i thought it was a lollipop . i wo n't do that again . "

her mom hugged her and said , " it 's okay , sara , i love you . next time , we can get a real lollipop . a red one , if you want . "

sara smiled and said , " yes , please . i love you too , mom . and i love red lollipops . " on tuesday , lily and ben wanted to decorate their room . they found some paper , crayons , scissors and glue . they cut out shapes and drew pictures on them . they made stars , hearts , flowers and animals .

" look , i made a fat cat ! " lily said , holding up a round orange cat with a big smile .

" that 's funny , i made a fat dog ! " ben said , showing a brown dog with floppy ears and a wagging tail .

they laughed and stuck their fat pets on the wall . they also hung some stars and hearts from the ceiling with string . they made their room look very pretty and colorful .

they were very proud of their work and ran to show their mom .

" mom , mom , come and see what we did ! " they shouted .

mom came and saw their room . she smiled and hugged them .

" you did a great job , my sweeties ! you are very creative and clever . i love your fat cat and dog . they are very cute . and i love your stars and hearts . they make me happy . you decorated your room very well . i 'm so proud of you ! " she said .

lily and ben felt very happy and hugged their mom back . they thanked her and invited her to play with them in their room . they had a lot of fun with their mom and their fat pets . they liked their room very much . they decided to decorate it again next tuesday . lily and rose were sisters who lived in a small house with their mom and dad . lily was older and liked to play with dolls and books . rose was younger and liked to play with cars and balls . they did not like to share their toys or their room .

one day , lily took rose 's favorite car and hid it under her bed . rose was very sad and angry . she looked everywhere for her car , but she could not find it . she asked lily , " where is my car ? i want to play with it . "

lily lied and said , " i do n't know . maybe you lost it . it 's not my car , so i do n't care . " she smiled and played with her dolls .

rose felt miserable . she did not have her car , and she did not have a friend . she cried and cried . she wished she had a nice sister who would share and play with her .

mom heard rose crying and came to see what was wrong . she saw lily playing with her dolls and rose sitting on the floor . she asked , " what 's going on , girls ? why is rose crying ? "

rose told mom what lily did . mom was very disappointed . she said , " lily , that was very mean and selfish of you . you made your sister suffer . how would you feel if someone took your dolls and lied to you ? "

lily felt ashamed . she realized she had hurt her sister . she said , " i 'm sorry , rose . i was wrong . i have your car under my bed . i will give it back to you . can you forgive me ? "

rose was happy to hear that . she said , " yes , i forgive you , lily . thank you for giving me back my car . can we play together ? "

lily nodded and hugged her sister . she said , " yes , we can play together . i 'm sorry i was not a good sister . i love you , rose . "

mom smiled and said , " i 'm glad you made up , girls . you are both very special and you should love and respect each other . sharing and being honest are important values . remember , sisters are friends for life . "

the end . ben and tom were brothers who liked to play cowboys and robbers . ben had a pistol that he got for his birthday . it was shiny and made a loud noise when he pulled the trigger . tom admired ben 's pistol and wanted to play with it too . but ben did not like to share his pistol . he said it was his and only his .

one day , ben and tom were playing in the backyard . ben was the cowboy and tom was the robber . ben chased tom with his pistol and pretended to shoot him . tom ran and hid behind a tree . he saw ben 's pistol on the ground . ben had dropped it when he tripped over a rock . tom thought this was his chance to play with the pistol . he ran and grabbed it before ben could see him .

ben got up and looked for his pistol . he saw tom holding it and pointing it at him . he was angry and scared . he yelled at tom to give it back . tom said no , he wanted to play with it . he pulled the trigger and made a loud noise . ben cried and ran to the house . he told their mom what tom did .

mom was not happy . she took the pistol from tom and scolded him . she said he should not take things that are not his . she said he could hurt someone with the pistol . she said he should say sorry to ben and share his toys . tom felt bad . he realized he was wrong . he went to ben and said sorry . he asked him if he could play with his pistol sometimes . ben nodded and hugged him . he said he would share his pistol with him . they went back to the backyard and played cowboys and robbers together . they had fun and forgot their fight . mom smiled and watched them . she was proud of her boys . ben and mia were playing in the garden after dinner . they liked to look at the sky and see the stars and the moon . the moon was big and bright and round .

" look , mia , the moon is like a big ball ! " ben said .

" yes , ben , it is . do you want to play with it ? " mia asked .

" how can we play with the moon ? it is too far away ! " ben said .

mia had an idea . she ran to the shed and got a bucket and a hose . she brought them to the garden and turned on the water .

" watch this , ben ! " mia said . she pointed the hose at the bucket and filled it with water . then she lifted the bucket and tilted it towards the moon .

" see , ben , i can fill the moon with water ! " mia said .

ben laughed . he saw the water splash out of the bucket and make a rainbow in the air . the moon looked like it had a green ring around it .

" that 's funny , mia ! you made a green moon ! " ben said .

they took turns filling the bucket and splashing the water at the moon . they had fun until their mom called them inside .

" time for bed , kids ! say goodnight to the moon ! " mom said .

" goodnight , moon ! goodnight , green moon ! " ben and mia said . they hugged each other and went to bed . they dreamed of playing with the moon again . sara and ben are playing in their room . they have many toys and books . sara likes to dress up her dolls . ben likes to build with blocks . they are happy and quiet .

but then , sara hears a loud noise . she looks at ben . he is sneezing . he sneezes again and again . he has a cold . his nose is red and runny . sara is scared . she does not want to get sick . she says to ben , " go away ! you are noisy and you make me sick ! "

ben is sad and angry . he does not want to go away . he likes to play with sara . he says to sara , " no , you go away ! you are mean and you make me cry ! "

they start to fight . they push and pull each other . they knock over their toys and books . they make a big mess .

mom hears the noise . she comes to their room . she sees sara and ben fighting . she sees the mess . she is not happy . she says to sara and ben , " stop ! what are you doing ? why are you fighting ? "

sara and ben stop fighting . they look at mom . they feel sorry . they say to mom , " we are sorry , mom . we were playing , but then ben sneezed and sara got scared and we got mad . "

mom hugs sara and ben . she says to them , " i understand . but you should not fight . you should be kind and help each other . ben , you need to rest and drink some water . sara , you need to wash your hands and be gentle . you are brother and sister . you should love each other . "

sara and ben nod . they say to mom , " we love you , mom . we love each other . we will be kind and help each other . "

mom smiles . she says to sara and ben , " that 's good . now , let 's clean up this mess . and then , we can read a story together . "

sara and ben help mom clean up their room . they put their toys and books in the drawer . they make their bed . they are happy and quiet .

mom reads them a story . they listen and laugh . they snuggle and hug . they are happy and quiet . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big bird in the park . it has a long neck and long legs . it is an ostrich .

" wow , look at that bird ! " anna says . " it is so big and fast ! "

" can we pet it ? " ben asks .

they run to the ostrich . the ostrich sees them and runs away . it is scared of the children .

" come back , bird ! " anna and ben shout . " we want to be your friends ! "

they chase the ostrich . the ostrich runs faster . it reaches the fence of the park . it tries to jump over the fence . but the fence is too high . the ostrich gets stuck on the fence . it cries out loud .

" oh no , the bird is hurt ! " anna says . " we have to help it ! "

they run to the fence . they see the ostrich 's feathers are torn . they see blood on the fence . they feel sorry for the ostrich .

" sorry , bird , we did not mean to scare you , " ben says . " we just wanted to play with you . "

they try to pull the ostrich off the fence . but the ostrich is too heavy . they can not move it .

" what can we do ? " anna asks .

they look around . they see a mail truck . it has a big box on the back . they have an idea .

" maybe we can mail the bird to the zoo , " ben says . " the zoo can take care of the bird . "

they run to the mail truck . they ask the mailman for help .

" please , mister , can you help us ? " anna says . " there is a big bird on the fence . it is hurt . can you mail it to the zoo ? "

the mailman is surprised . he looks at the ostrich . he sees it is in pain . he feels sorry for the ostrich .

" ok , kids , i will help you , " the mailman says . " but we have to be careful . the bird is delicate . we have to be gentle . "

he gets a big blanket . he wraps the ostrich in the blanket . he lifts the ostrich off the fence . he puts the ostrich in the box . he closes the box . he writes " to the zoo " on the box .

" thank you , mister , you are very kind , " anna and ben say .

" you 're welcome , kids , you are very brave , " the mailman says . " now , let 's go to the zoo . the bird will be happy there . "

they get in the mail truck . they drive to the zoo . they give the box to the zookeeper . the zookeeper opens the box . he sees the ostrich . he smiles .

" hello , little ostrich , welcome to the zoo , " the zookeeper says . " do n't worry , we will take good care of you . "

the ostrich feels better . it sees other ostriches . it makes new friends .

anna and ben are happy . they wave goodbye to the ostrich .

" bye , bird , we hope you like your new home , " anna and ben say .

" thank you , kids , you saved my life , " the ostrich says .

the end . sam liked to ride his rug . he pretended it was a big horse or a fast car . he made noises and moved the rug around the room . he had fun with his rug .

but his sister jen did not like his rug . she wanted to play with her dolls on the rug . she said the rug was hers and sam had to share . she tried to take the rug from sam . they fought over the rug .

mom heard them and came to see what was wrong . she saw them pulling and pushing the rug . she was angry and said they had to stop . she said they had to be nice and take turns . she said they had to put the rug away and play with something else .

sam and jen did not listen to mom . they wanted the rug for themselves . they kept fighting and did not hear mom . they did not see the dog come in . the dog was alert and saw the rug . he thought it was a toy . he jumped on the rug and bit it . he tore the rug with his teeth . he made a big hole in the rug .

mom saw the dog and the rug . she was very angry and sad . she yelled at sam and jen and the dog . she said they had ruined the rug . she said they had to go to their rooms and think about what they had done . she said they had no more rug to play with . she took the rug and threw it in the trash .

sam and jen and the dog felt bad . they had lost their rug and made mom mad . they wished they had listened to mom and shared the rug . they wished they had not fought over the rug . they wished they had a new rug to ride . lily and ben love to act . they like to pretend they are different people and animals . they have a big box of costumes and toys . they can be pirates , princesses , lions , or anything they want .

one day , they decide to act a story for their mom and dad . they pick a story they know well : the three little pigs . lily is the big bad wolf and ben is the third pig . they put on their costumes and find a cardboard house . they are ready to be stars .

they go to the living room and call their mom and dad . " come and see our show ! " they say . mom and dad sit on the couch and clap their hands . lily and ben start to act .

" little pig , little pig , let me in ! " lily says in a deep voice . she knocks on the cardboard house .

" not by the hair of my chinny chin chin ! " ben says in a high voice . he shakes his head .

" then i 'll huff and i 'll puff and i 'll blow your house down ! " lily says . she blows hard and the cardboard house falls down . ben runs to the couch and hides behind mom and dad .

lily and ben laugh and bow . mom and dad clap and cheer . they hug and kiss their children . " you are very good actors ! " they say . " you are our stars ! " lily and ben are playing in the park . they see a big slide that is made of wood . they want to go on the slide , but there is a line of other kids waiting .

" can we go on the slide , please ? " lily asks her mom .

" sure , but you have to wait your turn , " her mom says .

lily and ben wait and wait . they are bored and tired . they see a wide path that leads to the woods . they think it looks fun and exciting .

" let 's go see what 's in the woods , " ben says to lily .

" ok , but do n't go too far , " lily says .

they sneak away from the line and rush to the path . they run and run until they reach the woods . they see trees and flowers and birds and bugs . they hear noises and smells and colors . they are happy and curious .

" look , a squirrel ! " lily says , pointing to a furry animal .

" wow , a mushroom ! " ben says , picking up a red and white fungus .

they explore and collect and play . they forget about the slide and their mom . they are having too much fun .

but then , they hear a loud voice .

" lily ! ben ! where are you ? " their mom calls .

they look at each other and feel scared . they realize they are lost and alone . they drop their things and run back to the path . they hope their mom will find them . they are sorry and sad .

they see their mom waiting for them at the end of the path . she looks angry and worried . she hugs them and scolds them .

" where have you been ? i was looking for you everywhere . you ca n't just run away like that . you could have gotten hurt or lost . you have to listen to me and stay with me . do you understand ? " she says .

lily and ben nod and say sorry . they promise to never do it again . they hug their mom and say they love her . she smiles and says she loves them too .

they go back to the slide , but the line is gone . the slide is empty and closed . they missed their turn . they feel sad and disappointed .

" maybe next time , " their mom says .

they nod and hope so . they learned their lesson . they walk home with their mom , holding her hand . they are safe and sorry . lily and max are twins . they like to play outside with their toys . lily has a doll and max has a motorcycle . they make noises and pretend to go on adventures .

one day , they see a big puddle of mud . max thinks it is fun to drive his motorcycle in the puddle . he splashes mud everywhere . lily does not like the mud . she says , " max , stop ! you are making a mess . you are careless . "

max does not listen . he says , " lily , do n't be silly . it is just mud . it is fun . come and join me . " he drives his motorcycle faster and faster in the puddle . he does not see the rock in the mud . he hits the rock and falls off his motorcycle . he hurts his knee and cries .

lily runs to him and helps him up . she says , " max , are you okay ? i told you to be careful . you need to bathe your knee . it is dirty and it might get sick . " she takes him inside the house and washes his knee with water and soap . she puts a bandage on it and gives him a hug .

max says , " thank you , lily . you are a good sister . i am sorry i was careless . i will not drive my motorcycle in the mud again . i will play with you and your doll . " lily smiles and says , " that 's okay , max . i forgive you . i love you . " they hug and play together . tom and lily were best friends . they liked to play in the park every day . they had a loyal dog named spot who followed them everywhere .

one day , they saw a big slide in the park . tom wanted to try it , but lily was scared . " it is too high , " she said . " i do n't want to go . "

tom held lily 's arm and said , " do n't worry , i will lead you . i will go first and then you can come after me . spot will wait for us at the bottom . it will be fun , i promise . "

lily nodded and let tom lead her to the slide . tom climbed up the ladder and slid down with a whoop . he looked up and waved at lily . " come on , lily , you can do it ! "

lily took a deep breath and climbed up the ladder . she sat on the slide and looked down . she felt nervous , but she saw tom and spot smiling at her . she slid down and felt the wind in her hair . she landed on the ground and hugged tom and spot . " that was fun ! " she said . " thank you for leading me , tom . you are a good friend . "

tom smiled and said , " you are welcome , lily . you are a brave friend . let 's do it again ! " they ran back to the slide and had more fun . they were happy and loyal friends . lily liked to help her mom in the kitchen . she liked to wash the dishes , the spoons , and the cups . but her favorite thing to wash was the eggs . mom said eggs were very special and needed to be washed gently and carefully .

one day , mom gave lily a big basket of eggs to wash . she said they were from the farm and they had different colors and shapes . lily was very excited . she took the basket to the sink and started to wash the eggs one by one . she saw brown eggs , white eggs , speckled eggs , and even a blue egg .

lily was washing the blue egg when she heard a tiny crack . she looked at the egg and saw a small hole . she was scared . she thought she broke the egg . she wanted to cry . but then , she saw something move inside the hole . she saw a yellow beak and two black eyes . she heard a soft peep .

lily was amazed . she realized the blue egg was not an egg , but a baby bird . she gently lifted the egg and watched the bird come out of its shell . it was a fluffy chick with blue feathers . it looked at lily and peeped again .

mom came to the sink and saw lily holding the chick . she smiled and hugged lily . she said lily had done an impressive job washing the eggs . she said the blue egg was a special gift from the farm . she said the chick was a rare breed of bird and needed a lot of love and care . she said lily could keep the chick as a pet and name it whatever she wanted .

lily was very happy . she thanked mom and kissed the chick . she decided to name it bluey . she said bluey was her new best friend . she said she loved washing eggs . tim and sam are friends . they like to play with their toys . tim has a motorcycle . sam has a truck . they make noises and zoom around the room .

one day , tim says , " let 's play serve . you be the waiter and i be the customer . you bring me food and i pay you . "

sam nods . he likes to play serve . he goes to the kitchen and gets a plate and a spoon . he pretends to put food on the plate . he walks back to the room and says , " here you go , sir . your food is ready . "

tim looks at the plate and frowns . he says , " this is not food . this is nothing . i want real food . give me something else . "

sam feels sad . he says , " but this is pretend . we are playing . you have to use your imagination . "

tim shakes his head . he says , " no , i do n't . i want real food . and i want your motorcycle . give it to me or i wo n't pay you . "

sam feels angry . he says , " no , you ca n't have my motorcycle . it 's mine . you are being mean . you are not a good customer . "

tim gets up and tries to grab the motorcycle . sam holds on to it . they pull and tug . they yell and cry .

mom hears the noise and comes to the room . she sees the boys fighting . she feels fearful . she says , " stop it , both of you . what is going on here ? "

tim and sam stop and look at mom . they feel ashamed . they tell mom what happened . mom says , " that 's not how you play . you have to share and be nice . you have to respect each other 's toys . you have to use your words , not your hands . say sorry to each other and hug . "

tim and sam say sorry and hug . they feel better . they decide to play something else . they say , " we are sorry , mom . we love you . "

mom smiles and says , " i love you too . now , how about some real food ? i can serve you some cookies and milk . "

tim and sam say , " yes , please . thank you , mom . "

they go to the kitchen and eat the cookies and drink the milk . they talk and laugh . they are friends again . tim and sam are friends . they like to play outside . one day , they find a hose in the yard . they turn on the water and spray each other . they laugh and have fun .

but then , a big dog comes . the dog is angry . the dog does not like water . the dog barks and runs at tim and sam . tim and sam are scared . they try to run away .

the dog is faster . the dog bites tim on the leg . tim cries and bleeds . sam tries to help tim . he yells for help . but no one hears him . the dog is deaf . the dog does not hear sam .

the dog bites sam on the arm . sam cries and bleeds too . tim and sam are hurt . they are alone . they are sad . they learn that playing with the hose is not safe . they learn that the dog is bad . they learn that no one can help them . the end . tim and mia are friends . they like to draw with crayons on paper . they have many colors of crayons . they draw cars , flowers , animals and more .

one day , tim wants to draw a big sun . he picks a yellow crayon and starts to draw . but he makes a mistake . he draws the sun too big and it covers his car . he is sad . he wants to fix his drawing .

he looks for an eraser . he sees one on mia 's desk . he runs to mia and says , " mia , can i have your eraser , please ? i need to erase my sun . it is too big . "

mia is drawing a butterfly . she likes her eraser . it is pink and soft . she does not want to give it to tim . she says , " no , tim . this is my eraser . you can not have it . find your own eraser . "

tim is angry . he says , " but i need it now . please , mia . give me your eraser . i will give it back to you soon . "

mia shakes her head . she says , " no , tim . go away . leave me alone . "

tim is very angry . he grabs mia 's eraser from her desk . he runs away fast . he erases his sun . he is happy .

mia is very angry . she sees tim take her eraser . she screams , " tim , give me back my eraser . that is not nice . that is mine . "

she runs after tim . she tries to catch him . but tim is fast . he runs away from mia . he does not want to give back her eraser .

they run and run . they make a lot of noise . they do not see their teacher . she is coming to their room . she is not happy . she hears them scream and run . she says , " tim , mia , stop . what are you doing ? why are you fighting ? " lily loved animals . she wanted to be a veterinarian when she grew up . she liked to play with her stuffed animals and pretend they were sick . she had a toy doctor kit and a book about animals . she was very organized . she had a plan for each animal .

one day , she decided to play veterinarian with her real pets . she had a dog , a cat , and a hamster . she took them to her room and locked the door . she put them on her bed and opened her doctor kit . she said , " do n't worry , i will make you all better . "

she looked at her book and saw a picture of a dog with a bandage . she thought her dog had a hurt paw . she took a scissors and cut some of his fur . then she wrapped a tape around his paw . the dog yelped and tried to get away . lily said , " shh , it 's okay , i 'm helping you . "

she looked at her book again and saw a picture of a cat with a cone . she thought her cat had a scratch on her ear . she took a marker and drew a red line on her ear . then she put a plastic cup over her head . the cat hissed and scratched her . lily said , " stop , it 's okay , i 'm helping you . "

she looked at her book one more time and saw a picture of a hamster with a syringe . she thought her hamster needed a shot . she took a needle and tried to poke him . the hamster bit her and ran away . lily said , " ow , it 's okay , i 'm helping you . "

but her pets were not okay . they were scared and hurt . they made a lot of noise . lily 's mom heard them and came to her room . she saw what lily had done and was very angry . she said , " lily , what have you done ? you are not a veterinarian , you are a bad girl . you hurt your pets . they need a real veterinarian now . you are in big trouble . "

lily cried and said , " but i had a plan . i wanted to help them . i 'm sorry . "

but it was too late . her mom took her pets to the real veterinarian . she had to pay a lot of money . she had to throw away lily 's doctor kit and book . she had to ground lily for a long time . lily was very sad . she learned a hard lesson . she realized that playing veterinarian was not a good plan . sam was a regular boy who liked to play with his toys . he had a lot of cars , trucks , and trains , but his favorite toy was a red horn . he liked to blow the horn and make loud noises . he thought it was fun and funny .

one day , sam went to the park with his mom and his horn . he saw some other kids playing on the swings , the slide , and the sandbox . he wanted to join them , but he was shy . he did not know how to make friends . he thought maybe his horn could help him .

he ran to the swings and blew his horn as loud as he could . the other kids looked at him and frowned . they did not like the noise . they told him to go away . sam felt sad and ran to the slide . he blew his horn again , hoping to make them laugh . but they did not laugh . they got angry and told him to stop . sam felt sadder and ran to the sandbox . he blew his horn one more time , wishing to make them like him . but they did not like him . they threw sand at him and told him to leave . sam felt very sad and ran to his mom .

his mom saw him crying and hugged him . she asked him what was wrong . sam told her that he wanted to play with the other kids , but they did not like his horn . they did not want to be his friends . his mom said , " i 'm sorry , sam . i know you love your horn , but not everyone likes loud noises . maybe you should try something else to make friends . do you know what i recommend ? "

sam shook his head . he did not know what to do . his mom said , " i recommend that you use your words . words are better than horns . words can say hello , how are you , what is your name , do you want to play . words can be kind , polite , and friendly . words can make friends . why do n't you try that ? "

sam nodded . he wiped his tears and put his horn away . he took a deep breath and walked to the swings . he saw a girl with a yellow dress and a blue hat . he said , " hello , i 'm sam . what is your name ? " the girl smiled and said , " i 'm lily . nice to meet you , sam . " sam smiled back and said , " do you want to play ? " lily said , " sure , let 's play . " they played on the swings , the slide , and the sandbox . they had fun and laughed . they became friends .

sam was happy . he learned that words were better than horns . he thanked his mom for her recommendation . he still liked his horn , but he only used it at home . he used his words at the park . he made more friends and had more fun . he was a regular boy who liked to play with his toys and his friends . tom and lily liked to play with their toys in the garden . they had a big box of toys , with cars , dolls , animals , and a boat . one day , they found a new toy in the box . it was a small fisherman , with a hat , a coat , and a fishing rod . he looked very serious .

" let 's play with him ! " said lily . " he can catch fish in the pond ! "

" ok ! " said tom . " but be careful . he is very small . we do n't want to lose him . "

they took the fisherman and the boat to the pond . they put him in the boat and pushed it into the water . the fisherman held his fishing rod and waited for a fish .

" look , he is fishing ! " said lily . " he is so cute ! "

but then , something strange happened . the fisherman started to shrink . he became smaller and smaller , until he was as tiny as a bug . the boat was too big for him . he fell into the water and disappeared .

" where did he go ? " said tom . " he shrank ! "

" oh no ! " said lily . " he is gone ! maybe a fish ate him ! "

they ran to the pond and looked for the fisherman . but they could not see him . he was too small .

they were very sad . they had lost their new toy .

they did not know that the fisherman was a magic toy . he had a secret . he could shrink and grow . he did not like to be played with . he wanted to be free . he shrank on purpose , to escape from the children . he swam to the other side of the pond , where he found a small hole . he crawled into the hole and grew back to his normal size . he was happy . he had found a new home . he decided to stay there and fish in peace . he never saw tom and lily again . lily and tom were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . they saw a large dog with a man . the dog had a badge on its collar . the man wore a blue shirt and a hat .

" look , tom , a police dog ! " lily said . " i want to pet it . what is its name ? "

" i do n't know , lily . maybe we should ask the man first , " tom said . he was a little scared of the large dog .

lily ran to the man and the dog . she reached out her hand to touch the dog 's fur . the dog barked loudly . the man said , " stop ! do n't touch the dog . he is working . he is not a toy . "

lily was surprised and sad . she did not mean to make the dog angry . she said , " i 'm sorry , sir . i just wanted to say hello . what is his name ? "

the man looked at lily and saw that she was not bad . he said , " his name is rex . he is a police dog . he helps me find bad people and things . he is very smart and brave . but he is also very serious . he does not like strangers to touch him . he might think you are a threat . "

lily nodded . she understood . she said , " i 'm sorry , rex . you are a good dog . i respect you . can i give you a treat ? "

the man smiled . he said , " that is very nice of you , lily . yes , you can give him a treat . but only if you ask him first . say , ' rex , sit . ' "

lily did as the man said . she said , " rex , sit . " the dog obeyed . he sat down and looked at lily . lily took a treat from the man and gave it to rex . rex ate it and wagged his tail . he licked lily 's hand .

lily was happy . she said , " thank you , rex . thank you , sir . you are both very cool . can i be your friend ? "

the man and the dog nodded . they said , " yes , you can be our friend . but remember , always ask before you pet a police dog . they have a very important job to do . "

lily and tom learned a new thing that day . they said goodbye to the man and the dog . they went back to playing in the park . they had a lot of fun . lily liked to play in the garden . she liked to look at the flowers and the bugs . one day , she saw a lizard on a rock . it was green and had a long tail . lily wanted to touch it .

she went closer to the lizard . it did not move . lily reached out her hand . the lizard opened its mouth . it had sharp teeth . lily was scared . she thought the lizard was dangerous . she ran away .

she ran to her mom . her mom was sitting on a chair . she had a book . lily hugged her mom . she told her about the lizard . her mom listened . she said , " the lizard was not dangerous . it was just scared of you . it wanted to protect itself . you should not touch wild animals . they might bite you . "

lily nodded . she felt better . her mom comforted her . she kissed her on the head . she said , " you are brave and curious . but you have to be careful . next time , you can look at the lizard from far away . or you can read a book about lizards . they are very interesting . "

lily smiled . she liked books . she said , " ok , mom . can we read a book about lizards now ? " her mom said , " sure , honey . let 's go inside and find one . " they went inside . they read a book about lizards . lily learned a lot . she was not scared of lizards anymore . she was fascinated . lily and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big orange cat . the cat is sitting on a bench . lily and tom want to talk to the cat .

they go to the bench and say hello to the cat . the cat looks at them and meows . lily and tom think the cat is talking to them . they ask the cat its name and what it likes to do . the cat meows again and again .

lily and tom do not understand the cat . they try to make the same sound as the cat . they meow and meow . the cat looks at them and purrs . lily and tom think the cat is happy . they smile and pet the cat .

a lady comes to the bench . she is the cat 's owner . she says sorry to lily and tom . she says the cat is not talking , it is just making noise . she says the cat 's name is pumpkin and it likes to sleep and eat . she says thank you to lily and tom for being nice to pumpkin .

lily and tom say goodbye to pumpkin and the lady . they go to play on the swings . they still think pumpkin is a talking cat . they like pumpkin 's orange fur and meow . they say they want to see pumpkin again . they are happy . lily and anna are sisters . they like to play with dolls and dress them up . lily has a pink doll and anna has a blue doll . they are very happy .

one day , they go to the park with mommy . they bring their dolls with them . they see a big slide and run to it . they are enthusiastic . they want to slide down fast .

lily goes first . she holds her pink doll and slides down . whee ! she laughs . anna goes next . she holds her blue doll and slides down . whee ! she laughs too .

but then , a big boy comes . he sees the dolls and grabs them . he says , " these are mine now . they are cool . you ca n't have them . "

lily and anna are sad and angry . they say , " no ! these are ours . they belong to us . give them back ! "

the big boy says , " no . they are mine . go away . "

lily and anna cry . they want their dolls . they look at mommy . mommy sees what is happening . she walks to the big boy and says , " hey , you . these dolls are not yours . they are lily 's and anna 's . they love them very much . you have to give them back . now . "

the big boy is scared of mommy . he says , " sorry . here . " he gives the dolls back to lily and anna .

lily and anna hug their dolls . they say , " thank you , mommy . you are the best . "

mommy says , " you 're welcome , my sweeties . now , let 's go and play somewhere else . and be nice to others . "

lily and anna nod . they hold mommy 's hand and walk away . they are happy again . they are sisters . they belong together . anna and ben like to play with yarn . they have many colors of yarn : red , blue , yellow , green , and more . they like to make things with yarn , like hats , scarves , and dolls .

one day , they decide to try something new . they want to mix the yarn colors and make a rainbow . they take a big bowl and put some yarn in it . then they use a spoon to mix the yarn .

" look , anna , i am mixing red and yellow . what color do i get ? " ben asks .

" you get orange , ben . orange is a pretty color . can i mix blue and yellow ? " anna says .

" sure , anna . you can mix blue and yellow . what color do you get ? " ben says .

" i get green , ben . green is a nice color . can we mix more colors ? " anna says .

" yes , anna . we can mix more colors . let 's see what we get . " ben says .

they keep mixing the yarn colors until they have a big pile of rainbow yarn . they are very happy with their work . they think they are successful .

" wow , anna , we made a rainbow . it is so beautiful . we are very good at mixing yarn . " ben says .

" yes , ben , we are . we are very creative . we can make anything with yarn . " anna says .

they hug each other and smile . they love playing with yarn . they love mixing colors . they love making rainbows . sara likes to imagine . she imagines she is a princess in a big castle . she imagines she has a horse and a crown and a dress . she imagines she has a friend who is a dragon . the dragon is big and green and can fly and breathe fire .

one day , sara goes to the park with her mom . she sees a big pile of dirt and sand . she thinks it looks like a castle . she runs to the pile and starts to dig and build . she makes a tower and a gate and a wall . she imagines her dragon friend is there with her . she pretends to ride on his back and fly over the park .

but then , a boy comes to the pile . he has a shovel and a bucket . he wants to play too . he says , " can i join you ? " sara looks at him . he is dirty and has a runny nose . she does not want to share her castle . she says , " no , this is my castle . go away ! " the boy looks sad . he says , " but i want to be your friend . i like dragons too . " sara shakes her head . she says , " you are too dirty . you ca n't be my friend . you ca n't play with my dragon . "

the boy walks away . he feels lonely . he sits on a bench and watches sara . sara plays by herself . she imagines her dragon friend is happy . but he is not . he is sad too . he thinks sara is mean . he thinks the boy is nice . he wishes sara would share her castle . he wishes sara would make a new friend . he wishes sara would not be so dirty . he wishes sara would be more kind . sara and ben were playing in the park . they liked to swing , slide and run . sara saw a big tree with many leaves . she wanted to climb it .

" look , ben , i can go up the tree ! " she said .

ben was scared . he did not like to climb . he thought he might fall and feel pain .

" sara , be careful ! the tree is too high ! " he said .

sara did not listen . she was brave and curious . she climbed higher and higher . she felt happy and free .

" wow , i can see everything from here ! " she said .

but then , she heard a loud noise . it was a big dog . it was barking and running towards the tree . it wanted to catch sara .

" sara , come down ! the dog is angry ! " ben shouted .

sara was afraid . she tried to climb down , but she slipped . she fell from the tree . she landed on the grass . she felt pain in her arm and leg .

" ow , ow , ow ! " she cried .

ben ran to her . he hugged her and said sorry .

" sara , are you okay ? i 'm sorry i did not help you , " he said .

sara looked at him . she saw that he was worried and kind . she smiled and said thank you .

" ben , i 'm okay . you are a good friend . thank you for being here , " she said .

they heard a voice . it was sara 's mom . she had seen what happened . she came to help sara .

" sara , what did you do ? you are hurt . let me see , " she said .

she checked sara 's arm and leg . she saw that they were not broken , but they had scratches and bruises . she cleaned them and put bandages on them .

" sara , you were very brave , but also very silly . you should not climb so high . you could have been hurt worse . next time , listen to ben . he was right to be careful , " she said .

sara nodded . she knew her mom was right . she felt sorry for being naughty .

" mom , i 'm sorry . i wanted to see the tree . i did not think of the dog . i will listen to ben next time , " she said .

her mom hugged her and kissed her . she said she loved her .

" i love you , sara . you are my graceful girl . but please , be more safe , " she said .

sara and ben smiled . they were happy to have each other . they learned a lesson . they decided to play something else . they went to the sandbox and made a castle . they had fun and forgot the pain . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to run , jump and slide . they were very happy .

but then they felt very hot and thirsty . they looked for some water to drink , but they could not find any . the sun was very bright and there was no shade .

" where can we find some water ? " lily asked tom .

tom looked up at the sky . he saw some white clouds . he had an idea .

" maybe we can drink from the clouds ! " he said . " they look like water . "

lily nodded . she thought it was a good idea . they ran to the big hill and climbed to the top . they hoped they could reach the clouds .

but when they got to the top , they saw something strange . the clouds were not white anymore . they were red !

" what happened to the clouds ? " lily wondered .

tom pointed to a big plane . the plane was flying in the sky and making red smoke . the smoke was coloring the clouds .

" that plane is making the clouds red ! " he said . " it is not water . it is smoke . "

lily felt sad . she wanted to drink water , not smoke .

" let 's go back , " she said . " maybe we can find some water in the park . "

tom agreed . they went down the hill and ran back to the park . they saw a fountain with clear water . they were very happy .

they drank some water from the fountain . they felt cool and refreshed .

they smiled at each other and continued to play . they forgot about the red clouds . lily and ben like to create things with their toys . they have many animals , cars , blocks and dolls . one day , they decide to create a zoo in their room . they put the animals in different places and make sounds for them .

" look , this is the lion cage . roar ! " lily says , holding a yellow toy lion .

" and this is the elephant area . prrr ! " ben says , lifting a gray toy elephant with his trunk .

they have fun creating the zoo and pretending to be zookeepers . they feed the animals , clean their cages and talk to them .

but then , they hear a knock on the door . it is their mom . she opens the door and sees the mess in their room . she is not happy .

" what is this ? what did you create ? " she asks , looking at the toys everywhere .

" it 's a zoo , mom . we made it with our toys . do you like it ? " lily and ben say , smiling .

" a zoo ? it looks more like a mess . and some of these animals are very ugly . look at this monkey . it has no tail and one eye . and this giraffe . it has spots of different colors and a short neck . where did you get these toys ? " mom says , picking up some of the animals .

" we made them , mom . we used scissors , glue and paint . we wanted to make them different and funny . we like them . they are our ugly animals . " lily and ben say , proudly .

mom sighs . she knows they are creative , but she also wants them to be tidy and careful . she tells them to clean up their room and put away their toys . she also tells them to be more careful with their scissors , glue and paint . she says they can keep their ugly animals , but they have to take good care of them .

lily and ben agree . they love their mom and their zoo . they clean up their room and put their animals in a box . they say goodbye to them and promise to play with them again soon . they hug their mom and say sorry for the mess . mom hugs them back and says she loves them . she says they are very creative , but they also have to be responsible . she says she is proud of them . they smile and say thank you . they are happy . lily liked to record her voice with her toy phone . she would say funny things and then listen to them . she thought it was a smart game . she wanted to show her big brother tom how she could record .

one morning , she saw tom eating cereal in the kitchen . she had an idea . she sneaked behind him and pressed the record button on her phone . she said , " tom is a silly monkey who likes to eat bananas . " then she ran away , giggling .

tom heard her voice and turned around . he saw her phone on the table . he was angry . he did not like to be called a silly monkey . he grabbed her phone and chased after her . he wanted to make her say sorry .

lily ran to her room and locked the door . she was scared . she did not want tom to take her phone . she heard him banging on the door and shouting . she wished she had not recorded him .

then she had another idea . she pressed the play button on her phone . she heard her voice again , saying , " tom is a silly monkey who likes to eat bananas . " she laughed . she thought it was funny . she opened the door and showed tom her phone . she said , " look , tom , i recorded you . do you want to hear it ? "

tom saw her smile and heard her voice . he was not angry anymore . he thought it was funny too . he laughed . he said , " ok , lily , you are a smart girl who likes to record . but i am not a silly monkey who likes to eat bananas . i am a cool lion who likes to eat cereal . can i record you too ? "

lily nodded . she said , " yes , tom , you can record me too . but only if you share your cereal with me . "

tom agreed . he said , " deal . come on , lily , let 's go to the kitchen and record and eat cereal together . "

they went to the kitchen and played with the phone and ate cereal . they were happy . they were friends . sam and kim were friends . they liked to play with dolls and cars . they lived in a big nation with many people and places . one day , they heard a loud noise . it was a big plane . the plane dropped fire and smoke on their city . sam and kim were scared . they ran to their homes .

sam 's home was gone . the fire and smoke had burned it . sam cried . he looked for his mom and dad , but he could not find them . he was alone and hurt . he saw kim 's home . it was still there . he ran to kim 's home . he hoped kim was there .

kim 's home was there , but it was not safe . the fire and smoke had made it weak . kim was inside . she was hiding under a table . she heard sam 's voice . she was happy . she wanted to see sam . she wanted to comfort him . she crawled out from under the table . she called sam 's name .

but sam did not hear her . he was at the door . he pushed the door . the door was stuck . he pushed harder . the door opened . but then , the home fell down . it crashed on sam and kim . they were buried under the wood and bricks . they could not breathe . they could not move . they could not comfort each other . they died .

the big plane flew away . it had done its job . it had destroyed the city . it had killed many people . it had made the nation weak . the people in the plane were happy . they thought they were successful . they did not care about sam and kim . they did not care about the fire and smoke . they did not care about the hurt and pain . they only cared about winning . they were bad . lily and ben were friends . they liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big orange on a tree . they wanted to eat it .

" can we get the orange ? " lily asked ben .

" yes , we can . i have a stick . i can hit the orange and make it fall . " ben said .

he picked up a stick and threw it at the orange . but the stick missed the orange and hit a bird . the bird was angry . it flew down and pecked ben on the head .

" ow ! ow ! ow ! " ben cried . he ran away from the bird .

lily was scared . she did not want the bird to hurt ben . she cared for ben . she ran after him and hugged him .

" are you okay , ben ? " lily asked .

" yes , i am okay . thank you , lily . you are a good friend . " ben said .

they looked at the orange . it was still on the tree . they were confused .

" why did the bird do that ? " lily asked .

" i do n't know . maybe the bird likes the orange too . maybe the bird thinks we are bad . " ben said .

they decided to leave the orange alone . they went to play with other things . they were still friends . they were happy . tom and sam are friends . they like to play with toys . tom has a small helicopter . it can fly in the air . sam does not have a helicopter . he wants to play with tom 's helicopter .

" can i play with your helicopter , tom ? " sam asks .

" ok , but be careful . it is my favorite toy , " tom says .

sam takes the helicopter and goes outside . he makes it fly high and low . he has fun . but he forgets to be careful . he flies the helicopter too close to a tree . the helicopter hits a branch and falls down . it breaks into pieces .

" oh no ! what have i done ? " sam cries .

tom hears the noise and goes outside . he sees his broken helicopter . he is very sad and angry .

" sam , you broke my helicopter ! you did not listen to me ! you are a bad friend ! " tom shouts .

" i 'm sorry , tom . i did not mean to break it . i was having fun . please forgive me , " sam says .

tom thinks for a while . he remembers that sam is his friend . he knows that sam is sorry . he decides to forgive him .

" it 's ok , sam . i forgive you . but you have to be more careful next time . and you have to help me fix my helicopter , " tom says .

" thank you , tom . you are a good friend . i will help you fix it . and i will share my toys with you too , " sam says .

they hug and go inside . they look for glue and tape . they try to fix the helicopter . they learn to be careful and to share .

the end . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside in the grass and feel the sun on her face . one day , while she was playing , she found a shiny rock on the ground . it was a gift from the earth !

lily was so happy and felt gifted to have found such a pretty rock . but then she accidentally dropped it and it broke into pieces . she felt so sad that she began to weep .

her mommy came outside and saw that lily was crying . she asked what was wrong , and lily showed her the broken rock . mommy hugged her and said it was okay , that they could still keep the pieces and remember the special gift from the ground . and lily felt a little better , knowing that she still had a piece of the gift . once upon a time , there was a girl named lily . she was very wealthy and had many toys to play with . one day , while playing with her toys , she saw a bird that was hurt . the bird could n't fly and needed help .

lily wanted to help the bird , but she did n't know what to do . she asked her mom for help , but her mom was busy . so , lily decided to lay a blanket for the bird to rest on . she also gave the bird some food and water .

but then , lily 's cat came and tried to attack the bird . lily tried to stop the cat , but it was too fast . the bird flew away , and lily felt sad . she realized that sometimes , even when we try to help , things do n't always go as planned . but she was happy that she tried to help the bird . once upon a time , there was a hunter . he was very confused because he could n't find any animals to hunt . he walked and walked in the forest , but still no animals . suddenly , he saw a deer . the hunter wanted to catch the deer , so he bowed down and tried to sneak up on it . but the deer saw him and ran away . the hunter felt sad , but he knew he would find another animal someday . the end . once upon a time , there was a little bird who loved to fly . one day , while flying , the little bird saw a big tree with a broken branch . the little bird wanted to help , so it flew down to the ground to find something to repair the branch .

the little bird saw a stamp on the ground and thought it might help . so , the little bird picked up the stamp and flew back up to the broken branch . the little bird used the stamp to try and fix the branch , but it did n't work .

suddenly , a big storm came and the broken branch fell on the little bird . the little bird was not alert and did n't see it coming . the little bird was hurt and could n't fly anymore . the little bird wished it had been more careful and not tried to repair the branch with a stamp . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily who loved to explore . one day , she went on an adventure in the woods and found a big cave . the cave was dark and scary , but lily was brave and decided to go inside .

as she walked deeper into the cave , she saw something glowing . it was a purple crystal ! lily picked it up and held it in her hand . suddenly , she heard a voice . it was a bat who lived in the cave .

" hello , " the bat replied . " that crystal is very special . it can grant wishes . "

lily was amazed and wished for a big bowl of ice cream . the crystal glowed and suddenly , a bowl of ice cream appeared in front of her . lily was so happy and thanked the bat for his help . from that day on , lily visited the cave often and made many new friends . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved christmas very much and always wanted to see santa claus . one day , she saw a reindeer in her backyard . the reindeer looked curious and lily was very excited . she ran to her mom and dad to request if she could go and see the reindeer .

her parents said yes and they all went outside to see the reindeer . the reindeer was very friendly and lily was so happy to meet him . she asked the reindeer if he knew santa claus and the reindeer nodded his head . lily was so excited and she asked the reindeer if he could take her to see santa . the reindeer agreed and lily had the most magical christmas ever . once upon a time , there was a little boy named timmy . timmy had a toy car that he loved to play with , but one day it broke . timmy 's mom saw that he was sad and asked him what was wrong .

" my car is broken , mommy . can you fix it ? " timmy asked .

" i will try , but it might be difficult , " his mom replied .

