so they sat and watched the butterfly on the flower , and lily thought it was the most incredible thing she had ever seen . once upon a time , there was a kind and humble knight named jack . he had a big sword , but he never used it to hurt anyone . one day , while walking through the forest , he met a little girl named lily .

