the moral of the story is that it 's important to care about others and help them when they are sad . you do n't need a sword to be a hero , just a kind heart . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she had a green dress and loved to play outside . one day , she went for a walk with her mommy to see the sunset . her mommy said , " look lily , the sunset is so pretty ! "

