together , they played and pretended to fly the rocket to space . as they played , the sun began to set , and it started to get cold . tim and the cat decided to make a small fire to keep warm . they gathered sticks and leaves , and tim rubbed two sticks together until they started to burn . the fire kept them warm as they continued to play and talk about their adventures in space .

the end . once upon a time , there was a little girl named mia . mia had a big heart and loved to help others . she thought the world was an amazing place with so many fun things to do .

