he hugged lily and kissed her head . he looked at the sky . it was gray and cloudy . there was no sunset . there was no beauty . there was only sorrow . ben and mia were playing with their toys in the living room . they liked to build towers and bridges with the blocks and cars . they pretended they were in a big city with many people and noises .

