the big boy tried to grab the basket from lily . tom and spot tried to help her . they pulled and pushed and shouted . the basket swung from side to side . some apples fell out and rolled on the ground .

" stop it , " lily said . " you 're making a mess . go away . "

the big boy was stronger than them . he snatched the basket from lily and ran away . he laughed and said , " too bad for you . i have the basket now . you lose . "

lily , tom and spot were very sad and angry . they had lost their basket and their apples . they felt like crying .

but then , they heard a voice . it was their friend , anna . she had seen what happened . she was brave and smart . she had a plan .

" do n't worry , " she said . " i know how to get your basket back . follow me . "

she led them to a shortcut . they ran fast and caught up with the big boy . he was sitting under a tree , eating an apple . he did not see them coming .

anna threw a stick at him . it hit him on the head . he dropped the basket and said , " ow . who did that ? "

lily , tom and spot jumped out of the bushes . they grabbed the basket and ran away . they said , " ha ha . we have the basket now . you lose . "

the big boy was surprised and angry . he chased them , but he was too slow . they reached the playground and met their friends . they shared the apples and had a picnic . they thanked anna for her help . they were very happy and proud . they had got their basket back . they were brave . lily likes to write with her crayons . she writes her name , her mom 's name , and her cat 's name on a big paper . she is very happy .

but then she hears a loud noise outside . she looks out the window and sees a big dog . the dog is barking and running around . lily is scared . she does not like big dogs .

she runs to her mom and says , " mom , there is a big dog outside . he is scary . can we go away ? "

her mom hugs her and says , " do n't worry , lily . the dog is not here to hurt us . he is just lost . he is looking for his home . we can help him . "

her mom takes a piece of meat from the fridge and a box from the garage . she says , " we can make a trap for the dog . we can put the meat inside the box and leave it outside . when the dog smells the meat , he will go inside the box . then we can close the box and take him to the animal shelter . there they will find his owner or a new home . he will be safe and happy . "

lily thinks this is a good idea . she helps her mom to make the trap . she writes " dog " on the box with her crayon . she says , " maybe he can read . maybe he will know we are his friends . "

they put the trap outside and wait . soon they hear a thump . they look out the window and see the dog inside the box . he is wagging his tail and licking the meat . he is not barking anymore .

lily and her mom go outside and lift the box . the dog looks at them with big eyes . he is not scared anymore . he is thankful .

lily and her mom take the dog to the animal shelter . they say goodbye to him and hope he will find his home . they are proud of themselves . they are kind and brave . lily and ben were twins who liked to play outside . they had a big yard with a lot of grass and flowers . sometimes , they saw rare animals , like a rabbit or a bird , and they tried to be quiet and watch them .

one day , it rained a lot and the yard became muddy . lily and ben put on their boots and raincoats and went outside . they enjoyed jumping in the puddles and making splashes . they also enjoyed making mud pies and mud castles with their hands .

they saw a rare animal in the mud . it was a frog . it was green and slimy and had big eyes . it croaked and hopped . lily and ben wanted to catch it and play with it . they ran after it , but it was too fast . it jumped into a big puddle and disappeared .

lily and ben were sad . they wanted to see the frog again . they looked in the puddles , but they could not find it . they decided to go back to the house and have a snack . they took off their boots and raincoats and left them outside . they went inside and ate some cookies and milk .

they enjoyed their snack and told their mom about the frog . she said it was a rare animal and they were lucky to see it . she said maybe it would come back another day . lily and ben hoped so . they liked the frog and wanted to be its friend . they smiled and hugged their mom . they had a fun day . lily loved pastries . she liked to eat them for breakfast , lunch and snack . she did not like to share them with anyone . one day , she saw a big pastry in the kitchen . it was round and brown and had white cream on top . it looked yummy .

she wanted to eat the pastry , but it was not hers . it was for her mom 's birthday . her dad had made it and put it on the table . he told lily not to touch it . he said he would be back soon . lily did not listen . she climbed on a chair and reached for the pastry .

but the pastry was too heavy for her . it slipped from her hands and fell on the floor . it broke into pieces and made a big mess . lily was scared . she knew she had done a bad thing . she wanted to hide . she ran to her room and closed the door .

her dad came back and saw the pastry on the floor . he was angry and sad . he yelled , " who did this ? who ruined the pastry ? " he looked for lily . he found her in her room . he opened the door and saw her crying on her bed .

he asked her , " did you do this , lily ? did you take the pastry ? " lily nodded . she said , " i 'm sorry , dad . i wanted to eat the pastry . it looked yummy . i did not mean to break it . i was greedy and naughty . "

her dad hugged her and said , " i 'm glad you told me the truth , lily . but you should not have taken the pastry . it was not yours . it was for mom . she loves pastries too . and you made her sad . and you wasted the food . and you made a mess . that was not nice . you have to learn to share and respect other people 's things . do you understand ? "

lily said , " yes , dad . i understand . i 'm very sorry . i love you and mom . can i help you make another pastry ? " her dad smiled and said , " yes , you can . but first , you have to clean up the mess . and then , you have to say sorry to mom . and then , you have to promise me not to take things that are not yours again . can you do that ? "

lily said , " yes , dad . i can do that . i will do that . thank you for forgiving me , dad . " her dad kissed her and said , " you 're welcome , lily . i love you too . now , let 's go and make a new pastry . and maybe , we can share some with mom . what do you think ? "

lily said , " i think that 's a good idea , dad . i think mom will like that . and i think sharing is better than being greedy . i learned my lesson , dad . i will not be naughty again . " and they went to the kitchen and made a new pastry . and they shared it with mom . and they were happy .

the end . ben and mia are friends . they like to play with blocks and cars . one day , ben has a new toy . it is a robot that can talk and move . ben is very happy and enthusiastic . he wants to show mia his robot .

" look , mia , look at my robot ! " ben says . " it can say hello and dance and do tricks . do you want to play with it ? "

mia nods . she thinks the robot is cool and fun . she wants to learn how to make it do things . " can you teach me , ben ? " she asks .

ben smiles . he likes to teach mia . he is a good friend . he lets mia hold the remote control . he tells her what buttons to press . he watches as mia makes the robot say hello and dance and do tricks . he claps and cheers .

but then , something bad happens . mia presses a button that ben does not know . the robot makes a loud noise and starts to run . it runs out of the door and into the street . ben and mia chase after it . they are scared and worried . they do not see the big truck that is coming fast . the truck hits the robot and breaks it into pieces . ben and mia are very sad . they cry and hug each other .

" i 'm sorry , ben , i 'm sorry ! " mia says . " i did not mean to break your robot . i did not know what that button did . please forgive me . "

ben is angry and hurt . he does not want to forgive mia . he thinks she is a bad friend . he snatches the remote control from her . he says , " you are not my friend anymore . you are mean and careless . you ruined my robot . go away and leave me alone . "

mia is shocked and heartbroken . she does not understand why ben is so mad . she tries to say sorry again , but ben does not listen . he turns away and walks back to his house . he slams the door behind him . he does not want to see mia ever again .

mia is left alone in the street . she looks at the broken robot . she feels very sorry and very lonely . she wishes she could make things right . she wishes ben would be her friend again . she wishes she never pressed that button . she cries and cries . jenny loved to write in her diary every day . she wrote about her friends , her toys , her dreams and her secrets . she kept her diary under her pillow and never let anyone see it .

one day , her little brother tom found her diary and decided to play with it . he opened it and scribbled on the pages with his crayons . he tore some pages and threw them on the floor . he spilled his juice on the cover and made it sticky . he laughed and thought it was fun .

jenny came back from school and saw her diary on the floor . it was filthy and ruined . she screamed and cried . she picked it up and ran to her mom .

" mom , look what tom did ! he spoiled my diary ! he is so bad ! " she sobbed .

mom hugged jenny and said , " i 'm sorry , honey . tom is too young to understand . he did n't mean to hurt you . he was just curious . but he was wrong to touch your diary . it is yours and you have the right to keep it private . i will talk to him and make him apologize . and i will buy you a new diary , ok ? "

jenny nodded and wiped her tears . she was still sad , but she felt a little better . she hoped tom would say sorry and learn to respect her things . she also hoped her new diary would be as nice as her old one . she had many more things to write about . mira and ravi liked to play in the park . they liked to swing , slide and run . one day , they saw something shiny under a bench . they went to look . it was a copper coin .

" wow , look at this ! " mira said . " it is so shiny and pretty ! "

" can i see ? " ravi asked . he took the coin from mira and looked at it . he saw a picture of a man with a big hat and a beard .

" who is this ? " he asked .

" i do n't know , " mira said . " maybe he is a king or a hero . "

ravi liked the coin . he wanted to keep it . he put it in his pocket .

" hey , give it back ! " mira said . " we found it together . it is ours , not yours ! "

" no , it is mine ! " ravi said . " i like it more . it is shiny and pretty ! "

mira and ravi started to fight . they pulled and pushed each other . they shouted and cried . they forgot to have fun .

a man saw them . he was old and kind . he had a humble smile . he came to them .

" what is the matter , children ? " he asked .

" they are fighting over a coin , " a woman said . she was sitting on the bench . she had seen everything .

the man looked at the coin . he knew who it was . it was not a king or a hero . it was a man who had done bad things . he had hurt many people . he had made many coins with his picture . he had wanted to be rich and powerful . but he was not happy . he was lonely and sad .

the man told mira and ravi the story of the coin . he told them that the coin was not worth fighting over . he told them that the coin was not shiny and pretty . he told them that the coin was dirty and ugly .

mira and ravi listened . they felt sorry . they stopped fighting . they gave the coin to the man .

" thank you , sir , " they said . " we are sorry for being mean . we do n't want the coin . we want to be friends . "

the man smiled . he was happy . he gave the coin back to them .

" here , you can have it , " he said . " but do n't fight over it . do n't let it make you greedy or angry . use it to do something good . use it to buy a toy or a candy . use it to share or to help . use it to make someone happy . that is the best way to make it shine . "

mira and ravi nodded . they thanked the man . they hugged each other . they decided to buy a balloon with the coin . they decided to give it to a little girl who had no toys . they decided to make her smile .

they ran to the balloon seller . they bought a balloon . it was red and round . it was shiny and pretty . they gave it to the little girl . she smiled . she was happy .

mira and ravi were happy too . they had learned a lesson . they had made a friend . they had made the coin shine . lily was waiting for her mom to come home . she was playing with her dolls on the floor . she liked to make them talk and hug . she heard a car stop outside . she ran to the window and saw her mom 's car . she was so happy !

she opened the door and shouted , " mom , mom , i missed you ! " her mom smiled and got out of the car . she had a big bag in her hand . she walked to the door and hugged lily . she said , " i missed you too , my sweet girl . how was your day ? "

lily told her mom about her dolls , her snack , and her nap . she asked her mom , " what is in the bag ? " her mom said , " it is a surprise for you . do you want to see ? " lily nodded and clapped her hands . her mom opened the bag and took out a soft , fluffy toy . it was a bunny with long ears and a pink nose .

lily gasped and said , " a bunny ! it is so cute ! can i have it ? " her mom said , " of course , it is yours . i saw it at the store and i thought of you . you love bunnies , right ? " lily said , " yes , i do . thank you , mom . you are the best ! " she took the bunny and hugged it . it felt gentle and warm .

her mom said , " you are welcome , my love . i am glad you like it . what will you name it ? " lily thought for a moment and said , " i will name it rosie . because it has a pink nose like a rose . " her mom said , " that is a lovely name . rosie is lucky to have you as a friend . " lily said , " and i am lucky to have you as a mom . " they hugged again and went inside . lily showed rosie to her dolls and they all played together . lily was very happy . sara is a dancer . she likes to dance with her friends . they wear colorful dresses and shoes . they dance to music and make shapes with their arms and legs .

one day , sara and her friends go to a big hall . there are many people there . they want to see the dancers . sara and her friends are happy and excited . they go on the stage and wait for the music .

the music starts and the dancers begin to dance . sara is in the front . she spins and jumps and smiles . she feels like a bird . she sees her mom and dad in the crowd . they wave and clap for her .

but then , sara makes a mistake . she jumps too high and lands on her foot wrong . she feels a pain in her ankle . she falls to the floor . she cries out loud . the music stops and the people gasp .

sara 's friends run to her . they help her get up . they hug her and say , " it 's okay , sara . you are a good dancer . you are brave . we are sorry you hurt yourself . "

sara 's mom and dad come to the stage . they take sara to the doctor . the doctor says sara has a sprain . he puts a bandage on her ankle . he says , " you need to rest your ankle for a while . you will be fine soon . you are a strong girl . "

sara feels sad . she says , " i ca n't dance anymore . i ruined the show . i let everyone down . "

her mom and dad say , " no , sara . you did n't ruin anything . you did your best . you are a wonderful dancer . everyone loved your performance . you made us proud . "

sara smiles a little . she says , " thank you , mom and dad . thank you , friends . you are very kind . i love you all . "

she hugs them and says , " i will dance again . i will not give up . i will practice and get better . i will be a dancer again . " tom and lily were at the park with their mom . they saw a big statue of a lion with water coming out of its mouth . it was a fountain . tom and lily liked the fountain . they wanted to play with the water .

" can we go near the fountain , mom ? " tom asked .

" sure , but be careful . do n't get too wet , " mom said .

tom and lily ran to the fountain . they saw the water spray from the lion 's mouth . they felt the water splash on their faces . they laughed and had fun .

" look , lily , i can spray water too ! " tom said . he put his mouth near the fountain and tried to spray water like the lion . but he only got water in his nose . he coughed and sneezed .

" are you okay , tom ? " lily asked .

" i 'm okay , lily . but that was not a good idea , " tom said .

mom came to check on them . she saw tom 's wet face and nose . she smiled and gave him a tissue .

" you two are silly . the lion is a statue . it can spray water , but you ca n't . you are ordinary , but special , " mom said .

tom and lily hugged mom . they learned something new . they were ordinary , but special . they liked the fountain and the statue . they liked the park and mom . they were happy . lily and sam were playing in the park . they liked to slide on the big slide . it was fun and fast . they took turns to go down the slide .

one day , they saw a fireman in the park . he was wearing a red hat and a yellow coat . he had a big truck with a loud siren . lily and sam wanted to see the fireman and his truck .

they ran to the fireman and said hello . the fireman smiled and said hello back . he asked them if they liked to slide . they nodded and said yes . the fireman said he liked to slide too . he said he had a special slide on his truck . it was a long ladder that he used to reach high places .

he asked them if they wanted to try his slide . lily and sam were excited and said yes . the fireman was gentle and helped them climb on his truck . he showed them how to hold the ladder and slide down . lily and sam slid down the ladder . they laughed and clapped . it was fun and fast , but also a little scary .

the fireman said they were brave and good . he gave them stickers with his truck and his hat . he said he had to go now , but he would come back another day . he said goodbye and drove away with his siren . lily and sam waved and said goodbye . they thanked the fireman for letting them slide on his ladder . they went back to the big slide and played some more . they were happy and proud . they had a new friend , the fireman . sara liked to balance on the big log in the park . she pretended she was a tightrope walker in the circus . she wore a red hat and a blue dress and smiled at the birds and the flowers .

one day , a mean witch came to the park . she saw sara balancing on the log and she did not like it . she wanted to make sara fall and hurt herself . she hid behind a tree and waited for the right moment .

" hello , little girl , " the witch said , coming out of the tree . " what are you doing on that log ? "

" i 'm balancing , " sara said , not noticing the witch 's green skin and pointy nose . " i 'm a tightrope walker . do you want to try ? "

" no , thank you , " the witch said , pretending to be nice . " but i have a gift for you . a pretty necklace . do you want it ? "

sara loved necklaces . she nodded and reached out her hand . the witch gave her a necklace with a big pendant . sara put it on and thanked the witch .

but the necklace was not a gift . it was a curse . as soon as sara wore it , she felt dizzy and heavy . she could not balance on the log anymore . she wobbled and stumbled and fell to the ground .

" ha ha ha ! " the witch laughed . " now you will never balance again . you will be clumsy and weak and sad . that 's what you get for being happy and brave . "

sara cried and cried . she wanted to take off the necklace , but it was stuck . she felt hopeless and scared .

but then , she heard a voice . a familiar voice . a friendly voice .

" sara , sara , where are you ? " it was her big brother , tom . he had come to the park to play with her . he had seen the witch and the necklace and he knew what to do .

he ran to sara and hugged her . he took out a pair of scissors and cut the necklace off . he threw it away and said , " do n't worry , sara . i 'm here . you 're safe . the witch ca n't hurt you anymore . "

sara felt better . she smiled and thanked tom . she got up and said , " let 's go back to the log . i want to balance again . "

tom nodded and said , " sure . let 's go . you 're the best tightrope walker i know . "

they held hands and walked to the log . the witch was gone . the birds and the flowers cheered . sara balanced on the log and tom clapped . they were happy and brave . the end . tom and sam are friends . they like to play in the park . they see a big slide . they want to go on the slide .

" let 's go on the slide ! " tom says . " it looks fun ! "

" ok ! " sam says . " you go first , i will follow you . "

tom runs to the slide . he climbs up the ladder . he sits on the top . he is ready to slide down .

but then he sees a big dog . the dog is under the slide . the dog is angry . the dog barks at tom .

" help ! " tom yells . " there is a big dog ! it wants to bite me ! "

sam hears tom . he runs to the slide . he sees the big dog . he is scared .

" tom , do n't move ! " sam says . " i will get help ! "

sam runs to find a grown - up . he sees a man . the man is nice . he has a stick .

" please help ! " sam says . " my friend is on the slide . there is a big dog . the dog is angry . the dog wants to bite him ! "

the man hears sam . he sees the slide . he sees the big dog . he sees tom .

" do n't worry , son ! " the man says . " i will help your friend . i will provide a way for him to get down . "

the man runs to the slide . he holds the stick . he tries to scare the dog . he says " shoo ! shoo ! "

but the dog is not scared . the dog is mad . the dog jumps at the man . the dog bites the man 's leg .

" ow ! " the man says . " the dog bit me ! it hurts ! "

tom sees the man . he sees the dog . he sees the blood . he is very scared .

" help ! " tom yells again . " the dog bit the man ! the man is hurt ! "

sam sees the man . he sees the dog . he sees the blood . he is very sad .

" help ! " sam yells too . " the dog bit the man ! the man is hurt ! "

but no one else hears them . no one else comes . the dog is still angry . the dog is still under the slide . the dog is still barking .

tom and sam are stuck . they ca n't get down . they ca n't get away . they are not lucky . they are in trouble .

the end . lily and ben are twins . they like to watch tv . they watch famous people sing and dance . they want to be famous too .

one day , they find a big box in the garage . it is empty . they have an idea . they make the box into a stage . they use crayons and stickers to decorate it . they put on their best clothes and hats . they are ready to perform .

they ask mom to watch them . mom is busy in the kitchen . she says she will watch them later . lily and ben are sad . they want mom to watch them now . they think of a way to make mom watch them .

they go to the kitchen . they see the fridge . it is full of food . they have another idea . they take out some food . they take cheese , eggs , milk , and jam . they make a mess . they put the food on their faces and clothes . they look funny .

they run to the garage . they climb on the stage . they start to sing and dance . they sing loud and silly . they dance fast and crazy . they are having fun .

mom hears the noise . she goes to the garage . she sees lily and ben . she sees the food . she is shocked . she is angry . she is also amused . she laughs . she takes a picture . she says , " you two are very famous . you are famous for making a mess . now you have to clean it up . "

lily and ben stop singing and dancing . they see mom . they see the picture . they are proud . they are also sorry . they say , " we are sorry , mom . we wanted you to watch us . we wanted to be famous like on tv . "

mom hugs them . she says , " i love you , lily and ben . you are famous to me . you do n't need to make a mess to get my attention . i will always watch you . but first , let 's go to the bathroom and wash up . then we can watch some tv together . " anna and ben are friends . they like to play with dolls and cars . one day , anna has a new doll . it is big and pretty . it has a wide dress and a long hair .

" can i play with your doll ? " ben asks anna .

" ok , you can lend it for a little time . but be careful . do not break it or lose it , " anna says .

" thank you , anna . i will be careful , " ben says . he takes the doll and runs to the garden .

anna plays with her cars . she waits for ben to come back . she waits and waits . but ben does not come back .

she goes to the garden . she looks for ben and her doll . she sees ben . he is on the swing . he is swinging high and fast . he is holding her doll by the waist . he is laughing .

" ben , give me back my doll ! " anna shouts .

" no , i like it . it is mine now . go away ! " ben shouts back .

he swings higher and higher . he lets go of the doll . the doll flies in the air . it lands on the roof of the house . anna and ben can not reach it .

anna cries . she is very sad . she lost her new doll . ben is very bad . he is not her friend anymore . anna and ben like to play in the park . they like to slide , swing and run . but they do not like to play with lily . lily is bossy . she tells them what to do and what not to do . she does not share her toys . she says she is the best at everything .

one day , anna and ben find a big hole in the ground . they wonder what is inside . they peek into the hole . they see a dark tunnel . they hear a strange noise . they are curious . they decide to go inside . they tell lily to stay outside . they do not want her to spoil their fun .

lily is angry . she does not like to be left out . she thinks anna and ben are silly . she thinks they are scared of the dark . she wants to show them that she is brave . she follows them into the hole . she runs after them . she shouts at them . she says they have to listen to her .

anna and ben are annoyed . they want to explore the tunnel . they want to see what is making the noise . they ignore lily . they walk deeper into the tunnel . they see a light at the end . they are excited . they run towards the light .

lily is surprised . she sees the light too . she wonders what is there . she runs faster . she wants to be the first to see . she pushes anna and ben aside . she reaches the end of the tunnel . she gasps . she sees a big sunflower . the sunflower is rising from the underground . the sunflower is smiling . the sunflower is talking .

" hello , little ones , " the sunflower says . " welcome to my home . i am glad you came to visit . you are very brave and curious . i have a gift for you . do you want to see ? "

anna and ben nod . they are happy . they like the sunflower . they think he is friendly and kind . they want to see his gift .

lily shakes her head . she is not happy . she does not like the sunflower . she thinks he is weird and silly . she does not want his gift . she wants to go back .

" what is your gift ? " anna asks .

" follow me , " the sunflower says . he bends his stem . he shows them a hidden door . he opens the door . he invites them to enter . " this is my secret garden . you can play here as long as you like . you can see many beautiful flowers and animals . you can have fun and learn new things . you can be my friends . "

anna and ben smile . they thank the sunflower . they enter the door . they see a wonderful garden . they see many colors and shapes . they see butterflies and birds . they hear music and laughter . they are amazed . they want to play and learn . they want to be friends with the sunflower .

lily frowns . she does not thank the sunflower . she does not enter the door . she does not see the garden . she does not hear the music and laughter . she is bored . she wants to go back . she wants to be the boss .

" come on , anna and ben , " she says . " let 's go back . this is stupid . this is not fun . this is not real . you have to listen to me . i am the boss . "

anna and ben look at lily . they shake their heads . they do not want to go back . they do not want to listen to lily . they do not want to be bossed .

" no , lily , " they say . " we want to stay here . this is fun . this is real . this is our choice . you are not the boss . you are bossy . you are mean . you are not our friend . "

lily is shocked . she is hurt . she is angry . she does not understand . she does not know what to do . she cries . she runs away . she leaves the sunflower , the garden and the hole . she goes back to the park . she is alone . she is sad . she is sorry . anna and ben are playing in the park . they like to swing , slide and run . they are having fun .

but it is a hot day . the sun is very bright and makes them sweat . they need to drink water .

" anna , ben , come here ! " mom calls . " you need to drink some water . it is good for you . "

anna and ben run to mom . she has a bottle of water for each of them . she gives them the bottles .

" thank you , mom ! " anna says . she opens her bottle and drinks some water . it is cold and fresh . she feels better .

but ben does not want to drink water . he thinks water is boring . he wants juice or soda . he refuses to open his bottle .

" no , thank you , mom ! " ben says . " i do n't want water . water is boring . i want juice or soda . they are yummy and fun . "

mom shakes her head . she is not happy . she knows juice and soda have too much sugar . they are not good for ben .

" ben , you need to drink water . water is not boring . water is healthy and important . it helps you stay cool and strong . juice and soda have too much sugar . they can make you sick and tired . please drink some water . "

but ben still refuses to drink water . he puts his bottle down and runs away . he wants to play more .

mom sighs . she hopes ben will change his mind . she does not want him to get thirsty or sick . she loves him very much . lily and sam were friends who liked to play at the park . they liked to go on the slide , the swings and the seesaw . but sometimes , sam liked to tease lily and make her mad .

one day , they went to the park and saw a new slide . it was big and pink and had a tunnel . lily wanted to try it , but sam said , " no , you ca n't go on the slide . it 's only for boys . girls are too scared of the tunnel . "

lily felt angry and said , " that 's not true . i 'm not scared of anything . you 're just being mean . i can go on the slide if i want to . "

sam laughed and said , " fine , go ahead . but do n't cry when you get stuck in the dark . "

lily ignored him and climbed up the ladder . she reached the top and looked at the tunnel . it was dark and long , but she was brave . she said to herself , " i can do this . i 'm not scared of anything . " she slid down the slide and went into the tunnel .

