tom felt worse and worse . he knew he had lied to his dad and hurt his feelings . he knew he had twisted something that was not his and ruined it . he knew he had been very naughty and selfish .

he decided to be brave and humble . he took the file from under his bed and went to his dad . he said he was sorry . he said he had twisted the file and broken it . he said he had lied to him . he said he would never do it again .

