sally gave the ball to tim . they decided to play together . after playing , they got hungry . sally had a lime in her bag . they shared the lime and enjoyed the sour taste . sally and tim became good friends , all because of a yellow ball and a lime . once upon a time , in a big country , there was a little boy named tim . tim had a big red ball . he loved to play with it every day . but one day , his ball got hurt . it had a hole in it . tim was very sad .

