they got on the subway and ate the big cake together . tim was so happy . they laughed and talked as they rode the subway all day long . it was the best birthday ever for tim . once upon a time , in a small town , there was a row of five pretty houses . in one of these houses , lived a kind girl named emma . emma liked to play with her friends outside in the sun . they loved to run , jump , and laugh together . they were all very healthy and happy .

