ben looked at the ball . he liked it too . he wanted to play with it . he reached for the ball . " can i have it ? " he asked .

sara shook her head . " no , it 's mine . i found it . you ca n't have it ! " she said .

ben felt sad and angry . he wanted the ball . he pushed sara . sara fell down . she dropped the ball . she felt hurt and mad . she cried . " you are mean , ben ! you are not my friend ! " she said .

ben picked up the ball . he felt bad . he saw sara crying . he did not want to make her cry . he did not want to lose her friend . he remembered how they played in the garden every day . he remembered how they shared their toys and snacks . he remembered how they hugged and said sorry when they fought .

he walked to sara . he gave her the ball . " i 'm sorry , sara . i was mean . you can have the ball . you are my friend . " he said .

sara looked at ben . she looked at the ball . she wiped her tears . she smiled . " it 's okay , ben . i 'm sorry too . i was mean . we can share the ball . you are my friend . " she said .

they hugged . they played with the ball . they had fun in the garden . they were fine . tom and sam are friends . they like to play hero games . they have capes and masks . they run fast and jump high . they save toys and animals from bad guys .

one day , they see a big dog . the dog is angry and loud . it chases a small cat . the cat is scared and runs away . tom and sam want to help the cat . they are heroes .

" let 's go , sam ! " tom says . " we can stop the dog ! "

they run after the dog . they try to catch it . they shout and wave their capes . the dog does not listen . it is faster and stronger . it gets closer to the cat .

" tom , we need a plan ! " sam says . " the dog is too big ! "

tom thinks hard . he sees a stick . he has an idea .

" sam , look ! a stick ! " tom says . " we can throw it to the dog . maybe it will play with it and leave the cat alone . "

tom picks up the stick . he throws it as far as he can . the dog sees the stick . it stops chasing the cat . it runs to the stick . it picks it up with its mouth . it wags its tail . it is happy .

the cat sees the dog go away . it is safe . it runs to tom and sam . it rubs against their legs . it purrs . it is thankful .

tom and sam smile . they pet the cat . they are proud . they are heroes . lily ran fast in the race . she wanted to win a medal . she liked shiny things . but she fell down and hurt her knee . it was red and wet . she cried loud .

mom came and picked her up . she hugged her and said , " it 's okay , lily . you are brave and strong . i am proud of you . " she comforted her and wiped her tears . she put a band - aid on her knee . she gave her a kiss and a cookie .

lily felt better . she smiled and said , " thank you , mom . i love you . " she saw the other kids finish the race . they got medals . they looked happy . but lily was not sad . she had something better . she had mom .

mom said , " let 's go home , lily . it 's cold outside . we can watch a movie and cuddle on the couch . you can wear your medal tomorrow . you are a winner in my heart . " she wrapped her in a warm coat and held her hand .

lily nodded and said , " okay , mom . that sounds good . you are the best mom ever . " she hugged her and felt warm and cozy . she did not care about the medal . she had mom . and mom had her . they were happy . anna and ben are friends . they like to play in the pool . the pool is big and blue . it has a slide and a ball .

one day , anna and ben go to the pool with their moms . they put on their swimsuits and sun hats . they run to the pool and jump in . the water is cool and fun .

" look at me , anna ! " ben says . he slides down the slide and splashes into the pool . " i can slide fast ! "

anna smiles . she likes the slide too . she climbs up the ladder and slides down . " whee ! " she says . she lands in the water next to ben .

they play with the ball . they throw it and catch it . they laugh and shout .

but then , anna sees something . it is a frog . it is green and slimy . it is sitting on the edge of the pool . anna is scared of frogs . she does not like them .

" ben , look ! " anna says . she points to the frog . " a frog ! i do n't like frogs ! "

ben looks . he sees the frog . he is not scared of frogs . he likes them . he thinks they are cute .

" it 's okay , anna , " ben says . he swims to the frog . he picks it up gently . he holds it in his hand . " it 's just a frog . it wo n't hurt you . it 's quiet and friendly . do you want to touch it ? "

anna shakes her head . she swims away from ben and the frog . she does not want to touch it . she does not want to be near it .

" please , anna , " ben says . he follows her . he shows her the frog . " it 's soft and smooth . it has big eyes and a funny mouth . it can hop and swim . it 's a cool animal . please , accept it . it 's a gift for you . "

anna looks at ben . she sees that he is happy and kind . he wants to share his frog with her . he is her friend .

anna looks at the frog . she sees that it is quiet and friendly . it does not bite or croak . it is a cool animal .

anna takes a deep breath . she reaches out her hand . she touches the frog . it is soft and smooth . it does not hurt her . it is a gift for her .

anna smiles . she accepts the frog . she says , " thank you , ben . you are a good friend . i like the frog . "

ben smiles . he says , " you 're welcome , anna . you are a good friend too . i 'm glad you like the frog . "

they hug . they put the frog back on the edge of the pool . they play with the ball again . they have fun . they are happy . one day , a dog and a cat were playing in the park . they saw a big ball that was red and shiny . they both wanted the ball , so they ran to get it . but they got there at the same time , and they started to fight . they pulled and pushed and bit and scratched , but neither of them could get the ball .

a bird was watching them from a tree . he thought they were very funny , because they were making a lot of noise and making silly faces . he flew down and said , " why are you fighting over the ball ? it is not yours , and it is not fun to hurt each other . why do n't you share the ball and play together ? "

the dog and the cat stopped fighting and looked at the bird . they felt ashamed , because they knew he was right . they said , " we are sorry , bird . you are very smart . how can we share the ball and play together ? "

the bird said , " it is easy . you can take turns with the ball . one of you can roll the ball , and the other can chase it . then you can switch . that way , you both can have fun with the ball , and you can be friends . "

the dog and the cat liked the bird 's idea . they thanked him and said , " you are very kind , bird . you helped us solve our problem . do you want to play with us ? "

the bird said , " yes , i would love to play with you . you are very nice , dog and cat . you learned to share and be friends . that is the best way to have fun . "

the end .

moral : sharing is caring , and friendship is fun . mia and ben were playing in the kitchen . they liked to pretend they were chefs and make yummy food . they used pots and pans , spoons and forks , and some things from the fridge .

" look , i made a cake ! " mia said , holding a plate with a slice of bread and some cream on top . " do you want some ? "

" yes , please ! " ben said , taking a bite . " it is very good . can i have more cream ? "

" sure ! " mia said , opening the fridge . she saw a big bottle of cream and took it out . she tried to squeeze some cream on ben 's plate , but the bottle was too hard . she pushed and pushed , but nothing came out .

" let me help you , " ben said , grabbing the bottle . he pushed and pushed , too , but still nothing came out . he pushed harder and harder , until ...

pop !

the bottle exploded and cream flew everywhere . it landed on the table , the floor , the walls , and the children . mia and ben were covered in white sticky cream . they looked at each other and started to laugh .

" oh no ! " they heard a voice say . it was mom , who had just come home from work . she saw the mess in the kitchen and frowned . " what happened here ? this is not tidy at all ! "

" sorry , mom , " mia and ben said together . " we were playing chefs and the cream bottle popped . "

mom sighed and shook her head . " well , i 'm glad you had fun , but you need to clean up this mess . go wash your hands and faces , and then help me wipe the cream off everything . and next time , please be more careful with the cream . it is not a toy , it is for eating . "

" okay , mom , " mia and ben said . they ran to the bathroom and washed the cream off . then they came back and helped mom clean the kitchen . they used cloths and water and soap , and soon the kitchen was tidy again .

" thank you , mia and ben , " mom said , smiling . " you did a good job . now , how about we have some real cake for dessert ? i bought one from the bakery . it has cream on it , too , but it will not pop , i promise . "

" yay ! " mia and ben said , clapping their hands . they followed mom to the dining room , where a delicious cake was waiting for them . they cut some slices and ate them happily . they liked the cream on the cake , but they liked mom more . they gave her a big hug and a kiss , and said , " we love you , mom . "

" i love you , too , mia and ben , " mom said , hugging them back . " you are my sweet cream pies . " tim and sam are brothers . they like to play with their toys . they have cars , trucks , trains and planes . they make noises and pretend to drive them .

one day , they see a big book on the shelf . it has a picture of a reindeer on the cover . they do not know what a reindeer is . they ask their mom .

" mom , what is this ? " tim says , pointing to the book .

" that is a reindeer , tim . it is an animal that lives in the snow . it has horns and fur . some people say that reindeer can fly and help santa bring gifts on christmas . " mom says .

" wow , that is cool ! can we read the book , mom ? " sam says .

" sure , let 's read it together . " mom says . she opens the book and reads the story of rudolph , the red - nosed reindeer .

tim and sam listen to the story . they learn that rudolph is different from the other reindeer . he has a shiny red nose that glows in the dark . the other reindeer laugh at him and do not let him play with them . but one night , santa needs his help . he asks rudolph to lead his sleigh and guide the way with his nose . rudolph is happy and proud . he drives the sleigh with santa and delivers gifts to all the children . the other reindeer see how brave and useful he is . they apologize and become his friends .

tim and sam like the story . they think that rudolph is awesome . they decide to play with their toys again . but this time , they pretend that one of their cars is a reindeer . they stick a red button on its hood and make it drive in front of the other cars . they say that it is rudolph and that he is helping santa .

" look , mom , we have a reindeer too ! " tim says .

" that is very creative , boys . i like your reindeer . he is not normal , he is special . " mom says .

tim and sam smile . they hug their reindeer car and play happily . they do not care if it is normal or not . they love it anyway . tom and sam are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big jar of money on a bench . the jar has a sign that says " for the poor " .

" wow , look at all that money ! " tom says . " i wish i had some . "

" me too , " sam says . " do you think anyone is watching ? "

tom looks around . he does not see anyone . he has an idea . he says to sam , " i dare you to take some money from the jar . just a little bit . no one will know . "

sam feels scared . he knows it is wrong to take money that is not his . he says to tom , " no , i do n't want to . that is not honest . the money is for the poor . they need it more than us . "

tom laughs . he says , " you are a chicken . i am not afraid . i will take some money . watch me . " he runs to the jar and grabs a handful of money . he puts it in his pocket .

suddenly , a man comes out of a shop . he sees tom with the money . he is angry . he says , " hey , you ! what are you doing ? that is my money ! i was collecting it for the poor . give it back ! "

tom is scared . he drops the money and runs away . he does not look at sam . he feels bad .

sam is sad . he does not want to be friends with tom anymore . he thinks tom is not honest . he goes to the man and says , " i am sorry . tom dared me to take some money , but i did not . i know it is wrong . here , take this money . it is yours . "

the man smiles . he says , " thank you , young man . you are very honest . you did the right thing . here , take this candy . it is for you . "

sam takes the candy . he says , " thank you , sir . you are very kind . i hope the poor get the money . "

the man says , " they will . and i hope you find a better friend than tom . "

sam nods . he walks away . he feels good . he thinks , " i am glad i did not dare to take the money . it is better to be honest . " anna loved to dance . she liked to move her feet and arms to the rhythm of the music . she imagined she was a princess , a fairy , or a star . she danced in her room , in the garden , and in the park .

one day , she saw a poster for a dance show . it said : " do you want to dance on a big stage ? come and join us for a fun audition ! " anna wanted to go , but she was scared . she had never danced in front of many people before .

she told her mom about the poster . her mom said : " you are a great dancer , anna . you should try it . it will be fun . you just have to be brave and show them your moves . "

anna thought about it . she wanted to have fun . she wanted to show them her moves . she wanted to be brave . she said : " okay , mom . i will try it . can you come with me ? "

her mom said : " of course , i will come with you . i am very proud of you , anna . you are my brave dancer . "

the next day , anna and her mom went to the audition . there were many other kids who wanted to dance . anna felt nervous , but she remembered her mom 's words . she imagined she was a star . she danced with all her heart . she moved her feet and arms to the rhythm of the music . she smiled and had fun .

the judges liked her dance . they said : " you are a wonderful dancer , anna . you have a lot of talent and joy . you are in the show ! "

anna was very happy . she hugged her mom and said : " thank you , mom . you were right . it was fun . i was brave . i am a star ! " ben and mia liked to play in the old house . it was big and dark and had many rooms to explore . but they never went to the basement . they heard that there was a skeleton there , and it scared them .

one day , they found a door that they had not seen before . it was in the back of the kitchen , behind some boxes . they opened the door and saw some stairs going down . they were curious and brave , so they decided to go down and see what was there .

the basement was gloomy and cold . there were cobwebs and dust everywhere . they saw a big pot on a table , with a spoon in it . they wondered what was in the pot . they walked closer and looked inside . it was full of bones and water . they felt a shiver down their spines .

suddenly , they heard a loud noise behind them . they turned around and saw a skeleton standing in the corner . it had a hat and a coat and a big smile . it was holding a book and a candle . it said , " hello , children . do you want to hear a story ? i have many stories to tell . come , sit with me and stir the pot . it makes the bones nice and soft . "

ben and mia screamed and ran back to the stairs . they slammed the door behind them and ran out of the house . they never went back to the old house again . they told their friends about the skeleton in the basement , but no one believed them . they knew it was true , and they still had nightmares about it . lily and ben were playing with their toy cars in the garden . they liked to make noises and pretend they were racing . sometimes they crashed their cars and made a big wreck .

" look at my red car , it 's so fast ! " ben said .

" my yellow car is faster , watch me ! " lily said .

they zoomed their cars on the grass and the dirt . but then lily 's car hit a rock and flew into the air . it landed on the other side of the fence , where a big dog was sleeping .

" oh no , my car ! " lily cried .

she ran to the fence and tried to reach her car . but the dog woke up and saw the yellow car . he thought it was a toy for him . he picked it up with his mouth and started to chew it .

" hey , that 's my car , give it back ! " lily shouted .

the dog looked at lily and growled . he was hungry and he liked the taste of the car . he did not want to share .

" that car does not belong to you , it belongs to me ! " lily said .

she was angry and sad . she wanted her car back . she looked at ben and hoped he would help her .

ben saw what happened and felt sorry for lily . he wanted to help her , but he was afraid of the dog . he did not know what to do .

he looked around and saw a bone on the ground . he had an idea . he picked up the bone and threw it over the fence , far away from the dog .

" hey , dog , look , a bone ! " ben said .

the dog heard ben and saw the bone . he dropped the car and ran after the bone . he liked bones more than cars .

lily saw the dog leave and quickly grabbed her car . she was happy to have it back , but it was broken and dirty . she hugged it and thanked ben .

" thank you , ben , you are a good friend ! " lily said .

" you 're welcome , lily , i 'm sorry about your car , " ben said .

they walked back to their house , holding their cars . they decided to play with something else . they were still friends . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to draw with chalk on the ground . they made flowers , stars , and rainbows . they had fun .

but then a big dog came . it was black and fierce . it barked loud and ran fast . it wanted to play , but it scared lily and ben . it jumped on their drawings and made marks with its paws . it ruined their flowers , stars , and rainbows .

" go away , dog ! " lily shouted . " you are bad ! you are not nice ! "

" leave us alone , dog ! " ben cried . " you are mean ! you are not friendly ! "

but the dog did not listen . it kept barking and jumping and marking . lily and ben were sad and afraid . they ran to their mom and dad . they hugged them tight .

mom and dad saw the dog . they called the owner . the owner came and took the dog away . he said sorry to lily and ben . he said the dog was young and playful , but not trained . he said he would teach the dog to behave .

lily and ben felt better . they said thank you to the owner . they said bye to the dog . they hoped the dog would learn to be nice and friendly .

they went back to their drawings . they erased the marks with their hands . they made new flowers , stars , and rainbows . they smiled and laughed . they had fun . lily and ben were playing with their toy trains . they liked to make them go fast and slow , and stop at the station . they pretended to be the drivers and the passengers .

" choo choo , this is the red train . we are going to the station . please hold on tight , " said lily .

" choo choo , this is the blue train . we are going to the station too . please be careful of the doors , " said ben .

they made their trains stop at the station and opened the doors . they took out some of their stuffed animals and put them on the platform .

" hello , mr. bear . do you want to go on the red train or the blue train ? " asked lily .

" hello , miss bunny . do you want to go on the blue train or the red train ? " asked ben .

they helped their animals choose their trains and put them back inside . then they closed the doors and made their trains go again .

" choo choo , this is the red train . we are leaving the station . next stop , the kitchen , " said lily .

" choo choo , this is the blue train . we are leaving the station too . next stop , the garden , " said ben .

they made their trains go to different places in the house . they had fun exploring and pretending .

when they got to the kitchen , lily saw her mom cooking something on the stove . she smelled something yummy .

" mom , what are you cooking ? " asked lily .

" i 'm cooking some soup for lunch . do you want to help me ? " asked her mom .

" yes , please . can i stir the soup ? " asked lily .

" sure , but be careful . the soup is hot and the stove is hot . you need to use this spoon and this glove , " said her mom .

she gave lily a big spoon and a glove . lily put on the glove and stirred the soup gently . she felt happy and proud .

" mom , can i taste the soup ? " asked lily .

" of course , but wait a minute . i need to cool it down a little bit . you do n't want to burn your tongue , " said her mom .

she poured some soup into a small bowl and blew on it . then she gave it to lily .

" here you go . tell me what you think , " said her mom .

lily took a sip of the soup . it was warm and tasty . she liked it a lot .

" mmm , this is good soup , mom . thank you for cooking it , " said lily .

" you 're welcome , sweetie . i 'm glad you like it . and thank you for helping me , " said her mom .

they hugged and smiled . lily felt happy and loved . she wondered what ben was doing in the garden . maybe he was playing with some harmless bugs or flowers . she decided to join him after lunch . she liked playing with her trains and her mom . she liked having fun and learning new things . she liked being a big girl . lily and sam like to play soccer with their friends . they are on the same team and they wear blue shirts . the other team wears red shirts and they are very good . lily and sam want to win , but they are not very fast or strong .

one day , they have a big game against the red team . lily and sam are nervous , but they try to have fun . they run and kick the ball , but the red team always gets it . the red team scores many goals and the blue team scores none . lily and sam feel sad and angry .

at halftime , they sit on the grass and drink water . they hear the red team laughing and talking . one of the red players says , " look at those blue losers . they are so bad . they should just go home and cry . they embarrass themselves and their team . "

lily and sam hear this and feel hurt . they do n't like the red player . he is mean and rude . they want to show him that they are not losers . they want to make him stop laughing .

they have an idea . they are clever and they have a plan . they whisper to each other and smile . they wait for the second half to start .

when the game starts again , lily and sam pretend to be tired and slow . they let the red team get the ball and run to their goal . but they do n't chase them . they stay near the middle of the field .

the red player who was mean sees this and thinks it is funny . he wants to score more goals and make fun of them . he gets the ball and runs past lily and sam . he thinks they are too lazy to stop him . he laughs and says , " bye bye , blue losers . watch me score another goal . "

but he is wrong . lily and sam are not lazy . they are clever . they wait for the right moment and then they run very fast . they catch up with the red player and surprise him . they kick the ball away from him and pass it to each other . they run to the other goal and score . they cheer and hug . they are happy and proud .

the red player is shocked and angry . he ca n't believe what happened . he feels stupid and silly . he embarrasses himself and his team . he stops laughing and starts crying .

lily and sam see this and feel sorry for him . they are not mean and rude . they are kind and nice . they go to him and say , " do n't cry . it 's just a game . you are a good player , but you should not be mean to others . you should be nice and have fun . do you want to be our friend ? "

the red player looks at them and wipes his tears . he feels ashamed and sorry . he says , " yes , i want to be your friend . i 'm sorry i was mean to you . you are clever and good players . you taught me a lesson . can we play together ? "

lily and sam smile and nod . they say , " yes , we can play together . we can have fun and learn from each other . we can be friends . "

they shake hands and hug . they join the other players and play the rest of the game . they do n't care who wins or loses . they care about having fun and being friends . they are happy and they do n't embarrass themselves or their team . they are clever and kind . anna and ben were friends who liked to play outside . they had a big red ball that they took turns to roll down the hill . the ball bounced and rolled very fast , and they ran after it to catch it and return it to the top of the hill .

one day , a new boy moved in next door . his name was carl , and he had a shiny blue bike . he rode his bike up and down the hill , making loud noises and showing off . anna and ben watched him and felt envious . they wished they had a bike too .

" can we play with your bike ? " anna asked carl one day .

" no , it 's mine . you ca n't touch it , " carl said . he stuck out his tongue and rode away .

anna and ben felt sad and angry . they decided to play with their ball again , but they had an idea . they waited until carl was at the bottom of the hill , and then they rolled their ball very hard . the ball flew down the hill and hit carl 's bike , making it fall over . carl cried out and ran to his bike .

" hey , that 's not nice ! you broke my bike ! " carl shouted .

" we 're sorry , we did n't mean to , " anna and ben said . but they were not really sorry . they felt happy that they had made carl pay for being mean .

carl picked up his bike and saw that the wheel was bent and the chain was loose . he could n't ride it anymore . he felt sad and angry . he wished he had a ball too . ben was upset . he had to go to the hospital for an operation . he did not like the hospital . it was big and noisy and scary . he did not want to leave his mom and dad and his toys .

" ben , it 's time to go , " his mom said . she held his hand and gave him a hug . " do n't worry , the operation will make you feel better . the doctor is very nice and will take good care of you . "

ben shook his head . he did not want to go . he wanted to stay at home and play . he tried to pull his hand away from his mom . he started to cry .

" ben , please do n't cry , " his dad said . he picked him up and carried him to the car . " we will be with you all the time . we love you very much . the operation will be over soon and then you can go back home and play . "

ben sniffed . he hugged his dad and buried his face in his shoulder . he was still upset , but he felt a little better . he hoped his dad was right . he hoped the operation would not hurt . he hoped he could go back home and play soon . he did not want to walk in the hospital . he wanted to walk in the park with his mom and dad and his toys . tom and lily were twins who liked to play with their toys . one day , they found a big box in the garage . they decided to make it into a house . they cut out windows and a door with scissors . they drew pictures on the walls with crayons . they put a blanket inside for a bed .

they were having fun until their mom came and saw the mess . she was very angry . she said , " you made a big mess with the box and the scissors and the crayons . you did not ask me first . you could have hurt yourself or ruined the box . you are very naughty . you need to be punished . "

she took away the box and the scissors and the crayons . she told them to go to their room and stay there until dinner . tom and lily were very sad . they cried and said , " we are sorry , mom . we just wanted to play . we did not mean to make a mess . please give us back the box and the scissors and the crayons . "

mom said , " no , you have to learn your lesson . you have to respect other people 's things and ask before you use them . you have to clean up after yourself and be careful with sharp things . you have to listen to me and do what i say . maybe tomorrow , if you are good , i will give you back the box and the scissors and the crayons . but for now , you have to stay in your room and think about what you did . "

tom and lily went to their room and sat on their bed . they felt very sorry for what they did . they realized they were wrong and they hurt their mom 's feelings . they decided to say sorry to their mom and to be more careful and respectful next time . they also decided to share their toys and play nicely with each other . they hugged and said , " we love you , mom . we love you , brother / sister . we are glad we have each other . " lily saw a purple caterpillar on a leaf . she liked the caterpillar . she wanted to play with it . she said , " hello , caterpillar . you are very pretty . can i be your friend ? "

the caterpillar looked at lily . it said , " hello , lily . you are very nice . you can be my friend . but i have to go soon . i have to make a cocoon . "

lily did not know what a cocoon was . she asked , " what is a cocoon ? "

the caterpillar said , " a cocoon is a place where i sleep and change . when i wake up , i will be a butterfly . "

lily was amazed . she said , " wow , a butterfly ! that sounds fun . can i see you when you are a butterfly ? "

the caterpillar said , " yes , you can . but you have to follow me . i will show you where i make my cocoon . "

lily nodded . she said , " ok , i will follow you . let 's go , caterpillar . "

the caterpillar crawled off the leaf . lily followed it . they went to a bush with many flowers . the caterpillar found a good spot . it said , " this is where i make my cocoon . thank you for being my friend , lily . i will see you soon . "

lily said , " you are welcome , caterpillar . i will miss you . but i will come back and look for you . goodbye , caterpillar . "

the caterpillar said , " goodbye , lily . "

the caterpillar made a cocoon . lily went home . she waited for the caterpillar to become a butterfly . she hoped it would be purple too . sara and tom are friends . they like to play with cars and trucks . one day , they find a big box in the yard . they think it is a good place to play .

" let 's pretend this is a car , " sara says . " we can travel to many places . "

" ok , " tom says . " i will be the driver and you will be the cop . we have to catch the bad guys . "

they get inside the box and make noises like a car . they imagine they are on a road with other cars and people . they have fun .

but then , a dog comes to the yard . the dog is filthy . he has mud and dirt on his fur . he smells bad . he sees the box and thinks it is a toy . he runs to the box and bites it . he tears it with his teeth .

sara and tom are scared . they scream and try to get out of the box . the dog barks and shakes the box .

" help ! help ! " sara and tom cry .

their mom hears them and comes to the yard . she sees the dog and the box . she is angry and scared too .

" go away , you filthy dog ! " she shouts . she throws a stick at the dog . the dog drops the box and runs away .

