later that day , mr. brown came to their yard with a plate of cake . he smiled and said , " hello , tom and sue . i made a cake for you . do you want some ? "

tom and sue looked at each other and felt silly . they realized that they had been stupid to think that there was something scary in the chimney . they thanked mr. brown and took a piece of cake .

they learned that chimneys were not for monsters or dragons , but for baking cakes . they also learned that they should not judge things by their looks , but by their tastes . mia and leo were best friends . they liked to play pretend and sing songs . one day , they found a big box in the garage . inside the box , there were many things to decorate with . there were shiny stars , colorful ribbons , and fluffy feathers . there was also a microphone that made their voices sound loud and funny .

" let 's decorate the box and make it our stage ! " mia said . " we can sing and dance and have a show ! "

" good idea ! " leo agreed . " but we need costumes too . what can we wear ? "

they looked around the garage and saw some old clothes and hats . they tried them on and laughed . mia wore a long dress and a big hat with flowers . leo wore a jacket and a tie and a hairy wig .

" you look like a princess ! " leo said to mia .

" you look like a rock star ! " mia said to leo .

they decorated the box with the stars , ribbons , and feathers . they made it look very pretty and bright . they put the microphone on top of the box and turned it on . they were ready to start their show .

" welcome to mia and leo 's show ! " mia announced . " we are going to sing some songs for you . are you ready ? "

" yes , we are ready ! " leo said . " but wait , we need an audience . who can we invite ? "

they thought for a moment . then they had an idea . they ran to the house and called their parents and their little brother . they asked them to come to the garage and watch their show .

" okay , we will be there in a minute ! " their parents said .

" yay , we have an audience ! " mia and leo said . they ran back to the garage and waited for their family .

soon , their parents and their little brother came to the garage . they saw the decorated box and the microphone and the costumes . they smiled and clapped .

" wow , you did a great job ! " their parents said . " we ca n't wait to see your show ! "

" thank you ! " mia and leo said . " we hope you like it ! "

they picked up the microphone and started to sing . they sang their favorite songs and made up some new ones . they danced and twirled and jumped . they had a lot of fun . their family watched and cheered and sang along . they had a lot of fun too .

mia and leo 's show was a big success . they were very happy and proud . they hugged their family and thanked them for coming . they decided to keep the box and the microphone and the costumes . they wanted to do more shows in the future . they were the best friends and the best performers ever . lily and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . they have a ball and a boot . the boot is black and big . they use the boot to kick the ball .

one day , they see a new boy in the park . his name is ben . he has a red bike and a blue hat . he looks at lily and tom and says , " can i play with you ? "

lily and tom say , " yes , you can play with us . we are kicking the ball with the boot . do you want to try ? "

ben says , " yes , i want to try . but why do you use a boot ? why do n't you use your feet ? "

lily and tom say , " because the boot is fun . and it makes the ball go far . and it makes a loud sound . do you hear ? "

ben says , " yes , i hear . but i think it is hard to kick with a boot . and it is dirty . and it smells bad . "

lily and tom say , " no , it is not hard . and it is not dirty . and it does not smell bad . it is our boot . we like it . and we are good at kicking with it . watch ! "

lily and tom take turns to kick the ball with the boot . they show ben how to do it . they say , " you have to hold the boot with your hand . and you have to swing your arm . and you have to aim at the ball . and you have to let go of the boot . and you have to say , ' boo ! ' "

ben says , " ok , i will try . but i do n't think i can do it . i think i will miss the ball . or i will hit myself . or i will lose the boot . "

lily and tom say , " no , you will not miss the ball . or hit yourself . or lose the boot . you will do it . you will improve . you will have fun . come on , try ! "

ben takes the boot from lily . he holds it with his hand . he swings his arm . he aims at the ball . he lets go of the boot . he says , " boo ! "

the boot flies in the air . it hits the ball . the ball goes far . ben smiles . he says , " wow , i did it ! i kicked the ball with the boot ! it was fun ! it made a loud sound ! i heard it ! "

lily and tom clap . they say , " good job , ben ! you did it ! you kicked the ball with the boot ! you improved ! you had fun ! you heard it ! "

ben says , " thank you , lily and tom ! you are nice friends ! you taught me how to kick with the boot ! can i play with you again ? "

lily and tom say , " yes , you can play with us again . we like to play with you . you are a good friend . you can use the boot anytime . but you have to say , ' boo ! ' "

ben says , " ok , i will say , ' boo ! ' can we play some more ? "

lily and tom say , " yes , we can play some more . let 's go get the ball and the boot . and let 's have fun ! "

the end . jen and tom were friends who liked to play in the snow . they made a big snowman with a hat and a scarf . they gave him a carrot nose and two buttons for eyes . they were very happy .

but then a mean boy came and kicked their snowman . he laughed and said , " your snowman is ugly and stupid . i do n't permit you to play here . this is my snow place . "

