they picked up some snowballs and threw them at the mean boy . the mean boy threw some back . they had a loud snow fight .

but the mean boy was bigger and stronger . he hit jen and tom with many snowballs . he knocked off their hats and scarves . he grabbed their mittens and ran away . he said , " ha ha , now you have no mittens . your hands will be cold and wet . you are losers . "

jen and tom cried and ran home . they told their mom what happened . their mom hugged them and said , " i 'm sorry , my darlings . that was a very mean boy . he should not have done that . you did nothing wrong . you are brave and good . "

but jen and tom still felt bad . they had no mittens . they had no snowman . they had no fun . they wished the mean boy would go away . they wished they had new mittens . they wished they had a happy ending . tim and sam are friends . they like to play pretend . today , they are superheroes . they have masks and capes . tim has a blue mask and a red cape . sam has an orange mask and a green cape .

