mia smiles and hugs tom . she reminds him to be careful with max . they go back to their toys and play softly . they do not want to disturb max . they are good friends to each other and to max . lily and tom were playing in the park . they saw a big hill with a hole in it . they were curious . they wanted to see what was inside the hole .

" let 's go in and look , " said lily .

