lily and tom nodded . they were not afraid anymore . they were curious .

they came out from behind the rock . they talked to bob . they played with his toys . they had fun .

they learned that bob was a good giant . he liked to tell stories and jokes . he liked to share his food and his things . he was happy to have friends .

lily and tom liked bob . they were glad they met him . they had a new friend . tim and mia like to play with blocks . they make towers and bridges and castles with the blocks . they have a lot of fun with the blocks .

one day , they decide to have a contest . they want to see who can make the highest tower with the blocks . they each take some blocks and start to build . they balance the blocks on top of each other , trying not to make them fall .

" look at my tower , mia ! " tim says . " it is very high and strong . i think i will win the contest . "

" mine is high too , tim , " mia says . " but i have fewer blocks than you . you have more blocks . that is not fair . "

tim shrugs . he does not want to share his blocks . he thinks he deserves to have more blocks . he is not generous . he wants to win the contest .

he adds one more block to his tower . it is very tall now . he smiles . he thinks he has won .

but then , a gust of wind blows . it makes tim 's tower wobble . tim gasps . he tries to hold his tower , but it is too late . the tower falls down . the blocks crash to the ground . tim cries .

mia looks at her tower . it is still standing . it is not as tall as tim 's tower , but it is stable . she smiles . she thinks she has won .

but then , she sees tim 's sad face . she feels sorry for him . she is generous . she does not want to make him feel bad .

she takes some of her blocks and goes to tim . she says , " here , tim . you can have some of my blocks . we can build a new tower together . we can both win . "

but tim is angry . he does not want mia 's blocks . he does not want to build with her . he thinks she is trying to make fun of him . he pushes her away . he says , " no , mia . go away . i do n't want to play with you . you are mean . "

