tim and mia do not play with blocks anymore . they do not play with each other anymore . they are not friends anymore . they are sad . lily and tom were going on vacation with their mom and dad . they were very happy to see the big plane and the blue sky . they wanted to find new things and have fun .

but when they got to the hotel , they saw that it was very expensive . mom and dad had to pay a lot of money for the room and the food . they looked sad and worried . lily and tom did not like that .

they decided to help their mom and dad . they asked them if they could find cheaper things to do . mom and dad smiled and said yes . they said they could go to the park , the beach , and the museum . they said they did not need to spend a lot of money to enjoy the vacation .

lily and tom were glad . they had a lot of fun at the park , the beach , and the museum . they saw many new things and learned many new words . they also made some new friends . they thanked their mom and dad for the vacation .

mom and dad hugged them and said they were proud of them . they said they were very smart and kind . they said the best thing about the vacation was being together as a family . they said they loved them very much .

the moral of the story is : you do not need to spend a lot of money to have a good vacation . you can find happiness in simple things and with the people you love . ben and mia were playing in the garden . they liked to make up poems and sing them to each other . ben had a red book with many poems in it . he read one to mia .

" roses are red , violets are blue , sugar is sweet , and so are you . "

mia smiled and clapped . she liked the poem . she wanted to make one too . she looked around and saw a yellow flower .

" sunflowers are yellow , grass is green , lemons are sour , and you are mean . "

