ben shook his head and walked away . he did not want to play with mia anymore . he felt sad and angry .

mia watched him go and felt sorry . she did not mean to make him upset . she liked ben . she wanted to be friends .

she ran after him and hugged him . she said she was sorry . she gave him a kiss .

