" peppers are red , cheese is white , pizza is spicy , and you are right . " tom and sam were brothers who liked to play in the garden . one day , they saw a big bottle with a red label . it had a picture of a skull and a cross . tom wanted to open the bottle and see what was inside . sam said , " no , tom , that is poison . it can make you sick or die . we should not touch it . mom and dad told us to stay away from it . "

but tom did not listen to sam . he was curious and naughty . he opened the bottle and smelled it . it smelled bad , like rotten eggs . he said , " i wonder how it tastes . maybe it is not so bad . " he put the bottle to his mouth and drank a little bit .

sam saw tom drink the poison and screamed , " tom , no ! you are silly ! you drank poison ! you need help ! " he ran to the house and called mom and dad . they came quickly and saw tom lying on the ground . he was pale and sweating . he was not moving . he looked scary .

mom and dad were very worried and angry . they called the doctor and took tom to the hospital . the doctor gave tom some medicine and made him throw up the poison . he said , " tom is lucky . he did not drink too much poison . he will be okay , but he needs to rest and drink a lot of water . he should never do that again . poison is dangerous and can kill you . "

tom learned his lesson . he was sorry for what he did . he said , " i am sorry , sam . i am sorry , mom and dad . i was stupid and foolish . i will never touch poison again . i will listen to you and be good . " sam hugged tom and said , " i am glad you are okay , tom . i love you , brother . you are not stupid , but you need to be careful and smart . poison is not a toy . it is scary and bad . " mom and dad hugged them both and said , " we love you , tom and sam . we are happy you are safe . you are good boys , but you need to be wise and obey . poison is not a joke . it is a serious matter . " tom and lily were brother and sister . they liked to play with their toys , but they did not like to clean them . they left their toys all over the floor , on the bed , and on the table . mom and dad were not happy . they said , " tom and lily , you need to clean your toys . we are going on vacation soon , and we want a clean house . "

tom and lily did not listen . they said , " we do n't want to clean . we want to play . cleaning is boring . " they kept playing with their toys and making a mess . mom and dad were sad and angry . they said , " tom and lily , this is your last chance . if you do n't clean your toys , you will not go on vacation with us . you will stay with grandma , who lives in a cold place . "

tom and lily did not believe them . they said , " you are joking . you will not leave us . we want to go on vacation with you . we want to see the sun , the sea , and the sand . " they kept playing with their toys and making a bigger mess . mom and dad were serious . they said , " tom and lily , we are sorry , but you have made your choice . you will not go on vacation with us . you will stay with grandma , who lives in a cold place . maybe you will learn to clean your toys there . "

the next day , mom and dad packed their bags and left for vacation . they said goodbye to tom and lily , who cried and begged . they said , " please , mom and dad , take us with you . we are sorry . we will clean our toys . we do n't want to stay with grandma , who lives in a cold place . " but it was too late . mom and dad said , " we love you , but you have to face the consequences of your actions . we hope you will have fun with grandma , who lives in a cold place . we will see you in a week . "

tom and lily stayed with grandma , who lived in a cold place . they did not have fun . they had to wear thick clothes , and they could not play outside . they had to help grandma with chores , and they had to clean their toys every day . they missed mom and dad , and they missed the sun , the sea , and the sand . they learned their lesson . they said , " we were wrong . we should have cleaned our toys . we should have listened to mom and dad . we will never make a mess again . "

the moral of the story is : you should clean your toys and listen to your parents , or you might miss out on something fun . sara and tom like to help their dad . their dad is a painter . he paints walls and doors and fences . he has many colors of paint .

one day , their dad is painting the fence in the garden . he asks sara and tom to help him . he gives them each a small brush and a can of paint . sara gets yellow paint and tom gets blue paint .

