" but our fence looks nice too , " tom says . " we made it colorful and fun . look at our flowers and stars and cars and planes . "

their dad smiles . he looks at their part of the fence . he sees the yellow and blue paint . he sees the shapes and pictures .

" you are right , tom , " he says . " your fence looks nice too . you are very creative and clever . thank you for helping me . "

he hugs sara and tom . they hug him back . they are happy . they like to help their dad . they like to paint . jack likes golf . he has a golf stick and a golf ball . he plays golf in the yard with his dad . his dad teaches him how to hit the ball far and straight .

one day , jack decides to play golf by himself . he takes his golf stick and his golf ball and goes to the yard . he sees a big tree with a hole in it . he thinks it would be fun to hit the ball into the hole . he puts the ball on the ground and swings his golf stick .

but he misses the ball . the golf stick flies out of his hand and hits the tree . the tree makes a loud noise . jack is scared . he hears a voice from the hole .

" who 's there ? who hit my tree ? " the voice says . it sounds angry and scary .

jack is anxious . he does not know who the voice is . he thinks it might be a monster or a witch . he runs to the house and tells his dad what happened .

his dad laughs . he says , " do n't worry , jack . that 's not a monster or a witch . that 's mr. owl . he lives in the hole . he likes to sleep during the day . you woke him up with your golf stick . he 's probably grumpy . "

jack feels better . he says , " i 'm sorry , mr. owl . i did n't mean to hit your tree . i was trying to play golf . "

his dad says , " why do n't you go back and say sorry to mr. owl ? maybe he 'll forgive you and let you play golf with him . "

jack nods . he takes his golf stick and his golf ball and goes back to the yard . he sees mr. owl 's head poking out of the hole . he looks sleepy and grumpy .

" hello , mr. owl , " jack says . " i 'm sorry i hit your tree . i was trying to play golf . do you like golf ? "

mr. owl blinks . he says , " golf ? what 's golf ? "

jack shows him his golf stick and his golf ball . he says , " golf is a game . you hit the ball with the stick and try to get it into a hole . it 's fun . "

mr. owl says , " a hole ? like my hole ? "

