mr. owl says , " sure , why not ? but you have to teach me how to play . i 've never played golf before . "

jack smiles . he says , " ok , mr. owl . i 'll teach you how to play . it 's easy and fun . "

mr. owl says , " all right , then . let 's play golf . "

jack and mr. owl become friends . they play golf together in the yard . jack teaches mr. owl how to hit the ball far and straight . mr. owl teaches jack how to see in the dark and fly . they have a lot of fun . they decide to play golf every day . lily was a big girl who liked to do things by herself . she was independent and did not need help from anyone . she could put on her shoes , brush her teeth , and choose her clothes . she liked to wear her red jacket because it was warm and bright .

one day , she went to the park with her mom and dad . they saw some other kids playing with a ball . lily wanted to join them and have fun . she ran to the ball and kicked it hard . the other kids looked at her and smiled .

" hi , i 'm lily . can i play with you ? " she asked .

