lily nodded . she liked soccer . she had watched it on tv with her dad . she knew how to kick and pass and score . she was good at it .

she played with the other kids for a long time . they had a lot of fun . they ran and laughed and cheered . lily made some new friends . she was happy .

when it was time to go home , lily 's mom and dad called her . she said goodbye to the other kids and ran to them . she gave them a big hug .

