lily smiled and put on her jacket . she held her mom 's and dad 's hands and walked home . she was happy and warm . she liked to be independent , but she also liked to join others and share . she had the best of both worlds . ben and mia are friends . they like to play in the park . they see a big slide . ben wants to go on the slide . he has an urge to slide fast . mia is not sure . she is careful . she does not like to fall .

ben says , " come on , mia . the slide is fun . do n't be scared . " he runs to the slide and climbs up . he sits on the top and smiles . he says , " look at me , mia . i am going to slide . " he pushes himself and slides down . he laughs and says , " whee ! "

mia watches ben . she thinks the slide looks fun , too . she wants to try . she walks to the slide and climbs up . she sits on the top and looks down . she feels a little scared . she says , " ben , i do n't know . the slide is high . what if i fall ? "

ben says , " you wo n't fall , mia . the slide is safe . just hold on and slide . i will catch you . " he stands at the bottom and holds out his arms . he says , " trust me , mia . you can do it . "

mia takes a deep breath . she holds on and slides . she slides fast and feels the wind . she says , " whee ! " she reaches the bottom and ben catches her . they hug and laugh . they are happy . they say , " that was fun . let 's do it again . "

they part and climb up the slide again . they slide down and catch each other . they play on the slide until it is time to go home . they say goodbye and wave . they are still friends . they will play on the slide again . lily and sam went to the zoo with mom and dad . they saw many animals , like lions , monkeys , and giraffes . lily liked the giraffes best , because they had long necks and spots . sam liked the monkeys best , because they made funny noises and jumped around .

then they came to the pond , where the hippos lived . the hippos were big and round , and had huge mouths and teeth . some of them were in the water , and some of them were on the land . lily and sam wanted to see them better , so they went closer to the fence .

" look , sam , that hippo is eating grass ! " lily said , pointing to a hippo that was munching on some green plants .

" wow , he must be hungry ! " sam said , watching the hippo chew .

but then they noticed another hippo , that was hiding behind a rock . he was smaller than the other hippos , and had a pink bow on his head . he looked shy and scared , and did not come out to play with the other hippos .

" who is that hippo , mom ? " lily asked , curious .

