" sure , but be gentle and quiet . she might be nervous , " mom said .

lily and sam walked slowly to the rock , and smiled at rosie . they said hello in soft voices , and told her their names . rosie peeked out from behind the rock , and saw their friendly faces . she saw the pink bow on lily 's hair , and felt a little braver . she came out a bit more , and said hello back . she told them her name , and said she liked their bows .

lily and sam were happy to make a new friend . they gave rosie some grass , and asked her if she wanted to play . rosie nodded , and followed them to the water . she splashed and swam with them , and had fun . she was not shy anymore , and she liked the zoo . lily and ben are playing in the park . they see a big , bright rainbow in the sky . they are very happy and want to keep the rainbow .

