" yay , yay ! " ben says . " thank you , mom ! "

they hug mom and the camera . they keep the photo of the rainbow . they hope to see another rainbow soon . anna loved her doll , lily . she took lily everywhere with her . she played with lily , fed lily , and hugged lily . lily was her best friend . lily was dependable . she always listened to anna and made her happy .

one day , anna went to the park with her mom . she saw some other kids playing with a ball . they looked like they were having fun . anna wanted to join them , but she was shy . she held lily tight and watched them from a bench .

" hi , what 's your name ? " a girl asked anna . she had curly hair and a friendly smile . she was holding a doll , too .

" i 'm anna . this is lily , " anna said , pointing to her doll .

