mia and ben are friends . they play with blocks and make towers and houses and cars and planes and boats and trains . they are very happy and creative . they do not worry . they have fun . lily and ben were twins who loved to eat waffles for breakfast . every morning , their mom would make them hot and crispy waffles with butter and syrup . they would eat them with eager smiles and sticky fingers .

