they finished their breakfast and got ready for their day . they wondered what other new things they would discover and enjoy . they were happy twins who loved to eat waffles . anna and ben are playing with their toys in the living room . they have many toys : cars , dolls , blocks , and books . they like to make stories with their toys and pretend they are in different places .

