anna and ben finish their lunch and drink their juice . they wipe their mouths and say thank you . then they run back to the living room and pick up their toys . they are happy and ready to play more . they have many stories to tell . anna liked to visit her grandma on the farm . she loved to see the animals and help with the chores . one day , her grandma said , " anna , i have a surprise for you . come with me to the barn . "

anna followed her grandma and saw a big box with holes in it . she heard a soft meow from inside . " what is it , grandma ? " she asked .

