her grandma repeated the same with the black kitten and the gray kitten . she told anna their names and personalities . the black kitten was called shadow and he was very shy and timid . he liked to hide and watch . the gray kitten was called smokey and he was very persistent and brave . he liked to explore and climb .

anna liked all the kittens , but she liked smokey the most . he was the smallest and the most adventurous . he tried to get out of the box and follow anna . he climbed on her shoulder and rubbed his head against her ear . he meowed and said , " i want to go with you , anna . you are my friend . "

