" because it is broken , lily . we ca n't ride on it today . we have to fix it first . " dad said .

" but i want to ride on the boat now ! " ben complained . he was sad and angry .

" i know , ben . but we ca n't . it is not safe . how about we play with the sand and the rocks instead ? " dad suggested .

lily and ben looked at the sand and the rocks . they saw some shells and some fish . they thought they looked fun .

" okay , dad . we can play with the sand and the rocks . maybe we can find some treasure . " lily said .

" maybe we can make a new boat with the rocks . " ben said .

they smiled and ran to the shore . they forgot about the dry boat . they had fun with the sand and the rocks . dad was happy to see them happy . he hoped to fix the boat soon . ben and mia were playing with their toy train . it was shiny and made of copper . they liked to make it go fast on the tracks . but sometimes the tracks broke and they had to fix them .

" look , ben , this track is loose , " mia said . she tried to push it back into place , but it did not work .

" let me try , " ben said . he grabbed the track and pulled hard . but he pulled too hard and the track snapped in two . he gasped and dropped the pieces .

" oh no , ben , you broke it ! " mia cried . she was sad and angry . she loved her toy train .

" i 'm sorry , mia , i did n't mean to , " ben said . he felt bad and scared . he did not want mia to be mad at him .

they heard a knock on the door . it was their mom . she came in and saw the broken track .

" what happened here ? " she asked .

" ben snapped the track , " mia said , pointing at him .

" mia , do n't blame ben . it was an accident , " mom said . she picked up the track and looked at it . " do n't worry , i can fix it . i have some glue and tape in the kitchen . come on , let 's go . "

she took ben and mia by the hand and led them to the kitchen . she found the glue and tape and mended the track . she gave it back to ben and mia .

" here you go , kids . good as new , " she said . " now , be careful with your toy train . it 's very old and fragile . it was mine when i was little . "

" really , mom ? " ben asked . he looked at the copper train with wonder .

" yes , really . and you know what ? it was my dad 's when he was little , too . it 's a family treasure , " mom said . she smiled and hugged ben and mia . " now , why do n't you play nicely together ? and maybe share some cookies with your chubby teddy bear . he looks hungry . "

ben and mia nodded and thanked mom . they went back to their room and played with their toy train . they made it go fast on the tracks , but not too fast . they did not want to break it again . they also gave some cookies to their chubby teddy bear . he was happy and so were they . ben and lily like to play with their ball in the park . they throw the ball to each other and catch it . sometimes they miss and the ball rolls away . they run after it and laugh .

one day , they see a big net in the park . it is hanging from a tree . it looks like a fun place to play . ben and lily run to the net and climb on it . they pretend they are birds or monkeys . they swing and jump on the net .

but the net is old and broken . it has holes and tears . ben and lily do not see them . they are too busy having fun . suddenly , the net rips and ben and lily fall to the ground . they cry out in pain and fear .

" are you okay ? " lily asks ben .

" i hurt my knee , " ben says . " it is bleeding . "

" i hurt my arm , " lily says . " it is bruised . "

they hug each other and cry . they wish they had not played on the net .

a lady who works in the park hears them and comes to help . she sees the broken net and the hurt children . she feels sorry for them . she takes them to a bench and gives them band - aids and ice packs . she tells them not to play on the net again . it is not safe .

" thank you , lady , " ben and lily say .

" you 're welcome , children , " the lady says . " next time , play with your ball . it is more fun and less dangerous . "

ben and lily nod and smile . they take their ball and go home . they learn their lesson . they do not play on the net again . they play with their ball and have fun . lily and ben were friends who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big boat on the pond . it was shiny and had a flag and a horn . they wanted to ride the boat , but there was a sign that said " only for big kids " .

lily and ben felt sad . they wished they were big kids . they saw a man who worked at the park . he had a hat and a whistle . they asked him , " can we ride the boat , please ? "

the man smiled and said , " sorry , little ones . the boat is not available for you . it is too fast and too loud . you might get scared or hurt . but you can play with these ducks . they are friendly and fun . here , take some bread and feed them . "

lily and ben looked at the ducks . they were fluffy and quacked . they decided to give them a try . they took some bread and threw it to the water . the ducks came and ate it . they made happy noises and followed lily and ben .

lily and ben had fun with the ducks . they forgot about the boat . they laughed and ran and marched with the ducks . they felt like they had their own parade . they thanked the man for the bread and the ducks .

the man said , " you 're welcome , little ones . you see , you do n't need the boat to have fun . you can enjoy what you have and make the best of it . that is a good lesson to learn . maybe when you are big kids , you can ride the boat . but for now , you can be happy with the ducks . "

lily and ben nodded and hugged the man . they agreed with him . they learned that they could have fun with what was available . they waved goodbye to the ducks and the boat . they went home with a smile . lily was a painter . she liked to make pictures with colors . she had many colors in her box . red , blue , yellow , green , and more . she used a brush to put the colors on paper .

but lily was lonely . she had no friends to play with . she lived in a big house with her mom and dad , but they were always busy . they did not have time to look at her pictures . they did not have time to hug her or talk to her .

one day , lily had a bad idea . she thought , maybe if i make pictures on the walls , they will see them . maybe they will like them and love me . she took her box of colors and her brush and went to the living room . she saw a big white wall . she smiled and started to paint .

she painted a big sun , a blue sky , a green grass , and some flowers . she painted a happy face and wrote " i love you " with red . she was having fun . she did not hear her mom and dad come home .

they saw the wall and they were very angry . they shouted at lily . they said , " what have you done ? you have ruined the wall ! you have made a mess ! you are a bad girl ! " they took away her box of colors and her brush . they sent her to her room .

lily cried and cried . she felt very sad and lonely . she wished she had never painted on the wall . she wished she had friends to play with . she wished her mom and dad loved her . she looked at the wall of her room . it was white and boring . she had no pictures to make her happy . she had nothing . tom and sue were friends who liked to play together . they had a calendar on the wall that showed the days of the week and the months of the year . they used stickers to mark the days when they had something special to do , like a birthday or a trip .

one day , tom and sue had a big fight . they wanted to put a sticker on the same day , but for different reasons . tom said it was his grandma 's birthday and he wanted to give her a hug . sue said it was the day of the circus and she wanted to see the clowns and the animals . they both wanted to use the same sticker , a shiny star .

they started to yell at each other and pull the sticker . they did not want to share or take turns . they did not listen to each other . they disagreed a lot .

their mom heard the noise and came to see what was wrong . she saw the torn sticker and the angry faces . she was not happy . she said they were being harsh and selfish . she said they had to apologize and make up . she said they had to learn to respect and compromise . she said they could both use the sticker if they cut it in half and put one half on each day .

tom and sue felt sorry for what they did . they said they were sorry and hugged each other . they cut the sticker in half and put one half on tom 's grandma 's birthday and one half on sue 's circus day . they smiled and looked at the calendar . they realized they had many more days to play and have fun together . they learned that disagreeing is okay , but fighting is not . they learned that friendship is more important than stickers . lila and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big bird in the sky . it is red and yellow and blue . it is very interesting .

" look , ben , a bird ! " lila says .

" wow , it is pretty ! " ben says .

they run after the bird . they want to see it better . the bird flies over the land . it goes to the trees and the flowers and the pond .

" come on , lila , let 's follow it ! " ben says .

they run and run . they do not see where they are going . they do not hear the cars and the bikes and the people .

" stop , stop ! " a voice says . it is mom . she is angry and scared . she runs after them .

" stop , lila , stop , ben ! " mom says . " you are in danger ! the road is not for playing ! the cars can hurt you ! i warn you , come back now ! "

lila and ben hear mom . they are sorry and scared too . they stop and turn around . they run back to mom . they hug her and say sorry .

" sorry , mom , we did not see the road , " lila says .

" sorry , mom , we only wanted to see the bird , " ben says .

mom is not angry anymore . she is happy they are safe . she hugs them and says it is okay .

" it is okay , lila , it is okay , ben , " mom says . " but you have to be careful . you have to look and listen when you play . you have to stay away from the road . do you understand ? "

lila and ben nod . they understand . they say they will be careful .

mom smiles . she says they can play in the park . but they have to stay with her . she says they can watch the bird from the bench . she says the bird is interesting . but they are more interesting to her . tom and lily are friends . they like to play with blocks . they have many blocks of different shapes and colors . they can make houses , cars , animals and more with the blocks .

one day , they want to make a big tower with the blocks . they start to stack the blocks on top of each other . they use squares , circles , rectangles and triangles . they have fun and work together .

but then , they have a problem . they have only one thick triangle left . they both want to use it for the top of the tower . they think it will look nice and strong .

tom says , " i want the thick triangle . it is mine . i saw it first . " lily says , " no , i want the thick triangle . it is mine . i need it more . " they start to pull and tug on the thick triangle . they are angry and sad .

the thick triangle breaks in half . the tower falls down . the blocks make a loud noise . tom and lily cry . they are sorry . they broke the thick triangle and the tower . they hug and say , " i am sorry . you are my friend . can we share the thick triangle and make a new tower ? " they nod and smile . they are happy again . they use the two halves of the thick triangle and make a new tower . it is not as big , but it is still nice and strong . they play with the blocks and have fun . they are friends . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to dig in the sand and find things . tom found a shiny stone . he showed it to lily .

" look , lily , i found a pretty stone . it is smooth and bright . do you want to see ? " tom said .

lily nodded . she took the stone from tom and looked at it . she liked it too . she wanted to keep it .

" can i have it , tom ? it is so nice . i want to make a necklace with it , " lily said .

tom shook his head . he wanted his stone back . he liked it more than lily .

" no , lily , it is mine . i found it first . give it back to me , " tom said .

lily did not listen . she ran away with the stone . tom ran after her . he was angry and sad .

" stop , lily , stop ! that is not fair . you are a bad friend . give me my stone ! " tom shouted .

lily did not stop . she ran faster . she thought she was clever . she had a plan . she put the stone in her mouth and chewed it . she thought tom would not want it anymore .

but the stone was hard and sharp . it hurt lily 's teeth and tongue . it made her bleed . she cried out in pain . she spit out the stone and the blood .

tom caught up with her . he saw what happened . he felt sorry for lily . he picked up the stone and threw it away . he did not want it anymore .

" lily , lily , are you okay ? why did you do that ? that was a bad idea . the stone was not for chewing . it was for looking . you are not intelligent . you are silly , " tom said .

lily sobbed . she felt sorry too . she wished she had not taken the stone . she wished she had been a good friend .

" tom , tom , i am sorry . i was wrong . i was greedy . i wanted the stone too much . i did not think . i was not intelligent . i was silly , " lily said .

tom and lily hugged . they said they were sorry . they wanted to be friends again . but they had to go to the doctor . lily had to fix her teeth and tongue . tom had to fix his heart . they learned a hard lesson . they never played with stones again . lily and ben are playing in the park . they see a lot of white birds on the grass . they are doves . lily and ben like doves . they are cute and soft .

" let 's gather some bread for the doves , " lily says . she has a bag of bread in her backpack . she takes out some pieces and breaks them into small bits .

