" thank you , doves , for being our friends , " ben says . he waves to the doves . lily waves too . they are happy . they love doves . tom and lily were playing in the garden . they liked to dig in the dirt and look for bugs . sometimes they found worms , beetles , or spiders . they put them in a jar and watched them .

one day , they saw a big bug flying near a flower . it had a long nose and thin wings . it made a loud buzzing sound .

" look , lily , a mosquito ! " tom said . " let 's catch it ! "

" no , tom , do n't ! " lily said . " mosquitoes are bad . they can bite you and make you itch . mommy warned us about them . "

but tom did not listen . he ran after the mosquito with his jar . he tried to trap it inside . the mosquito was fast and smart . it dodged tom 's jar and flew towards his arm . it landed on his skin and bit him .

" ow ! " tom cried . " it hurts ! "

lily ran to him and saw a red bump on his arm . she felt sorry for him . she took him to the house and gave him a band - aid . she also gave him a hug .

" next time , listen to me , tom , " she said . " and listen to mommy . she knows a lot of things . she is ancient . "

tom nodded . he learned his lesson . he did not like mosquitoes . he liked lily . she was his sister and his friend . he hugged her back . lily and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big bird in a tree . the bird has many colors and a long tail . it is a parrot .

" hello , bird ! " lily says . " can you talk ? "

the bird looks at lily and ben . it opens its beak and says , " hello , hello ! i can talk and sing ! "

lily and ben are very surprised . they clap their hands and laugh . they ask the bird to sing a song .

the bird nods and says , " i will sing a song , but you have to do something for me first . you have to find me some nuts . i am very hungry . "

lily and ben agree . they run around the park and look for nuts . they find some acorns , some peanuts , and some walnuts . they bring them to the bird .

" here you go , bird ! " ben says . " we found you some nuts . now , will you sing a song for us ? "

the bird takes the nuts and eats them . it makes a happy sound . it says , " thank you , thank you ! you are very kind . now , i will sing a song for you . listen carefully . "

the bird clears its throat and begins to sing . it sings a beautiful song that lily and ben have never heard before . it sings about the sky , the sun , the rain , and the rainbow . it sings with a sweet voice and a funny accent .

lily and ben are very glad . they listen to the song and smile . they think the bird is amazing . they join the bird and sing along . they have a lot of fun .

the end . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to eat candy and never ate healthy food . one day , her mom told her that eating healthy food was important to stay strong and healthy . lily did n't listen to her mom and kept eating candy .

one day , lily was playing with her toys outside when she saw a lot of traffic on the road . she wanted to cross the road to play with her friends , but the traffic was too much . she tried to run across the road , but a car almost hit her . luckily , she was safe , but she realized that she should have listened to her mom and eaten healthy food to stay strong .

from that day on , lily started eating healthy food and became strong and healthy . she even started to own her own garden where she grew fruits and vegetables . she learned that it 's important to listen to her mom and take care of her body , so she can stay safe and healthy . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she had a humble house with a big garden . yesterday , she went to the park to play with her friends . she had lots of fun swinging and sliding .

but when it was time to go home , lily 's friends said goodbye and left . lily felt sad because she missed them already . she walked home slowly , dragging her feet .

when she got home , her mom noticed that something was wrong . " what happened , lily ? " her mom asked . " i miss my friends , " lily replied with a sad face .

her mom smiled and said , " it 's okay to miss your friends , but remember that you can always call them or invite them over to play again . and next time , try to enjoy the moment and have fun , even if it 's just for a little while . " lily nodded and felt better . she realized that her mom was right and that she did n't have to feel sad all the time . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she lived in a house with her mommy and daddy . one day , they decided to visit a big mountain .

the mountain was very hard to climb , but lily was very excited . she put on her red shoes and started walking up the mountain . her mommy and daddy followed her .

when they reached the top , they saw a beautiful view . there were trees and flowers and birds . lily was so happy she started to dance . she loved visiting the mountain . once upon a time , there was a little boy named timmy . timmy was very scared of the dark . one night , he woke up and saw that his room was very dark . he called out , " mommy , i 'm scared ! "

his mommy came running into the room and said , " do n't be scared , timmy . i 'm here to protect you . " she turned on the light and timmy felt much better .

but then his mommy had to go back to bed . timmy felt lonely and scared again . he called out , " mommy , do n't leave me ! "

his mommy came back into the room and said , " i wo n't leave you , timmy . but you have to be brave . you can do it . " and with that , she left the room again .

timmy felt scared at first , but then he remembered what his mommy had said . he took a deep breath and ran to the light switch . he turned on the light and felt very proud of himself . from that day on , timmy was n't scared of the dark anymore . once upon a time , there was a big , tall tree in a field . the tree was so tall that it could see everything around it . the tree was happy in its field until one day , a strong wind blew and shook its branches . the tree was scared and started to yawn .

the wind kept blowing and blowing until the tree 's roots were pulled out of the soil . the tree tried to hold on , but it was too late . it fell to the ground with a loud thud . the tree was sad and did n't know what to do .

but then , some animals came to help the tree . a group of birds tweeted and chirped , and a family of rabbits dug a hole in the soil to help the tree 's roots grow again . the tree was grateful and happy once more . it realized that even though bad things can happen , there are always friends who can help . once upon a time , there was a kind girl named lily . she lived in a big city with her family . one day , they went on a walk and saw a big factory . it was very loud and had lots of smoke . lily 's dad told her that the factory made toys for kids to play with .

lily loved to balance on one foot and hop around . she tried to balance on a big rock but fell down . her mom told her to be careful and polite to others .

later , they went to the park and lily saw a boy who was sad because he lost his toy . lily felt bad for him and gave him one of her toys . the boy was happy and thanked her . lily felt good inside because she was polite and helped someone . once upon a time , there was a girl named lily who loved to dance . she wore a pretty skirt that twirled around when she moved . she practiced every day , but sometimes she felt frustrated when she could n't get a dance move right .

one day , lily had a big dance recital . she was nervous but excited to show everyone what she had been practicing . when she finished her dance , everyone in the audience started to applaud . lily felt so happy and proud of herself .

after the recital , lily 's mom took her out for ice cream to celebrate . lily twirled around in her skirt , feeling like a true dancer . she knew that even when she felt frustrated , she could keep practicing and get better . and maybe one day , she would dance on a big stage again and hear the applause once more . once upon a time , there was a boy named timmy . timmy was very excited to go to the park with his mom . he put on his cool red shoes and waited by the door . but his mom was delayed because she could n't find her keys . timmy was sad that they could n't go to the park right away .

while they waited , timmy 's mom decided to stitch a hole in timmy 's favorite teddy bear . timmy watched as his mom carefully sewed the stitch in the bear 's belly . he was happy that his bear was fixed and hugged it tightly .

finally , timmy 's mom found her keys and they went to the park . timmy ran and played with his friends , and his bear watched from the sidelines . timmy was happy that he got to go to the park , and he was even happier that his bear was fixed . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . one day , lily 's mommy gave her a big package . lily was so happy ! she opened the package and inside was a shiny new toy .

lily loved her new toy so much that she started to clap her hands . clap , clap , clap ! but then , lily felt something strange . her hands were getting icy cold !

