lily felt better knowing that her mommy loved her and wanted to make her happy . her mommy glued the doll back together , and even though it was n't perfect , lily was still happy to have her doll back . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily who loved to make crafts . one day , she found some pretty stickers and wanted to put them on her notebook . she got some glue and started to stick them on . but then , she accidentally spilled the glue all over her notebook . she tried to cover it up with more stickers , but it did n't work .

lily 's mommy came in and saw what happened . she got angry because the glue ruined the notebook . lily felt sad and did n't know what to do . she tried to take the stickers off , but they would n't come off . in the end , lily had to throw away her favorite notebook . she learned to be more careful with glue and to ask for help when she needs it . once upon a time , there was a little spider named itsy . itsy lived in a big , old house with lots of cobwebs . she liked to spin her webs in the corners of the rooms . one day , itsy saw a fly buzzing by . she wanted to catch the fly , so she spun a sticky web to trap it .

but the fly was too fast and itzy 's web did n't catch it . the fly flew away and itsy felt sad . suddenly , a kind butterfly flew by and said , " do n't be bitter , little spider . the fly will pass by again soon . "

itsy felt better and waited patiently . and sure enough , the fly passed by again and this time , itsy 's web caught it . she was so happy and grateful to the butterfly for passing by and giving her kind words . from that day on , itsy knew that good things would come to her if she waited patiently and trusted her friends . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to eat candy and play with her toys . one day , she went to her friend 's house for a party . they were going to celebrate her friend 's birthday !

lily was so excited to taste the cake her friend 's mom made . it was chocolate with lots of frosting on top . but before they could eat the cake , they had to clean up the playroom . it was filthy with toys everywhere !

after they cleaned up , they sang " happy birthday " to lily 's friend and ate the delicious cake . lily had so much fun at the party that she did n't want to go home . she could n't wait to celebrate her own birthday with all her friends too ! once upon a time , there was a boy named timmy who loved playing hockey . he had a cool blue helmet and a shiny stick . one day , timmy 's mom took him to the hockey rink to play with his friends . timmy was so excited to play that he could n't stop talking about it .

as they arrived at the rink , timmy saw his friends skating on the ice . he ran to join them , but as soon as he stepped on the ice , he fell down . his friends laughed , but timmy did n't mind . he got up and kept playing .

after a while , timmy 's team scored a goal and they all cheered . but then , timmy 's friend billy fell down and started to weep . timmy went to comfort him and said , " do n't worry , billy . it 's just a game . we can play again tomorrow . "

the game continued and timmy 's team won . as they left the rink , timmy 's mom said , " i 'm proud of you , timmy . you played well and you were a good friend to billy . " timmy smiled and said , " thanks , mom . hockey is cool , but having friends is even cooler . " once upon a time , there was a little boy named timmy . timmy wanted to find some pretty flowers to give to his mommy . so , he went outside to gather some flowers . he looked all around the yard and found some red , yellow , and blue flowers . timmy was so happy !

but then , he saw a big dog . the dog was the guard of the yard . timmy did n't know the dog and he was scared . he did n't know if the dog was friendly or not . the dog barked at timmy , but then he saw that timmy was just gathering flowers . the dog wagged his tail and let timmy go .

timmy was relieved and happy that the guard dog was friendly . he went back to his mommy and gave her the pretty flowers . she was so proud of her little boy ! timmy felt good knowing that he gathered the flowers and made his mommy happy . once upon a time , there was a boy named timmy . timmy loved to ride his bike all around the town . one day , he saw some kids playing basketball in the park . timmy wanted to play too , so he asked if he could join . the kids were friendly and said yes .

timmy had never played basketball before , but he tried his best . he dribbled the ball and shot it towards the hoop . he did n't make it the first time , but the friendly kids cheered him on . timmy tried again and this time , the basketball went right through the hoop !

after playing basketball , timmy rode his bike back home . he was so happy that he made new friends and learned a new game . from that day on , timmy would ride his bike to the park every day to play basketball with his friendly friends . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved going to the zoo with her mommy and daddy . one day , she saw a big elephant and a nosy monkey .

" mommy , look at the monkey ! he 's so nosy ! " lily said .

" yes , he is . but look over there , lily . they 're having a race ! " mommy said , pointing to the zebras .

lily watched as the zebras ran as fast as they could . " wow , they 're so fast ! " she said .

after the race , lily and her family went to see the lions . " roar ! " the lions said . " they 're so loud ! " lily said , holding onto her mommy 's hand .

it was a fun day at the zoo for lily and her family . they saw lots of animals and even watched a race . lily could n't wait to come back again . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . one day , she went to the store with her mommy . her mommy gave her some money to buy candy . lily was so happy !

when they got home , lily 's mommy started to cook dinner . lily watched as her mommy made spaghetti . it smelled so good ! lily said , " mommy , i 'm sleepy . " her mommy said , " okay , lily . you can go take a nap . "

after her nap , lily woke up and saw that dinner was ready . she sat down at the table and ate her spaghetti . it was delicious ! lily said , " mommy , you 're the best cook ever ! " her mommy smiled and said , " thank you , lily . " once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily who loved to explore in the woods . one day , she found a mushroom that looked very different from the others she had seen before . it was big and red with white spots . she thought it looked mysterious .

lily picked up the mushroom and brought it home to show her mom . her mom questioned where she found it and if it was safe to touch . lily told her mom all about her adventure in the woods and how she found the mysterious mushroom .

her mom looked at the mushroom and said it was too dangerous to eat . lily was sad that she could n't try it , but her mom promised they could go on more adventures in the woods to find other mysterious things . from that day on , lily loved to question and explore the world around her . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she had long hair that reached down to her toes . one day , her mom said it was time for a haircut . lily was scared because she did n't want her hair to break . but her mom promised that it would n't hurt and that she would still look pretty .

