the end . tom and lily were twins who liked to play together . they had many toys , but their favorite was a big red ball . they would roll it , bounce it , and kick it in the yard . they never wanted to share it with anyone else .

one day , their mom said they had to go to grandma 's house for a visit . she told them to pack some clothes and a toy . tom and lily both wanted to take the big red ball , but there was only one . they started to fight over it , pulling and pushing and yelling .

" stop it , you two ! " mom said . " you ca n't both take the ball . you have to separate it . one of you can take the ball , and the other can take something else . "

tom and lily looked at each other . they both wanted the ball , but they also loved each other . they did n't want to make mom upset . they decided to take turns . tom said he would take the ball first , and lily said she would take it next .

they packed their bags and got in the car . mom drove them to grandma 's house , which was far away . it was cold outside , and the sky was gray . tom and lily hugged the ball in their laps , feeling warm and happy .

when they got to grandma 's house , they ran inside to say hello . grandma was very happy to see them . she gave them cookies and milk , and asked them what they wanted to do . tom and lily said they wanted to play with the ball in the yard .

" okay , but be careful , " grandma said . " it might rain soon . and do n't forget to share the ball . "

tom and lily nodded and ran outside . they played with the ball for a while , rolling it , bouncing it , and kicking it . they had a lot of fun . then , it was time to switch . tom gave the ball to lily , and lily gave him a hug .

" thank you , tom , " lily said . " you are a good brother . "

" you 're welcome , lily , " tom said . " you are a good sister . "

they smiled and continued to play . but then , they heard a loud thunder . they looked up and saw dark clouds . it started to rain . they ran back to the house , holding the ball .

they got inside and dried themselves . they put the ball on the floor , next to their bags . they went to the living room , where grandma was waiting for them . she had a surprise for them . she had two new toys : a blue car and a pink doll .

" look what i got for you , tom and lily , " grandma said . " these are for you to keep . you do n't have to share them . you can play with them whenever you want . "

tom and lily were very happy . they thanked grandma and hugged her . they took their new toys and played with them . they also played with each other , and with the ball . they had a wonderful time at grandma 's house . they learned that it was good to separate things sometimes , but it was also good to share them . they also learned that they loved each other very much , and that made them happy . sara and tom were playing in the park . they liked to swing and slide and run . they saw a big white dog near the fence . the dog was barking loud and showing its teeth .

" look , a dog ! " sara said . " can we pet it ? "

" no , sara , it is not a nice dog . it is angry and scary . stay away from it , " tom said .

but sara did not listen . she wanted to touch the white fur . she walked close to the fence . the dog saw her and jumped . it tried to bite her hand .

sara screamed . she was fearful . she ran back to tom . tom hugged her and said , " are you okay , sara ? that was a bad dog . you should not go close to it . "

sara nodded . she was sorry . she said , " i am okay , tom . thank you for helping me . you are a good friend . i will not go close to bad dogs again . "

they went to find their mom . she gave them a snack and a kiss . she said , " i am glad you are safe , sara and tom . you should always be careful with dogs you do not know . some of them are not friendly . you should always ask before you pet them . "

sara and tom agreed . they learned a lesson . they finished their snack and played some more . they had fun in the park . they did not go close to the white dog again . lila and ben were playing in the park . they saw a big jet in the sky . it was white and shiny . it made a loud noise .

