" look , ben , i made a jet ! " lila said . " we can pretend to fly in it . come on , get in . "

ben was happy . he crawled into the box with lila . they sat on the floor and pretended to be pilots . they made noises like the jet engine and the radio .

" hello , this is lila and ben . we are flying in our jet . we are going to the moon . over , " lila said .

" hello , this is the moon . we are waiting for you . you are very charming pilots . over , " ben said .

they laughed and had fun . they tried to fly in their jet . they used their imagination . they were happy . sam and mia were hungry . they wanted to eat pizza for dinner . but mom said no . she said pizza was not good for them . she said they had to eat soup and salad .

sam and mia did not like soup and salad . they made faces and said yuck . they did not want to eat their dinner . they wanted to eat pizza .

