one day , mom says they have to go to grandma 's house for a visit . tom and lily are not happy . they want to stay home and play on the couch . they say no to mom and cry and whine . mom is sad and angry . she says they have to go and be nice to grandma .

at grandma 's house , tom and lily are bored . grandma has no toys , no couch , no tv . she only has a small chair , a fat cat , and some books . tom and lily sit on the floor and pout . they do not talk to grandma or the cat . they miss their couch and their toys .

