she gave the doll back to jill . jill looked at her doll and saw that her head was on her neck . she was very happy and said , " thank you , mom . you are so fair . you made my doll good again . i love you and i love my doll . " she kissed her mom and her doll and ran to her room . she played with her doll and brushed her hair . she was glad that her doll was not broken anymore . she and her doll had a lot of fun . lily was a little cat who lived in a big house with a mean dog . the dog liked to chase lily and bark at her . lily was scared of the dog and wanted to escape . one day , she saw a window open in the kitchen . she jumped on the table and ran to the window . she looked outside and saw a garden with flowers and birds . she wanted to go there and be safe .

she jumped out of the window and landed on the grass . she felt the sun on her fur and the breeze on her whiskers . she smelled the flowers and heard the birds . she was happy and free . she ran and played in the garden . she saw a butterfly and followed it . she saw a pond and drank some water . she saw a tree and climbed it . she saw a bird 's nest and peeked inside . she saw four baby birds and their mother . the mother bird was kind and did not peck lily . she let lily look at her babies and sing with them .

lily liked the garden and the birds . she did not want to go back to the house and the dog . she wanted to stay in the garden and be safe . she decided to make a new home in the tree . she found some leaves and twigs and made a cozy bed . she curled up and took a nap . she dreamed of butterflies and flowers . she was happy and free . she had escaped . lily and ben are friends . they like to play together . today they go to the park with their moms . they see a big tent . there is music and people inside .

