sara and ben nodded . they understood a little bit . they said sorry to mom and dad . they said they would only look , not touch . they still liked the museum , but they also liked their toys and books and pets . they decided to touch and rub them when they got home . anna loves cream . she likes to eat it with cake , or fruit , or just by itself . she thinks cream is very yummy and sweet . but cream is expensive . her mom and dad do not have a lot of money . they can only buy cream sometimes , as a treat .

