they took the ball and ran to the grass . they played with the ball and had fun . they were quiet and happy . mom smiled and watched them . she was proud of them . tom was a clumsy frog . he liked to hop , but he often fell into the mud or bumped into trees . his friends laughed at him and called him silly . tom felt sad and wished he could hop better .

one day , he met a wise owl in the forest . the owl said , " i can help you , tom . i know a magic spell that can make you hop very high and fast . but you have to do something for me first . you have to find a shiny stone and bring it to me . "

