they laughed and roared together . they were not scared anymore . they were jolly again . they had each other , and they were safe . they were happy . tom and jen were friends . they liked to play with toys . they had a big box of toys . they had cars , dolls , blocks , and a missile . the missile was red and shiny . it had a button on it . tom and jen did not know what the button did .

