" but they are so pretty and shiny . i want them , " tom said . he was not happy with his mom 's answer .

he waited until his mom was looking at some flowers . then he ran to the fountain and reached his hand inside . he grabbed a handful of coins and tried to pull them out .

but he did not see an elderly lady sitting on a bench near the fountain . she saw what tom was doing and she was not happy . she got up and walked to tom . she grabbed his arm and made him drop the coins .

" hey , you little thief ! what do you think you are doing ? those coins are not yours . you should be ashamed of yourself . how would you feel if someone took your toys or your candy ? " she scolded him .

