tom nodded and sniffled . he felt sorry for what he did . he learned that he should not take other people 's things and he should resist the temptation . he said sorry to his mom and the lady . he promised to be a good boy from now on . he learned a valuable lesson that day . ben and lily are friends . they like to play in the park . they see a big bush with red berries . they want to eat the berries . they are hungry .

