the snake saw tom and was angry . it hissed and rattled its tail . it made a lot of noise . it said , " go away , boy , go away . this is my home . you are not welcome . if you follow me , i will bite you . "

tom heard the snake and was scared . he said , " oh , no , the snake is noisy and mean . it wants to bite me . i made a mistake . i should have listened to sue . " he ran back to sue .

sue hugged tom and said , " i 'm glad you are safe , tom . next time , do n't touch the snake . do n't follow things that might hurt you . listen to your friends . they want to help you . "

tom said , " i 'm sorry , sue . you were right . i was wrong . i will listen to you next time . thank you for being my friend . "

the end .

moral value : listen to your friends and do n't follow things that might hurt you . anna and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . they see a big swing . anna wants to go on the swing . ben wants to go on the swing too .

" can i go first ? " anna asks .

" no , i want to go first ! " ben says .

they start to push and pull . they do not behave . they make a lot of noise .

" stop ! " a voice says . it is mom . she is not happy . she sees anna and ben fighting .

" you need to share and take turns , " mom says . " if you do not behave , you can not play on the swing . "

anna and ben feel sorry . they say sorry to each other . they say sorry to mom .

" can we play on the swing now ? " anna asks .

" yes , but you have to be nice and fair , " mom says .

anna and ben nod . they go to the swing . they take turns . they push each other gently . they feel the smooth air on their faces . they smile and laugh . they behave . they have fun . anna and ben were playing outside after the rain . they liked to jump in the puddles and splash each other . they saw a big puddle near the fence . it looked very fun .

" let 's jump in that puddle ! " ben said .

" ok ! " anna said .

they ran to the puddle and jumped in . but the puddle was not water . it was mud . it was brown and sticky and smelly . it was disgusting .

" yuck ! " anna said . " this is not a puddle . this is mud . "

" yuck ! " ben said . " this is gross . let 's get out . "

they tried to get out , but the mud was too deep . they were stuck . they started to cry .

" help ! " anna said . " help ! "

" help ! " ben said . " help ! "

a man heard them and came to the fence . he saw them in the mud . he had a rope . he threw the rope to them .

" grab the rope ! " he said . " i will pull you out . "

anna and ben grabbed the rope . the man pulled them out . they were covered in mud . they were very thankful .

" thank you , mister ! " anna said .

" thank you , mister ! " ben said .

" you 're welcome , " the man said . " but next time , be careful where you jump . not all puddles are water . some are mud . and mud is disgusting . "

anna and ben nodded . they learned their lesson . they had to trust their eyes and not jump in anything that looked like a puddle . they had to be safe and smart . they said goodbye to the man and went home to wash . they never jumped in a mud puddle again . ben and lily were playing with blocks . they wanted to make a big stack of blocks . but they did not agree on how to do it .

