they were both angry and did not want to play anymore .

then they saw a hairy cat . the cat was walking on the floor . it saw the blocks and was curious . it sniffed the blocks and pushed them with its paw . it made a new stack of blocks . it was a mix of red and blue and green blocks .

the cat looked at ben and lily and meowed . it seemed to say , " look at my stack . it is better than yours . "

ben and lily looked at the cat and its stack . they felt silly . they realized that they did not have to agree on everything . they could share and make different stacks .

they smiled at the cat and at each other . they said , " sorry , cat . sorry , friend . "

they picked up some blocks and joined the cat . they made more stacks of blocks . they had fun . they agreed to disagree . lily and max were playing in the kitchen . they liked to pretend they were chefs and make yummy food . they used pots and pans and spoons and bowls . they also used some fruits and vegetables that mommy gave them .

