they went to mommy , who was reading a book on the couch . " mommy , can we have a knife to cut the banana ? " they asked .

" sure , but only a small one . and you have to use it on the cutting board , not on the table or the floor . and you have to wash it when you are done , " mommy said .

she gave them a small knife and a cutting board . they thanked her and went back to the kitchen .

they put the banana on the cutting board and cut it into slices . they ate some and put some in a bowl . they looked around for more things to add to their bowl .

" hey , lily , what is in that cabinet ? " max asked . he pointed to a tall cabinet next to the fridge . it had a lock on it .

