he took out a bottle and shook it . it made a sound . he opened it and smelled it . it smelled bad . he made a face .

" yuck , this is not food . this is medicine . mommy takes it when she is sick , " he said .

he put the bottle back and took out a jar . it had a picture of a flower on it . he opened it and saw a cream . he touched it and rubbed it on his hand . it felt soft and smooth .

" ooh , this is nice . this is lotion . mommy puts it on her skin to make it soft , " he said .

he gave the jar to lily and took out a box . it had a picture of a cake on it . he opened it and saw a powder . he tasted it . it tasted sweet .

