he poured some sugar in the bowl with the banana . he gave the box to lily and took out another bottle . it had a picture of a lemon on it . he opened it and saw a liquid . he poured some in the bowl with the sugar and the banana .

" look , lily , i made a drink . do you want some ? " he asked .

" ok , but be careful . it might be sour , " lily said .

they took two spoons and dipped them in the bowl . they put the spoons in their mouths and tasted the drink .

they both made a face and spit it out . it was sour and bitter and awful .

" blech , this is not a drink . this is vinegar . mommy uses it to clean things , " max said .

they threw the bowl in the sink and rinsed their mouths with water . they felt sick .

they heard mommy coming to the kitchen . they saw her face . she looked angry .

" what are you doing ? why did you open the cabinet ? do n't you know these things are not for kids ? they are dangerous . you could have hurt yourselves , " mommy said .

she took them off the chairs and hugged them . she checked them for any signs of harm . she was relieved they were ok .

