sara nods and smiles . she remembers that mom has a box of batteries in the kitchen . she runs to get one , while tom waits with the cars . she comes back with a new battery and gives it to tom . he puts it in her car and closes the door . he hands her the remote control and says , " try it now , sara . "

sara pushes the button and her car comes to life . it makes a loud noise and moves on the track . she makes it jump over the gaps and loops , just like tom 's car . she laughs and says , " thank you , tom . you are a good brother . our cars are adorable . they are so much fun ! " anna and ben are twins . they like to travel with their mom and dad . they have a big car that can go very fast . sometimes they go to the beach , or the park , or the zoo .

one day , they travel to the farm . they want to see the cows , and the pigs , and the chickens . they are very happy and excited . they sing songs in the car .

