they get their bags and follow the man to the truck . they climb inside and buckle up . the man hooks their car to the truck and starts the engine . the truck moves slowly and pulls their car along .

anna and ben look at their car . they hope it can be fixed soon . they still want to go to the farm . but they are also glad that they are safe and that someone helped them . they smile and hug mom and dad . they know that they will travel again , and have fun , and see new things . ben and mia are twins . they like to play with their toys . but sometimes they make a big mess . mom says they have to sort their toys and put them away .

