they start to pull the ugly doll . they yell and cry . mom hears them and comes upstairs . she sees the ugly doll and says , " stop ! this is not your toy or my toy . this is grandma 's toy . she gave it to me when i was little . it is very old and special . you have to be gentle with it . "

