they hug mom and the ugly doll . then they finish sorting their toys and put them away . they go downstairs and have lunch . they are happy . tom and sam were brothers . they liked to play outside with their ball . but one day , they saw a big boot on the grass . it was their dad 's boot . he left it there when he came home from work .

