tom and sam looked at each other . they did not know what to say . they were in trouble . tom and mia are playing in the yard . they see a big tree with many leaves . tom says , " let 's make a fort with the leaves . " mia says , " yes , that sounds fun . "

they start to gather the leaves and pile them up . they make a big mound of leaves and a small hole to crawl in . they pretend they are in a secret hideout .

but then , they hear a loud noise . it is dad with an axe . he is chopping some wood for the fire . he does not see tom and mia in the leaves . he swings the axe and hits the mound .

