dad is surprised and sorry . he says , " oh , i 'm so sorry , kids . i did n't know you were there . i thought it was just a messy pile of leaves . are you okay ? "

tom and mia nod . they are not hurt , but they are sad . dad says , " i 'm sorry i spoiled your fun . how about we make a new fort together ? i can carry some wood and you can carry some leaves . we can make it stronger and bigger . "

tom and mia smile . they say , " okay , dad . that sounds nice . we forgive you . "

they hug dad and then they start to work on their new fort . they have fun and they are careful with the axe . lily was sad . she had a big cut on her lip . it hurt when she talked or smiled . she did not want to play with her toys or read her books . she just wanted to lie on her bed and cry .

mama came to see lily . she saw the cut on her lip and said , " oh , my poor baby . how did you hurt your lip ? " lily told her that she fell off her bike and hit her mouth on the ground . mama hugged her and said , " i 'm sorry , lily . that must have been very scary and painful . but you are brave and strong . your lip will heal soon . do you want me to help you ? "

lily nodded . mama went to the bathroom and came back with a wet cloth and a band - aid . she gently cleaned the cut on lily 's lip and put the band - aid on it . she said , " there . now your lip is protected from dirt and germs . the band - aid will support your lip and make it feel better . it also has a picture of a unicorn on it . do you like unicorns , lily ? "

lily smiled a little and said , " yes , mama . i like unicorns . they are pretty and magical . thank you for the band - aid . it is useful and nice . " mama smiled back and said , " you 're welcome , lily . i love you very much . do you feel better now ? " lily said , " yes , mama . i feel better . can i hug you ? " mama said , " of course , lily . you can hug me anytime . come here , my sweet girl . " mama and lily hugged and kissed . lily felt happy and safe in mama 's arms . she said , " mama , you are the best . you always support me and make me feel better . i love you , mama . " mama said , " i love you too , lily . you are the best , too . you always make me proud and happy . you are my sunshine . " mama and lily cuddled on the bed and read a story about a unicorn and a princess . lily forgot about her cut lip and enjoyed the story . she was glad that mama was there for her . she knew that mama would always support her , no matter what . sara and tom are twins . they like to play outside in the snow . they make a big snowman with a hat and a scarf . they give him a carrot nose and two buttons for eyes .

but tom is not happy . he complains a lot . he says his hands are cold and wet . he says his mitten is too small and has a hole . he says he wants to go inside and have hot chocolate .

sara is smart . she knows how to make tom feel better . she says , " look , tom , our snowman is lonely . he needs a friend . why do n't we make another snowman for him ? we can use your mitten as his hat . it will keep him warm and cozy . "

tom thinks for a moment . he likes the idea . he says , " okay , sara , let 's do that . maybe my mitten will be happy too . and then we can go inside and have hot chocolate . "

sara and tom work together . they roll another big ball of snow and put it on top of the first one . they use tom 's mitten as a hat and find a stick for a mouth . they name him bob and put him next to their first snowman .

they look at their snowmen and smile . they are proud of their work . they say , " hello , bob . hello , snowman . we hope you like your hats and scarves . you are our friends . "

then they run inside and have hot chocolate . they are warm and happy . they do not complain anymore . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play in the park with their toys . one day , they found a yellow bell on the ground . it was shiny and made a nice sound .

