they hugged and smiled . they decided to share the broken bell and play together . they were best friends again . tom and sue like to play with maps . they have many maps of different places . they like to look at the pictures and colors on the maps . they also like to add stickers to the maps . they have stickers of animals , cars , stars and more .

one day , they find a new map in a box . it is a map of a big park . the map is black and white . there are no pictures or colors on the map . tom and sue are curious . they want to make the map more fun .

