sue nods . she takes out a sheet of stickers . she picks a yellow duck sticker . she puts it on the map . " look , this is the pond in the park . the duck can swim in the pond . "

tom and sue smile . they like their map . they add more stickers to the map . they add blue birds , green trees , pink flowers and more . they make the map colorful and happy .

they show their map to their mom . she looks at the map . she smiles too . she likes their map . she says , " you did a great job , tom and sue . you made the map more fun . you are very creative . " tom and sue hug their mom . they are proud of their map . they hang their map on the wall . they like to look at their map . they like to play with maps . tom was a shy boy who did not like to talk to other kids . he liked to play with his cars and trucks in his room . he had a big red truck that he loved very much . he called it big red .

one day , tom was sick and had to stay in bed . his mom gave him a pill to make him feel better . she said he had to swallow it with water . tom did not like pills . they were hard and bitter . he hid the pill under his tongue and pretended to drink the water .

his mom left him alone and said she would come back later . tom spit out the pill and put it on his nightstand . he did not want to take it . he wanted to play with big red . he reached for his truck , but he knocked over the pill . it rolled off the nightstand and under the bed .

tom got out of bed and crawled under the bed to find the pill . he saw a lot of dust and some old toys , but no pill . he heard his mom coming back . he was afraid she would be angry if she saw he did not take the pill . he crawled deeper under the bed , hoping she would not see him .

" tom , are you awake ? " his mom asked . she opened the door and saw his empty bed . she saw the glass of water and the pill on the floor . she frowned . she looked under the bed and saw tom 's feet . she bent down and pulled him out . " tom , why did you disturb the pill ? you have to take it to get well . it 's not a toy , you know . "

tom felt ashamed . he did not mean to disturb the pill . he just wanted to play with big red . he looked at his mom and said in a small voice , " i 'm sorry , mom . i do n't like pills . they are yucky . "

his mom hugged him and said , " i know , sweetie . but they are good for you . they help you fight the germs that make you sick . how about this ? if you take the pill now , i will let you play with big red for a little while . ok ? "

tom nodded . he took the pill and swallowed it with water . it was still hard and bitter , but he did not spit it out . he wanted to make his mom happy . he wanted to play with big red . he smiled and said , " thank you , mom . can i have big red now ? "

his mom smiled and said , " of course , honey . here you go . but do n't forget to rest , too . you need to sleep to get well . i love you , tom . "

she gave him big red and kissed him on the forehead . she left him alone and closed the door . tom hugged big red and played with him on his bed . he felt a little better . he did not disturb the pill anymore . he was a good boy . lily and sam are twins . they live in a big city with many cars , buildings and people . they like to go to the park and play with their ball and their dog . they also like to ride the bus and see different things .

