sue learned that it 's important to take care of her things , so they do n't get lost . the bird learned to ask before taking something that is n't theirs . and they both learned that saying sorry and forgiving can make new friends . once upon a time , there was a little girl named amy . she was restless and always wanted to learn new things . one day , she saw a big book on a shelf . it was a dictionary . she wanted to look at it , but it was too high for her to reach .

