they hugged their mom and dad and smiled . they were not bored and tired anymore . they were happy and excited . they liked the planes . they could not wait to fly in the big plane and see the clouds and the birds . lila and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big dog . the dog is brown and has a long tail . the dog is not happy . it barks and growls at them .

