they learned that dad was very good at making things and that they could be too . they also learned to respect other people 's belongings and to keep them clean . they had fun playing pirates with their skull , but they also loved their dad more . lila was a curious girl who liked to explore . one day , she saw a well in the field near her house . she wondered what was inside the well and how deep it was . she decided to go closer and look .

