lila nodded and smiled too . she liked the idea of having a frog friend . she took her mommy 's hand and walked back to the well . she hoped the frog was still there and wanted to play with her . lily and ben were friends who liked to play together . they had many toys , but their favorite was a red cap with a star on it . they took turns wearing the cap and pretending to be superheroes .

