lily felt happy and proud . she thanked the lady and gave her another hug . she held the flower and smiled . she had a wonderful day . she had seen a beautiful show . she had met a kind dancer . she had received a nice compliment . she had learned a new word . she had found a new dream . she had a lot of surprises . ben and mia like to play with blocks . they build towers and houses and bridges . sometimes they knock them down and start again . they have fun together .

