they took the book and went to grandma 's room . grandma was sitting on her bed , knitting a scarf . she smiled when she saw them .

" hello , my dears . what do you have there ? " she asked .

sara and ben showed her the book . they whispered , " grandma , can you read this book for us ? we found it in the attic . it is very old and interesting . "

grandma looked at the book and gasped . she recognized it . it was her father 's book . he was a writer and a traveler . he wrote stories about his adventures in faraway lands . he gave the book to grandma when she was a little girl .

" where did you find this book ? " grandma asked .

