grandma hugged them and said , " i am not mad , my dears . i am glad you found this book . it is very special to me . it reminds me of my father and his stories . he taught me to love reading and learning . he also taught me to be honest and brave . he would be happy to share his book with you . but you have to promise me something . "

" what is it , grandma ? " sara and ben asked .

" you have to promise me to always tell the truth to your parents . they love you and they want you to be safe . they do not want you to go to the attic because it is dusty and dangerous . they do not want you to get hurt or sick . they also want you to respect their rules and their things . if you find something that does not belong to you , you have to ask permission before you touch it or take it . do you understand ? " grandma said .

sara and ben nodded . they felt sorry for breaking their parents ' rules . they said , " we understand , grandma . we promise to tell the truth to mom and dad . we are sorry for taking the book without asking . we will give it back to you . "

grandma smiled and said , " thank you , my dears . i appreciate your honesty and your apology . you can keep the book for a while . i will read it to you and tell you more about my father and his stories . but you have to tell your parents what you did and why . they will forgive you and they will be proud of you . and maybe they will let you go to the attic with them someday , when it is safe and clean . how does that sound ? "

sara and ben smiled and said , " that sounds great , grandma . thank you for being so kind and wise . we love you . "

they hugged grandma and kissed her cheek . then they went to find their parents and tell them the truth . they learned a valuable lesson that day . they learned to be honest , respectful , and curious . they also learned to cherish their family and their stories . they had a wonderful time with grandma and the ancient book . they never forgot that day . it was a special day . it was yesterday . one day , a boy and a girl went to the woods with their dad . they liked to play and look at the trees and the birds . their dad told them to stay close and not to go too far .

but the boy and the girl saw a big rock and wanted to climb it . they ran to the rock and left their dad behind . they did not see the wolf that was hiding behind the rock . the wolf was hungry and angry . he saw the boy and the girl and licked his teeth .

the boy and the girl reached the top of the rock and looked around . they saw the wolf and screamed . the wolf jumped and tried to catch them . the boy and the girl ran down the rock and called for their dad .

but their dad was too far away and did not hear them . the wolf was faster and caught the boy and the girl . he bit them and dragged them to his den . the boy and the girl cried and wished they had listened to their dad .

the dad came to the rock and saw the wolf tracks and the blood . he was sad and scared . he looked for the boy and the girl , but he could not find them . he knew the wolf had taken them . he wished he had been closer and had seen the wolf . he went back to his car and drove away . he never saw the boy and the girl again . ben and mia are friends . they like to play with numbers . they have a big book with numbers and pictures . they can say the numbers from one to ten .

