mia says , " no , it is not . it is a smart word . zero is very important . it can make other numbers bigger or smaller . zero is famous . it is in books and songs and games . "

ben and mia start to argue . they do not want to share the book . they pull the book from each other . the book rips . they both cry .

mom comes and sees the book . she says , " oh , no . what happened ? why are you crying ? "

ben and mia say , " we are sorry , mom . we broke the book . we were fighting about zero . "

mom says , " zero is a number and a circle . it can be both . it is not silly or smart . it is just zero . you do not have to fight about it . you can learn about it together . and you can fix the book with tape . "

ben and mia say , " okay , mom . we are sorry . we will not fight again . we will be friends . and we will say sorry to zero . " lily was a little girl who liked to show her life to her friends . she had a large family with many people and animals . she had a mom and a dad , a big brother and a little sister , a dog and a cat , a fish and a bird . she loved them all very much .

one day , she invited her friend sam to come to her house . she wanted to show him her life . she took him to her room and showed him her toys and books . she showed him her fish and her bird . she said , " this is my life in my room . do you like it ? "

sam nodded and smiled . he liked lily 's life in her room . he said , " you have many things to play with and see . your life is fun . "

then , lily took him to the living room and showed him her family . she showed him her mom and her dad , her big brother and her little sister , her dog and her cat . she said , " this is my life in my living room . do you like it ? "

sam nodded and smiled . he liked lily 's life in her living room . he said , " you have many people and animals to love and hug . your life is warm . "

finally , lily took him to the backyard and showed him her garden . she showed him her flowers and her fruits , her bugs and her birds . she said , " this is my life in my backyard . do you like it ? "

