their dad shook his head and said , " i 'm sorry , boys , but it 's too late . you did not unite and work together . you did not take care of the farm . you were selfish and stubborn . now the farm is not perfect and happy . it is broken and sad . and so am i. " tim and sam were brothers who liked to play near the harbor . they watched the big boats come and go , and sometimes they saw fish and birds . one day , they saw a small boat that looked troubled . it had a hole in it and water was coming in .

