the harbor master looked at the troubled boat and nodded . " thank you for telling me , boys . you did a good thing . that boat belongs to an old fisherman who is very poor . he needs his boat to catch fish and sell them . i will call a friend who can help him fix his boat . you can come with me and watch if you want . "

