sara and lily got up and went to the block corner . they started to build a tower with the blocks . they laughed and talked and had fun . sara felt happy and not shy anymore . she had made a new friend . she liked her new school . sam and mia were playing with their dolls in the yard . they liked to pretend they were mommies and daddies . they had a big wagon that they used to load their dolls and take them for a ride .

