mia looked at the hairy infant and frowned . " that 's not a doll , sam . that 's a puppy . it belongs to someone . we ca n't take it . "

but sam did not listen . he liked the puppy and wanted to keep it . he put it in the wagon with the other dolls and said , " come on , mia , let 's go . the puppy will be happy with us . "

mia shook her head and followed sam . she was worried that someone would miss the puppy and be sad . she hoped they would find its owner soon .

they walked along the street , pulling the wagon . the puppy was scared and confused . it did not like being in the wagon with the dolls . it wanted to go back to its home and its family . it started to whimper and squirm .

" shh , puppy , do n't cry , " sam said , trying to calm it down . " we are your new family . we will love you and play with you . "

but the puppy did not want sam 's love . it wanted to escape . it saw a chance when they crossed a busy road . it jumped out of the wagon and ran into the traffic .

" stop , puppy , stop ! " sam shouted , dropping the wagon and chasing after it . " come back ! "

mia screamed and ran after sam . she saw a big car coming fast . she tried to pull sam back , but it was too late . the car hit them both and they flew in the air .

the puppy was safe on the other side of the road . it saw what happened and felt sorry . it barked and ran away , looking for its home .

the end . lily and tom were playing in the garden . they saw a small door under the big tree . they wanted to see what was inside .

" let 's try to open it , " tom said . he pulled the handle , but it did not move . there was a lock on the door .

" maybe we can find the key , " lily said . she looked around the garden . she saw a shiny thing on a flower . she ran to get it .

" look , tom , i found the key ! " lily said . she showed him the shiny thing . it was a delicate key , with a heart shape on the end .

" wow , good job , lily ! " tom said . he took the key and put it in the lock . he turned it slowly . the lock clicked and the door opened .

they peeked inside the door . they saw a bright room with many toys and books . they smiled and went inside .

they had a lot of fun playing in the secret room . they tried different games and read different stories . they forgot about the time .

then they heard a voice outside the door .

" lily , tom , where are you ? it 's time for lunch ! " it was their mom .

they quickly put the toys and books back where they found them . they closed the door and locked it . they ran to their mom .

" sorry , mom , we were playing in the garden , " lily said .

" we found a small door under the tree , " tom said .

" a small door ? what do you mean ? " their mom asked .

they looked at each other and smiled . they decided not to tell their mom about the secret room . it was their special place . they would come back another day and play some more . tom likes to wear his frog hat . it is green and soft and has big eyes . he thinks it makes him powerful , like a frog that can jump high and swim fast . he wears it every day , even when it is hot or cold .

one day , he goes to the park with his mom and his frog hat . he sees a pond with real frogs . he wants to play with them . he runs to the pond and says hello to the frogs . he thinks they are his friends .

but the frogs are scared of tom and his frog hat . they think he is a big frog that wants to eat them . they croak and hop away . tom is sad . he does not understand why the frogs do not like him .

his mom sees him and comes to him . she hugs him and tells him that the frogs are shy and do not know him . she says he can watch them from a distance , but not touch them . she says he can still be powerful with his frog hat , but he has to be gentle and kind to the frogs .

tom nods and smiles . he still likes his frog hat , but he also likes the real frogs . he decides to be a good friend to them . he sits on a bench with his mom and his frog hat and watches the frogs . he says thank you to them for letting him see them . he thinks they are powerful too , in their own way . lily and ben are playing in the park . they see a big hill with many yellow flowers . lily likes yellow . she wants to pick some flowers for her mom .

" come on , ben ! " lily says . " let 's march to the hill and get some flowers ! "

ben nods . he likes to march . he follows lily as they march to the hill . they sing a song as they march . " we are marching , marching , marching , to the yellow hill ! "

when they reach the hill , they see a big bee . the bee is buzzing around the flowers . it looks angry . lily and ben are scared of the bee .

" go away , bee ! " lily shouts . " we want some flowers ! "

the bee does not go away . it flies closer to lily and ben . it makes a loud noise . " buzz , buzz , buzz ! these are my flowers ! you ca n't have them ! "

lily and ben run away from the bee . they do not want to get stung . they run back to the park . they are sad . they do not have any flowers for mom .

they see a lemonade stand . a nice lady is selling lemonade . she smiles at lily and ben .

" would you like some lemonade ? " she asks . " it is very cold and sweet . "

lily and ben nod . they are thirsty . they give the lady some coins . she gives them two cups of lemonade .

they drink the lemonade . it is sour . they make funny faces . they laugh .

the lemonade makes them feel better . they forget about the bee and the flowers . they thank the lady and go back to playing .

they decide to march to the swings . they sing a new song as they march . " we are marching , marching , marching , to the swingy swings ! " tom and lily were playing in the park with their ball . they liked to kick the ball to each other and run after it . they were very enthusiastic and happy .

but then , tom kicked the ball too hard and it went over the fence . lily ran after the ball and tried to climb the fence . she wanted to get the ball back . but she slipped and fell down . she hurt her leg and cried .

tom heard lily cry and ran to her . he saw her leg was bleeding and he was scared . he shouted for help . " help ! help ! lily is hurt ! "

a man who was walking his dog heard tom and came to see what was wrong . he saw lily and her leg and called an ambulance . he told tom to stay with lily and talk to her . he said the ambulance would come soon and take lily to the hospital .

tom sat next to lily and held her hand . he said , " do n't worry , lily . the ambulance will come and make you better . you are brave and strong . i 'm sorry i kicked the ball too hard . i love you , lily . "

lily said , " i love you too , tom . thank you for being with me . it 's okay , it was an accident . the ball was fun . maybe we can play again when i 'm better . "

they heard a loud noise and saw a big car with lights and a siren . it was the ambulance . the man and the dog waved to them . the ambulance stopped and two people came out . they had uniforms and bags . they were the paramedics . they came to lily and tom and smiled .

" hello , lily . hello , tom . we are here to help you . we are going to take you to the hospital and fix your leg . you are very brave and we are proud of you . do n't be afraid , we will be with you all the time . can you come with us ? "

lily nodded and let the paramedics lift her on a stretcher . tom followed them and got in the ambulance with lily . he hugged her and said , " do n't worry , lily . everything will be okay . i 'm with you . "

the ambulance drove away with lily and tom . they were still enthusiastic and happy , but also a little scared and sad . they knew they would be okay , because they had each other . ben and lily liked to play in the park . they liked to swing , slide and run . one day , they saw a big metal box near the trees . it was dark and shiny . they were curious .

" let 's go see what 's inside , " ben said .

" ok , but be careful , " lily said .

they walked to the metal box and opened the door . it was dark inside . they saw some buttons and wires . they heard a strange noise .

" what is this ? " ben asked .

" i do n't know . maybe it 's a spaceship , " lily said .

" wow , a spaceship ! let 's pretend we are astronauts , " ben said .

he pushed a button . the metal box started to shake . the noise got louder . the door closed .

" ben , what did you do ? " lily cried .

" i do n't know . i just pushed a button , " ben said .

they felt the metal box lift off the ground . they looked out the window . they saw the park get smaller and smaller . they saw the sky change from blue to black . they saw stars and planets .

" ben , we are in space ! " lily said .

" wow , we are in space ! this is amazing , " ben said .

they smiled at each other . they forgot to be scared . they were happy . they had changed their game . they had changed their world . they had changed their lives . lily liked to draw with her crayons . she had many colors and she made beautiful pictures of flowers , animals and people . she kept her crayons in a drawer in her room , and she always closed it when she was done .

one day , her friend max came to play with her . he saw her pictures and said , " wow , you are very good at drawing . can i try ? " lily nodded and gave him some crayons . she showed him how to draw a butterfly and a sun . max tried , but he was not very good . he made the butterfly too big and the sun too small . he got angry and said , " this is hard . i do n't like it . " he threw the crayons on the floor and stomped on them . they broke into pieces .

lily was very sad . she said , " why did you do that ? those were my crayons . you should be careful and gentle with them . they are not toys . they are for making art . " max said , " i do n't care . they are stupid . i want to play something else . " he ran out of the room .

lily picked up the broken crayons and put them back in the drawer . she cried and hugged her teddy bear . she wished max would say sorry and be nice to her .

her mom heard her crying and came to see what was wrong . she saw the mess and asked , " what happened , lily ? " lily told her what max did and how he hurt her feelings . her mom hugged her and said , " i 'm sorry , lily . that was very mean of him . he should not have done that . you are a very good and kind friend . you shared your crayons with him and you taught him how to draw . you should be proud of yourself and your beautiful pictures . maybe he will learn to be a better friend and apologize to you . but if he does n't , you can always find other friends who will appreciate you and your art . "

lily smiled and said , " thank you , mom . i love you . " she gave her mom a kiss and said , " can i show you my pictures ? " her mom nodded and said , " of course , lily . i would love to see them . they are very beautiful . "

the moral value of the story is : be respectful and grateful when someone shares something with you . do n't break or ruin other people 's things . apologize when you make a mistake . be proud of your talents and creativity . find friends who support and value you . tom and mia are friends . they like to play with balls . they have many balls of different colors and sizes . they throw them , catch them , roll them and bounce them .

one day , they find a new ball in the park . it is big and round and shiny . it looks like a balloon , but it is not . it is hard and heavy . tom and mia want to play with it .

" let 's see who can throw it the farthest , " tom says . he picks up the ball and tries to throw it . but it is too heavy for him . he drops it on the ground . " ouch ! that hurts ! " he says .

mia laughs . " you are not strong enough , " she says . " let me try . " she picks up the ball and tries to throw it . but it is too heavy for her too . she drops it on the ground . " ow ! that hurts ! " she says .

tom and mia look at each other . they are sad . they can not play with the ball . they sit on the grass and sigh .

a man walks by . he sees the ball and the children . he smiles . he is tall and strong . he has a serious face . he wears a uniform . he is a firefighter .

" hello , kids , " he says . " do you need some help ? "

tom and mia nod . they point at the ball .

" that 's a fire extinguisher , " the man says . " it is not a toy . it is for putting out fires . it is very dangerous . you should not touch it . "

tom and mia are surprised . they did not know that . they feel sorry .

" we are sorry , sir , " they say . " we did not know . we thought it was a ball . we wanted to play with it . "

the man nods . he is not angry . he is kind . he picks up the fire extinguisher and puts it in his truck .

" i understand , " he says . " but you should be careful . there are many things that look like toys , but they are not . they can hurt you or others . you should always ask an adult before you play with something you do n't know . "

tom and mia nod . they have learned a lesson . they thank the man .

" you 're welcome , " he says . " and do n't worry . there are many other balls you can play with . like this one . " he takes out a small red ball from his pocket . he gives it to tom and mia . " this is a rubber ball . it is soft and light . you can throw it , catch it , roll it and bounce it . and it wo n't hurt you or anyone else . "

tom and mia are happy . they smile . they take the ball . they say goodbye to the man .

" goodbye , sir , " they say . " thank you for the ball . and thank you for putting out fires . you are very brave . "

the man smiles . he waves . he drives away .

tom and mia look at the ball . they like it . it is round and red and shiny . it looks like a cherry , but it is not . it is a ball . a rubber ball .

they stand up . they are ready to play .

" let 's see who can bounce it the highest , " tom says .

" ok , " mia says .

they throw the ball in the air . they watch it bounce . they laugh . they have fun .

they succeed . sam liked to play with his toy car . he made it go fast and slow , and turn left and right . he also liked to make it reverse , which meant to go back . he thought it was fun to reverse and then go forward again .

one day , he was playing with his car on the floor , when he saw a big ball . he wanted to push the ball with his car , so he drove towards it . but the ball was too big and heavy , and it did not move . sam tried again and again , but the ball stayed still .

sam was persistent , which meant he did not give up . he thought maybe he could move the ball if he reversed and then went forward very fast . he backed up his car as far as he could , and then zoomed towards the ball . but he went too fast , and his car hit the ball hard and bounced back . sam fell over and hurt his knee .

sam started to cry . his mom heard him and came to see what was wrong . she saw his car , the ball , and his knee . she hugged him and said , " it 's okay , sam . you were very brave and persistent , but sometimes things are too big and hard to move . maybe you can play with something else , or ask me for help . "

sam nodded and wiped his tears . he gave his mom a kiss and said , " thank you , mom . i love you . " he picked up his car and looked for another toy to play with . he still liked to reverse , but he decided to be more careful next time . anna and ben like to play with trains . they have a big box of trains and tracks . they make long and short trains . they make loops and bridges . they have fun .

one day , they see a real train outside . it is big and loud . it has smoke and steam . they run to the window and watch . they want to ride the train .

" can we go on the train , mom ? " anna asks .

" maybe another day , dear . the train is not for us . it is for people who go far away , " mom says .

" but i want to see the steam . it is white and thin . it goes up and up , " ben says .

" i know , ben . the steam is very pretty . but the train is very fast . it is not safe for little kids . you have to mind the train , " mom says .

anna and ben are sad . they want to go on the train . they look at their box of trains . they have an idea .

they take out their trains and tracks . they make a big train . they put a kettle on the stove . they wait for the water to boil .

when the water boils , the kettle makes a whistle . it makes steam . anna and ben take the kettle and put it behind their train . they pretend it is the engine . they make train noises .

" choo choo ! look , mom , we have steam ! " anna says .

" wow , you do ! that is very clever . you made your own train with steam , " mom says .

anna and ben smile . they are happy . they play with their train with steam . they mind the kettle . they have fun . tom and sam liked to play cricket in the park . they had a bat , a ball and two sticks . they took turns to hit the ball and run . sometimes they hit the ball very far and had to look for it in the grass .

one day , they saw a big tree with a hole in it . they wondered what was inside . they went closer and looked . they saw a small animal with long legs and wings . it was a cricket . it made a loud noise . tom and sam were scared . they ran away .

the next day , they came back to the park . they wanted to play cricket again . they looked for the tree with the hole . they wanted to see the cricket again . they hoped it was not angry . they found the tree and peeked inside . but the cricket was not there . they saw a note . it said :

" hello , tom and sam . i am a cricket . i am intelligent . i can read and write . i like your game . i took your ball . i will pass it back to you . come and play with me . i am lonely . your friend , cricket . "

tom and sam were surprised . they did not know crickets could talk . they looked around and saw the ball . it was on the other side of the park . they ran to get it . they saw the cricket . it was on a branch . it waved at them . tom and sam waved back . they smiled . they decided to play with the cricket . they had a new friend . anna and ben were twins who liked to play with their toys . they had many toys , but their favorite was a big dollhouse with many rooms and furniture . they liked to pretend that they were a family living in the dollhouse .

one day , their mom said that they had to clean their room and put away their toys . she said that they had too many toys and they should give some to other children who had none . she said that they could choose which toys they wanted to keep and which ones they wanted to donate .

anna and ben looked at their toys and tried to decide . they agreed on most of them , but they both wanted to keep the dollhouse . they started to argue .

" i want the dollhouse ! it is mine ! " anna said .

" no , it is mine ! i play with it more ! " ben said .

they pulled the dollhouse from each other and tried to separate it . but the dollhouse was delicate and it broke into pieces . they heard a loud snap and saw the roof , the walls , and the furniture fall apart .

they both gasped and felt sad . they had broken their favorite toy . they looked at their mom , who had heard the noise and came to see what happened . she was not happy .

" look what you did ! you broke the dollhouse ! do you know how much it cost ? it was a very high price ! you were not careful with it . you were selfish and greedy . now you have no dollhouse and no one else can have it either . how do you feel ? " she scolded them .

anna and ben felt very sorry and ashamed . they knew they had made a big mistake . they wished they had shared the dollhouse and not fought over it . they hugged each other and apologized .

" we are sorry , mom . we are sorry , dollhouse . we are sorry , other children . we were bad . we will be good . we will share our toys and be kind . please forgive us . " they said .

mom saw that they were sincere and felt sorry for them too . she hugged them and said that she forgave them . she said that they could still donate some of their toys and maybe find another dollhouse that was cheaper and stronger . she said that they had learned a lesson and that she loved them .

anna and ben nodded and smiled . they thanked their mom and said that they loved her too . they helped her clean their room and put away their toys . they hoped that they would find a new dollhouse and that they would never break it again . they learned to be careful with delicate things and to not separate what they loved . lila and sam were friends who liked to play and dance . one day , they found a big puddle of mud in the park . they thought it would be fun to jump and splash in the mud . they got very filthy and laughed a lot .

but then , lila saw a pretty flower on the side of the puddle . she wanted to pick it and give it to her mom . she reached for the flower , but sam slapped her hand away . he said , " no , that 's mine ! i saw it first ! "

lila was very sad and angry . she said , " that 's not nice , sam ! you ca n't take everything you want ! you have to share with your friends ! "

sam did n't listen . he grabbed the flower and ran away . he thought he was clever and happy . but he was wrong .

soon , he tripped and fell on the ground . the flower flew out of his hand and landed in the mud . it was ruined . sam cried and cried . he wished he had been kind to lila . he realized that being greedy and mean was not fun at all .

lila saw sam crying and felt sorry for him . she went to him and said , " i 'm sorry you lost your flower , sam . do you want to play and dance with me again ? "

sam nodded and said , " yes , please . i 'm sorry i slapped you , lila . you are a good friend . can you forgive me ? "

lila smiled and said , " of course , sam . i forgive you . let 's go and wash our hands and faces . then we can play and dance together . "

they hugged and walked to the fountain . they washed their hands and faces and felt much better . they learned that sharing and caring was more important than having and taking . they danced and played happily for the rest of the day . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to find rocks and make shapes with them . tom found a big rock that was warm from the sun . he wanted to make a house with it .

" look , lily , i found a warm rock ! " he said . " it is good for a house . "

but lily wanted the warm rock too . she thought it was good for a cake .

" no , tom , it is my rock ! " she said . " i saw it first . it is good for a cake . "

tom and lily both pulled the rock . they were angry and sad . they did not want to share .

" let go of my rock ! " tom said .

" give me my rock ! " lily said .

they called and called , but no one heard them . they were too far from their moms and dads .

then they heard a loud bark . it was a big dog . the dog ran to them and wanted to play . he saw the rock and thought it was a ball . he grabbed the rock with his mouth and ran away .

" hey , that is our rock ! " tom and lily said . they forgot their fight . they ran after the dog .

but the dog was faster . he ran to his owner and dropped the rock . the owner saw tom and lily and smiled .

" are you looking for this ? " he said . he picked up the rock and gave it to them .

" thank you , mister , " tom and lily said . they looked at the rock and then at each other . they felt sorry for being mean .

" can we share the rock ? " tom said .

" yes , we can share the rock , " lily said .

they hugged and smiled . they decided to make a house and a cake with the rock . they played happily in the park . they learned to be nice and to call for help when they needed it . mia and lily are sisters . mia is four and lily is three . they like to play in the garden . mia has a new toy . it is a pink bunny that can hop . mia loves her bunny . she makes it hop on the grass and on the flowers .

lily sees mia 's bunny . she wants to play with it too . she is jealous of mia . she runs to mia and says , " give me the bunny ! i want the bunny ! "

mia says , " no , lily ! it is my bunny ! you have your own toys . go away ! "

lily is angry . she tries to grab the bunny from mia . mia holds the bunny tight . they start to fight . they pull and push and shout .

mom hears them . she comes to the garden . she sees mia and lily fighting . she is not happy . she says , " stop it , girls ! fighting is not nice . you have to share and be kind . mia , let lily play with your bunny for a while . lily , say sorry to mia for being rude . then you can take turns with the bunny . "

mia and lily listen to mom . they say sorry to each other . they hug and make up . they play with the bunny together . they make it hop on the grass and on the flowers . they laugh and have fun . mom smiles and watches them . she is proud of her sisters . tom and lily were playing in the big room . they liked to look at the books on the bookcase . there were many books with pictures and stories . tom and lily wanted to read them all .

but there was one book that they did not like . it was ugly . it had a scary face on the cover . it was black and red and had big teeth . tom and lily were afraid of it .

" let 's hide it , " lily said . " then we do n't have to see it . "

" ok , " tom said . " but where ? "

they looked around the room . they saw a closet , a table , a chair , and a rug . they did not know where to put the ugly book .

" i know , " tom said . " follow me . "

he took the book and lead lily to the corner of the room . there was a small door . tom opened it . it was dark inside .

" what is this ? " lily asked .

" it 's a secret place , " tom said . " no one goes here . we can put the book here and forget about it . "

he threw the book inside and closed the door . he and lily smiled . they felt better .

" let 's go back to the bookcase , " lily said . " there are many nice books to read . "

" ok , " tom said . " but do n't tell anyone about the secret place . "

they ran back to the bookcase and picked a book . they sat on the floor and read it together . they were happy . they did not think about the ugly book anymore . ben and lily are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big sign . the sign has a picture of a jar . the jar is full of candy . the sign says : " guess how many candy in the jar . win a prize ! "

ben and lily want to win the prize . they go to the table where the jar is . a nice lady is there . she says : " hello , kids . do you want to play the game ? "

" yes , please ! " ben and lily say .

" ok , then . write your name and your guess on this paper . put it in this box . the one who is closest to the right number wins the prize . good luck ! "

ben and lily take the paper and the pen . they write their names . they look at the jar . it is very big . it has many candy . how many ? ben thinks hard . he writes : " 50 " . lily thinks harder . she writes : " 100 " .

they put their papers in the box . they say thank you to the lady . they wait for the winner to be announced .

the lady looks at the papers . she counts the candy in the jar . she smiles . she says : " we have a winner ! the right number is 97 . the closest guess is 100 . lily , you win the prize ! "

lily is very happy . she jumps up and down . she hugs ben . she says : " yay ! i win ! i win ! "

ben is happy for lily . he claps his hands . he says : " good job , lily ! you are very smart ! "

the lady gives lily the prize . it is a long , soft , colorful scarf . lily loves it . she wraps it around her neck . she says : " thank you , lady ! thank you , ben ! this is the best day ever ! " lily and ben were twins . they liked to play and have fun . but today was a boring day . it was raining outside and they had nothing to do inside . they looked at their toys , but they did not want to play with them . they looked at their books , but they did not want to read them . they looked at each other and sighed .

" mom , can we do something fun ? " lily asked .

" sorry , sweeties , i 'm busy making a cake for your dad 's birthday . you have to wait until he comes home , " mom said .

lily and ben did not like waiting . they wanted to have fun now . they looked around the kitchen and saw a big bowl of flour , some eggs , some butter , and some sugar . they had an idea .

" let 's help mom make the cake ! " ben whispered .

" ok , but we have to be quiet and quick , " lily whispered back .

they sneaked to the kitchen counter and grabbed some of the ingredients . they put them in a smaller bowl and mixed them with a spoon . they did not know how to make a cake , but they thought it would be easy . they added some water , some salt , some pepper , and some ketchup . they thought it would make the cake more tasty .

they poured the batter into a cake pan and put it in the oven . they did not know how to turn on the oven , but they pushed some buttons and hoped for the best . they ran back to their room and waited .

soon , they smelled something burning . they heard mom scream .

" what have you done ? " mom shouted .

she opened the oven and saw a black , smoky , stinky mess . she took it out and put it on the table . she was very angry .

lily and ben came out of their room . they looked at the cake and felt sorry .

" we wanted to help you , mom . we wanted to make a cake for dad , " lily said .

" we thought it would be fun , mom . we thought it would be tasty , " ben said .

mom looked at them and saw their sad faces . she felt sorry too .

" i know you meant well , sweeties , but you ca n't make a cake without following a recipe . and you ca n't use the oven without asking me . you could have hurt yourselves or started a fire , " mom said .

she hugged them and kissed them .

" i love you , but you have to be careful and listen to me . now , let 's clean up this mess and make a new cake together . ok ? " mom said .

lily and ben nodded . they helped mom clean up the kitchen and make a new cake . they followed mom 's instructions and used the right ingredients . they put the cake in the oven and watched it bake . they saw it rise and turn golden . they smelled it and it smelled yummy .

they decorated the cake with frosting and sprinkles . they wrote " happy birthday dad " on it . they put some candles on it and waited for dad to come home .

when dad came home , he saw the cake and smiled . he hugged mom and kissed her . he hugged lily and ben and kissed them .

" thank you for the cake , my loves . it looks delicious . did you make it ? " dad asked .

" yes , we did . but we had some help from mom , " lily said .

" we made another cake before , but it was not good . it was black and smoky and stinky , " ben said .

dad laughed .

" really ? what did you put in it ? " dad asked .

lily and ben told him what they put in the first cake . they told him how they sneaked to the kitchen and how they pushed the buttons on the oven . they told him how mom screamed and how they felt sorry .

dad laughed more .

