lily and ben thought that today was not a boring day after all . it was a spring day . a day full of surprises and learning and love . a day they would remember . tom and sam are brothers . they like to walk in the park with their dog , rex . rex is big and brown and very friendly . he likes to run and play and chase birds .

one day , they see a big pond in the park . it has ducks and fish and frogs . tom and sam want to go near the pond and feed the ducks . rex wants to go too . he likes water and ducks .

