" that sounds crazy . how can water leak out of the pond ? " tom says .

" i do n't know . i just heard it from dad . he said it happened once when he was little . he said it was a big mess , " sam says .

tom and sam and rex walk to the pond . they see the ducks and the fish and the frogs . they throw some bread to the ducks . the ducks come closer and quack . rex barks and wags his tail . he wants to play with the ducks .

