soon , the pond is almost empty . the ducks and the fish and the frogs are gone . the ground is wet and muddy . tom and sam and rex are wet and muddy too .

they hear a loud voice . it is dad . he is coming to the park . he sees the pond and the leak and the mess . he sees tom and sam and rex . he is not happy .

" tom ! sam ! rex ! what have you done ? you made the pond leak ! this is crazy ! how did this happen ? " dad says .

tom and sam and rex look at each other . they do n't know what to say . they are in trouble . they wish they had listened to sam and not gone too close to the water . they wish they had stopped rex from jumping in the pond . they wish they had not made the pond leak . they wish they had not made dad angry . they wish they had not made a big mess . lily and tom were playing in the park . they liked to swing , slide and run . they saw a big dog near the trees . the dog was black and had sharp teeth . it looked fierce .

