lily screamed too . she grabbed tom 's hand and pulled him to the bench . they climbed on the bench and hugged each other . they hoped the dog would go away .

a man came out of the trees . he had a notebook and a pen in his hand . he was the dog 's owner . he called the dog and put a leash on it . he walked towards lily and tom .

