but one boy , tom , was not scared . he liked storms . he wanted to see the lightning . he ran out of his house and climbed a hill . he saw the bright flashes in the sky . he heard the big booms . he felt the rain on his face . he was happy .

" tom , come back ! " his mother shouted . " it is not safe ! the lightning can strike you ! "

but tom did not listen . he wanted to see more . he ran to a big tree . he touched the tree . he felt the bark . he felt something else . he felt a shock . he saw a flash . he heard a boom . he fell down .

the lightning had struck the tree . and tom . he was hurt . he was not happy . he was sorry .

his mother ran to him . she saw him on the ground . she saw the tree on fire . she was scared and sad . she hugged him . she cried .

" tom , tom , are you okay ? " she asked .

tom opened his eyes . he saw his mother . he saw the smoke . he felt the pain . he was sorry .

