sam felt bad . he realized he was wrong . he did not want to make the girl sad . he wanted to be her friend . he took off the wrap from bobo and walked to the girl . he said , " i 'm sorry . i was silly . i should not have taken your wrap . here , you can have it back . " he gave her the torn wrap and a hug .

the girl smiled . she said , " thank you . i forgive you . you can still play with me and my doll . do you want to ? " sam nodded . he said , " yes , please . and you can play with bobo , too . he is my best toy , but i can share him with you . "

the girl and sam became friends . they played together with their toys and had fun . sam learned to be kind and generous . he learned that sharing is better than taking . he learned that friends are more important than wraps . he was happy . and so was bobo . the end . lily wanted to bake a cake for her mom 's birthday . she asked her dad to help her . they went to the kitchen and looked for the things they needed . they found flour , sugar , eggs , butter , and milk . they also found a big bowl , a spoon , a pan , and an oven .

