" let 's set the timer for 30 minutes , " dad said . " then we can decorate the cake with frosting and sprinkles . "

lily clapped her hands and said , " yay ! mom will love it ! "

they went to the living room and waited for the cake to bake . lily saw her brother 's trumpet on the couch . she picked it up and blew into it . it made a loud noise .

