dad hugged lily and said , " i 'm sorry , lily . i 'm sorry . we 'll make another cake . we 'll make a better cake . do n't cry . do n't cry . "

the dog wagged its tail and licked lily 's face . the dog said , " woof ! woof ! " tom and lily were best friends . they liked to play in the park every day . one day , they saw a big hill in the park . they had never seen it before . they wanted to climb it and see what was on top .

