the monkey did not answer . it just made a funny face and wiggled its tail . tommy laughed some more . he said , " monkey , monkey , you are my friend . you make me jolly . i like you . "

tommy and the monkey played for a long time . they had fun in the crib . they were jolly . ben and lily liked to play in the park . they liked to slide , swing , and run . but their favorite thing was to whistle . they learned how to whistle from their dad , who whistled all the time . they whistled loud and soft , high and low , fast and slow . they whistled songs and sounds and words .

