one day , lily and anna are playing dress - up in lily 's room . lily lifts a pink skirt from her box . she puts it on her doll . she says , " look , anna , my doll has a pretty skirt . she is a princess . your doll has a plain skirt . she is a maid . "

anna feels sad . she does not like lily 's words . she says , " no , lily , that is not nice . my doll has a nice skirt too . she is not a maid . she is a friend . friends do not say mean things . "

lily looks at anna . she sees anna 's tears . she feels sorry . she says , " i am sorry , anna . you are right . your doll has a nice skirt too . she is a friend . friends do not say mean things . can we share our clothes ? then our dolls can have different skirts . "

anna smiles . she says , " yes , lily , we can share our clothes . then our dolls can have fun . thank you for being a good friend . "

