tom and lily said , " sorry , mom . we were just playing pretend . we did not mean to be bad . " mom said , " i know , my loves . you are not bad . you are just crazy . crazy pirates . now , come and eat your soup . it is hot and yummy . " tom and lily said , " thank you , mom . you are the best . the best cook and the best mom . " they hugged mom and ate their soup . they were happy . lily likes to play with her blocks . she has many blocks of different colors and shapes . she can make towers , houses , bridges and more . she likes to see how tall she can make her towers before they fall down .

one day , she is playing with her blocks in her room . she has a big pile of blocks on the floor . she picks up a blue block and puts it on top of a red block . then she picks up a yellow block and puts it on top of the blue block . she keeps adding more blocks to her tower . she wants to make it as tall as her .

she is very careful not to knock down her tower . she moves slowly and gently . she is almost done . she only needs one more block to finish her tower . she looks for the perfect block . she sees a green block on the floor . she reaches for it .

but as she reaches for the green block , she bumps into her tower . her tower wobbles and shakes . she gasps and tries to catch it . but it is too late . her tower falls down with a loud crash . the blocks scatter all over the floor .

lily feels sad and angry . she worked hard to make her tower . she wanted to see how tall it was . she wanted to show it to her mom and dad . but now it is gone . she feels like crying .

she looks at the green block in her hand . she is still holding it . she is so mad at the green block . she thinks it is the green block 's fault . she thinks the green block ruined her tower . she wants to make the green block pay .

