she cries loud and hard . she cries so loud that her mom and dad hear her . they run to her room . they see her on the floor . they see the blood and the broken block . they see the fallen tower .

they rush to her . they hug her and comfort her . they clean her wound and bandage it . they tell her it is okay . they tell her they love her . they tell her they are proud of her . they tell her they are sorry about her tower .

