lily feels better . she smiles and hugs them . she thanks them for helping her . she tells them she loves them . she tells them she is happy . she tells them she wants to play with her blocks again . tom and mia are in school . they sit at their desks and draw with crayons . tom likes to draw cars and trucks . mia likes to draw flowers and butterflies .

