they hug mom and then they eat their salad . they eat it slow and careful . they do not like it very much . but they do not want to fight anymore . they want to be good boys . and they want to have pizza and cake and ice cream later . tom and mia are twins . they like to play with their toys and eat food . but they do not like the same food . tom likes to eat candy and cake . mia likes to eat fruit and salad . mom and dad want them to eat healthy food .

one day , mom and dad go to the store . they tell tom and mia to stay at home and be good . they leave some food on the table for them . there is candy and cake for tom , and fruit and salad for mia .

