sara sees a big table with many bottles . the bottles have different colors . they look like paint . sara wants to paint with them . she takes a brush and a bottle . she opens the bottle and dips the brush . she paints on a paper .

but the bottle is not paint . it is a chemical . it is hot and smelly . it makes a fizz and a smoke . it burns the paper and the brush . sara is scared and drops the bottle . the bottle breaks and spills on the floor .

the floor is hot and smelly too . it makes a fire . the fire alarm rings . sara and her dad run out of the lab . they are safe , but the lab is damaged . sara is sorry and sad . she says she is sorry to her dad . her dad hugs her and says he is glad she is okay . he says he loves her , but she should not paint with chemicals . he says he will buy her more paint and paper . sara says she loves him too , and she will only paint with paint . jill and jack liked to play with shells . they found many shells on the beach . some shells were big and some shells were small . some shells were shiny and some shells were dull . jill and jack put their shells in a basket . they wanted to sell their shells to people .

one day , a man came to the beach . he had a big boat . he said he wanted to buy shells from jill and jack . he said he would give them money and candy . jill and jack were happy . they showed him their basket of shells .

the man looked at the shells . he said they were very nice . he said he liked how they were organized . he said he wanted all of them . he gave jill and jack some money and candy . he took the basket of shells and put it on his boat . he said goodbye and sailed away .

jill and jack counted their money and ate their candy . they were very proud . they thought they had made a good deal . they did not know that the man was bad . he did not want the shells for himself . he wanted to sell them to other people for more money . he did not care about the shells . he did not care about the reef where the shells came from . he did not care about jill and jack .

the next day , jill and jack went to the beach again . they wanted to find more shells . but they could not find any . the beach was empty . the reef was broken . the man had taken all the shells . he had hurt the reef . he had hurt the fish and the crabs and the starfish . he had hurt jill and jack . jill and jack were sad . they wished they had not sold their shells . they wished they had kept them and played with them . they wished they had protected the reef and the animals . they learned a hard lesson . they learned that some people are greedy and mean . they learned that some things are more important than money and candy . they learned that they should not trust strangers . they learned that they should love and respect nature . one day , tom and lily went to the park with their mom . they saw many flowers , birds and bugs . they liked to play and run on the grass .

" look , tom , i found a worm ! " lily said . she held a long , thin worm in her hand . it was brown and wiggly .

" wow , let me see ! " tom said . he took the worm from lily and looked at it . he thought it was funny and ticklish .

" can we cook the worm ? " tom asked . he had an idea . he wanted to make a joke .

" no , tom , we ca n't cook the worm . that 's mean and yucky ! " lily said . she did not like tom 's idea . she wanted to put the worm back in the dirt .

" but it would be fun ! " tom said . he ran to the bench where their mom was sitting . he had a thick book in his hand . he wanted to use the book as a pan .

" mom , look what i have ! " tom said . he showed the worm to his mom .

" tom , what are you doing with that worm ? " mom asked . she was surprised and curious .

" i want to cook it ! " tom said . he smiled and opened the book . he put the worm on the book .

" tom , no , do n't cook the worm ! " mom said . she was shocked and worried . she took the book and the worm from tom .

" tom , that 's not nice . the worm is alive . it needs the dirt and the air . you ca n't cook it . it would hurt the worm and make it die . " mom said . she explained to tom why he should not cook the worm .

" i 'm sorry , mom . i did n't know . i just wanted to make a joke . " tom said . he felt sorry and sad .

" it 's okay , tom . i know you did n't mean to be bad . but you have to be gentle and kind to the animals . they are our friends . do you understand ? " mom said . she hugged tom and kissed him .

" i understand , mom . i love you . " tom said . he hugged mom and kissed her .

mom took tom and lily to the dirt . she helped them put the worm back in the dirt . the worm was happy and safe .

" bye , worm . have a nice day . " tom and lily said . they waved to the worm .

" good job , tom and lily . you are good kids . now , let 's go home and have some cookies . how does that sound ? " mom said . she smiled and took their hands .

" yay , cookies ! that sounds good ! " tom and lily said . they smiled and followed mom .

they left the park and went home . they had a good day . they learned something new . they were happy . tom and mia like to play with popcorn . they like to eat it and make it pop in the big pot . they also like to attach it with a string and make a long necklace . they wear the necklace and pretend to be kings and queens .

one day , they find a bag of green popcorn in the kitchen . they think it is very funny and want to try it . they put some in the pot and wait for it to pop . but the green popcorn does not pop . it makes a loud noise and smoke comes out of the pot . tom and mia are scared and run away .

mom and dad come to the kitchen and see the mess . they are not happy . they ask tom and mia what they did . tom and mia say they wanted to play with the green popcorn . mom and dad tell them that the green popcorn is not for eating or playing . it is for the garden . it is a special popcorn that helps the plants grow .

tom and mia are sorry . they say they did not know . they help mom and dad clean the kitchen . they also help them plant the green popcorn in the garden . they hope the plants will grow big and strong . they also hope they will find some normal popcorn to play with next time . lila liked to read books . she had many books in her room . she read them every day . she learned new things from the books . she was happy .

one day , lila saw a big trunk in the attic . she was curious . she opened the trunk . she found more books inside . she was excited . she wanted to read them all .

she took some books from the trunk and went to her room . she read them one by one . she liked the stories . she did not hear her mom calling her for dinner . she did not hear her dad coming home . she did not hear the fire alarm .

the trunk had a secret . it was a magic trunk . it made the books come alive . but it also made the books burn . the books caught fire in lila 's room . the fire spread to the attic . the fire reached the trunk . the trunk exploded .

lila did not see the fire . she did not smell the smoke . she did not feel the heat . she was too busy reading . she did not notice anything until it was too late . she screamed . but no one heard her . she was trapped . she was scared . she was sorry .

the firemen came . they tried to save lila . but they could not . the fire was too big . the house was too damaged . lila was gone . the books were gone . the trunk was gone .

lila 's mom and dad were sad . they cried . they wished they had been more generous with lila . they wished they had spent more time with her . they wished they had told her they loved her . they wished they had never found the trunk . sara and ben were playing in the yard . they liked to run and jump and chase each other . sara saw a big pile of laundry on the porch . she had an idea .

