but ben was smart . he saw sara 's feet under the laundry . he sneaked up to her . he touched her arm .

" freeze ! " he shouted . " i got you ! "

sara was surprised . she tried to move , but she had to freeze . she was stuck behind the laundry .

ben laughed . he was happy . he had won the game .

but then he heard a loud voice . it was mom .

" ben ! sara ! what are you doing ? " mom said . " that is my clean laundry . you made it dirty and messy . come here right now ! "

ben and sara felt bad . they had been clumsy . they had ruined mom 's laundry . they came out from behind the laundry . they looked at mom . they said sorry .

mom was angry . she told them to go inside . she told them to help her with the laundry . she told them to not play with the laundry again .

ben and sara nodded . they followed mom inside . they helped her with the laundry . they learned their lesson . they did not play with the laundry again . ben and mia like to play with their toy farm . they have many animals : cows , pigs , sheep , horses and chickens . they also have a big truck that can load the animals and take them to different places .

one day , they decide to load the hairy animals on the truck and drive them to the park . they put the cows , the sheep and the horses on the truck . they leave the pigs and the chickens on the farm .

" beep beep ! " ben says , as he drives the truck . " we are going to the park with the hairy animals ! "

mia sits next to him and holds a sheep . " i like the sheep . it is soft and warm . can i keep it ? " she asks .

" no , you ca n't keep it . it is not a pet . it is a farm animal . we have to take it back to the farm later . " ben says .

they arrive at the park and unload the animals . they let them run and graze on the grass . they have fun watching them and petting them .

but soon , it is time to go home . they have to load the animals back on the truck and drive them to the farm .

" come on , hairy animals ! it is time to go home ! " ben says .

he and mia catch the animals and put them on the truck . they say goodbye to the park and drive back to the farm .

they unload the animals and put them in their pens . they thank them for the fun day .

" goodbye , hairy animals ! we had a great time with you ! " mia says .

" maybe we can play with you again another day ! " ben says .

they go back to their toy farm and play some more . they are happy and tired . they love their animals . lily and ben are friends . they like to play and joke with each other . one day , they go to the park with their moms . they see a big slide and run to it .

lily goes first . she slides down fast and laughs . ben waits for his turn . he wants to joke with lily . he thinks of a funny thing to do . he slides down with his foot up in the air . he hopes lily will see his foot and laugh too .

but lily does not see his foot . she only sees his face . she thinks he is making a funny face at her . she laughs and says , " you look silly , ben ! " ben is confused . he looks at his foot and says , " no , look at my foot , lily ! it is a joke ! "

lily looks at his foot and sees it in the air . she does not think it is funny . she thinks it is rude . she says , " that is not a joke , ben ! that is mean ! you should not put your foot up like that . it is not fair to the other kids . they might get hurt by your foot . "

ben feels bad . he did not mean to be mean . he only wanted to make lily laugh . he says , " i am sorry , lily . i did not know it was mean . i will not do it again . can we still be friends ? "

lily thinks for a moment . she sees that ben is sorry . she says , " ok , ben . i forgive you . but you have to be careful with your foot . and you have to find better jokes . can you do that ? "

ben nods . he says , " yes , lily . i can do that . thank you for being my friend . you are very fair . "

they hug and smile . they go to play some more . they have fun and joke with each other . but they do not use their feet . they use their words . tom and sam were brothers who liked to play with their toys . they had many toys , but their favorite was a big fan that made wind . they liked to turn it on and feel the wind on their faces and hair . they also liked to make funny noises with the fan , like " wooo " and " brrr " .

one day , their mom told them to be quiet , because she had a surprise for them . she said she was going to make a cake for them , and they had to wait in their room until it was ready . tom and sam were happy , because they loved cake . they went to their room and closed the door .

but they did not want to be quiet . they wanted to play with the fan . they turned it on and started to make loud noises with it . they did not hear their mom calling them to come and see the surprise . they did not smell the cake that was baking in the oven . they only heard the fan and their own voices .

suddenly , the fan stopped working . tom and sam looked at it and saw that it was broken . they had played with it too much and too hard . they felt sad and scared . they had ruined their favorite toy . they wondered what their mom would say .

they opened the door and saw their mom standing there with a big smile and a big cake . she had candles on it and a sign that said " happy birthday , tom and sam " . she had made the surprise for their birthday , which was today . she did not know that they had broken the fan .

tom and sam felt ashamed and sorry . they did not deserve the surprise . they had been bad and noisy . they told their mom what they had done and asked for forgiveness . their mom hugged them and said that she loved them , but that they had to learn to be careful and respectful with their things and with others . she said that they could still have the cake , but that they had to help her fix the fan later .

tom and sam thanked their mom and said that they were sorry . they learned their lesson . they blew the candles and ate the cake . they enjoyed the surprise , but they also missed the fan . they promised to be good and quiet from now on . lily likes to collect shells on the beach . she has a big bag full of shells of different colors and shapes . she likes to look at them and make necklaces with them . she gives some necklaces to her friends and family .

one day , lily goes to the beach with her mom and dad . she sees a lot of new shells on the sand . she runs to pick them up and put them in her bag . she is very happy .

but then , she sees a boy who is also collecting shells . he is bigger than lily and has a mean face . he sees lily 's bag and grabs it from her . he says , " these are my shells now . go away , you little baby . "

lily feels very sad and angry . she tries to get her bag back , but the boy is too strong . he pushes her away and laughs . he is very rude .

lily 's mom and dad see what is happening . they run to help lily . they tell the boy to give back the bag and to say sorry . they say , " that is not nice . you should not take things that are not yours . you should share and be kind . "

the boy feels scared and ashamed . he gives back the bag and says sorry . he runs away .

lily hugs her mom and dad . they hug her back . they say , " we are proud of you , lily . you are brave and sweet . you have a lot of beautiful shells . let 's go home and make some more necklaces . "

lily smiles . she feels better . she says , " thank you , mom and dad . i love you . i love my shells . i love my necklaces . " lily and ben were friends who liked to play outside . they waited for spring to come , because spring meant flowers and sun and fun . but this year , spring was late . the sky was still gray and cold , and the snow was still on the ground .

one day , they saw a weird thing in the park . it was a big machine with a long arm and a claw . it was digging up the dirt and making a lot of noise . lily and ben were curious and went closer to see what it was doing .

" hey , what are you doing ? " ben asked the man who was driving the machine .

" i 'm building a new road here , " the man said . " this park is too small and boring . we need more cars and shops and buildings . "

" but what about the flowers and the trees and the birds ? " lily asked . " they need the park to live and grow . and we need the park to play and have fun . you ca n't take away our park ! "

" sorry , kid , but that 's progress , " the man said . " the park has to go . nothing can prevent it . now , move along , this is dangerous . "

lily and ben were sad and angry . they did n't want to lose their park . they wanted to see spring come and make everything beautiful and happy . they had an idea . they ran to their homes and got their shovels and buckets . they came back to the park and started to dig in the snow . they made a big pile of snow in front of the machine .

" hey , what are you doing ? " the man shouted . " get out of the way ! you 're blocking my work ! "

" we 're saving our park ! " lily and ben shouted back . " we 're making a snow wall to prevent you from destroying it ! we love our park and we want spring to come ! "

the man was annoyed and tried to move the machine , but the snow wall was too strong and too high . he could n't break through it . he had to stop and wait for help . lily and ben smiled and hugged each other . they had done it . they had protected their park . they hoped that spring would come soon and reward them with flowers and sun and fun . lily and ben were twins who liked to play with blocks . they wanted to build the tallest tower they could . they stacked the blocks one by one , higher and higher . they tried to improve their tower by making it stronger and straighter .

but sam , their big brother , was bored . he did not like to play with blocks . he wanted to play with his ball . he saw lily and ben 's tower and thought it was silly . he kicked his ball hard and hit the tower . the blocks fell down with a loud crash . lily and ben cried . their tower was gone .

sam laughed and ran away with his ball . he did not say sorry . he did not care . he saw a cake on the table . it was for mom 's birthday . it looked delicious . he wanted to eat it . he reached for the cake and grabbed the top . but the cake was not ready . it was still hot . sam burned his hand and dropped the cake . the cake splattered on the floor . mom came in and saw the mess . she was angry . she scolded sam and sent him to his room . sam cried . he had no cake and no ball . he wished he had played with blocks . lily and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big man talking to many people . he has a book and a stick . he points at the book and says many words .

