" what does he know ? " lily asks .

" i do n't know , " ben says . " maybe he knows about animals or plants or stars . "

lily and ben are curious . they go closer to the big man and the people . they sit on the grass and listen . the big man talks about birds . he shows pictures of different birds in the book . he says their names and their sounds .

lily and ben like birds . they see some birds in the trees . they point at them and make their sounds . they have fun .

the big man sees lily and ben . he smiles . he is kind . he asks them if they like birds . lily and ben nod . they say yes .

" would you like to see my book ? " the big man asks .

lily and ben nod again . they say yes .

the big man gives them his book . he lets them look at the pictures . he tells them more about the birds . he teaches them some new words .

lily and ben are happy . they learn a lot . they thank the big man . they wave to him and the people . they go back to the park . they play with the birds . they are friends . anna and ben like to play in the park . they like to swing , slide and run . one day , they see a big man in a suit . he has a briefcase and a phone . he is a lawyer . he works with words and papers .

the lawyer is very busy . he talks on his phone and walks fast . he does not see anna and ben . he does not see the puddle . he steps in the puddle and slips . he falls down and gets wet . his phone and papers get wet too .

anna and ben are scared . they think the lawyer is angry . they think he will yell at them . they run away and hide behind a tree . they hope the lawyer does not find them .

the lawyer is not angry . he is surprised . he is wet and dirty . he laughs at himself . he sees anna and ben behind the tree . he smiles and waves at them . he says , " do n't be scared . i 'm not mad . it was an accident . the puddle was deep . i should have looked where i was going . "

anna and ben come out from behind the tree . they are not scared anymore . they are curious . they ask the lawyer what he does . he tells them he helps people with problems . he shows them his phone and papers . he says , " these are my tools . i use them to talk and write . sometimes i go to court . that 's a place where people talk and listen . "

anna and ben think the lawyer is interesting . they ask him more questions . he answers them . he is nice and friendly . he says , " you are smart and brave . you like to play and learn . maybe you can be lawyers too someday . " anna and ben smile and nod . they like the lawyer . they say , " thank you for talking to us . we 're sorry you fell in the puddle . we hope you dry soon . " the lawyer says , " you 're welcome . i 'm glad i met you . have fun in the park . " he picks up his briefcase and walks away . he is careful not to step in any more puddles . anna and ben wave goodbye . they go back to play . they are happy . sam was a dog who liked to perform tricks for his family . he could sit , roll , shake and bark on command . his family gave him treats and rubs when he did well . sam was happy and proud of his skills .

one day , sam saw a big truck outside his house . he was curious and wanted to see what was inside . he ran out of the door and across the street . he did not look for cars or listen for horns . he was too excited to perform for the truck driver .

but the truck driver did not see sam . he was busy talking on his phone and did not hear sam 's barks . he started the engine and drove away . he did not know that sam was under the truck 's wheels .

sam felt a sharp pain and a loud noise . he tried to move but he could not . he was scared and hurt . he wanted his family to come and help him . he wanted a treat and a rub . but his family did not come . they did not know where he was . they were inside the house , waiting for him to come back .

sam closed his eyes and stopped breathing . he did not perform any more tricks . he did not get any more treats or rubs . he was gone . sara was hungry . she wanted to eat some soup . she went to the kitchen and saw a big pot on the stove . she got a spoon and opened the lid . the soup smelled good .

but then she heard a loud roar . she turned around and saw a fierce lion in the living room . the lion had escaped from the zoo and found its way into sara 's house . it was angry and hungry too . it saw sara and the soup and wanted to eat them both .

sara was scared . she dropped the spoon and ran to the door . but the door was locked . she had to find another way out . she looked for a window or a phone or anything that could help her .

the lion followed her . it knocked over the furniture and the plants and the toys . it disturbed everything in its path . it roared and snarled and showed its big teeth .

sara ran into the bathroom and locked the door . she hoped the lion would not break it . she prayed for someone to come and save her . she wished she had never touched the soup . tom and sam are friends . they like to play with balls . they have a big ball that is blue . they roll the ball to each other . it is easy and fun .

one day , they go to the park . they see a hill . they want to roll the ball down the hill . they think it will be more fun . they take the ball to the top of the hill .

" are you ready ? " tom asks sam .

