they push the ball down the hill . the ball goes fast . it rolls and rolls . tom and sam run after the ball . they laugh and shout .

but the ball does not stop . it rolls into the street . there are cars in the street . the cars go fast too . they do not see the ball .

crash !

the ball hits a car . the car stops . the ball breaks . the blue ball is gone . tom and sam are sad . they cry .

the driver of the car is angry . he gets out of the car . he sees tom and sam . he yells at them .

" who did this ? who threw the ball ? this is bad ! you are bad ! you have to pay for the damage ! "

tom and sam are scared . they do not have money . they do not know what to do . they wish they did not roll the ball down the hill . they wish they played with the ball in the park . they wish they still had the blue ball . they wish they were home . lily and ben were playing soccer with their team . they liked to kick the ball and run fast . they wanted to win the game and have fun .

but sam was on their team too . sam was selfish . he did not like to share the ball . he always wanted to score by himself . he did not care about his team .

one time , sam had the ball and ran to the goal . he saw lily and ben open , but he did not pass to them . he tried to shoot , but the other team blocked him . the other team got the ball and ran to the other goal .

lily and ben ran after them . they wanted to save the goal . they saw sam standing and pouting . they shouted at him .

" sam , help us ! we are a team ! we need you ! " lily said .

" stop being selfish ! pass the ball next time ! " ben said .

but sam did not listen . he did not move . he did not care .

lily and ben reached the other goal . they saw the other team about to shoot . they jumped and blocked the ball . they saved the goal !

their team cheered for them . they were happy and proud . they hugged each other .

but sam was not happy . he was alone and sad . he realized he was wrong . he wished he had helped his team . he wished he had not been selfish . he learned a lesson . lily and tom were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they saw a big swamp near their house . it was green and wet and had many frogs and bugs . lily and tom wanted to catch some frogs and bugs , so they ran to the swamp .

but the swamp was not safe . it had mud and holes and water that smelled bad . lily and tom did not see the mud and holes and water . they only saw the frogs and bugs . they ran and ran and tried to catch them .

then , lily stepped on a hole and fell into the swamp . she screamed and cried and got very wet and dirty . tom heard her scream and ran to help her . but he also stepped on a hole and fell into the swamp . he screamed and cried and got very wet and dirty too .

lily and tom were scared and sad . they wanted to get out of the swamp , but they did not know how . they called for their mom and dad , but they did not hear them . they felt very alone and cold in the swamp .

then , they saw a pale light in the sky . it was the moon . the moon was big and bright and round . it looked at lily and tom and smiled . it said , " do n't be scared and sad . i will help you . i will show you the way out of the swamp . follow me . "

lily and tom looked at the moon and smiled too . they felt a little better . they followed the moon 's light and saw a path . they walked on the path and got out of the swamp . they saw their house and their mom and dad . they ran to them and hugged them . they told them what happened and said they were sorry .

their mom and dad were happy and relieved . they said , " we are glad you are safe . we were looking for you . we love you . but do n't go to the swamp again . it is not safe . it is not a place to play . "

lily and tom nodded and said , " we know . we are sorry . we love you too . thank you , moon , for helping us . "

the moon winked and said , " you are welcome . i am always here for you . good night , lily and tom . "

lily and tom said , " good night , moon . " they went inside and took a bath and put on clean clothes . they went to bed and fell asleep . they dreamed of frogs and bugs and the moon . lily and ben liked to play in the park . they liked to run , swing , slide and climb . they also liked to number the trees . they would count how many trees they saw on each trail . they had fun and learned a lot .

one day , they saw a new trail . it was clean and shiny . it had signs with numbers and pictures . lily and ben wanted to try it . they followed the signs and counted the trees . they saw one , two , three , four , five trees . they were happy .

but then , they saw a big sign . it said : " stop ! this trail is for bikes only . do not walk here . it is dangerous . " lily and ben did not know what " bikes " or " dangerous " meant . they thought the sign was just another number . they kept walking .

soon , they heard a loud noise . it was a bike . it was fast and big . it came towards them . lily and ben were scared . they tried to move , but they were too late . the bike hit them . they fell down . they hurt their legs and arms . they cried .

the bike rider stopped . he was angry . he said : " what are you doing here ? this trail is not for you . you are not supposed to walk here . you are breaking the rules . you are making the trail dirty . you are lucky i did not hurt you more . go away ! "

lily and ben felt bad . they did not mean to break the rules . they did not mean to make the trail dirty . they did not mean to get hurt . they said : " we are sorry . we did not know . we just wanted to number the trees . we like to learn . please do not be mad . "

the bike rider calmed down . he saw that lily and ben were young and innocent . he said : " i am sorry too . i did not mean to yell at you . i was just surprised and worried . you should not walk on this trail . it is for bikes only . bikes are like cars . they are fast and heavy . they can hurt you . you should walk on the other trails . they are safer and nicer . they have more trees to number . do you understand ? "

lily and ben nodded . they understood . they thanked the bike rider . they got up and walked back to the other trails . they learned a new lesson . they learned to follow the signs and the rules . they learned to be careful and respectful . they learned to stay on the right trail . they were still happy . ben was a boy who liked to draw . he had many pens and pencils and papers . he also had a big bottle of ink . he liked to make black lines and dots and shapes with the ink .

one night , ben was drawing in his room . he was very tired , but he wanted to finish his picture . he did not hear his mom call him for bed . he did not see his clock say it was late . he only saw his ink and his paper .

he was so tired that he did not notice when he knocked over the bottle of ink . the ink spilled on his desk and on his floor and on his bed . it made a big mess . ben was careless with his ink .

he yawned and rubbed his eyes . he looked at his picture and smiled . he thought it was very good . he did not see the ink everywhere . he put his picture on his desk and crawled into his bed .

he fell asleep in his ink - stained bed . he did not know that his mom would be very angry in the morning . he did not know that he would have to clean up his mess . he did not know that his ink would ruin his sheets and his clothes . he only knew that he liked to draw . lily and sam were playing in the park . they liked to swing , slide and run . they saw a big telephone on a pole . it was red and shiny .

