they went closer to the telephone . they saw a button that said " push " . lily pushed the button . the telephone made a loud noise .

" hello , hello , who is there ? " a voice said from the telephone .

lily and sam were scared . they did not know who was talking .

" who are you ? " lily asked in a small voice .

" i am the park ranger . i use this telephone to talk to other rangers and help people in the park . who are you ? " the voice said .

lily and sam told the voice their names and that they were playing in the park .

" that 's nice . are you having fun ? " the voice asked .

" yes , we are . but we are sorry for pushing the button . we did not mean to bother you , " lily said .

" that 's okay . you did not bother me . you were just curious . but next time , please ask a grown - up before you use the telephone . it is for emergencies only , " the voice said .

" okay , we will . thank you for being gentle with us , " sam said .

" you 're welcome . have a good day and be safe , " the voice said .

lily and sam said goodbye to the voice and hung up the telephone . they went back to their game . they were happy and learned something new . tom and ben are brothers . they like to play in the woods . they have a big axe . they use it to chop wood for the fire . they are lively boys . they run and jump and laugh .

one day , they find a big tree . it has many branches and leaves . they want to chop it down . they take turns with the axe . they hit the tree hard . the tree does not fall . they hit it harder . the tree still does not fall .

they get tired . they want to sleep . they make a bed of leaves under the tree . they lie down and close their eyes . they do not hear a loud crack . they do not see the tree fall . they do not feel the tree hit them . they sleep .

mom and dad are worried . they look for tom and ben . they see the big tree . they see the axe . they see the bed of leaves . they see the boys . they are scared . they run to the boys . they lift the tree . they check the boys . they are alive . they are hurt . they cry .

mom and dad take tom and ben to the doctor . the doctor helps them . he gives them medicine . he puts bandages on them . he tells them to rest . he tells them to be careful . he tells them to not play with the axe . he tells them to love each other . they nod . they hug . they sleep . tom and lily were playing with paper and scissors . they liked to cut shapes and make animals and flowers . tom had a big pair of scissors and lily had a small pair . tom wanted to cut faster and make bigger shapes , so he lifted his scissors high and snipped hard .

but tom was not careful . he lifted his scissors too high and too close to his face . he snipped his nose and it hurt a lot . he dropped his scissors and cried . lily saw what happened and ran to him . she was scared and sorry for tom .

lily hugged tom and said , " it 's okay , tom . i will get mommy . she will make it better . " she left her scissors on the floor and ran to find mommy . mommy came quickly and saw tom 's nose . she said , " oh , tom , what did you do ? you were very stupid to lift your scissors like that . you could have hurt yourself more . let me see your nose . "

mommy cleaned tom 's nose and put a band - aid on it . she said , " you are lucky it is not a big cut . but you have to be more careful with scissors . they are sharp and dangerous . you have to hold them low and away from your face . and you have to share them with lily . she has small scissors and you have big scissors . you can both cut paper and have fun . "

tom said , " i 'm sorry , mommy . i 'm sorry , lily . i was stupid . i wo n't lift my scissors like that again . i will share them with lily . can we still play with paper and scissors ? " mommy said , " yes , you can . but only if you promise to be careful and listen to me . and you have to say sorry to lily too . " tom said , " i promise , mommy . i 'm sorry , lily . can i see your paper animals and flowers ? " lily said , " yes , you can . they are pretty . i will show you . but do n't cut them with your scissors . " tom said , " i wo n't . i will just look at them . they are very nice . you are good at cutting paper . " lily said , " thank you , tom . you are good too . but you have to be more smart . " tom and lily smiled and hugged . mommy smiled too and said , " that 's better . now you can play nicely together . but remember , be careful with scissors . " ben and lily were playing with their toy cars in the garden . they liked to make noises and pretend they were racing . ben had a red car and lily had a blue car .

" vroom , vroom , i 'm faster than you ! " ben said .

" no , you 're not , i 'm faster ! " lily said .

they zoomed their cars on the grass and the dirt . they enjoyed playing with their cars very much .

but then , ben 's car got stuck in a puddle of oil . someone had left a can of oil near the shed and it had spilled . ben 's car was all oily and dirty . he tried to pull it out , but it was too slippery .

" oh no , my car ! " ben cried . " it 's ruined ! "

lily stopped her car and went to help ben . she saw his car in the oil and felt sorry for him .

" do n't cry , ben , it 's okay , " she said . " we can clean your car . come on , let 's go to the hose . "

ben sniffed and nodded . he followed lily to the hose . she turned on the water and sprayed ben 's car . the oil and the dirt came off . ben 's car looked shiny and red again .

" wow , thank you , lily ! " ben said . " you 're a good friend . my car is fine now . "

lily smiled and gave ben a hug . " you 're welcome , ben . i 'm glad you 're happy . can we play some more ? "

ben nodded and hugged lily back . " yes , let 's play some more . you can have a turn with my car if you want . "

they took their cars and went back to the garden . they were not grumpy anymore . they enjoyed playing with their cars and each other . they had fun until it was time to go inside . tim and liz are twins . they like to play with their toys in their room . but sometimes they make a lot of noise and disturb mom and dad . mom and dad are working on their laptops in the living room .

one day , tim and liz find a big sock in their closet . it is dad 's sock . it is very tough and long . they think it is a fun toy . they put it on their arms and pretend it is a snake . they make hissing sounds and chase each other around the room .

mom and dad hear the noise and come to see what is going on . they see tim and liz with the sock on their arms . they are not happy . they tell tim and liz to stop playing with the sock . they say it is not a toy . it is dad 's sock . he needs it for his feet . they take the sock away and give tim and liz some books to read .

tim and liz are sad . they liked the sock . they think it was a fun toy . they do not want to read the books . they want to play with the sock . but they do not want to disturb mom and dad . they know mom and dad are busy . they decide to be quiet and read the books . maybe later they can play with the sock again . tim and sam are friends . they like to play with planes . they have many planes in their room . some are big , some are small , some are red , some are blue .

