tim and sam nod . they understand . they go to the tent and smile and talk to the people . they tell them their names and their stories . they tell them about their planes and their dreams . they listen to their stories and their hopes . they make them laugh and smile .

the people are very grateful . they thank tim and sam for their kindness . they tell them they are very sweet and smart . they tell them they are like little pilots .

tim and sam are very proud . they feel good . they hug the people and say goodbye . they thank the pilot and his team for their work . they say they want to be like them when they grow up .

the pilot and his team are very proud too . they hug tim and sam and say goodbye . they tell them they are very brave and strong . they tell them they are already like them .

tim and sam smile and wave . they hold hands and run back to their home . they are happy and united . they have learned a lot today . they have learned about planes and people . they have learned about helping and caring . they have learned about uniting . lily and ben were twins who liked to play games . they were very competitive and always wanted to win . one day , they found a big glass jar in the kitchen . it was full of colorful candies .

" let 's play a game , " said lily . " who can guess how many candies are in the jar ? "

" ok , " said ben . " i guess 50 . "

" no , that 's too many , " said lily . " i guess 30 . "

they asked their mom to count the candies and tell them who was right . their mom opened the jar and started to count .

" one , two , three , four , five ... "

but before she could finish , lily and ben grabbed some candies and put them in their mouths .

