their mom smiled and gave them each a kiss . she was proud of them for making up . she told them the answer to the game .

" there are 37 candies in the jar , " she said . " so , lily was closer . she wins . "

lily and ben clapped and cheered . they were happy for each other . they decided to split the candies and enjoy them together . they learned that playing games was more fun when they were not too competitive . lily and ben are best friends . they like to play in the park and share their toys . one day , they see a big white tent in the park . they go to look inside . they see many people in pretty clothes and a big cake . they hear music and clapping .

