lily and tom look at the skeleton again . they see that it has a bright orange hat and a purple scarf . it also has a sign that says , " boo ! " they realize that it is not a real skeleton . it is a toy . they feel silly and laugh . they say , " it is a funny joke . we are not scared anymore . can we play with the skeleton ? "

mom and dad say , " yes , you can . but be careful and gentle . and do n't forget to share . " lily and tom say , " ok . " they go back to the pile and take the skeleton . they make it swing , slide and run with them . they have fun with the skeleton . they are happy . sara liked to play with her mom 's perfume . she liked how it smelled and how it made her feel pretty . she wanted to share it with her grandma , who lived far away . she thought grandma would be happy to get a nice smell in the mail .

one day , when mom was busy , sara took the perfume bottle and put it in a box . she wrote " to grandma " on the box and put a stamp on it . she was very proud of her gift . she ran outside and put the box in the big blue mailbox .

but sara did not know that perfume was not good to mail . the bottle was glass and it could break . the perfume was liquid and it could leak . the mailman did not know what was in the box . he threw it in his truck with many other boxes . the box bounced and bumped and cracked . the perfume spilled and soaked the other boxes . it made a big mess and a harsh smell .

the mailman was angry and sad . he had to throw away many boxes that were ruined by the perfume . he had to clean his truck and his clothes . he had to pay a fine for mailing something dangerous . he did not deliver the box to grandma . he threw it in the trash .

grandma did not get sara 's gift . she did not get any mail at all . she was lonely and sad . she wondered why sara did not write to her or call her . she missed sara very much .

sara did not know what happened to her gift . she waited and waited for grandma to thank her . she did not get any letter or phone call from grandma . she was confused and sad . she wondered why grandma did not like her gift . she missed grandma very much . tom likes to help his dad fix things . he has a toy hammer that he uses to bang on nails and wood . he thinks he is very good at fixing things .

