dad hears tom cry . he runs to the shed and sees tom on the floor . he sees the hammer next to him . he sees a bump on his head . he is very worried . he picks up tom and hugs him . he says he is sorry . he says he will make him feel better . he takes him inside and puts some ice on his head . he gives him a cookie and a kiss . he tells him he loves him .

