lily and tom are happy . they are not afraid anymore . they say thank you to the man . they say bye to the dog . they eat their sandwiches and cookies . they play in the park . they have fun . sara and ben are twins who love to play hide and seek . one day , they decide to play in the big park near their house . sara is the seeker and ben is the hider . they make a promise to each other : no peeking and no cheating .

sara counts to ten and then starts to look for ben . she looks behind the trees , under the benches , and in the bushes . she can not find him anywhere . she wonders where he is hiding . she thinks maybe he is hiding in the slide . she runs to the slide and climbs up the ladder . she is about to look inside the slide when she hears a voice .

