they both giggle and continue to play . they have fun and respect their promise . they learn that peeking and cheating are not fair and not fun . they learn that keeping a promise and being honest are good and make them happy . tom and lily were twins who liked to play in their room . they had many toys and books and games . but they did not like to sleep in their room . they were afraid of the monster under their bed .

