they invited max to join them on their bed . they played with their toys and books and games . they had a lot of fun . they forgot to be afraid of the monster under their bed . they realized that he was not a terrible monster . he was a friendly monster . they hoped that he would stay with them forever . anna loved to sing . she sang every day , in the morning , in the afternoon , and at night . she sang to her dolls , to her cat , and to her mom . she sang happy songs , silly songs , and sad songs . singing made her feel good .

one day , anna went to the park with her mom . she saw a big pond with many flowers . she saw a white flower that looked like a star . she asked her mom what it was . her mom said it was a lily . anna liked the lily . she wanted to sing to it .

she ran to the edge of the pond and leaned over to see the lily better . she opened her mouth to sing , but then she slipped and fell into the water . she got wet and cold and scared . she cried out for her mom . her mom came and pulled her out of the water . she hugged her and wrapped her in a towel .

