they run back to the park and tell their friends about the truck . they say they learned something new and met someone different . they say they had a lot of fun . they say they want to hear and see the truck again . tim and sam were best friends . they liked to play in the yard with their toys . one day , they saw a big hole in the fence . they wanted to see what was on the other side .

