her friends followed her to the table and looked at the pies . they all looked yummy and smelled good . they thanked anna and her mom and picked a slice of pie . they ate and talked and laughed . they told anna that her pies were the best and that she was a popular baker . anna felt proud and happy . she loved her friends and her pies . she thought that this was the best party ever . ben and lily are twins . they like to play with their toys and puzzles . one day , they find a big box in the living room . it has a zip on it . they want to see what is inside .

