mia is older and smarter than them . she knows how to open zips . she sees ben and lily struggling with the box . she smiles and walks over to them . she takes the zip and gently wiggles it . it slides open . ben and lily are happy and excited . they hug mia and thank her . they are grateful for her help .

they look inside the box and see a lot of new books and games . they are for them . they are a surprise from their grandma . they are delighted and amazed . they take out the books and games and start to play with them . they share them with mia and their dog . they have a lot of fun . they love their grandma and their sister . they are a happy family . ben and lily were twins who liked to play with their toys . one day , they saw a big box with a bow on it in the living room . they wondered what was inside . maybe it was a new toy for them to share . they wanted to open it and see .

but mom said , " no , you ca n't open it . it is a mystery . it is a gift for grandma . we will wrap it and give it to her on her birthday . you have to wait and be patient . "

ben and lily were sad and curious . they waited for mom to go to the kitchen . then they tiptoed to the box and tried to peek inside . they lifted the lid a little bit and saw something soft and fluffy . it was a pink sweater with a heart on it .

