mom saw the box and smiled . she did not know what had happened . she picked up the box and said , " come on , kids . let 's go and wrap this mystery for grandma . she will love it ! " lily and ben were brother and sister . they liked to play in the backyard . one day , they saw a big hole in the fence . they wanted to see what was behind it .

they crawled through the hole and found a swamp . it was wet and muddy and smelled bad . there were frogs and bugs and snakes . lily and ben were fearful . they wanted to go back .

but then they heard a loud roar . it was a swamp monster . it had green scales and sharp teeth and red eyes . it saw lily and ben and wanted to eat them .

