lily and ben crawled through the hole and ran to the house . they hugged each other and told their mom what happened .

mom was proud of them for being brave and fighting the swamp monster . she gave them cookies and milk and fixed the hole in the fence . lily and ben never went to the swamp again . they were happy to play in the backyard . sara was a rich girl who had many toys and dresses . she liked to play with her dolls and her purse . her purse was pink and shiny and had a lot of coins inside . she liked to pretend that she was going to the store and buy more things .

one day , she saw a bunny in her garden . the bunny was white and fluffy and had long ears . sara wanted to pet the bunny and give it a carrot . she ran to the kitchen and got a carrot . then she went outside and looked for the bunny .

the bunny was hiding behind a bush . sara saw its ears and smiled . she walked slowly and quietly to the bush . she held out the carrot and said , " hello , bunny . do you want to be my friend ? " the bunny saw the carrot and smelled it . it was hungry and curious .

the bunny came out of the bush and hopped to sara . sara was happy and reached out to touch the bunny . but the bunny was scared and shy . it did not like to be touched by strangers . it saw sara 's purse and thought it was a toy . it grabbed the purse with its teeth and ran away .

sara was shocked and sad . she cried , " no , bunny , no ! that is my purse ! give it back ! " she chased the bunny , but the bunny was fast and clever . it sprang over the fence and disappeared . sara stopped and sobbed . she lost her purse and her coins . she learned that not all animals like to play with her . she wished she had been more gentle and careful with the bunny . lily was a big girl who liked to dance . she had a pretty dress and a veil that her mom made for her . she was going to dance in front of many people at the school show .

she was not scared , but excited . she wanted to show everyone how well she could dance . she practiced a lot with her mom and her teacher . she knew all the steps and the music .

when it was her turn , she went on the stage with a big smile . she saw her mom and dad in the crowd . they waved at her and gave her a thumbs up . she heard the music start and began to dance . she twirled , jumped , and spun with grace . she felt happy and proud .

the music ended and she bowed . she heard a loud noise . it was the people clapping . they were applauding for her . they liked her dance . she saw her mom and dad stand up and cheer . they were so proud of her . she felt a warm feeling in her heart .

she ran to them and hugged them . they told her she was amazing and brave . she thanked them and told them she loved them . she felt very lucky . she had a tough day , but a wonderful night . she was a big girl who liked to dance . lily and max are twins . they like to play in the bathtub . they have many toys in the water . they have a duck , a boat , a fish and a frog .

one day , lily has an idea . she says to max , " let 's change our toys . you give me your boat and i give you my duck . then we can play different games . "

