they swap their toys and start to play . lily pretends that her boat is a pirate ship . she says , " arrr , i am a strong pirate . i will take your treasure , max . "

max pretends that his duck is a superhero . he says , " no , lily . you ca n't take my treasure . i am a strong superhero . i will stop you , pirate . "

they splash and laugh in the bathtub . they have a lot of fun . they forget about the time . they do not hear their mom calling them .

