mom says , " i 'm glad you had fun , but you also made a mess . next time , please do n't splash so much . and do n't forget to change your toys back . now , come on . let 's dry you off and get you ready for bed . " tim and anna liked to play in the park . they liked to skip on the grass , swing on the swings , and slide on the slides . they also liked to share their toys and equipment with other kids .

one day , they saw a new kid in the park . his name was max . he had a big bag of equipment . he had balls , bats , cones , and ropes . tim and anna wanted to play with him and his equipment .

