tim and anna felt sad and angry . they did not like max . they decided to leave him alone and play with other kids .

max played with his equipment by himself . he did not have any friends . he did not have any fun . he was very lonely and unhappy .

soon , it started to rain . the rain was heavy and cold . max did not have an umbrella or a coat . he got wet and dirty . his equipment got wet and dirty too . some of his equipment broke or got lost in the mud .

max cried and cried . he wished he had shared his equipment with tim and anna . he wished he had been nice and friendly . he wished he had skipped on the grass , swung on the swings , and slid on the slides . but it was too late . he had a bad day . he learned a hard lesson . ben and lily liked to draw with crayons . they had many colors and shapes to make pictures . one day , they found a big paper on the wall . it had a symbol on it . the symbol was a circle with a line and a dot . it was the sun .

