they drew more things on the paper . they made a house , a tree , a bird , and a flower . they were happy .

but then , a man came into the room . he saw the paper on the wall . he was angry . he shouted at ben and lily . " what have you done ? this is a terrible mess ! this is not a paper for drawing . this is a map . the symbol is the sun . it shows where we are . you have ruined it ! "

ben and lily were scared . they did not know what a map was . they did not know they did something bad . they dropped their crayons and ran away . they hid under a table . they were sad . they worried that the man would be mad at them forever . they wished they had not drawn on the paper . they wished they had asked first . lily and ben are brother and sister . they like to play with toys and watch cartoons . one day , their mom says they can order pizza for dinner . lily and ben are happy . they love pizza .

mom asks them what they want on their pizza . lily says she wants cheese and olives . ben says he wants cheese and pepperoni . mom orders the pizza on the phone . she says it will come soon .

lily and ben wait for the pizza . they play with their blocks and cars . they hear a knock on the door . mom opens the door . it is the pizza man . he has a big box with their pizza .

mom pays the pizza man and takes the box . she puts it on the table . she says , " let 's eat ! " lily and ben run to the table . they are hungry .

mom cuts the pizza into slices . she gives lily a slice with cheese and olives . she gives ben a slice with cheese and pepperoni . lily and ben take a bite . they say , " yum ! "

lily looks at ben 's slice . she sees the red pepperoni . she thinks it looks tasty . she wants to try it . she is envious of ben . she says , " can i have some of your pepperoni ? "

ben looks at lily 's slice . he sees the black olives . he thinks they look gross . he does not want to try them . he is happy with his pepperoni . he says , " no , this is mine . you have your olives . "

