mom smiles . she says , " that 's better . now , enjoy your pizza . and next time , maybe you can order something new . " lily and ben nod . they eat their pizza . they are happy . lily and ben are friends who live on a farm . they like to play in the wheat field and look for bugs and birds . sometimes they tease each other and make funny noises .

one day , they see a big orange cat in the wheat . it is hiding and watching them . lily and ben are curious and want to pet the cat . they walk slowly and quietly towards it .

but the cat does not want to be petted . it is scared and angry . it hisses and scratches at them . lily and ben run away and cry . they have red marks on their arms and legs .

the farmer hears them and comes to see what is wrong . he sees the cat and chases it away . he tells lily and ben that the cat is wild and does not like people . he gives them a hug and a band - aid . he says they should not tease the cat or go near it .

lily and ben say they are sorry and they learned their lesson . they decide to play somewhere else and be nice to animals . they are still friends and they are happy . tom and lily are best friends . they like to play together every day . they share their toys , their snacks and their secrets . they make each other happy .

one day , tom has a surprise for lily . he finds a red balloon in his room . he blows it up and ties a string to it . he thinks lily will love it . he runs to her house with the balloon .

lily sees tom and his balloon . she smiles and runs to him . she hugs him and says , " thank you , tom ! you are so smart and kind . you always think of me . "

tom hugs her back and says , " you are welcome , lily . you are so smart and sweet . you always make me laugh . "

they squeeze each other 's hands and look at the balloon . it is shiny and round . it looks like a big heart . they feel a warm and happy feeling in their own hearts . they are best friends . tim and mia liked to play with their toys in the garden . they had a lot of fun with their cars , dolls , balls and blocks . but they also liked to pretend they had magic powers . they would wave their hands and say funny words , and imagine they could make things happen .

one day , they found a big stick in the grass . it looked like a magic wand . tim picked it up and said , " i am a wizard ! i can do anything i want ! " mia said , " no , i am a fairy ! i can do better magic than you ! " they started to argue and fight over the stick . they pulled and pushed and shouted .

then , something strange happened . the stick glowed and sparkled . it made a loud noise . tim and mia felt a shock in their hands . they let go of the stick and fell to the ground . they looked at each other and saw that they had changed . tim had wings and a dress . mia had a beard and a hat . they had swapped their magic powers !

they were very scared and confused . they did not like their new looks . they wanted to go back to normal . they tried to use their magic , but it did not work . they did not know the right words or gestures . they started to cry and scream .

their mom heard them and came to the garden . she saw them and gasped . she was very troubled . she did not know what had happened or how to fix it . she picked up the stick and saw that it had a label . it said , " magic trick wand . for ages 10 and up . warning : do not use on people or animals . may cause unexpected effects . " she realized that it was a toy from the store , but a very dangerous one . she wished she had never bought it . she hugged tim and mia and said , " do n't worry , my loves . we will find a way to make you normal again . i 'm sorry i gave you this bad stick . it was not real magic . it was a trick . " lily liked to play dress - up with her mom 's clothes . she would take them from the closet and put them on . she would pretend to be a princess , a teacher , or a doctor . she had a lot of fun .

but sometimes , she forgot to put the clothes back . she would leave them on the floor , on the bed , or on the chair . her mom would get mad and tell her to clean up . lily did not like to clean up . she thought it was boring .

one day , lily found a hanger in the closet . it was shiny and metal . she wondered what it was for . she tried to bend it , but it was too hard . she tried to wear it , but it was too big . she tried to throw it , but it was too heavy . she did not think it was useful .

then , she had an idea . she took the hanger and hooked it on the door . she took some of her mom 's clothes and hung them on the hanger . she made a curtain with the clothes . she went behind the curtain and said , " ta - da ! i am a magician ! "

she came out of the curtain and changed her clothes . she went back and said , " ta - da ! i am a dancer ! " she did this many times , with different clothes and different words . she had a lot of fun .

her mom came home and saw the mess . she was about to get mad , but then she saw lily behind the curtain . she heard her say , " ta - da ! i am a chef ! " she smiled and said , " wow , lily , you are very creative . you made a hanger useful . "

lily came out of the curtain and hugged her mom . she said , " thank you , mom . i love you . i will clean up now . " she took the clothes off the hanger and put them back in the closet . she gave the hanger to her mom and said , " here , mom . you can have it . it is useful . "

her mom hugged her back and said , " thank you , lily . i love you too . you are a good girl . you made my day . " they both smiled and went to the kitchen . they made some cookies and ate them . they had a lot of fun .

the end . tom and mia were playing in the park . they saw a bird on a tree . the bird was filthy . it had mud and feathers on its body .

" look , a filthy bird ! " tom said .

" yuck , it is dirty ! " mia said .

they wanted to see the bird better . they walked close to the tree . the bird saw them and flew away .

" bye , filthy bird ! " tom said .

" where did it go ? " mia asked .

they looked around . they saw the bird on another tree . it was cleaning itself with its beak .

" look , it is cleaning itself ! " mia said .

" wow , it is smart ! " tom said .

they smiled and clapped . the bird looked at them and chirped . they waved at the bird and said hello . the bird flew away again .

" bye , bye , bird ! " tom and mia said .

they went back to playing in the park . they had fun . they liked the bird . lily and tom were twins who liked to play together . but one day , they had a big fight over a toy car . they shouted and pushed each other until their mom came and took the car away . she said they had to share and be nice , or they would have no toys at all .

lily and tom were very angry and sad . they did not want to talk to each other or play with anything else . they sat on opposite sides of the room and made faces . they felt miserable .

at lunchtime , mom made them some soup and bread . she put a dish of soup in front of each of them and told them to eat . but lily and tom did not want to eat . they just stared at their soup and sighed .

mom saw that they were still upset and had an idea . she whispered something in lily 's ear and then in tom 's ear . lily and tom looked at each other and smiled a little . they picked up their spoons and started to eat their soup .

but they did not eat it normally . they ate it very quietly and slowly , making funny shapes with their mouths . they pretended they were eating worms , or mud , or bugs . they giggled and winked at each other . they had a secret game .

mom watched them and smiled too . she was glad they were having fun and getting along . she whispered to herself , " maybe they will be friends again after all . " lily was a little girl who liked to display her toys . she had many toys , but her favorite was a big red nose . she liked to put it on and make funny noises . she always made her mom and dad laugh .

one day , lily wanted to show her nose to her friend sam . she put it in her backpack and went to his house . she knocked on the door and sam opened it . he was happy to see her .

" hi , lily ! do you want to play ? " he asked .

" yes , sam ! i have something to show you . it is very funny , " she said .

she opened her backpack and reached for her nose . but her hand felt nothing . her backpack was empty . she looked inside and saw a hole . her nose had fallen out on the way .

" oh no ! where is my nose ? " she cried .

sam saw her sad face and hugged her . he said , " do n't worry , lily . we can find your nose . maybe it is on the street . let 's go and look . "

they went outside and followed the path that lily had taken . they looked for the big red nose . they asked people if they had seen it . but no one had .

lily was very sad . she thought she had lost her nose forever . she said , " i 'm sorry , sam . i wanted to display my nose to you . but now it is gone . "

sam said , " it 's okay , lily . i 'm sure we will find it . maybe it is at the park . we can go there and play . maybe someone found it and left it there . "

they went to the park and looked around . they saw swings and slides and benches and trees . but they did not see the nose .

they decided to play on the swings for a while . they pushed each other and had fun . they forgot about the nose for a moment .

then , lily heard a familiar noise . it was a honk . she looked up and saw a clown . he was wearing a big red nose . he was making balloons for the children .

lily ran to the clown and said , " excuse me , sir . is that your nose ? "

the clown smiled and said , " no , little girl . this is not my nose . this is your nose . i found it on the street . i thought it was a toy . i was going to give it back to you . but i saw you were sad . so i decided to wear it and make you laugh . "

he took off the nose and gave it to lily . she was very happy . she thanked the clown and hugged him . she said , " you are very kind , sir . you made me laugh . and you gave me back my nose . thank you very much . "

she put on the nose and honked it . she ran to sam and said , " look , sam ! i found my nose . the clown had it . he was very nice . he wanted to display it to me . he wanted to make me happy . "

sam was happy too . he said , " that 's great , lily . i 'm glad you have your nose back . it is very funny . can i try it ? "

lily said , " sure , sam . you can try it . we can share it . we can display it to everyone . we can make them laugh . "

they took turns wearing the nose and honking it . they made the clown and the children and the parents laugh . they had a lot of fun . they learned that sometimes , losing something can lead to finding something better . they learned that displaying something can mean sharing something . they learned that laughing is the best thing to do . lila and ben liked to play with their toy dinosaurs . they had many different kinds of dinosaurs , big and small , with horns and spikes and long tails . they also had a toy volcano that could make red foam come out when they pressed a button .

one day , they decided to make a game where the dinosaurs had to escape from the volcano before it erupted . they put some dinosaurs near the volcano and some far away . they took turns to press the button and make the foam come out . they made loud noises like " roar " and " boom " and " splat " .

lila had a big green dinosaur that she liked very much . she called it rex . she put rex far away from the volcano , because she did not want him to get hurt . ben had a small yellow dinosaur that he called snap . he put snap near the volcano , because he thought it was more fun .

when ben pressed the button , the foam came out and covered snap . snap was scared and tried to run away , but he was stuck . he made a noise like " snap , snap , snap " with his mouth . lila heard snap and felt sorry for him . she took rex and ran to help snap . she used rex 's tail to push away the foam and free snap . snap was happy and thanked lila and rex . he said " snap , snap , snap " in a friendly way .

lila and ben learned that it was not nice to put their toys in danger . they also learned that rex 's tail was very useful . they decided to play a different game where the dinosaurs were friends and helped each other . they had more fun and were more careful with their toys . they still liked the volcano , but they used it less often . jill liked to play in the old shed . she liked to look at the tools and the boxes and the jars . but she did not like the cobwebs . they were sticky and icky and made her sneeze .

one day , she saw a big cobweb in the corner . it had a purple spider on it . the spider was shiny and had eight legs . jill was scared of the spider . she wanted to run away .

but then she saw something else . it was a doll . a pretty doll with a pink dress and yellow hair . the doll was under the cobweb . jill wanted the doll . she reached out her hand .

the spider saw jill . it did not like jill . it wanted to keep the doll . it made a hissing noise and moved closer to jill . jill was more scared . she pulled back her hand .

she looked at the spider and the doll . she wanted to play with the doll , but she did not want to touch the spider . she did not know what to do . she wished the spider would quit being mean and let her have the doll . she wished the cobweb would go away . she wished she had a friend to help her . lily and ben wanted to play in the dark . they took a flashlight from the kitchen and went to the basement . they turned off the light and closed the door . it was very dark and quiet .

they used the flashlight to make shadows on the wall . they made a dog , a bird , a rabbit and a monster . they laughed and had fun . they tried to scare each other with the monster shadow .

but then , the flashlight stopped working . it made a click sound and went off . lily and ben were scared . they could not see anything . they could not find the door . they cried for help .

mom heard them and came to the basement . she opened the door and turned on the light . she saw lily and ben holding the flashlight . she hugged them and said , " do n't worry , you are safe . the flashlight just needs new batteries . let 's go upstairs and have some cookies . "

lily and ben felt better . they said sorry to mom for taking the flashlight . they said they wanted to play in the dark . mom said it was okay to play , but they should always ask first . she said they were very brave and successful in making shadows . she gave them cookies and milk . they smiled and thanked mom . they decided to play something else next time . ben and mia like to bounce . they bounce on their beds , on the sofa , on the trampoline . they bounce high and low , fast and slow , with joy and laughter .

one day , they want to bounce in the town . they ask their mom if they can go . mom says yes , but they have to be careful . there are many cars and people in the town . they have to hold hands and look both ways .

