lily and ben scream . they drop the map and run away . they hope the dog wo n't catch them . they hope mom will find them . they hope they will be safe . one day , ben and lily were playing with their toys in the living room . they had many cars , dolls , blocks and books . they liked to make noises and stories with their toys . but they did not like to clean up after they played .

