their mom came to the living room and saw the mess . she was not happy . she frowned and said , " ben , lily , look at this mess ! you have to clean up your toys now ! and you have to go to the doctor . the doctor is good for you . the doctor helps you stay healthy and strong . the doctor is not scary . the doctor is nice . "

