one day , mia and leo are playing with their toys . mia puts her doll on the bed and covers her with a sheet . she says , " shh , my doll is sleeping . do n't wake her up . " leo sees the sheet and thinks it looks fun . he wants to play with it . he says , " i want the sheet . give it to me . " he pulls the sheet from the bed .

