one day , sara saw ben 's skeleton and wanted to play with it . she thought it looked fun and different . she took it from ben when he was not looking and ran to her room . ben saw sara take his skeleton and got angry . he followed her and tried to get it back . sara and ben started to fight over the skeleton . they pulled and pushed and shouted .

mom heard the noise and came to see what was wrong . she saw sara and ben fighting over the skeleton and was not happy . she told them to stop and asked them why they were fighting . sara and ben both said that they wanted the skeleton and that the other one was selfish . mom shook her head and said that they were both selfish . she said that they should learn to share and play nicely with each other . she said that if they did not , she would take away both the doll and the skeleton .

sara and ben did not want to lose their toys . they looked at each other and felt sorry . they said sorry to mom and to each other . they decided to share and play nicely with each other . they took turns playing with the doll and the skeleton . they had fun and made each other laugh . mom smiled and was proud of them .

it was getting late and mom said that it was time for bed . sara and ben yawned and agreed . they put away their toys and hugged mom goodnight . they went to their rooms and fell asleep . they dreamed of dolls and skeletons and friends . they were not selfish anymore . sara and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys and books . they are lively and happy . one day , they go to the store with mom . mom gives them some money to buy a treat .

sara sees some gum . she likes gum . she asks mom , " can i have some gum , please ? "

