ben feels ashamed . he says , " i 'm sorry , mom . i was wrong . i should have listened to you and had only one piece of gum . "

mom says , " i forgive you , ben . but i hope you learned your lesson . greed and dishonesty are bad . they can cause trouble and pain . next time , be happy with what you have and tell the truth . "

ben says , " i will , mom . i love you . "

