sara hugs ben . she says , " do n't worry , ben . your hair will grow back . and i will share my gum with you . "

ben smiles . he says , " thank you , sara . you are a good sister . "

sara and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys and books . they are lively and happy . and they are also kind and honest . sam liked to play with his cars in the garage . he had many cars of different colors and sizes . he made them zoom and beep and crash on the floor . he pretended he was a driver and went on adventures .

but sometimes , sam got tired of playing . he wanted to rest and be quiet . he looked for a cozy spot in the garage . he saw a big box with a soft blanket inside . he climbed into the box and wrapped the blanket around him . he felt warm and snug .

the garage was peaceful . sam could not hear the cars or the people outside . he could only hear his own breathing and his heartbeat . he closed his eyes and smiled . he fell asleep and dreamed of more adventures . he was happy . i like to play guess with my mom . she shows me a card with a picture and i have to say what it is . sometimes it is easy , like a cat or a ball . sometimes it is hard , like a star or a spoon . i get excited when i guess right and she claps for me .

