i thought hard and looked at the word again . then i had an idea . i said , " mine ! " she nodded and hugged me . she said , " yes , that 's right ! and this card is yours , too . it is a gift for you , because you are learning to read . " i was so happy and proud . i said , " thank you , mom . i love you and i love this card . it is mine ! " lily liked to sing songs . she had a toy that could record her voice . she wanted to show her songs to her mom and dad . she took the toy to her room and opened her wardrobe . she saw many dresses and shoes . she wanted to look pretty for her songs .

