her mom came to her room and knocked on the door . she opened the door and saw lily in her wardrobe . she saw the toy in her hand . she heard the song . she was not happy . she said , " lily , what are you doing ? you made a mess in your wardrobe . you did not listen to me . you did not do your homework . you did not help me with the dishes . you only played with your toy . that is not good . that is not easy . that is hard . "

lily felt sad . she did not want to make her mom angry . she said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i wanted to sing songs for you and dad . i wanted to make you happy . i did not know you needed me . i did not know i had homework . i did not know i had to help you . i only wanted to have fun . "

her mom hugged her and said , " i know , lily . i love your songs . they are very beautiful . but you also have to do other things . you have to learn and help and listen . that is how you grow and be good . that is how you make me and dad happy . that is how you have fun . do you understand ? "

lily nodded and said , " yes , mom . i understand . i will do my homework and help you with the dishes . i will listen to you and dad . i will also sing songs , but not too loud and not too long . i will share my toy with you and dad . i will be good and easy . "

her mom smiled and said , " that 's my girl . i 'm proud of you . now , let 's go and clean up your wardrobe . then , we can listen to your songs together . and maybe , we can sing along with you . how does that sound ? "

lily smiled and said , " that sounds great , mom . i love you . "

the end . lily and tom were friends who liked to play with blocks . they had many blocks of different colors and shapes . they could make houses , towers , cars and animals with their blocks .

one day , they decided to make a big castle with their blocks . they worked hard and used many blocks to make the walls , the doors , the windows and the towers . they were very proud of their castle .

but then , ben came along . ben was a mean boy who liked to break things . he saw the castle and wanted to play with it . he did not ask lily and tom if he could join them . he just grabbed some blocks and started to add them to the castle .

lily and tom did not like what ben was doing . he was making the castle look bad . he was using blocks that did not match the colors or the shapes of the castle . he was making the castle too big and too messy .

lily and tom complained to ben . they told him to stop and to go away . they said he was ruining their castle . they said he was not their friend .

but ben did not listen . he laughed and said he was having fun . he said he could do whatever he wanted with the blocks . he said he did not care about lily and tom .

lily and tom were very sad and angry . they did not know what to do . they wanted to save their castle , but they were afraid of ben . he was bigger and stronger than them .

