lily and tom cried . they had worked so hard and now their castle was gone . they had a poor day . they wished ben would go away and never come back . they wished they could have their castle back . they wished they could play with their blocks in peace . tim and sam were brothers who liked to play with their toys . but they did not like to share . they always fought over who got the best toy , or who had more toys , or who played longer . they made a lot of noise and did not listen to their mom .

one day , mom had enough . she took away all their toys and put them in a big box . she said they could not have them back until they learned to be nice and share . she said they had to sit in their room and think about what they did .

tim and sam were very angry and sad . they sat on their bed and did not talk to each other . they did not have anything to do . they only heard the silence . the silence was bitter . it made them feel lonely and bored .

after a while , tim looked at sam and said he was sorry . he said he did not like to fight and he wanted to play with him . sam said he was sorry too . he said he did not like the silence and he wanted to be friends . they hugged and said they loved each other .

mom heard them and smiled . she came into their room and gave them back their toys . she said she was proud of them for saying sorry and being nice . she said they could play with their toys , but they had to share and take turns . she said sharing was caring .

tim and sam nodded and thanked mom . they played with their toys and had fun . they did not fight anymore . they shared and took turns . they made happy noises and listened to mom . they learned that the silence was bitter , but the friendship was sweet . tim and jen like to play hide and seek in the park . they take turns to count and hide . one day , they see a big wreck near the pond . it is a car that has crashed into a tree . the car is wet and dirty and has a broken window .

tim and jen are curious . they want to see the wreck up close . they run to the pond and hide behind the car . they peek inside the window and see a lot of things . they see a bag , a hat , a book and a toy . they wonder who owns them .

but then they hear a loud voice . it is a man who is angry . he is looking for his car . he sees tim and jen hiding behind the car . he shouts at them and tells them to go away . he says they are bad kids who are messing with his car .

tim and jen are scared . they run away from the car and the man . they run back to the park and find their mom . they tell her what happened . she hugs them and says they are not bad kids . she says they should not go near the wreck . she says it is dangerous and not a good place to hide . she says they should play hide and seek somewhere else . tim and jen agree . they say they are sorry and they love their mom . they go to play hide and seek in the playground . they have fun and forget about the wreck . sara likes to paint . she has many colors of paint and a big paper . she paints a house , a tree , a sun and a cat . she is happy with her painting .

but then , the fog comes . the fog is white and thick . it covers everything outside . sara can not see the house , the tree , the sun or the cat . she is sad . she does not like the fog .

