she shows her painting to her mom . her mom likes it . she says sara is very creative . she gives sara a hug and a cookie . sara smiles . she likes to paint . she likes the fog . she likes her mom . lily and ben were playing in the park . they saw a big dog with brown fur and a long tail . the dog was sleeping under a tree .

