it ran to the road . it hoped to find lily and tom . it wanted to be their friend . it wanted to be an honest goat . lily likes to play with her rocks . she has many rocks of different colors and shapes . she calls them minerals . she likes to mix them in her bucket and make patterns .

one day , she finds a new mineral in the garden . it is white and soft and sparkly . she thinks it is very pretty . she puts it in her bucket with her other minerals .

she wants to show her mom her new mineral . she runs to the house with her bucket . but on the way , she trips and falls . her bucket spills and her minerals scatter on the ground .

she feels sad and cries . her mom hears her and comes to help . she hugs lily and says , " it 's okay , sweetie . we can pick up your minerals and put them back in your bucket . they are still beautiful . "

she helps lily gather her minerals . she sees the white one and says , " wow , this is a special mineral . it is called salt . it is mild and tasty . you can use it to mix with your food and make it more yummy . "

lily smiles and says , " really ? can i try ? " she licks the salt and makes a funny face . she says , " it is mild , but also salty . i like it . can i keep it ? "

her mom says , " of course you can . it is your mineral . you can mix it with whatever you like . but do n't eat too much , or you will be thirsty . "

lily nods and says , " thank you , mom . i love you and i love my minerals . " she puts the salt in her bucket and hugs her mom . they go inside to have a snack and mix some salt with their food . tim and jen were playing in the park . they saw a big dog with a red ball . they wanted to play with the dog and the ball . they ran to the dog and said , " hi , dog ! can we play with you ? "

the dog did not like tim and jen . the dog was mean and ugly . the dog growled and showed his teeth . he did not want to share his ball . he set his mouth on the ball and ran away .

tim and jen were sad and scared . they did not like the mean and ugly dog . they ran back to their mom and dad . they told them what happened . mom and dad hugged them and said , " it 's ok , tim and jen . some dogs are not nice . but we are nice . we love you . do you want to play with our ball ? "

tim and jen nodded and smiled . they forgot about the mean and ugly dog . they played with their mom and dad and their ball . they had fun in the park . they were happy . lila loves dolphins . she has a big toy dolphin that she sleeps with every night . she hugs it and squeezes it tight . she likes to pretend that she is swimming with dolphins in the sea .

one day , lila goes to the zoo with her mom and dad . they see many animals , but lila is most excited to see the dolphins . they are gray and shiny and jump out of the water . lila claps and laughs . she wants to touch them and squeeze them .

lila 's mom and dad buy her a ticket to feed the dolphins . lila is very happy . she holds a fish in her hand and walks to the edge of the pool . a dolphin comes close and opens its mouth . lila throws the fish and the dolphin catches it . lila smiles .

the dolphin comes back and nudges lila 's hand with its nose . lila feels its skin . it is smooth and wet . lila gently strokes the dolphin and says , " hello , dolphin . you are so nice . i love you . " the dolphin makes a squeaky sound and wags its tail .

lila leans over and gives the dolphin a kiss . she wraps her arms around its head and squeezes it tight . the dolphin hugs her back with its flippers . lila feels warm and happy . she thinks , " this is the best day ever . i wish i could stay with the dolphin forever . " lily liked to dress up in her mom 's clothes . she liked to wear big hats and shiny shoes and long dresses . she liked to pretend she was a princess or a teacher or a doctor . she had a lot of fun playing dress up in her room .

one day , her mom said they were going to the park . lily wanted to go , but she also wanted to dress up . she had an idea . she put on her mom 's red dress , her mom 's blue hat , and her mom 's yellow shoes . she looked very funny , but she thought she looked very pretty . she grabbed her mom 's purse and ran to the door .

her mom saw her and smiled . she said , " lily , you look very nice , but that 's not a normal outfit for the park . you might get dirty or hot or hurt . why do n't you change into something more comfortable ? " lily shook her head . she wanted to wear her dress up clothes . she said , " please , mom , please . i want to dress up . i want to be a princess at the park . "

her mom sighed . she said , " okay , lily , okay . but you have to be careful . and you have to listen to me . and you have to share your toys with the other kids . do you understand ? " lily nodded . she said , " yes , mom , yes . i will be careful . i will listen . i will share . can we go now ? " her mom said , " yes , we can go now . but first , let me get something for you . " she went to the freezer and took out a cone of ice - cream . she gave it to lily and said , " here , this is for you . a special treat for a special girl . but you have to eat it fast , or it will melt . "

lily was very happy . she loved ice - cream . she said , " thank you , mom , thank you . you are the best mom ever . " she licked the ice - cream and smiled . she held her mom 's hand and walked to the car . she was ready to go to the park . she was ready to have fun . she did not know that her dress up clothes and her ice - cream would cause a lot of trouble . she did not know that her mom had a plan . she did not know that her mom was very smart . she did not know that sometimes , normal is better . tom and lily like to eat salad . salad is good for them . it has green leaves , red tomatoes , yellow cheese and brown nuts . they make salad with mom in the kitchen . they wash the leaves , cut the tomatoes , grate the cheese and chop the nuts . they put them in a big bowl and mix them with oil and vinegar . they are happy and hungry .

they take the salad to the table and sit down . mom brings bread and water . they say thank you and start to eat . the salad is yummy and crunchy . they eat a lot and feel full . they leave some salad in the bowl for later . they clear the table and put the bowl in the fridge . they go to play in the living room . they have fun with their toys and books .

they forget about the salad . the salad stays in the fridge for a long time . it gets old and bad . the leaves turn brown and slimy . the tomatoes get soft and mushy . the cheese gets hard and smelly . the nuts get stale and bitter . the oil and vinegar separate and drip . the salad rots in the bowl . it is not yummy and crunchy anymore . it is yucky and gross .

one day , mom opens the fridge and sees the salad . she is surprised and angry . she says , " who left this salad in the fridge ? it is rotten and nasty . it is a waste of food and money . it is not good for anyone . it has to go in the trash . " she takes the bowl out of the fridge and holds her nose . she walks to the trash can and dumps the salad . the bowl is empty and dirty . she washes the bowl and puts it away .

tom and lily hear mom and feel sorry . they remember the salad . they say , " we are sorry , mom . we forgot the salad . we did not mean to make it rot . we will not do it again . we will eat all our salad next time . we will help you make a new salad . " mom smiles and hugs them . she says , " it is ok , my loves . i forgive you . you are good and sweet . you can help me make a new salad . we will have it for dinner . it will be fresh and tasty . " they are happy and hungry again . anna and ben like to pretend they are pirates . they have a big box that is their ship . they put a stick and a cloth on it to make a flag . they say " arrr ! " and " ahoy ! " and look for treasure .

one day , they find a shiny coin in the sand . anna says , " this is mine ! i saw it first ! " ben says , " no , it is mine ! i dug it up ! " they both pull on the coin and try to take it .

the coin flies out of their hands and lands in a puddle . the puddle is wet and muddy . the coin is not shiny anymore . anna and ben are sad and mad . they do not want to play pirates anymore .

they sit on the dry grass and do not talk to each other . they look at the box and the flag . they think about the fun they had before . they miss each other .

anna says , " i am sorry , ben . i was mean . you can have the coin . " ben says , " i am sorry , anna . i was mean too . you can have the coin . " they both smile and hug . they say , " let 's share the coin . we are friends . "

they go back to the box and the flag . they pretend they are pirates again . they say " arrr ! " and " ahoy ! " and look for more treasure . they are happy . the end . ben and mia love to play in the park . they like to slide , swing , and run . but their favorite thing is to rock on the big tiger . the tiger is rare . it is not like the other animals on the rockers . it is orange and black , and has sharp teeth and a long tail .

one day , when ben and mia go to the park , they see that the tiger is gone . they are sad and confused . where did the tiger go ? they ask their mom , but she does not know . they ask the park keeper , but he does not know either . they look around , but they can not find the tiger .

they are about to give up , when they hear a roar . they follow the sound , and see the tiger in a new place . it is on a big truck , with a sign that says " zoo " . the park keeper is there , and he smiles at them . he says that the tiger is going to a new home , where it can meet other tigers and be happy . he says that they can visit the tiger at the zoo , and that he will send them a picture of the tiger with its new friends .

ben and mia are still sad , but they are also happy for the tiger . they wave goodbye to the tiger , and the tiger roars back . they hug their mom , and thank the park keeper . they decide to rock on the other animals , and make up stories about them . but they always remember the rare tiger , and look forward to seeing it again . lily liked to help mom with the laundry . she would part the clothes into two piles : one for white and one for color . she would put the white clothes in the big machine and add some soap . then she would press the button and watch the clothes spin and splash .

when the machine stopped , she would take out the white clothes and put them in the basket . then she would do the same with the color clothes . she felt very powerful when she pressed the button and made the machine work .

one day , she wanted to surprise mom and do the laundry by herself . she parted the clothes into two piles , but she did not look carefully . she put some red socks in the white pile and some white shirts in the color pile . she added some soap and pressed the button .

she waited for the machine to stop and then took out the clothes . she was shocked to see that the white clothes were pink and the color clothes were dull . she did not feel powerful anymore . she felt sad and scared . she did not know what to do .

she ran to mom and showed her the clothes . she said she was sorry and that she wanted to help . mom hugged her and said it was okay . she said she was proud of her for trying to help , but that she should always ask first . she said they could fix the clothes with some bleach and some dye . she said they could do the laundry together and have some fun . lily smiled and felt better . she learned a lesson and still liked to help mom with the laundry . anna liked to swim . she had a swim class every week with her friends . she learned how to kick , splash and breathe in the water . she had a lot of fun .

but anna also liked to win . she was competitive . she wanted to be the fastest swimmer in her class . she always tried to beat the other kids in the races . she did not like to lose .

one day , anna had a swim test . she had to dress in her swim suit and swim across the pool . she was nervous and excited . she wanted to get a good score and a sticker .

she lined up with the other kids at the edge of the pool . the teacher blew the whistle . anna jumped in the water and started to swim . she swam as fast as she could . she looked at the other kids . she was ahead of them . she smiled .

but then , she felt something tug on her leg . it was her swim suit . it was too big for her . it was slipping off . she stopped swimming and tried to pull it up . but it was too late . her swim suit came off and floated away . anna was embarrassed . she covered herself with her hands and cried .

the teacher saw what happened . she swam to anna and wrapped her in a towel . she said , " it 's okay , anna . it was an accident . do n't worry . you did a great job . you are a good swimmer . you can try again next time . here , have a sticker . "

anna sniffed and nodded . she thanked the teacher and hugged her . she felt better . she learned that swimming was not only about winning . it was also about having fun and being kind . she decided to be less competitive and more friendly . she also decided to get a new swim suit that fit her better . lila and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . they enjoy the swings , the slide and the sandbox . they also like to watch the birds fly in the sky . they think the birds are pretty and fast .

one day , they see a big , black bird . it is a crow . the crow is rude . it makes loud noises and scares the other birds . it also tries to take their snacks . lila and ben do not like the crow . they want it to go away .

" shoo , shoo , crow ! " they say . " you are not nice . you are not welcome . leave us alone ! "

but the crow does not listen . it laughs and flaps its wings . it thinks it is funny to bother lila and ben . it does not care if they are sad or angry .

lila and ben are upset . they do not enjoy the park anymore . they decide to go home . they hope the crow will not follow them . they hope they will not see it again . they hope the other birds will come back . they hope they will have fun in the park tomorrow . anna and ben liked to help their mom in the kitchen . they wanted to make a cake for dad 's birthday . mom gave them a big bowl and some spoons . she said , " you can mix the flour , the eggs , the milk and the sugar . but be careful , do n't make a mess . "

anna and ben took turns to stir the bowl . they had fun making the cake batter . they poured it into a pan and smoothed the top . mom said , " now we have to bake the cake in the oven . the oven is very hot , so you have to stay away from it . do you understand ? "

anna and ben nodded . they said , " yes , mom , we understand . the oven is hot . we will stay away from it . " mom smiled and put the pan in the oven . she set the timer and said , " the cake will be ready in half an hour . let 's go to the living room and wait . "

anna and ben followed mom to the living room . they played with their toys and watched some cartoons . they forgot about the cake in the oven . they did not hear the timer beep . they did not smell the cake burning . they did not see the smoke coming out of the kitchen .

mom was reading a book on the couch . she suddenly smelled something bad . she looked up and saw the smoke . she jumped up and ran to the kitchen . she saw the cake in the oven . it was black and hard . she opened the oven and took out the pan . she was very angry and sad . she said , " oh no , the cake is ruined . anna , ben , come here right now . this is serious . "

anna and ben heard mom 's voice . they were scared . they ran to the kitchen . they saw the cake in the pan . it was not a cake anymore . it was a rock . they felt sorry . they said , " mom , we are sorry . we forgot about the cake . we did not mean to ruin it . please do n't be mad at us . "

mom looked at anna and ben . she saw their faces . they were sad and sorry . she felt sorry too . she said , " i know you did not mean to ruin the cake . but you have to be more careful . the oven is not a toy . it can be dangerous . you have to listen to me when i tell you something . do you understand ? "

anna and ben nodded . they said , " yes , mom , we understand . the oven is not a toy . it can be dangerous . we will listen to you when you tell us something . we are sorry . please forgive us . "

mom hugged anna and ben . she said , " i forgive you . i love you . but we still have a problem . we do n't have a cake for dad 's birthday . what can we do ? "

anna and ben thought for a moment . they had an idea . they said , " mom , we can make another cake . we have more flour , eggs , milk and sugar . we can mix them again . and this time , we will watch the oven . we will not forget . we will make a good cake for dad . please , can we try again ? "

mom smiled . she said , " okay , let 's try again . but this time , we will do it together . we will watch the oven . we will not forget . we will make a good cake for dad . he will be happy . and we will be happy too . " lily and tom were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . they saw a big hill with many trees and flowers . they wanted to go there and explore .

" can we go to the hill , mom ? " lily asked .

" no , dear , it is too far and too steep . you might get hurt or lost . stay here where i can see you , " mom said .

but lily and tom did not listen . they waited until mom was busy talking to another mom . then they ran to the hill . they felt excited and curious .

they climbed the hill and saw many new things . they saw a bird 's nest , a shiny rock , a butterfly . they wanted to touch everything .

" look , tom , a hole ! " lily said . she pointed to a dark hole under a tree . " what is in there ? "

" i do n't know . let 's find out , " tom said . he went closer to the hole and bent down . he put his hand inside .

suddenly , he screamed . he pulled his hand out . it was bleeding . something had bitten him . it hurt a lot .

" lily , help me ! it hurts ! " tom cried .

lily was scared . she ran to tom and hugged him . she saw his hand . it was red and swollen . she did not know what to do .

" mom ! mom ! " she shouted . but mom was too far away . she could not hear them .

they were alone on the hill . they were hurt and lost . they wished they had listened to mom . they were sorry . but it was too late . anna and ben love to play with their crayons and paper . they like to design different things , like houses , animals , and cars . they also like to show their designs to their mom and dad , who always say they are very good .

one day , they decided to design a big parade . they drew many people and animals , and gave them flags and hats and drums . they cut out their designs and taped them to sticks . then they asked their mom if they could march around the house with their parade .

" sure , you can march with your parade , but be careful not to bump into anything or make too much noise , " their mom said . " and do n't forget to clean up when you are done . "

anna and ben were very eager to start their parade . they held their sticks and marched around the living room , the kitchen , and the hallway . they sang a song and made drum sounds with their mouths . they had a lot of fun .

their mom watched them and smiled . she was proud of their creativity and imagination . she also liked their song and drum sounds . she joined them for the last lap of their parade , and then helped them put away their crayons and paper . she gave them a big hug and a kiss , and said , " you are the best parade designers ever ! " lily and ben are friends . they like to play in the hall at school . the hall is big and long and has many doors . sometimes they run in the hall and make loud noises . sometimes they hide behind the doors and jump out to scare each other .

one day , they find a ball in the hall . it is red and round and bouncy . they want to play with the ball . they take turns to pass the ball to each other . they throw the ball high and low and far and near . they have fun with the ball .

but then , they hear a voice . it is the teacher . she is angry . she says , " what are you doing in the hall ? you are not supposed to play with the ball in the hall . you are supposed to be in the classroom . give me the ball and go back to your seats . "

lily and ben are sad . they like the ball . they do not want to give it to the teacher . they do not want to go back to the classroom . they think the hall is cool and the classroom is boring .

but they know they have to listen to the teacher . they say sorry to the teacher . they give her the ball . they walk back to the classroom . they hope they can play with the ball again another day . one day , a little girl named lily went to the park with her mom . she saw a big slide and wanted to try it . she climbed up the stairs and sat on the slide . but then she felt scared . the slide was too high and too fast . she wanted to go back down , but there were other kids behind her . she started to cry .

" mommy , help me ! " she shouted .

her mom heard her and ran to the slide . she climbed up the stairs and reached lily . she gave her a big hug and said , " it 's okay , sweetie . i 'm here . you do n't have to slide if you do n't want to . we can go down together . "

lily felt her mom 's hug and stopped crying . she felt safe and loved . she hugged her mom back and said , " thank you , mommy . i love you . "

they went down the stairs and walked to a bench . they sat down and looked at the sky . they saw the sun , the clouds , and the birds . lily smiled and said , " mommy , the world is so beautiful . "

her mom smiled and said , " yes , it is . and you know what ? you are beautiful too . and brave . and smart . and kind . you can do anything you want , as long as you try and have fun . and if you ever feel scared or sad , i will always be here to hug you and help you . "

lily hugged her mom again and said , " you are the best mommy in the world . i 'm happy to have you . "

they hugged each other and enjoyed the day at the park .

the moral value of the story is : hugs can make you feel safe and loved . you can overcome your fears with the help of someone who cares for you . you should appreciate the beauty of the world and yourself . sara and tom are friends . they like to play together . one day , they go to the park with their moms . they see a big slide . sara wants to go on the slide . tom is scared .

" come on , tom . the slide is fun . you can go after me , " sara says .

" no , sara . the slide is too high . and it is dark inside . i do n't like dark places , " tom says .

sara tries to make tom feel better . she says , " it is not so dark . there are holes in the slide . you can see the sky and the trees . and i will be with you . we can hold hands . "

tom thinks for a moment . he likes sara . he trusts her . he says , " okay , sara . i will try . but you go first . and do n't let go of my hand . "

sara smiles . she says , " okay , tom . that is the order . i go first , you go second . and we hold hands . come on , let 's go . "

sara and tom climb the stairs to the slide . sara goes in first . she holds tom 's hand . tom follows her . he feels nervous . he sees the dark tunnel . he closes his eyes . he squeezes sara 's hand .

sara says , " do n't worry , tom . we are almost there . you can do it . it is fun . "

tom hears sara 's voice . he feels a little better . he opens his eyes . he sees some light . he sees the end of the slide . he sees the grass . he feels the wind . he feels the thrill .

sara and tom come out of the slide . they laugh . they hug . they are happy .

they did it . they went on the slide . together .

their moms see them . they are proud . they clap . they cheer .

" wow , sara and tom . you are so brave . you went on the big slide . how was it ? " sara 's mom says .

" it was fun . it was not so dark . we held hands . we liked it , " sara says .

tom 's mom says , " that 's great , tom . i 'm glad you tried something new . you are a good friend to sara . did you like the slide ? "

tom says , " yes , mom . i liked the slide . sara helped me . she is a good friend to me . she mentioned the holes . i saw the sky and the trees . it was not so scary . "

sara and tom smile . they are friends . they like to play together . they like to try new things . together . ben and lily are playing in the garden . they see a big stack of leaves that dad made . they want to hop on it and make it fly .

" can we hop on the leaves , dad ? " ben asks .

" yes , but be careful . the leaves are wet from the rain . you might slip and fall , " dad says .

ben and lily do not care . they run to the stack and hop on it . the leaves make a crunchy sound and fly in the air . ben and lily laugh and hop some more .

but then , lily hops too high and slips on a wet leaf . she falls off the stack and lands on the grass . she starts to cry .

" ow , ow , ow ! i hurt my knee ! " lily says .

ben hears lily and stops hopping . he runs to her and hugs her .

" i 'm sorry , lily . are you okay ? " ben says .

lily sniffles and shows ben her knee . it has a small scratch and some dirt .

" it 's okay , ben . it 's not a big hurt . just a little one , " lily says .

dad comes to them and wipes lily 's knee with a cloth . he gives her a kiss and a band - aid .

" there , there . you 're brave , lily . the band - aid will make it better , " dad says .

lily smiles and thanks dad . she hugs ben and says , " you 're a good brother , ben . you made me feel better . "

ben smiles and says , " you 're a good sister , lily . you 're fun to play with . "

dad says , " you 're both good kids . i love you . how about we go inside and have some cookies and milk ? "

ben and lily nod and say , " yes , please ! "

they hold hands and follow dad to the house . they leave the wet stack of leaves behind . they had fun , but they also learned to be careful . anna likes to read books . she likes to go to the library with her mom and dad . the library has many books . some books are big and some books are small . some books have pictures and some books have words .

one day , anna sees a big book with many words . she wants to read it . she asks her mom to help her . her mom says , " this book is hard . it is for older kids . you can read it when you grow up . " anna is sad . she wants to read the book now .

she sees a boy with a small book with pictures . she thinks the boy is silly . she says , " your book is easy . it is for babies . you should read a hard book like mine . " the boy is hurt . he likes his book . he says , " my book is fun . it is about animals . you should not be mean to me . "

anna 's mom hears anna . she is not happy . she says , " anna , you should not say that . every book is good . every book has something to show you . you should be kind to others . you should not judge a book by its cover . "

anna feels sorry . she says , " i am sorry , boy . i was wrong . can you show me your book ? " the boy smiles . he says , " sure . i can show you my book . it is about lions . they are strong and brave . " anna says , " wow . that is cool . can i show you my book ? it is about stars . they are bright and beautiful . " the boy says , " yes . i would like to see your book . it is about something i do not know . "

anna and the boy become friends . they show each other their books . they learn new things . they have fun . they thank their moms and dads for taking them to the library . they say , " we love books . we love the library . we love each other . " lily was a compassionate girl who liked to help others . she had a mask that she wore when she went outside . the mask was blue and had stars on it . lily liked her mask because it kept her and her friends safe from germs .

one day , lily saw a boy who was crying on the playground . he did not have a mask and he was scared . lily went to him and asked , " what is wrong ? "

the boy said , " i lost my mask and i ca n't find it . my mom will be mad at me . and i do n't want to get sick . "

lily felt sorry for the boy . she said , " do n't worry , i have an extra mask . you can have it . "

she took out a mask from her backpack . it was pink and had hearts on it . she gave it to the boy and said , " here , this is for you . it will protect you from germs and make you happy . "

the boy smiled and said , " thank you , lily . you are very kind . i like your mask . it is pretty . "

lily smiled back and said , " you 're welcome . i 'm glad you like it . we can be friends . "

the boy nodded and said , " yes , we can be friends . what is your name ? "

lily said , " my name is lily . what is yours ? "

the boy said , " my name is ben . nice to meet you , lily . "

lily and ben put on their masks and played together . they had fun and laughed . lily was happy that she helped ben . she gained a new friend and a good feeling in her heart . tom and lily like to play in the garden . they have a plant that they water every day . the plant has green leaves and red flowers . tom and lily think the plant is pretty and happy .

one day , they see a big bug on the plant . the bug is black and has many legs . it is eating the leaves and making holes . tom and lily are scared and angry .

" go away , bug ! " tom says . " you are hurting our plant ! "

the bug does not listen . it keeps eating and eating . lily runs to get their mom .

" mom , mom , come quick ! " lily says . " there is a bad bug on our plant ! "

mom follows lily to the garden . she sees the bug and the plant . she looks serious .

" oh no , this is a problem , " mom says . " this bug is called a caterpillar . it can eat a lot of leaves and damage the plant . we need to move it to another place . "

mom picks up the caterpillar gently and puts it in a jar . she gives the jar to tom and lily .

" can we keep it , mom ? " tom asks . " it is kind of cute . "

mom smiles . " you can keep it for a while , but you need to know something . this caterpillar will change soon . it will make a cocoon and become a butterfly . then you have to let it go , so it can fly and find its own food . "

tom and lily are surprised and excited . they want to see the caterpillar change . they thank mom and take the jar to their room . they hope the plant will be okay . they also hope the butterfly will be pretty and happy . sam was a lonely frog . he lived in a big pond with many other frogs , but he had no friends . he liked to sit on a log and watch the water and the sky . sometimes he tried to call other frogs , but they did not answer him . they were too busy playing and jumping and swimming .

one day , he saw a new frog on the other side of the pond . she was green and shiny and had a big smile . sam wanted to talk to her , but he was shy and scared . he did not know how to cross the pond . he looked around and saw a big log floating in the water . he had an idea .

he jumped on the log and started to push it with his feet . the log moved slowly across the pond . sam hoped the new frog would see him and say hello . he called to her in a loud voice .

" hi , i am sam . i live on this log . do you want to be my friend ? "

the new frog heard him and looked up . she saw him on the log and smiled . she jumped in the water and swam towards him . she reached the log and climbed on it . she said to him in a sweet voice .

" hi , i am lily . i am new here . i live in the reeds . i would love to be your friend . "

sam and lily looked at each other and felt happy . they had found a friend . they decided to share the log and play together . they talked and laughed and sang . they were not lonely anymore . they were happy frogs . lily was a little girl who liked to eat toast for breakfast . she liked to put butter and jam on her toast and make it sweet and soft . she ate toast every day and was happy .

one day , she went to visit her grandma , who lived in a different house . her grandma made toast for her , but it was not the same as her toast . it was thin and hard and had cheese and ham on it . lily did not like it and made a face .

" what 's wrong , lily ? " her grandma asked . " do n't you like your toast ? "

lily shook her head . " no , grandma , i do n't . it 's different from my toast . i like my toast better . "

her grandma smiled and said , " i understand , lily . but you know , different is not bad . different can be good . different can be fun . different can help you learn new things and meet new people . do you want to try something different today ? "

lily thought for a moment . she loved her grandma and wanted to make her happy . she also wanted to learn new things and meet new people . she decided to give the toast a try . she took a bite and was surprised . it was not sweet and soft , but it was salty and crunchy . it was different , but it was good .

" wow , grandma , this is good ! " lily said . " thank you for making it for me . i like your toast too . "

her grandma hugged her and said , " you 're welcome , lily . i 'm glad you like it . you 're a brave and curious girl . i 'm proud of you for trying something different . you never know what you might like until you try . "

lily smiled and ate her toast . she learned that different can be good . she also learned that she can meet new things and new people by being brave and curious . she was happy . ben and lily were playing in the living room when they heard a knock on the door . they ran to see who it was . it was the mailman with a big package for them .

