they played with their new toys and forgot about the black paper on the floor . mom smiled and cleaned it up . she was happy to see them happy . tom and anna lived in a small village near the big forest . they liked to play with their friends and explore new places . one day , they found a big cave in the forest . they wanted to see what was inside .

