lena and tom nodded and said : " yes , please . we want to join the fun race . " the lady gave them each a number to wear on their shirts . she said : " ok , kids . when i say go , you can start running . are you ready ? "

lena and tom said : " yes , we are ready . " they stood next to each other and waited for the lady to say go . they looked at each other and smiled . they were both eager to win the medal .

the lady said : " go ! " lena and tom started running as fast as they could . they ran past the other kids and reached the tree . they turned around and ran back to the lady . they were very close to each other . they both wanted to be the first one to come back .

they reached the lady at the same time . they both touched the lady 's hand . they both said : " i won ! i won ! "

the lady looked at them and laughed . she said : " wow , kids . you are both very fast and very good . you both finished the race at the same time . you both deserve a medal . "

she took out two shiny medals from her bag and gave one to lena and one to tom . she said : " here you go , kids . you both won the fun race . you both get a medal . congratulations ! "

lena and tom were very happy . they thanked the lady and hugged each other . they put on their medals and showed them to everyone . they were very proud and very happy . they had joined the fun race and won a medal . tom and sam love to play baseball . they have a big field near their house where they can hit and catch the ball . one day , they want to travel to another field that is far away . they ask their mom if they can go .

" can we go to the big field , mom ? " tom says .

