mom thinks for a moment . she knows that the big field is not very safe . there are cars and dogs and trash there . she also knows that it rained a lot last night and the field is wet and muddy .

" i do n't think it is a good idea to go to the big field today , " mom says . " it is wet and dirty and dangerous . you can play in our field . it is dry and clean and safe . "

but tom and sam do not listen to mom . they think mom is wrong . they sneak out of the house and take their bikes . they ride to the big field . they are excited to play baseball there .

when they get to the big field , they see that mom was right . the field is wet and muddy . there are cars and dogs and trash everywhere . they try to play baseball , but they slip and fall . they get their clothes and bikes dirty . they lose their ball in a puddle . they are not happy .

