they wish they had listened to mom . they wish they had stayed in their field . they learn their lesson . they hope mom will forgive them . tom and sam are friends . they like to play with boats . they have many boats . some are big , some are small . some are red , some are blue . some have sails , some have motors .

one day , they go to the lake . they want to sail their boats . they bring their most popular boats . tom has a big red boat with a white sail . sam has a small blue boat with a yellow sail . they put their boats in the water . they blow on the sails . the boats go fast .

