" no , look at my boat ! " sam says . " it is the best boat ! "

they laugh and have fun . they watch their boats race .

but then , tom sees a rock . his boat is going to hit the rock . he runs to the edge of the lake . he tries to catch his boat . but he slips on the wet grass . he falls into the water . splash !

" tom ! " sam shouts . " are you okay ? "

tom is wet and cold . he is sad . his boat is broken . the sail is torn . the mast is snapped .

