they go to the shore . they dry off . they fix tom 's boat . they use sam 's sail . they find a stick . they make a new mast . they make tom 's boat the best boat again .

they put their boats in the water . they blow on the sails . the boats go fast . they are both happy .

they are the best friends . they have the best boats . lily and tom were playing with their toys in the living room . lily had a doll that she loved very much . tom had a car that he liked to zoom around . they were having fun until tom saw lily 's doll .

" can i play with your doll ? " tom asked .

