lily hugged her doll and sobbed , " you broke my doll ! she was my favorite ! she had so much value to me ! "

tom felt bad . he wanted to make lily happy again . he thought of an idea . he ran to his room and got a piece of paper and a crayon . he drew a picture of lily and her doll , and wrote , " i 'm sorry , lily . i love you . from tom . " he folded the paper and put it in an envelope . he wrote , " lily " on the front . he ran back to the living room and gave the envelope to lily .

