they hugged again and went back to the living room . they played with their toys together , and shared them nicely . they learned to be careful and kind with each other 's things . they had fun and were happy . ben and lily like to play with their toy cars . they have many cars of different colors and sizes . they make roads and bridges with blocks and books . they pretend to drive and honk and park .

one day , ben 's car gets stuck under the sofa . he tries to reach it with his hand , but he can not . he feels sad and angry . he wants his car back . he asks lily to help him .

