lily and ben finish their exam . they hand in their paper . they hope they did well . they think the exam was fun . they learned new things . they like animals . they think animals are cool . tom and lily were playing in the park with their toy dinosaurs . they liked to make them roar and run and fight . they pretended they were in a big forest full of life .

