but tom and lily did not want to play with the dog . they wanted to play with their toy dinosaurs . they wanted to make them roar and run and fight . they wanted to pretend they were in a big forest full of life . lily and max were adventurous twins who liked to explore new places . one day , they went with their mom to a big building where she had to work . mom said they could play in the lobby while she talked to some people .

