lily and max nodded and said sorry . they learned their lesson and never mixed the elevator buttons again . sam and mia liked to play outside . they liked to run , jump , and slide on the grass . they liked to see the birds , the flowers , and the bugs . they did not like the rain . the rain made them wet and cold . the rain made the grass muddy and slippery . the rain made them go inside .

