they ran to the slide and climbed up . they slid down with their umbrellas . they laughed and shouted . they thought it was fun . they did not see the big puddle at the bottom of the slide . they did not see the rough rock in the puddle . they slid into the puddle and hit the rock . the umbrellas flew out of their hands . the water splashed on their faces . the rock hurt their knees . they cried and screamed . they were wet and cold and hurt . they wished they had gone inside . they wished they had listened to their mom . they learned a hard lesson . they did not like the rain . they did not like their big idea . they did not like their bad ending . lily and sam were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and swing . they saw many flowers and birds and bugs . lily saw a butterfly . it was yellow and black and very pretty . she wanted to catch it .

