lily and sam waved at the butterfly . they felt happy too . they learned to value the butterfly and its freedom . they went back to playing in the park . they had a good day . lily and ben were twins who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big hole in the ground . they wanted to see what was inside . they went closer and looked down . the hole was very deep and dark . they could not see anything .

