ben picked up a stone and threw it in the hole . they waited for a sound , but they heard nothing . the stone was gone . lily and ben felt a cold wind coming from the hole . they shivered and hugged each other . they wished they had not come to the hole .

suddenly , they heard a loud roar from the hole . it was a scary sound , like a monster or a lion . lily and ben screamed and ran away . they prayed that the monster would not come out of the hole and chase them . they ran to their mommy and daddy , who were sitting on a bench . they told them what they had seen and heard .

mommy and daddy hugged them and said , " lily and ben , we are glad you are safe . you should never go near a hole like that . it is very dangerous . you do n't know what is in there . it could be an animal or a trap or a bad person . you should always stay with us or ask us before you explore something new . "

lily and ben said they were sorry and they learned their lesson . they said they would never go to the hole again . mommy and daddy said they forgave them and they loved them . they said they were welcome to play in the park , but only in the safe areas . they gave them a kiss and a cookie and took them to the swings . lily and ben felt happy and safe . they thanked mommy and daddy and prayed that the monster in the hole would leave them alone . ben and lily wanted to go on the kayak with dad . they liked the kayak . it was big and blue and had two seats . they put on their life jackets and hats and waited by the lake .

