they hugged and smiled . they left the museum . they went home . they put their art on the fridge . they were happy . lily and max were twins who liked to play together . they had a big toy box in their room with many fun things inside . sometimes they would peek inside the box and choose a toy to play with . but sometimes they would peek inside the box and see something they did not like .

