they mix everything together . it looks yucky and smells bad . but they think it is cool .

they want to bake their cake in the oven . they carry the bowl to the oven . but the bowl is heavy and slippery . ben trips on the rug . he drops the bowl . the yucky mix splashes everywhere . on the floor , on the walls , on the oven , on ben and mia .

