" uh - oh , " mia says .

mom comes in . she sees the mess . she is very angry . she scolds ben and mia . she makes them clean up . she does not let them play in the kitchen anymore . she does not give them any cake .

ben and mia are sad . they wish they did not make the yucky mix . they wish they did not trip . they wish they did not make mom angry . they wish they had a good cake . lily and ben were playing with their toys in the living room . they had many toys , because their parents were rich and bought them whatever they wanted . lily liked dolls and ben liked cars . they were having fun , but they also knew they had to go to bed soon .

" ben , it 's time to put away your toys and brush your teeth , " lily said . she was older than ben and liked to act like a big sister .

