" you can play more tomorrow , ben . come on , let 's be good and listen to mommy and daddy , " lily said . she picked up her dolls and put them in a basket .

ben looked at his cars and sighed . he wanted to delay going to bed as much as he could . he had an idea . he grabbed a big object from the shelf . it was a globe , a round thing that showed all the places in the world . he rolled it on the floor and pretended it was a giant car .

" look , lily , look at my big car . it can go anywhere . it can go to china and africa and australia , " ben said . he hoped lily would join him and forget about bedtime .

lily looked at ben and shook her head . she knew ben was trying to delay going to bed . she also knew that the globe was not a toy and that mommy and daddy would be angry if they saw ben playing with it .

" ben , that 's not a car , that 's a globe . it 's not a toy , it 's an object for learning . you ca n't play with it , you have to put it back on the shelf , " lily said . she walked over to ben and tried to take the globe from him .

" no , no , no , it 's my car , it 's my car . let go , let go , " ben said . he held on to the globe and pulled it away from lily . they started to tug and fight over the globe .

they were making so much noise that mommy and daddy heard them from upstairs . they came down to the living room and saw lily and ben fighting over the globe .

" what are you two doing ? it 's past your bedtime . and why are you playing with the globe ? that 's not a toy , that 's an object for learning . you could break it or hurt yourselves , " mommy said . she took the globe from them and put it back on the shelf .

" daddy , ben was trying to delay going to bed . he was pretending the globe was a car and he would n't listen to me , " lily said .

" daddy , lily was trying to take my car away . she was being mean and bossy and she would n't play with me , " ben said .

mommy and daddy looked at each other and sighed . they knew lily and ben were both tired and cranky . they also knew they had to teach them to share and respect their things .

" listen , lily and ben , we love you very much , but you have to follow the rules . bedtime is bedtime , and you have to put away your toys and brush your teeth . and you have to be careful with the things in the house , especially the ones that are not toys . they are objects for learning , and you can look at them and ask us questions about them , but you ca n't play with them or fight over them . do you understand ? " daddy said .

lily and ben nodded . they felt sorry for making mommy and daddy upset . they also felt sleepy and yawned .

" okay , then . let 's go upstairs and get ready for bed . we 'll read you a story and tuck you in . and tomorrow , you can play with your toys again , as long as you share and be nice to each other , " mommy said .

lily and ben hugged mommy and daddy and said sorry . they followed them upstairs and did what they were told . they brushed their teeth and put on their pajamas . they listened to a story and said goodnight . they snuggled in their beds and closed their eyes . they dreamed of cars and dolls and places in the world . they were happy and loved . ben and lily were twins who liked to play in the park . one day , they found a big hole in the ground . they wondered what was inside .

