they learned their lesson . they never went near the hole again . they played in other parts of the park , where there were no bears or teeth . they were happy and safe . ben and lily were playing in the backyard . they had a big box that they pretended was a boat . they used a rope to tie the box to a tree . they said they were going on an adventure .

