they sailed away on their boat . they did not notice the clothes on the ground . they did not hear their mom calling them . they were too busy having fun . lily and tom were friends who liked to play in the garden . they liked to look at the flowers and smell them . lily 's favorite flower was the rose , because it was red and pretty . tom 's favorite flower was the sunflower , because it was big and bright .

one day , they saw a new flower in the garden . it was green and round , with a lot of spikes . they did not know what it was . they went closer to see it .

