they decided to come back to the garden every day and watch the flower . they hoped it would bloom and show them its color and shape . they counted the days and the number of spikes on the flower .

on the seventh day , they came to the garden and saw something amazing . the flower had opened and revealed a beautiful purple star . it had a sweet smell and a soft center . they were very happy and surprised .

" look , look , it bloomed ! " lily exclaimed .

