they smiled and hugged each other . they had learned something new and seen something wonderful . they thanked the flower for its gift and went to tell their parents . they never forgot the day the starflower bloomed . lily wanted to wear her new dress for the party . it was a pink dress with shiny buttons and a big bow . she thought it was the most impressive dress ever . she put it on and looked at herself in the mirror . she smiled and twirled around .

