lily nodded and took her mom 's hand . she was very happy and excited . she could n't wait to show her friends her impressive dress and her polished shoes . she hoped they would like them as much as she did . tim and kim are twins . they like to play and learn . mom and dad teach them many things . they teach them math . math is fun . math is numbers and shapes .

one day , tim and kim have a math game . they have cards with numbers and shapes . they take turns to pick a card and show it to the other . they have to say what the number or shape is . if they are right , they get a point . if they are wrong , they lose a point .

tim picks a card . it has a circle . he shows it to kim .

