kim and tim smile . they hug each other . they play the math game again . they use only numbers and shapes that they know . they give each other hints . they cheer each other up . they have fun . they learn math . they are happy . they are twins . they are friends . ben is a lazy cat . he likes to sleep on the sofa all day . he does not like to play with his toys or run in the garden . he only wakes up when he is hungry or thirsty .

one day , ben sees a fly buzzing around the room . he thinks it looks tasty . he tries to catch it with his paw , but he is too slow . the fly lands on his nose and tickles him . ben sneezes very loud . the fly flies away .

