ben is tired . he stops running and sits on the floor . he licks his paw and rubs his nose . he thinks the fly is not worth it . he goes back to the sofa and curls up . he closes his eyes and falls asleep . he dreams of fish and milk . he is a lazy cat . anna loves to ride her bike . her bike is white and has a basket with flowers . she likes to put her teddy bear in the basket and take him for a ride . teddy is very soft and adorable . he is anna 's best friend .

