anna and teddy say goodbye and ride away . they are very glad . they had a lot of fun . they love to ride . lily and ben were friends who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big pond with many ducks and fish . they wanted to swim with them , but their mom said no . she said the water was too cold and dirty , and they could get sick .

