they smiled and played with their snowman until it was time for dinner . they had a lot of fun building their snowman with the ornaments . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in their room . they have many toys in their drawer . but anna likes to tease ben . she takes his toys and hides them . she laughs and says , " you ca n't find them , you ca n't find them ! "

