tom and lily take the eggs from the box . they look at each egg . some eggs are big , some eggs are small . some eggs are white , some eggs are brown . some eggs are smooth , some eggs are bumpy .

tom and lily sort the eggs into two groups . they put the big , white , smooth eggs in one bowl . they put the small , brown , bumpy eggs in another bowl . they are proud of their work . they show mom their sorted eggs .

mom smiles and says , " well done , tom and lily ! you sorted the eggs very well . but for the cake , we need all the eggs , not just some . it does n't matter if they are big or small , white or brown , smooth or bumpy . all the eggs are good for the cake . can you help me crack the eggs and put them in the mixer ? "

tom and lily nod and say , " yes , mom ! " they help mom crack the eggs and put them in the mixer . they watch the eggs turn into batter . they lick the spoon and say , " yum ! " they ca n't wait to eat the cake . they think sorting eggs is fun . lily and ben are twins . they like to play in the house . one day , they find a big box in the hall . they want to see what is inside .

" let 's grab the box and take it to our room , " ben says .

" ok , " lily says . they grab the box and start to carry it up the stairs . the box is heavy and hard to hold .

suddenly , they hear a loud noise . it is their dog , spot . spot is wild and loves to chase things . he sees the box and thinks it is a toy . he runs after lily and ben and barks .

" spot , no ! " lily and ben shout . " this is not your toy ! "

but spot does not listen . he jumps on the box and makes it fall . lily and ben lose their balance and tumble down the stairs . the box breaks open and spills many things on the floor .

lily and ben are scared and hurt . they cry for their mom . mom hears them and comes quickly . she sees the mess and the dog and the twins .

" oh , my ! " mom says . " what happened here ? "

she hugs lily and ben and checks if they are ok . she tells spot to sit and be quiet . she picks up the things from the box and puts them back . she finds a letter on top of the box . it says :

" dear lily and ben , happy birthday ! here are some gifts from your grandma and grandpa . we hope you like them . we love you very much . grandma and grandpa . "

mom reads the letter to lily and ben . they feel sorry for breaking the box and the gifts . they say they are sorry to mom and spot . they thank grandma and grandpa for the gifts .

mom smiles and says , " it 's ok . accidents happen . i 'm glad you are not badly hurt . let 's go to your room and open the gifts together . maybe spot can have one too . "

lily and ben nod and smile . they grab mom 's hand and go to their room . spot follows them and wags his tail . they are happy and forget about the stairs and the box . they have a fun birthday . timmy was a good boy who liked to work hard . he helped his mom and dad with chores , like cleaning his room , washing dishes , and feeding the dog . he also liked to work on his puzzles , his drawings , and his books . he was proud of his work and showed it to his mom and dad every day .

but timmy had a problem . he was afraid of the dark . every night , when he went to bed , he had bad dreams . he dreamed of scary things , like monsters , ghosts , and spiders . he called them nightmares . he woke up crying and ran to his mom and dad 's room . they hugged him and told him it was okay , but he still felt scared .

one night , timmy had a plan . he decided to work on his nightmares . he took his flashlight , his teddy bear , and his favorite book . he said to himself , " i am brave . i can face my nightmares . i can make them go away . " he turned off the light and closed his eyes .

he dreamed of a big , hairy beast that roared and chased him . he was terrified , but he remembered his plan . he turned on his flashlight and shone it at the beast . he saw that it was not a beast , but a giant , fluffy bunny . he said to the bunny , " you are not scary . you are cute . do you want to be my friend ? " the bunny nodded and smiled . he hugged the bunny and felt happy .

he dreamed of a pale , spooky ghost that moaned and floated around him . he was nervous , but he remembered his plan . he held his teddy bear and said to the ghost , " you are not spooky . you are lonely . do you want to play with me ? " the ghost nodded and smiled . he played with the ghost and felt calm .

he dreamed of a huge , hairy spider that crawled and spun webs . he was disgusted , but he remembered his plan . he opened his book and said to the spider , " you are not hairy . you are clever . do you want to read with me ? " the spider nodded and smiled . he read with the spider and felt smart .

timmy woke up feeling good . he had worked on his nightmares and made them go away . he had made new friends and learned new things . he was proud of his work and showed it to his mom and dad . they hugged him and told him they were proud of him too . he was not afraid of the dark anymore . he was happy . lila and tom were playing in the kitchen . they wanted to make a cake for mom . they had a big bowl , some flour , some eggs , some milk and some sugar . they also had a spoon to mix everything .

" let 's mix , mix , mix ! " said lila , stirring the bowl with the spoon . " we will make the best cake ever ! "

tom nodded and cracked an egg . he tried to put it in the bowl , but he missed . the egg fell on the floor and made a mess . " oops ! " said tom .

lila looked at the egg and frowned . she was troubled . she did not like messes . she did not want mom to be angry . " tom , you have to be careful ! " she said . " we have to clean this up ! "

but tom did not listen . he cracked another egg and threw it in the air . he wanted to catch it with the spoon and put it in the bowl . he thought it was fun . but he missed again . the egg hit the wall and splattered . " whee ! " said tom .

lila gasped . she was more troubled . she saw more mess on the floor and on the wall . she did not think it was fun . she did not want mom to see this . " tom , stop it ! " she said . " we have to finish the cake ! "

but tom did not stop . he grabbed the sugar and poured it all over the bowl . he made a big pile of sugar on top of the flour and the eggs and the milk . he smiled and said , " look , lila , it 's snowing ! "

lila cried . she was very troubled . she saw the sugar everywhere . she saw the bowl overflowing . she saw the cake ruined . she did not want mom to come . she said , " tom , you are bad ! you ruined the cake ! you ruined everything ! "

just then , mom came in . she saw the kitchen . she saw the mess . she saw the bowl . she saw lila and tom . she was not happy . she said , " what have you done ? " lily liked to collect things . she had a box full of shiny things , soft things , and pretty things . she liked to look at them and play with them . sometimes she shared them with her friends .

one day , she saw a new thing on the door of her room . it was a knob . it was round and smooth and had a hole in the middle . lily wanted to collect it . she tried to pull it off the door , but it was stuck . she asked her mom for help .

" mom , can i have this knob ? " she said .

" no , lily , you ca n't have the knob . it belongs to the door . if you take it off , the door wo n't close and it will be dark and cold in your room , " her mom said .

" but i like the knob . it is shiny and smooth and has a hole . i want to put it in my box , " lily said .

" i know , lily , but the knob is not for collecting . it is for opening and closing the door . you have many other things in your box that you can play with . why do n't you find something else to collect ? " her mom said .

lily thought for a moment . she looked around her room and saw a book on her shelf . it had a picture of a cat on the cover . lily liked cats . she decided to collect the book instead . she took it off the shelf and put it in her box .

" look , mom , i found a new thing to collect . it is a book . it has a cat . i like cats , " she said .

" that 's great , lily . i 'm glad you found a new thing to collect . books are good for collecting . they have stories and pictures and words . you can read them and learn from them . maybe you can read the book with the cat to me later , " her mom said .

" okay , mom . i will read the book with the cat to you later . thank you for helping me , " lily said .

" you 're welcome , lily . i love you , " her mom said .

" i love you too , mom , " lily said . tom and sue are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big dog . the dog is black and has sharp teeth . the dog looks dangerous .

" run , sue , run ! " tom says . he is scared of the dog . he thinks the dog will bite them .

sue runs with tom . but the dog runs faster . the dog is close to them . sue feels panic . she does not want the dog to catch them .

" help , help ! " sue shouts . she hopes someone will hear them .

a man hears sue . he is strong . he has big muscles . he runs to the park . he sees the dog . he picks up a stick . he waves the stick at the dog .

" go away , bad dog ! " the man says . he sounds angry . the dog is afraid of the man . the dog stops running . the dog runs away .

tom and sue are safe . they are happy . they thank the man .

" thank you , mister ! " tom says .

" thank you , mister ! " sue says .

the man smiles . he is kind . he tells tom and sue to be careful .

" next time , do not go near dangerous dogs , " the man says . " they can hurt you . "

tom and sue nod . they understand . they go home with the man . the man is their dad . tom and lily were making pizza with their mom . they had a big ball of dough to roll and shape . mom gave them each a piece of dough and a rolling pin .

" be careful with the dough , children . do n't slap it too hard or it will break , " mom said .

tom and lily nodded and started to roll their dough . tom wanted to make a big pizza , so he rolled his dough very thin . lily wanted to make a small pizza , so she rolled her dough very thick .

" look , mom , my pizza is bigger than lily 's ! " tom said , holding up his dough .

" that 's nice , tom , but you have to leave some space for the sauce and the cheese , " mom said .

lily looked at tom 's pizza and felt jealous . she wanted a big pizza too . she had an idea . she waited until tom was not looking and slapped his dough with her hand . tom 's dough tore and made a hole .

" hey , what did you do ? " tom cried , seeing his dough ruined .

" i slapped your pizza , because i wanted a big pizza too , " lily said , smirking .

" that 's not fair , lily ! you ruined my pizza ! " tom said , angry .

mom heard the noise and came to see what was wrong . she saw tom 's dough with a hole and lily 's dough with a handprint .

" what happened here ? " mom asked .

" lily slapped my pizza and made a hole ! " tom said .

" is that true , lily ? " mom asked .

lily looked down and nodded . she felt ashamed .

" why did you do that , lily ? " mom asked .

" because i was jealous of tom 's pizza , " lily said .

mom sighed and said , " lily , that was not a nice thing to do . you should not slap other people 's things , because that can hurt them and make them sad . you should be happy with what you have and share with others . do you understand ? "

lily nodded and said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i 'm sorry , tom . i was wrong to slap your pizza . "

tom looked at lily and said , " it 's okay , lily . i forgive you . but next time , do n't slap my pizza , okay ? "

lily smiled and said , " okay , tom . next time , i will ask you if i can have some of your pizza , okay ? "

tom smiled and said , " okay , lily . next time , i will share some of my pizza with you , okay ? "

mom smiled and said , " that 's good , children . now , let 's fix your dough and make some pizza together , okay ? "

tom and lily nodded and hugged mom . they learned to be kind and generous with each other . they made some delicious pizza and ate it with mom . they were happy and full . tom and lily were friends who liked to play outside . one day , they saw a big hill with many flowers . they wanted to go up the hill and see the view . they ran and jumped over the rocks and the grass . they were very happy .

but on the way , they saw a poor dog . the dog was thin and dirty . it had no collar and no home . it looked sad and scared . tom and lily felt sorry for the dog . they stopped and said hello to the dog .

" hi , dog . what is your name ? " lily asked .

the dog did not answer . it only wagged its tail a little .

" can we pet you ? " tom asked .

the dog nodded . it liked to be petted . tom and lily stroked its fur and gave it some water and a biscuit . the dog smiled and licked their hands .

" can we take you with us ? " lily asked .

the dog barked . it wanted to go with them . tom and lily agreed . they took the dog by the leash and continued to the hill . they were very happy .

they reached the top of the hill and saw the view . it was beautiful . they saw the sun , the sky , the trees , and the river . they also saw a rainbow . they felt lucky .

" look , dog . this is a good day . we have a new friend . you have a new home . we are happy . you are happy . we are lucky . you are lucky . " tom said .

the dog barked . it agreed . it was a good day . it had a new friend . it had a new home . it was happy . it was lucky .

tom , lily , and the dog hugged and jumped . they were very happy .

the end .

moral value : the story teaches that kindness and friendship can make a poor dog and two children happy and lucky .

foreshadowing or setup and payoff : the story foreshadows the rainbow by mentioning the sun and the sky . the rainbow is the payoff for the kindness and friendship of the characters . lily was a little girl who liked to play with her toys . she had a lot of toys , but her favorite was a teddy bear named bobo . she took bobo everywhere with her , even to the office where her mom worked .

one day , lily and bobo went to the office with mom . mom had to do some work on her computer , so she told lily to sit quietly and play with bobo . lily nodded and smiled , but she was bored . she wanted to explore the office and see what was there .

she waited until mom was busy , then she got up and walked around . she saw a lot of desks , chairs , papers , and machines . she touched some of them , but they were not fun . she saw a door that said " do not enter " . she was curious . she opened the door and went inside .

the room was dark and quiet . there was a big bed with a blanket and a pillow . lily thought it looked cozy . she climbed on the bed and lay down with bobo . she closed her eyes and took a nap .

mom finished her work and looked for lily . she could not find her anywhere . she asked her co - workers , but they did not see her . she was worried . she searched the whole office , but she could not find lily . she saw the door that said " do not enter " . she opened it and turned on the light .

she saw lily and bobo sleeping on the bed . she was relieved and angry . she woke lily up and scolded her . she told her that she was naughty and that she should not go into places that she was not allowed to . she told her that she could have gotten hurt or lost . she told her that she was sorry and that she loved her .

lily felt bad . she said she was sorry and that she loved mom . she hugged mom and bobo . mom hugged her back and kissed her . she told her that it was time to go home . lily nodded and smiled . she learned her lesson . she never went into the do not enter room again . tom and lily were playing in the kitchen . they wanted to make a cake for mom . they found a menu with a picture of a cake . they tried to read the words , but they were too hard .

" we need to measure the flour and the sugar , " tom said . he found a cup and a spoon . he poured some flour into the cup . he spilled some on the floor . he did not care .

lily saw the sugar . she liked sugar . she took a big spoonful and put it in her mouth . she smiled . she took another spoonful and put it in the bowl . she did not measure it .

tom and lily mixed the flour and the sugar . they added some eggs and some milk . they did not know how much . they stirred and stirred . the batter was lumpy and sticky .

they poured the batter into a pan . they put the pan in the oven . they did not set the timer . they did not know how long .

they waited and waited . they smelled something burning . they opened the oven . the cake was black and hard . smoke came out . they coughed and cried .

mom came into the kitchen . she saw the mess . she saw the cake . she was angry and sad .

" what did you do ? " she asked .

" we wanted to make a cake for you , " tom said .

" we followed the menu , " lily said .

mom looked at the menu . it was not a menu . it was a magazine . the picture of the cake was an ad .

mom sighed . she hugged tom and lily . she was not angry anymore . she was glad they tried .

" but next time , please ask me for help , " she said . " and please measure the ingredients . and please use a real menu . and please clean up the floor . "

tom and lily nodded . they were sorry . they wanted to make mom happy . they learned a lesson . they were poor bakers . tom and lily are brother and sister . they like to play with their toys in the living room . one day , tom sees a big red truck that lily got for her birthday . he wants to play with it , but lily says no . she says it is her truck and she does not want to share .

tom gets angry and grabs the truck from lily . lily cries and tries to get it back . they pull and tug and shout . mom hears the noise and comes to see what is wrong . she sees tom and lily fighting over the truck . she is not happy .

mom tells tom and lily to stop . she says they have to share their toys and be nice to each other . she says tom has to give the truck back to lily and say sorry . she says lily has to let tom play with the truck sometimes and say sorry too .

tom and lily feel bad . they do not want to make mom sad . they do not want to hurt each other . they give each other a hug and say sorry . they decide to take turns with the truck and play together . mom smiles and says she is proud of them . she gives them a kiss and a cookie . tom and lily are happy . they love their mom and their brother and sister . sara was a creative girl who liked to draw and make things . she had many colors and papers and stickers in her room . she loved to show her art to her friends and family .

one day , a big storm came to her town . the sky was dark and loud . sara was scared and ran to her mom . mom hugged her and said , " do n't worry , sara . we are safe in our house . the storm will pass soon . "

sara looked out the window and saw a big , spinning thing . it was a tornado . it was moving fast and breaking things . sara was curious and asked , " mom , what is that ? "

mom said , " that is a tornado , sara . it is a very strong wind that can do a lot of damage . we have to stay away from it and hope it goes away . "

sara said , " can i draw it , mom ? it looks interesting . "

mom said , " sure , sara . you can draw anything you want . but be careful not to go near the window . drawing can help you feel calm and happy . "

sara took her colors and papers and started to draw the tornado . she used black and gray and purple and blue . she made the tornado big and scary . but she also added some things to make it fun . she drew a smiley face on the tornado . she drew some birds and flowers and rainbows around it . she drew herself and her mom holding hands and waving at the tornado .

she showed her drawing to her mom and said , " mom , this is my tornado . i want to introduce it to you . his name is tom . he is not so bad . he is just playing with the wind . he likes to make noise and move things . he is creative like me . "

mom smiled and said , " wow , sara . that is a very creative drawing . you have a big imagination . you made the tornado look friendly and funny . i like your tornado . his name is tom . nice to meet you , tom . "

sara smiled and said , " thank you , mom . i like to draw . it makes me happy . maybe tom will like my drawing too . maybe he will stop breaking things and go away . "

mom said , " maybe , sara . maybe . but even if he does n't , we are safe and we have each other . and we have your art . you are a very brave and creative girl , sara . i am proud of you . "

the moral value of the story is : creativity can help you cope with fear and see things in a different way . lily and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . they like to run , jump and slide . they like to exercise .

one day , they see a big dog in the park . the dog is black and brown . it has a loud bark . it runs towards them .

lily and tom are nervous . they do not like the big dog . they think the dog is angry . they panic .

" help ! help ! " lily cries . " the dog is coming ! "

" run ! run ! " tom says . " we have to hide ! "

they run to the slide . they climb up the ladder . they slide down the other side . they hope the dog will not follow them .

but the dog is fast . it runs to the slide . it jumps on the ladder . it slides down the other side . it is still barking .

lily and tom are very scared . they do not know what to do . they hug each other .

" please , go away ! " lily says to the dog . " we do not want to play with you ! "

but the dog does not go away . it wags its tail . it licks their faces . it is not angry . it is friendly .

lily and tom are surprised . they do not understand . they look at the dog . the dog looks at them .

" hi ! " a voice says . " i am sorry . this is my dog . his name is rex . he likes to play . he does not mean to scare you . "

lily and tom look up . they see a boy . he is holding a leash . he smiles at them .

" are you his owner ? " lily asks .

" yes , i am . i am sorry . he ran away from me . he likes to exercise . he likes to slide . he is a good dog . he does not bite . " the boy says .

lily and tom feel better . they are not nervous anymore . they are not scared anymore . they are curious .

" can we play with him ? " tom asks .

" sure , you can . he likes to play . he likes to make friends . do you want to throw his ball ? " the boy says .

lily and tom nod . they smile . they are not in panic anymore . they are happy .

they play with rex and the boy . they throw his ball . they run with him . they slide with him . they have fun .

they like the big dog . they like the boy . they make new friends . they exercise . they have a good day . sara and ben were twins . they liked to play in the park with their mom and dad . one day , they saw a big , old tree in the park . it had many branches and leaves . sara and ben wondered what was inside the tree .

" can we go and see , mom ? " sara asked .

" sure , but be careful , " mom said .

sara and ben ran to the tree . they saw a hole at the bottom of the trunk . they peeked inside . they saw a small , gray animal with a long , bushy tail . it was a squirrel .

" hello , squirrel , " ben said .

the squirrel looked at them and made a noise . it sounded like " chirp , chirp " .

" what are you doing in the tree , squirrel ? " sara asked .

the squirrel came out of the hole . it climbed up the trunk and jumped from branch to branch . it looked for nuts and seeds . it was hungry .

" i live in the tree , " the squirrel said . " it is my home . i have a nest and a family . we store food for the winter . we are proud of our tree . it is old and strong . "

sara and ben watched the squirrel . they thought it was cute and smart . they wanted to be friends with it .

" can we play with you , squirrel ? " ben asked .

" sure , but you have to be fast and careful , " the squirrel said . " the park has many dangers . there are dogs and cats and cars and people . they can hurt us . we have to be alert and hide . "

sara and ben nodded . they followed the squirrel . they played hide and seek and tag and catch . they had fun . they learned about the tree and the squirrel 's life . they respected the squirrel and its home .

they thanked the squirrel for playing with them . they said goodbye and went back to their mom and dad . they told them about the squirrel and the tree . they were happy and curious . they wondered what else they could find in the park . tom was a musician . he liked to play the guitar and sing songs . he was very good at making music . he was also very healthy . he ate fruits and vegetables every day . he drank water and milk . he did not like candy or soda .

one day , tom went to a party with his friends . there were many people and many things to eat and drink . tom saw a big cake with frosting and sprinkles . he thought it looked yummy . he wanted to try a piece . he took a big bite and started to chew .

" ow ! " tom cried . he felt a sharp pain in his tooth . he spit out the cake and saw blood . he had a cavity . he ran to the bathroom and looked in the mirror . he saw a hole in his tooth . he felt very sad and scared .

" tom , what happened ? " his friend lisa asked . she followed him to the bathroom . she saw his tooth and felt sorry for him .

" i ate some cake and it hurt my tooth , " tom said . " i have a cavity . i need to go to the dentist . "

" i 'm sorry , tom , " lisa said . " you should not eat too much cake . it has a lot of sugar . sugar is bad for your teeth . it makes them rot . you should eat healthy food like fruits and vegetables . they are good for your teeth . they make them strong and shiny . "

" you are right , lisa , " tom said . " i was silly to eat the cake . i should have listened to my mom . she always tells me to eat healthy food and brush my teeth . i will do that from now on . i do n't want to have more cavities . they hurt and they are ugly . "

tom learned his lesson . he went to the dentist and got his tooth fixed . he stopped eating candy and cake . he started eating more fruits and vegetables . he drank water and milk . he brushed his teeth every day . he stayed healthy and happy . he kept playing the guitar and singing songs . he was still a good musician . he also became a good friend . he shared his healthy food with lisa and his other friends . he taught them how to take care of their teeth . they all thanked him and smiled . they had beautiful teeth and beautiful music . lily liked to write stories . she had a big book with many pages . she used a pink pen to write her stories . she wrote about princesses , fairies , animals and stars .

one day , she had no idea what to write . she looked at her book and saw many stories . she wanted to write a new story . she asked her mom for help .

" mom , i want to write a story , but i have no idea . can you help me ? " lily said .

" sure , lily . let 's think together . what do you like to write about ? " mom said .

" i like to write about princesses , fairies , animals and stars . but i wrote about them already . i want something new . " lily said .

mom smiled . she had an idea . she said , " how about you write a story about a pink dragon ? a pink dragon who is kind and friendly and likes to help others . maybe he can meet a princess , a fairy , an animal and a star . what do you think ? "

lily liked the idea . she said , " yes , mom . that sounds fun . a pink dragon . i will write that . thank you , mom . "

lily took her pink pen and her big book . she started to write her story . she wrote about the pink dragon and his adventures . she was happy . she had a new story . she showed it to mom . mom was proud . she said , " lily , you are a great writer . i love your story . the pink dragon is very nice . you have a good imagination . "

lily hugged mom . she said , " thank you , mom . you are the best . you helped me find an idea . i love you . "

mom hugged lily . she said , " i love you too , lily . you are my sweet girl . keep writing your stories . they make me happy . " ben and mia like to play outside . they have a big tree in their yard . they like to climb the tree and see the birds and the sky . they have a rope and a basket . they put toys and snacks in the basket and pull it up the tree .

one day , they are playing in the tree when they see dark clouds . they hear thunder and see lightning . they are scared . they want to go down the tree and go inside the house .

" ben , it is going to rain . we have to go down now , " mia says .

" but we have to take our basket . we ca n't leave it here , " ben says .

they look at the basket . it is very fat . they have many toys and snacks in it . they try to pull it down , but it is too heavy . the rope is tight and hard .

the rain starts to fall . it is cold and wet . they are wet too . they are sad and cold .

" help ! help ! " they shout .

mom hears them . she comes out of the house . she sees them in the tree . she sees the fat basket . she gets a ladder . she puts the ladder on the tree . she climbs the ladder and helps them down . she takes the basket too .

they hug mom . they are happy and safe . they go inside the house . they dry their clothes and hair . they drink hot cocoa and eat cookies . they tell mom about their adventure . mom smiles and kisses them . she is proud of them . she says they are brave and smart . they love mom . they love their tree too . they will play in it again , but not when it rains . once upon a time , two werebears had a big fight . they crashed and roared and shouted like thunder .

the other animals in the forest were really worried about what would happen next . then , out of nowhere , a bunny appeared with a special invitation . it was very charming and the werebears stopped fighting .

the bunny invited them to a lovely party in the forest . the two werebears smiled and said yes . they followed the bunny together and had lots of fun at the party . everyone was so happy and they all danced until it was bedtime .

the werebears became good friends and they never fought again ! once upon a time , there was a hairy monster . he lived lonely in the woods , far away from people . every day he wanted to go to the event in town , but he was scared .

one day , the monster decided he had enough courage to go . but when he arrived , he saw that everyone was ignoring him . he was sad . he did not understand why he was not welcomed .

the monster decided that if he was not wanted , he would leave . before he left , he promised himself that he wouldnâ€ ™ t feel so alone anymore . heâ€ ™ d find another way to make friends . he went home to the woods .

the next day , the hairy monster decided to throw a party in the woods . all the animals came to join him . they played fun games and laughed and celebrated together . and from that day forward , the monster was never ignored again ! once upon a time , there was a fancy fairy named fae . fae was very small and loved to fly around the world . one day , while flying around a grapevine , fae noticed something very special . she discovered a box filled with special wine !

