lily had an idea . she gave the little boy a hug and told him not to worry . she promised to come back the next day and help him find his toy car . the little boy smiled and thanked her . lily felt happy that she could help someone , even though she did n't find any new treasures for her collection . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside on her swing set . every day , she would swing back and forth , feeling the wind in her hair and the sun on her face .

one day , lily saw a beautiful angel in the sky . the angel had big , white wings and a kind smile . lily waved to the angel and the angel waved back .

later that day , lily 's mom gave her a cookie . lily was so happy and wanted to share it with someone . she remembered the generous angel and decided to leave the cookie on the swing set for the angel to enjoy .

the next day , when lily went outside to play , she saw that the cookie was gone . she looked up at the sky and saw the angel again . the angel smiled down at lily and lily knew that the angel had enjoyed the cookie . from that day on , lily always left a treat on the swing set for the generous angel . once upon a time , there was a playful dog named max . max loved to run and jump and play with his ball . one day , max saw a butterfly and chased after it . he ran and ran until he was very tired . then , max saw a big tree and decided to rest under it .

as max was resting , he saw the sun going down in the west . he thought it was very pretty and wanted to watch it for a while . but as he was looking up at the sky , he lost his balance and fell off the tree . max hurt his leg very badly and could n't walk anymore .

max 's owner came looking for him , but could n't find him . max was all alone and scared . eventually , max 's leg got worse and he could n't move anymore . sadly , max passed away under the tree where he fell . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to dance and would twirl around her room every day . one day , her mom bought her an ugly dress that lily did n't like . she regretted telling her mom she liked it .

the next day , lily went to a dance party with her friends . she wore the ugly dress and felt embarrassed . she regretted wearing it . but then , her favorite song came on and she started to dance . she forgot about the dress and just had fun .

after the party , lily realized that the dress did n't matter . she was happy because she got to dance with her friends . she promised herself to always have fun and not regret anything . the end . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . they saw a big sign that said " do not touch " . the sign was near a metal fence . lily was curious . she wanted to know what was behind the fence .

she said to ben , " let 's go and see what is behind the sign . maybe there is something fun . "

ben was fearful . he said , " no , lily , we should not go . the sign says do not touch . maybe there is something bad . "

but lily did not listen . she ran to the fence and touched it with her hand . she screamed . the fence was hot . it burned her hand . she cried and ran back to ben .

ben hugged her and said , " i 'm sorry , lily . are you okay ? you should not have touched the fence . the sign was there to warn us . it was hot because there is a fire behind it . we should tell mom and dad . "

lily nodded . she was sorry too . she learned her lesson . she said , " you are right , ben . we should listen to the sign . and we should listen to you . you are a good brother . let 's go and find mom and dad . " tom and sue like to play in the park . they see a pond with many frogs . they want to catch a frog and take it home .

" look , there is a big frog ! " tom says . he runs to the pond and tries to grab the frog . but the frog is too fast and jumps away .

" let me try ! " sue says . she sees a small frog that does not move . she thinks it is easy to catch . she bends down and picks up the frog .

" got it ! " sue says . she holds the frog in her hand and shows it to tom . " it is a weird frog . it has red spots and blue eyes . "

tom comes closer and looks at the frog . he does not like it . he thinks it is ugly and scary . he screams and runs away .

sue does not understand . she thinks the frog is cute and funny . she wants to keep it as a pet . she puts the frog in her pocket and follows tom .

but the frog is not a normal frog . it is a poison frog . it does not like to be in sue 's pocket . it bites sue with its sharp teeth . sue feels a pain in her leg . she falls down and cries .

the frog jumps out of her pocket and goes back to the pond . it is happy to be free . sue is not happy . she is sick and hurt . she needs help . but tom is gone . he is too afraid to come back . sue is alone and sad . the end . lily was a little girl who liked to play with her cat , milo . milo was a black and white cat who liked to chase birds and mice . one day , lily found a feather on the floor . it was soft and shiny and had many colors . she picked it up and showed it to milo .

" milo , look at this feather ! it is so pretty ! do you know where it came from ? " lily asked .

milo looked at the feather and then at lily . he felt sorry . he knew where the feather came from . he had caught a bird in the garden and played with it until it stopped moving . he had left the feather behind when he heard lily calling him .

milo meowed and rubbed his head against lily 's leg . he wanted to tell her that he was sorry for hurting the bird , but he did not know how . he hoped that lily would understand .

lily smiled and stroked milo 's fur . she did not understand why milo was acting so strange , but she loved him anyway . she put the feather in her hair and said , " you are a good cat , milo . i love you . do you want to play with me ? "

milo purred and nodded . he followed lily to her room , where they played with her toys and books . he forgot about the feather and the bird . he was happy to be with lily . he hoped that the bird would forgive him . lily and max were playing in their room . they had many toys , but their favorite was a glow - in - the - dark rug . it had stars and planets and rockets on it . when they turned off the light , the rug glowed like the night sky .

" wow , look at the rug ! " lily said . " it is so pretty and bright ! "

" i like the rocket , " max said . " it looks like it is flying to the moon ! "

they pretended to be astronauts and explored the rug . they jumped from star to star and landed on different planets . they had a lot of fun .

but soon , they got tired and sleepy . they curled up on the rug and hugged their teddy bears . the rug was soft and warm and comfortable . they felt safe and cozy .

" good night , lily , " max said .

" good night , max , " lily said .

they closed their eyes and dreamed of space adventures . the rug glowed gently and watched over them . lily and max are best friends . they like to play together in the park . one day , they find a big camera on a bench . it has a red button and a screen .

" look , a camera ! " lily says . " let 's record us playing ! "

" okay ! " max says . " how do we do it ? "

lily picks up the camera and points it at max . she presses the red button . the screen shows max 's face .

" say something , max ! " lily says .

" hello , camera ! " max says . he makes a funny face and sticks out his tongue . lily laughs .

" your turn , lily ! " max says . he takes the camera and points it at lily . he presses the red button . the screen shows lily 's face .

" hello , camera ! " lily says . she smiles and winks . max giggles .

" you are adorable , lily ! " max says .

" thank you , max ! " lily says . " you are adorable , too ! "

they hug and laugh . they record more of their fun in the park . they are very happy . tom and sam were brothers who liked to play with fire . they found a box of matches in the kitchen and took it to their room . they lit one match and watched it burn . it was fun and pretty . they lit another match and another . they did not see the smoke that filled the air .

mom and dad were in the living room . they smelled the smoke and ran to the boys ' room . they saw the fire and the smoke . they were scared and angry . they grabbed tom and sam and ran outside . they called the firemen to put out the fire .

the firemen came with big trucks and hoses . they sprayed water on the fire and the smoke . they managed to stop the fire , but the boys ' room was ruined . all their toys and clothes and books were burned or wet . mom and dad were very sad and very mad . they scolded tom and sam for playing with fire . they said they were naughty and dangerous . they said they had to go to bed without dinner or stories .

tom and sam were very sorry and very sad . they cried and hugged each other . they wished they had not played with fire . they wished they had listened to mom and dad . they wished they had a jolly day instead of a bad day . they learned a hard lesson . fire is not a toy . fire is not fun . fire is bad . tom likes to write in his journal . he has a red journal with many pages . he writes about his day , his toys , his friends and his dreams . he draws pictures too . he keeps his journal under his bed , so no one can see it .

one day , tom wants to write in his journal after lunch . he runs to his room and looks under his bed . but he can not find his journal . he feels sad and angry . where is his journal ? he thinks maybe his sister took it . he does not like his sister . she is mean and dull . she never plays with him .

he goes to his sister 's room and knocks on the door . she does not answer . he opens the door and sees her journal on her desk . it is pink and has flowers on it . he thinks it is ugly and boring . he decides to take it and hide it . he grabs the journal and runs out of the room .

but he does not see the water on the floor . his sister spilled her juice and did not clean it up . he steps on the water and slips . he falls down and hurts his knee . he drops the journal and it gets wet . he cries out loud .

his sister hears him and comes out of her room . she sees him on the floor and her journal in the water . she gets mad and yells at him . she calls him a thief and a baby . she takes her journal and hits him on the head . he cries louder .

their mom hears them and comes to see what is wrong . she sees them fighting and the mess on the floor . she is not happy . she scolds them and makes them say sorry to each other . she tells them to clean up the water and the journal . she tells them to share their journals and be nice to each other . she gives them a hug and a kiss . she tells them she loves them .

tom and his sister feel sorry and ashamed . they do what their mom says . they clean up the water and the journal . they look at each other 's journal and see what they wrote and drew . they find some things that are funny and interesting . they start to talk and laugh . they decide to swap their journals and read them . they find out they have some things in common . they feel closer and happier . they thank their mom and hug each other . they learn a lesson . tim and jen are friends . they like to play soccer in the park . one day , they go to the park and see a lot of fog . they can not see the other side of the field .

" wow , look at the fog ! " tim says . " it is like a big cloud on the ground . "

" can we still play soccer ? " jen asks . " i want to kick the ball . "

" sure , we can play soccer , " tim says . " but we have to be careful . we do not want to kick the ball too far or lose it in the fog . "

they start to play soccer . they kick the ball to each other and try to score goals . they have fun . sometimes , they can not see the ball well , but they use their ears to hear where it is .

" goal ! " tim shouts . he kicks the ball into the net . he is happy . he is successful .

" good job , tim ! " jen says . she claps her hands . she is happy for her friend .

" thank you , jen ! " tim says . he runs to her and gives her a high five . they are both happy .

they play soccer until the fog goes away . then they see the sun and the sky . they smile . they had a good day . sara and ben are going on a big plane with mom and dad . they are very happy . they want to see new things and play with new friends . mom and dad tell them to pack their bags and bring their passports . passports are small books with their names and pictures . they need them to go on the plane .

sara and ben pack their bags . sara puts her favorite doll , her books , and her clothes in her bag . she zips it up and puts it by the door . ben puts his toy cars , his ball , and his clothes in his bag . but he does not zip it up . he leaves it open on the floor .

mom and dad are ready to go . they check their passports and their bags . they see sara 's bag by the door . they say , " good job , sara . you packed your bag very well . " they see ben 's bag on the floor . they say , " oh no , ben . your bag is very messy . you need to zip it up and put it by the door . and where is your passport ? "

ben looks for his passport . he can not find it . he says , " i do n't know , mom . i had it before . maybe it is in my bag . " he dumps his bag on the floor . his clothes , his cars , and his ball fall out . but his passport is not there . he says , " oh no , mom . i lost my passport . i ca n't go on the plane . "

mom and dad are very worried . they look for ben 's passport . they look under the bed , in the closet , in the drawers . they can not find it . they say , " ben , you need to find your passport . we have to go soon . the plane will not wait for us . "

sara sees ben 's passport . it is under her doll . she picks it up and gives it to ben . she says , " here , ben . i found your passport . it was under my doll . you must have put it there by mistake . " ben is very happy . he says , " thank you , sara . you are a good sister . i 'm sorry i was messy . i will zip up my bag and put it by the door . " he hugs sara and kisses her .

mom and dad are very happy . they say , " thank you , sara . you are a very helpful daughter . you saved the day . and thank you , ben . you are a very sorry son . you learned your lesson . now let 's go on the plane and have fun . " they take their passports and their bags and go to the car . sara and ben are very happy . they say , " yay , we are going on the plane . we ca n't wait to see new things and play with new friends . " they wave goodbye to their house and their toys . they are ready for their adventure . tom and lily were two kids who liked to play in the park . they had a lot of fun on the swings , the slide and the sandbox . one day , they saw a big bird in a cage near the park . the bird was very pretty , with bright feathers and a long tail . it looked sad and hungry .

" who is this bird ? " tom asked .

" that is the king of the birds , " a man said . he was the owner of the bird . " he is very rare and great . i bought him for a lot of money . but he is very shy and does not like people . he only eats special seeds that i bring him . "

" can we feed him ? " lily asked .

" no , you ca n't . he is mine and he does not need your food . go away and play somewhere else , " the man said . he was very rude and mean .

tom and lily felt sorry for the bird . they wanted to make him happy and friendly . they had some bread and nuts in their backpacks . they waited until the man was not looking and threw some food into the cage . the bird saw the food and came closer . he ate the bread and nuts and made a happy sound . he looked at tom and lily and smiled .

" thank you for feeding me , " the bird said . " you are very kind and brave . i do n't like this cage and this man . he does not care about me . he only cares about money . he does not know that i am the king of the birds and i have a great power . i can grant you one wish each . what do you wish for ? "

tom and lily were surprised and happy . they thought about their wishes . tom wished for a new bike , because his old one was broken . lily wished for a new doll , because her old one was lost . the bird nodded and said , " your wishes are granted . but you have to do one more thing for me . you have to open this cage and let me go . i want to be free and fly with my friends . will you do that for me ? "

tom and lily agreed . they opened the cage and the bird flew out . he thanked them again and said , " you are the best kids i ever met . you have a good heart and a good mind . you know how to share and care . you are not greedy and selfish like the man . you deserve your wishes and more . remember , the true king is not the one who has the most , but the one who gives the most . goodbye and good luck ! "

the bird flew away and tom and lily ran to their new bike and doll . they were very happy and proud . they learned a valuable lesson that day . they learned that feeding the king of the birds was better than owning him . they learned that being kind and generous was better than being rude and mean . they learned that freedom and friendship were better than money and power . they learned that the king of the birds was great , and so were they . tom and ann are husband and wife . they like to make things with wood . they have a big shed with many tools . tom can use a saw , a hammer , and a drill . ann can use a paintbrush , a glue , and a tape .

one day , they decide to make a birdhouse for their garden . tom cuts the wood into pieces . ann paints them with bright colors . they work hard and have fun .

" look , tom , our birdhouse is almost done ! " ann says . " we just need to put the roof on . "

" yes , ann , it looks very impressive ! " tom says . " you are very good at painting . i like the flowers and the dots . "

" thank you , tom . you are very good at cutting . the pieces fit well together . " ann says . " can you use the drill to make a hole for the birds ? "

" sure , ann . i can do that . " tom says . he uses the drill to make a hole in the front of the birdhouse . then he uses the glue and the tape to attach the roof .

they carry the birdhouse to the garden and hang it on a tree . they are very happy and proud of their work .

" maybe some birds will come and live in our birdhouse . " ann says .

" i hope so , ann . that would be nice . " tom says .

they hug each other and smile . they love each other and their birdhouse . sara and ben were best friends . they liked to play pretend games in the park . one day , they decided to play marriage . they found some flowers and a ring made of grass . sara put the ring on ben 's finger and said , " now you are my husband and i am your wife . we have to love each other and share everything . "

ben nodded and smiled . he liked sara very much . he gave her a hug and said , " you are my wife and i am your husband . we have to be kind and help each other . "

they played happily for a while , until they saw a big dog running towards them . the dog looked angry and scary . sara and ben were afraid . they ran away from the dog , but they dropped the ring and the flowers .

the dog stopped and sniffed the ring and the flowers . he liked them . he picked them up with his mouth and ran away with them .

sara and ben were sad . they lost their ring and their flowers . they felt guilty . they thought they broke their marriage .

they looked at each other and said , " i 'm sorry . i love you . "

they hugged each other and felt better . they decided to make a new ring and new flowers . they said , " we are still husband and wife . we do n't need a ring and flowers to show it . we have each other . " lily and ben are twins . they like to play with their toys and watch tv . but sometimes they get tired and need a nap .

one day , they were watching a show about hairy animals . they saw a lion , a bear , and a monkey . they learned how the animals live and what they eat .

" wow , look at the lion ! " ben said . " he has a big mane and sharp teeth . he is the king of the animals . "

" i like the monkey , " lily said . " he has a long tail and funny face . he can swing from the trees and eat bananas . "

they watched the show until it was over . then their mom came in and said , " time for a nap , kids . you have been watching tv for a long time . you need to rest your eyes and your brains . "

" but mom , we are not sleepy , " ben said . " we want to watch more tv . "

" me too , " lily said . " we want to see more hairy animals . "

mom smiled and said , " i know you like the show , but you also need a nap . napping is good for you . it helps you grow and learn . and you can watch more tv later , after you wake up . "

she took them to their bedroom and tucked them in their beds . she gave them each a kiss and said , " sweet dreams , my loves . i will be back soon . "

lily and ben closed their eyes and tried to nap . but they kept thinking about the hairy animals . they imagined they were in the jungle with the monkey , or in the savanna with the lion , or in the forest with the bear . they made noises and pretended to be the animals .

mom heard them and came back to check on them . she saw them playing and laughing in their beds . she shook her head and said , " you two are not napping at all . you are having too much fun . "

she decided to join them and said , " can i be a hairy animal too ? how about a cat ? meow ! "

lily and ben giggled and said , " yes , mom , you can be a cat . we love you , our hairy cat mom . "

they hugged her and snuggled with her . they felt cozy and warm . they stopped playing and started to nap . they dreamed of hairy animals and happy adventures . one day , a boy and a girl were playing in the snow . they made a big snowman with a hat , a scarf and a carrot nose . they were very happy with their snowman .

" look , our snowman is so nice ! " the boy said .

" yes , he is ! " the girl said . " but he looks a little cold . maybe we should give him a hug . "

they ran to the snowman and hugged him . but as soon as they touched him , they felt something unusual . the snowman was not cold and soft . he was warm and hard .

" ouch ! " the boy said . " what is this ? "

the snowman moved his arms and smiled . he was not a snowman . he was a man dressed in snow clothes .

" hello , children ! " the man said . " i 'm sorry i scared you . i was playing a trick on you . i wanted to see if you would notice me . "

the boy and the girl were very surprised . they had never seen a man who could freeze like a snowman .

" who are you ? " the girl asked .

" i 'm a magician , " the man said . " i can do many unusual things . do you want to see ? "

the boy and the girl nodded . they were curious and excited . the man showed them some of his magic tricks . he made a rabbit appear from his hat , he turned his scarf into a snake , and he made the carrot nose fly in the air .

the boy and the girl laughed and clapped . they liked the man and his magic . they forgot they were cold and hungry . they had a lot of fun with the unusual man who could freeze like a snowman . lily was a creative girl who liked to make things with her toys . one day , she decided to make a farm with her blocks , animals and dolls . she built a barn , a fence , a pond and a field . she put her cows , pigs , chickens and horses in the barn and the fence . she put her ducks and fish in the pond . she put her dolls in the house .

lily wanted to grow some corn in the field , but she did not have any seeds . she looked around and saw a box of cereal . she thought it looked like corn . she took some cereal and put it in the field . she said , " this is my corn . it will grow big and yellow . "

lily went to the kitchen and got a cup of water . she said , " my corn needs water to grow . i will drink some water and then give some to my corn . " she drank some water and then poured some on the cereal . she said , " there , now my corn is happy . "

lily went back to her farm and played with her toys . she pretended to feed the animals , milk the cows , collect the eggs and ride the horses . she had a lot of fun . she looked at her corn and saw that it was wet and soggy . she said , " oh no , my corn is not growing . it is mushy . maybe it needs more sun . "

lily moved her corn to the window and put it on the sill . she said , " maybe the sun will make my corn dry and hard . then it will be ready to eat . " she left her corn there and went to play some more .

later , lily 's mom came to see what she was doing . she saw her farm and said , " wow , lily , you are very creative . you made a wonderful farm with your toys . what is this on the window ? " she pointed to the cereal .

lily said , " that is my corn . i planted it in the field and gave it water . but it did not grow . it is wet and mushy . i put it in the sun to make it dry and hard . then i can eat it . "

lily 's mom smiled and said , " that is very clever , lily , but that is not corn . that is cereal . cereal is made from corn , but it is not the same . cereal does not grow in the field . it comes in a box . you can eat it with milk or yogurt for breakfast . do you want some ? "

lily said , " yes , please . i like cereal . but i also like corn . can we have corn for dinner ? "

lily 's mom said , " sure , we can have corn for dinner . corn is a vegetable that grows on a tall plant . it has green leaves and yellow kernels . you can eat it with butter and salt . it is very yummy . do you want to help me cook it ? "

lily said , " yes , please . i want to help you cook the corn . maybe i can learn how to grow it too . then i can have my own corn on my farm . "

lily 's mom said , " that sounds like a great idea , lily . you are a very creative and curious girl . i love you very much . "

lily said , " i love you too , mom . and i love my farm . and i love corn . and i love cereal . and i love water . and i love the sun . and i love everything . " sara was a very obedient girl . she always listened to her mom and dad and did what they asked . she helped with the chores , shared her toys , and said please and thank you . she loved her family very much .

one day , it was sara 's birthday . she was very excited . she wondered what kind of cake and presents she would get . she hoped her friends would come to her party . she got dressed in her prettiest dress and waited for her mom and dad to call her .

but they did not call her . she waited and waited . she felt sad and confused . did they forget her birthday ? did they not love her anymore ? she decided to go and look for them . she walked out of her room and into the hall .

she saw a big sign that said " happy birthday sara ! " and balloons and streamers everywhere . she heard a loud " surprise ! " and saw her mom and dad and all her friends smiling and clapping . they had planned a surprise party for her . they hugged her and gave her a big cake and lots of presents . they sang happy birthday and played games and had fun .

sara was so happy . she realized that her mom and dad did not forget her birthday . they wanted to make it special for her . they loved her very much . she thanked them and her friends for the surprise . she learned that sometimes being obedient means being patient and trusting . she had the best birthday ever . tom and anna are friends . they like to play in the classroom . they have many toys and books . but today , tom is not happy . he feels sad and angry .

" why are you sad , tom ? " anna asks him .

" because ben took my car . he said it is his . but it is mine . i want it back , " tom says .

" did you tell the teacher ? " anna says .

" no . i am scared of ben . he is big and mean . he can hurt me , " tom says .

anna feels sorry for tom . she wants to help him . she has an idea .

" come with me , tom . i have a plan . we can get your car back , " anna says .

she takes tom by the hand and leads him to the other side of the classroom . there , she sees ben playing with tom 's car . she walks up to him and says :

" hi , ben . can i see your car ? it looks very nice . "

ben smiles and gives anna the car . he thinks anna likes him . he does not see tom behind anna .

" thank you , ben . but this is not your car . this is tom 's car . you took it from him . that is not nice . you should say sorry to tom and give him his car back , " anna says .

she gives the car to tom and pushes him forward . tom holds the car and looks at ben . ben feels ashamed and angry . he does not like to say sorry . he wants to keep the car .

" no , it is my car . i found it . you are lying . give it back to me , " ben says .

he tries to grab the car from tom . but anna stops him . she says :

" no , ben . you are wrong . this is tom 's car . he brought it from home . he has his name on it . look . "

she points to the sticker on the car . it says " tom " . ben sees the sticker . he knows he is caught . he feels more ashamed and angry . he does not know what to do .

the teacher sees the fight . she comes over and says :

" what is going on here ? why are you fighting over a car ? "

anna tells the teacher what happened . the teacher listens and nods . she says :

" ben , you did a bad thing . you took tom 's car without asking . that is stealing . that is not how we share and play in the classroom . you need to say sorry to tom and give him his car back . and you need to go to the time - out corner and think about what you did . "

ben feels very sorry . he knows he was wrong . he says :

" i am sorry , tom . i am sorry , teacher . i will not do it again . "

he gives tom his car back and goes to the time - out corner . tom feels happy . he has his car back . he says :

" thank you , anna . you are a good friend . you helped me . "

anna feels happy too . she says :

" you are welcome , tom . i am glad you are happy . do you want to play with me ? "

tom nods and smiles . he says :

" yes , i do . let 's play . "

they go to the play area and play with the car and other toys . they have fun . they are friends . lily liked to play catch with her big brother tom . they had a ball that was green and soft . tom threw the ball to lily and she caught it with her hands . she smiled and threw it back to tom . they did this many times and had fun .

one day , tom had a birthday . he got a cake with candles on it . the candles were not green , they were red and yellow and blue . they looked pretty and bright . tom 's mom said , " make a wish and blow out the candles , tom . " tom closed his eyes and made a wish . he opened his eyes and blew hard .

but lily wanted to catch the candles . she thought they were like the ball . she reached out her hand and tried to grab a candle . but the candle was hot and it burned her . she cried out and dropped the candle . it fell on the floor and made a mess .

tom 's mom ran to lily and hugged her . she said , " oh , lily , i 'm sorry . the candles are not for catching . they are for blowing . they are fire and fire can hurt you . you have to be careful . " she took lily to the sink and put cold water on her hand . she gave her a band - aid and a kiss .

