lily and ben pet spot and thank him . they are happy and not scared anymore . they wave to spot and go back to play in the garden . they hope they will not see the spider again . lily and max were playing with their toy trains on the floor . they had a big track with a switch that made the trains go different ways . lily liked to make her train go fast and loud . max liked to make his train go slow and quiet .

