they decided to play with the lime instead of eating it . they rolled it , tossed it , and squeezed it . they had fun and learned to be kind and respectful to each other .

the moral of the story is : listen to your siblings and share with them . they know what is good for you and want you to be happy . mia loved to watch the otters at the zoo . they were so gifted at swimming and playing in the water . she wished she could be an otter too . she asked her mom , " can i be an otter , mom ? "

