mia and leo swing and sing and laugh . they have fun and they are happy . they are not shy anymore . they are friends who like to swing . lily liked to play with her mom 's large vase . it was blue and shiny and had flowers on it . she would fill it with water and pretend it was a lake for her toy ducks . sometimes she would put her hand inside and feel the cold water .

