they giggled and dreamed of all the things they could make with their blocks . they did not notice that their eyes were getting heavy and their voices were getting softer . soon , they were fast asleep , holding their green blocks in their hands . anna liked to play dress - up with her dolls . she had many dresses for them , in different colors and shapes . she liked to change their dresses every day , and make them look pretty .

one day , she saw a new dress in her mom 's closet . it was shiny and sparkly , and had a long skirt . anna wanted to try it on , and see how she looked . she took the dress and put it on over her clothes . it was too big for her , and dragged on the floor .

