they hugged mommy and ate their pie . they were happy . anna was restless . she did not want to sit at the table and eat her vegetables . she wanted to play with her toys and run around the house . she pushed her plate away and said , " no , no , no ! i do n't like vegetables ! "

her mom was not happy . she said , " anna , you have to eat your vegetables . they are good for you . they make you strong and healthy . you can play after you finish your dinner . "

