her mom sighed . she said , " no , anna , you ca n't play now . you have to eat your vegetables first . that 's the rule . if you do n't eat your vegetables , you ca n't have dessert . and you ca n't watch your favorite show . and you ca n't go to the park tomorrow . do you understand ? "

