her mom said , " i love you too , anna . now , let 's eat our vegetables and enjoy our dinner . " tom and anna were humble children who lived in a small house with their mother . they did not have many toys or clothes , but they were happy and kind . one day , their mother told them that they would have a special guest for dinner . she said it was a friend who helped her when she was sick .

