anna and tom did as they were told . they spread the cloth over the table and arranged the plates and cups . the cloth was white and soft , and it made the table look nice . they wondered who the guest was and what he would bring .

soon , there was a knock on the door . their mother opened it and smiled . it was a man with a beard and a hat . he carried a big basket in his arms .

" hello , my friend . thank you for coming . please , come in . these are my children , tom and anna . they have been looking forward to meeting you . "

