tom and anna thanked john and hugged him again . they felt very happy and grateful . they helped their mother and john to serve the bread and cakes . they sat around the table and ate and talked . they laughed and smiled . they felt like they had a new friend . they forgot about their troubles and enjoyed the moment . they felt the warmth of the cloth , the taste of the bread and cakes , and the love of their mother and john . they felt blessed . lily and tom were playing with their toys in the living room . they liked to pretend they were astronauts and explore the universe . they had a big cardboard box that they used as a spaceship . they put stickers and drawings on it to make it look like a real spaceship .

" ready for take off , lily ? " tom asked , sitting in the box and holding a toy steering wheel .

