they closed their eyes and waited for the impact . but nothing happened . they opened their eyes and saw that they were still in the living room . the box had fallen over and they were lying on the floor .

they looked at each other and started to laugh . they realized it was just a game and they were not really in danger .

" that was fun , tom ! " lily said , getting out of the box .

" that was fun , lily ! " tom said , following her . " but maybe next time we should not fly so close to the black hole . it might make us become black too ! "

they giggled and hugged each other . they decided to play something else . they still loved the universe , but they also loved their home . tom and lily are friends who like to play on the farm . they like to see the animals and feed them grass and hay . one day , they see a big horse in the stable . the horse is brown and has a long mane and tail .

