they leave the stable and go to the pond . they see the ducks and throw them some bread . the ducks are happy and quack . tom and lily are happy too . they forget about the horse and have fun . lily and ben like to play volleyball in the park . they have a big ball that is yellow and blue . they hit the ball over a net with their hands . lily is good at volleyball . she can serve the ball very fast and hard . ben is not so good . he is clumsy . he often drops the ball or misses the net .

one day , they play with some new friends . their names are mia and sam . mia and sam are also good at volleyball . they can serve and spike the ball very well . spike means to hit the ball down hard . lily and ben want to win the game . they try their best .

lily serves the ball to sam . sam spikes the ball back to lily . lily catches the ball with her hands . she throws the ball to ben . ben tries to spike the ball to mia . but he is clumsy . he slips and falls . the ball goes over his head and out of the park .

