" yes , you are , " sam says . " do n't be sad , ben . you have a good spirit . you can learn to spike better . we can teach you . "

lily and ben feel happy . they thank mia and sam . they all become friends . they decide to play volleyball again next week . they hope to have more fun and learn more skills . they also hope ben will be less clumsy . lily and ben are best friends . they like to play with toys , draw pictures and read books . one day , they go to the park with their moms . they see a big slide , a swing and a sandbox . they run to the slide and take turns going down .

lily has a photo in her pocket . it is a photo of her and ben on their birthday . they had a big cake , balloons and presents . lily likes the photo very much . she wants to show it to ben . she takes it out of her pocket and holds it in her hand .

but then , she sees a butterfly . it is yellow and blue and very pretty . lily loves butterflies . she forgets about the photo and runs after the butterfly . she wants to catch it and touch it . she follows it across the grass and to the flowers .

ben waits for lily at the slide . he wonders where she is . he looks around and sees her chasing the butterfly . he smiles and runs to join her . he likes butterflies too . he does not see the photo on the ground . he forgets about it too .

the moms watch their kids from a bench . they talk and laugh and drink juice . they do not see the photo either . it is on the grass , near the slide . it is sunny and warm . the photo fades and curls . it is slow and sad . it misses lily and ben . it wishes they would remember it . tom and mia are friends . they like to play outside . one day , they see a big hill near their house . they want to go up the hill and see what is on the other side .

they hold hands and start to climb the hill . it is hard and steep . they have to be careful not to slip . they see rocks and flowers and bugs . they say , " wow , this is interesting ! "

they reach the top of the hill . they look down and see a valley . the valley is green and wide . they see a river and a bridge and some animals . they say , " wow , this is beautiful ! "

they want to go down the hill and explore the valley . they run and jump and laugh . they are happy and excited . but they are also fast and careless . they do not watch where they are going .

tom stumbles on a root . he falls and hurts his knee . he cries and says , " ow , ow , ow ! " mia stops and runs back to him . she sees his knee is red and bleeding . she says , " oh no , tom , are you okay ? "

she helps him get up and hugs him . she says , " do n't worry , tom , i am here . we will go back home and get a band - aid and a hug from mom . then you will feel better . "

tom nods and smiles . he says , " thank you , mia , you are a good friend . i am sorry i was too fast . next time , we will be more careful . "

they hold hands and walk back home . they still think the valley is beautiful and interesting . but they also think the hill is hard and steep . they decide to play in their yard instead . they are still happy and excited . they are still friends . ben was a goat who lived on a farm . he liked to eat grass and play with his friends . he had a big horn on his head that he used to push and fight with other goats .

one day , a bad man came to the farm . he wanted to take ben 's horn and sell it for money . he caught ben and tied him to a tree . he took a sharp knife and cut off ben 's horn . ben felt a lot of pain and cried out loud . he suffered a lot .

the bad man ran away with ben 's horn . ben was left alone and bleeding . he was very sad and scared . he felt poor without his horn . he could not play or fight with his friends anymore . he felt ugly and weak .

the farmer heard ben 's cry and came to help him . he saw what the bad man had done and felt sorry for ben . he wrapped a cloth around ben 's wound and gave him some water and hay . he hugged ben and told him he was still a good goat . he said he would take care of him and protect him from the bad man .

ben felt a little better . he thanked the farmer and licked his hand . he still missed his horn , but he was glad he had a friend . he hoped his horn would grow back someday . he learned that horns are not as important as kindness and love . lily and max are twins . they like to have fun . they have a big bed in their room . they have many toys and books . they have a dog named spot .

one night , lily and max can not sleep . they want to have an adventure . they get out of bed and put on their coats and hats . they take spot with them . they sneak out of the house and go to the park .

the park is dark and quiet . lily and max see the moon and the stars . they see the swings and the slide . they see the pond and the ducks . they have a lot of fun . they play with spot . they swing and slide . they feed the ducks . they laugh and sing .

but then they hear a noise . it is their mom and dad . they are looking for them . they are worried and angry . they find lily and max and spot . they take them back to the house . they scold them and hug them . they tell them to never do that again . they tell them to go to bed and sleep .

lily and max are sorry . they say they are sorry . they love their mom and dad . they love spot . they go to bed and sleep . they dream of their adventurous night . they smile . lily likes to help mommy clean the house . she has a small mop that she uses to wipe the floor . mommy has a big mop that she uses to make the floor shiny . lily and mommy work together and sing songs .

one day , lily hears a noise outside . she runs to the window and sees a big truck . the truck has a hose and a loud sound . lily is curious and wants to see what the truck is doing . she drops her mop and goes to the door .

mommy sees lily and says , " lily , where are you going ? stay here and listen to me . the truck is spraying water on the street . it is not safe to go outside . you might get wet and cold . come back and finish your mop . "

