lily nods and says , " okay , mommy . i love you too . what is our warm snack ? " mommy says , " it is a surprise . but i think you will like it . it is sweet and yummy . " lily and mommy finish their mop and go to the kitchen . mommy gives lily a warm cup of cocoa and a cookie . lily is happy and says , " thank you , mommy . this is the best warm snack ever . " mommy hugs lily and says , " you are welcome , lily . you are the best helper ever . " tim and kim were twins who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big slide that looked fun . tim ran to the slide and climbed up the ladder . kim followed him , but she was scared . she did not like high things .

" come on , kim , it 's easy ! " tim said . " just sit and slide down . whee ! "

tim slid down the slide and laughed . he waited for kim to join him . but kim did not move . she sat on the top of the slide and cried .

" i ca n't , tim , i ca n't ! " kim said . " it 's too high and fast . i want to go back . "

tim felt sorry for kim . he wanted to help her . he had an idea .

" kim , do n't cry . i have a secret for you . do you want to hear it ? " tim said .

kim nodded . she liked secrets .

" ok , listen . the slide is not real . it 's just a lie . it 's made of paper and glue . it ca n't hurt you . it 's empty inside . there 's nothing there . you can slide down and nothing will happen . trust me , kim . it 's a lie . "

kim looked at tim . he sounded serious . he was her brother . he would not lie to her . maybe he was right . maybe the slide was a lie . maybe it was empty .

" are you sure , tim ? " kim asked .

" sure , i 'm sure . come on , kim . it 's a lie . it 's empty . it 's fun . let 's slide together . " tim said .

he held out his hand to kim . kim took his hand . she felt brave . she decided to trust tim . she decided to slide .

they slid down the slide together . they felt the wind and the sun . they felt happy and free . they reached the bottom and smiled .

" that was fun , tim ! " kim said . " thank you for telling me the secret . the slide was a lie . it was empty . but it was fun . "

tim hugged kim . he was proud of her . he was glad she slid . but he also felt guilty . he knew he lied to her . he knew the slide was not a lie . he knew it was not empty . he knew it was real . he knew he lied to make her slide . he wondered if she would ever find out . he wondered if she would ever forgive him . he wondered if he did the right thing . he wondered what life would be like if he told the truth . tim and kim were twins who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big goat with long horns . they wanted to touch the goat , but their mom said no . she said the goat was deaf and could not hear them . she said the goat might get scared and slap them with his horns .

but tim and kim did not listen to their mom . they waited until she was talking to another mom . then they ran to the goat and tried to pet him . the goat did not like that . he felt them pull his fur and he turned around . he saw them with his eyes and he was angry . he slapped them with his horns . tim and kim cried out loud . they had bumps on their heads .

their mom heard them and ran to them . she was very mad . she picked them up and took them to the bench . she put ice on their bumps and said , " i told you not to touch the goat . he is deaf and he does not like strangers . you could have been hurt more . you have to listen to me . i know what is best for you . "

tim and kim felt sorry . they said , " we are sorry , mom . we did not mean to make the goat mad . we just wanted to see him . he looked so soft and nice . "

their mom hugged them and said , " i know you were curious , but you have to be careful . some animals are not friendly and some are deaf . you have to respect them and keep your distance . next time , you can ask me before you touch anything . i love you and i want you to be safe . "

tim and kim nodded and said , " we love you too , mom . we will listen to you next time . can we still play in the park ? "

their mom smiled and said , " yes , you can . but stay away from the goat . he needs his space . "

tim and kim agreed and went to play with their ball . they had fun and they did not bother the goat again . the goat was happy too . he ate his grass and he did not slap anyone with his horns . lily liked to play with marbles . she had many marbles of different colors and sizes . she kept them in a big jar in her room . she was very good at rolling and hitting marbles with other marbles . she was popular with the other kids who liked to play marbles with her .

one day , a new boy came to her school . his name was max . he also liked to play with marbles . he had a very big and shiny marble that he called his lucky marble . he said it was the best marble in the world . he said he could beat anyone with his lucky marble .

lily wanted to play with max and his lucky marble . she asked him if he wanted to play with her . max said yes , but he said he would only play for keeps . that meant that whoever lost had to give their marbles to the winner . lily was not afraid . she believed in her skills and her marbles . she agreed to play for keeps .

they went to the playground and drew a circle on the ground . they put their marbles inside the circle . they took turns to roll their marbles and try to knock the other marbles out of the circle . lily was very good . she knocked out many of max 's marbles . max was not happy . he rolled his lucky marble with all his strength . he hit lily 's marble hard . but his lucky marble bounced off and rolled out of the circle . lily won !

lily was happy . she had won all of max 's marbles , including his lucky marble . she picked them up and put them in her jar . she said thank you to max and asked him if he wanted to play again . max was sad . he had lost his lucky marble and all his other marbles . he said no and walked away . lily felt sorry for him . she ran after him and gave him back his lucky marble . she said it was a very nice marble and she wanted to be his friend . max smiled . he said thank you to lily and said he wanted to be her friend too . they hugged and went back to the playground to play some more . they both believed that marbles were fun and friends were better . tom and mia are mice who live in a big house . they like to find cheese in the kitchen , but they have to be careful of the cat . one day , they see a big piece of cheese on the table . it smells very good .

