they hear a loud meow . the cat has seen them . it jumps on the table and chases them .

" help , help ! " tom and mia scream .

they run and hide under a napkin . they hope the cat will go away . they wish they never drank the water . they wish they never saw the cheese . they wish they were big again . spot was a dog who liked to play with his toys . he had a ball , a bone , and a fake duck that made a sound when he bit it . spot loved his fake duck the most , because it sounded like a real duck .

one day , spot was playing with his fake duck in the garden , when he heard a real duck quack from the pond . spot was curious and ran to the pond to see the real duck . he left his fake duck on the grass .

the real duck saw spot and was scared . he did not want to play with a big dog . he quacked louder and louder to tell spot to go away . but spot did not listen . he wanted to play with the real duck . he jumped into the pond and tried to catch the real duck with his mouth .

the real duck was very angry and bit spot on the nose . spot yelped and ran out of the pond . he was wet and hurt and sad . he looked for his fake duck , but he could not find it . someone had taken it while he was in the pond .

spot learned a lesson that day . he learned that he should listen to others when they say no . he learned that he should not chase real ducks , because they are not toys . he learned that he should take care of his fake duck , because it was his best friend . he hoped that he would find his fake duck again someday . lily liked to fix things . she had a box of tools and some old toys that she could take apart and put back together . she was very creative and made new things from the parts . she made a car with wings , a robot with a hat , and a doll with a flashlight .

one day , lily wanted to fix her brother 's bike . it had a flat tire and a broken bell . lily thought she could make it better . she took her tools and went to the garage . she did not ask her brother if she could fix his bike . she thought it was a surprise .

but her brother was not happy when he saw what lily did . she had taken off the tire and the bell and put them on her car with wings . she had also painted the bike pink and put stickers on it . her brother was angry and yelled at her . he said she ruined his bike and he did not want it anymore .

lily was sad and sorry . she did not mean to make her brother mad . she wanted to help him . she realized she should have asked him first . she said she was sorry and asked him if they could fix the bike together . her brother calmed down and said yes . he said he liked some of her ideas , but not all of them . he said they could share some of the parts and make both the bike and the car with wings better .

lily and her brother worked together to fix the bike and the car with wings . they used some of lily 's tools and some of her brother 's tools . they were both creative and had fun . they learned to respect each other 's things and to ask before they fix them . they also learned to cooperate and to appreciate each other 's skills . they hugged and thanked each other . they rode the bike and the car with wings around the yard . they were happy . anna was a restless daughter . she liked to run and jump and play all day . she did not like to sit still or be quiet . she always wanted to see new things and have fun .

one day , anna and her mom went to the mall . mom wanted to buy some clothes and shoes for herself and anna . but anna did not want to try on clothes and shoes . she wanted to go to the toy store and the candy store and the playground . she pulled mom 's hand and said , " mom , can we go there ? please , please , please ! "

mom sighed and said , " anna , we have to buy these things first . then we can go to the toy store and the candy store and the playground . but you have to be patient and behave . can you do that for me ? "

anna nodded , but she was not happy . she followed mom to the dressing room and the cashier , but she was bored and restless . she fidgeted and whined and made faces . mom tried to calm her down and make her smile , but she was tired and frustrated .

finally , they finished buying the clothes and shoes . mom said , " ok , anna , now we can go to the toy store and the candy store and the playground . but you have to choose one thing from each store , ok ? and you have to say thank you and be polite , ok ? "

anna smiled and said , " ok , mom , thank you . i love you . " she hugged mom and ran to the toy store . she saw many toys that she liked , but she chose a big teddy bear that was soft and brown . she said , " mom , can i buy this ? please , please , please ? "

mom smiled and said , " yes , anna , you can buy that . it 's very cute . but remember , only one thing from each store , ok ? "

anna nodded and said , " ok , mom , thank you . i love you . " she hugged mom and ran to the candy store . she saw many candies that she liked , but she chose a big lollipop that was red and sweet . she said , " mom , can i buy this ? please , please , please ? "

mom smiled and said , " yes , anna , you can buy that . it 's very yummy . but remember , only one thing from each store , ok ? "

anna nodded and said , " ok , mom , thank you . i love you . " she hugged mom and ran to the playground . she saw many slides and swings and tunnels that she liked , but she chose a big slide that was high and fast . she said , " mom , can i go on this ? please , please , please ? "

