they hung up the phone and got ready to go to the park . they were happy and they forgot about the rain . they mailed each other letters every week and they always played together . they were best friends forever . tom and lily are twins . they like to play with their toys and books . but sometimes they fight and make a mess . mom and dad are not happy when they fight and make a mess .

