they went inside and had cake and ice cream and played with their toys . they had a lot of fun . they learned that celebrating is not about the season or the weather , but about the friendship and the love . they also learned that making someone happy is a wonderful gift . they were very grateful for each other . tom and lily were twins who liked to play with their toys . they had many toys , but they always wanted more . they were spoiled children who did not share or say thank you .

