tom and lily promised and hugged their dad again . they learned a valuable lesson that day . they learned to be more careful and respectful , more kind and generous , and more willing to pause to think or say sorry . they learned to be less spoiled and more grateful . they learned to love and appreciate the world and each other . lily and ben were friends who liked to play together . they lived in a big house with a big garden and many toys . they were wealthy , but they were not happy . they always wanted more things and never shared with others .

one day , they saw a new fridge in the kitchen . it was shiny and white and had a lot of food inside . lily and ben wanted to see what was in the fridge , so they opened the door and looked inside . they saw ice cream , cake , juice , cheese , and many other yummy things . they decided to take some of the food and eat it in their room .

they took a lot of food and ran to their room . they did not close the fridge door , because they were greedy and wanted to come back for more . they did not include their parents or their nanny , because they were selfish and wanted to keep the food for themselves . they did not say thank you , because they were rude and did not care about others .

