" look , sam , he 's so big ! " tom said .

" yeah , and he has a nice mane ! " sam said .

they were so close to the lion , they could almost touch him . they wondered how he felt . they wanted to pet him . they forgot that he was a wild animal .

tom had an idea . he saw a hole in the fence . it was big enough for his finger . he thought he could poke the lion and make him wake up . he thought it would be fun .

he whispered to sam , " hey , sam , watch this . i 'm going to poke the lion with my finger . "

sam thought it was a bad idea . he said , " no , tom , do n't do that . he might bite you . he might get angry . he might roar . "

but tom did n't listen . he put his finger through the hole and touched the lion 's fur . it was soft and warm . he smiled . he thought he was brave .

but then , something happened . the lion opened his eyes . he saw tom 's finger . he did n't like it . he snapped his jaws and bit tom 's finger . he roared .

tom screamed . he pulled his finger back . it was bleeding . it hurt a lot . he cried . he was scared .

sam was scared too . he hugged tom . he called for help . he said , " i 'm sorry , tom . i told you not to poke the lion . he 's a wild animal . he 's not a toy . "

the moms heard the scream and the roar . they ran to the fence . they saw tom 's finger . they saw the lion . they were shocked . they took tom to the nurse . they said , " what did you do , tom ? why did you poke the lion ? you could have lost your finger . you could have been hurt worse . "

tom felt sorry . he said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i wanted to see the lion better . i wanted to pet him . i did n't know he would bite me . i wo n't do it again . "

the nurse cleaned tom 's finger and put a bandage on it . she said , " you 're lucky , tom . the lion did n't bite too hard . your finger will heal . but you have to be careful . you have to respect the animals . you have to follow the rules . you have to listen to your mom and your friend . "

tom nodded . he said , " i understand , nurse . i learned my lesson . i will be careful . i will respect the animals . i will follow the rules . i will listen to my mom and my friend . "

tom and sam hugged . they said , " we 're still best friends . "

they left the zoo . they did n't see the lion again . they saw other animals . they had fun and learned new things . but they never forgot the day they visited the famous lion . lily and ben liked to play zoom - zoom with their toy cars . they had many cars of different colors and sizes . they made roads and bridges with their blocks and books . they zoomed their cars on the roads and over the bridges . they made noises like vroom and beep .

