they laugh at the bird . the bird laughs at them . they are all happy . they are all friends . sam and tom were friends who liked to play with fire . they found a box of matches in the kitchen and took it to the backyard . they lit some leaves and sticks and watched the fire grow . they thought it was funny to see the smoke and the sparks .

