mom is in the kitchen . she is deaf , so she did not hear the noise . she sees ben and lily and hugs them . she asks them what is wrong . they point to the window and say " glass , ball , break " .

mom understands and nods . she tells them not to worry . she says she will call dad and he will fix the window . she says they are safe and she loves them . she says they are brave and good .

ben and lily feel better . they hug mom and say they love her too . they say they are sorry for the window . mom says it is not their fault . she says they can help her protect the window until dad comes . she gives them some tape and paper . they go to the living room and cover the crack with tape and paper . they make a sign that says " do not touch " . they are proud of their work . they smile and play with their toys again . sara and tom are playing in the sand . they have a big bucket and a small spoon . they want to make a sand cake . they need salt to make it tasty .

