sara and tom are happy . they thank the man . they take the box . they run back to the sand . they sprinkle the salt on their cake . they make it tasty .

they eat their cake . they share it with the man . they are friends . they have fun . they do n't lose anything . they find something . they find salt . lily and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . they have a big ball and a small bike . they share the ball and the bike . they are happy .

one day , a new boy comes to the park . his name is tom . he has a wide hat and a loud voice . he sees the ball and the bike . he wants them . he runs to lily and ben . he says , " give me the ball and the bike . they are mine now . "

lily and ben are scared . they say , " no , they are ours . we share them . you can play with us , but you can not take them . " tom does not listen . he pushes lily and ben . he grabs the ball and the bike . he says , " ha ha , i have them . you have nothing . go away . "

lily and ben are sad . they cry . they do not know what to do . they want their ball and their bike back . they do not like tom . they think he is mean . they think he is making war .

then , they see a big dog . the dog is friendly . he likes to play . he sees tom with the ball and the bike . he thinks they are toys . he runs to tom . he barks . he jumps . he bites the ball . he chews the bike . he makes them broken .

tom is scared . he screams . he drops the ball and the bike . he runs away . he does not want the dog . he does not want the ball and the bike . he does not want war .

lily and ben are happy . they hug the dog . they kiss him . they say , " thank you , dog . you are our hero . you are our friend . you make peace . " they take the ball and the bike . they do not mind that they are broken . they can still play with them . they can still share them . they are happy . anna likes to dream . she dreams of flying in the sky , swimming in the sea , and playing with animals . sometimes she dreams of being a princess , wearing a smooth dress and a shiny crown . she likes to tell her dreams to her mommy and daddy when she wakes up .

one day , anna has a very special dream . she dreams of a magic shirt . the shirt can change color and shape when she touches it . she can make it pink or blue , big or small , round or square . she has fun trying different things with the shirt . she makes it into a cape , a hat , a scarf , and a tent .

she hears a voice in her dream . it is her friend ben . he says , " hi , anna . i like your shirt . can i play with you ? " anna says , " yes , ben . you can play with me . this is a magic shirt . look what it can do . " she shows him how to change the shirt . they laugh and play together .

anna is happy in her dream . she thinks , " this is the best dream ever . i wish it would never end . " but then she hears another voice . it is her mommy . she says , " anna , wake up . it is time for breakfast . " anna opens her eyes . she sees her mommy smiling at her . she says , " mommy , i had a wonderful dream . i dreamed of a magic shirt and ben was there too . "

mommy says , " that sounds like a lovely dream , anna . but now you have to get ready for the day . you can tell me more about your dream later . come on , let 's go to the kitchen . " she helps anna get out of bed and put on her clothes . anna looks at her shirt . it is not magic . it is just a plain yellow shirt . she thinks , " maybe i can dream of the magic shirt again tonight . " she smiles and follows her mommy . lily likes to write . she has a big book and a red pen . she writes about her toys , her friends and her cat . she writes every day .

one day , she sees a bug on her book . it is small and green . it has six legs and two wings . lily thinks it is cute . she says , " hello , bug . do you want to be my friend ? "

the bug does not say anything . it crawls on her book . it makes a hole in her page . lily is sad . she says , " no , bug . you are not my friend . you are bad . you ruined my book . "

the bug flies away . lily cries . she hugs her book . she says , " i 'm sorry , book . i love you . you are my best friend . "

her mom hears her cry . she comes to her room . she sees the hole in her book . she says , " what happened , lily ? "

lily tells her mom about the bug . she says , " the bug was mean . it hurt my book . i do n't like bugs . "

her mom hugs her . she says , " i 'm sorry , lily . bugs can be naughty sometimes . but they do n't mean to hurt you . they are just looking for food and a home . maybe the bug liked your book too . "

lily thinks for a moment . she says , " maybe . but i do n't want to share my book with bugs . they can have other things . like leaves and flowers . "

her mom smiles . she says , " that 's very kind of you , lily . how about we fix your book ? we can use some tape and stickers . and we can write a new story together . what do you think ? "

lily smiles too . she says , " yes , mom . that sounds fun . thank you . i love you . "

they hug and kiss . they fix the book . they write a new story . it is about lily and her book and their adventures . they are happy . lily was a bird who loved to fly . she liked to feel the wind on her wings and see the trees and flowers below . she had many friends who flew with her , like sam the sparrow and ben the bluebird . they sang songs with their voices and played games in the sky .

one day , lily saw a big cloud . it was dark and scary . she heard a loud noise like thunder . she was afraid . she wanted to fly away , but the cloud was too fast . it caught her and made her wet and cold . she could not see her friends . she could not hear their voices . she felt alone and sad .

she cried out , " help ! help ! where are you ? " she hoped someone would hear her voice and come to her . she waited and waited , but no one came . she thought she would never fly again .

but then , she saw a bright light . it was the sun . it came out from behind the cloud and shone on her . it made her warm and dry . it made the cloud go away . she was happy . she looked around and saw her friends . they had been looking for her . they heard her voice and followed the sun . they flew to her and hugged her . they said , " lily , we are here ! we are glad you are okay ! we missed you ! "

lily smiled and said , " thank you ! i missed you too ! you are the best friends ever ! " she felt glad and safe . she flew with them and sang songs with her voice . she loved to fly . lily loved her pony very much . she named him spot because he had many spots on his fur . she liked to brush his hair and feed him carrots . spot was an adorable pony and he made lily happy .

one day , lily and spot went for a walk in the park . they saw many flowers and birds and other animals . lily saw a big slide and wanted to try it . she asked spot to wait for her at the bottom . spot nodded and watched lily climb the stairs .

lily slid down the slide very fast and felt the wind in her hair . she laughed and shouted , " whee ! " but when she reached the bottom , she saw that spot was not there . she looked around and saw him lying on the grass , not moving . she ran to him and saw that he had a cut on his leg . he was bleeding and he looked sad .

lily felt scared and sad too . she did not know what to do . she hugged spot and said , " do n't worry , spot . i will fix you . i will get help . " she looked for someone who could help her . she saw a man with a red hat and a big bag . he was a vet . he helped animals who were sick or hurt .

lily waved to the vet and called , " please , please , help me ! my pony is hurt . he needs to be fixed . " the vet heard her and came to her . he saw spot and said , " oh , poor pony . what happened to him ? " lily told him about the slide and the cut . the vet said , " do n't worry , lily . i can fix him . i have some medicine and some bandages in my bag . he will be fine soon . "

the vet took out his medicine and his bandages and cleaned spot 's cut . he put some cream on it and wrapped it with a bandage . he said , " there , that should do it . he will heal in a few days . he just needs some rest and some love . " he gave spot a pat and a treat . spot wagged his tail and licked the vet 's hand . he looked happy again .

lily thanked the vet and said , " you are very nice . you fixed my pony . he is my best friend . i love him very much . " the vet smiled and said , " you are very welcome . you are a good friend to your pony . he is very lucky to have you . he is an adorable pony . " he gave lily a hug and said goodbye .

lily hugged spot and said , " i 'm sorry , spot . i should have been more careful . i 'm glad you are fixed . you are an adorable pony . i love you very much . " spot nuzzled lily and said , " i love you too , lily . you are an adorable girl . you are my best friend . " they walked home together , happy and safe . tom and lily like to play in the park . they like to dig in the sand and look for gems . gems are shiny and pretty and make them happy .

one day , they find a big gem in the sand . it is red and sparkly and has many sides . they are very excited and want to keep it .

but then , a smelly dog comes and sniffs the gem . the dog likes the gem too . it picks up the gem in its mouth and runs away .

tom and lily are sad and angry . they chase the dog and shout , " give us back our gem ! it is ours ! "

the dog does not listen . it runs faster and faster . it goes to a pond and jumps in . the water is dirty and green .

tom and lily stop at the edge of the pond . they do not want to go in the water . it is too smelly and gross .

they see the dog swimming with the gem in its mouth . the gem is not shiny and pretty anymore . it is wet and muddy and dull .

tom and lily look at each other . they do not want the gem anymore . it is not worth it .

they turn around and walk away . they decide to look for a new gem in the sand . a gem that is not smelly and that no dog will take . sam and lily were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they found a big cooler in the garage . they opened it and saw many yummy things inside . there were juice boxes , cheese sticks , crackers , and cookies .

" wow , look at all the snacks ! " sam said . " let 's take them to the park and share with our friends . "

" ok , but we have to ask mom first , " lily said . she was a good girl who always followed the rules .

sam and lily ran to the house and asked mom if they could take the cooler to the park . mom said yes , but they had to be careful and come back soon . she also told them to split the snacks evenly with their friends .

sam and lily nodded and thanked mom . they took the cooler and went to the park . they saw their friends playing on the swings , the slide , and the sandbox . they called them over and showed them the cooler .

" wow , look at all the snacks ! " their friends said . " can we have some ? "

" sure , you can have some , " sam said . " but you have to give me something in return . "

" like what ? " their friends asked .

" like your toys , your stickers , your hats , anything you have , " sam said . he was a greedy boy who wanted more things .

lily did not like what sam was doing . she thought it was not fair to their friends . she said to sam , " no , sam , that 's not nice . we have to split the snacks evenly with our friends . that 's what mom said . we do n't need their things . we have enough . "

sam did not listen to lily . he said to her , " no , lily , you are silly . we can get more things from our friends . they want the snacks . they will give us anything we want . you can split your snacks , but i will keep mine . "

sam and lily started to argue . they pulled the cooler from each other . their friends watched them and felt sad . they did not want to trade their things for the snacks . they just wanted to play and share with sam and lily .

the cooler was too heavy for sam and lily to hold . it slipped from their hands and fell to the ground . it opened and all the snacks spilled out . some of the juice boxes burst and made a mess . some of the cheese sticks and crackers broke and got dirty . some of the cookies were eaten by a dog that ran by .

sam and lily looked at the cooler and the snacks . they felt sorry for what they had done . they had wasted the snacks and hurt their friends . they wished they had listened to mom and split the snacks evenly .

they looked at each other and said , " we 're sorry . "

they looked at their friends and said , " we 're sorry . "

their friends came closer and said , " it 's ok . we 're still friends . "

they hugged and made up . they decided to play together and have fun . they did not need the snacks or the things . they had each other . they were happy . sara and tom are friends . they like to play with toys . sara has a new toy . it is a laser . it makes red light . tom wants to play with it too .

