they take some cookies . they are yummy . they are happy . they forget about the laser . they play with other toys . they have fun . the end . tom and mia were twins who lived in a big house with their mom and dad . they were very wealthy , which means they had a lot of toys , clothes , and food . sometimes they got bored of playing with their toys , so they liked to wander around the house and explore .

one day , they found a big map on the wall in their dad 's office . it showed many different places and colors . tom pointed at a red place and asked , " what is this ? "

mia looked at the word under the red place and tried to read it . " it says ... nation . i think it means a big land where many people live . "

tom nodded and said , " do you think they have toys and food like us ? "

mia shrugged and said , " i do n't know . maybe they have different toys and food . maybe they have more or less . maybe they are happy or sad . "

tom and mia wondered about the other nations on the map . they wanted to see them and learn more about them . they decided to ask their mom and dad if they could travel to some of them someday . they hoped they would meet new friends and have fun . anna liked to sing songs . she had a toy microphone that she got for her birthday . she sang songs with her microphone every day . she sang happy songs , sad songs , silly songs , and loud songs .

one day , anna had a new friend come to play . his name was ben . ben liked to play with cars and trucks . he had a big truck that he brought with him . anna wanted to show ben her microphone . she said , " ben , this is my microphone . i sing songs with it . do you want to sing with me ? "

ben was shy . he did not like to sing . he said , " no , thank you . i like to play with my truck . can i show you my truck ? "

