ben laughed . he thought anna 's microphone was funny . he said , " that is a funny microphone . can i try it ? "

anna said , " sure . you can try it . here , you hold it . and i will hold your truck . what do you want to say with the microphone ? "

ben thought for a moment . then he said , " hello , i am ben . i like to play with cars and trucks . and i like to make new friends . like anna . "

anna smiled . she said , " that was a good thing to say , ben . you are a good friend . and you have a good voice . do you want to sing a song with me now ? "

ben said , " ok . i will sing a song with you . but only a short one . and then we can play with your microphone and my truck some more . "

anna said , " ok . that sounds good . let 's sing a song about friends . friends are the best . "

and they sang a song about friends . and they played with the microphone and the truck . and they had a lot of fun . tim and lily were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they saw a lot of fog in the air . they wanted to see what was in the fog , so they ran into it . they did not listen to their mom , who told them to stay close to the house .

as they ran , they got lost in the fog . they could not see each other or the house . they were scared and cold . they called for their mom , but she could not hear them . they tried to find their way back , but they only got deeper into the fog .

suddenly , they heard a loud roar . it was an enormous bear , who lived in the woods . the bear smelled the twins and wanted to eat them . the twins screamed and ran , but the bear was faster . the bear caught them and bit them . they felt a lot of pain and then they stopped feeling anything . the bear ate them and left their bones in the fog .

the fog cleared and their mom came looking for them . she saw the bones and knew what happened . she cried and cried . she wished she had made them listen to her . she was very sad and lonely . she never played outside again . ben and mia are friends . they like to play in the park . they have a big red ball . they kick the ball to each other . they have fun .

one day , a big dog comes to the park . the dog sees the ball . the dog runs to the ball . the dog grabs the ball with his teeth . the dog runs away with the ball .

" hey , that 's our ball ! " ben shouts . " give it back ! "

mia is scared of the dog . she hides behind a tree . she says , " ben , be careful . the dog is tough . he might bite you . "

ben is brave . he runs after the dog . he says , " no , i want our ball . the ball is ours . "

the dog runs to a fence . the dog tries to jump over the fence . but the ball is too big . the ball gets stuck in the fence . the dog ca n't get the ball out .

ben sees the ball . he says , " ha , i got you . i will rescue our ball . "

ben reaches for the ball . but the dog is angry . the dog barks at ben . the dog tries to bite ben .

ben is scared . he says , " help , help . the dog is mean . he wants to hurt me . "

mia hears ben . she says , " i have to help ben . he is my friend . "

mia finds a stick . she runs to the fence . she says , " go away , dog . leave ben alone . "

mia waves the stick at the dog . the dog is afraid of the stick . the dog runs away .

ben is happy . he says , " thank you , mia . you are tough . you saved me . "

mia is happy . she says , " you 're welcome , ben . you are brave . you rescued our ball . "

ben and mia hug . they take their ball . they go back to the park . they kick the ball to each other . they have fun . they are friends . the end . lily and ben were friends who liked to play in the park . they liked to write their names on the ground with pebbles . they found many pebbles of different colors and shapes .

one day , they met a new boy in the park . his name was sam . sam was deaf . he could not hear what lily and ben said . he used his hands to talk . lily and ben did not know how to talk with their hands . they felt shy and curious .

sam saw lily and ben writing with pebbles . he smiled and joined them . he picked up a pebble and wrote his name on the ground . he pointed to his name and then to himself . lily and ben understood . they pointed to their names and then to themselves . they smiled back .

lily and ben learned some words with their hands from sam . sam learned some words with his mouth from lily and ben . they had fun playing and writing with pebbles . they became friends .

the moral of the story is : you can make friends with anyone , even if they are different from you . you can learn from each other and have fun together . tommy loves hockey . he has a hockey stick and a ball . he plays hockey in the yard with his dad . sometimes , his dad lets him wear a helmet and gloves . tommy feels like a big hockey star .

one day , tommy sees an enormous bird in the sky . it is black and white and has a long neck . tommy thinks it is a hockey bird . he wants to play hockey with it . he runs inside and gets some bread . he breaks the bread into small pieces and puts them in his pocket .

he goes back outside and calls the bird . " hey , hockey bird ! come here ! i have something for you ! " tommy waves his hockey stick and throws some bread on the ground . the bird sees the bread and flies down . it lands near tommy and eats the bread . tommy is happy . he thinks the bird likes him .

" can you play hockey with me , hockey bird ? " tommy asks . he gives the bird his ball and taps it with his stick . the bird looks at the ball and pecks it . it makes a loud honk . tommy laughs . he thinks the bird is funny .

the bird honks again and flaps its wings . it picks up the ball in its beak and flies away . tommy is sad . he wants his ball back . he runs after the bird and shouts . " hey , hockey bird ! give me my ball ! that 's not fair ! "

but the bird does not listen . it flies higher and higher until tommy can not see it anymore . tommy stops and cries . he lost his ball and his hockey friend . he wishes the bird would come back .

his dad sees him and comes over . he hugs tommy and wipes his tears . he says , " do n't worry , tommy . that was not a hockey bird . that was a goose . geese are not good at playing hockey . they are good at flying and swimming . maybe it will bring your ball back someday . but for now , i have a surprise for you . "

he takes tommy inside and shows him a new hockey ball . it is red and shiny and has a star on it . tommy smiles . he likes his new ball . he says , " thank you , dad . you are the best . can we play hockey now ? "

his dad nods and smiles . he says , " of course , tommy . let 's go . but first , let 's feed the cat . she is hungry too . " he gives tommy some cat food and a bowl . tommy feeds the cat and pets her . she purrs and rubs against him . tommy thinks she is nice .

he grabs his hockey stick and his new ball and runs outside with his dad . they play hockey in the yard until it gets dark . tommy has fun . he forgets about the goose and the old ball . he thinks hockey is the best game ever . tim and mia are adventurous kids . they like to explore new things and have fun . one day , they find a big tube in the backyard . it is shiny and long and has a hole at each end .

" wow , look at this tube ! " tim says . " i wonder what it is for . "

" maybe it is a tunnel to another place , " mia says . " let 's go inside and see . "

they crawl into the tube and see the light at the other end . they hear a loud noise and feel the tube shake .

" uh - oh , what is that ? " tim asks .

" it sounds like a truck , " mia says . " maybe the tube is part of the truck . "

they peek out of the hole and see a big truck parked next to the tube . a man is walking towards them with a tool in his hand .

" hey , you kids , get out of there ! " the man shouts . " this is not a toy , this is a pipe . i need to remove it and take it away . "

tim and mia are scared . they quickly crawl out of the tube and run to their house .

" sorry , mister , we did n't know , " tim says .

" we just wanted to see what it was , " mia says .

the man is angry , but he sees that they are just curious kids . he calms down and explains to them that the tube is a pipe that carries water to the houses . he tells them that it is broken and he has to replace it with a new one .

" oh , i see , " tim says . " that is important . "

" yes , it is , " the man says . " but it is also dangerous to play with pipes . they can be hot or cold or have sharp edges . you could get hurt or cause a leak . next time , be more careful and ask before you touch something that does n't belong to you . "

" ok , we will , " mia says . " thank you for telling us . "

the man nods and smiles . he goes back to his work and removes the tube . tim and mia watch him from a safe distance . they learned something new today , but they also learned to be more respectful and cautious . they are still adventurous , but they are also smarter . sara and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . there is a bridge in the park . the bridge goes over a stream . sara and ben like to cross the bridge and look at the water .

one day , sara sees a duck in the stream . the duck is yellow and fluffy . sara thinks the duck is cute . she wants to pet the duck . she says to ben , " look , a cute duck ! let 's go and say hello ! "

ben is not sure . he says , " but the duck might bite us . or it might swim away . maybe we should just watch from the bridge . "

sara insists . she says , " no , no , no . the duck is friendly . it wants to play with us . come on , ben , do n't be scared . follow me ! "

sara runs down the bridge and towards the duck . ben follows her , but he is nervous . he hopes the duck is nice .

the duck sees sara and ben . it quacks and wags its tail . it swims closer to them . sara and ben smile . they reach out their hands and touch the duck 's soft feathers . the duck likes it . it nibbles their fingers gently . sara and ben giggle . they make friends with the duck . they are happy . they forget about the bridge . ben and lily like to play with their toys . they have many toys , but their favorite is the big red automobile . they pretend to drive it around the house and make loud noises .

one day , they find a big box in the garage . they open it and see a lot of old things . they see books , clothes , and pictures . they also see a small blue automobile . it looks like their big red automobile , but much smaller .

" look , lily , a baby automobile ! " ben says . he picks it up and shows it to lily .

" wow , it is so cute ! " lily says . she wants to play with it too . she reaches for it , but ben pulls it away .

" no , it is mine ! " ben says . he holds it tight and runs away .

lily is sad . she wants to share the automobile with ben . she follows him and tries to catch him . they run around the house , but ben is faster .

they come to the bathroom . ben sees the bathtub . it is full of water . he has an idea . he throws the small blue automobile into the water .

" ha ha , now you ca n't have it ! " ben says . he laughs and runs away .

lily is shocked . she runs to the bathtub and looks for the automobile . she sees it sinking to the bottom . the water is deep and dark . she ca n't reach it .

she starts to cry . she likes the small blue automobile . she wants to save it . she calls for ben .

" ben , ben , help me ! the automobile is in the water ! " lily says .

ben hears lily . he feels bad . he knows he was mean to her . he runs back to the bathroom . he sees lily crying and the automobile in the water .

he is sorry . he hugs lily and says , " i 'm sorry , lily . i was wrong . i should have shared the automobile with you . let me get it for you . "

he rolls up his sleeves and puts his arm in the water . he feels for the automobile . he finds it and pulls it out . it is wet and dirty .

he gives it to lily and says , " here , lily . you can have it . it is yours . "

lily smiles and says , " thank you , ben . you are a good brother . i love you . "

they hug and say sorry to each other . they dry the automobile with a towel . they decide to play with it together . they are happy . lily and ben are twins . they like to play with paper . they can fold paper into many shapes . they can make hats , boats , planes and animals .

one day , they decide to make a city with paper . they fold paper into houses , shops , cars and trees . they put them on a big mat . they pretend to be people in the city . they talk to each other .

" hello , i am lily . i live in this house . it is pink and blue . it has a door and a window . do you want to come in ? " lily says .

" hello , i am ben . i live in that house . it is yellow and green . it has a roof and a chimney . yes , i want to come in . thank you ! " ben says .

they go into each other 's houses . they look around . they see paper furniture , toys and pictures . they think they are adorable . they smile and hug .

they play in the city for a long time . they have fun . they are happy . they love paper . they love each other . sara was playing with her doll in the garden . she liked to pretend that her doll was a doctor and she was a patient . she put a bandage on her doll 's arm and said , " there , you are all better now . "

but then , she heard a loud meow from the fence . it was a black cat with a white spot on its nose . the cat looked hungry and scared . sara liked cats , so she ran to the fence and said , " hello , kitty . do you want to play with me and my doll ? "

the cat meowed again and jumped over the fence . it ran to sara and rubbed its head on her leg . sara smiled and picked up the cat . she said , " you are so soft and cute . what is your name ? "

the cat did not answer , but it licked sara 's face . sara giggled and said , " i will call you spot . do you want some milk and cookies ? "

the cat nodded and purred . sara said , " ok , let 's go to the kitchen . but first , we have to ask mommy . "

sara carried the cat to the house and knocked on the door . mommy opened the door and saw sara and the cat . she said , " sara , who is this ? "

sara said , " this is spot , mommy . he is a hungry cat . can we give him some milk and cookies , please ? "

mommy looked at the cat and said , " he is a very pretty cat , sara . but he is not our cat . he belongs to someone else . we ca n't keep him . "

sara felt sad and said , " but mommy , he likes me and my doll . he needs a bandage , too . he has a scratch on his ear . can we keep him for a little while , please ? "

mommy shook her head and said , " no , sara . we ca n't keep him . he might have a family who is looking for him . we have to find his owner and return him . that is the right thing to do . "

sara did not want to let go of the cat . she said , " no , mommy . he is my cat . i want to keep him . he is my friend . "

sara started to cry and demand , " please , mommy . please , please , please . "

mommy sighed and said , " sara , stop crying and demanding . you have to be a good girl and share . we can give the cat some milk and cookies , but then we have to look for his owner . maybe we can find another cat for you later . ok ? "

sara sniffed and said , " ok , mommy . but can i play with him for a little while ? "

mommy nodded and said , " yes , you can play with him for a little while . but then you have to say goodbye . "

sara hugged the cat and said , " thank you , mommy . you are the best mommy ever . "

mommy smiled and said , " you are welcome , sara . you are the best sara ever . " ben liked to watch cartoons on tv . he liked the funny animals and the bright colors . he had a favorite cartoon about a dog and a cat who were friends . he watched it every day after lunch .

