lily understands . she does not want to hurt the bee or make it sting her . she says , " okay , mom . i will not touch the bee . i will just watch it . " she watches the bee fly from flower to flower . she sees how the bee lands on the petals and sticks out its tongue . she sees how the bee carries pollen on its legs . she learns a lot about the bee .

lily is happy . she likes the bee and the flowers . she says , " thank you , mom , for taking me to the park . i learned a lot today . " her mom smiles and hugs her . she says , " you 're welcome , lily . i 'm glad you had fun . learning is fun . " they go home and have honey on toast . lily was a little girl who loved to dance . she danced every day in her room , in the garden , and in the park . she wanted to be a graceful dancer like the ones she saw on tv .

