but lily did not know that oil was slippery . when she danced in her room , she slipped on the oil and fell down . she hit her head on the floor and started to cry . her mom heard her and ran to her room . she saw lily on the floor , with oil on her hair and clothes .

she hugged lily and asked her what happened . lily told her about the dance show and the oil . her mom said , " lily , you do n't need oil to be a graceful dancer . you need to be yourself and have fun . oil can make you fall and hurt yourself . it can also make a mess and waste money . the best dancers are not the ones who look shiny , but the ones who dance with their hearts . "

lily realized that her mom was right . she said sorry for making a mess and wasting money . she said she would not use oil anymore . she said she would dance with her heart and have fun . her mom smiled and said she was proud of her . she said they would still go to the dance show , but only to watch and enjoy , not to copy and compare .

lily learned a lesson that day . she learned that oil was not good for dancing . she learned that being graceful was not about looking shiny , but about being yourself and having fun . she learned that dancing with her heart was the best way to dance . one day , anna and ben went to the park with their mom . they saw a big tree with many fruits on it . they wanted to pick some fruits to eat .

