they smiled . they hugged . they became friends . they took turns to ride the leaf boat . they had fun . they learned to share . they learned to be nice . the park keeper was happy . he watched them play . he smiled too . tim and mia like to play with their kayak . it is a big toy boat that they can sit in and paddle on the water . they have a lot of fun with their kayak , but they also have to take care of it .

one day , they want to play with their kayak in the lake . they ask their mom if they can go . she says yes , but they have to be careful and wear their life jackets . she also tells them to shut the door when they leave the house , so the cat does not run out .

