they go to the man who gives them food and drinks . tom orders popcorn . sam orders water and a fruit . they pay with their money . they go to their seats . they share their food and drinks . they watch the movie . they have fun . they are happy . lily was a little girl who liked to draw . she had many crayons and papers to make pictures . one day , she wanted to draw an angel . she took a white crayon and a blue paper . she drew a big circle for the head , two small circles for the eyes , a line for the mouth , and a triangle for the nose . then she drew a long oval for the body , two sticks for the legs , and two curves for the arms . she was happy with her angel , but she forgot something . she needed to draw the wings .

