they finished the book and hugged mom . they thanked her for the surprise and the story . they told her they loved her and the book . mom kissed them and told them she loved them too . she said they could read the book again tomorrow . they were happy and sleepy . they put the book back in the bag and went to bed . they dreamed of the loud lion and the brave mouse . tim and jen were twins who liked to play outside . one day , they found a big hill of dirt and rocks . they wanted to climb it and see what was on the other side .

