they put on their hats and boots and started to march up the hill . they felt the texture of the dirt and the rocks with their hands and feet . it was rough and hard and sticky . they liked it .

they marched and marched until they reached the top of the hill . they looked around and saw a big pond with ducks and frogs . they also saw a sign that said " no trespassing " .

" wow , look at the pond , tim ! " jen said . " can we go and see the ducks and frogs ? "

