they looked at each other and said , " that was not fun ! "

they decided to go home and tell their mom what happened . they hoped she would not be mad at them . they learned their lesson . they would not trespass again . anna liked to bounce . she bounced on her bed , on the sofa , on the ball . she bounced everywhere . she was happy when she bounced .

