anna felt angry . she did not care if the boy was popular . she did not want to be his friend . she wanted to bounce . she said , " you are not nice . you are not the king of anything . you are selfish . you ca n't have the bounce house all to yourself . it is for everyone . i will bounce here . you ca n't stop me . "

