he went inside the bounce house . he bounced with anna and the others . he apologized and made friends . he learned a lesson . he was happy when he bounced . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to slide on the big slide . it was fun and fast . they took turns to go down the slide and then ran back to the top .

