they set up the tent in their room . they move some of their toys and books inside . they close the curtain . they make the room dark . they turn on a flashlight . they crawl inside the tent . they have fun . they play for a long time . lily was eager to go to the park with her mom . she put on her new skirt that had flowers on it . she liked how it spun when she twirled . she ran to the door and asked , " mom , can we go now ? "

