they hold hands . they walk away . they find a new game . they play happily . they are friends . the end . ben loves his chicken . he got it from his grandpa when it was a tiny egg . he kept it warm and safe in a box until it cracked and a fluffy chick came out . he named it fluffy and fed it seeds and water every day .

fluffy likes ben too . she follows him around the yard and pecks at his shoes . she likes to cuddle with him and sleep on his lap . she makes soft noises that make ben happy . she is his best friend .

every day , fluffy grows a little bigger . she gets more feathers and a longer tail . she learns to run and flap her wings . she can even fly a little bit . ben is proud of her and shows her to his mom and dad . they say she is a perfect chicken .

one day , fluffy lays an egg . ben is surprised and excited . he runs to tell his grandpa . grandpa smiles and hugs him . he says fluffy is a good chicken and ben is a good chicken keeper . he says ben can keep the egg and see what happens .

ben takes the egg and puts it in a box like he did with fluffy . he hopes it will hatch and he will have another chicken friend . he thinks fluffy will be a good mom and teach the new chick how to be a perfect chicken too . he ca n't wait to see . lily and ben were playing in the garden . they liked to look at the flowers and the bugs . they saw a big red flower that was very pretty . lily wanted to smell it .

