sam and mia nod . they still do not like the doctor , but they like ice cream . they decide to be brave and let the doctor check their lungs . they hope their lungs are regular and healthy . they hope they can go home soon and play with their toys and run in the park . sara was a little girl who loved to play dress - up . she had many hats and dresses and shoes in her closet . she liked to pretend she was a queen and rule over her stuffed animals . she had a crown made of paper and glitter that she wore on her head .

one day , her mom told her they were going to visit her grandma . sara was excited because she loved her grandma very much . she wanted to show her grandma her crown and play queen with her . she packed her crown and some of her favorite dresses in a bag and got ready to go .

when they arrived at grandma 's house , sara ran to hug her . grandma smiled and hugged her back . she said , " hello , my sweet sara . how are you today ? " sara said , " i 'm good , grandma . i brought something for you . look ! " she opened her bag and took out her crown . she put it on grandma 's head and said , " you are the queen , grandma . and i am your princess . we can play together and have fun . "

grandma looked at the crown and laughed . she said , " thank you , sara . this is a very beautiful crown . you are very kind and creative . i 'm grateful for you . " she kissed sara on the cheek and said , " let 's go to the garden and play . i have some flowers and cookies for you . "

sara and grandma had a wonderful time playing queen and princess in the garden . they picked flowers , ate cookies , and told stories . sara felt happy and loved . she thanked grandma for the flowers and cookies and for being the best grandma ever . grandma thanked sara for the crown and for being the best princess ever . they hugged and smiled . they were both grateful for each other . anna likes to paint . she has many colors and brushes . she paints on paper , on walls , on rocks , on anything . she likes to make shapes and animals and flowers . she paints with joy .

