they finish their painting and singing . they look at their work and clap . they hug each other and say thank you . they are friends . they go home with their parents , who are proud of them . they promise to paint and sing together again . they have fun . lily was a little girl who loved to play with her ball . she liked to kick it high in the air and catch it with her hands . she also liked to kick it to her dog , max , who would run after it and bring it back to her . they had a lot of fun together .

one day , lily 's mom told her that they had to go to the store . lily did not want to go . she wanted to stay and play with her ball and max . she said , " no , mom , i want to stay ! " but her mom said , " sorry , lily , we have to go . you can play later . come on , let 's go . "

