her mom was very angry . she said , " lily , that is enough . you are being very bad . we are going home right now . you are in big trouble . you can not play with your ball or max for the rest of the day . you have to go to your room and think about what you did . "

lily was very sad . she did not want to go home . she did not want to go to her room . she wanted to play with her ball and max . she realized that she had made a big mistake . she wished she had listened to her mom and been good . she felt miserable . lily and max were playing in the park . they liked to go on the swings and slide . they also liked to chase each other and pretend to be animals . lily was a lion and max was a zebra .

