they hugged again and decided to play something else . they did not want to scream or hurt each other . they wanted to have fun and be happy . lily was restless . she did not want to play with her toys or read her books . she wanted to do something new and fun . she saw her mom cook in the kitchen . she smelled the yummy food and heard the pots and pans make noise . she wanted to cook too .

