they listen to their mom and feel better . they snuggle with her and each other . they are not scared anymore . they are a little bit jolly again . they wait for the storm to end and the sun to shine . they hope to race with their wagon again tomorrow . anna was a very intelligent girl . she liked to learn new things and ask questions . she had many books and toys in her room . she also had a big map on the wall . she wanted to see the world and make friends .

one day , anna went to the park with her mom . she saw a group of children playing with a ball . she wanted to join them , but she was shy . she did not know their names or how to talk to them . she sat on a bench and watched them .

then , she heard a voice . " hi , i 'm leo . what 's your name ? " she turned and saw a boy with curly hair and a friendly smile . he was holding a book . she recognized the book . it was one of her favorites . it was about animals and their habitats .

