they sat on the bench and started the game . they took turns saying different animals and learning from each other . they laughed and had a good time . they forgot about the ball and the other children . they found a new friend . tim and mia liked to play in the garage with their dad 's tools . they pretended to fix cars and bikes and make noises like engines . one day , they found a big hammer that was shiny and heavy . tim wanted to try it , but mia said it was too big for him .

" let me have it , mia . i can use it . i am strong , " tim said .

" no , tim . it is dad 's hammer . he needs it for work . he is dependable . he fixes things for people . you might break it or hurt yourself , " mia said .

but tim did not listen . he grabbed the hammer from mia and swung it in the air . he felt powerful and happy . he tried to hit a nail on the wall , but he missed . the hammer slipped from his hand and flew across the garage . it hit a glass jar that was on a shelf . the jar broke and dropped to the floor . it made a loud crash and a mess .

tim and mia were scared . they heard their dad coming from the house . he looked angry and worried . he saw the broken jar and the hammer on the floor . he saw tim and mia hiding behind a box .

" what happened here ? who did this ? " he asked .

