sara and ben hugged mom and ate their pizza . they were very happy . they did not mind the delay , because the pizza was perfect . lily liked to feed the ducks at the pond . she had a bag of bread and a big smile . she walked with her mom and dad to the water . she saw many ducks swimming and quacking .

