they invited ben to join them on the water . they shared their surfs and had fun . they learned how to surf and how to be kind . they were happy . lily liked to play with her doll , ann . she took ann everywhere with her . she brushed her hair , gave her tea , and sang to her . lily loved ann very much .

one day , lily went to the park with her mom . she saw a big well with a bucket and a rope . she wondered what was inside the well . she asked her mom if she could borrow a coin to throw in the well and make a wish . her mom said yes and gave her a coin .

