but then , something terrible happened . the coin hit the bucket and made it swing . the bucket knocked ann out of lily 's arms and into the well . lily screamed and cried . she had lost her doll . she was very worried and sad .

her mom heard her and ran to the well . she saw what had happened and hugged lily . she told her not to worry . she said they would find a way to get ann back . she said they would need some help . she said they would go and look for a friendly farmer who had a long rope and a hook . she said they would come back to the well and try to fish out ann . she said they would not give up until they found her . she said she was sorry for lily 's loss . she said she loved her very much . lily liked to go to the lake with her dad . he was a fisherman and he taught her how to catch fish . lily loved to see the fish splash and wiggle on the hook . she always let them go back to the water after she looked at them .

one day , they went to the lake when the sky was dark and the wind was strong . the water was rough and made big waves . lily 's dad said they had to be careful and stay close to the shore . he gave lily a small rod and a worm and told her to wait for a fish to bite .

lily waited and waited , but no fish came . she was bored and cold . she saw a big rock near the water and thought it would be fun to climb on it . she left her rod on the ground and ran to the rock . she did not tell her dad .

she climbed on the rock and looked at the lake . she saw a big fish jump out of the water . it was shiny and had a long nose . lily wanted to catch it . she reached out her hand and tried to grab it . but the fish was too fast and too far . lily lost her balance and fell off the rock .

she screamed as she hit the water . it was cold and deep . she could not swim . she felt the fish touch her leg and she screamed again . she was scared and wet .

