her dad looked at the lake and saw the big fish . it was a pike , a fish with sharp teeth . he realized how lucky they were . he said , " lily , that fish was not a good fish . it was a bad fish . it could have hurt you . you have to be careful and not touch it . you have to be happy with the small fish . they are nice and gentle . "

