they go home . they tell their parents what happened . their parents are proud . they say they did a good thing . they say they are good friends . tom and jen are friends . they like to travel and see new things . one day , they find a big box in the park . the box is cheap . it has holes and dirt on it . but tom and jen think it is fun . they say , " this is our car . we can travel in it . "

