they pull the box to the tree . they climb inside the box . they pretend they are in a car . they say , " we are traveling to the zoo . we will see lions and monkeys and bears . " they make noises like animals . they laugh and have fun . they forget about the truck and the road . they are happy under their roof . lily was a new girl in the preschool . she felt shy and scared . she did not know anyone . she saw a boy playing with blocks . he had brown hair and a red shirt . she wanted to play with him , but she did not know how to say hello .

the teacher saw lily standing alone . she was a compassionate teacher . she wanted to help lily make friends . she walked over to lily and smiled .

