lily and ben nodded . they put away the blocks and sat down with the other children . they listened to miss amy 's story . they learned that even a big lion can need help from a small mouse . they learned that it is good to be compassionate and help others . they liked the story . they liked miss amy . they liked preschool . they were happy . lily and sam are twins . they like to play outside in winter . they make snowmen and snowballs and slide on the ice . but today it is too cold and wet . it is not snowing , it is pouring . the rain makes the snow melt and the ice slippery .

