they hold hands and run to the backyard . they pour water from their buckets and make rivers and lakes . they find pine cones and rocks and sticks and make animals and plants and treasures . they whisper and giggle and have fun . they forget about the cold and the wet . they are happy .

mommy watches them from the window . she smiles and shakes her head . she knows they are having fun . she knows they are safe . she knows they will come inside soon . she pours hot cocoa and waits for them . she loves her twins . anna and ben were twins who liked to play in the garden . they had a big sandbox where they could dig and make castles . one day , they found a shiny metal thing in the sand . it looked like a door with a handle .

