they walked for a long time in the dark . they saw pipes and wires and machines . they heard strange noises and smelled bad things .

" this is not fun , this is scary , " anna said . " i want to go back . "

" me too , " ben said . " but i do n't know how . we are lost . "

they started to cry . they wished they had not opened the door . they regretted being curious .

they heard footsteps and saw a light . a man came towards them . he wore a helmet and a uniform . he looked angry .

" who are you and what are you doing here ? " he asked .

