the man sighed . he was not angry , he was worried .

" you are very lucky i found you , " he said . " this is a dangerous place . it 's not for children . it 's for workers who fix the water and the electricity . you could have been hurt or trapped . come with me , i 'll take you back to the door . "

he took them by the hand and led them up the stairs . he closed the door behind them and locked it .

" next time , do n't touch things that are not yours , " he said . " and keep your garden tidy . you never know what you might find . "

anna and ben nodded . they thanked the man and ran back to their house . they hugged their mom and dad and told them what happened . they were happy to be safe and warm . they learned their lesson . they never opened the door again . tom and lily were best friends . they liked to play outside in the sun . they had many toys , but their favorite was a big red ball . they liked to bounce it , roll it , and kick it .

one day , a new boy came to their street . his name was max . he saw tom and lily playing with the ball and wanted to join them . he asked them , " can i play with you ? can you lend me the ball ? "

