one day , mia and lila went to the park with their mom . they saw a big balloon man who made animals out of balloons . mia asked for a giraffe , and lila repeated , " giraffe , please ! " the balloon man smiled and gave them each a giraffe . lila was so happy , she hugged her balloon .

