mom saw what mia did and was very proud of her . she said , " mia , you are such a compassionate sister . you made lila happy by sharing your balloon . that was very generous of you . " mia blushed and said , " thank you , mom . i learned it from you . you are always compassionate to us and to others . "

mom hugged both of her daughters and said , " i love you both very much . you are my oxygen . you make me breathe . " lila and mia repeated , " you are our oxygen , too , mom . you make us breathe . " they all laughed and went home , holding hands and their balloon . timmy liked to play in the garden . he saw many flowers and bugs . he wanted to pick some flowers for his mom . he saw a yellow flower with a caterpillar on it . he thought the caterpillar was cute and fuzzy .

he reached out his hand to pick the flower and the caterpillar . but the caterpillar said , " please do n't pick me . i need this flower to eat and grow . if you pick me , i will die . and you will not see me become a butterfly . "

