one day , lily and sam wanted to paint shapes . they had a book with shapes . there was a circle , a square , a triangle , and a star . lily and sam tried to paint the shapes on their paper . lily painted a circle . it was round and yellow . sam painted a square . it was flat and blue . they showed each other their shapes .

