they feel sorry for what they did . they wish they had played with something else . they hope their dad will not be too angry . they hope they can still be friends . they hope they can still play together . but not with toy guns . not inside the house . not near the ceiling . lily and ben were playing in the living room . they liked to pretend they were pirates and explore the sofa , the table and the chair . the chair was big and brown and had a soft cushion . lily climbed on the chair and pretended it was a ship . she said , " ahoy , matey ! i am the captain of this ship . do you see any treasure ? "

