they decided to stop playing with crayons and draw on paper instead . they also drank some water and ate some cookies . they learned their lesson and never drew on the ceiling again . one day , ben and his mom went to the zoo . ben loved to see the animals , but his favorite was the tiger . he wanted to carry a toy tiger with him , but his mom said no . she said the toy was too big and heavy , and he might lose it or drop it .

