tim looks for sam in the fog . he hears a noise behind a tree . he thinks it is sam . he runs to the tree and points his toy gun . " bang ! bang ! i got you , sam ! " he shouts .

but it is not sam . it is a little dog . the dog is scared . it barks and runs away .

" oops ! sorry , doggy ! " tim says . he feels bad . he did not mean to shoot the dog .

" tim , where are you ? " sam calls . he comes out of his hiding place . he sees tim and the dog .

" what happened ? " sam asks .

" i thought you were behind the tree , but it was a dog . i shot the dog by mistake . it was not fun , " tim says .

" i 'm sorry , tim . that was not a good hiding place . the dog was there first . are you ok ? " sam says .

" i 'm ok , but i do n't want to play with toy guns anymore . they are not nice . let 's play something else , " tim says .

" ok , tim . let 's play catch . that is fun and nice . and let 's say sorry to the dog if we see it again , " sam says .

they put away their toy guns and take out a ball . they play catch in the fog . they have fun and are nice . they are good friends . tom and lily were playing in the park . it was a sunny day and they liked to run and slide and swing . tom had a pair of sunglasses that he found in his mom 's car . he put them on and said , " look at me , i 'm cool ! "

lily wanted to try the sunglasses too . she asked tom , " can i use your sunglasses , please ? " tom said , " no , they are mine . you ca n't have them . " lily felt sad and angry . she said , " that 's not fair . you should share . "

tom did not want to share . he ran away from lily and went to the sandbox . he saw a big pile of sand and decided to bury his sunglasses there . he thought , " this way , lily ca n't find them and i can keep them for myself . "

but he did not know that a dog was watching him . the dog liked to dig and sniff and chew . he saw tom hiding something in the sand and thought , " what is that ? maybe it 's a bone or a toy . i want to see . "

as soon as tom left the sandbox , the dog ran to the spot where he buried his sunglasses . he dug them out and put them in his mouth . he thought , " this is not a bone or a toy . this is hard and shiny and tastes bad . but i like it anyway . "

tom came back to the sandbox and looked for his sunglasses . he could not find them . he felt scared and sad . he said , " where are my sunglasses ? i need them . they are mine . "

lily saw tom crying and felt sorry for him . she said , " what 's wrong , tom ? did you lose your sunglasses ? " tom said , " yes , i did . i hid them in the sand and now they are gone . someone took them . "

lily looked around and saw the dog . the dog was wearing the sunglasses and wagging his tail . he looked happy and cool . lily said , " look , tom . there is your sunglasses . the dog has them . he likes them too . "

tom saw the dog and felt angry and silly . he said , " hey , that 's my sunglasses . give them back , dog . they are not for you . " he tried to get the sunglasses from the dog , but the dog ran away and barked .

lily said , " tom , do n't be mad . the dog is just playing . maybe you can find another pair of sunglasses . there are many available in the store . or you can ask your mom to buy you one . or you can share with me . i have a pair of sunglasses too . they are pink and pretty . do you want to try them ? "

tom looked at lily and her sunglasses . he felt sorry and grateful . he said , " thank you , lily . you are very nice . i 'm sorry i was mean to you . can i use your sunglasses , please ? " lily said , " sure , tom . you can use them . but only if you promise to share with me next time . " tom said , " i promise . let 's be friends . " they hugged and smiled and put on the sunglasses . they looked cool and happy . the end . tom and jen were brother and sister . they liked to go on vacation with mom and dad . they packed their bags and got in the car . they were going to the beach .

" are we there yet ? " tom asked . he was impatient . he wanted to see the water and the sand .

" not yet , honey . we have to drive for a long time , " mom said .

jen was bored too . she looked out the window and saw cows and trees . she wanted to see fish and shells . she sighed .

" can we play a game ? " jen asked .

" sure , what game do you want to play ? " dad asked .

" i spy with my little eye something that is green , " jen said .

" is it a tree ? " tom guessed .

" no , " jen said .

" is it a grass ? " tom guessed .

" no , " jen said .

" is it a frog ? " tom guessed .

" no , " jen said .

" then what is it ? " tom asked .

" it is a traffic light , " jen said .

tom was angry . he thought jen was cheating . he said jen was not fair . he said jen was a liar . he said jen was a meanie .

jen was hurt . she said tom was rude . she said tom was a baby . she said tom was a crybaby .

they started to yell at each other . they did not listen to mom and dad . they did not stop fighting .

mom and dad were sad . they said tom and jen were naughty . they said tom and jen were spoiling the vacation . they said tom and jen had to be quiet .

but tom and jen did not care . they kept on arguing . they did not see the big truck that was coming . they did not hear the horn that was honking . they did not feel the crash that was happening .

the car was hit by the truck . the car was smashed . the car was broken . the car was on fire .

tom and jen were hurt . they were bleeding . they were crying . they were scared .

mom and dad were hurt too . they were trapped . they were burning . they were dying .

nobody came to help them . nobody could save them . nobody could lead them to safety .

they did not go to the beach . they did not have fun . they did not have a vacation .

they had a bad ending . tom and lily were playing in the garden . they liked to dig and water the plants . they saw a big red tomato on a vine . tom wanted to pick it and eat it .

" look , lily , a tomato ! let 's get it ! " tom said .

" no , tom , we ca n't . mom said we have to wait until they are ripe . this one is not ready yet . " lily said .

" but i 'm hungry . and it looks so good . just one bite . " tom said . he reached for the tomato .

lily pushed him away . " stop , tom , you 'll hurt the plant . and mom will be mad . you have to wait . "

tom pushed her back . " no , you stop . you 're not the boss of me . i want the tomato . " he grabbed the tomato and pulled .

lily pulled too . " give it back , tom . you 're being mean . it 's not fair . " she cried .

they pulled and pulled . the tomato was strong . it did not come off . but the vine was not . it snapped . the tomato fell to the ground . it splashed and broke .

tom and lily stopped . they looked at the tomato . they looked at each other . they felt bad . they had ruined the tomato . and the plant . and mom 's work .

they heard mom coming . she saw the tomato . she saw the vine . she saw their faces . she was not happy .

" what happened here ? " mom asked .

tom and lily hung their heads . they did not know what to say . they were sorry .

mom sighed . she picked up the tomato . she picked up the vine . she said , " this was an impressive tomato . it was big and red and juicy . it would have been delicious . but you were not patient . you were not careful . you were not kind . you pushed and pulled and fought . and you wasted the tomato . and you hurt the plant . and you made me sad . "

tom and lily felt worse . they said , " we 're sorry , mom . we were wrong . we wo n't do it again . can we fix it ? "

mom said , " you ca n't fix the tomato . or the vine . but you can fix your behavior . you can say sorry to each other . and you can help me with the other plants . and you can learn to share and wait and respect . do you understand ? "

tom and lily nodded . they said sorry to each other . they hugged . they helped mom with the other plants . they learned their lesson . they did not fight over tomatoes anymore . anna and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . they have a yellow ball . they throw the ball to each other and laugh .

one day , a big boy comes to the park . he sees the yellow ball . he wants the ball . he runs to anna and ben and grabs the ball . he says , " this is my ball now . go away ! "

anna and ben are sad and scared . they want their ball back . they say , " please , give us our ball . we can share . we can be friends . see , we sign peace . " they make a sign with their fingers . the sign means peace and love .

but the big boy does not care . he does not know the sign . he does not want peace and love . he wants the ball . he says , " no , this is my ball . you are silly . i do not like you . go away or i will hit you ! "

he raises his fist . he looks angry . anna and ben are very sad and scared . they run away . they cry . they lose their ball . they lose their fun . they have no peace . the big boy is mean . he has the ball . he has no friends . the end . tom and mia like to play with cars . they have many cars of different colors and sizes . some cars have motors that make them go fast . tom and mia like to race their cars on the floor .

one day , tom and mia decide to have a big race . they choose their best cars with motors . tom has a red car and mia has a blue car . they make a line with tape to show the start and the end of the race . they say , " ready , set , go ! " and push their cars .

the cars zoom across the floor . tom 's car is very fast , but mia 's car is faster . mia 's car reaches the end of the race first . mia says , " i win ! i win ! my car is the best ! "

tom feels sad . he wanted to win the race . he says , " no fair ! your car has a better motor than mine ! "

mia sees that tom is sad . she remembers that winning is not everything . she says , " i 'm sorry , tom . you are right . my car has a better motor than yours . that is not fair . do you want to try my car ? "

tom looks at mia . he sees that she is humble and kind . he says , " thank you , mia . you are a good friend . can we share your car ? "

mia smiles and nods . she says , " yes , we can share my car . and we can also share your car . we can have fun with both cars . "

tom and mia hug and play with their cars . they do not care who wins or loses . they are happy to play together . lily was a white cat who liked to walk around the farm . she liked to see the cows , the pigs , the chickens and the ducks . she also liked to play with the farmer 's dog , max , who was her friend .

one day , lily saw a big mouse near the barn . she wanted to catch it and have some fun . she ran after the mouse , but the mouse was fast and clever . it ran into the barn , where lily could not see it .

lily followed the mouse into the barn . she looked around , but it was dark and dusty . she heard the mouse squeak , and she ran towards the sound . she did not see the big machine that the farmer used to cut the hay . she did not hear the farmer turn it on .

the farmer did not see lily either . he was busy working with the hay . he did not know that lily was in the barn . he did not hear her meow .

the machine was loud and sharp . it cut the hay and it cut lily too . lily felt a lot of pain and she stopped moving . she was not alive anymore .

max heard the machine and he ran to the barn . he saw lily on the floor , covered in blood . he barked and cried . he wanted lily to wake up and play with him . but lily did not wake up . she was gone .

the farmer heard max and he came to see what was wrong . he saw lily and he was very sad . he liked lily and he was sorry that he hurt her . he buried lily under a tree and he gave max a hug . he said , " i 'm so sorry , max . i did not mean to kill lily . she was a good cat . "

but max was still sad . he missed lily very much . he did not want to play or eat or walk . he only wanted lily back . he was lonely and unhappy . he wished that lily had never chased the mouse . he wished that the machine had never cut her . he wished that he could see her again . but he could not . lily was gone and he was alone . the end . tim and sam were best friends . they liked to play with cars and make zoom sounds . one day , they found a big cake on the table . it looked yummy and sweet .

" let 's taste the cake , " tim said . " no one will know . "

sam nodded . he was hungry and curious . they climbed on the chairs and took big bites of the cake . it was soft and creamy . they smiled and ate more .

but then , they heard a loud voice . it was mom . she was angry and sad .

" what did you do ? " she asked . " that was my birthday cake . i made it for myself . i was proud of it . now it is ruined . you are naughty and selfish . "

tim and sam felt bad and scared . they tried to say sorry , but mom did not listen . she sent them to their rooms without any toys or stories . they cried and wished they had not tasted the cake . they had lost their best friend and their mom 's love . lily liked to bounce on her bed . she bounced up and down , up and down , with a big smile on her face . she bounced so high that she could touch the ceiling . she bounced so fast that she felt like a bird .

one day , she bounced too hard and fell off the bed . she landed on the floor with a thud . she felt a pain in her arm . she cried out loud . mommy heard her and came running .

mommy picked up lily and hugged her . she looked at her arm and said , " you have a boo - boo , my sweetie . let me get you some ice and a band - aid . " she took lily to the kitchen and put some ice on her arm . she gave her a band - aid with a star on it . she said , " there , you are fine now . do you want some toast for breakfast ? "

lily nodded . she liked toast with butter and jam . mommy made her some toast and cut it into small pieces . she gave her a glass of milk and a spoon . she said , " eat your toast , my darling . it will make you feel better . and no more bouncing on the bed , okay ? "

lily said , " okay , mommy . i 'm sorry . i love you . " she ate her toast and drank her milk . she felt fine . she gave mommy a kiss and a hug . she said , " thank you , mommy . you are the best . " mommy smiled and said , " you are welcome , lily . you are the best , too . " they hugged and kissed again . they were happy . tom and sam are brothers . they like to play in the snow . they make a big snowman with a red hat and a red scarf . they are happy .

but then , a big dog comes . the dog is mean . he barks at tom and sam . he runs to the snowman . he bites the red hat and the red scarf . he knocks down the snowman . tom and sam are sad .

they run to their mom . they tell her about the dog . mom is angry . she goes to the dog 's owner . she tells him to keep his dog away from her boys . the owner is rude . he says he does not care . he says his dog can do what he wants . mom is very angry .

she says she will call the police . she takes tom and sam home . she gives them hot chocolate and hugs . she says she loves them . she says they can make another snowman tomorrow .

but tom and sam do not want to make another snowman . they are scared of the dog . they do not want to play in the snow anymore . they stay inside . they are not happy . the end . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to swing , slide and run . but they did not like to share . they always wanted the same toy or the same spot .

one day , they saw a shiny red shoe on the grass . it was big and had a button on the side . lily ran to the shoe and picked it up . she wanted to try it on .

" give me the shoe ! " ben shouted . he ran after lily and tried to grab the shoe . " it is mine ! "

" no , it is mine ! " lily shouted back . she held the shoe tight and pushed ben away . " you have your own shoes ! "

they pulled and pushed and yelled . they did not see the man who was looking for his shoe . he was angry and sad . his shoe was broken . the button was gone and the sole was torn .

" hey , you two ! what are you doing with my shoe ? " the man said . he walked to lily and ben and took the shoe from them . " you spoiled my shoe ! it was a special shoe . it could make music and light . but now it is broken . you are bad kids ! "

lily and ben felt sorry and scared . they did not know the shoe was special . they did not mean to break it . they looked at each other and said , " we are sorry , mister . we did not know . we just wanted to play . "

the man sighed and shook his head . he said , " you should not take things that are not yours . you should not fight over toys . you should share and be nice . do you understand ? "

lily and ben nodded and said , " yes , we understand . we will share and be nice . we will not spoil things . "

the man smiled and said , " that is good . now , go and play . but be careful and kind . and if you see something that is not yours , leave it alone . "

lily and ben said , " okay , thank you , mister . " they gave the shoe back to the man and ran to the swings . they decided to take turns and have fun . they learned their lesson . they did not want to spoil anything again . lily liked to play with her toy camera . she liked to record things that she saw and heard . she liked to record her cat , max , who had soft fur and green eyes . she liked to record her mom , who sang songs and read books to her . she liked to record her dad , who made jokes and built things with her .

one night , lily had a big idea . she wanted to record the stars and the moon . she asked her mom if she could go outside and look at the sky . her mom said yes , but she had to wear her coat and hat . it was cold and dark outside . lily put on her coat and hat and took her toy camera . she went outside with her mom .

lily looked up at the sky . she saw many stars and a big moon . they were bright and shiny . she pointed her toy camera at them and pressed the button . she said , " i am recording the stars and the moon . they are so pretty . i want to show them to dad and max . "

her mom smiled and said , " that 's a great idea , lily . you are very smart and creative . i 'm sure dad and max will love your video . but we should go back inside soon . it 's getting late and you need to sleep . "

lily nodded and said , " okay , mom . can i record one more thing ? "

her mom said , " sure , what do you want to record ? "

lily looked around and saw a big tree . it had many leaves and branches . she said , " i want to record the tree . it is so tall and strong . maybe it has a bird or a squirrel in it . "

her mom said , " okay , let 's go to the tree . but be careful , do n't go too close . the tree might have thorns or bugs . "

lily and her mom walked to the tree . lily pointed her toy camera at the tree and pressed the button . she said , " i am recording the tree . it is so green and brown . i wonder what lives in it . "

suddenly , they heard a loud noise . it was a hoot . it came from the tree . lily and her mom looked up and saw a big owl . it had yellow eyes and dark fur . it looked at them and hooted again .

lily was surprised and excited . she said , " wow , mom , look ! it 's an owl ! it lives in the tree ! can i record it ? "

her mom said , " yes , you can , but be quiet . do n't scare it . it might fly away . "

lily whispered , " okay , mom . i will be quiet . " she pointed her toy camera at the owl and pressed the button . she said , " i am recording the owl . it is so dark and fluffy . it makes a funny sound . i like it . "

the owl looked at them and hooted one more time . then it spread its wings and flew away . lily and her mom watched it go . they smiled and hugged . they said , " that was amazing . we saw an owl . we recorded it . we will remember it forever . "

they went back inside and showed their video to dad and max . they were happy and proud . they had a good night . they slept well and dreamed of stars and moons and trees and owls . tim and jen are playing with their toys in the living room . tim has a red car and jen has a yellow telephone . they make noises and pretend to talk to each other .

" hello , this is jen . who is this ? " jen says into the telephone .

" hello , this is tim . i am driving my car . vroom , vroom ! " tim says back .

they laugh and have fun . but then , jen 's mom comes in and says , " jen , it is time to finish playing . we have to go to the store . "

jen does not want to go . she likes playing with tim and the telephone . she says , " no , mom . i want to play more . please ! "

tim hears jen and feels sorry for her . he knows how it is to leave a fun game . he says , " jen , it is ok . we can play again later . here , you can have my car . it is a gift for you . "

jen smiles and hugs tim . she says , " thank you , tim . you are very nice . i like your car . it is a gift for me . "

jen 's mom smiles too . she says , " that is very kind of you , tim . you are a good friend . jen , say goodbye to tim and put your toys away . we have to go now . "

jen and tim say goodbye and put their toys away . jen takes the car and the telephone with her . she waves to tim as she leaves . tim waves back . he is a little sad , but he is happy that jen is happy . he thinks , " jen is a good friend . i hope she likes the store . maybe she will call me with the telephone later . " tim and jen are friends who like to play on the farm . they like to see the cows , the pigs , and the chickens . they also like to jump on the hay in the barn .

one day , they find a big pile of hay in the corner . tim says , " let 's make a fort with the hay . we can hide and pretend we are soldiers . "

jen says , " no , let 's make a nest with the hay . we can pretend we are birds and sing . "

tim and jen disagree . they both want to play with the hay , but they want to play different games . they start to pull the hay from each other .

" stop it ! " tim says . " this is my hay ! "

" stop it ! " jen says . " this is my hay ! "

they hear a loud noise . they look up and see a gray cat on the roof . the cat is angry . it does not like the noise . it jumps down and runs towards tim and jen .

" meow ! " the cat says . " this is my hay ! "

tim and jen are scared . they drop the hay and run away . they decide to play something else . they do not want to make the cat mad . they agree to be friends and share . lily and ben were best friends . they liked to play together in the park . one day , they found a big box under a tree . they wondered what was inside .

" maybe it is a secret , " lily said . " maybe someone left it for us . "

" let 's open it and see , " ben said . he lifted the lid of the box . he gasped . lily peeked inside . she smiled .

inside the box , there was a small , fluffy puppy . it had brown fur and black eyes . it wagged its tail and licked ben 's hand . it was adorable .

" whoa , it is a puppy ! " ben said . " it is so cute ! "

" can we keep it ? " lily asked . " please , please , please ? "

ben looked around . he did not see anyone who owned the box or the puppy . he nodded . " okay , but we have to be careful . it is our secret . we have to hide it from our moms and dads . "

lily and ben hugged the puppy . they named it spot . they decided to take turns keeping it in their houses . they made a bed for it out of an old blanket . they fed it some bread and milk . they played with it and taught it some tricks .

they were very happy with their secret puppy . they did not know that someone was watching them from behind the tree . it was a man with a mean face and a big net . he was the one who left the box and the puppy . he was not a nice man . he wanted to catch the puppy and sell it for money . he waited for the right moment to grab it .

the story foreshadows or sets up the conflict by introducing the man with the mean face and the big net at the end of the first paragraph . it pays off or resolves the conflict by revealing his plan and motive at the end of the last paragraph . the story also creates suspense and curiosity by making the reader wonder what will happen to the puppy and the children . once upon a time , there was a little mouse named timmy . timmy loved to eat cheese , but he was very clumsy . one day , timmy went to the market to trade some cheese for some bread .

at the market , timmy met a cat named mittens . mittens was planning to catch timmy and eat him for dinner . " hello , little mouse , " said mittens . " what brings you to the market today ? "

" i 'm here to trade some cheese for some bread , " replied timmy .

mittens smiled slyly . " i have a better plan , " she said . " why do n't you come back to my house and we can share the cheese and bread together ? "

timmy thought this was a good idea , but he was also a little scared of mittens . " okay , " he said , " but can we eat the cheese and bread outside ? "

mittens agreed and they went to her house . they ate the cheese and bread and had a nice time . timmy was happy that he made a new friend , but he also knew he had to be careful around mittens . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she had a furry teddy bear that she loved to play with . one day , lily 's mom asked her to go upstairs and clean her room . lily did n't want to go upstairs and resisted her mom 's request .

but then , lily remembered her favorite toy was upstairs too . she thought about her furry teddy bear and decided to go upstairs after all . when she got to her room , she saw her teddy bear sitting on her bed .

lily picked up her teddy bear and hugged it tightly . she felt happy that she went upstairs and found her favorite toy . from that day on , lily did n't resist going upstairs anymore because she knew her furry teddy bear was waiting for her . the end . once upon a time , there was a little rabbit named benny . benny loved to play in the bushes near his house . one day , he saw a gray cat walking towards him . benny got scared and ran away .

the next day , benny went back to play in the bushes . but the gray cat came back and scared him again . benny decided to cut down the bushes so he could see the cat coming .

but then , benny realized that cutting the bushes was not a good idea . the bushes were important for his home and for the animals that lived there . benny learned that it is better to face his fears than to destroy something important . from that day on , benny was brave and never cut down the bushes again . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to ride the big yellow bus to school every day . but one day , the bus driver took a different route and lily got lost . she felt frustrated and scared .

suddenly , the bus stopped and a kind lady helped lily find her way back home . lily was so happy and grateful . she realized that sometimes things change and it can be scary , but there are always people who can help you .

from that day on , lily looked forward to riding the bus and meeting new friends . she knew that even if things do n't go as planned , there is always a way to find happiness and joy . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside and see all the pretty flowers . one day , she saw a pink flower that she had never seen before . it was so pretty !

as she was playing , she accidentally broke a toy . her mom told her that it was against the law to break things that did n't belong to her . lily felt sad and knew she needed to say sorry .

later that day , lily saw her friend wearing a pink dress . she told her friend how pretty she looked in her pink dress . her friend smiled and said thank you . they played together and had a lot of fun . the end . once upon a time , there was a little boy named timmy . timmy loved ice cream and always wanted a cone . one day , timmy went to the ice cream truck and asked for a cone . the ice cream man gave him a cone with chocolate ice cream .

timmy was so happy to have his cone . he licked it and licked it until there was no more ice cream left . but then , timmy did something stupid . he accidentally dropped his cone on the ground and it was ruined .

timmy was sad that he did n't have his cone anymore , but the ice cream man was nice and gave him another one . timmy was happy again and made sure to be careful with his cone this time . the end . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to sail on her toy boat in the bathtub . one wednesday , she was having so much fun sailing her boat when her mom came in .

mom : " what are you doing , lily ? "

lily : " sailing my boat ! it 's funny ! "

mom : " that does look like fun . can i join you ? "

lily : " yes , please ! let 's sail together ! "

so , lily and her mom sailed their boats together and had a funny and fun time on that wednesday . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . lily liked to play in the park with her friends . one day , lily 's mom said they were going on a long car ride . lily was excited but also tired . she asked her mom , " are we there yet ? " her mom said , " not yet , but soon . "

on the car ride , lily saw many things like cows and trees . she was happy to see them , but she was still tired . finally , they arrived at a big theater . lily 's mom said , " we are here to watch a play . " lily did n't know what a play was , but she was excited to see it .

when the play started , lily saw people on stage acting out a story . she thought it was fun to watch . suddenly , lily saw a character in the play who looked just like her ! she was so surprised and happy . lily 's mom had planned this surprise for her . lily had so many questions about the play , and her mom answered them all . it was a great day for lily . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . one day , lily and her mommy went to the store . they walked around and looked at all the toys and candy . lily saw some gum and asked her mommy if she could have it . her mommy said , " yes , but you have to pay for it with your own money . "

lily had some money in her piggy bank at home . she was very excited to buy the gum . they went to the cashier and lily gave her money to the lady . the lady gave lily the gum and said , " thank you for being so organized with your money . "

