" sorry , sam , " mia said . she did not sound sorry . she was still smiling .

" sorry , mum , " sam said . he was still crying . he was still wet .

mum hugged sam . she dried him with a towel . she gave him a kiss . she told him it was ok .

" mia , you need to learn to share and play nice , " mum said . she gave mia a look . she told her to go to her room .

mia pouted . she did not want to go to her room . she wanted to play with her dragon toy . she did not like to share and play nice . she was a dragon . sam and mia are twins . they like to play pretend . today , they pretend to work in an office . they have a big desk , a phone , a computer and some papers .

sam says , " i am the boss . you are my helper . you have to do what i say . "

mia says , " no , i am the boss . you are my helper . you have to do what i say . "

they argue and get mad at each other . they do not want to share the office .

mom hears them and comes to see what is wrong . she says , " why are you fighting ? you can both be the boss . you just have to choose who goes first . "

sam and mia look at each other . they think for a moment . then they say , " ok , mom . we will take turns . sam can be the boss first , then mia can be the boss next . "

mom smiles and says , " that is a good idea . you can have fun and be fair . but remember , the office is not real . it is only a game . do not hurt each other or break anything . "

sam and mia nod and say , " ok , mom . we will be careful and nice . "

mom leaves them to play . sam and mia sit on the big desk . they pick up the phone and the computer . they pretend to talk to people and write things . they have a brown folder with some papers . they pretend to sign them and give them to each other .

they say , " good job , boss . good job , helper . we are a good team . "

they smile and hug . they are happy . they like to play pretend . they like to work in an office . sara liked to help her mom in the kitchen . she liked to mix and roll and cut the pastry . she liked to make shapes with the pastry , like stars and hearts and flowers . she liked to put jam and cheese and chocolate on the pastry . she liked to eat the pastry when it was done .

one day , sara saw a big pastry on the table . it was round and golden and smelled good . sara wanted to eat it , but her mom said no . her mom said it was for a special guest . sara wondered who the guest was . she thought it was a mysterious guest .

sara was curious about the pastry . she wanted to see what was inside . she climbed on a chair and reached for the pastry . she poked it with her finger . she made a hole in the pastry . she saw something red and juicy . she wanted to taste it . she put her finger in her mouth . it was sweet and sour . she liked it . she wanted more .

sara poked the pastry again and again . she made more holes in the pastry . she ate more of the red and juicy stuff . she did not hear her mom coming back . she did not see her mom 's face . she did not know her mom was angry .

her mom saw the pastry . she saw the holes . she saw the red and juicy stuff . she saw sara 's finger . she knew what sara did . she was very angry . she shouted at sara . she said sara was naughty . she said sara had to fix the pastry . she said sara had to make a new pastry . she said sara had to say sorry to the guest .

sara was scared . she did not want to fix the pastry . she did not know how to make a new pastry . she did not want to say sorry to the guest . she cried . she said she was sorry . she said she was hungry . she said she liked the pastry .

her mom sighed . she hugged sara . she said she loved sara . she said she understood sara . she said she would help sara . she said they would fix the pastry together . she said they would make a new pastry together . she said they would say sorry to the guest together .

sara smiled . she said she loved her mom . she said she was happy . she said she would help her mom . she said they would fix the pastry together . she said they would make a new pastry together . she said they would say sorry to the guest together .

they fixed the pastry . they made a new pastry . they said sorry to the guest . the guest was sara 's grandma . she was not angry . she was not mysterious . she was nice . she said she loved sara . she said she loved the pastry . she said she was happy . they all ate the pastry . they all smiled . they all hugged . they all had a good day . jill and tom were twins who liked to play in the attic . they found many old things there , like books , clothes , and toys . one day , they saw a shiny box with a lock on it . they were curious about what was inside .

" let 's open it ! " jill said .

" but we do n't have a key , " tom said .

" maybe we can find one , " jill said . " look , there are many keys on this ring . maybe one of them fits . "

they tried the keys one by one , but none of them worked . they were about to give up , when jill noticed a small key hidden under a hat . she picked it up and tried it on the lock . it clicked and opened .

" wow , look ! " jill said . " there are many ornaments in the box . they are so pretty and sparkly . they look like stars and snowflakes and bells . "

" can we touch them ? " tom asked .

" i do n't know , " jill said . " maybe they are fragile . maybe they belong to someone . "

" who cares ? " tom said . " they are just ornaments . let 's take them out and play with them . "

he reached for the box , but jill stopped him .

" wait , tom , " she said . " do you hear that ? someone is coming up the stairs . maybe it 's mom or dad . maybe they will be angry if they see us with the box . "

" quick , let 's hide it ! " tom said .

they put the box under a blanket and ran to the other side of the attic . they pretended to play with some dolls and cars . they heard the door open and saw their grandma enter .

" hello , my dears , " she said . " what are you doing here ? "

" we are just playing , grandma , " jill said .

" can we show you something , grandma ? " tom said .

" what is it , tom ? " she asked .

he ran to the blanket and lifted it . he showed her the box with the lock and the ornaments .

" look , grandma , look what we found ! " he said .

grandma gasped and smiled . she took the box and hugged it .

" oh , my , oh , my , " she said . " this is a very special box . it was my mother 's . she gave it to me when i was a little girl . she told me these ornaments were magic . they could make your wishes come true . "

" really , grandma ? " jill and tom asked .

" yes , really , " she said . " but you have to be careful with them . they are very old and delicate . and you have to keep them a secret . only the people who love you can see them . "

" can we see them , grandma ? " jill and tom asked .

" of course , you can , " she said . " you are my grandchildren . you are very special to me . come , let 's sit down and i 'll tell you a story about these ornaments . and maybe , if you are good , i 'll let you make a wish . " ben and lily were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . they saw a funny man with a big hat and a long coat . he had a shiny coin in his hand .

" hello , children ! " the funny man said . " do you want to see a magic trick ? "

ben and lily nodded . they liked magic . the funny man smiled and showed them the coin .

" watch closely , " he said . " i will make this coin disappear and reappear . where do you think it will go ? "

ben pointed to his hat . lily pointed to his coat . the funny man shook his head .

" no , no , no , " he said . " you are both wrong . the coin will go to a very special place . a place where you are always welcome . a place where you can find many friends and surprises . do you know what place i mean ? "

ben and lily thought hard . they did not know . the funny man winked and said the magic word .

" abracadabra ! "

he opened his hand and the coin was gone . he reached behind ben 's ear and pulled out the coin .

" ta - da ! " he said . " the coin went to your ear , ben . you are very lucky . this is a magic coin . it can make your wishes come true . do you want to keep it ? "

ben was amazed . he nodded and took the coin . he thanked the funny man .

" what about you , lily ? " the funny man asked . " do you want a magic coin too ? "

lily nodded . she wanted a magic coin . the funny man repeated the trick and gave her a coin from her ear .

" now you both have magic coins , " he said . " but remember , you can only use them once . so choose your wishes wisely . and do n't forget to have fun . goodbye , children ! "

the funny man waved and walked away . ben and lily looked at their coins . they wondered what to wish for . they decided to share their wishes with each other .

" i wish for a big ice cream , " ben said .

" i wish for a new doll , " lily said .

they closed their eyes and wished hard . they opened their eyes and saw their wishes come true . there was a big ice cream in ben 's hand and a new doll in lily 's hand . they were very happy . they hugged each other and thanked their magic coins .

they ate the ice cream and played with the doll . they had a lot of fun . they agreed that the funny man was very nice and that the park was a very special place . a place where they were always welcome . a place where they could find many friends and surprises . a place where magic could happen . anna likes to help her mom with the mail . she likes to put the letters in the big blue box . she likes to see the mailman come and take the letters away . she thinks the mailman is very busy and nice .

one day , anna sees a cat near the big blue box . the cat is black and white and has a bell on its neck . the cat looks at anna and meows . anna thinks the cat is cute and wants to play with it . she runs to the cat and tries to pet it .

but the cat does not want to play with anna . the cat is scared of anna and runs away . anna chases the cat and forgets about the mail . she leaves the letters on the ground . the wind blows the letters away . anna does not see the letters fly away . she only sees the cat .

the mailman comes and looks for the letters . he does not see any letters in the big blue box . he does not see any letters on the ground . he sees anna and the cat . he asks anna , " where is the mail , anna ? did you put the letters in the big blue box ? "

anna stops and looks at the mailman . she feels bad . she says , " i 'm sorry , mailman . i did not put the letters in the big blue box . i wanted to play with the cat . the cat ran away and i ran after it . i forgot about the mail . i do n't know where the letters are . "

the mailman is not happy . he says , " anna , you should not forget about the mail . the mail is important . the letters are for other people . they are waiting for the letters . they will be sad if they do n't get the letters . you should be careful and responsible with the mail . you should not play with the cat when you have a job to do . "

anna nods and says , " i understand , mailman . i 'm sorry . i will be careful and responsible with the mail next time . i will not play with the cat when i have a job to do . i will help you find the letters . "

the mailman smiles and says , " thank you , anna . that is very kind of you . i 'm sure we can find the letters together . and maybe after we find the letters , you can play with the cat for a little while . the cat might like that . "

anna smiles and says , " yes , mailman . that sounds good . i like the cat . but i like the mail too . and i like you . you are very busy and nice . "

the mailman and anna look for the letters . they find some of them in the bushes , some of them on the fence , and some of them on the roof . they put the letters in the big blue box . they see the cat sitting on a wall . the cat looks at them and meows . anna and the mailman wave at the cat . the cat waves back with its tail . anna and the mailman laugh . they are happy . they have done a good job . they have learned a lesson . tim and mia like to play with their toy dinosaurs . they have big ones and small ones , green ones and brown ones , with horns and with spikes . they make noises and pretend they are in a jungle .

one day , they find a new toy in the closet . it is a gun that can shoot water . tim and mia think it is very fun . they fill it with water and run outside . they see their toy dinosaurs on the grass . they decide to play a game .

tim says , " i am a hunter and you are a dinosaur . i will shoot you with water and you will fall down . " mia says , " ok , but i am a fast dinosaur and you will miss me . " they start to run and chase each other . tim tries to shoot mia with water , but she dodges and hides behind the trees . mia roars and tries to scare tim .

they have a lot of fun , but they also get wet and dirty . their mom sees them and says , " what are you doing ? you are soaking wet and muddy . come inside and change your clothes . " tim and mia stop playing and go inside . they are sad to leave their toy dinosaurs and their water gun .

but their mom has a surprise for them . she says , " i have a useful idea . you can use your water gun to help me water the plants . they are thirsty and need some water . and you can bring your toy dinosaurs too . they can watch and learn . " tim and mia think that is a good idea . they take their water gun and their toy dinosaurs and help their mom water the plants . they are happy and proud . they say , " we are useful hunters and dinosaurs . we can shoot water and help the plants . " their mom smiles and hugs them . she says , " you are very useful and very clever . and very wet . let 's go and have a snack . " they go and have a snack and tell their mom about their game . they say , " we love our toy dinosaurs and our water gun . they are very fun . " their mom says , " i love you and your toy dinosaurs and your water gun . they are very fun too . " they laugh and eat and play some more . lily had long hair that she liked to comb every day . she had a pink comb that her mom gave her for her birthday . she used it to make her hair smooth and shiny .

one day , she was playing with her friend max in the park . they ran and jumped and had fun . but then , lily tripped on a rock and fell down . she scraped her knee and cried . max helped her get up and gave her a hug .

" are you okay , lily ? " he asked .

lily nodded , but then she saw something that made her sad . her pink comb was broken . it had fallen out of her pocket and snapped in half . she picked up the pieces and sobbed .

" my comb , my comb ! it 's broken ! mom gave it to me ! i ca n't comb my hair anymore ! " she wailed .

max looked at the comb and had an idea . he ran to his backpack and took out some tape . he came back to lily and said , " do n't cry , lily . i can fix it . i can repair your comb . look ! "

he taped the two pieces of the comb together and handed it to lily . she smiled and hugged him .

" thank you , max ! you are a good friend . you repaired my comb . now i can comb my hair again ! " she said .

max smiled back and said , " you 're welcome , lily . i 'm glad you 're happy . and your hair is still healthy and beautiful . come on , let 's play some more ! "

they held hands and ran to the swings . they forgot about the scrape and the tape . they just enjoyed their friendship and their fun . ben and lily were playing in the kitchen . they wanted to make a cake for mom . they found some dough in the fridge and put it on the table . they rolled it and cut it with cookie cutters . they made stars and hearts and circles .

" look , lily , i made a big star ! " ben said . he showed his cookie to his sister .

" that 's nice , ben . i made a heart for mom . she will love it ! " lily said . she smiled and put her cookie on a tray .

they had some dough left . they decided to make funny shapes with it . they twisted it and squeezed it and stretched it . they made snakes and worms and balls .

" look , lily , i made a crazy snake ! " ben said . he waved his dough snake in the air .

" that 's funny , ben . i made a crazy worm ! " lily said . she wiggled her dough worm on the table .

they laughed and played with their dough . they did not see that mom was watching them from the door . she smiled and took a picture of them .

" hi , kids . what are you doing ? " mom asked .

" we are making a cake for you , mom ! " ben and lily said together .

" that 's very sweet of you , but you know what ? you need to bake the cookies in the oven , not play with the dough . and you need to clean up the mess . look , you have dough on your hands and faces and clothes . and on the floor and the walls and the chairs . you made a big splash of dough everywhere ! " mom said .

" oops , sorry , mom . we did not mean to make a mess . we just wanted to have fun . " ben and lily said .

" i know , i know . you are very creative and playful . but you also need to be careful and tidy . come on , let 's wash your hands and faces and put the cookies in the oven . then we can clean up the kitchen together . and then we can eat the cake and enjoy your wonderful shapes . how does that sound ? " mom said .

" okay , mom . that sounds good . we love you , mom . " ben and lily said .

they hugged mom and followed her to the sink . they washed their hands and faces and helped mom put the cookies in the oven . then they cleaned up the kitchen and waited for the cake to be ready . they were happy and proud of their work . they had a lot of fun with the dough . and they learned a lesson about splashing and cleaning . anna and her mom went to church every sunday . anna liked to sing and listen to stories , but she did not like to sit still for a long time . she wanted to play with her toys or run outside .

one sunday , anna saw a big box in the church hall . it had many books and clothes and toys inside . a sign said , " for the poor children " . anna asked her mom , " who are the poor children ? "

her mom said , " they are children who do not have enough things to eat or wear or play with . they live in faraway places where there is war or sickness or hunger . we can help them by giving them some of our things . we can also pray for them , that god will make them fine and happy . "

anna felt sad for the poor children . she wanted to help them . she looked at the box and saw a teddy bear that she liked . it was brown and soft and had a red bow . she asked her mom , " can i have that teddy bear ? "

her mom said , " no , anna . that teddy bear is for the poor children . you have many toys at home . you can share some of them with the poor children . that would make them happy and god happy too . "

anna thought for a moment . she loved her toys , but she also wanted to be kind . she said , " okay , mom . i will give some of my toys to the poor children . but can i hug the teddy bear first ? "

her mom smiled and said , " yes , you can hug the teddy bear first . but then you have to put it back in the box . and do n't forget to pray for the poor children , anna . "

anna nodded and ran to the box . she hugged the teddy bear and whispered , " i hope you find a good home , teddy bear . i hope you make a poor child happy . i hope god makes you and the poor children fine . amen . "

then she put the teddy bear back in the box and went to sit with her mom . she felt good in her heart . she sang and listened to stories and prayed with her mom . she did not mind sitting still for a long time . she knew she had done a good thing . sara and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big watch on a wall . the watch has many colors and shapes . it makes sounds and lights .

" wow , look at that watch ! " sara says . " it is amazing ! "

ben nods . he feels happy and curious . he wants to touch the watch . he runs to the wall and reaches for the watch .

" be careful , ben ! " sara shouts . " the watch might be hot or sharp ! "

but ben does not listen . he touches the watch . he feels a shock . he cries out loud . he lets go of the watch . he falls to the ground .

sara runs to ben . she feels scared and sorry . she hugs ben and says , " are you okay , ben ? i am sorry you got hurt . "

ben sniffles . he feels pain and sad . he says , " it is okay , sara . i am sorry i did not listen . the watch is not amazing . it is bad . "

sara and ben go to the bench . they sit and rest . they see a lady with a dog . the dog is fluffy and friendly . it wags its tail and licks their faces .

" look at that dog ! " ben says . " it is amazing ! "

sara smiles . she feels happy and glad . she says , " yes , it is amazing . and it is nice . do you want to pet the dog ? "

ben nods . he feels brave and calm . he pets the dog . he says , " the dog is soft and warm . i like the dog . "

sara and ben make a new friend . they forget about the watch . they have fun in the park . they feel good and happy . lily wanted to go to the park with her friend ben . she asked her mom if she could go .

" not yet , lily . you have to finish your lunch first , " her mom said .

" but i 'm not hungry . and ben is waiting for me , " lily said .

" lily , you have to eat something . you need energy to play . and you have to promise me that you will stay with ben and not wander off . the park is big and you are still small , " her mom said .

lily nodded . she wanted to be a good girl and listen to her mom . she also wanted to be independent and have fun with her friend . she ate her sandwich quickly and drank her juice . then she put on her shoes and coat .

" can i go now , mom ? " she asked .

" yes , you can go . but remember your promise , okay ? " her mom said .

" okay , mom . i promise . i love you , " lily said .

" i love you too , lily . have fun and be careful , " her mom said .

lily ran outside and met ben . they held hands and walked to the park . they played on the swings , the slide , and the seesaw . they laughed and had a great time . lily kept her promise and stayed with ben . she was happy and independent . tom and lily liked to play in the park . they liked to slide , swing and run . one day , they saw a big sack near the trees . they wanted to see what was inside .

they ran to the sack and opened it . they saw many shiny things . they were coins and jewels . tom and lily were happy . they wanted to take some .

but then they heard a loud noise . it was a man . he was angry . he was the owner of the sack . he had stolen the shiny things from a bank . he was dangerous .

he saw tom and lily with his sack . he shouted at them . he wanted to catch them . tom and lily were scared . they dropped the sack and ran away .

they ran to their mom and dad . they told them what happened . their mom and dad hugged them . they said they were brave and smart . they said they should never touch a strange sack again . they said they should always listen to their ear . their ear would tell them if something was good or bad . tom and lily nodded . they learned their lesson . they were happy to be safe . tom and lily were playing in the park . they liked to run and jump and slide . they saw a big hill with a lot of trees . they wanted to climb the hill and see what was on the other side .

they held hands and started to walk up the hill . they saw many birds and bugs and flowers . they heard a loud noise . it sounded like a roar . they stopped and looked around . they saw a giant coming out of the trees . the giant had long hair and long teeth and long nails . he looked angry and hungry .

tom and lily were scared . they wanted to run away . but the giant saw them and moved towards them . he reached out his big hand to grab them .

" help ! help ! " tom and lily shouted .

they heard another noise . it sounded like a bark . they saw their dog , rex , running towards them . rex was a brave and loyal dog . he barked and bit the giant 's leg . the giant felt pain and let go of tom and lily . he kicked rex away and moved back to the trees .

tom and lily ran to rex and hugged him . they thanked him for saving them . they decided to go back to the park and never climb the hill again . they learned that some places are not safe to explore . they were happy to have rex as their friend . sara was bored . she had no toys to play with . her mom was busy in the kitchen . her dad was at work . she wanted to have some fun .

she saw a door in the hall . it was closed . she had never been inside . she wondered what was behind it . she walked to the door and tried to open it . it was locked . she was curious .

she saw a crack under the door . she bent down and tried to peek through it . she saw something shiny . it looked like a big knife . she wanted to touch it . she pushed her hand under the door . she felt something cold and sharp . it hurt . she screamed .

her mom heard her scream and ran to the hall . she saw sara 's hand bleeding . she saw the crack under the door . she knew what was behind it . it was her dad 's workshop . he had tools and knives and other dangerous things . he had told sara not to go near it . he had locked the door to keep her safe .

she was angry and scared . she grabbed sara 's hand and wrapped it in a cloth . she took her to the car and drove to the hospital . she called her dad and told him what happened . he was sad and sorry . he wished he had hidden the key better .

sara had to get stitches . she had to wear a bandage for a long time . she learned a lesson . she never peeked through the crack again . she never had fun with the shiny knife . she had a dull scar on her hand . she was sorry too . anna and ben are friends . they like to play at the gym . the gym has many toys and balls and mats . anna and ben have fun at the gym .

one day , anna and ben want to play with the same ball . the ball is big and red and bouncy . anna says , " i saw the ball first . it is mine . " ben says , " no , i saw the ball first . it is mine . " anna and ben start to pull the ball . they are angry and loud .

an old lady is sitting on a bench . she is watching anna and ben . she is sad . she says , " stop , children . stop fighting . fighting is not nice . sharing is nice . why do n't you play with the ball together ? "

anna and ben look at the old lady . they feel sorry . they say , " we are sorry , lady . we are sorry for fighting . you are right . sharing is nice . " they let go of the ball . they smile at each other . they say , " do you want to play with the ball with me ? " they nod . they play with the ball together . they are happy and quiet .

the old lady is happy too . she says , " good , children . good for playing together . good for saying sorry . good for sharing . that is how you make friends . that is how you forgive . forgiving is nice . forgiving is good . " anna and ben say , " thank you , lady . thank you for teaching us . we will remember . we will forgive . we will share . we will be friends . " they hug the old lady . they hug each other . they go back to the gym . they have more fun at the gym . tom and anna were twins . they liked to play with their toys and their dog . but they did not like their baby brother , ben . ben was an infant . he cried a lot and took their mom 's time .

one day , mom had to go to the store . she asked tom and anna to watch ben for a while . she said , " be nice to your brother . he is small and needs your love . " tom and anna nodded , but they did not mean it .

as soon as mom left , tom and anna went to their room . they shut the door and locked it . they did not want to hear ben cry . they did not care if he was cold or hungry or lonely . they just wanted to play with their toys and their dog .

but ben did cry . he cried louder and louder . he was cold and hungry and lonely . he wanted his mom and his blanket and his bottle . he did not understand why tom and anna shut the door and locked it . he felt sad and scared .

after a while , mom came back . she heard ben cry . she ran to his room . she saw that the door was shut and locked . she was angry and worried . she knocked on the door and shouted , " tom ! anna ! open the door ! what are you doing to your brother ? "

tom and anna heard mom . they felt guilty and ashamed . they opened the door and saw mom holding ben . ben was still crying . he was cold and hungry and lonely . mom looked at tom and anna with a sad face . she said , " how could you do this to your brother ? he is your family . he needs your care and kindness . you should love him , not hurt him . "

tom and anna felt sorry . they realized that they were wrong . they hugged mom and ben . they said , " we are sorry , mom . we are sorry , ben . we love you . we will not shut the door and lock it again . we will be nice to you . we will play with you and share our toys and our dog . "

mom smiled and kissed them . she said , " i am glad you learned your lesson . i love you all . now let 's go to the kitchen and have some cookies and milk . "

the moral of the story is : you should love and respect your family , especially the ones who are smaller and weaker than you . you should not shut them out or ignore them . you should help them and make them happy . ben and mia were hungry . they wanted to eat waffles for breakfast . mom said they could make waffles with the waffle maker . she showed them how to pour the batter and close the lid .

ben and mia waited for the waffle maker to beep . they smelled the yummy waffles . they wanted to eat them right away . but mom said they had to yield . yield means to wait and let someone else go first .

" who will get the first waffle ? " mom asked .

" me ! " ben said .

" me ! " mia said .

they both reached for the waffle . they pulled and tugged . the waffle broke in half . ben and mia were sad . they looked at the broken waffle . they looked at mom . they were confused .

" why did you break the waffle ? " mom asked .

" we both wanted it ! " ben said .

" we did n't want to yield ! " mia said .

mom sighed . she said , " yielding is not bad . it is good . it means you are kind and fair . it means you share and care . it makes everyone happy . do you want to be happy ? "

ben and mia nodded . they said , " yes , we want to be happy . "

mom smiled . she said , " then let 's make another waffle . and this time , you can take turns . ben , you can get the first half . mia , you can get the second half . and then you can swap and try each other 's waffles . how does that sound ? "

ben and mia liked that idea . they said , " that sounds good ! "

they made another waffle . they yielded . they shared . they cared . they ate the waffles . they were happy . mom was happy too . she said , " you are good kids . i love you . "

ben and mia hugged mom . they said , " we love you too , mom . and we love waffles ! " sara loved to paint . she had many colors and brushes . she liked to paint flowers and trees and animals . she painted every day on big papers .

one day , a storm came . the sky was dark and loud . the rain was fast and hard . sara was scared . she could not paint outside . she wanted to paint the storm , but she had no paper .

she saw a big wall in her room . it was white and empty . she had an idea . she took her colors and brushes . she painted the storm on the wall . she painted the sky and the rain and the wind . she painted a big thunder and a bright lightning . she painted a rainbow and a sun .

she was happy . she made a beautiful painting . she showed her mom and dad . they were surprised . they said she was very talented . they took a picture of her painting . they sent it to a magazine . the magazine liked her painting . they put it on the cover . sara became famous . she was proud . she loved to paint . tom was a little boy who liked to play with his toys . he had a lot of cars , trains , and planes that he zoomed around the floor . he also had a teddy bear that he hugged and talked to . he loved his teddy bear very much .

one day , tom was playing with his toys in his room . he heard his mom call him for lunch . he was hungry , so he got up and ran to the kitchen . he forgot to put his teddy bear away . he left it on the floor near the door .

after lunch , tom 's dad came home from work . he was tired and wanted to take a shower . he went to the bathroom and opened the door . he did not see tom 's teddy bear on the floor . he stepped on it and it made a loud squeak . he was surprised and lost his balance . he fell down and hit his head on the sink .

tom heard the noise and ran to the bathroom . he saw his dad on the floor and his teddy bear under his foot . he was scared and sad . he cried and shouted , " daddy , daddy , are you okay ? teddy , teddy , are you okay ? "

his mom heard him and came to the bathroom . she saw what happened and called for help . she helped his dad get up and checked his head . he had a bump and a cut , but he was okay . she hugged him and said , " do n't worry , daddy , you 'll be fine . "

she also picked up tom 's teddy bear and gave it to him . she said , " do n't worry , tom , your teddy bear is fine too . he 's a brave bear . he saved your dad from falling harder . he 's a hero . "

tom hugged his teddy bear and said , " thank you , teddy , for saving daddy . i 'm sorry i left you on the floor . i love you , teddy . "

he also hugged his dad and said , " i love you , daddy . i 'm sorry you got hurt . are you feeling better ? "

his dad hugged him back and said , " i love you too , tom . i 'm feeling better . it was an accident . i 'm sorry i stepped on your teddy bear . he 's a good bear . he saved me . "

they all smiled and hugged each other . they were happy that they were okay . they went to the living room and watched a movie together . they had popcorn and juice . they forgot about the miserable bathroom . they had a good time . ben and sam are brothers . they like to play outside . they have a big yard with a swing , a slide and a sandbox . one day , they see a new thing in the yard . it is a big box with a red tie on it .

" look , ben , a box ! " sam says . " what is in it ? "

" i do n't know , sam . let 's open it ! " ben says . they run to the box and pull the tie . the box opens and they see a lot of toys inside . there are cars , balls , blocks and books .

" wow , so many toys ! " sam says . " can we play with them ? "

" yes , we can , sam . but we have to be careful . these toys are clean and new . we do n't want to make them dirty or break them . " ben says . he picks up a car and makes it zoom on the grass .

sam nods . he picks up a ball and throws it in the air . he tries to catch it , but he misses . the ball bounces away and rolls under the slide .

" oops , i lost the ball ! " sam says . he runs after the ball . he bends down to get it , but he sees something else under the slide . it is a big spider with long legs and hairy body .

" ah , a spider ! " sam screams . he jumps back and steps on a block . the block hurts his foot and he falls down . he starts to cry .

" sam , what 's wrong ? " ben says . he hears sam 's cry and drops the car . he runs to sam and sees the spider and the block . he is not afraid of spiders . he picks up the ball and throws it at the spider . the spider runs away .

" it 's okay , sam . the spider is gone . you are brave . " ben says . he helps sam stand up and hugs him . he looks at sam 's foot and sees a red mark . he says , " does your foot hurt ? "

" a little bit , ben . thank you for saving me from the spider . " sam says . he smiles and hugs ben back . he says , " you are a good brother . "

they walk back to the box and put the toys inside . they close the box and tie the tie . they say , " we will play with the toys later . but first , we have to wash our hands and feet . we want to be clean and healthy . "

they go inside the house and find their mom . she sees them and says , " what have you been doing , boys ? "

" we found a box with toys , mom . but we also found a spider and a block . ben saved me from the spider and i stepped on the block . " sam says .

" oh , my , that sounds like an adventure . i 'm glad you are okay , sam . and i 'm proud of you , ben . you are a good brother . " mom says . she kisses them and says , " let me see your foot , sam . and then , let 's wash your hands and feet . and then , you can have a snack and tell me more about the box and the toys . "

ben and sam nod . they follow their mom and wash their hands and feet . they have a snack and tell their mom about the box and the toys . they are happy and excited . they ca n't wait to play with the toys again . but they also remember to be careful and clean . and they love each other very much . lily and ben were friends who liked to play with a big red ball . they would bounce the ball to each other and catch it with their hands . sometimes they would bounce the ball very high and try to jump and touch it . they had a lot of fun with the ball .

one day , they saw a new boy in the park . his name was sam and he had a small blue ball . he was bouncing his ball by himself and looked sad . lily and ben wanted to be nice and asked him a question . they said , " do you want to play with us and our big red ball ? "

sam was happy and said , " yes , thank you ! " he ran to join them and they bounced the ball together . they took turns and shared the ball . they laughed and had more fun than before .

but then , something bad happened . the big red ball bounced too far and went into the street . a car came and hit the ball . the ball popped and made a loud noise . lily , ben and sam were scared and sad . they lost their ball .

lily and ben started to cry . they said , " we loved our big red ball . it was our favorite toy . now we have nothing to play with . " they looked at sam and his small blue ball . they wanted to take his ball and bounce it .

but sam was kind and said , " do n't cry . you can play with my ball . it is not as big or as red as your ball , but it can still bounce . it is not important what the ball looks like . it is important who you play with . you are my friends and i want to share with you . "

lily and ben smiled and said , " thank you , sam . you are very nice and generous . you are right . it is not important what the ball looks like . it is important who you play with . you are our friend and we want to share with you too . "

they hugged sam and took his small blue ball . they bounced it together and had fun again . they learned a lesson . they learned that sharing is caring and that friendship is more valuable than any toy . anna and ben were twins . they liked to play together . they also liked to give each other presents on their birthday . their birthday was soon .

one day , anna saw a big box in the closet . she thought it was a present for her . she wanted to see what was inside . she tried to open the box , but it was too heavy . she was clumsy and dropped the box . it made a loud noise .

" anna , what are you doing ? " ben asked . he came into the room . he saw the box on the floor . he was angry . " that is my present for you ! you spoiled the surprise ! "

" i 'm sorry , ben . i did n't know . i was curious . please do n't be mad at me , " anna said . she felt bad .

ben sighed . he picked up the box . he looked at it . it was not broken . he smiled . " it 's okay , anna . i forgive you . but you have to promise me something . do n't try to open your presents before your birthday . it will ruin the fun . let me prevent you from doing that . "

anna nodded . she hugged ben . " i promise , ben . thank you for being nice to me . and thank you for the present . i ca n't wait to see what it is . "

ben hugged anna back . " you 're welcome , anna . i love you . and i hope you like the present . it is something special . " lily and max are twins . they like to play in the park with their mom and dad . but today , they have to go to a big house with their aunt and uncle . they do not like the big house . it is too quiet and boring .

the big house has many things that lily and max do not have . it has a big pool , a big tv , a big bed , and a big car . mom and dad say these things are luxury . but lily and max do not care . they want to play with their toys and run and jump .

aunt and uncle are grumpy . they do not like noise and mess . they tell lily and max to sit still and be quiet . they do not let them touch anything . they do not smile or laugh . they only look at their phones and books .

lily and max are sad and angry . they do not want to stay in the big house . they want to go back to the park . they miss their mom and dad . they whisper to each other and make a plan .

when aunt and uncle are not looking , lily and max run to the door . they open it and run outside . they see the big car . they jump in and pretend to drive . they honk the horn and make loud noises . they have fun .

aunt and uncle hear the noise and come outside . they are very grumpy . they yell at lily and max and take them out of the car . they say they are naughty and bad . they say they will call mom and dad .

lily and max do not care . they smile and hug each other . they are happy . they hope mom and dad will come soon and take them to the park . they do not like luxury . they like to play . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in the park with their mom and dad . one day , they see a big hill in the park . they want to climb the hill and see the view .

" can we go up the hill , mom ? " anna asks .

" sure , but be careful . it is steep and rocky . hold my hand , " mom says .

anna and ben hold mom 's hand and start to climb the hill . they see many interesting things on the way . they see flowers , bugs , birds , and stones . they are happy and curious .

but when they reach the top of the hill , ben feels scared . he looks down and sees how high they are . he sees the cars , the houses , the trees , and the people . they look very small and far away . he worries that he might fall .

" mom , i do n't like it here . it is too high . i want to go down , " ben says .

" it 's okay , ben . you are safe with me . look , anna is enjoying the view . she is not afraid . do you want to see what she sees ? " mom says .

" no , thank you . i just want to go down . please , mom , " ben says .

mom hugs ben and says , " all right , we can go down . but do n't worry , ben . you are brave and strong . you climbed the hill with me . that is a big achievement . i am proud of you . "

mom , anna , and ben hold hands and go down the hill . they are careful and slow . when they reach the bottom , ben feels better . he smiles and says , " thank you , mom . i love you . "

" i love you too , ben . and i love you , anna . you are both wonderful , " mom says .

they hug and kiss and go back to play in the park . they have a fun and happy day . lily and ben were playing with their toy soldiers in the garden . they liked to make them march and fight and say " yes , sir ! " and " no , sir ! " they pretended they were the bosses of the soldiers and gave them orders .

one day , they saw an enormous bird in the sky . it was black and white and had a long neck and big wings . it was a swan . the swan flew over the garden and saw the toy soldiers . it thought they were food . it swooped down and grabbed one of the soldiers in its beak .

" hey , that 's mine ! " ben shouted . he ran after the swan and tried to get his soldier back . lily followed him . the swan flew away with the soldier and landed on the pond . it tried to eat the soldier , but it was hard and plastic . it spat it out and made a loud noise .

" give it back , give it back ! " ben yelled . he threw a stick at the swan , but he missed . the swan looked at him and said " give it back , give it back ! " it repeated what ben said .

" wow , it can talk ! " lily said . she clapped her hands and laughed . she wanted to talk to the swan too . she said " hello , swan , hello ! " the swan looked at her and said " hello , swan , hello ! " it repeated what lily said .

ben and lily were amazed . they forgot about the soldier and started to talk to the swan . they asked it questions and it repeated their words . they had fun with the swan and became friends . the swan gave the soldier back to ben and said " sorry , sorry ! " ben said " it 's okay , it 's okay ! " he smiled and hugged the soldier . lily said " thank you , thank you ! " she waved at the swan . the swan said " you 're welcome , you 're welcome ! " it flapped its wings and flew away . ben and lily waved goodbye and went back to their game . they had a new story to tell . lily and max were best friends . they liked to play with toys and make up stories . one day , they found a big box in the garage . they decided to make it into a helicopter .

" i will be the pilot and you will be the co - pilot , " max said . he put on a hat and a scarf . " are you ready to fly ? "

" yes , i am , " lily said . she put on a necklace and a bracelet . " but first , we have to get married . "

" married ? " max asked . he did not like that idea . " why do we have to get married ? "

" because that 's what people do when they love each other , " lily said . she took max 's hand and tried to put a ring on his finger . " and i love you , max . "

" but i do n't want to get married , " max said . he pulled his hand away . " i just want to fly the helicopter . "

lily was sad . she did not understand why max did not want to marry her . she thought he loved her too . she started to cry .

" please do n't cry , lily , " max said . he felt sorry for making her sad . " i do love you , but i 'm not ready to get married . maybe when we are older . "

" really ? " lily asked . she wiped her tears . " do you promise ? "

