" okay , " lily said . she smiled . " but you have to be patient with me . i do n't know how to fly a helicopter . "

" i will teach you , " max said . he helped her get into the box . " it 's easy and fun . you 'll see . "

they pretended to fly the helicopter around the garage . they had a lot of fun . they forgot about getting married . they were happy to be best friends . anna liked to help her mom bake pastries in the kitchen . she would roll the dough , cut out shapes , and sprinkle sugar on top . her mom would put them in the oven and make them warm and yummy .

one day , anna wanted to make a special pastry for her dad . she asked her mom if she could use the blueberries from the fridge . her mom said yes , but only a few . anna nodded and took the blueberries to the table .

she made a round pastry and put some blueberries in the middle . she folded the dough over and pressed the edges . she was very proud of her pastry . she put it on a tray with the other pastries and waited for her mom to bake them .

but then , her brother ben came into the kitchen . he was hungry and saw the tray of pastries . he did not know that anna made a special one for her dad . he picked up the round pastry and took a big bite .

anna saw him and shouted , " no , ben , that 's for dad ! give it back ! "

ben was surprised and tried to say sorry , but he had his mouth full . he snapped at anna and said , " mmm , it 's good . i want it . "

anna was angry and sad . she ran to her mom and told her what ben did . her mom scolded ben and made him spit out the pastry . she hugged anna and said , " do n't worry , sweetie . we can make another one for dad . he will love it no matter what . "

