they run to get their coats and shoes . they follow dad to the car .

they go to the park and have a lot of fun . they swing , slide , run and play . they see some funny animals and flowers . they laugh and giggle .

they forget about the rug . they are happy . lily and ben liked to build things with their blocks . they made houses , cars , castles and more . they had fun playing with their blocks and sharing them .

one day , they wanted to build something new . they looked out the window and saw the sky . it was blue and sunny , with some white clouds . lily had an idea .

