they hug . they are friends . they go to the well . they drink some water . they are thirsty . they play some more . they have fun . lily loved her pretty dress . it was pink and had flowers on it . she liked to twirl and dance in it . but she was not allowed to wear it today . mommy said it was too dirty and she had to wear a blue dress instead .

lily was angry . she did not like the blue dress . it was boring and had no flowers . she wanted to wear her pretty dress . she had an idea . she waited until mommy was busy in the kitchen . then she ran to her room and took her pretty dress from the closet . she put it on and hid the blue dress under the bed .

she went back to the living room and smiled . she hoped mommy would not notice . she started to twirl and dance in her pretty dress . she felt happy .

but mommy did notice . she came out of the kitchen and saw lily in her pretty dress . she was not happy . she frowned and said , " lily , what are you doing ? why are you wearing your pretty dress ? i told you it was too dirty and you had to wear the blue dress . you did not listen to me . you were naughty . "

