lily nodded and said , " yes , mommy . i understand . i 'm sorry , mommy . " she went to her room and did what mommy said . she felt sad . she wished she could wear her pretty dress . she wished mommy was not mad at her . she hoped mommy would forgive her . she hoped mommy would still love her . tom and lily were friends . they liked to play in the park . they liked to swing and slide and run . one day , they saw a big balloon in the sky . it was red and shiny and had a string .

