they went to the swing set and daddy helped ashley swing . they went down the slide and she rode on a bike . ashley had so much fun at the park yesterday ! once upon a time there was an adorable little girl called dolly . dolly was three years old and lived in a house with her mummy and daddy . one day , mummy and daddy were out shopping and dolly was alone at home . she had her favourite rag toy to play with , but the rag toy got stuck between the couch cushions .

