one day , ben was feeling sick . he had a sore throat and a fever . his mom took a thermometer and put it in his mouth . she looked at the number and said , " oh , ben , you have a high temperature . you need to rest and drink some water . you ca n't go outside and play today . "

ben was sad . he wanted to play with his red car . he asked his mom , " can i at least take my red car to bed with me ? "

his mom smiled and said , " of course , you can . your red car is your special toy . you can include it in your bed . but you have to promise me you will stay in bed and try to sleep . "

ben nodded and hugged his red car . he went to his bed and put his red car next to his pillow . he felt a little better with his red car by his side .

