they smiled and played together . they had fun . they forgot about the wet and brown picture . tom and lily wanted to make a cake for mom 's birthday . they found a recipe in a book and got all the things they needed . they put flour , sugar , eggs , butter and milk in a big bowl . then they saw a mixer on the counter .

