tom and lily wished they had not fought . they wished they had been nice to each other . they wished they had their toys to throw at the dog . they wished they had their moms to hug them . but it was too late . the dog caught them and hurt them . they cried and cried . they learned a hard lesson . they should not disagree so much . they should be friends . ben and lily liked to play with tape . they had many colors of tape and they used it to make shapes and pictures on the wall . sometimes they also used it to stick things together , like paper or toys . they had a lot of fun with tape .

one day , they found a big roll of tape in the garage . it was shiny and silver and very sticky . they wanted to play with it , but they knew it was not theirs . it was dad 's tape and he used it for his work . they were anxious because they did not want to get in trouble , but they also wanted to try the tape .

they decided to take a little bit of the tape and use it in their room . they thought dad would not notice . they took the tape and ran to their room . they started to make a big star on the wall with the tape . it was very pretty and sparkly .

but then they heard dad coming . he was looking for his tape . he needed it for his project . he was angry and he shouted , " who took my tape ? " ben and lily were scared . they knew they had done something bad . they did not know what to do .

they decided to release the tape from the wall and give it back to dad . they hoped he would forgive them . they pulled the tape from the wall , but it was very hard . the tape was too sticky and it ripped the paint off the wall . it made a big mess . ben and lily cried . they were sorry and they said , " we are sorry , dad . we just wanted to play with the tape . we did not mean to ruin the wall . "

dad came to their room and saw the tape and the wall . he was very upset . he said , " you should not have taken my tape . it is not a toy . it is for my work . and you should not have put it on the wall . it is very bad for the wall . you have to be more careful and respectful of other people 's things . "

ben and lily felt very bad . they said , " we are sorry , dad . we will not do it again . we will help you fix the wall . we will help you with your project . we love you , dad . "

dad hugged them and said , " i love you too , ben and lily . i know you did not mean to cause trouble . but you have to learn from your mistake . next time , ask me before you use something that is not yours . and do not play with things that are not safe or appropriate for you . ok ? "

ben and lily nodded and said , " ok , dad . we understand . we are sorry . we love you , dad . "

dad smiled and said , " i love you too , ben and lily . now let 's go and clean up this mess . and then we can find something else to play with . something that is not tape . " anna likes to go to the farm with her mom and dad . she likes to see the animals and feed them . one day , she sees a new animal . it is white and fluffy . it has four legs and a long tail . it makes a sound like " baa " .

" what is that , mom ? " anna asks .

" that is a sheep , anna . it is a friendly animal . do you want to meet it ? " mom says .

anna nods . she walks to the fence with mom . the sheep comes closer . it looks at anna with big eyes . anna reaches out her hand . the sheep sniffs it . then it licks it . anna giggles .

" hello , sheep . you are soft and warm . i like you , " anna says .

the sheep baa 's again . it rubs its head on anna 's hand . anna pets it . she feels happy .

" can we take it home , mom ? " anna asks .

mom smiles . she shakes her head .

" no , anna . the sheep belongs to the farm . it has a home here . it has other sheep to play with . it is safe and happy here . we can visit it again , but we can not take it home , " mom says .

anna understands . she hugs the sheep . she says goodbye . she waves to the other animals . she holds mom 's hand . they go back to the car .

anna had a fun day at the farm . she met a new friend . she learned a new word . she ca n't wait to come back . tim and tom were brothers who liked to play with fire . they had a box of matches that they stole from their dad . one day , they decided to go to the park and burn some leaves and sticks . they thought it was fun to watch the fire and the smoke .

" look , tom , the fire is so big and bright ! " tim said .

" yes , and the smoke is so thick and black ! " tom said .

they did not see that the smoke was going up to the sky . they did not hear that some people were shouting and calling for help . they did not care that they were making a big mess and danger .

soon , a big red truck came to the park . it had a loud siren and a long hose . it was a fire truck . the firemen jumped out of the truck and ran to the fire . they sprayed water on the fire and put it out . they also saw tim and tom hiding behind a tree .

" hey , you two , come here ! " one of the firemen said . " did you start this fire ? "

tim and tom were scared . they knew they were in trouble . they tried to run away , but the firemen caught them .

" why did you do this ? do you know how stupid and dangerous this is ? " another fireman said . " you could have burned the whole park , or hurt yourself or someone else . you are very naughty and irresponsible ! "

the firemen took tim and tom to their dad . their dad was very angry and sad . he scolded them and punished them . he also had to pay a lot of money for the damage they caused . tim and tom felt very sorry and ashamed . they wished they never played with fire .

the moral of the story is : playing with fire is stupid and dangerous . it can burn you , or someone else , or something else . it can make a lot of smoke and trouble . you should never play with fire , or steal matches , or lie to your dad . you should listen to the firemen and be good and safe . tom and lily liked to play with stamps . they had a big box of stamps with different pictures and colors . they used the stamps to make cards and drawings for their friends and family .

one day , they found a new stamp in the box . it was a big stamp with a lion on it . it looked very playful and friendly . tom and lily wanted to try it out . they took some paper and ink and stamped the lion on it . they liked how it looked .

but then , they heard a loud roar . they turned around and saw a real lion in their room . it had escaped from the zoo and found its way into their house . it saw the stamp and thought it was another lion . it wanted to play with it .

tom and lily were very scared . they panicked and ran to the door . but the door was locked . they did not know what to do . they hoped that someone would come and help them .

luckily , their mom heard the roar and came to see what was going on . she saw the lion and the stamp and realized what had happened . she called the zoo and asked them to send someone to take the lion back . she also opened the door and hugged tom and lily . she told them that they were brave and that everything was okay .

tom and lily were happy that their mom was there . they apologized for using the stamp and said they would not do it again . they also said they were sorry for the lion and hoped it would find a good home . they learned that stamps were fun , but not as fun as real animals . lily and ben like to play in the garden . they dig holes and look for shiny things . sometimes they find rocks with colors and sparkles . they call them minerals . they put them in a box and show them to mom .

one day , they find a big mineral that is black and rough . it has red eyes and sharp teeth . it looks like a monster . lily and ben are very scared . they drop the mineral and run away .

" help , help ! " they cry . " there is a monster in the garden ! "

mom hears them and comes outside . she sees the mineral and laughs .

" that is not a monster , my dears . that is a fossil . it is a very old animal that turned into a rock . it can not hurt you . it is just a mineral . "

lily and ben look at the fossil . they touch it and feel that it is hard and cold . they are not scared anymore . they are curious .

" wow , that is a clever animal . how did it turn into a rock ? " lily asks .

mom explains that fossils are made when animals die and get buried under the dirt . over a long time , the dirt and water change the animal into a rock . she says that fossils can tell us about the past and the different animals that lived before .

lily and ben think that fossils are amazing . they want to learn more about them . they put the fossil in their box and thank mom for teaching them . they are happy that they found a clever mineral that was not a monster . tom and sue were very happy . they were going to fly in a plane . they had never flown in a plane before . they packed their bags and said goodbye to their dog .

they went to the big place where the planes were . they showed their tickets to a nice lady . she gave them stickers with numbers . they followed the signs to find their plane .

they entered the plane . it was very different from a car or a bus . it had many seats and windows . it had a long aisle and a big door . they found their seats and buckled their belts . they looked out the window and saw the wings and the wheels .

a man with a hat and a microphone spoke to them . he said they were ready to fly . he told them to listen to the ladies in blue . they would help them if they needed anything .

the plane started to move . it went faster and faster . then it lifted off the ground . tom and sue felt a funny feeling in their stomachs . they looked out the window and saw the clouds and the sky . they smiled and held hands . they were flying in a plane . they were very happy . lily and ben were playing with their toys in the living room . lily had a doll that she loved very much . she named her doll anna and gave her a pink dress and a hat . ben had a car that he liked to zoom around the floor . he named his car bob and gave him a blue sticker and a horn .

one day , lily and ben decided to swap their toys for a while . they thought it would be fun to try something new . lily took bob and made him drive on the couch . ben took anna and made her sit on the table . they were having a good time until they heard a loud rip .

" oh no ! " lily cried . she looked at bob and saw that his blue sticker had torn off . she felt very bad . she knew that ben loved his sticker . she picked up bob and examined him . she tried to fix the sticker , but it was too late . it was broken .

" hey , what happened ? " ben asked . he came over and saw lily holding bob . he saw the ripped sticker and felt very sad . he loved his sticker . it was original . he had made it himself . he took bob from lily and examined him . he tried to stick the sticker back , but it was too late . it was broken .

" i 'm sorry , ben , " lily said . " i did n't mean to break your sticker . i was just playing with bob . he is a very nice car . "

" i know , lily , " ben said . " i 'm sorry , too . i did n't mean to make you worry . i was just playing with anna . she is a very pretty doll . "

lily and ben looked at each other . they felt sorry for each other . they hugged and said they were still friends . they decided to swap their toys back . they thought it was better to play with their own toys . they loved their toys very much . they were original . they had given them names and things . they were happy . lily liked to draw and paint . she was very creative . she made pictures of animals , flowers , and people . she used many colors and shapes . she was happy when she showed her art to her family and friends .

one day , lily wanted to make a big picture of her hero . her hero was her big brother , ben . he was kind , brave , and strong . he helped her with many things . he played with her and read to her . lily loved him very much .

she found a big piece of paper and some crayons . she started to draw ben 's face , hair , and eyes . she wanted to make him look very good . she used her favorite colors . she was having fun .

but then , she ran out of space . she wanted to draw ben 's body , arms , and legs . but there was no more room on the paper . she was sad . she did not know what to do . she did not want to waste her paper . she did not want to start over .

she thought hard . she had an idea . she decided to stretch her paper . she took some tape and scissors . she cut the paper in half . she taped the two pieces together . she made the paper longer . she was smart .

she finished her picture . she drew ben 's body , arms , and legs . she added some details , like his shirt , pants , and shoes . she wrote his name and " my hero " on the paper . she was proud .

she showed her picture to ben . he was surprised and happy . he hugged her and thanked her . he said he liked her picture very much . he said she was very creative and clever . he said she was his hero too . they smiled .

the moral of the story is : you can use your creativity to solve problems and make something beautiful . you can also show your love and appreciation to your hero . lily was a little girl who liked to play with her toys . she had a doll , a bear , a ball and a book . she loved her toys very much and gave them names . her doll was anna , her bear was bob , her ball was charlie and her book was dave .

one day , lily was playing with her toys in her room . she made them talk to each other and have fun . she made anna and bob dance , charlie and dave play catch , and then she read dave to all of them . she was very happy and smiled a lot .

but then , she heard a loud noise from outside . she looked out of her window and saw a big truck . the truck was very noisy and scary . it came to her house and stopped . lily was worried . she did not know what the truck wanted . she hugged her toys and ran to her mom .

mom was in the kitchen . she saw lily and her toys . she saw that lily was worried . she asked her what was wrong . lily told her about the truck . mom smiled and said , " do n't be worried , lily . the truck is here to help us . it is here to take some of our old things to a new place . we are going to move to a new house soon . a new house with a big yard and a swing . you will like it there . you can bring your toys with you . they will be happy too . "

lily was not worried anymore . she was curious . she asked mom if she could see the new house . mom said yes . she took lily and her toys to the car . they drove to the new house . it was very pretty and bright . lily saw the big yard and the swing . she was excited . she ran to the swing and asked mom to push her . she laughed and smiled . she looked at her toys and said , " this is our new home . we will be happy here . " her toys smiled too . they were happy . lily liked to play with her pepper toy . it was red and green and had a funny face . she pretended it was her friend and talked to it .

" hello , pepper . do you want to play a game ? " she asked .

" yes , lily . what game do you want to play ? " the pepper answered .

lily thought for a moment . she liked to win . she looked around her room and saw her blocks , her books , and her puzzles .

" let 's play puzzles . i have a big one with animals . you can help me find the pieces , " she said .

the pepper agreed . they went to the floor and opened the puzzle box . lily started to look for the edges . the pepper tried to help , but it was hard . it had no hands , only a stem .

" lily , i ca n't hold the pieces . can you help me ? " the pepper asked .

lily looked at the pepper . she felt sorry for it . but she also wanted to be independent . she wanted to do the puzzle by herself .

" no , pepper . you can watch . i can do it . i am a big girl , " she said .

the pepper felt sad . it wanted to play with lily . it wanted to be her friend . it did not like to watch .

" lily , please . let me play with you . i want to have fun . i want to be your friend , " the pepper said .

lily heard the pepper . she saw its face . it looked sad . she thought for a moment . she liked to win . but she also liked to be kind . she liked to have friends .

" okay , pepper . you can play with me . you can tell me where the pieces go . we can do it together . we can be friends , " she said .

the pepper smiled . it was happy . it thanked lily . they started to do the puzzle together . they had fun . they were friends . they both won . tom and amy are friends . they like to play outside . one day , it is raining . tom and amy want to have fun .

" let 's choose a game , " tom says . " we can play with the ball , or the cars , or the dolls . "

" i want to play with the dolls , " amy says . " they are pretty and nice . "

" no , dolls are boring , " tom says . " i want to play with the cars . they are fast and cool . "

tom and amy do not agree . they start to argue . they do not share . they do not listen . they are not quiet .

mom hears them . she is angry . she comes outside . she sees tom and amy fighting . she sees the toys on the wet grass . she sees the mud on their clothes .

" stop it , both of you ! " mom says . " you are being naughty and rude . you are making a mess . you are not playing nicely . you have to go inside . no more toys for today . "

tom and amy are sad . they are sorry . they want to play . but mom does not change her mind . she takes them inside . she makes them sit on the couch . she does not let them watch tv . she does not let them have a snack . she does not let them talk .

tom and amy are bored . they are hungry . they are lonely . they wish they had chosen a different game . they wish they had been quiet . they wish they had been good . but it is too late . they have to wait until tomorrow . maybe then they can play outside again . maybe then they can be friends again . ben and mia were twins who liked to play together . they had many toys , but their favorite was a big teddy bear . they named him mr. fuzz and gave him a red scarf and a blue hat . they hugged him , talked to him , and took him everywhere .

one day , their mom said they had to go to the doctor . she said the doctor would check their ears and give them a shot . ben and mia were scared . they did not like the doctor or the shot . they wanted to stay home with mr. fuzz .

" can we take mr. fuzz with us ? " ben asked .

" sure , you can , " mom said . " but you have to share him . he ca n't sit on both of your laps at the same time . "

ben and mia nodded . they agreed to share mr. fuzz . they put him in a bag and went to the car .

at the doctor 's office , they waited in a room with other kids . some of them were crying . ben and mia felt nervous . they took mr. fuzz out of the bag and held him tight .

" ben , it 's your turn , " mom said . " come with me . "

ben did not want to go . he wanted to stay with mia and mr. fuzz . he clutched the teddy bear and shook his head .

" please , ben , be brave , " mom said . " it will be over soon . and you can have a yummy treat after . "

ben looked at mia . she smiled and said , " it 's okay , ben . i 'll wait for you here . and you can have mr. fuzz back when you 're done . "

ben felt a little better . he trusted mia . he gave her mr. fuzz and followed mom to the doctor .

the doctor was nice . he looked at ben 's ears and said they were healthy . he gave him a shot and said it was to keep him from getting sick . it hurt a little , but not too much . ben was brave and did not cry .

" good job , ben , " the doctor said . " you did great . here 's a sticker for you . and you can have a yummy treat from the jar . "

ben smiled and picked a lollipop . he thanked the doctor and went back to the room . he saw mia holding mr. fuzz . she looked happy to see him .

" ben , you 're back ! " mia said . " how was it ? "

" it was not so bad , " ben said . " the doctor was nice . and i got a sticker and a lollipop . look ! "

" wow , that 's awesome ! " mia said . " can i have a bite ? "

ben nodded . he shared his lollipop with mia . he also gave her his sticker . he said , " thank you for letting me have mr. fuzz . he helped me be brave . do you want to hold him again ? "

mia smiled and said , " no , thank you . you can have him . he 's your friend . and you were very brave . i 'm proud of you . "

ben and mia hugged each other and mr. fuzz . they were happy . they learned to share and to accept things that scared them . they knew they had each other and mr. fuzz to help them . they were the best twins ever . one day , a mole was digging in the ground . he liked to make tunnels and find food . he was very hungry , so he dug deeper and deeper . he did not see the trap that a farmer had set for him .

the trap was a big metal thing with sharp teeth . when the mole touched it , it snapped shut and hurt him a lot . he tried to get out , but he could not . he felt very scared and sad .

a mouse came by and saw the mole in the trap . he felt sorry for him and wanted to help . he said , " hello , mole . i am a mouse . you are in a trap . it is very bad . do you want me to offer you some cheese ? maybe it will make you feel better . "

the mole looked at the mouse and said , " thank you , mouse . you are very kind . but i do not want cheese . i want to be free . can you open the trap for me ? "

the mouse said , " i will try , mole . but it is very hard . the trap is very strong . i have to be careful not to get hurt too . "

the mouse tried to open the trap with his teeth and his paws . he pulled and pushed and bit and scratched . but he could not open it . he got tired and sore . he said , " i am sorry , mole . i can not open the trap . it is too hard for me . maybe someone else can help you . "

the mole said , " it is okay , mouse . you did your best . you are a good friend . but i think i will not make it . i feel very weak and cold . i think i will die soon . "

the mouse said , " no , mole . do not say that . do not give up . maybe someone will come and save you . maybe the farmer will change his mind and let you go . maybe a big bird will come and break the trap . do not lose hope , mole . "

the mole said , " thank you , mouse . but i do not think so . i think this is the end for me . goodbye , mouse . i hope you have a good life . i hope you find a lot of cheese and a nice home . i hope you are happy . "

the mouse said , " goodbye , mole . i will miss you . you are a brave and nice mole . i hope you find peace and rest . i hope you are happy too . "

the mole closed his eyes and stopped breathing . he was dead . the mouse cried and said , " i am sorry , mole . i wish i could have helped you . i wish you were still alive . you are my friend . "

the farmer came and saw the mole in the trap . he was happy and said , " ha ! i got you , you pesky mole . you will not dig in my land anymore . you will not eat my crops anymore . you will not bother me anymore . you are dead . "

he took the mole out of the trap and threw him away . he did not see the mouse . he did not care about the mole . he did not know that the mole had a friend . he did not know that the mole had a story . he did not know that the mole had a life . he was a bad farmer . sara was having a birthday party . she wanted to invite all her friends to play and eat cake and jelly . she made cards with stickers and glitter and wrote her name on them . she gave one to lily , one to ben , one to sam and one to tom .

but tom was a fat boy who liked to be mean . he did not like sara or her cards . he tore his card and threw it on the floor . he said , " i do n't want to go to your stupid party . your cake and jelly are yucky . you are a baby and your friends are silly . "

sara felt sad and angry . she did not know why tom was so rude . she said , " you are a bad boy , tom . you are not my friend anymore . you ca n't come to my party . go away and leave me alone . "

tom did not care . he laughed and ran away . he saw a big dog on the street . he thought it would be fun to tease the dog . he threw a stick at the dog and shouted , " hey , you fat dog , come and get me . you are too slow and dumb to catch me . "

but the dog did not like tom either . the dog was angry and scared . the dog ran after tom and bit him on the leg . tom screamed and cried . he wished he had been nice to sara and her friends . he wished he had gone to her party . he wished he had eaten cake and jelly . but it was too late . he had to go to the hospital and get a shot . he had no friends and no fun . he was sorry . ben and lily are friends . they like to play with blocks and cars and dolls . they have a lot of toys in their room . but sometimes they forget to put them away . then their room is messy and their mom is not happy .

one day , mom says , " ben and lily , you have to gather your toys and make your room tidy . if you do , you can have a treat . but if you do n't , you ca n't go to the park . "

ben and lily want to go to the park . they love to swing and slide and run . but they have so many toys to gather . they feel tired and bored . they start to whine and cry .

mom hears them and comes to their room . she says , " ben and lily , why are you crying ? you can gather your toys faster and easier if you work as a team . a team is when you help each other and share the work . then you can have fun and finish sooner . "

ben and lily think about it . they decide to try to be a team . they pick up their blocks and cars and dolls and put them in their boxes and baskets and shelves . they help each other and say thank you and good job . they make their room tidy and neat .

mom sees their room and smiles . she says , " ben and lily , you did a great job ! you gathered your toys and made your room tidy . you worked as a team and you were kind and polite . i 'm very proud of you . now you can have a treat and go to the park . "

ben and lily are happy . they hug mom and say thank you . they get their treat and go to the park . they swing and slide and run . they have fun and laugh . they are a good team . mia and ben were playing in the park with their mom . they liked to slide , swing , and run around . but it was getting cold and windy , and mom said they had to go home soon .

" can we play for five more minutes , please ? " mia asked .

" okay , but only five minutes . and put on your sweaters , or you will catch a cold , " mom said .

mia and ben put on their sweaters and ran to the merry - go - round . they climbed on and asked mom to spin them . mom spun them faster and faster , and they laughed and screamed .

" wow , this is fun ! " ben said .

" i feel dizzy ! " mia said .

mom stopped the merry - go - round and helped them get off . mia and ben felt wobbly and giggly .

" are you okay ? " mom asked .

" yes , we are okay . but we are very dizzy , " mia said .

" maybe you should sit down for a while and drink some water , " mom said .

mia and ben nodded and followed mom to a bench . they drank some water and felt better .

" mom , can we mention something ? " ben asked .

" sure , what is it ? " mom asked .

" we love you very much , and we had a lot of fun today , " ben said .

mia hugged mom and said , " yes , we love you very much , and we are happy . "

mom smiled and hugged them back . she said , " i love you too , very much . and i 'm glad you had fun . but now it 's time to go home and have some dinner . "

mia and ben agreed and held mom 's hand . they walked home , feeling warm and cozy in their sweaters . lily and ben were playing with blocks in the living room . they liked to build towers and houses with different shapes and colors . lily had a lot of triangles , and ben had a lot of squares .

" look , i made a roof with triangles ! " lily said , showing her house to ben .

" that 's nice , but i made a wall with squares ! " ben said , showing his tower to lily .

they were having fun , but then they heard a loud noise . it was raining outside , and the wind was blowing hard . they saw water coming through the window and wetting the floor .

" oh no , our blocks are getting wet ! " lily cried .

" quick , let 's move them to a dry place ! " ben said .

they grabbed their blocks and ran to the kitchen , where their mom was making cookies . they put their blocks on the table and looked at them . some of them were still dry , but some of them were wet and sticky .

" mom , can you help us dry our blocks ? " lily asked .

" of course , sweeties . here , use this towel and wipe them gently . " mom said , giving them a soft towel .

lily and ben took turns drying their blocks with the towel . they were careful not to break them or mix them up . they thanked their mom for the towel and the cookies .

" mom , you are the best ! " lily said .

" mom , we are grateful for you ! " ben said .

mom smiled and hugged them . she was happy to see them playing nicely and sharing their blocks . she was proud of them for being polite and helpful . she loved them very much . sara and ben are playing with blocks in the living room . they like to build towers and bridges and houses with the blocks . they have many colors and shapes of blocks to choose from .

" look , sara , i made a big tower ! " ben says , showing his creation to his sister . " it is taller than you ! "

sara feels an urge to knock down ben 's tower . she thinks it would be fun to see the blocks scatter all over the floor . she does not like that ben 's tower is taller than her . she is a little bit crazy .

" no , ben , your tower is not good ! " sara says , and pushes the tower with her hand . the blocks fall down with a loud noise . ben is very angry .

" sara , why did you do that ? " ben shouts . " you are mean and naughty ! you ruined my tower ! "

sara laughs and runs away . she thinks it is funny to make ben mad . she does not care that she made a mess . she likes to scatter the blocks .

ben cries and tries to pick up the blocks . he wants to build his tower again . he does not want to play with sara anymore . he thinks she is crazy . anna liked to play in the park with her ball . she liked to throw it and catch it and roll it on the grass . she was very good at playing with her ball . one day , a stranger came to the park . he was a big man with a big hat and a big smile . he said , " hello , little girl . what a nice ball you have . can i play with you ? "

anna did not know the stranger . she felt a little scared . she remembered what her mom had told her . " never talk to strangers , anna . they might be bad people who want to hurt you or take you away . if a stranger talks to you , run to me or to a grown - up you know and trust . "

anna said , " no , thank you . i do n't want to play with you . you are a stranger . i do n't know you . " she picked up her ball and ran to her mom , who was sitting on a bench nearby . she told her mom what the stranger had said .

her mom hugged her and said , " good girl , anna . you did the right thing . i 'm very proud of you . you are very smart and brave . you should never permit a stranger to play with you or touch you or take you anywhere . even if they seem friendly , they might be lying or hiding something . you are safe with me and with people you know and love . "

