they checked in their bags and got their tickets . then they had to go through a gate where a man looked at their tickets and asked them to walk through a metal thing . lily and ben did as they were told , but when they came out , they saw something bad . mom and dad were not with them . they were on the other side of the gate , and the man would not let them through .

