her dad climbed up the ladder and helped her down . " do n't worry , lily . i will always save you , " he said . lily hugged her dad and felt safe . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she had a key to her toy box , but she could n't find it . she looked under her bed , in her drawers , and even in her closet . she was sad because she could n't play with her toys .

