from that day on , lily made sure to keep her key in a safe place so she would n't lose it again . and whenever she found something amazing , she would show it to her sister . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to sing songs all day long . one day , she found a cherry tree in her backyard . she loved to eat cherries , but she could n't reach them .

