the aeroplane lifts off the ground and flies into the air . they open their eyes and see the clouds and the sun . they giggle and clap their hands . they are flying to see their grandma . they are having a cool adventure . lila and ben were playing in the backyard . they liked to dig in the dirt and look for shiny things . sometimes they found rocks , sometimes they found coins , sometimes they found nothing .

