" can we keep it ? can we show it to your dad ? " ben asked .

" sure , we can keep it . and we can show it to my dad . maybe he will tell us more about it . maybe he will let us see his box of coppers . maybe he will give us one . he is very nice and very smart , " lila said .

they put the copper in their pocket and ran inside . they were very excited and very curious . they were also very persistent . they did not stop asking lila 's dad about the copper until he agreed to show them his box and tell them a story . they learned a lot and had a lot of fun . they decided to keep digging in the dirt and look for more shiny things . maybe they would find more coppers . maybe they would find something else . they did not know , but they wanted to find out . lily and ben were friends . they liked to play hide and seek in the park . one day , they found a big tree with many leaves . lily said , " let 's hide behind the tree . no one will find us there . " ben agreed . they ran behind the tree and waited .

soon , they heard their mommies calling them . " lily ! ben ! where are you ? " they did not answer . they wanted to surprise their mommies . they giggled and held their hands . they felt happy and safe behind the tree .

but then , something strange happened . the tree started to shake . the leaves started to fall . the wind started to blow . lily and ben felt scared . they looked around and saw that the park was gone . everything was gone . they only saw a big , dark hole . they did not know where they were . they did not know what to do .

