lily and ben did what the voice said . they closed their eyes and wished . they wished to go back to the park . they wished to see their mommies . they wished to never disappear again . they felt a warm breeze and a soft light . they opened their eyes and saw that they were behind the tree again . the park was there . their mommies were there . they ran to them and hugged them . they told them what happened . their mommies did not believe them . they thought they were making up a story . they said , " you have a big imagination . but you also have a big heart . we are proud of you . you are good friends . now , let 's go home . it is time for dinner . "

lily and ben smiled . they thanked the magic tree . they said goodbye to each other . they promised to play again tomorrow . they walked home with their mommies . they were happy and safe . they did not disappear again . lily and ben were playing in the garden . they liked to run and jump and hide behind the flowers . they saw a big vine that grew on the wall . it had many green leaves and purple flowers .

