the bee flew away . it was busy making honey . it did not care about lily and ben . they lay on the ground and cried . they wished they had never climbed the vine . tom is a big dog with white fur . he likes to run and play in the park with his friends . but today , he feels itchy and scratchy all over . he has fleas , tiny bugs that bite and make him hurt .

