he sees his owner , sam , coming to the park . he runs to him , hoping he will help him . but sam does not notice the fleas . he only sees tom 's white fur covered in dirt and mud . he says , " tom , you are so dirty ! you need a bath ! "

tom hates baths . he thinks they are cold and wet and scary . he does not want to go in the water . he tries to hide behind a tree , but sam finds him . he tries to pull away , but sam holds him . he tries to bark , but sam says , " shh , it 's okay . it will be over soon . "

