the dog is scared and sorry . it does not want to make tom and sam mad . it wags its tail and barks . it tries to say sorry .

tom and sam see the dog is not mean . it is just a silly dog . they stop shouting and calm down . they pat the dog and say , " it is okay , dog . we forgive you . but do not break our hut again . help us fix it . "

the dog nods and helps tom and sam . they find more sticks and leaves and make the hut again . it is stronger and bigger than before . they let the dog inside the hut and play with it . they are friends now . they are happy . tom and jen are friends . they like to play with blocks and cars . one day , they have a big fight . tom wants to build a tower with all the blocks . jen wants to share the blocks and make a bridge . tom says , " no , they are mine ! go away ! " jen says , " that is not nice ! you are mean ! " they push and pull the blocks and make a mess .

mom sees them and is sad . she says , " why are you fighting ? you are friends . you should help each other and have fun . fighting is bad . it makes you and others unhappy . do you want to be unhappy ? " tom and jen shake their heads . they do not want to be unhappy . they want to be happy .

mom says , " then you should say sorry and share . sharing is good . it makes you and others happy . do you want to be happy ? " tom and jen nod . they want to be happy . they say sorry and hug . they share the blocks and make a tower and a bridge . they play together and have fun .

mom smiles and says , " good job ! you are good friends . you succeed in life when you are kind and generous . kindness and generosity make you and others happy . happiness is the best thing in life . do you agree ? " tom and jen agree . they are happy . they thank mom and continue to play .

the moral value of the story is : sharing is good . kindness and generosity make you and others happy . happiness is the best thing in life . tom and lily were playing with their toy cars and trucks in the garden . they liked to make roads and bridges with sticks and stones . they also liked to load and unload their trucks with sand and pebbles .

one day , they found a big white thing in the sand . it was hard and shiny and had a pointy end . " what is this ? " tom asked . " it looks like a tooth , " lily said . " maybe it is from a dinosaur or a dragon . " they decided to keep it and put it in their truck .

they were very happy with their new treasure . they showed it to their mom and dad , who said it was a cow 's tooth . they did not believe them . they thought it was much more exciting to pretend it was from a scary animal .

the next day , they wanted to play with their tooth again . but when they looked in their truck , it was gone . they searched everywhere , but they could not find it . they were very sad and angry . " who took our tooth ? " tom asked . " maybe it was a thief or a monster , " lily said .

they heard a loud bark from behind the fence . it was their neighbor 's dog , rex . he was big and black and had sharp teeth . he liked to chase and bite things . tom and lily were afraid of him . they saw him holding something in his mouth . it was their tooth . he had jumped over the fence and stolen it .

tom and lily wanted their tooth back . but they did not know how to get it . they were too scared to go near rex . they needed a plan . they thought hard . they had an idea . they took their truck and filled it with their favorite treats : cookies , crackers , and cheese . they pushed it slowly towards the fence . they hoped rex would see it and drop their tooth .

rex saw the truck and smelled the food . he was hungry and curious . he dropped the tooth and ran towards the truck . he started to eat the treats . tom and lily waited for their chance . they ran to the fence and grabbed their tooth . they were very brave . they ran back to their garden and put their tooth in a safe place . they were very happy . they had their tooth back . they had outsmarted rex . they had a great story to tell . lila and ben were playing with their toy cars on the floor . they liked to make them go fast and make loud noises . lila had a red car and ben had a blue car . they pretended they were racing on a big road .

" ready , set , go ! " lila shouted , and pushed her car forward . ben did the same , and their cars zoomed along the floor . they laughed and cheered as they watched their cars .

but then , lila 's car hit a bump and flipped over . it landed on its back , and its wheels stopped spinning . lila gasped and ran to her car . she picked it up and looked at it . she saw a long line on the side of her car . it was a scratch .

" oh no , my car is broken ! " lila cried . she felt sad and angry . she looked at ben and said , " you did this ! you made my car crash ! "

ben shook his head and said , " no , i did n't ! it was an accident . i 'm sorry , lila . let me see your car . "

ben took the car from lila and examined it . he turned it over and looked at the scratch . he touched it gently and said , " it 's not so bad , lila . it 's just a little line . your car can still go fast and make noises . it 's still a good car . "

lila sniffed and said , " but it 's not the same . it 's not pretty anymore . it has a line on it . "

ben smiled and said , " but lila , the line does n't matter . it does n't change what your car can do . and it does n't change how much you love your car . the line is just a mark of your car 's adventure . it shows that your car is brave and strong . it 's a wise car . "

lila looked at ben and then at her car . she thought about what he said . she realized he was right . the line was not a bad thing . it was a part of her car 's story . she smiled and said , " you 're right , ben . thank you . you 're a good friend . and you 're a wise boy . "

ben hugged lila and said , " you 're welcome , lila . you 're a good friend too . and you 're a wise girl . "

they put their cars back on the floor and played again . they did n't mind the line on lila 's car . they were happy and had fun . they were wise children . lila and ben were playing on the beach . they liked to make sand castles and dig holes . they also liked to collect shells and stones and scatter them on the sand . they made patterns and shapes with them .

" look , ben , i found a large shell ! " lila said , holding up a shiny pink shell . " it 's so pretty ! "

" wow , lila , that 's a nice shell ! " ben said . " can i see it ? "

lila gave him the shell and he looked at it closely . he saw a tiny hole in the shell . he put his ear to it and heard a soft sound .

" lila , listen , i can hear the sea in the shell ! " ben said , excited .

lila put her ear to the shell and heard the sound too . she smiled and said , " that 's amazing , ben ! the shell is like a magic phone ! "

they took turns listening to the shell and talking to the sea . they pretended they were pirates and mermaids and explorers . they had so much fun that they forgot to watch the tide .

