but sara was wrong . the branch was weak and old . it could not hold sara 's weight . it snapped and sara fell to the ground . she hit her head and did not move . ben ran to sara and cried . he said , " sara , sara , wake up . i am sorry . i did not mean to be silly and boring . i just wanted you to be safe . please wake up . "

but sara did not wake up . she was dead . ben was very sad and scared . he wished he could go back in time and stop sara from climbing the tree . he learned a hard lesson . he learned that it is not good to be brave and strong if you are also foolish and stubborn . he learned that it is better to listen to your friends who care about you and want you to be safe . he learned that hanging from a tree is not worth losing your sight and your life . anna and ben are friends . they like to play with toys . one day , anna has a new toy . it is a blue box . she can open it and find a surprise inside .

