the moral of the story is : sharing is caring . it is good to be kind to your friends . lily and ben were playing with their toys in the living room , while mom was in the kitchen . mom was making coffee for herself and dad , who was coming home soon . mom was anxious because dad had a big meeting at work today , and she wanted to hear how it went .

