the squirrel agreed . he liked the kids and their ball . he liked their daddy too . he was dependable . he always gave them nuts . tommy was excited for his birthday . he was going to have a big cake with four candles on it . he wanted to make a wish when he blew them out . he wondered what he should wish for .

