one day , anna is playing with her phone in her room . she is wearing her pink bathrobe . it is soft and warm and dry . she hears her mom call her name . " anna , time for lunch ! " anna says , " ok , mom , i 'm coming ! " she puts down her phone and runs to the kitchen .

