one day , lisa had a good idea . she thought she could give her mom a massage . she knew that a massage was when you touch someone 's back or shoulders gently to make them feel good . she had seen her dad do it for her mom sometimes .

she waited until her mom was resting on the couch after dinner . she went to her and said , " mom , can i give you a massage ? i want to thank you for all you do for me . "

her mom smiled and said , " that 's very thoughtful of you , lisa . yes , you can give me a massage . that would be very nice . "

