" ok , but we have to be smart and quiet , " ben whispers .

they nod and make a promise . they will work together and get the red car .

they wait until mom goes to the kitchen . then they sneak to the shelf . lily stands on a chair and ben holds her hand . lily reaches for the red car . she almost has it .

but then mom comes back . she sees them and frowns .

