lily and ben say i love you too . they go and play with their other toys and books . they share and are nice . they do n't fight anymore . they are smart and nice twins . tom and lily were playing outside with their ball . they liked to kick the ball to each other and catch it . they were having fun until they saw the sky . it was dark and gray . they heard a loud noise . it was thunder .

