her mom hugged her . she said , " of course i forgive you , lily . you are my daughter . i love you no matter what . but you have to learn from your mistakes . now , let 's go inside and clean your doll . and then we can play together . "

lily smiled . she said , " thank you , mom . you are the best . i love you too . "

the end . ben is a dog . he likes to run and play with his ball . he has a big yard with a fence . sometimes he sees other dogs outside the fence . he barks at them and they bark back .

one day , a new dog comes to the fence . he is big and black and has sharp teeth . he growls at ben and tries to bite him . ben is scared and angry . he runs to the fence and bites the new dog 's tip . the new dog yelps and runs away .

ben is happy and proud . he chased away the bad dog . he goes back to his ball and plays some more . he is very tired after all the running and biting . he finds a shady spot under a tree and lies down . he closes his eyes and sleeps . he dreams of his ball and the fence and the new dog . he is a good dog . sam liked to jog with his dad every morning . they would put on their shoes and hats and go outside . they would jog around the park and see the birds and the flowers . sam felt happy when he jogged with his dad .

one day , sam 's dad had to go to work early . he gave sam a hug and a kiss and said , " i 'm sorry , buddy , but i ca n't jog with you today . i have to go to the office and do some important things . but i have a surprise for you . look in the mailbox . "

sam was sad . he wanted to jog with his dad . he did not want to stay home alone . he walked to the mailbox and opened it . inside , he found a big envelope with his name on it . he tore it open and saw a card with a picture of a dog . it said , " i love you , sam . you are my best friend . i will be back soon . love , dad . "

sam smiled . he felt a little less lonely . he hugged the card and ran inside . he decided to jog around the house with his card and pretend that the dog was his dad . he hoped that his dad would come back soon and jog with him again . he knew that his dad loved him very much . lily was a daughter who loved to play . she had many toys and books and dolls in her room . she liked to make stories with them and pretend they were her friends . sometimes she played so much that she forgot to eat or rest .

one day , her mom called her for lunch . she said , " lily , come and eat . i made your favorite soup . it is delicious and warm . " lily did not want to stop playing . she said , " no , mom . i am busy . i have to finish my story . " her mom said , " lily , you need to eat . you will be hungry and tired if you do n't . you can play later . " lily said , " no , mom . i want to play now . "

her mom was sad and worried . she said , " lily , please listen to me . you are my daughter and i love you . i want you to be healthy and happy . eating is good for you . you can have some soup and a cookie . then you can play again . " lily thought for a moment . she loved her mom and she loved soup and cookies . she said , " okay , mom . i will come and eat . but can i bring one doll with me ? " her mom said , " yes , you can . but only one . come on , let 's go . "

lily picked up her favorite doll and followed her mom to the kitchen . she saw a big bowl of soup and a plate of cookies on the table . she smelled the soup and it was delicious . she said , " thank you , mom . this looks yummy . " she sat down and ate her soup and a cookie . she shared some with her doll . she felt full and happy . she said , " mom , this was the best lunch ever . i love you . " her mom said , " i love you too , lily . you are a good daughter . now , do you want to play some more ? " lily said , " yes , mom . but can i play in the living room ? i want to be with you . " her mom said , " of course , you can . you can play with your doll and your books . i will read a story to you later . " lily said , " okay , mom . that sounds fun . " she took her doll and her books and went to the living room . she settled on the couch and played quietly . she was happy and content . she had a good day . tim and mia are friends . they go to the same classroom every day . they like to play with toys and draw pictures . but today , something is wrong . the classroom is very smelly .

" yuck ! what is that smell ? " tim asks . he covers his nose with his hand .

" i do n't know . maybe it is the trash can . or the lunch box . or the paint . " mia says . she looks around the classroom .

they see their teacher , mrs. lee , walking to the door . she has a big bag in her hand . she looks unhappy .

" hello , children . i 'm sorry , but we have to leave the classroom for a while . there is a skunk in the bag . he came in through the window and sprayed everything . he is very scared and angry . " mrs. lee says .

" a skunk ? what is a skunk ? " tim asks .

" a skunk is a black and white animal . he has a tail that can spray a bad smell . he does that when he feels in danger . we have to be very quiet and gentle with him . maybe he will calm down and go away . " mrs. lee says .

" can we see the skunk ? " mia asks .

" no , no , no . that is not a good idea . the skunk might spray you too . and that would make you very smelly . and it would hurt your eyes . we have to go to another room and wait for the animal helper to come . he will take the skunk away and make him happy again . " mrs. lee says .

tim and mia nod . they follow mrs. lee to another room . they hope the skunk will be okay . and they hope the classroom will not be smelly anymore . ben and lily were best friends . they liked to play together at the park . they also liked to share gum . gum was sweet and sticky and fun to chew .

one day , ben had a new pack of gum . he gave one to lily and said , " this is my favorite gum . it is red and it tastes like berries . do you like it ? "

lily nodded and smiled . she put the gum in her mouth and chewed . it was very yummy . she said , " thank you , ben . this is a good gum . i like it too . "

they played on the swings and the slide and the sandbox . they had a lot of fun . but then , lily 's mom came to pick her up . she said , " lily , it 's time to go home . say goodbye to ben . "

lily hugged ben and said , " bye , ben . i had fun with you . see you tomorrow . "

ben hugged lily and said , " bye , lily . i had fun with you too . see you tomorrow . "

lily got in the car with her mom and waved to ben . ben waved back and watched them drive away . he felt sad . he missed lily . he wanted to play with her more .

he walked home with his dad . he was quiet . he did not talk . he did not smile . he still had his gum in his mouth , but he did not enjoy it .

his dad noticed and asked , " ben , what 's wrong ? you look sad . are you okay ? "

ben sighed and said , " i miss lily . she is my best friend . we shared gum . it was red and it tasted like berries . it was her favorite gum too . but she had to go home . i do n't have anyone to play with now . "

his dad hugged him and said , " i understand , ben . i miss my friends too sometimes . but you know what ? lily will come back tomorrow . you can play with her again . and you can share gum again . and you can have fun again . you do n't have to be sad . you can be happy . "

ben smiled a little and said , " really ? lily will come back tomorrow ? "

his dad nodded and said , " yes , really . lily will come back tomorrow . and you know what else ? i have a surprise for you . i have another pack of gum . it is green and it tastes like mint . do you want to try it ? "

ben 's eyes lit up and he said , " yes , please ! i love gum . thank you , dad . you are the best . "

his dad gave him a piece of gum and said , " you 're welcome , ben . you are the best too . i love you . "

ben chewed the gum and said , " i love you too , dad . this is a good gum . i like it . but i will save one for lily . she might like it too . "

his dad smiled and said , " that 's very nice of you , ben . i 'm sure lily will appreciate it . you are a good friend . "

ben felt happy . he did not miss lily so much . he was not worried . he had his dad and his gum . he looked forward to seeing lily tomorrow . he hoped she would like the green gum . he thought it would be fun to share it with her . he thought life was good . lila was a wealthy girl who lived in a big house with many toys . she liked to play with her dolls and dress them up in pretty clothes . she had a big box of oil that she used to make their hair shiny and smooth .

one day , her mother told her that they had a visitor . it was her cousin ben , who lived in a small house with few toys . he liked to play with cars and trucks and make them go fast . he had no oil for his toys , only dirt and mud .

lila did not want to share her toys with ben . she said they were only for girls and he would break them . she did not allow him to touch her dolls or her oil . she was mean and rude to him .

ben felt sad and bored . he wanted to play with lila , but she was not nice . he looked around the big house and saw a shiny car in the garage . he thought it looked like a fun toy . he went to the garage and opened the door of the car . he saw a bottle of oil on the seat . he thought it was the same oil that lila used for her dolls . he wanted to make the car shiny and smooth too .

he opened the bottle and poured the oil all over the car . he rubbed it with his hands and smiled . he thought the car looked beautiful . he did not know that he was making a big mess .

lila heard a noise in the garage . she ran to see what it was . she saw ben and the car covered in oil . she screamed and cried . she was very angry and scared . she called her mother and told her what ben had done .

her mother came and saw the oil . she was shocked and upset . she scolded ben and told him to go to his room . she said he was naughty and careless . she said he had to pay for the damage . she said he could not play with lila anymore .

lila felt happy and proud . she thought she had won . she thought ben deserved to be punished . she did not say sorry or thank you to him . she did not care about his feelings .

but later , she felt lonely and bored . she had no one to play with . she looked at her dolls and her oil . she realized they were not fun without a friend . she wished she had been kinder and more generous to ben . she wished she had allowed him to play with her toys . she wished she had shared her oil with him . she wished she had a cousin who liked her . ben and mia were friends . they liked to play in the park . one day , they found a jar on the grass . it was big and shiny . they wanted to see what was inside .

