they were about to give up , when they heard a voice from inside the jar . it was low and scary .

" who dares to disturb me ? " the voice said .

ben and mia were shocked . they dropped the stick and the jar and ran away . they did not want to play with the jar anymore . it was terrible . they decided to play with the swings instead . they hoped the voice would not follow them . they learned a lesson : some jars are better left alone . lily loved to cook with her mom . she liked to stir the soup , crack the eggs and sprinkle the cheese . one day , mom gave her a new pan . it was shiny and red and had a big handle . lily was very happy .

" can i cook something in my new pan ? " lily asked .

" sure , honey . what do you want to make ? " mom said .

lily thought for a moment . she wanted to make something brilliant , something that would make mom proud . she decided to make a cake . she took some flour , some sugar , some butter and some milk . she mixed them all in a bowl . then she poured the batter into her new pan .

" can i put it in the oven ? " lily asked .

" wait a minute , honey . you need to add some baking powder and some vanilla . and you need to grease the pan first . otherwise , the cake will stick and burn . " mom said .

lily did not listen . she was too excited . she put the pan in the oven and turned it on . she waited for a few minutes . then she smelled something bad . she opened the oven and saw a big mess . the cake had risen too much and spilled over the pan . it was black and hard and smelled awful .

" oh no ! what did i do ? " lily cried .

mom came and saw the disaster . she was not angry . she hugged lily and said , " it 's okay , honey . you tried your best . but next time , you need to follow the recipe and listen to me . cooking is fun , but it also requires some rules and skills . do you understand ? "

lily nodded . she felt sorry for ruining her new pan and wasting the ingredients . she said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i wanted to make you a brilliant cake . i wanted you to applaud me . "

mom smiled and said , " you do n't need to make me a brilliant cake to make me happy . i love you no matter what . and i applaud you for being brave and creative . but i also want you to learn from your mistakes and be careful and respectful . do you want to try again ? "

lily nodded again . she said , " yes , mom . i want to try again . can you help me ? "

mom said , " of course , honey . i 'm always here to help you . let 's clean up this mess and start over . and this time , let 's use a cake tin instead of a pan . "

lily and mom worked together to make a new cake . they followed the recipe and listened to each other . the cake came out soft and sweet and smelled delicious . they decorated it with frosting and sprinkles . they shared it with dad and brother . they all enjoyed it and applauded lily for her effort and improvement .

lily felt happy and proud . she learned a valuable lesson . she learned that cooking is fun , but it also requires some rules and skills . she learned that listening to mom is important and helpful . she learned that making mistakes is okay , as long as she tries again and does better . she learned that mom loves her no matter what , and that she can make her happy by being brave and creative . she hugged mom and said , " thank you , mom . you are brilliant . " ben and lily were playing in the living room . they liked to pretend they were spies and look for clues . they saw a cable on the floor that went to the tv . ben wondered what it was for .

