lily cried and cried . she wished she had stopped ben from touching the cable . she wished they had played something else . she wished they had an ordinary day . sam and lily were twins who liked to watch television . they watched cartoons and songs and animals on the big screen . they watched every day , all day , and did not play with their toys or books or each other .

one day , their mom said , " sam and lily , you watch too much television . it is not good for you . you need to do other things , like draw or read or run outside . turn off the television and go play . "

