then , suddenly , the television exploded . it made a loud bang and a bright flash and a lot of smoke . sam and lily screamed and cried and ran to their mom . but it was too late . the television had hurt them . they had burns and cuts and bruises all over . they had to go to the hospital and stay there for a long time . they could not watch television anymore . they wished they had listened to their mom . they learned a hard lesson . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to go fishing with her dad . one day , they went to the lake to catch some fish . her dad gave her a heavy rod to hold .

