together , they cleaned up the broken glass and fixed the window . lily learned that it 's okay to make mistakes , but it 's important to take a step towards making things right . she promised to be more careful in the future and her parents were proud of her . the moral of the story is that it 's important to take responsibility for our actions and try to make things right when we make mistakes . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she was very sleepy and wanted to go on a trip . she asked her mommy if they could go on an adventure . her mommy said yes , but they needed to bring their passports .

