they decided to play something else . they still liked to pretend they were explorers , but they also liked to learn new things . they wondered what else they could find in the park . ben and mia like to collect rocks . they have a big box of rocks in their room . some rocks are shiny , some are smooth , some are colorful . they like to look at their rocks and make shapes with them .

