anna nods . she stands up and dances in front of the tv . she dances with the baby . she dances with her mom . she dances with her dog . she is happy . she loves to dance . sara and ben like to play with their toy cars . they have a big box of cars and a long tunnel made of cardboard . they take turns to push their cars through the tunnel and make zoom sounds .

