mom smiles . she says , " i love you too , sara and ben . you are good kids . you can learn from your mistakes . next time , i will buy you a better car . a car that is strong . a car that is good . a car that you can play with together . " sara and ben were playing in the kitchen . they liked to pretend they were chefs and make yummy food . sara was bossy . she told ben what to do all the time . she said , " ben , you cut the cauliflower . i will fix the soup . hurry up , we have guests coming soon . "

