sara and ben hugged . they laughed . they threw away the cake . they ate the soup . they learned to share and to be kind . they had fun . they were happy . lily was a shy girl who liked to play with her dolls . she did not have many friends at school , because she was afraid to talk to them . she wished she had a friend who would understand her and play with her .

one day , she found a shiny stone in the park . it was blue and sparkly , and it made her feel happy . she took it home and put it under her pillow . that night , she heard a voice in her ear .

