lily and max nodded . they tried to be polite and care for the opera . but they still did not like it . they wished they could sing their own songs instead . they hoped the opera would end soon . lily and ben are kids who live next door . they hate each other . they always fight and yell and make noise . one day , lily 's mom makes a big cake for her birthday . it is delicious . it has chocolate and cream and sprinkles . lily loves cake .

