they learned a lesson . they should not take things that are not theirs . they should respect other people 's work . and they should not play with food . food is for eating , not for wasting . lily and ben were twins who liked to play with fire . they had a box of matches that they hid under their bed . sometimes , when their mom and dad were busy , they would sneak out to the backyard and light the matches . they liked to watch the fire burn and make sparks .

one evening , they decided to try something new . they found a pile of dry leaves and sticks and put them in a deep hole . they thought it would be fun to make a big fire in the hole . they took their matches and lit the leaves and sticks . the fire burned bright and hot , and they laughed and clapped .

but they did not know that the fire was dangerous . the fire spread quickly and caught the fence on fire . the fence was close to the house , and soon the house was on fire too . lily and ben smelled the smoke and saw the flames . they were scared and ran to the front door .

