lily and ben felt sorry and ashamed . they wished they had not played with fire . they learned a hard lesson . they said , " we are sorry , mom and dad . we did not mean to burn the house . we were curious and bored . we did not think of the consequences . we will never play with fire again . please forgive us . "

the moral of the story is : do not play with fire . fire can burn and destroy . fire can hurt you and others . fire is not a toy . fire is a serious matter . listen to your parents and follow the rules . be careful and responsible . lily and ben are playing in the kitchen . they see a big blue jug on the table . they both want to play with it .

