lily and ben feel sorry . they nod and say sorry . they help mom clean up the mess . they hug and say sorry to each other . they learn to be careful and kind . they do not want to break things and make mom angry again . anna likes to count . she counts her fingers , her toes , her dolls , and her books . she can count up to ten . she is very proud of herself .

one day , anna finds a comb in her mom 's drawer . it is shiny and has many teeth . anna thinks it is a funny thing . she wonders how many teeth it has . she decides to count them .

she starts from one end and says the numbers out loud . one , two , three , four , five , six , seven , eight , nine , ten . she is not done yet . she keeps counting . eleven , twelve , thirteen , fourteen , fifteen , sixteen , seventeen , eighteen , nineteen , twenty . she is still not done . she counts more . twenty - one , twenty - two , twenty - three , twenty - four , twenty - five , twenty - six , twenty - seven , twenty - eight , twenty - nine , thirty . she is amazed . the comb has so many teeth .

she wants to show her mom . she runs to the living room , where her mom is reading a book . she holds up the comb and says , " mom , look ! i counted the teeth of the comb . it has thirty teeth . that is a lot of teeth . "

her mom smiles and hugs her . she says , " wow , anna , you are so smart . you counted all the way to thirty . that is a big number . i am very proud of you . and you know what ? you have a lively mind . you are always curious and eager to learn new things . that is a good thing . "

