her mom says , " sure , you can . but first , can you give me a kiss ? "

anna says , " yes , mom . " she gives her mom a kiss and then runs back to her room with the comb . she counts the teeth again and again . she is happy . she likes to count . tom and lily were playing with their toy cars in the living room . they liked to make them zoom and crash on the carpet . they had many cars of different colors and sizes . they had fun with their cars .

but mom was not happy . she was working on her laptop on the couch . she had to finish an important report for her boss . she did not like the noise and the mess that tom and lily made . she told them to play quietly and to clean up their toys . she did not allow them to wreck the living room .

tom and lily did not listen to mom . they thought she was boring and mean . they wanted to play louder and messier . they threw their cars in the air and on the floor . they knocked over the lamp and the vase . they made a big wreck .

