tom and lily were sad and sorry . they wished they had listened to mom . they wished they had played quietly and cleaned up their toys . they wished they had not wrecked the living room . they had no fun with their cars . they had a bad ending . sara and tom were playing on the porch . they had a big box of toys and they were having fun . sara liked the doll with the pink dress and tom liked the truck with the loud horn .

