" yes , mom , we can do that , " tom said .

they hugged mom and then hugged each other . they said sorry to each other and gave each other their toys . they played on the porch again . they were careful and they were happy . lila and ben were playing in the garden . they saw a big shiny crystal on the grass . it was blue and sparkly .

