they hugged each other . they picked up the pieces of the crystal and put them in a box . they hoped that maybe they could fix it someday . they went back to playing in the garden . they learned a lesson . lila and ben were playing on the beach . they liked to dig holes and make castles with the sand . they also liked to splash in the water and look for shells and crabs . but they had to be careful of the tide . the tide was the water that came and went . sometimes it was low and left more sand to play on . sometimes it was high and covered the sand and made big waves .

one day , lila and ben were having fun on the beach when they saw the tide was coming in . they decided to move their things to a higher spot . but ben did not want to leave his castle . he had worked hard to make it and he was proud of it . he said to lila , " no , i want to stay here . my castle is the best . the tide will not get it . "

lila tried to tell him that the tide was strong and fast and that it would wash away his castle . she said , " ben , you have to come with me . the tide is coming . it will take your castle and maybe you too . it is not safe here . we can make another castle later . "

but ben did not listen . he was stubborn and angry . he said , " no , no , no . i demand to stay here . this is my castle and i will not leave it . you go away . you are dull and boring . you do not know how to have fun . "

lila was sad and scared . she did not want to leave ben alone , but she also did not want to stay with him . she did not know what to do . she looked at the tide and saw that it was getting closer and closer . she looked at ben and saw that he was still sitting by his castle , not caring about the tide . she decided to go and get help . she ran to their mom and dad , who were sitting on a blanket nearby . she told them what was happening . they got up and followed her to the beach . they saw ben and his castle and the tide . they shouted at him to come with them . but ben did not hear them . he was too busy looking at his castle . he did not see the big wave that was coming . he did not see how it crashed over his castle and him . he did not see how it dragged him into the water . he did not see anything . he only felt the cold and the wet and the fear . he screamed for help . he wished he had listened to lila . he wished he had left his castle . he wished he was not so foolish . he wished he was not so alone . tommy liked to play with his toys in his room . he had many toys , but his favorite was a big truck that could make loud noises and move fast . he liked to pretend that he was a driver and that he had to deliver things to different places . sometimes he used his blocks or his books as the things he had to deliver .

one day , his mom told him that they were going to visit his grandma . tommy was happy , because he loved his grandma and she always gave him cookies and hugs . he wanted to show her his big truck , so he put it in his backpack and got ready to go . his mom also told him to bring some vegetables from their garden , because grandma liked to cook with them . tommy helped his mom pick some carrots and tomatoes and put them in a basket .

when they got to grandma 's house , tommy ran to the door and knocked . grandma opened the door and smiled . she hugged tommy and his mom and invited them in . she said she had a surprise for tommy in the living room . tommy was curious , so he followed her . he saw a big table with a cloth on it . grandma said , " i made a display for you , tommy . do you want to see it ? " tommy nodded , and grandma pulled the cloth off .

tommy gasped . on the table , there were many toys that looked like vegetables . there was a carrot that could roll , a tomato that could bounce , a lettuce that could spin , and more . they were all colorful and shiny and had funny faces . tommy thought they were amazing . he said , " wow , grandma , these are so cool ! can i play with them ? " grandma said , " of course , my dear . they are for you . i made them myself . i know you like trucks and vegetables , so i thought you would like these too . "

tommy was so happy . he hugged grandma and thanked her . he took his backpack off and opened it . he wanted to show grandma his big truck too . but when he opened it , he saw that his truck was gone . instead , there were only carrots and tomatoes in his backpack . he had mixed up the baskets . he felt embarrassed . he said , " oh no , grandma , i 'm sorry . i brought the wrong basket . this is not my truck . this is your vegetables . " grandma laughed . she said , " do n't worry , tommy . it 's okay . we can use these vegetables for lunch . and i 'm sure your mom can find your truck in the car . come on , let 's play with your new toys . they are much more fun than a truck . " tommy smiled . he agreed . he played with his vegetable toys and had a great time with grandma . he forgot about his truck and his mistake . he was happy . lily and max were twins who lived on a big ranch with their mom and dad . they liked to play with the horses , the cows , and the dogs . they also liked to rock on the old wooden swing that hung from a big tree .

one day , they were rocking on the swing when they saw a new horse in the field . it was black and shiny , and it ran very fast . lily and max wanted to see the new horse up close .

" let 's go and say hello to the new horse , " lily said .

