he reached out his hand to touch the horse 's nose . the horse did not like that . he jerked his head back and kicked the fence . he made a loud noise that scared lily and max .

" whoa , easy , boy . he 's just a kid . he does n't mean any harm , " a voice said .

lily and max turned around and saw their dad . he was holding a rope and a bucket of apples . he walked slowly to the horse and spoke softly to him .

" this is jet . he 's a new horse i bought from a friend . he 's not used to people yet . he needs some time to trust us . he 's a good horse , but he 's restless . he needs a lot of exercise and attention , " their dad explained .

" can we help you with him , dad ? " lily asked .

