" ok , dad . we will , " max said .

lily and max smiled . they liked the new horse , even if he was restless . they wanted to be his friends . they followed their dad to the field and helped him feed and groom jet . they hoped that one day , they could rock on his back and ride him around the ranch . tom and sam were brothers who liked to play with their toy planes . they would make them soar in the air and pretend they were pilots . one day , they found a big box in the garage . it had many old things that their dad wanted to throw away . they saw some wires , some cans , some paper and some glue .

