sam agreed and they started to work . they used the wires to make wings , the cans to make engines , the paper to make a tail and the glue to stick everything together . they were very proud of their new plane . they decided to test it in the backyard .

they carried the plane outside and put it on the ground . they ran behind it and pushed it hard . the plane started to roll and then it lifted off the ground . it soared in the air for a few seconds and then it crashed into a tree . the plane broke into pieces and fell to the ground .

" oh no ! " tom and sam cried . " our plane is ruined ! "

they ran to the tree and tried to pick up the pieces . they were very sad and angry . they blamed each other for the crash .

" it 's your fault ! " tom said . " you pushed it too hard ! "

