they say thank you again to ben 's mom . they say goodbye to each other . they hug and promise to play again soon . they are good friends . sara was at the doctor 's office with her mom . she had a sore throat and a fever . the doctor wanted to look inside her mouth and throat . he had a long , thin tube with a light at the end . he called it a scope .

