but one day , lily did not come to the pond . tommy waited and waited , but she did not show up . he felt sad and lonely . he wondered where she was . he took out his pill and looked at it . he thought , maybe i should take it . maybe it will make me feel better . he put the pill in his mouth and swallowed it .

he did not feel better . he felt worse . he felt sick and dizzy and sleepy . he fell on the ground and closed his eyes . he did not see lily running to him . she had been at the doctor 's . she had a bad cold . she had a pill too , but it was different . it was sweet and easy to swallow . she said , " tommy , tommy , wake up ! i 'm sorry i 'm late . are you okay ? " but tommy did not answer . he was too sick . lily cried and called for help . she wished she had been there sooner . she wished tommy had not taken his pill . she wished they could sail their boat again . ben and mia liked to play in the garage with their dad . they had many toys and tools there . one day , they saw a big box in the corner . they wanted to know what was inside .

" can we open it , dad ? " ben asked .

