ben and mia tried to lift the box , but they could not . it was too heavy for them . they felt sad .

" do n't worry , kids . i have an idea . let 's use this , " dad said . he showed them a jack . a jack is a tool that can lift heavy things .

dad put the jack under the box and turned a handle . the jack made a noise and lifted the box up . ben and mia were amazed .

" wow , dad ! you are so mighty ! " mia said .

" thank you , mia . but you know what ? you are mighty too . you are mighty in your own way . you are mighty smart , mighty kind , and mighty brave , " dad said .

ben and mia smiled . they felt happy . they hugged their dad and thanked him . then they opened the box and found a surprise . it was a new bike for ben and a new doll for mia . they were so excited . they played with their new toys in the garage . they had a lot of fun . anna liked to twist her hair when she was bored . she twisted and twisted until her hair was curly and funny . she looked at her image in the mirror and laughed . she thought she looked like a sheep .

one day , she twisted her hair too much . it got stuck and tangled . she tried to untwist it , but it hurt . she cried and called for her mom . her mom came and saw her hair . she said , " oh , anna , what did you do ? "

her mom got a comb and some oil . she gently combed and oiled anna 's hair . she untwisted and untangled it . it took a long time . anna felt sorry and said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i wo n't twist my hair again . "

her mom smiled and hugged her . she said , " it 's okay , anna . i love you no matter what . but next time , do n't twist your hair so much . it 's not good for your hair . "

anna nodded and said , " i love you too , mom . thank you for fixing my hair . " she looked at her image in the mirror again . her hair was soft and shiny . she was happy .

she decided to play with her toys instead of twisting her hair . she found a ball that was deep blue . she liked the color . she threw the ball and caught it . she had fun . she forgot about her hair . she was glad . tom and sam are friends . they like to ride bikes in the park . tom has a new bike . it is red and shiny . sam has an old bike . it is blue and rusty .

" look at my new bike ! " tom says . " it is fast and cool . do you want to try it ? "

sam nods . he wants to try tom 's new bike . he puts on tom 's helmet . it is big and yellow . it has a light on the front . the light can blink .

" be careful ! " tom says . " my bike is not easy to ride . you have to balance and steer . "

sam gets on the bike . he pedals hard . he feels the wind in his hair . he smiles . he likes tom 's new bike .

but sam is clumsy . he does not see the rock on the path . he hits the rock with his wheel . he loses his balance . he falls off the bike .

" ouch ! " sam cries . he scrapes his knee . he drops the helmet . the light stops blinking .

tom runs to sam . he helps him up . he checks the bike . it is not broken .

" are you okay ? " tom asks . he is worried .

sam nods . he is okay . he is sorry . he gives tom his helmet .

" i 'm sorry , tom , " sam says . " i was clumsy . i broke your helmet . "

tom hugs sam . he is not angry .

" it 's okay , sam , " tom says . " you are my friend . the helmet is not important . the light can be fixed . do you want to ride my bike again ? "

sam shakes his head . he does not want to ride tom 's bike again . he likes his old bike . it is blue and rusty .

" can we ride your bike ? " sam asks . " it is easy and fun . "

tom nods . he agrees . he likes sam 's old bike . it is blue and rusty .

they swap bikes . they put on their helmets . they ride together in the park . they are happy . they are friends . lily and max are friends . they like to play in the park . today , they find a big blue box . it has a button on it . lily pushes the button . music comes out of the box . it is a happy song .

