lily and max start to dance . they jump and clap and wiggle . they have fun . then , lily has an idea .

" let 's spin ! " she says . " spinning is fun ! "

she holds max 's hand . they spin around and around . they spin fast and slow . they spin like tops . they laugh and giggle .

but then , they spin too much . they feel dizzy . they fall down on the grass . they look at the sky . the sky is blue , like the box .

