" i 'm okay , " max says . " but i 'm tired . let 's rest . "

they lie on the grass . they listen to the music . they close their eyes . they smile . they are happy . they are friends . anna and ben like to play with their toy cars . they have a big rug with roads and buildings on it . they make sounds like vroom and beep as they drive their cars around . sometimes they have races or pretend to go to the shop or the park .

one day , anna and ben have a problem . they both want to play with the same car . it is a red car with a shiny sticker on it . they think it is the coolest car ever . they both reach for it at the same time and pull on it .

" let go , it 's mine ! " anna says .

