" you did it ! " ben says .

they start to cry and yell at each other . their mom hears them and comes to see what is wrong . she sees the broken car and the upset children .

" what happened here ? " she asks .

they both point at each other and say , " he / she did it ! "

mom sighs and picks up the pieces of the car . she looks at them and says , " i think i can fix this . but first , you two need to calm down and say sorry to each other . how about you do some exercise to get rid of your bad feelings ? "

anna and ben nod . they do n't like to fight . mom shows them how to do some jumping jacks , some squats , and some stretches . they follow her and start to feel better . they breathe deeply and smile .

" are you ready to say sorry now ? " mom asks .

anna and ben look at each other and say , " sorry . "

they hug and say , " i love you . "

mom smiles and says , " i love you too . and i have good news . i fixed your car . see , it can still drive and reverse . and the sticker is still cool . but you have to share it and be gentle with it , okay ? "

anna and ben nod and say , " okay . "

they take the car and thank mom . they go back to their rug and play nicely . they take turns driving and reversing the car . they make sounds like vroom and beep . they are happy again . tom and sam are friends . they like to play in the park . they see a big horse . the horse is brown and has a long tail . the horse is eating grass .

" look , a horse ! " tom says . " can we touch it ? "

" i do n't know , " sam says . " maybe it will bite us . "

they go closer to the horse . they want to pet it . the horse looks at them . it makes a loud noise . " neigh ! "

tom and sam are scared . they run away . the horse chases them . it is fast and high .

" help ! " tom and sam shout . " the horse is angry ! "

a man comes . he is the horse 's owner . he stops the horse . he talks to tom and sam .

" why did you disturb my horse ? " he asks . " he does n't like strangers . "

" we are sorry , " tom and sam say . " we just wanted to say hello . "

the man is not mad . he smiles . he lets tom and sam touch the horse . he tells them the horse 's name is max .

" max is a good horse , " he says . " but you have to be careful . he is shy and strong . you have to ask before you pet him . "

tom and sam nod . they say thank you to the man and max . they learn a new word : disturb . they promise not to disturb max again . they go back to play in the park . they are happy . lily did not like the dark . she was scared of the shadows on the ceiling . she wanted to sleep with her mom and dad , but they said no . they said she was a big girl and she had to sleep in her own bed . they gave her a hug and a kiss and a teddy bear . they said the teddy bear would keep her safe and happy .

lily tried to accept what they said , but she still felt sad and lonely . she hugged her teddy bear and closed her eyes . she hoped the dark would go away soon . she heard a noise outside her window . she opened her eyes and saw a bright light . it was the moon . the moon was big and round and shiny . it made the shadows on the ceiling look like funny shapes . lily smiled . she liked the moon . she felt less scared .

she decided to play a game with her teddy bear . she pointed at the ceiling and asked her teddy bear what he saw . she said , " i see a cat . do you see a cat ? " she waited for her teddy bear to answer . she pretended he said yes . she said , " i see a star . do you see a star ? " she waited for her teddy bear to answer . she pretended he said yes . she said , " i see a heart . do you see a heart ? " she waited for her teddy bear to answer . she pretended he said yes . she said , " i love you , teddy bear . do you love me ? " she waited for her teddy bear to answer . she pretended he said yes . she gave him a big hug and a kiss . she felt happy and warm .

she looked at the moon again . she said , " thank you , moon , for making the dark less scary . you are my friend . good night , moon . " she closed her eyes and fell asleep . she dreamed of cats and stars and hearts . she did not have any bad dreams . she did not wake up until the sun came up . she woke up with a smile . she was proud of herself . she had slept in her own bed all night . she had accepted the dark . she had made a new friend . she had had fun . she was a big girl . she was brave . she was happy . lily was restless . she did not want to nap . she wanted to play . she saw a hammer on the floor . it was big and shiny . she picked it up and smiled .

she walked around the house . she saw a vase with flowers . she did not like the vase . she lifted the hammer and smashed the vase . it broke into pieces . she heard a loud noise . she liked the noise .

she saw a picture on the wall . it was of a dog . she did not like the dog . she lifted the hammer and hit the picture . it fell off the wall . she heard another loud noise . she liked the noise .

she saw a cake on the table . it was for her brother 's birthday . she did not like her brother . she lifted the hammer and smashed the cake . it splattered everywhere . she heard a squishy noise . she liked the noise .

she heard footsteps . it was her mom . she saw what lily had done . she was angry . she took the hammer from lily and said , " no , no , no ! you are a bad girl ! you destroyed everything ! go to your room now ! "

lily cried . she did not like her mom . she did not like the hammer . she did not like anything . she wished she had napped . lily liked to look at small things with her microscope . she had a book with pictures of bugs and plants that she could find in the garden . she would put them on a slide and see how they looked under the microscope . she thought they were very pretty and interesting .

one day , she wanted to show her friend ben what she saw . she invited him to her room and gave him the microscope . " look , this is a ladybug . it has red and black spots . and this is a leaf . it has veins and hairs . do you like them ? " she asked .

ben nodded , but he was not very careful . he moved the microscope too fast and knocked it over . it fell on the floor and broke . lily was very sad and angry . " you broke my microscope ! it was my favorite toy ! how could you do that ? " she cried .

ben felt sorry and scared . he did not mean to break it . he wanted to make lily happy again . he looked around and saw a toy car on the shelf . he picked it up and gave it to lily . " i 'm sorry , lily . i did n't want to break your microscope . please do n't be mad at me . here , you can have my car . it is very fast and fun . you can replace your microscope with my car , " he said .

lily looked at the car and shook her head . she did not want the car . she wanted her microscope . she pushed the car away and turned her back to ben . she did not want to talk to him . she was very quiet .

ben felt sad and lonely . he did not know what to do . he wished he could fix the microscope . he wished he could be lily 's friend again . he learned that he should be more careful with other people 's things . he learned that he could not replace something that was special to someone else . he learned that saying sorry was not enough . he learned that he had to show respect and kindness . he hoped that lily would forgive him someday . lily loves to sing . she sings when she wakes up , when she plays , and when she goes to bed . she sings songs about flowers , stars , and animals . she sings loud and happy .

one day , lily goes to a big park with her mom . there are many children there . they run , slide , and swing . lily sees a stage with a microphone . she wants to sing on the stage . she asks her mom if she can .

" sure , honey , you can sing on the stage . but be careful , there are some judges there . they will listen to your singing and give you a score . do you know what a judge is ? " mom says .

lily shakes her head . she does not know what a judge is . she thinks it is a nice word .

" a judge is someone who decides if something is good or bad . they have a paper and a pen . they write a number on the paper . the higher the number , the better they like it . the lower the number , the worse they like it . do you understand ? " mom explains .

lily nods . she thinks she understands . she does not care about the number . she just wants to sing .

she runs to the stage . she picks up the microphone . she sees three judges sitting on chairs . they have papers and pens . they look at her . she smiles at them . she sings her favorite song . it is a song about a rainbow .

the judges listen to her singing . they write numbers on their papers . lily does not see the numbers . she sees the rainbow in her mind . she sings loud and happy .

when she finishes , she hears a clap . she looks around . she sees many people clapping . they are smiling at her . she sees her mom clapping . she is smiling at her . she sees the judges clapping . they are smiling at her . they hold up their papers . they have big numbers on them . lily does not know what the numbers mean . she thinks they are good .

she feels happy . she feels safe . she runs to her mom . she hugs her .

" mom , i sang on the stage ! did you like it ? " lily says .

