lily beams . she is proud . she is a star . she loves to sing . anna liked to sing . she sang when she woke up , when she ate , when she played and when she went to bed . she sang happy songs , sad songs , silly songs and loud songs . she sang to her toys , to her mom , to her dad and to her dog . singing made her feel good .

but anna did not have any friends who liked to sing . the other kids at the park did not want to sing with her . they said singing was boring or noisy or babyish . they wanted to run , or swing , or slide , or climb . anna tried to join them , but she felt lonely . she wished she had a friend who liked to sing as much as she did .

