he decided to try the other wheels on the new car . he put a red wheel on the front left , a blue wheel on the front right , a yellow wheel on the back left and a green wheel on the back right . he looked at the car and smiled . he thought it looked funny and colorful . he made the car go fast on the floor and made loud noises .

but then , something bad happened . the wheels did not fit well on the new car . they were too loose and wobbly . as sam made the car go fast , the wheels fell off one by one . the car crashed on the floor and made a sour noise . sam was very sad . he picked up the car and the wheels and put them back in his toy box . he wished he had black wheels for his new car .

