but then , the sky became dark and it started to rain . fluffy and the elderly man got very wet . they tried to find a place to hide from the rain , but they could not . fluffy 's toys got wet too , and they could not play anymore . fluffy and the elderly man were sad because they could not play with the toys anymore . once upon a time , there was a big red car with four round wheels . the car loved to drive fast on clear sunny days . one day , the car was driving when it saw a little boy named tim playing with his toy car .

the car stopped and said , " hi tim ! can i play with you ? " tim was very happy and said , " yes , mr. car ! i love cars ! " so , they played together all day long . they raced , and tim sat in the big red car and felt the wind in his hair .

but then , it was time for tim to go home . the big red car was sad , but tim said , " do n't worry , mr. car . i will return tomorrow to play with you again ! " the car smiled and said , " i will wait for you , tim . " the next day , tim came back , and they played together again , just like they promised . once upon a time , there was a blue sack . the blue sack was cheap , but it was very happy . it lived in a big shop with many other sacks . one day , a mean man came to the shop . he saw the blue sack and said , " you are too cheap . i do n't want you . "

the blue sack was sad . it wanted to show the mean man that it was good , even though it was cheap . so , the blue sack waited for a nice person to come to the shop . a little girl came with her mom . the little girl saw the blue sack and said , " i like this blue sack . can i have it , mom ? " the mom said yes , and they took the blue sack home .

the blue sack was very helpful at the little girl 's house . it held all of her toys and made her happy . the mean man saw the little girl and the blue sack one day . he saw how happy they were together . the mean man learned that even cheap things can be good and make people happy . and the blue sack , the little girl , and the mean man all lived happily ever after . one day , a boy named tim found a big pot of glue . he wanted to use the glue to make a pretty picture . tim was very happy . but his little sister , sue , saw the glue too . she wanted to use it for her toys .

tim and sue started to fight over the glue . they pulled and pulled , but no one would let go . the glue spilled all over the floor . now , the glue was spoiled , and they could n't use it for their picture or toys .

tim and sue were sad . their mom came in and saw the mess . she said , " you must learn to share and lead each other to do good things . " tim and sue said sorry to each other . they cleaned up the glue and promised to share and lead each other to do good things from now on . once upon a time , in a small town , there was a lazy cat named tom . he loved to sleep all day and play all night . tom had a mystery box that he found in his yard . he did not know what was inside , but he wanted to find out .

one sunny day , tom met a new friend named sam , a little dog . tom told sam , " i have a mystery box , but it is locked . can you help me open it ? " sam wagged his tail and said , " yes , let 's try to open it together ! "

tom and sam tried to unlock the mystery box . they pushed it , pulled it , and even tried to bite it open . but the box stayed locked . they were tired but did not give up . finally , they found a key under a big rock . tom put the key in the lock and turned it . the mystery box opened , and inside were many colorful toys for tom and sam to play with . they were so happy and played together all day long . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she found a letter on the ground . the letter was lost . lily was a thoughtful girl , so she wanted to help .

lily asked her mom how to return the letter . her mom said , " we can go to the post office and give it to the mailman . he will know what to do . "

they went to the post office and gave the letter to the mailman . the mailman smiled and said , " thank you , lily ! you are very thoughtful . " lily felt happy that she could help return the letter . once upon a time , in a small village , there was a little girl named lucy . lucy was nervous to go outside and play . she was scared that she would get lost . but one day , she decided to be brave and go on an adventure .

lucy walked and walked until she discovered a big forest . she saw pretty flowers and tall trees . lucy was so happy that she forgot to be nervous . but as she went deeper into the forest , the sky became dark and it started to rain .

lucy tried to find her way back to the village , but she could n't . she became very , very scared . the rain got heavier and the wind blew harder . lucy cried and cried , but no one could hear her . and so , lucy stayed lost in the forest , never finding her way back home . once upon a time , a little boy named tim had a basketball . he loved to play with it all day long . he would bounce it , throw it , and roll it on the ground . tim 's basketball was his best friend .

one day , tim found a big scale . he thought , " i want to weigh my basketball ! " so , he put his basketball on the scale . the scale said the basketball was not heavy . tim was happy because he could still play with it easily .

tim played with his basketball for a long , long time . he became very good at it . all his friends wanted to play with him and his basketball . tim was happy , and so was his basketball . they played together for many more long days , always having fun . once upon a time , there was a thoughtful boy named tim . tim loved to tie his shoes all by himself . he was very good at it . one day , he went for a walk in the park with his mom .

in the park , tim saw a shiny rock . his mom told him it was a mineral . tim thought the mineral was very pretty . he wanted to take it home with him .

tim had an idea . he used his shoe lace to tie the mineral to his shoe . he was so happy to have the pretty mineral with him . tim and his mom went home , and tim showed the mineral to his dad . they all loved the shiny mineral tim found . once upon a time , there was a brave little dog named max . max loved to run , jump , and play with his friends . one sunny day , max and his best friend , a small cat named lily , went on an adventure to find some yummy food .

as they walked , max said , " i 'm so thirsty ! let 's find something to drink . " lily agreed and they continued on their journey . soon , they found a little pond with clear water . " let 's drink from the pond ! " said lily . they both drank the cool water and felt happy .

after they drank , they saw a big tree with lots of food hanging from it . " look , max ! food ! " lily shouted . they both climbed the tree and ate the delicious fruit . they were very brave and had a great adventure . at the end of the day , max and lily went home , full and happy . once , there was a soft horse named tom . tom lived on a big farm with his friends . they liked to play and eat together . one day , tom had a plan to have more fun with his friends .

tom 's plan was to play a new game . the game was called " find the carrot " . he told his friends about the game and they all wanted to play . so , they all went to look for carrots around the farm .

they looked near the trees , under the rocks , and by the pond . at last , they found many carrots near the garden . tom and his friends were very happy . they enjoyed the new game and played it all day long . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lucy . she loved to play with her toys all day . lucy was a very obedient girl and always listened to her mom and dad .

one sunny day , lucy went to play in the park . while playing , she found a shiny diamond on the ground . she was very happy and picked it up . lucy wanted to show her mom and dad the pretty diamond .

lucy went home and showed the diamond to her mom and dad . they were very proud of their obedient girl for sharing her find . they all played together with the shiny diamond and had a lot of fun . from that day on , the diamond became lucy 's favorite toy to play with . once upon a time , in a small town , there was a famous sunflower . the sunflower was very big and tall . all the people in the town loved the sunflower . they would come to see it every day .

one day , a little boy named tim went to see the famous sunflower . he saw that the sunflower was sad . tim asked the sunflower , " why are you sad ? " the sunflower said , " i am sad because i am all alone . " tim wanted to help the sunflower . he had an idea .

tim went home and got some seeds . he came back to the sunflower and planted the seeds all around it . soon , many new sunflowers grew . the famous sunflower was not alone anymore . it was very happy . the people in the town were happy too . they learned that it is important to help others when they are sad or alone . and that is the story of the famous sunflower and the little boy named tim . once upon a time , in a yellow house , there lived a little girl named lily . she loved to play with her toy bird that could soar high in the sky . one sunny day , lily took her toy bird outside to play .

as lily made her toy bird soar up and down , she saw her friend tom . tom had a big jar of jelly with him . " hi , lily ! do you want to eat some jelly with me ? " tom asked . lily smiled and said , " yes , i love jelly ! "

lily and tom sat under a big tree and shared the jelly . they laughed and talked as they watched lily 's toy bird soar high in the sky . they had a great day playing together with the toy bird and eating the sweet jelly . once upon a time , there was a farm . on the farm , there were many animals . there was a big pig , a little duck , and a funny rabbit . they liked to play together every day .

one sunny day , the rabbit said , " let 's play a game ! we can spring and jump all around the farm ! " the pig and the duck agreed . so , they started to jump and spring . they jumped over the tasty apples and the green grass . they had a lot of fun .

after playing , the pig said , " i am hungry . let 's eat some tasty food from the farm . " the duck and the rabbit agreed . they all sat down and ate the tasty apples together . they laughed and talked . they were happy to be friends on the farm . once upon a time , there was a purple bird named bobo . bobo loved to eat oats . one day , while flying , he saw a big bag of oats on the ground . bobo was very happy and said , " yummy ! oats for me ! "

bobo tried to open the bag , but it was closed very tight . he thought , " how can i solve this ? " bobo asked his friend , the squirrel , for help . the squirrel said , " let 's work together to open the bag ! "

bobo and the squirrel pulled and pulled . finally , the bag opened ! they both said , " we did it ! we solved the problem ! " they shared the oats and were very happy . from that day on , they were the best of friends . once upon a time , there was a little boy named tim . tim was a tough boy who liked to play outside . one day , tim saw a big ant . the ant was carrying a piece of sugar .

tim said , " hi , ant ! do you need help ? " the ant said , " yes , please ! this sugar is very heavy . " so tim helped the ant carry the sugar . they walked and walked until they reached the ant 's home .

when they got there , the ant said , " thank you , tim ! you are a good friend . " tim smiled and said , " you 're welcome , ant ! i 'm happy to help . " and from that day on , tim and the ant were the best of friends . ben and lily liked to play in the garden . they had a hose that made water come out . they liked to spray the water on the flowers and the grass . sometimes they sprayed each other and laughed .

one day , they saw a bird on the fence . the bird was brown and had a red spot on its head . it was singing a pretty song . ben and lily wanted to talk to the bird . they said hello and asked its name .

but the bird did not answer . it just kept singing . ben and lily thought the bird was deaf . they felt sad for the bird . they wanted to help it hear .

they had an idea . they took the hose and sprayed water on the bird . they thought the water would make the bird 's ears clean and clear . they said , " can you hear us now , bird ? "

but the bird did not like the water . it got wet and angry . it stopped singing and flew away . ben and lily were surprised and sorry . they did not mean to scare the bird .

they learned a lesson . they learned that not all animals like water . they learned that some animals have different ways of hearing . they learned to be kind and gentle to the bird . they hoped the bird would come back and sing again . they wanted to encourage the bird to be their friend . lila and ben are twins who love to play with their toy trains . they have a long track that goes around their room and many different trains to choose from . they like to polish their trains every day to make them shiny and smooth .

one day , lila and ben have a big fight . lila wants to use the red train , but ben says it is his and he wo n't share . lila says she polished it yesterday , so it is hers today . ben says he polished it this morning , so it is his all day . they pull and tug on the red train , but neither of them will let go .

they are so busy fighting that they do n't notice their little brother , sam , who is crawling into their room . sam sees the long track and the shiny trains and thinks they are fun to play with . he grabs the blue train and puts it in his mouth . he chews and bites on it , making it dirty and broken .

lila and ben hear sam 's noise and look at him . they are shocked and angry to see what he has done to their blue train . they run to him and try to take it away , but sam cries and holds on . lila and ben forget about their fight and work together to calm sam down . they explain to him that the trains are not for eating , but for rolling on the track . they show him how to play with them gently and safely .

lila and ben learn their lesson . they realize that fighting over the red train was silly and selfish . they decide to share their trains and their track with each other and with sam . they also remember to polish their trains every day , but not too much , so they do n't get too attached to them . they are happy and grateful for their toys and their family .

the moral value of the story is : sharing is caring , and fighting is not nice . lila and tom are twins . they like to play in the park with their mom and dad . one day , they see a big slide . they want to go on the slide .

" mom , dad , can we go on the slide ? " they ask .

" sure , but be careful and wait your turn , " mom and dad say .

lila and tom run to the slide . they see a line of kids waiting to go on the slide . they do not want to wait . they want to go now .

they push and shove the other kids . they make them cry and fall . they reach the slide and climb up fast .

" stop , that is not nice ! " mom and dad shout .

but lila and tom do not listen . they slide down together . they think they are having fun .

but when they reach the bottom , they see something scary . there is a big hole in the slide . it is the exit . but it is not a good exit . it is an empty exit . there is nothing under the hole . only air .

lila and tom scream . they are afraid . they hold each other tight . they wish they had been nice .

mom and dad run to the slide . they see the hole . they are scared too . they call for help .

soon , a fireman comes . he has a ladder and a rope . he climbs up the slide . he reaches the hole . he sees lila and tom . they are still screaming .

" do n't worry , i will save you , " he says .

he ties the rope around them . he lowers them down . he gives them to mom and dad .

lila and tom are safe . but they are not happy . they are sorry . they hug mom and dad . they say sorry to the other kids . they say thank you to the fireman .

they learn a lesson . they learn to be nice and wait their turn . they learn to be careful and look before they slide . they learn that a bad exit can lead to an empty fall . tim and lily were playing in the park . they liked to sort the leaves by color and shape . they made piles of red , yellow , green and brown leaves . they had fun throwing the leaves in the air and catching them .

" look , tim , i found a big stick ! " lily said , holding a long , thin branch . " let 's use it to make a fence for our leaves . "

" ok , lily , that 's a good idea , " tim said . he took the stick from lily and started to poke it into the ground . he made a line of holes around their piles of leaves .

but the stick was not a stick . it was a bone . a bone from a skeleton . a skeleton that was buried under the leaves . a skeleton that was angry and hungry .

the skeleton felt the bone moving . it woke up from its long sleep . it pulled the bone out of the ground . it saw tim and lily . it smiled with its big , white teeth .

" hello , little ones , " the skeleton said in a low , calm voice . " do you want to play with me ? "

tim and lily were scared . they screamed and ran away . but the skeleton was faster . it grabbed them with its bony hands . it dragged them under the leaves . it ate them up .

the end . lily and ben are friends . they like to play outside . one day , they see a big colorful tent in the park . they want to go inside .

" look , ben , a tent ! let 's go and see ! " lily says .

" ok , lily , but be careful . maybe there are big people inside , " ben says .

they hop to the tent . they open the flap . they see a lot of cups and pots and spoons . they smell something nice .

" wow , what is this ? " lily asks .

" i think it is coffee . my mom drinks coffee in the morning . she says it makes her happy , " ben says .

" can we try some ? " lily asks .

" i do n't know . maybe it is too hot . maybe it is not for kids , " ben says .

they hear a voice . it is a lady . she is smiling . she has a colorful dress and a colorful hat .

" hello , little ones . do you like my coffee shop ? i sell coffee and tea and cookies and cakes . do you want some ? " she says .

lily and ben are shy . they do not know the lady .

" who are you ? " lily asks .

" i am anna . i travel with my tent and my coffee . i like to meet new people and share my coffee . do you want to be my friends ? " anna says .

lily and ben nod . they like anna . she is nice and colorful .

" ok , then . come and sit with me . i will give you some milk and cookies . and maybe a little bit of coffee , if you want . but not too much . coffee is for grown - ups , mostly , " anna says .

lily and ben are happy . they sit with anna . they drink milk and eat cookies . they taste a little bit of coffee . it is bitter and warm . they make faces .

anna laughs . she tells them stories about her travels and her coffee . they listen and ask questions . they have fun .

they hop to the tent . they open the flap . they see a lot of cups and pots and spoons . they smell something nice .

the end . tim and lily liked to play in the garage . they found many things there , like old toys , tools and boxes . sometimes they pretended they were pirates or astronauts or detectives . one day , they saw a big black bag in the corner . it looked mysterious .

" what is in there ? " tim asked .

" i do n't know . let 's open it and see , " lily said .

they walked to the bag and pulled the zipper . inside , they saw something shiny and round . it had wires and buttons and a screen . it looked like a bomb .

" wow , what is this ? " lily said .

" i think it 's a toy . maybe it makes noises or lights , " tim said .

he reached for the buttons and pressed one . the screen flashed red and a loud beep sounded . a voice said , " warning , warning , bomb activated . ten seconds to explosion . "

tim and lily were scared . they did not know what to do . they ran to the door and tried to open it , but it was locked . they banged on the door and shouted for help , but no one heard them .

they looked at each other and cried . they hugged and said , " i love you . "

they saw a window and waved to the outside , hoping someone would see them and save them . but no one did .

the bomb counted down . five , four , three , two , one .

boom . tom and sue like to play with their toy boat . they take it to the pond and sail it on the water . they have fun watching it go fast and slow , left and right .

one day , they see a big fat duck on the pond . the duck is hungry and looks at their boat . it thinks it is food . it swims towards it and opens its mouth .

" look out , tom ! " sue shouts . " the duck wants our boat ! "

tom tries to pull the boat back , but it is too late . the duck bites the boat and breaks it . it makes a loud quack and swims away .

tom and sue are sad . they cry and hug each other . they have no boat to play with anymore .

they go home and tell their mom what happened . she is sorry for them , but she is also angry . she says they should not have taken the boat to the pond . she says it was her laundry basket and she needs it to wash their clothes .

tom and sue feel bad . they say they are sorry and they will not do it again . they help their mom with the laundry , but they still miss their boat . they wish they had a real boat that the duck could not eat . lily and tom like to go to the park with mom . they see many things in the park . they see trees and flowers and birds and dogs . they like to play on the swings and the slide and the sandbox .

one day , they see something new in the park . it is a big white horse . the horse is very pretty and graceful . it has long hair and a shiny coat . it walks and runs and jumps in the park . lily and tom want to touch the horse and say hello .

mom says they can go near the horse , but they have to be careful and gentle . the horse has a name . it is snowy . snowy is a friendly horse . he likes to eat carrots and apples and sugar cubes . lily and tom give him some treats . they pet his nose and his mane and his back . they feel his soft fur and his warm breath .

snowy likes lily and tom . he lets them sit on his back and hold his reins . he takes them for a ride in the park . they go fast and slow and around and around . they feel the wind and the sun and the joy . they laugh and smile and hug snowy .

lily and tom love snowy . they say thank you and goodbye to him . they hope to see him again in the park . they go home with mom . they tell dad about their adventure . they dream of snowy and the park . they are happy . tom and anna liked to play on the farm . they liked to see the cows , the pigs , the chickens and the sheep . the sheep were soft and white and had funny faces .

one day , tom and anna saw a new sheep . it was small and black and had a loud voice . it was a baby sheep . the baby sheep wanted to play with tom and anna . it ran after them and made a lot of noise . " baa , baa , baa ! " it said .

tom and anna were scared of the baby sheep . they ran away and hid behind a big tree . they did not want to play with the baby sheep . they wanted to play with the other sheep . the other sheep were quiet and gentle .

but the baby sheep did not give up . it followed tom and anna to the tree . it pushed its head through the branches and looked at them . it opened its mouth and said , " baa , baa , baa ! " it demanded to play with tom and anna .

tom and anna did not know what to do . they did not like the baby sheep . it was noisy and rude . they wished it would go away . but then they saw something . they saw the baby sheep 's eyes . they were big and brown and sad . the baby sheep was lonely . it had no friends .

tom and anna felt sorry for the baby sheep . they decided to give it a chance . they came out from behind the tree and said , " hello , baby sheep . do you want to play with us ? " the baby sheep nodded and smiled . it said , " baa , baa , baa ! " it was happy .

tom and anna and the baby sheep played together on the farm . they had fun and became friends . the baby sheep was not noisy and rude anymore . it was nice and sweet . tom and anna liked the baby sheep . and the baby sheep liked tom and anna . lily and ben are friends . they like to play in the garden . they see many flowers and bugs . they also see a big rabbit . the rabbit is brown and soft . it hops around the garden and eats vegetables .

" hello , rabbit ! " lily says . " do you want to play with us ? "

the rabbit looks at lily and ben . it wiggles its nose and ears . it does not say anything . it is shy .

" please , rabbit , do not be shy , " ben says . " we are nice . we will not hurt you . "

the rabbit thinks for a moment . it likes lily and ben . they are lively and kind . it decides to play with them . it hops closer to them and bows its head . it is a friendly gesture .

lily and ben are happy . they bow back to the rabbit . they give it some carrots and lettuce . they pet it gently . they play hide and seek and tag with it . they have a lot of fun .

the rabbit is happy too . it has made new friends . it likes to play in the garden . it likes to eat vegetables . it likes to bow to lily and ben . it is a good day . tom and jen are friends who like to play with tops . they have many tops of different colors and shapes . they spin their tops on the floor and watch them go round and round .

one day , tom finds a new top in his toy box . it is big and shiny and has a star on it . he thinks it is the best top ever . he shows it to jen and says , " look at my new top ! it is faster and prettier than yours . i bet it can spin longer than any other top . "

jen feels sad and angry . she likes her tops too . she thinks they are fun and beautiful . she says , " no , your top is not the best . my tops are better . they have more colors and patterns . they can spin just as long as yours . let 's have a contest and see who has the best top . "

tom agrees . he is competitive and wants to prove that his top is the best . he and jen go to the backyard and find a flat spot to spin their tops . they count to three and let their tops go . they watch them closely and cheer for their own tops .

but something goes wrong . tom 's new top is not as good as he thought . it wobbles and slows down quickly . it falls to the ground and stops spinning . jen 's tops keep spinning and spinning . they are steady and smooth . jen wins the contest .

tom feels sad and angry . he looks at his new top and sees that it is not shiny anymore . it has scratches and dents on it . it looks old and rotten . he says , " this top is no good . it is broken and ugly . i do n't want it anymore . " he throws it away and runs to his house .

jen feels sorry for tom . she knows he liked his new top . she thinks it is not nice to throw away a toy . she picks up tom 's top and looks at it . she sees that it still has a star on it . she thinks it is still special . she says , " this top is not rotten . it is just different . it has a story to tell . maybe we can fix it and play with it again . " she puts it in her pocket and goes to find tom . she wants to be his friend and share her tops with him . ben and lily were on a big boat with their mom and dad . they were going to a new place called a port . a port was where many boats came and went . ben and lily liked to look at the different boats and the people on them .

one day , they saw a very big boat with a big flag . it was red and white and blue . mom said it was from a country called france . ben and lily wanted to go on the boat and see what was inside .

" can we go , mom ? can we go ? " they asked .

mom smiled and said , " maybe , but you have to mind me and dad . the boat is very big and you could get lost . and you have to be polite to the people on the boat . they speak a different language than us . "

ben and lily nodded . they said they would mind mom and dad and be polite . they followed them to the boat . a man in a blue suit and a white hat greeted them . he said something in a funny way . mom said it was hello in french . ben and lily said hello back .

the man let them on the boat . he showed them around . he showed them the rooms , the kitchen , the dining hall , and the deck . ben and lily saw many incredible things . they saw paintings , statues , books , and toys . they saw food , drinks , flowers , and cakes . they saw people , dogs , cats , and birds . they saw the water , the sky , the sun , and the clouds .

ben and lily had a lot of fun on the boat . they thanked the man for showing them around . they said goodbye in french . they went back to their boat with mom and dad . they told them what they saw and how they felt . mom and dad were happy that ben and lily enjoyed the boat . they hugged them and said they were proud of them . they said they would see more incredible things at the port . ben and lily smiled . they could n't wait . tom and lily like to play with rockets . they have many rockets of different colors and sizes . they pretend to fly to the moon and the stars . one day , they find a big rocket in the park . it is red and shiny and has a button on it .

" wow , look at this rocket ! " tom says . " it is so big and cool . i want to fly it . "

" me too , " lily says . " but how do we fly it ? "

tom sees the button and pushes it . the rocket makes a loud noise and starts to move . it goes up and up in the air .

" tom , what did you do ? " lily shouts . " the rocket is flying away ! "

" come on , lily , let 's follow it ! " tom says . he runs after the rocket .

lily is scared . she does not want to follow the rocket . she thinks it is dangerous . she wants to stay in the park .

" tom , wait for me ! " lily cries . " do n't follow the rocket . it is too fast and too high . we will get lost . "

but tom does not listen . he is excited . he wants to see where the rocket goes . he thinks it will take him to the moon and the stars . he runs faster and faster .

lily tries to catch up with tom . but she is weak . she can not run as fast as tom . she gets tired and out of breath . she falls down and hurts her knee .

" tom , help me ! " lily screams . " i am hurt and scared . i want to go back to the park . "

but tom does not hear her . he is too far away . he follows the rocket until it disappears in the sky . he does not know where he is . he is alone and lost . he wishes he had stayed with lily . he wishes he had not pushed the button . he wishes he had not followed the rocket . sara and ben are very happy . they are going to the theater with mom and dad . they like to watch movies on the big screen . they have popcorn and juice in their hands .

they enter the theater and look for seats . the theater is open and bright . there are many people and noises . sara and ben see a big poster of a lion and a girl . the poster says " the lion and the girl " . sara and ben want to see that movie .

" mom , dad , can we see that movie ? " sara asks .

" sorry , honey , that movie is not for little kids . it is scary and sad . we are going to see a different movie . it is funny and fun . you will like it . " mom says .

" what movie is it ? " ben asks .

" it is called " the dog and the bone " . it is about a dog who loves bones and goes on an adventure . he meets many friends and enemies . he learns a lesson . it is a good movie . " dad says .

