they were happy and relieved . they decided to play something else . they left the jungle and went to the kitchen , where they had some cookies and milk . they learned to be careful when they play pretend . tommy liked to play soccer with his friends in the park . he had a big ball that he could kick hard and fast . sometimes he kicked the ball too hard and it went out of the park . he had to run and get it back .

