he had a lot of fun in his new chamber . he received the best gift ever . he was very happy . lily and max are twins . they like to play in the park with their dog , spot . one day , they see a big sign in the park . the sign has a picture of a cat and some words . lily and max can read some words , but not all of them . they ask their mom what the sign says .

