one day , anna saw a big peach on the tree . it was the biggest peach she had ever seen . she wanted to eat it . she reached for it , but it was too high . she tried to jump , but she was too small . she looked for a stool , but there was none . she felt sad and angry .

she saw her brother ben nearby . he was taller than her . he was playing with his truck . anna had an idea . she ran to him and said , " ben , can you help me ? i want the big peach on the tree . can you get it for me ? "

