ben and lily were scared and ran away . they hid behind a tree and whispered to each other . " who is he ? why is he here ? he is so big and strange ! " ben said . " i do n't know . maybe he is lonely and wants a friend . he looks nice and sad , " lily said .

the giant saw them hiding and walked slowly towards them . he knelt down and said , " please do n't be afraid . i mean no harm . i just came to visit this place . i live far away , in the mountains . i do n't have many friends there . will you be my friends ? "

ben and lily looked at each other . they felt sorry for the giant . he seemed kind and gentle . they decided to give him a chance . they came out from behind the tree and said , " ok , we will be your friends . but you have to be careful . you are very big and we are very small . you might hurt us by accident . "

the giant nodded and said , " i understand . i will be careful . thank you for accepting me . what are your names ? " ben and lily told him their names and asked him his . he said , " my name is gulliver . nice to meet you , ben and lily . what do you like to play ? "

ben and lily told him about their favorite games and toys . they showed him their ball , their bike , their doll and their truck . the giant was amazed and curious . he wanted to try them all , but he was too big for them . he said , " i wish i had toys like yours . they are so fun and colorful . i only have rocks and sticks in the mountains . "

ben and lily felt sorry for him again . they wanted to make him happy . they had an idea . they said , " we can make you some toys . we can use some cardboard , some paint , some glue and some scissors . we can make you a big ball , a big bike , a big doll and a big truck . do you want that ? "

