tom and sam felt sorry and scared . they said they were sorry , and they ran back to their home . they learned a lesson that day . they learned that taking things without asking is wrong , and that being greedy can lead to trouble . they learned to respect other people 's things , and to be thankful for what they have . one day , a pirate named jack was sailing on his big boat with his loyal crew . they liked to find treasure and have fun . but they also had a problem . another pirate named tom wanted to take their boat and treasure . he had a bigger boat and more crew . he was very mean and greedy .

