jack and his crew shared their treasure with the fishers . they gave them gold and jewels and pearls . the fishers gave them fish and nets and hooks . they were happy and grateful . they became friends . they sailed away together . they were loyal and united . they were good pirates . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in the garden . but they are not allowed to go near the big shed . the big shed has steel tools and machines . mom and dad say they are dangerous .

one day , anna and ben are bored . they see the big shed . they want to see what is inside . they are naughty . they sneak to the shed when mom and dad are not looking . they open the door and go in .

