they go to the kitchen and enjoy their hot chocolate . they talk and laugh with their mom . they are happy . they are a happy family . lisa and ben are best friends . they live next door to each other and play every day . they like to run , jump , draw , and sing together . they make a lot of noise , but they are happy .

one day , ben has to go away with his family . they are going to visit his grandma in another town . ben tells lisa that he will be back soon . he gives her a hug and a picture of them . lisa feels sad . she says , " i will miss you , ben . have fun with your grandma . "

lisa tries to play by herself , but it is not the same . she does not have anyone to run , jump , draw , and sing with . she does not make any noise , but she is not happy . she looks at the picture of ben and wishes he was here .

the next day , lisa hears a knock on the door . she opens it and sees ben . he has a big smile and a toy for her . he says , " i am back , lisa . i missed you too . grandma gave me this toy for you . she is very compassionate . she said you are a good friend . "

lisa is overjoyed . she hugs ben and thanks him for the toy . she says , " i am so glad you are back , ben . you are a good friend too . let 's play together and make some noise . "

they run , jump , draw , and sing together . they make a lot of noise , but they are happy . they do not miss each other anymore . they are best friends . sara was very happy . she had a pool in her backyard . she liked to swim and splash with her toys . she wanted to share her pool with her friends .

she invited tom , lily and ben to come to her pool . they were very excited . they brought their swimsuits and towels . they said thank you to sara and her mom .

they had a great time in the pool . they played games and laughed . they were careful and kind to each other . they listened to sara 's mom when she told them the rules .

sara was very proud . she had good friends . she liked to share her pool with them . she learned that sharing is fun and makes everyone happy . she gave them hugs and said goodbye . she hoped they would come again soon . lily and tom are friends . they like to play at school . they have a big blackboard in their classroom . they can draw and write on it with chalk .

one day , lily and tom want to draw a big house on the blackboard . they want to pretend they are wealthy and live in a nice house . they draw a door , windows , a roof , and a garden . they are happy with their house .

but then , ben comes in . ben is mean . he does not like lily and tom . he wants to ruin their house . he takes a red chalk and draws a big x on the blackboard . he laughs and says , " your house is ugly and stupid . you are not wealthy . you are poor and silly . "

lily and tom are sad and angry . they do not like ben . they want to erase the x and fix their house . but ben is bigger and stronger than them . he pushes them away and says , " go away . this is my blackboard . i can do what i want . "

lily and tom do not know what to do . they look around and see a chair . they have an idea . they work together and move the chair to the blackboard . they climb on the chair and lean on the blackboard . they use their hands and feet to rub off the x. they fix their house and smile .

ben is surprised and mad . he tries to stop them , but he is too late . he falls off the chair and hurts his knee . he cries and runs away .

lily and tom are proud and happy . they hug each other and say , " we are friends . we are wealthy . we have a nice house . " they play and have fun . they do not care about ben . they love their blackboard . lily was going to start school soon . she was very excited , but also a little worry . she did not know any of the other kids or the teacher . she did not know what they would do or learn . she did not know if they would like her .

the day before school , her mom gave her a new uniform . it was a blue dress with white buttons and a red bow . lily liked it very much . she thought it was pretty and comfortable . she tried it on and looked at herself in the mirror . she smiled and twirled around .

the next morning , lily put on her uniform and her backpack . she ate her breakfast and brushed her teeth . she hugged her mom and dad and got in the car . they drove to the school and parked . lily saw a big building with many windows and doors . she saw a playground with swings and slides . she saw many kids with different uniforms and backpacks .

lily felt a little worry again . she held her mom 's hand and walked to the door . she saw a lady with a big smile and a name tag . she said , " hello , i 'm miss rose , your teacher . welcome to school , lily . you look charming in your uniform . come in , i have a surprise for you . "

lily followed miss rose into the classroom . she saw many toys and books and colors . she saw a big table with a cake and candles . she saw a sign that said , " happy birthday , lily ! " she saw all the kids clapping and cheering . she felt a big surprise and a big joy . she forgot her worry and said , " thank you , miss rose . thank you , everyone . this is the best day ever ! " sam liked to hold his toy car . he took it everywhere he went . he liked to make it zoom and beep and pretend he was driving . he also liked to hold his mom 's hand when they walked to the park . she was nice and warm and made him feel safe .

one day , sam 's mom had to go to a lecture . she said it was about something important for her work . she said she would be back soon and asked sam to stay with his grandma . sam was sad . he wanted to go with his mom . he did not like lectures . they were boring and long and made him sleepy .

sam 's grandma was nice , but she did not have any toys . she only had books and puzzles and a big clock . sam did not like books and puzzles and clocks . he liked cars and balls and trains . he missed his toy car . he left it in his mom 's car by mistake . he wished he could hold it and play with it .

sam 's grandma tried to cheer him up . she gave him a cookie and a glass of milk . she read him a story and sang him a song . she showed him how to make a paper airplane and how to draw a flower . sam smiled a little , but he still felt sad .

then , sam heard a familiar sound . it was his mom 's car . she was back from the lecture . she parked outside and ran to the door . she hugged sam and his grandma and said she was sorry she was late . she said the lecture was very interesting , but she missed sam a lot . she said she had a surprise for him . she reached into her bag and pulled out his toy car . she said she found it in her car and knew he would want it . she gave it to him and said she loved him .

sam was very happy . he held his toy car and his mom 's hand . he said he loved her too . he said he was sorry he was sad . he said he liked his grandma and her cookie and her story and her song and her airplane and her flower . he said he did not like lectures , but he was glad his mom learned something important . he said he wanted to go to the park and make his car zoom and beep and pretend he was driving . he said he wanted to have fun with his mom and his grandma and his car . he said he was a nice boy . lily and ben were playing with their toys in the living room . lily had a doll and ben had a car . they liked to make up stories and pretend they were going on adventures .

" let 's call grandma and tell her what we did today , " lily said . she picked up the telephone and pressed some buttons . she put the telephone to her ear and smiled .

" hello , grandma , it 's lily and ben . we are having fun with our toys . we went to the park and saw some ducks . we fed them bread and they quacked . then we came home and had a snack . we had cookies and milk . they were yummy . "

grandma was very happy to hear from lily and ben . she loved them very much and missed them . she asked them some questions and told them some stories . she sounded cheerful and kind .

" thank you for calling me , lily and ben . you made my day . i love you very much and i ca n't wait to see you soon . have a good night and sweet dreams . "

lily and ben said they loved her too and said goodbye . they hung up the telephone and hugged each other . they were glad they had a grandma who cared for them . they put away their toys and went to bed . they had completed a good day . ben and lily were playing in the park . they saw a big hill with a hole in it . they wanted to see what was inside .

" let 's go to the cave ! " ben said .

" ok , but be careful ! " lily said .

they ran to the hill and crawled into the hole . it was dark and cold . they saw some rocks and some bugs . they heard some noises .

" what is that ? " lily asked .

" i do n't know . maybe a bear ! " ben said .

they were scared . they wanted to go back .

" let 's jump out of the cave ! " lily said .

" ok , but how ? " ben said .

they looked for a way out . they saw a small opening with some light . they had to jump very high to reach it .

" can you do it ? " ben asked .

" i can try ! " lily said .

she jumped as hard as she could . she grabbed the edge of the opening . she pulled herself up .

" i did it ! " lily said .

" good job ! " ben said .

he jumped too . he also grabbed the edge . he pulled himself up .

" we did it ! " ben said .

they were happy . they ran back to the park . they told their mom and dad about their adventure .

" wow , you are very brave ! " mom said .

" and very smart ! " dad said .

they hugged ben and lily . they gave them some juice and cookies . ben and lily smiled . they liked the cave , but they liked their mom and dad more . here is one possible story , but there are many other ways to write it .

lily and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . they have a ball and a dog . the dog is big and brown . his name is rex .

one day , they see a high tree in the park . it has red and yellow leaves . lily and ben want to climb the tree . they think it is fun . they leave the ball and the dog on the ground .

but rex does not like to stay on the ground . he likes to run and jump . he sees the ball and he wants to play . he starts to chase the ball . he runs fast and far . he does not hear lily and ben call him .

lily and ben are scared . they do not see rex . they do not see the ball . they think rex is lost . they climb down the tree . they look for rex . they shout his name .

they hear a bark . they see rex . he is not lost . he is in another part of the park . he has the ball in his mouth . he is happy . he sees lily and ben . he runs to them . he wags his tail .

lily and ben are happy too . they hug rex . they take the ball . they say sorry to rex . they say they will not leave him alone . they play with him and the ball . they have fun . they love rex . rex loves them . sara and tom are friends . they like to play in the park . they see a big slide . sara wants to go first . she climbs up the ladder and sits on the slide .

" are you ready ? " she asks tom .

" yes , i am ready ! " tom says .

sara slides down very fast . she is happy . she laughs and says , " whee ! "

but then she sees something on the ground . it is a pepper . a red pepper . sara does not like peppers . she thinks they are hot and yucky . she tries to avoid the pepper , but she can not . she slides right over it . she feels a sting on her leg . she cries out , " ow ! "

tom slides down after her . he sees sara crying . he is worried . he runs to her and asks , " what happened ? are you okay ? "

sara points to the pepper and says , " i hit the pepper . it hurt me . it is not nice . "

tom picks up the pepper and throws it away . he says , " i am sorry , sara . the pepper is gone now . it will not hurt you anymore . "

he hugs sara and says , " you are brave . you are my friend . i will make you feel better . "

he takes sara to the bench . he gives her a band - aid for her leg . he gives her a cookie from his backpack . he gives her a smile .

sara stops crying . she says , " thank you , tom . you are nice . you are my friend . you make me feel better . "

they eat the cookie together . they share a laugh . they go back to play . they have fun . they are happy . lily liked to play in the garden . she liked to smell the flowers , chase the butterflies and dig in the dirt . she had a little shovel and a bucket that she used to make mud pies .

one day , lily 's mom said , " lily , you ca n't play in the garden today . it is too wet and cold . you will get sick and dirty . you can play inside with your toys . "

lily was sad . she did not want to play inside . she wanted to play in the garden . she said , " but mom , i love the garden . please , can i play in the garden ? "

" no , lily , you ca n't . i 'm sorry , but it is not safe . maybe tomorrow , if the sun comes out , you can play in the garden . now , come inside and have some milk and cookies . "

lily did not listen . she was angry and stubborn . she ran out of the door and into the garden . she did not care if it was wet and cold . she wanted to have fun .

but soon , lily realized that playing in the garden was not fun at all . the flowers were droopy , the butterflies were gone and the dirt was sticky . she slipped and fell in a puddle . she got mud all over her clothes and hair . she started to shiver and sneeze . she felt miserable .

she wished she had listened to her mom . she wished she had played inside . she wished she had some milk and cookies . she cried and cried .

her mom heard her cry and came out to the garden . she saw lily in the puddle , covered in mud . she felt sorry for her . she said , " oh , lily , what have you done ? you are wet and dirty and sick . you did not obey me . you did not allow me to help you . come on , let 's go inside and get you cleaned up . "

she picked up lily and carried her inside . she gave her a warm bath , a dry dress and a cozy blanket . she gave her some milk and cookies and a hug . she said , " lily , i love you . i only want what is best for you . next time , please listen to me . i know what is good for you . "

lily felt ashamed and sorry . she said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i love you too . you are right . i should have listened to you . i should have allowed you to help me . thank you for taking care of me . can i play in the garden tomorrow ? "

mom smiled and said , " yes , lily , you can play in the garden tomorrow . if the sun comes out and the garden is dry and bright . but only if you promise to be careful and follow my rules . "

lily nodded and said , " i promise , mom . i will be careful and follow your rules . i will be a good girl . "

mom kissed her and said , " that 's my lily . now , let 's read a story and have a nap . you need to rest and get well . "

lily snuggled with her mom and said , " ok , mom . i like stories and naps . i like you and the garden . i am happy . "

the end . ben and mia are brother and sister . they like to play with their toys in their room . one day , their mom tells them to clean their room and put away their toys . she says they have too many toys and they should sell some of them .

ben and mia do not want to sell their toys . they love their toys and they have fun with them . they do not want to give them to other kids . they try to hide their toys under the bed and in the closet . but their mom finds them and puts them in a big box . she says she will take them to the market and sell them .

ben and mia are sad and angry . they do not want to lose their toys . they sneak out of the house and follow their mom to the market . they see their mom talking to a lady who wants to buy their toys . the lady looks at the toys and says they are dirty and dusty . she says she will only pay a little money for them .

ben and mia are excited . they think their mom will not sell their toys if they are dusty . they run to the box and grab their toys . they hug them and say they are sorry for not cleaning them . they tell their mom they want to keep their toys and they will clean them and put them away .

their mom is surprised and annoyed . she tells them they are being naughty and selfish . she says they have to share their toys with other kids who do not have any . she says they have to learn to let go of things they do not need .

ben and mia are confused and sad . they do not understand why their mom wants to sell their toys . they do not think they have too many toys . they think their toys are special and they need them . they do not want to share them with strangers . they start to cry and beg their mom to let them keep their toys .

their mom sees their tears and hears their pleas . she feels sorry for them and remembers how much she loved her toys when she was a kid . she decides to let them keep some of their toys , but not all of them . she tells them they can choose three toys each to keep , and the rest they have to sell . she says they can use the money to buy something new or to help someone in need .

ben and mia are relieved and happy . they thank their mom and hug her . they look at their toys and try to decide which ones to keep and which ones to sell . they pick their favorite ones and put them in a small bag . they say goodbye to the other ones and put them back in the box . they hope they will find a good home with other kids who will love them and play with them . they walk back to their house with their mom , holding their toys and smiling . sam and mia like to help mom bake . mom gives them a big bowl of dough and a mixer . the mixer has two hooks that spin and make the dough smooth and soft .

" can i use the mixer , mom ? " sam asks .

" sure , sam , but be careful . the mixer is fast and loud . hold it with both hands and do n't touch the hooks . they can hurt you , " mom says .

sam nods and takes the mixer . he turns it on and pushes it into the dough . the mixer makes a whirring noise and the dough moves around . sam smiles and feels the dough get warm and sticky .

" mia , do you want to try ? " sam asks .

" yes , please ! " mia says . she reaches for the mixer , but sam pulls it away .

" no , mia , it 's my turn . you can roll the dough later , " sam says .

mia frowns and crosses her arms . she wants to use the mixer too . she thinks sam is not nice .

" sam , share the mixer with mia . she is your sister and she wants to help too , " mom says .

" but mom , i like the mixer . it 's fun and cool , " sam says .

" i know , sam , but the mixer is not a toy . it 's a tool . we use it to make the dough ready for the oven . mia can use it for a little while , and then you can roll the dough with her . rolling the dough is fun and cool too , " mom says .

sam sighs and gives the mixer to mia . mia takes it and turns it on . she holds it with both hands and pushes it into the dough . the mixer makes a whirring noise and the dough moves around . mia smiles and feels the dough get warm and sticky .

" thank you , sam . the mixer is fun and cool , " mia says .

" you 're welcome , mia . can i roll the dough with you now ? " sam asks .

" sure , sam . let 's roll the dough together , " mia says .

they turn off the mixer and put it on the table . mom gives them a rolling pin and some flour . they sprinkle some flour on the dough and the rolling pin . they roll the dough flat and cut out shapes with cookie cutters . they make stars , hearts , circles , and squares . they put the shapes on a baking sheet and mom puts it in the oven .

" good job , sam and mia . you are great helpers . the cookies will be ready soon . they will be yummy and sweet , " mom says .

sam and mia hug mom and thank her . they are happy and proud . they like to help mom bake . they like to use the mixer and roll the dough . they are careful and safe . they are good siblings and friends . tom and lily liked to play with rocks . they had many rocks of different colors and shapes . they liked to polish their rocks with a cloth and make them shiny . they kept their rocks in a big box in their room .

one day , tom and lily wanted to polish their rocks together . they took out their box and opened it . but they saw that their rocks were all mixed up and messy . some rocks were dirty , some rocks were broken , and some rocks were missing .

" who did this to our rocks ? " tom asked . he was angry and sad .

" i do n't know , " lily said . she was also angry and sad . " maybe it was max , our dog . he likes to chew on things . "

they looked around and saw max sleeping on the bed . he had a rock in his mouth . it was one of tom 's favorite rocks . it was blue and smooth .

" max , bad dog ! " tom shouted . he ran to the bed and tried to take the rock from max . but max growled and bit tom 's hand .

" ow , ow , ow ! " tom cried . he let go of the rock and held his hand .

lily ran to tom and hugged him . she said , " are you okay , tom ? let me see your hand . "

she looked at tom 's hand and saw a small cut . she said , " it 's not too bad , tom . but we need to clean it and put a band - aid on it . "

she took tom to the bathroom and washed his hand . she found a band - aid and put it on his cut . she said , " there , now it 's better . do n't worry , tom . we can still polish our rocks . but we need to find a new place to keep them . a place where max ca n't reach them . "

tom nodded and smiled . he said , " thank you , lily . you are a good sister . i 'm sorry i shouted at max . he did n't know he was hurting our rocks . he just wanted to play . "

lily smiled and said , " you 're welcome , tom . you are a good brother . i 'm sorry i blamed max . he is a good dog . he just needs to learn what he can and ca n't chew . "

they hugged each other and went back to their room . they picked up their rocks and sorted them . they polished their rocks with a cloth and made them shiny . they found a new box with a lid and put their rocks in it . they put the box on a high shelf where max could n't reach it . they were happy and proud of their rocks . they decided to show them to their mom and dad later . they also decided to give max a treat and a toy to play with . they loved their rocks , but they loved their dog and each other more . lily and sam went to the beach with mom and dad . they liked to play in the sand and splash in the water . they saw many things at the beach : shells , crabs , birds , and boats .

" look , lily , i found a big shell ! " sam said . he held up a shiny shell that was pink and white . " can i keep it ? "

" sure , sam , it 's very pretty , " lily said . she found a small shell that was blue and green . " can i keep this one ? "

" yes , lily , you can keep it too , " sam said . they put their shells in a bucket and ran to show mom and dad .

mom and dad smiled and said they liked their shells . they said it was time to eat . they had brought sandwiches , fruit , and cookies for lunch . they also had a bottle of hot sauce that mom and dad liked to put on their sandwiches .

" can i try some hot sauce ? " sam asked . he was curious about the red liquid .

" be careful , sam , it 's very spicy , " mom said . " it might make your mouth burn . "

" i do n't mind , i want to try it , " sam said . he took the bottle and poured some hot sauce on his sandwich . he took a big bite and then he made a funny face .

" ow , ow , ow ! " sam said . he felt like his mouth was on fire . he dropped his sandwich and ran to the water . he tried to drink some water to cool down his mouth , but it was salty and made him cough .

lily laughed and said , " i told you it was spicy , sam . you should have listened to mom . "

sam came back from the water and said , " i 'm sorry , mom . i wo n't try hot sauce again . it 's too spicy for me . "

mom gave him a hug and said , " it 's okay , sam . you were brave to try something new . but next time , maybe you should ask for a little bit first . "

sam nodded and said , " okay , mom . can i have a cookie instead ? "

mom gave him a cookie and said , " sure , sam . here you go . and here 's some juice to wash it down . "

sam ate his cookie and drank his juice . he felt better and said , " thank you , mom . i love you . "

" i love you too , sam , " mom said . " and i love you , lily . "

" i love you , mom , " lily said . " and i love you , sam . "

they all hugged and said they loved each other . they enjoyed their lunch and their day at the beach . they had fun and learned something new . they were a happy family . lily and max were twins . they liked to play together , but sometimes they wanted different things . one day , they went to the park with their mom . they saw a big bus with many colors and pictures on it . it was a fun bus .

" mom , can we go on the fun bus ? " lily asked . she liked the fun bus . it had slides and swings and toys inside .

" maybe later , sweetie . we have to go to the store first , " mom said .

max did not like the fun bus . he thought it was too loud and too crowded . he wanted to go to the store and buy a new car . he had a lot of cars , but he wanted more .

" no , lily . we do n't want to go on the fun bus . we want to go to the store , " max said . he was stubborn . he did not listen to lily or mom .

" yes , we do , max . the fun bus is fun . the store is boring , " lily said . she was stubborn too . she did not listen to max or mom .

they started to argue . they raised their voices and pulled their mom 's arms . mom was tired and annoyed . she did not like when they fought .

" stop it , both of you . you are being rude and selfish . you have to learn to share and compromise . sometimes you get what you want , and sometimes you do n't . that 's life , " mom said . she was firm and fair .

she made a plan . she said they could go to the store first and buy one thing each . then they could go on the fun bus for a little while . but they had to be nice and polite and take turns .

lily and max thought about it . they did not like the plan at first , but they knew mom was right . they said sorry to each other and to mom . they agreed to the plan . they hugged and smiled .

they went to the store and bought a car for max and a doll for lily . then they went on the fun bus and had fun . they slid and swung and played with their toys . they also made some new friends . they thanked mom for taking them to the park . they learned a lesson . they were happy . ben liked to play with his toy camera . he liked to record things he saw and heard . he recorded his mom singing , his dad reading , and his dog barking . he also recorded his baby sister crying .

one day , ben wanted to record something new . he saw an ambulance outside his window . he heard a loud siren . he wondered what was inside the ambulance . he wanted to record it .

he ran outside with his toy camera . he followed the ambulance down the street . he did not see the cars and bikes and people . he did not hear his mom calling him .

" ben , come back ! it 's dangerous ! " his mom shouted .

but ben did not listen . he wanted to record the ambulance . he wanted to see where it was going . he thought it was going to a hospital . he wanted to see the hospital .

he ran and ran until he reached a big building . he saw a sign that said " hospital " . he saw people in white clothes . he saw more ambulances . he saw a lot of things he wanted to record .

he went inside the building . he looked around with his toy camera . he saw a lot of doors and rooms and machines . he saw people who were sick and hurt . he saw people who were sad and scared . he did not like what he saw .

he wanted to go back to his mom . he wanted to go back to his home . he wanted to stop recording . he felt sorry for the people in the hospital .

he tried to find the way out . he got lost . he did not know where to go . he started to cry .

" hey , little boy , what are you doing here ? " a voice asked .

ben looked up . he saw a man in a white coat . he had a badge that said " doctor " . he had a kind smile .

" i 'm sorry , i was recording the ambulance . i wanted to see the hospital . but i do n't like it here . i want to go back to my mom . can you help me ? " ben said .

" of course , i can help you . do n't worry , we 'll find your mom . but you should n't run after ambulances . it 's very dangerous . you could get hurt or lost . you should always stay with your mom or dad . do you understand ? " the doctor said .

" yes , i understand . i 'm sorry . i wo n't do it again . thank you for helping me . " ben said .

the doctor took ben by the hand . he led him to the front desk . he asked the lady there to call ben 's mom . he gave ben a sticker that said " brave " . he told ben to be careful and to have fun with his toy camera .

ben smiled . he thanked the doctor . he hugged his mom when she came . he was happy to see her . he was happy to leave the hospital . he learned his lesson . he decided to record only happy things from now on . anna and ben are twins . they like to play in the living room . they have many toys and books there . but they also have to be careful . there is a big vase on the table . it is shiny and pretty . mom says it is very old and special . she says they must not touch it or break it .

one day , anna and ben are playing with their blocks . they make a tower and a bridge . they are having fun . they are eager to make their blocks higher and longer . they do not notice the vase on the table . they do not see how close their blocks are to it .

suddenly , ben pushes his block too hard . it falls off the bridge and hits the vase . the vase wobbles and tips over . it falls to the floor and breaks into many pieces . anna and ben hear a loud crash . they look at the vase . they are scared and sad . they know they did a bad thing .

mom hears the crash too . she runs to the living room . she sees the vase and the blocks . she sees anna and ben . they are crying and sorry . mom is angry and sad . she loves the vase . it was a gift from her grandma . she says they were naughty and careless . she says they have to go to their room . she says they have to clean up the mess later .

anna and ben go to their room . they are still crying and sorry . they hug each other . they say they did not mean to break the vase . they say they will be more careful next time . they say they love mom and the vase . they hope mom will forgive them . they hope the vase can be fixed . they hope they can play in the living room again . anna and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big box under a tree . they think it is a surprise for them .

" let 's open it ! " anna says . " maybe it has toys or candy inside . "

" ok ! " ben says . " but we have to be quiet . maybe someone will come and take it away . "

they run to the box and lift the lid . they are very lucky . the box is full of cookies and juice . they smile and clap their hands .

" wow ! this is the best surprise ever ! " anna says . " who do you think gave it to us ? "

" i do n't know . maybe a fairy or a nice person . " ben says . " let 's eat some . they look yummy . "

they sit down and start to eat the cookies and drink the juice . they do not see the man who is hiding behind the tree . he is not a fairy or a nice person . he is a bad man . he put the box there to provide food for his big dog . his dog is hungry and angry . he does not like to share .

the man whistles and the dog comes out . he sees anna and ben eating his food . he growls and barks . he runs to them and bites them . they scream and cry . they drop the cookies and juice . they try to run away , but the dog is faster . he chases them and hurts them . the man laughs and watches . he does not help them . he is very mean .

anna and ben are not lucky . they are in trouble . they are not happy . they are sad and scared . they wish they never opened the box . they wish they never saw the surprise . they wish they had a good ending . tim and sam are brothers . they like to play with their toys . they have many cars , trucks , and trains . but they also have to eat their lunch . mom makes them soup and salad . she puts a large carrot on each plate .

" finish your soup and salad , boys , " mom says . " then you can play some more . "

tim and sam eat their soup . it is hot and tasty . but they do not like salad . they do not like carrots . they push them away .

" mom , can we go now ? " tim asks . " we are not hungry . "

" no , you have to eat your carrots , " mom says . " they are good for you . they make you strong and healthy . "

tim and sam do not want to eat their carrots . they make faces . they try to hide them under the napkins . they pretend to feed them to the dog .

mom sees what they are doing . she is not happy . she takes away their napkins and their toys .

" boys , you have to eat your carrots , " she says . " or you will not get any dessert . "

tim and sam love dessert . they want to have cake and ice cream . they look at their carrots . they are large and orange . they do not look yummy .

but they want dessert . they want to play with their toys . they want to make mom happy .

they decide to eat their carrots . they take small bites . they chew and swallow . they drink some water . they finish their carrots .

" mom , we ate our carrots ! " they say . " can we have dessert now ? "

mom smiles . she is proud of them . she gives them cake and ice cream . she gives them their toys .

" good job , boys , " she says . " you ate your carrots . you are good eaters . you can play now . "

tim and sam are happy . they thank mom . they eat their cake and ice cream . they play with their toys . they forget about the carrots . lila and sam are twins . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big pond with ducks and fish . they want to feed them bread .

they go to the pond and break the bread into small pieces . they throw the pieces into the water . the ducks and fish come to eat them . lila and sam are happy . they laugh and clap .

then , they see something shiny in the water . it is a veil . it is orange and sparkly . it looks like a fairy 's dress . lila wants to touch it . she leans over the pond and reaches for it .

but she slips and falls into the water . splash ! she is wet and cold . she cries . sam is scared . he calls for help .

a lady hears them and comes to the pond . she helps lila out of the water . she wraps her in a towel . she asks her if she is okay . lila nods . she is still crying .

the lady looks at the veil . she says it is hers . she lost it yesterday . she is happy to find it . she thanks lila and sam for helping her . she gives them a hug .

she says they can keep the veil . she says it is a gift . she says they can use it to play pretend . lila and sam smile . they say thank you . they are happy .

they go home with the veil . they dry off and change clothes . they use the veil to play fairy and prince . they have fun . they forget about the pond . they are happy . tom and sam are friends . they like to play with trains . they have a big box of trains and tracks . they make a long track in the living room . they put two trains on the track . one is red and one is blue .

tom says , " let 's race the trains . i have the red train . you have the blue train . the station is at the end of the track . the first train to get to the station wins . "

sam says , " ok . let 's race . ready , set , go ! " they push the trains on the track . the trains go fast . they make noise . choo - choo !

the red train and the blue train are close . they are almost at the station . but then , the cat jumps on the track . the cat is big and furry . the cat blocks the way . the trains stop . tom and sam are scared . they do not want the cat to break the trains .

they shout , " go away , cat ! go away ! " the cat looks at them . the cat does not care . the cat lies down on the track . the cat purrs . tom and sam are sad . they can not race the trains . they can not get to the station . they do not know what to do . sara and ben are playing in their room . they have many toys and books and games . they like to make fun things with them . but they do not like to clean up . their room is very messy .

" look , sara , i made a big tower with the blocks ! " ben says . he is proud of his tower . he wants to make it taller .

" wow , ben , your tower is very high ! " sara says . she is playing with her dolls . she has a tea party with them . she wants to make more tea .

ben tries to reach for more blocks . he stretches his arm as far as he can . but he can not get them . they are on the shelf . he needs a stool to stand on .

" sara , can you help me ? " ben asks . he looks at his sister . she is busy with her dolls . she does not hear him .

ben sees a switch on the wall . he thinks it is for the light . he has an idea . he pushes a chair to the wall . he climbs on the chair . he reaches for the switch . he thinks it will make the room brighter .

but the switch is not for the light . it is for the fan . ben does not know that . he flips the switch . the fan starts to spin . it makes a loud noise . it blows air everywhere .

the air hits ben 's tower . the blocks fall down . they make a loud crash . the air hits sara 's tea party . the cups and plates fly away . they make a loud clatter . the air hits the books and games . they fly off the shelf . they make a loud thud .

sara and ben are scared . they cover their ears . they look at their room . it is more messy than before . they do not know what to do .

mom hears the noise . she comes to their room . she sees the mess . she sees the fan . she sees ben on the chair . she sees sara on the floor . she is not happy .

" ben , sara , what did you do ? " mom asks . she turns off the fan . she helps ben down . she hugs sara . she looks at them . they look sorry .

" we were playing , mom , " ben says . he points to the switch . " i wanted more light . i did not know it was for the fan . "

" we did not mean to make a mess , mom , " sara says . she points to her dolls . " i wanted more tea . i did not hear ben . "

mom sighs . she knows they did not mean to be bad . but they need to learn to be careful . and they need to learn to clean up .

" okay , ben , sara , i understand , " mom says . " but you have to be more responsible . you have to ask for help when you need it . and you have to tidy up your room when you are done playing . "

" yes , mom , we will , " ben and sara say . they feel sorry . they want to make mom happy .

mom smiles . she loves them . she helps them clean up their room . they work together . they put everything back where it belongs . they make their room neat and nice .

they are happy . they hug mom . they say thank you . mom hugs them back . she says you are welcome . she says she is proud of them . they are proud of themselves . they learned a lesson . they will be more careful next time . they will have more fun . sara liked to play with her mom 's purse . it had many things inside , like keys , coins , and lipstick . sara liked to pretend she was a grown - up lady , and put on the lipstick and hold the keys . sometimes , she would wave the purse in the air , like she was saying hello to someone .

one day , sara was playing with the purse in the living room , while her mom was in the kitchen . sara saw a big window , and thought it would be fun to wave the purse at the cars and people outside . she ran to the window , and lifted the purse high . but the window was not regular . it was very thin and fragile . when sara waved the purse , it hit the window hard , and the window broke . the purse and the things inside fell out , and landed on the street .

sara was very scared . she heard her mom scream , and saw the glass on the floor . she started to cry , and ran to her mom . her mom was very angry and sad . she hugged sara , and told her she was not hurt , but she was very naughty . she said sara had to pay for the window and the purse , and she could not play with the purse anymore . sara felt very sorry , and wished she had not waved the purse . she learned that some things are not for playing , and some windows are not regular . tom is a pilot . he likes to fly planes in the sky . he is very dependable . he always does his job well and helps people go to different places .

one day , tom has to fly a big plane with many people inside . he is happy and ready to go . but when he gets to the plane , he sees a problem . the wing of the plane is broken . it has a big hole in it . tom is worried . he can not fly the plane like this . it is not safe .

tom tells the people in the plane that they have to wait . he calls his boss and asks for help . he says they need a new plane or a way to fix the wing . his boss says he will try to find a solution . but he says it might take a long time .

the people in the plane are not happy . they are angry and bored . they want to fly now . they do not want to wait . they start to complain and shout at tom . they say he is a bad pilot and he should fix the plane himself .

tom feels sad and stressed . he wants to make the people happy and fly the plane . but he knows he can not do it alone . he needs help . he hopes his boss will find a way to help him soon . he tries to be calm and patient . he tells the people in the plane that he is sorry and he is doing his best . he says he is a dependable pilot and he will not let them down . he asks them to be calm and patient too . he says they will fly soon . he hopes they will believe him . tom and ann like to play with their toys . they have many toys , but their favorite is a big red car . the car can make noises and move by itself . tom and ann like to pretend they are driving the car to different places .

one day , their mom says they have to go to the store with her . she says they need to buy some food for dinner . she says they can bring one toy each . tom and ann both want to bring the car , but they can not share it . they start to fight over the car . they pull and push and yell .

their mom is angry . she says they are being naughty and selfish . she says they can not bring any toys . she takes the car away from them and puts it on the shelf . she says they have to go to the store now . tom and ann are sad and mad . they do not want to go to the store . they want to play with the car .

at the store , their mom buys some things . she buys bread and cheese and milk and eggs . she also buys some potatoes . she says potatoes are good for them . she says they are not expensive . she puts the potatoes in a big bag .

tom and ann are bored . they do not like the store . they do not like potatoes . they want to go home and play with the car . they have an idea . they think they can prevent their mom from buying potatoes . they think they can make the potatoes go away .

they wait until their mom is not looking . they sneak to the bag of potatoes . they take the potatoes out of the bag . they throw the potatoes on the floor . they kick the potatoes . they smash the potatoes . they make a big mess .

their mom sees what they are doing . she is very angry . she says they are being naughty and wasteful . she says they have to pay for the potatoes . she says the potatoes are expensive now . she says they have to use their money to pay for the potatoes . she says they have no money left to buy toys . she says they have to go home now . she says they have to go to bed early . she says they can not play with the car for a long time .

tom and ann are sad and mad . they do not want to pay for the potatoes . they do not want to go home . they do not want to go to bed . they want to play with the car . but they can not . they have no choice . they have to do what their mom says . they have to learn their lesson . they have a bad ending . jill and tom were twins who liked to play with their toys . one day , they found a magazine on the table . it had many pictures of animals and people . they wanted to look at the magazine , but they did not know how to share .

" i saw it first ! " jill said . she grabbed the magazine and set it on her lap .

" no , i saw it first ! " tom said . he pulled the magazine and set it on his lap .

they both pulled and pulled until the magazine ripped in half . they were sad and angry . they did not want to play with each other anymore .

mom heard the noise and came to see what happened . she saw the ripped magazine and the unhappy twins . she was not happy either .

" look what you did ! " mom said . " you ruined the magazine . it was a gift from grandma . she wanted you to enjoy it together . but you were selfish and greedy . you did not think of each other . that is not nice . "

jill and tom felt sorry . they knew mom was right . they did not want to hurt grandma or mom . they did not want to fight with each other . they wanted to be friends .

they hugged each other and said , " we are sorry , mom . we are sorry , grandma . we are sorry , twin . we love you . can we fix the magazine ? "

mom smiled and said , " i love you too , twins . i am glad you are sorry . you can try to fix the magazine with some tape . but more importantly , you can learn to share and care . that is what makes you adorable . " lily was a careless girl who liked to play in the mud . she did not like to wash her hands or face or hair . she said it was too much work and not fun at all .

one day , her mother told her to wash up before dinner . lily did not listen . she ran outside and found a big puddle of mud . she jumped in it and splashed around . she got mud all over her clothes and skin and hair .

" look at me , i 'm a mud monster ! " she shouted . she thought it was very funny .

but her mother did not think it was funny . she came outside and saw lily covered in mud . she was very angry .

" lily , what have you done ? " she asked . " you are so careless ! you have to wash up right now or you will not get any dinner ! "

lily did not want to miss dinner . she liked to eat . she followed her mother inside and went to the bathroom . her mother turned on the water and gave her a soap and a towel .

" scrub , scrub , scrub ! " her mother said . " you have to wash all the mud off . it is dirty and bad for you . "

lily did not like to scrub . it hurt her skin and made her eyes sting . she cried and complained .

" i do n't want to wash , i want to play ! " she said . " washing is boring and hard ! "

her mother did not listen . she helped lily wash her hands and face and hair . she rinsed off the soap and dried her with the towel .

" there , now you are clean and pretty , " her mother said . " but you have to be more careful next time . do you understand ? "

lily nodded . she did not want to make her mother angry again . she said she was sorry and gave her a hug .

" i love you , mommy , " she said .

" i love you too , lily , " her mother said . " now let 's go have dinner . " lily and max were twins who liked to play in the park . one day , they found a big stick that looked like a sword . they both wanted to have it , but they did not want to share .

" i saw it first ! " lily said . " it is mine ! "

" no , it is mine ! " max said . " i am stronger ! "

they started to pull the stick from each other , but it was very hard . they did not notice that a dog was watching them from behind a tree . the dog liked sticks too , and he wanted to have some fun .

the dog ran towards lily and max and barked loudly . he jumped on them and snatched the stick from their hands . he ran away with it , wagging his tail .

lily and max were very surprised and scared . they let go of the stick and fell on the ground . they looked at each other and felt very silly . they realized that they had been selfish and rude . they had not listened to each other or tried to take turns . they had not enjoyed the stick at all , and now they had lost it .

they got up and hugged each other . they said they were sorry and that they loved each other . they decided to play something else together , something that did not need a stick . they learned that sharing is better than fighting , and that being kind is more fun than being selfish .

the dog watched them from a distance and smiled . he had taught them a lesson , and he had a new toy . he was happy . he did not feel embarrassed , because he did not know what that word meant . he just liked sticks . ben and lily liked to play in the yard . they had a big pile of leaves to jump in . they laughed and threw leaves at each other . they were having fun .

but then mom came out . she was not happy . she saw the leaves all over the yard . she saw ben and lily with dirty clothes and faces . she said , " you two made a big mess . you need to clean it up . here , take this rake and put the leaves in the bag . "

ben and lily did not want to clean up . they wanted to play more . they said , " but mom , we were having fun . can we play a little longer ? " mom said , " no , you have to clean up now . it is almost time for dinner . and you need to wash up too . you are very dirty . "

ben and lily sighed . they took the rake and started to put the leaves in the bag . it was hard work . they did not like it . they wished they could play more . but they knew they had to listen to mom . they hoped they could play again tomorrow .

they worked until the pile of leaves was gone . they put the rake and the bag away . they went inside to wash up . mom smiled and said , " good job , ben and lily . you cleaned up the yard very well . i am proud of you . now you can have dinner . and maybe after dinner , we can read a story together . "

ben and lily smiled too . they were hungry and tired . they liked stories . they said , " thank you , mom . we love you . " they hugged mom and went to the table . they had a good dinner . and they had a good story . they were happy . the end . lila and ben liked to play on the beach . they liked to gather shells and rocks and make shapes in the sand . one day , they saw a big sail on the water . it was white and shiny and had a flag with a star on it .

" wow , look at that sail ! " lila said . " it must belong to a wealthy person . maybe they have a lot of toys and candy on their boat . "

" maybe they do , " ben said . " do you think they would share with us ? "

lila and ben decided to wave at the sail and shout hello . they hoped the wealthy person would see them and come to the shore . they waited and waited , but the sail did not come closer . it went farther and farther away , until it was a tiny dot on the horizon .

lila and ben felt sad and disappointed . they wondered why the wealthy person did not want to be their friend . they went back to their shells and rocks and tried to have fun , but they were not as happy as before .

the next day , lila and ben went to the beach again . they were surprised to see a lot of people and cars and trucks there . they saw some men wearing uniforms and badges and carrying big guns . they also saw some men wearing masks and handcuffs and looking scared .

" what is going on ? " lila asked .

one of the uniformed men heard her and came over . he smiled and knelt down to their level .

" hello , kids . do you remember the sail you saw yesterday ? " he asked .

lila and ben nodded .

" well , that sail belonged to a very bad person . he was not wealthy , he was a thief . he stole a lot of money and jewels from a bank and tried to escape on his boat . but we caught him and his friends . we followed them on our own boat and radioed for help . now they are going to jail and we are going to return the money and jewels to the bank . "

lila and ben gasped . they could not believe it . the sail they admired was a sail of a criminal . they felt glad that the bad person was caught and that the good people were safe .

" wow , you are very brave and smart , " lila said .

" thank you , " the uniformed man said . " you are very kind and curious . do you want to see the money and jewels we found on the boat ? "

lila and ben nodded eagerly . the uniformed man led them to a truck where there were many bags and boxes full of shiny things . he opened one of them and showed them some gold coins and sparkling necklaces .

" look at these , " he said . " they are very pretty , but they are not as important as being honest and good . remember that , kids . money and jewels can make you happy for a while , but they can also make you greedy and mean . the best things in life are not things , they are friends and family and love . "

lila and ben smiled and hugged the uniformed man . they thanked him for showing them the money and jewels and for teaching them a lesson . they realized that they did not need to be wealthy to be happy . they had each other and they had fun . they went back to their shells and rocks and made shapes in the sand . they were happy again . lily was a shy girl who liked to draw in her notebook . she had many colors and shapes in her notebook , but she did not show them to anyone . she was afraid that they would laugh at her or take her notebook away .

one day , a new boy came to her class . his name was sam and he had curly hair and big eyes . he sat next to lily and smiled at her . lily felt nervous and looked down at her notebook .

" hi , i 'm sam . what are you drawing ? " he asked .

lily did not answer . she held her notebook close to her chest and hoped he would go away .

" can i see your notebook ? i like to draw too . maybe we can draw together , " he said .

lily shook her head . she did not want to share her notebook with anyone , especially a stranger .

sam did not give up . he took out his own notebook and showed it to lily . it had many pictures of animals and cars and stars . he pointed to a picture of a lion and said , " this is my favorite . i want to be a lion when i grow up . what do you want to be ? "

lily looked at his notebook and felt curious . she liked his pictures . they were bright and fun . she peeked at her own notebook and saw a picture of a flower . she wanted to be a flower when she grew up . a flower that could grow anywhere and make people happy .

she looked at sam and saw that he was still smiling . he did not seem mean or scary . he seemed nice and friendly . maybe he would not laugh at her or take her notebook away . maybe he would like her pictures and her dreams .

she took a deep breath and opened her notebook . she showed him her picture of a flower and said , " this is my favorite . i want to be a flower when i grow up . "

sam 's eyes widened and he clapped his hands . " wow , that 's a beautiful flower . i like it . you are a good drawer . can i draw a flower too ? "

lily nodded and smiled . she felt happy and brave . she gave him a color and said , " yes , you can . here , you can use this . "

they drew flowers together in their notebooks . they talked and laughed and became friends . lily was not shy anymore . she had someone who liked her and her notebook . she had someone who could lead her to new adventures . lily liked to play dress - up with her mom 's clothes . she would take them from the closet and put them on . she felt like a princess or a fairy . but she did not like to put the clothes back on the hangers . she would leave them on the floor or on the bed .

one day , mom was very busy . she had to cook and clean and talk on the phone . she did not notice that lily was playing dress - up again . lily took a lot of clothes from the closet and tried them on . she found a shiny dress that was very pretty . she wanted to keep it for herself . she thought mom would not miss it . she put it in a hidden place under her bed .

when mom finished her work , she went to the closet . she wanted to wear the shiny dress for a special dinner . but she could not find it . she looked everywhere . she asked lily if she had seen it . lily said no . she lied . she felt bad , but she did not want to give up the dress .

mom was very sad . she had to wear another dress that was not as pretty . she wondered what happened to the shiny dress . did it disappear ? did someone take it ? she wished she could find it .

that night , lily could not sleep . she felt guilty . she knew she did something wrong . she did not like to see mom sad . she did not like to lie . she decided to tell the truth . she got up and took the dress from under her bed . she went to mom 's room and knocked on the door .

mom opened the door and saw lily holding the dress . she was surprised and happy . she hugged lily and thanked her . she asked her why she took the dress . lily said she was sorry . she said she liked the dress and wanted to keep it . but she realized it was not hers . she said she learned a lesson . she said she would not take things that belong to others . she said she would put the clothes back on the hangers after playing dress - up .

mom was proud of lily . she said she forgave her . she said she was glad she told the truth . she said she loved her . she said she could wear the dress sometimes , but only with her permission . she said she would teach her how to take care of the clothes . she said they could play dress - up together .

lily smiled . she felt happy . she gave the dress to mom and hugged her . she said she loved her too . she said she would be a good girl . she said she was sorry for making the dress disappear . she said she would make it reappear on the hanger . tom and lily wanted to go to the theater with their mom . they liked to watch funny people and animals on the big screen . mom said they could go if they ate their lunch first . but tom and lily did not like their lunch . it was green and slimy and smelled bad .

" yuck , i do n't want to eat this ! " tom said , pushing his plate away .

" me neither ! " lily said , making a face .

mom was not happy . she said they had to eat their lunch or they could not go to the theater . she said it was good for them and it would make them strong and healthy .

but tom and lily refused to eat their lunch . they said they were not hungry and they only wanted to go to the theater . they cried and whined and stomped their feet .

mom said they had to stay home then . she said they could not go to the theater if they did not listen to her . she said they had to learn to eat what they were given and to be polite and grateful .

tom and lily were very sad and angry . they missed the theater and the funny people and animals . they wished they had eaten their lunch . they looked at their plates and saw that their lunch was not so bad after all . it was just peas and carrots and fish . they liked peas and carrots and fish . they were blue that they had refused to eat their lunch . they said they were sorry to mom and asked if they could go to the theater next time .

mom hugged them and said she forgave them . she said they could go to the theater next time if they ate their lunch first . she said she loved them and wanted them to be happy and healthy . tom and lily said they loved her too and they would eat their lunch next time . they learned their lesson and they never refused to eat their lunch again . one day , anna and ben went to the park with their mom . they saw a big train with a lot of smoke coming out of it . the smoke was hot and wet . it was called steam .

" can we ride the train , mom ? " anna asked .

" sure , but you have to be careful and listen to the conductor . he will tell you when to get on and off the train . he is very nice and compassionate . he likes children and he knows a lot about trains . do you trust him ? " mom said .

" yes , mom , we trust him . he has a funny hat and a whistle . he smiles a lot . " ben said .

they waited in line and then got on the train . the conductor checked their tickets and gave them a sticker . he said , " welcome to the park train . i hope you enjoy the ride . please stay in your seats and do not lean out of the windows . the train will go around the park and show you some animals and flowers . if you have any questions , you can ask me . i am here to help you . "

the train started to move and the steam made a loud sound . anna and ben looked out of the windows and saw ducks , rabbits , roses , and sunflowers . they waved to the people and the animals . they felt happy and excited .

" wow , this is so fun . i love the train . thank you , mom . thank you , conductor . " anna said .

" you 're welcome , anna . i 'm glad you like it . the train is my favorite too . it is very old and special . it needs a lot of care and love . that 's why i always check the steam and the wheels and the brakes . i want to make sure the train is safe and happy . " the conductor said .

the train stopped at the station and the conductor said , " this is the end of the ride . i hope you had a good time . please get off the train and have a nice day . come back soon . "

anna and ben got off the train and hugged the conductor . they said , " thank you , conductor . you are very compassionate . we trust you . we will come back soon . "

they walked back to their mom and told her everything they saw and heard on the train . they said they wanted to ride the train again . mom smiled and said , " maybe next time . now let 's go home and have some lunch . you must be hungry after such a big adventure . " lily liked to design things with her crayons and paper . she made lovely pictures of flowers , animals and people . she was very proud of her designs and showed them to her mom and dad .

one day , lily 's brother tom came into her room . he was bored and wanted to play . he saw lily 's designs on the floor and said , " what are these ? they look silly . can i have them ? "

lily said , " no , tom . these are my designs . i worked hard on them . they are not silly . they are lovely . please leave them alone . "

but tom did not listen . he grabbed some of lily 's designs and tore them up . he made a big mess and a big wreck . he laughed and said , " now they look funnier . you should thank me . "

lily was very sad and angry . she cried and said , " tom , you are mean . you ruined my designs . you did not ask me . you did not respect me . you hurt my feelings . you should say sorry . "

mom heard the noise and came into the room . she saw the wreck and lily 's tears . she said , " tom , what did you do ? why did you destroy lily 's designs ? that was not nice . that was not fair . that was not kind . "

tom felt ashamed . he realized he was wrong . he said , " i 'm sorry , lily . i 'm sorry , mom . i was bored and i wanted to play . i did not think about how lily felt . i did not care about her designs . i was selfish and rude . i will not do it again . "

mom said , " tom , i 'm glad you are sorry . but sorry is not enough . you need to make it up to lily . you need to help her clean up the mess . you need to make her a new design . you need to be a good brother . "

tom agreed . he helped lily clean up the wreck . he took some crayons and paper and made her a new design . he drew a heart and wrote , " i love you , lily . you are a great designer . i am sorry for what i did . "

lily smiled and hugged tom . she said , " thank you , tom . i love you too . you are a good brother . i forgive you for what you did . "

mom smiled and hugged them both . she said , " i 'm proud of you , tom and lily . you learned a lesson today . you learned to respect each other 's work and feelings . you learned to say sorry and to make it up . you learned to love and to forgive . that is what makes a lovely family . " sara liked to play with her beans . she had many beans of different colors and shapes . she put them in a bowl and made them talk to each other . she gave them names and stories .

one day , she took her beans outside to play in the garden . she put them on a big leaf and pretended it was a boat . she made the beans sail on the water in the pond . she had fun watching them splash and float .

but then , a big wind came and blew the leaf away . sara ran after it , but it was too fast . she saw the leaf and the beans go over the fence and into the street . she was sad and scared . she had lost her beans .

