heidi and her mommy spent many precious moments together . now whenever heidi sees someone kneeling , she smiles and remembers the wonderful time when they were together . once upon a time there was a little girl named mary . mary went on an adventure one day to the park . when she got there , she saw a wild twig zipping through the sky ! mary was so excited that she wanted to join in the fun . she ran after the twig , zipping around the park with it . she felt so wild and free . the twig was her new best friend and they had such a wonderful time . after a few hours , the twig flew up high and gave mary one last zip around the park before it flew away . mary waved goodbye and she was so happy to have had such an adventure . once there was a furry bear called teddy . he loved eating his dinner every day but there was a problem . teddy could n't hold a spoon , it was too difficult for him . he watched his friends use spoons every night and wished he could do the same .

