mommy kissed her daughter on the forehead and said , â€œyou also have the biggest and kindest heart ever!â€ amy had a dream . it was a big , tall dream . it was like a zigzag in the sky . amy was a proud girl . she wanted to follow her dream to the end of the sky . she reached her hand out and it felt so big and strong . she stretched and stretched until she could touch the sky . then , when she did , a magical thing happened . her dream came true ! and amy was so excited , she ran around and around in circles , twirling and dancing her way through the sky . she knew that she would make it , no matter what . and she did ! one day , there was a girl who wanted a motor to play with . her parents told her she could n't have one because it was too dangerous . the girl was very sad and felt helpless . she wanted the motor so badly .

