soon , everyone noticed how responsible she had become . her parents were very proud of her . the girl was so happy that she had been able to accept their rule and keep her motor safe . once upon a time , there was a tiny bird . it was looking for a place to live . so , it flew around the woods . suddenly it stumbled upon a nice nest . it was so tight , with lots of soft feathers .

the bird was so happy ! it hopped into the nest and made it its home . after a long day , the bird shook its feathers and closed its eyes . it felt so safe snuggled up in the tight nest .

