the little bird found a permanently safe and snug place to stay ! it was so happy to have its own warm nest . once upon a time , there was a little girl named daisy . daisy was very happy and loved playing outside . one day , daisy went outside and saw something wonderful . a tiny bug had become stuck in a puddle of water ! to help the bug , daisy slowly and carefully picked it up . the bug looked back at daisy and winked , then flew away .

