suddenly , a strong wind blew which scared the bird away . benny was relieved and ran away . but he was still alert and was always careful when walking in the woods . once upon a time , there was a fairy . she was very tiny and very special . her skin shone like the stars in the night sky and her wings twinkled like diamonds in the sunlight .

