the next day , susie and the fairy met again and said goodbye . they both waved and smiled until the fairy flew away . susie knew she would never forget her friend , the magical fairy . once upon a time , there was a young girl called daisy . daisy wanted to find something useful to do with her day . she went outside and saw a celery plant . she wanted to make something out of the celery stalks , so she started to tear off each stalk one by one .

