when he was done , the toast was golden and delicious . jack gobbled it down and it tasted great ! he smiled and thought about all the fun he would have that day . yesterday , a boy was very eager . he was going to go on a mark - making adventure . first , he picked up some crayons and markers . then , he found a piece of paper and some cardboard . with a big smile , he started drawing and coloring . everywhere he marked was a rainbow of colors . the boy made pictures , shapes and designs . he was so excited about his work and the colors he had made . in the end , the boy was very satisfied with his mark - making . once upon a time , there was a big wide lake . in the lake , there was a wish . everyone wanted the wish to come true , but no one knew how to make it happen .

