once she was finished , the kitchen looked so organized and neat ! she was so excited to show her mom the hard work she did , and was even more excited when her mom gave her a big hug for being such a helpful , organized little girl . once upon a time there was a old man . he had a big mustache on his face . one day he was walking in the park when he heard something strange . he tried to see what it was , but he could n't find it . suddenly he heard it again , this time greated and louder . the old man looked around , and saw that it was a small kid . the kid was standing next to a tree and he was laughing . the old man heard the kid saying , â€œi want a mustache too!â€ the old man smiled and said , â€œof course you can have a mustache ! but it will take a lot of work.â€ the old man told the kid that he must be patient and practice a lot if he wanted a mustache . the kid happily accepted and the old man said goodbye . after that day , the kid went to the park every day , practicing hard to make his mustache . finally , one day the old man came to the park and he saw that the kid had a mustache ! he was so proud and happy for him . the old man smiled and said , â€œwell done . you have a wonderful mustache now.â€ once upon a time there was a fierce cat . he lived all alone in a cottage in the woods . every day , he would go out and explore the woods and look for mice to catch .

one day while he was out exploring , it started to rain . he had nowhere to hide so he quickly ran back to his cottage . but when he arrived , the door was locked and he could n't get in !

