the fierce cat never forgot that day and every time it rains , he looks for his box and his bar of soap to make bubbles and stay happy ! once upon a time there was a poor lion . he wanted to cool off , so he went to the lake to soak . he dipped his paws in the water and splashed his mane . he was so happy !

but soon , a group of birds flew by . they were so loud and the lion was scared . he jumped out of the lake and ran away as fast as he could . he never went back there again .

but he still remembered the feeling of the cool water and how good it felt to soak . he wished he could go back , but he never did . the poor lion was too scared . once there was a boy named jacob . he wanted to talk to the judge , so he went to the court . he stood in front of the judge and wanted to ask him something . but the judge was deaf and could n't hear him . so he had to whisper .

