when they finished , they both stood up and smiled . anna was so happy to visit the university and she promised herself that one day she would also go to university , just like her mom . once upon a time , there was a horse called steve . he was a very interesting horse and he liked to solve puzzles . every day , steve went outside and looked for puzzles to solve .

