for the rest of the holiday , the family went exploring . tom had so much fun on their holiday . he would never forget the old castle and zipping down the road . once upon a time , there was a little squirrel who liked to play in the park . the squirrel was always very careful , but one day , it did n't watch where it was going and slipped down a deep hole . it was very scared , until it heard a voice .

