he could n't wait to go to the next party ! once upon a time a little girl named lucy wanted to make her own dinner . she gone to the fridge and opened the door . inside she found a pizza . she was so excited ! she took out the pizza and grabbed a plate . then she grabbed a fork and a knife . she wanted to be independent and wrap the pizza all by herself . she started to cut the pizza and then she started to wrap it . she put the wraps on the plate . when she was finished she went to the table and show her parents her dinner . they were so proud of her ! the end . mama was holding a pale vegetable in her hand . it was broccoli . she asked alexis if she would like to try it . alexis began to cry . she did n't want to try the broccoli . she wanted macaroni and cheese instead .

