hop listened carefully to the wise owl 's words and promised to be kind to everyone , even if they did n't have any carrots to share . as hop hopped back to the meadow , he saw a little bird who had fallen from its nest . hop knew he had to help the bird , so he gently picked it up and brought it back to its nest .

the bird 's mother was so grateful to hop for his kindness that she shared some of her delicious berries with him . hop realized that the wise owl was right - being kind to others always pays off in the end . from that day on , hop made sure to always be kind and helpful to others , even if they had zero carrots to share . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . one day , she felt like she needed to go to the toilet . she hurried to find one , but she could n't find it . she felt ashamed because she could n't hold it anymore .

