from then on , lily always remembered to hurry when she needed to go to the toilet . she never felt ashamed again because she knew what to do . the end . once upon a time , there was a little boy named timmy . timmy loved to play with his toys all day long . one day , timmy 's favorite toy broke . he was sad and did n't know what to do .

