timmy was fascinated and said , " mom , you 're so smart ! i want to be like you when i grow up . " his mom smiled and said , " you can be anything you want to be , timmy . just be creative and never stop learning . " once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she lived in a big city with her mommy and daddy . one day , they decided to go on a trip to an ancient castle .

