they searched everywhere and finally found the toy . the little girl was so happy and thanked gigi and duckie . gigi then mailed her letter and went back home with her friends , feeling happy and proud of herself for helping someone in need . once upon a time , there was a big , big jungle . there were many animals living there , like lions , monkeys , and elephants . one day , a little monkey named max was playing with his friends . they were having so much fun until they heard a loud noise . they looked up and saw a large , scary bird flying above them .

