the bird flew down and tried to attack them , but they were safe under the tree . the bird could n't reach them . max and his friends were so happy that they joined together and found a safe place to hide . they learned that when they work together , they can overcome any problem . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play with her toys and her friends . one day , lily and her friends were playing in the park when suddenly they felt the ground shake . it was an earthquake ! they were very scared and did n't know what to do .

