lily learned that earthquakes can happen , but she also learned that she can be brave and stay safe . she filled her heart with courage and promised to always be prepared for anything . once upon a time , there was an old rabbit named benny . he loved to eat cauliflower for dinner every night . one day , benny went to a talent show and saw a monkey who could juggle bananas . benny was so impressed , he started to applaud loudly .

after the show , benny went to the monkey and gave him a piece of his cauliflower as a gift . the monkey was so happy and thanked benny . from that day on , benny and the monkey became good friends and would often go to talent shows together . they would always applaud loudly for the performers they liked .

one day , benny decided to try a new vegetable for dinner instead of cauliflower . he tried broccoli and found out he liked it even more ! but he never forgot his love for cauliflower and would still have it sometimes . benny and the monkey continued to go to talent shows and applaud for their favorite acts . they were the happiest of friends . the end . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside in the sunshine and pick flowers . one day , she saw her friend timmy playing with a big rod . lily was fearful of the rod because she thought it might hurt her .

timmy wanted to play with lily , but she did n't want to play with the rod . they started to disagree about what to play with . lily wanted to play with her dolls , but timmy wanted to play with the rod .

