she realized that sometimes things that seem too good to be true , like a cheap telescope , can lead to disappointment . she learned to appreciate the stars from afar and to be content with what she had . once upon a time , there was a little girl who had a big pocket . the pocket was full of all of her special treasures . one day , the girl felt troubled inside . she did n't know why she felt this way , but she knew she had to leave . the little girl slowly filled her pocket with her favorite things and she left her house . she walked , and walked , until she found a nice , quiet spot . she sat , and thought about why she was so troubled . after a while , she realized that she was feeling upset because she was missing her friends . she told her pocket how she was feeling and it made her feel better . she decided to return home , and she was feeling much better when she left . once upon a time there was a tired ostrich . he was walking around the field looking for something to eat .

suddenly , he heard a loud voice demanding him to stop . he looked around and saw a man with a whip . the man said , " you must work for me ! "

