the ostrich had no choice but to obey the man 's demands . he worked all day in the hot sun and he was so tired . as the sun began to set , the man told the ostrich that he could finally go home .

but when the ostrich woke up in the morning to go home , he was gone . the man had sold him to the circus . the tired ostrich had to live his life in the circus from then on .

the end . once there was an elderly painter . he was painting a picture at his home . all of a sudden he heard a loud voice .

