the mommy and her babies were very close . every night she would make them dinner and tell them stories . they always had lots of cuddles and kisses . everyone was so happy ! once upon a time there was a little girl who was very curious . every day she would go outside and explore the world around her . one day she decided to go off on a mysterious adventure .

