it worked ! katie was so proud that her map helped them get past the lake . she was even calmer when they made it to the next place safely . the rest of the journey was full of exciting adventures , with katie leading the way . once upon a time , there was a fierce lion who had a best friend . the lion 's friend was a small mouse . the mouse was very brave and never afraid of the lion .

