at the end of the night , everybody was tired and happy . they waved goodbye , and the star sparkled one last time , giving them a big happy smile . once there was a powerful dog named spot . spot spent his days playing in the yard and having fun . one day , he saw a rake and thought he would try out spinning it . he spun and spun and seemed to really enjoy it .

