ray hopped onto the machine , but he soon realised it was too fast . he was frightened and tried to jump off , but he could n't . ray was bravely persistent , so he held on and soon realised he was enjoying the ride ! as ray hopped along , he realised the machine was taking him to lots of interesting and new places .

as ray hopped on the machine , he slowly started to understand the moral value - to never give up , no matter how challenging things can be . ray learnt that if he was brave and persistent enough , he could experience new adventures .

from then on , ray enjoyed hopping on the machine , and he quickly realised just how amazing the world was . ray learnt that , with the help of determination and bravery , anything is possible ! once upon a time there were two friends , max and mia . they both loved to paint . one day they had an idea . they decided to each make a painting and see who could make the best one .

