the little girl smiled as the ship sailed away , happy to be on such an adventure . what would she discover next ? once there was a boy named joe . he was very excited to go to the party . so he put on his best suit and ran to the party . but suddenly he realised he had forgotten something very important . he had forgotten the presents !

joe was very disappointed . but he thought of a bright idea . he asked his brother if he could lend him a suit . his brother gladly gave him a suit , and joe ran off to buy presents .

it was difficult to find the right presents , but joe finally found something good . then he ran back to the party with his presents and his brother 's suit . everyone was very impressed with his suit and they enjoyed the presents very much . joe had a wonderful time at the party ! gina and her dad were out walking together . they approached a big field and saw a rare arrow lying in the grass . ginaâ€ ™ s dad said , â€œgina , look ! what a rare arrow ! letâ€ ™ s pick it up.â€ gina hesitated and said , â€œno , i donâ€ ™ t want to.â€ her dad said , â€œcome on , gina . we should accept it . itâ€ ™ s a special gift.â€ so gina accepted the rare arrow and took it home . when they arrived home , ginaâ€ ™ s dad showed her how to draw an arrow on a piece of paper . he said , â€œnow , if you ever need an arrow you can draw one.â€ gina smiled and said , â€œthanks , dad . i accept the rare arrow and the lesson you gave me.â€ and so gina kept the rare arrow , happy with her new possession . it was a sunny morning when the kids went out to the backyard .

" let 's play catch ! " said mary .

just then , the sky suddenly become dark and it started to rain . everyone ran inside , to get away from the unknown rain .

mary 's mom then said , " i have an idea . let 's go for a nut hunt inside , until the rain stops . "

the kids cheered and started scampering everywhere , searching for nuts . they searched in the kitchen , the living room , and the bedrooms , but no nuts were found .

after 20 minutes of searching , the rain still had n't stopped . mary suddenly got an idea and asked , " what if we look outside ? "

her mom replied , " okay , let 's give it a try . "

so the kids collected their umbrellas and went out to the backyard . to their delight , the ground was covered with nuts that the rain had brought .

they all smiled and clapped with joy . what a wonderful surprise from the unknown rain ! once upon a time , there was a huge bear . he was walking through a big , open field . everywhere he went , he sneezed because the air was full of pollen . he thought , " it 's so hard to breathe this way . "

just then , a little bird flew up to him . she said , " hey , bear ! i have the answer to your problem ! up in the sky , there is a lot of oxygen . if you want to breathe better , then you should fly up and get some ! "

the bear thought about this . he knew that he was n't a bird , so he could n't fly . he said , " how can i fly ? i 'm too big and heavy . "

the bird replied , " if you find a really big tree , you can climb up it and then jump into the sky ! the oxygen is up there waiting for you ! "

the bear thanked the little bird and decided to try her plan . he found a huge tree and began to climb it . when he reached the top , he jumped off into the sky . just like the little bird promised , the oxygen was there to help him breathe . the bear thanked the little bird and happily flew off into the big , blue sky . once upon a time , there was a wide river . on the other side of the river , was a distant land , full of wonders . little jack and his friend jessica wanted nothing more than to explore the far away place .

one day , jack 's dad presented him with a passport . without a moment 's hesitation , jack and jessica set off to cross the river . the water was cold , but they were so excited to go , they did n't care .

just as the children reached the center of the river , the current became much stronger . jack was about to thank his dad for the passport , but the current pulled him and jessica too far away .

suddenly , the strong current pushed the children into the deep depths of the river . jack and jessica were never seen again .

the moral of the story is to cherish gifts from family and never take your loved ones for granted . no matter how far you go , they will always be with you in your heart . once upon a time there was a nice lady called maggie . she was very kind and had a special talent - she could give massages . every night , people would come to visit maggie and she would give them lovely massages .

one day , a little girl called lucy was admiring maggie . lucy was only three years old but she wanted to learn how to give massages too . so lucy asked maggie to teach her .

maggie said yes and started teaching lucy . but lucy found it very tricky . she could n't understand maggie 's instructions because maggie was deaf . maggie used sign language to talk .

that 's when maggie realized that lucy could n't hear her . so maggie found a new way to teach the little girl - she used pictures of people getting massages . lucy studied the pictures and soon she was able to give massages too .

maggie was very proud of lucy . she was so pleased that her massage skills had passed on to a new generation ! once there was a little girl called ann who wanted an olive . she asked her dad to get her one , however he said that he did n't have any . ann started to feel sad and began to cry .

her dad looked around , trying to find something that he could give her . he soon noticed that his friend had a big olive tree . he offered to take ann there so she could get an olive .

they walked for a long time until , finally , they reached their destination . ann 's dad asked his friend if she could pick an olive . his friend happily said that she could .

ann was so happy . she carefully went over to the tree and picked the biggest , ripest olive she could find . she was very happy with her reliable friend 's offer and went home with the olive to eat . once upon a time there was a little girl named amy who was very cheerful ! one day amy asked her mom , " mom , can i bake a cake in the oven ? " .

her mom smiled and said , " yes of course , sweetheart . you just need to be careful and take it out when it 's done " .

amy could n't wait to bake her cake ! she put the cake in the oven and waited . after a few minutes , the kitchen started to fill with smoke . amy quickly opened the oven and saw that the cake was burned .

" oh no ! " amy cried . she asked her mom , " mom , did i do something wrong ? "

her mom replied , " yes , amy , you were supposed to check the cake before taking it out of the oven " .

amy felt sad . her cake was ruined and it seemed like she had done something wrong .

amy sadly replied , " okay mom . i 'm sorry " .

even though she was cheerful before , the bad ending to her story left her feeling very unhappy . after school one day , max went to spend time at his grandpa 's house . when he arrived , he noticed something big and white in the garden . it was a tank . max has never seen anything like it before . he wondered why it was in the garden .

max asked his grandpa why there was a tank outside . grandpa told him it was a part of his special collection . he said that a long time ago , he used to mow down trees in a white tank . he said this was like a badge of honor , and he wanted to always recognize and remember it .

max thought it was very strange and he did n't understand why grandpa kept it . he wanted to play with it , but grandpa said no . this made max very unhappy . he knew that he could n't get to play with the tank and he knew it was going to stay in the garden forever . it was a bad ending for max . once upon a time there was a little girl who lived in a far away land . this land was very cold and the little girl did n't like it very much . all she wanted was peace .

one day , the little girl had a great idea . she decided to set off on an adventure ! she went to the mountains , the forests and everywhere she could think of . everywhere she went , she brought a little bit of peace .

at first , the people she met were scared , as the cold was so bad . but when they saw the little girl with peace in her heart , they quickly realized that she meant no harm .

the little girl continued to share her peace with the people she met . everywhere she went , the people soon forgot about the cold . soon , the place was filled with peace , love , and happiness .

the little girl had set off on her adventure looking for peace , and found that giving peace was even better . she had made the world a much better place . once upon a time there lived a little girl called lucy . lucy was only three - years - old , but she wanted to solve a big mystery .

