so that 's what they did . they saved up all of their money and bought the tap . now their house is nice and warm , and they do n't have to worry about the tap anymore . once upon a time there was a little girl who was very excited to explore . she walked through the woods until she came across a cute pond . she knelt down and spotted some sparkling pebbles in the water . full of enthusiasm , she wanted to join them . she extended her arm and tried to grab one of the pebbles , but it was too far away .

