as it turned out , the rabbit was not so friendly . he never made it to grandma 's house and the letter was never delivered ! the lazy mouse had failed his mummy 's task and grandma never received the letter . once upon a time there was a bear named teddy who lived in a village by the cold sea . every day teddy would go for a long walk in search of adventures .

