the brave boy smiled , filled with pride that he had done something nice . he waved goodbye to the snake and went home , happy . once upon a time there was a poor family . one day they heard a knock at the door . when they opened it , there was a carpet seller . he offered to give them a beautiful , soft carpet for their house . the family was very poor and had no money , so the seller said he would give the carpet for free .

