tom wears his new math book in his backpack . he goes to school with a big smile . he shows his new math book to his teacher and his friends . they all say , " wow , tom . what a nice math book . can we see it ? " tom says , " yes , you can . we can do math together . " he opens his math book and starts to count and add and take away . he is very happy . he loves math . anna and ben were playing in their room with their toys . they liked to make up stories with their dolls and cars and animals . sometimes they shared their toys , and sometimes they wanted to have their own .

