she hugged sara . she said , " sara , i know you wanted to design a beautiful picture on the wall . but you were not careful and patient . you made a mistake . you should have left the fly alone . you should have waited for the paint to dry . you should have asked me for help . now , the wall is ruined . we have to fix it . "

