they hold hands and walk to their mom . they leave the bee alone . the bee flies back to its hive and makes more honey . one day , a young boy named tom wanted to have a party . he liked to play with his friends and have fun . he asked his mom if he could invite some friends to his house . his mom said yes , but he had to be careful and polite .

