lily and anna like the puzzle . they work together to find the pieces and make the picture . they talk and laugh and help each other . they forget about the doll and the fight . they feel happy and calm . mom watches them and feels peaceful . she says , " you are good sisters . i love you both . " she comforts them with a hug and a song . lily and anna love mom . they say , " we love you too , mom . " they finish the puzzle and show it to mom . they are proud and glad . they have a good day . tom and anna went to the park with mom . they saw a big tent with a sign that said " circus " . mom bought tickets for them to see the show . tom and anna were very happy . they wanted to see the clowns and the animals .

