they became good friends and visited him often . they learned that he was not so different from them after all . he was just a person who liked to read and have a pet .

the moral of the story is : do n't judge a person by their appearance . you can find a friend in anyone if you are kind and curious . mia and leo were best friends . they liked to play in the park near their homes . one day , they saw a big hill with many trees and flowers . they wanted to climb the hill and see the landscape .

