lily went to school the next day and told her friends about the weird lollipop . they all thought it was funny and wanted to try it too . soon , the broccoli - flavored lollipops became very popular . everyone wanted to taste them ! but lily still did n't like them . she preferred her candy to taste like candy . once upon a time , there was a little boy named timmy . he loved going to the beach and playing in the sand . one day , he saw a big shark swimming in the ocean . timmy was scared at first , but then he got excited and wanted to tell his friends .

when timmy got back to his friends , he told them about the shark he saw . his friends were jealous that they did n't get to see it too . they all decided to go look for the shark together .

as they walked along the beach , they saw something moving in the water . it was the shark ! they all got excited and watched as it swam away . timmy was happy that he got to see the shark and his friends were happy for him . they all went home with big smiles on their faces . once upon a time , there was an old fisherman who loved to go fishing . one day , he went to the river to catch some fish . he caught a lot of fish , but he was tired and decided to take a nap . while he was sleeping , a naughty boy came and stole all his fish .

when the old fisherman woke up , he saw that his fish were gone . he was sad and angry . he asked the other fishermen if they saw the boy who stole his fish , but no one had seen him . then , a little girl came and said , " i saw the boy who stole your fish . he lives in the village . he dressed like a clown . "

the old fisherman went to the village and found the boy . he asked him why he stole his fish . the boy said , " i 'm sorry . i was hungry and did n't have any food . " the old fisherman felt sorry for the boy and gave him some fish . he said , " it 's not good to steal . always ask for help if you need something . " the boy learned his lesson and promised never to steal again . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she liked to go on adventures in the forest . one day , she met a skeleton . the skeleton was very scary , but lily knew it was just a fake one . she laughed and played with the skeleton .

but then , a big bad wolf appeared . the wolf was not fake . it wanted to eat lily and the skeleton . they tried to run away , but the wolf was too fast . it caught them and ate them both . the end . once upon a time , there was a boy named timmy . he loved to play with his toys and build towers out of blocks . one day , he found a big ball and started bouncing it around the room .

suddenly , timmy heard a loud noise . it was his mom calling him for lunch . he quickly ran towards the kitchen , forgetting about the ball .

