but then , he heard the sound of waves coming from outside . his mom took him to the beach where he saw the big , humble waves crashing against the shore . timmy felt much better and realized that sometimes things break , but there are always new and exciting things to discover . once upon a time , there was a little boat named billy . billy loved sailing on the big blue sea . one day , billy saw a bright anchor in the water . he wanted to take a closer look , so he sailed over to it . but when he got too close , the anchor got stuck on billy 's boat ! billy could n't move anymore .

" oh no ! " billy cried . " i ca n't move ! what should i do ? "

just then , a friendly seagull flew by . " do n't worry , billy , " the seagull said . " i can help you . you need to soak the anchor in water . then it will come loose . "

billy followed the seagull 's advice and soaked the anchor in the water . it worked ! the anchor came loose , and billy was able to sail away . he said goodbye to the seagull and continued on his adventure . once upon a time , there was a girl named lily who loved playing with her toys . one day , lily went to her friend 's house to play . her friend had a luxury toy that lily really wanted . she asked her friend if she could play with it , but her friend said no .

lily was sad and did n't know what to do . she thought about taking the toy without asking , but she knew that was wrong . she asked her mom for advice . her mom told her that it 's important to be dependable and not steal things that do n't belong to you .

lily thought about it and decided to talk to her friend again . she told her friend how much she liked the toy and asked if they could share it . her friend agreed , and they had lots of fun playing together . lily learned that it 's always better to talk things out instead of stealing or taking things without permission . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside in the sun , but her mom always told her to come inside at noon for lunch . one day , lily was playing with her friends when they saw a mysterious box in the bushes .

