her friends agreed and they spent the rest of the afternoon pretending to be knights and princesses , using the mysterious toys to protect their kingdom . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to dance and sing . one day , her mom told her that there was going to be a show on the stage at the park . lily was so excited to perform in front of everyone .

when they got to the park , lily saw that the stage was big and beautiful . she felt a little nervous , but her mom told her to relax and have fun . lily took a deep breath and felt better .

as lily was getting ready to go on stage , she saw another girl who had a very modest dress . the girl looked sad and lily asked her what was wrong . the girl said that she was too shy to go on stage . lily told her not to worry and that they could perform together .

lily and the girl went on stage and sang a beautiful song . everyone clapped and cheered for them . after the show , the girl thanked lily for helping her and they became friends . lily felt happy and proud of herself for being brave and making a new friend . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she went to the mall with her mommy . lily loved the mall because there were so many pretty things to look at . she saw sparkly dresses , shiny shoes , and colorful toys .

but suddenly , lily got lost in the mall . she looked around but could n't find her mommy . she felt scared and helpless . she did n't know what to do .

lily tried to remain calm and remembered what her mommy had taught her . she stayed in one place and waited for her mommy to find her . finally , her mommy came and gave her a big hug . lily was so happy to be found and she promised to always stay close to her mommy at the mall . the end . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to play outside in the garden . one day , she saw a butterfly and she was eager to catch it . she ran after the butterfly , but she fell and got a stitch in her knee .

