they learned their lesson . they decided to play nicely from then on . they decided to share and take turns . they decided to be kind and gentle . they decided to respect each other and their things . they decided to have fun with their toys and books . and they decided to love their cushions , even if they were not perfect . tom and sue were friends who liked to play in the park . one day , they saw a big kangaroo near the trees . the kangaroo was brown and had a pouch . tom and sue wanted to see the kangaroo up close , so they ran towards it .

" hello , kangaroo ! " tom said . " can we play with you ? "

the kangaroo looked at them and shook its head . it was not happy . it wanted to sleep . it had a baby in its pouch who was also sleepy . the kangaroo hoped the kids would go away .

" please , kangaroo , let us touch you ! " sue said . " you are so soft and cute ! "

the kangaroo did not like that . it felt scared and angry . it did not want the kids to touch it or its baby . it made a loud noise and kicked its legs . tom and sue were surprised and scared . they ran away from the kangaroo .

the sky was gloomy and dark . it looked like it was going to rain . tom and sue felt sad and sorry . they had made the kangaroo mad . they did not mean to . they just wanted to be friends .

" maybe we should not have bothered the kangaroo , " tom said . " maybe it was tired and wanted to be alone . "

" yes , maybe we should have left it alone , " sue said . " maybe we can come back another day when it is sunny and happy . "

they walked back to their homes , holding hands . they learned a lesson . they learned to respect the kangaroo and its baby . they learned to be careful and kind . they hoped the kangaroo would forgive them and sleep well . lily and max went to the park with mom . they saw a big slide , a swing , and a sandbox . lily wanted to play in the sandbox , but max wanted to go on the slide .

" come on , lily , the slide is fun ! " max said .

" no , i like the sand . you go on the slide , i will make a castle , " lily said .

max ran to the slide and climbed up the ladder . he saw a boy at the top of the slide . the boy had sunglasses on his face . max thought the sunglasses were cool .

" hi , i 'm max . can i try your sunglasses ? " max asked .

the boy looked at max and shook his head . " no , these are mine . you have to pay me if you want them , " the boy said .

" pay you ? how much ? " max asked .

" two cookies , " the boy said .

max did not have any cookies . he only had a banana in his backpack . he did not want to give his banana to the boy . he liked bananas .

" sorry , i do n't have any cookies . can i just try them for a second ? " max asked .

the boy frowned and pushed max away . " no , go away . you are not normal . you do n't have sunglasses , " the boy said .

max felt sad and angry . he did not like the boy . he did not want his sunglasses anymore . he slid down the slide and ran to lily .

" lily , let 's go to the swing . the boy on the slide is mean . he has sunglasses and he wo n't let me try them . he says i 'm not normal , " max said .

lily hugged max and smiled . " you are normal , max . you are my brother and i love you . you do n't need sunglasses to be cool . you are cool without them , " lily said .

max smiled back and hugged lily . " thank you , lily . you are the best sister ever . you are cool too . let 's go to the swing and have fun , " max said .

mom watched lily and max from a bench . she was proud of them . they were kind and happy . they did not need sunglasses to enjoy the park . they had each other . sara and ben were very thirsty . they had been walking in the hot sand for a long time . they wanted to find water and shade . they saw a green spot far away . they hoped it was an oasis .

they ran towards the green spot . they were happy when they saw it was an oasis . there were palm trees , grass , flowers and a pond . they also saw a man sitting under a tree . he had a hat , a beard and a camel .

" hello , sir ! " sara and ben said . they waved to the man . they were polite . they wanted to ask him if they could drink some water and rest under the tree .

the man waved back . he smiled . he said , " hello , children ! you are welcome to my oasis . you can drink some water and rest under the tree . but please , do not touch my camel . he is very shy and does not like strangers . "

" thank you , sir ! " sara and ben said . they drank some water and rested under the tree . they did not touch the camel . they were polite . they wanted to be nice to the man and his camel .

the man was happy . he said , " you are very polite , children . you respect my oasis and my camel . i like you . i have a gift for you . here , take these dates . they are sweet and juicy . they will give you energy for your journey . "

" thank you , sir ! " sara and ben said . they took the dates . they were delicious . they thanked the man again . they said goodbye to him and his camel . they waved to them . they left the oasis . they were happy and grateful .

the moral of the story is : be polite and respectful to others . they will be kind and generous to you . tim and mia were playing in the park . they liked to slide , swing and climb on the equipment . but there was a fat boy who was mean to them . he pushed them off the slide and took their swing . he said they were too small and weak to play .

tim and mia were sad and angry . they wanted to have fun , but the fat boy ruined it . they tried to tell him to stop , but he did not listen . he just laughed and called them names .

one day , a big dog came to the park . he was friendly and liked to run and jump . he saw tim and mia and wagged his tail . he wanted to play with them . but the fat boy did not like the dog . he was afraid of him . he yelled at the dog and threw a stick at him .

the dog did not like that . he barked and chased the fat boy . the fat boy ran away , screaming . he tripped and fell on the ground . he hurt his knee and cried .

tim and mia felt sorry for the fat boy . they went to help him . they gave him a band - aid and a hug . they said they were sorry he was scared . they asked him if he wanted to be their friend .

the fat boy was surprised . he did not expect them to be nice to him . he realized he had been mean to them . he felt ashamed and sorry . he said he was sorry too . he said he wanted to be their friend . he said he would share the equipment and not push them anymore .

tim and mia smiled . they said they were happy to be his friend . they said they would teach him how to play with the dog . they said they would have more fun together .

the dog wagged his tail . he licked the fat boy 's face . he was happy too .

the moral of the story is : do n't be mean to others . be kind and share . you will make more friends and have more fun . sara was sick . she had a bad cough and a sore throat . she did not want to play or eat . she only wanted to sleep .

her mom took her to the doctor . the doctor was an elderly man with white hair and glasses . he looked at sara and said , " you have a cold , little one . you need to take this pill and drink lots of water . it will make you feel better soon . "

sara did not like pills . they were big and bitter . she shook her head and said , " no , thank you . i do n't want the pill . "

the doctor smiled and said , " i know , pills are not fun . but they are good for you . they will help you fight the germs that make you sick . how about this ? if you take the pill , i will give you a sticker . you can choose any sticker you want from this book . there are animals , stars , flowers , and more . do you like stickers ? "

sara loved stickers . she nodded and said , " yes , please . i like stickers . "

the doctor gave her a glass of water and the pill . he said , " good girl . swallow the pill quickly and then you can have your sticker . "

sara did as the doctor said . she swallowed the pill and made a face . it was bitter . but she was brave . she did not cry or spit it out . she said , " i did it . can i have my sticker now ? "

the doctor praised her and said , " you did it . you are very brave and smart . of course you can have your sticker . here , look at the book and pick one . "

sara looked at the book and saw many stickers . she liked them all . but she saw one that made her smile . it was a sticker of a doctor . she pointed at it and said , " i want this one . i want to be a doctor when i grow up . "

the doctor was surprised and happy . he said , " you want to be a doctor ? that 's wonderful . you can help many people and animals . here , take the sticker and put it on your shirt . you are a doctor in training . "

sara took the sticker and put it on her shirt . she felt proud and happy . she said , " thank you , doctor . you are very nice . you made me feel better . "

the doctor hugged her and said , " you are very welcome , sara . you are very nice too . you made me feel happy . now , go home and rest . you will be well soon . "

sara and her mom left the doctor 's office . sara waved at the doctor and said , " bye , doctor . see you soon . "

the doctor waved back and said , " bye , sara . see you soon . " he smiled and thought , " maybe one day , she will be a doctor too . " tom is a musician . he likes to play the guitar and sing songs . he plays music for his friends and family . they clap and smile when they hear him .

one day , tom goes to the park with his mom . he sees a big tree with a hole . he hears a sound from the hole . it is a bird . the bird is hurt . it has a broken wing . tom feels sad for the bird .

" mom , can we help the bird ? " tom asks .

" sure , tom . we can care for the bird . but we have to be quiet . the bird is scared , " mom says .

they take the bird home . they put it in a box with some water and seeds . tom plays his guitar softly for the bird . he sings a gentle song . the bird listens and relaxes . it starts to chirp along .

" look , mom . the bird likes my music . it is happy , " tom says .

" yes , tom . you are a good musician and a good friend . the bird is lucky to have you , " mom says .

they hug and smile . they care for the bird until it is well . then they take it back to the park and let it fly away . the bird thanks them with a song . tom and mom wave goodbye . they are happy too . lily and tom were eager to see the new baby . they had waited a long time for their mom to come home from the hospital . they heard the car in the driveway and ran to the door .

" mom , mom , can we see the baby ? " they shouted .

mom smiled and carried a small bundle in her arms . she sat on the couch and opened the blanket . lily and tom stared at the baby 's face . they had never seen anything like it .

the baby had a lot of hair , but it was not brown like lily 's or blond like tom 's . it was red , like fire . the baby also had a tiny nose , big ears , and green eyes . lily and tom felt a shock in their chests . they did not know what to say .

" say hello to your brother , max , " mom said . " he is very special and he loves you very much . "

lily and tom looked at mom and then at the baby . they did not understand why he was so different . but they saw that he was cute and he smiled at them . they decided to give him a chance .

" hi , max , " lily said softly . she touched his hair gently . " you have pretty hair . "

" hi , max , " tom said bravely . he tickled his ears . " you have funny ears . "

max giggled and reached for their fingers . lily and tom felt a warm feeling in their hearts . they realized that they loved him too .

they hugged mom and the baby . they were eager to play with him and teach him new things . they were happy to have a new brother . ben and lily are friends . they like to play and laugh together . one day , they find a big book in the library . the book has many jokes inside . ben and lily want to read the jokes and make each other laugh .

" can we read this book , please ? " ben asks the librarian .

" yes , you can , but be careful . the book is very thick and heavy . do n't drop it or hurt yourself , " the librarian says .

ben and lily take the book to a table . they open the book and start to read the jokes . they read jokes about animals , food , colors , and more . they giggle and snort at the funny words and pictures .

" listen to this one , lily . what do you call a fish that wears a bow tie ? " ben says .

" i do n't know , ben . what do you call it ? " lily says .

" a so - fish - ticated fish ! " ben says .

lily laughs so hard that she falls off her chair . ben laughs too and helps her get up .

" that was a good joke , ben . do you have another one ? " lily says .

" yes , i do . what do you get when you cross a snowman and a vampire ? " ben says .

" i do n't know , ben . what do you get ? " lily says .

" frostbite ! " ben says .

lily and ben laugh again . they have so much fun reading the jokes . they forget about the time and the book . they do n't see the librarian coming to their table .

" excuse me , children . it 's time to close the library . you have to return the book now , " the librarian says .

" okay , we will . thank you for letting us read the book . it was very funny , " ben and lily say .

they give the book back to the librarian . they say goodbye to each other and go home . they are happy and tired . they dream of more jokes and more laughs . sara and ben are twins . they like to play dress - up with their mom 's clothes . one day , they find a big purple hat in the closet . sara puts it on her head and says , " look at me , i am a queen ! "

ben laughs and says , " no , you are not a queen . you are a clown ! the hat is too big for you . it does not fit your head . it falls over your eyes . "

sara feels sad and takes off the hat . she says , " you are mean , ben . i like the hat . it is pretty and purple . you are just jealous . "

ben says , " i am not jealous . i am bored . let 's play something else . how about we put on a show for mom and dad ? we can sing and dance and make them happy . "

sara thinks for a moment and says , " okay , that sounds fun . but i want to wear the hat . it is part of my costume . "

ben says , " fine , you can wear the hat . but you have to let me wear the red scarf . it is part of my costume . "

sara agrees and they put on their costumes . they go to the living room and tell mom and dad to sit on the couch . they say , " we have a special show for you . please watch and enjoy . "

mom and dad smile and say , " we are ready . we ca n't wait to see your show . "

sara and ben start to sing and dance . they make funny faces and silly noises . they twirl and jump and clap . mom and dad watch and laugh . they think sara and ben are very cute and talented .

when sara and ben finish their show , they bow and say , " thank you , thank you . we hope you liked our show . "

mom and dad stand up and applaud . they say , " we loved your show . you are both amazing . you are our stars . "

sara and ben feel happy and proud . they hug mom and dad and say , " we love you too . you are our best audience . "

they all go to the kitchen and have some cookies and milk . they talk about their show and their costumes . sara says , " i like my purple hat . it makes me feel like a queen . "

ben says , " i like my red scarf . it makes me feel like a hero . "

mom and dad say , " we like your purple hat and your red scarf . they make you look like yourselves . you are our queen and our hero . " sam likes to play on the beach . he likes to dig in the sand and make castles . he likes to splash in the water and look for shells . he likes to watch the birds and the boats .

one day , sam sees a crab on the beach . the crab is small and red . it has two big claws and many legs . sam thinks the crab is funny and cute . he wants to play with the crab .

sam runs to the crab and says hello . the crab is scared of sam . it thinks sam is big and loud . it wants to hide in the sand . the crab speeds away from sam . it runs very fast on its legs .

sam chases the crab . he thinks it is a game . he wants to catch the crab and hold it . he runs very fast on his feet . he laughs and shouts .

the crab sees a hole in the sand . it is the crab 's home . the crab runs to the hole and jumps in . it is safe and cozy . the crab is happy .

sam reaches the hole . he looks in and sees the crab . he is sad . he ca n't play with the crab anymore . he says bye to the crab . he hopes the crab is happy too .

sam goes back to his castle . he decides to make a new friend . he makes a crab out of sand . he gives it two big claws and many legs . he makes it small and red . he thinks it is original and cool . he is proud of his crab . he plays with his crab and smiles . he is happy . tom and lily liked to play in the garden . they liked to run and jump and hide . one day , they saw a big vine on the wall . it had many green leaves and purple flowers .

" look , a vine ! " tom said . " let 's climb it and see what 's on the other side . "

lily was not sure . she looked at the vine and said , " it looks too high and thin . i do n't think it 's fit for climbing . we might fall and hurt ourselves . "

tom did not listen . he said , " do n't be scared . it will be fun . i 'll go first and show you . " he grabbed the vine and started to pull himself up .

lily watched him and said , " be careful , tom . the vine might break . "

tom did not hear her . he climbed higher and higher . he felt proud and brave . he wanted to see the top of the wall . he did not notice that the vine was getting weaker and weaker .

suddenly , the vine snapped . tom screamed and fell . he landed on the ground with a thud . he felt pain in his arm and leg . he cried and cried .

lily ran to him and said , " oh , tom , are you okay ? i 'm sorry , i 'm sorry . i told you the vine was not fit for climbing . "

tom looked at her and said , " i 'm sorry , too . i should have listened to you . you were right . the vine was not fit for climbing . it was not worth it . i did not value your advice . "

lily hugged him and said , " it 's okay , tom . i forgive you . you are my brother and i love you . come on , let 's go inside and get some help . maybe mom can make you feel better . "

they walked inside , holding hands . they learned a lesson that day . they learned to value each other and to be careful with vines . lily and ben were playing hide and seek in the park . lily was the seeker and ben was the hider . lily counted to ten and then opened her eyes . she looked around and saw a big tree , a slide , a swing and a bench . where could ben be ?

she ran to the tree and looked behind it . no ben . she ran to the slide and looked under it . no ben . she ran to the swing and looked on it . no ben . she ran to the bench and looked over it . no ben . she was getting dizzy from running so much .

she heard a giggle from behind the bench . she turned around and saw ben 's feet sticking out . she smiled and shouted , " i found you , ben ! you ca n't hide from me ! "

ben crawled out from behind the bench and laughed . " you 're good , lily ! but i have a surprise for you . come with me ! "

he took her hand and led her to the edge of the park . there was a big road with many cars and buses and bikes . that was traffic . ben pointed to a big sign on the other side of the road . it said , " happy birthday , lily ! "

lily gasped and clapped her hands . she was so happy . she did n't know ben had made a sign for her . he had hidden it behind the bench and waited for her to find him . he had revealed his surprise .

" thank you , ben ! you 're the best friend ever ! " lily said and hugged him .

" you 're welcome , lily ! you 're the best friend ever , too ! " ben said and hugged her back .

they watched the traffic for a while and then went back to the park to play some more . they had a lot of fun on lily 's birthday . lila and ben were curious kids . they liked to explore new places and find new things . one day , they saw a big boat near the beach . they wanted to go on the boat and see what was inside .

they asked their mom if they could go on the boat . their mom said no . she said the boat was not safe and they could get lost or hurt . she told them to play on the sand and not go near the water .

but lila and ben did not listen . they waited until their mom was busy and they ran to the boat . they climbed on the boat and looked around . they saw a lot of ropes and boxes and barrels . they also saw a big wheel and a map .

" look , ben , this is a map of an island ! " lila said . she pointed to a picture of a green and blue land with palm trees and flowers . " maybe there is treasure on the island . let 's go there ! "

ben nodded . he liked treasure . he took the map and held it in his hand . he also took a rope and tied it to the wheel . he thought he could steer the boat like a captain .

they did not know that the boat was old and broken . they did not know that the wind was strong and the waves were high . they did not know that the island was far and dangerous .

they pushed the boat away from the beach and into the water . they laughed and cheered as the boat moved . they did not hear their mom calling them . they did not see her crying and running after them .

the boat went faster and faster . the water splashed and rocked the boat . the rope snapped and the wheel spun . the map flew away and the boat lost its way .

lila and ben were scared . they hugged each other and cried . they wished they had listened to their mom . they wished they had stayed on the sand .

the boat hit a big rock and broke . lila and ben fell into the water . they tried to swim but they were too tired and cold . they sank into the deep and dark water .

they never saw the island . they never found the treasure . they never came back to the beach .

the moral of the story is : listen to your mom and do n't go on a boat without permission . it was a cold season . tom and sue wore hats and coats when they went outside . they liked to play in the snow and make snowmen . one day , they saw a small bird on the ground . it was not moving .

" look , tom , a bird ! " sue said . " is it sleeping ? "

tom shook his head . " no , sue , it is not sleeping . it is hurt . maybe it is hungry and cold . we have to help it . "

tom and sue picked up the bird gently and took it to their house . they put it in a box with some hay and a bowl of water . they gave it some bread crumbs and seeds . the bird opened its eyes and chirped softly .

" hello , bird , " tom said . " we are tom and sue . we want to be your friends . we will take care of you until you are better . "

the bird nodded and ate some food . it looked happier and warmer . tom and sue smiled . they had saved the bird . they were happy too .

they named the bird cheap , because they had found it for free . they played with cheap every day . they taught it some words and songs . cheap learned fast and sang back . tom and sue loved cheap very much .

when the season changed and the snow melted , cheap was strong and healthy again . tom and sue knew that cheap wanted to fly and be with other birds . they were sad , but they also wanted cheap to be happy .

they took cheap to the park and opened the box . cheap flew out and circled around them . it landed on tom 's shoulder and kissed his cheek . it landed on sue 's hand and nipped her finger . it said , " thank you , tom and sue . you are good friends . i will miss you . "

tom and sue hugged cheap and said , " you are welcome , cheap . you are a good friend too . we will miss you . but we are glad you are free . fly high and be safe . "

cheap flew away and joined a flock of birds . it looked back and waved its wing . tom and sue waved back and smiled . they had saved cheap , and cheap had saved them . they had learned a lot from each other . they had shared a special season . sara and tom are playing with paper and scissors . they want to make snowflakes for the window . sara cuts a big circle from the paper . tom cuts a small circle . sara says , " my snowflake will be bigger than yours . "

tom says , " no , my snowflake will be prettier than yours . " he folds his circle in half and then in half again . he cuts some shapes from the edges . sara does the same with her circle . they unfold their circles and look at their snowflakes .

sara 's snowflake is big and has four points . tom 's snowflake is small and has eight points . they are both very nice . sara says , " your snowflake is small , but it has more points than mine . it is very pretty . " tom says , " your snowflake is big , but it has less points than mine . it is very nice . "

they smile at each other and nod . they are happy with their snowflakes . they glue them on the window . they look at the snow outside . they say , " we made snowflakes like the ones in the sky . " they hug and go to play with their toys . sara and tom are playing in the living room . they see a telephone on the table . sara picks it up and puts it to her ear .

" hello , hello , who is this ? " she says .

tom laughs and takes the other end of the telephone . he pretends to be a lion .

" roar , roar , i am a big , wide lion . i want to eat you ! " he says .

sara screams and drops the telephone . she runs to the sofa and hides behind a pillow .

" tom , you are not a lion . you are my brother . you are silly and mean ! " she says .

tom feels sorry . he puts down the telephone and goes to the sofa . he hugs sara and says sorry .

" sara , i am sorry . i was just playing . i do not want to eat you . i love you . do you want to play something else ? " he says .

sara smiles and hugs tom back . she questions him .

" what do you want to play , tom ? " she says .

tom thinks and says .

" let 's play with the blocks . we can build a house for the lion and the girl . they can be friends . " he says .

sara likes the idea . she takes tom 's hand and they go to the blocks . they play happily and forget about the telephone . ben and mia like to play in the pool . they have a big blue ball that they throw to each other . sometimes they pretend that the ball is a shark and they have to swim away from it .

one day , they see a new toy in the pool . it is a small gray shark that can move by itself . it has a button on its back that makes it turn on and off . ben and mia are curious and want to try it .

" can we play with the shark , mom ? " ben asks .

" sure , but be careful . it might bite you , " mom says , joking .

ben and mia laugh and take the shark to the shallow end of the pool . they turn it on and watch it swim around . they take turns holding it and feeling its fins and teeth .

" it feels real , " mia says .

" it is not real . it is a toy , " ben says .

they decide to play a game with the shark . they throw the blue ball to the deep end of the pool and then turn the shark on . they pretend that the shark is chasing the ball and they have to save it .

" ready , set , go ! " ben shouts .

they both dive into the water and swim as fast as they can . they see the shark moving closer to the ball . they try to reach it before the shark does .

" got it ! " mia yells , grabbing the ball .

" good job ! " ben says , swimming next to her .

they turn around and see the shark following them . they scream and laugh and swim back to the shallow end . they turn the shark off and hug the ball .

" that was fun , " ben says .

" that was scary , " mia says .

they look at the shark and smile . they like their new toy . they think it is cool and fun . they want to play with it again . lila and tom are playing in the park . they see a big dog with a red collar . the dog is friendly and wags its tail . lila and tom want to pet the dog , but they are not sure if they can .

" can we say hello to your dog ? " lila asks a lady who is holding a leash .

" sure , his name is spot . he likes children . but you have to ask him first . hold out your hand and let him sniff it . then you can pet him gently . " the lady says .

lila and tom do what the lady says . they hold out their hands and let spot sniff them . spot licks their hands and wags his tail more . lila and tom smile and pet spot 's fur . spot is soft and warm .

" can we shake his paw ? " tom asks .

" yes , you can . hold his paw and say ' shake ' . he will lift it up and down . " the lady says .

lila and tom try to shake spot 's paw . they hold his paw and say ' shake ' . spot lifts his paw up and down . lila and tom giggle and clap their hands .

" good boy , spot ! " they say .

spot is happy and barks . he wants to play more . he sees a ball on the ground and runs to get it . he brings it back to lila and tom and drops it in front of them . he looks at them with alert eyes and waits for them to throw it .

" let 's play fetch with spot ! " lila says .

" ok , i 'll throw the ball and you catch it , spot ! " tom says .

lila and tom take turns throwing the ball and spot runs to catch it . he brings it back every time and shakes his head . he makes lila and tom laugh and have fun . they play with spot until it is time to go home .

" bye , spot ! thank you for playing with us ! " lila and tom say .

" bye , lila and tom ! thank you for being nice to spot ! " the lady says .

lila and tom wave to spot and the lady . they hold their thumbs up and say ' good job ' . they walk back to their mom and dad , who are waiting for them . they tell them about their new friend , spot , and how they learned to shake his paw . mom and dad are proud of them and hug them . they all go home happy . sara and tom like to play pretend . they have many toys and costumes . sometimes they become animals . they roar like lions , hop like rabbits , or fly like birds .

one day , they find a new costume in the closet . it is a big , gray elephant suit . sara wants to try it on . she puts on the suit and the trunk . she feels very big and strong . she says to tom , " look at me ! i am an elephant ! i can stomp and spray water ! "

tom is not impressed . he thinks sara is too loud and bossy . he says , " you are not a real elephant . you are just a girl in a suit . you are not modest . you are proud and rude . "

sara is hurt by tom 's words . she does not want to be proud and rude . she wants to be a good friend . she takes off the suit and the trunk . she says to tom , " i am sorry . i was just having fun . i did not mean to be mean . can we play something else ? "

tom sees that sara is sorry . he feels bad for being harsh . he says to sara , " i am sorry too . i was just jealous . you looked so cool in the suit . can we share it ? "

sara smiles and nods . she says , " yes , we can share it . we can take turns being the elephant . or we can be other animals . we can have fun together . "

they hug and make up . they decide to be modest and kind . they play pretend and become animals . they are happy . lily and sam were playing in the park . they saw a white bird on a tree . it was a dove . the dove had a brilliant ring on its neck . it sparkled in the sun .

