tom ran inside the house to hide . he looked for a safe place . he saw the chimney and thought it was a good place to hide . tom climbed into the chimney , but it was dark and dirty . he did not like it in there . he wanted to get out .

tom 's friend , a little girl named sue , heard tom crying . she knew he was scared . sue came to help tom . she reached into the chimney and pulled tom out . tom was happy to be out of the chimney . the big bird flew away , and tom was safe . tom and sue hugged , and they played together all day . once upon a time , there was a big black dog named max . max loved to move and play outside . one day , max went to the park to have some fun .

at the park , max saw a calm cat named lily . lily was sitting on a bench , watching the birds . max wanted to be friends with lily , so he walked over to her . " hi , i 'm max . do you want to move and play with me ? " max asked .

lily looked at max and said , " okay , max . i will play with you . " together , they moved and played all day . they ran , jumped , and had lots of fun . max and lily became best friends , and they played at the park every day . one day , a little cat named kitty felt an urge to escape her house . she wanted to see what was outside . so , she opened the door and went out into the big world .

kitty saw a little bird on a tree . the bird said , " hi kitty , what are you doing outside ? " kitty replied , " i wanted to escape my house and see the world . " the bird said , " that 's fun ! let 's play together ! "

after playing , kitty felt tired and wanted to go back home . she told the bird , " i had fun , but i want to go home now . " the bird said , " okay , kitty . see you again soon ! " kitty went back home , happy that she had a fun day outside . once upon a time , there was a little penguin named pippin . pippin lived in a cold place with lots of ice and snow . he had many friends , but pippin loved to dance more than anything else .

one day , pippin found a wild party in the middle of the ice . there were many animals at the party , all having fun and playing games . pippin was so happy to see the party , and he knew he wanted to dance with his friends .

pippin started to dance with his friends , and they all had a great time . they danced and danced until they were tired . pippin was the best dancer of them all , and everyone loved watching him dance . at the end of the party , pippin and his friends went home , happy and tired from their wild dancing adventure . one day , a boy named tim and his friend , sue , went to the park . they saw a wide field and wanted to play a game . they chose to play tag . tim and sue ran around , laughing and having fun .

tim said , " i am going to get you ! " sue paused for a moment and said , " no , you wo n't ! " they kept playing their game , running and laughing .

as they played , the sky began to get dark . tim and sue knew it was time to go home . they said goodbye and promised to play more games tomorrow . and when tomorrow came , they had even more fun than before . one day , a little dog named spot was very excite . he was going to have a big sausage for lunch . spot loved sausages more than anything in the world . he could not wait to eat it .

spot 's mom told him to be careful with the sausage . it was very hot and could be dangerous . spot listened to his mom and waited for the sausage to cool down . he did not want to get hurt .

when the sausage was safe to eat , spot took a big bite . it was so yummy ! he was so happy to have his favorite food for lunch . spot knew that listening to his mom was a good idea . once upon a time , in a far away land , there was a little girl named mia . she loved to run and play with her friends . one day , mia saw a lost dog . the dog was sad and did not know where to go . mia wanted to help the dog find its home .

mia and the dog walked around the land . they asked people if they knew the dog 's home . no one knew where the dog lived . mia and the dog kept looking . they walked and walked until they found a house with a picture of the dog on the door .

mia knocked on the door . a lady opened the door and saw the dog . she was so happy and grateful to see her dog . she thanked mia for helping find her dog . mia felt good that she was able to help . the dog was happy to be home , and mia made a new friend . tim and jen are twins . they like to play in the snow . they put on their coats , hats , boots and gloves . they go outside with their mom .

" look , mom , snowman ! " tim says . he points to a big snowman in the park . the snowman has a carrot nose , a scarf and a hat .

" can we play with the snowman , mom ? " jen asks . she likes the snowman 's smile .

" sure , but be careful . do n't break the snowman , " mom says . she sits on a bench and watches them .

tim and jen run to the snowman . they say hello to him . they touch his nose , his scarf and his hat . they hug him . they are happy .

but then , tim sees something . he sees a glove on the ground . it is red and open . it looks like the snowman 's glove .

" hey , jen , look ! the snowman lost his glove ! " tim says . he picks up the glove .

" oh no , poor snowman ! he must be cold ! " jen says . she feels sorry for the snowman .

" let 's give him back his glove , jen . come on , march with me ! " tim says . he holds the glove in his hand . he starts to march to the snowman .

" okay , tim , i 'm coming . march , march , march ! " jen says . she follows tim . they march to the snowman .

they reach the snowman . they see his hand . it is white and bare . they put the glove on his hand . they smile .

" there , snowman , now you have your glove . you are warm and cozy , " tim says . he pats the snowman 's hand .

" thank you , tim and jen . you are very kind and helpful , " the snowman says . he winks at them .

tim and jen are surprised . they hear the snowman talk . they look at each other . they look at mom . mom smiles and nods .

" wow , the snowman can talk ! how cool ! " tim says .

" yes , he can . he is a magic snowman . he likes to make friends , " mom says .

" can we be your friends , snowman ? " jen asks .

" of course , you can . you are my friends . you made me happy , " the snowman says .

tim and jen are happy too . they hug the snowman again . they laugh and play with him . they have fun in the snow . lily and ben are brother and sister . they like to play with their ball in the yard . they pass the ball to each other and laugh .

one day , a big dog comes to the yard . the dog is black and furry . he barks loud and runs fast . lily and ben are scared . they drop the ball and run to the house .

" mommy , mommy , there is a big dog in the yard ! " lily cries .

mommy comes out and sees the dog . she is not scared . she knows the dog . his name is max . he is their neighbor 's dog . he is friendly and likes to play .

" max , come here , boy ! " mommy calls . max stops barking and runs to mommy . he wags his tail and licks her hand .

" see , lily and ben , this is max . he is not a bad dog . he just wants to play with you and your ball . he is fine , " mommy says .

lily and ben come out of the house . they are still a little scared . mommy holds their hands and walks to max . max sniffs them and wags his tail . he is happy to see them .

" hi , max , we are lily and ben . do you want to play with us and our ball ? " lily asks .

max barks and nods . he likes lily and ben . he likes their ball .

lily and ben smile . they are not scared anymore . they pick up their ball and pass it to max . max catches it and passes it back . they play and laugh . they are friends . ben and lily were playing in the living room with their toys . they liked to make noises and pretend they were cars , planes , or animals . they had a lot of fun together , but sometimes they also fought over the toys .

one day , they noticed a cord on the floor . it was long and black and had a plug at the end . they wondered what it was for and where it went . they decided to follow the cord and see .

they crawled on the floor and pulled the cord with them . they did not see that the cord was connected to a lamp on the table . as they moved the cord , the lamp wobbled and fell . it made a loud crash and broke into pieces . ben and lily were scared and stopped .

mom heard the noise and came to see what happened . she saw the broken lamp and the cord in ben and lily 's hands . she was angry and sad . she said , " what did you do ? you broke the lamp ! that was a gift from grandma ! you should not play with cords , they are dangerous ! you could get hurt or start a fire ! "

ben and lily felt sorry and ashamed . they said , " we are sorry , mom . we did not know . we were curious . we wanted to see where the cord went . we did not mean to break the lamp . "

mom sighed and hugged them . she said , " i know you did not mean to , but you have to be careful . cords are not toys . they are for electricity . electricity can be good , but it can also be bad . it can hurt you or damage things . you have to ask me or dad before you touch anything with a cord . do you understand ? "

ben and lily nodded and said , " yes , mom . we understand . we will not touch cords again . we will ask you or dad first . we are sorry for breaking the lamp . we love you and grandma . "

mom smiled and said , " i love you too , ben and lily . i forgive you . but you have to help me clean up this mess . and you have to say sorry to grandma too . she will be sad to see her lamp broken . "

ben and lily agreed and helped mom pick up the pieces of the lamp . they also noticed a smelly smell in the room . it was from the lamp . they did not like the smelly smell . they learned their lesson . they learned that cords are not toys , and that curiosity can be good , but it can also be bad . they learned to be more careful and respectful of other people 's things . they learned to say sorry when they make a mistake . they learned to listen to mom and dad . they learned a lot from the cord . tom and sam are friends . they like to play with trucks in the park . tom has a big red truck . sam has a small blue truck . they make noises and drive their trucks on the grass .

one day , they see a new boy in the park . he has a yellow truck . but his truck is not like tom 's or sam 's . his truck can spin . he pushes a button and his truck spins around and around . it makes a funny sound . tom and sam stop playing and watch the yellow truck .

" wow , that truck is cool ! " tom says . " i want to try it . "

" me too ! " sam says . they run to the new boy and ask him if they can play with his truck .

the new boy shakes his head . " no , this is my truck . you ca n't touch it . go away . "

tom and sam feel sad and angry . they are jealous of the yellow truck . they want to have a truck that can spin too .

they go back to their trucks and try to make them spin . but they ca n't . their trucks only go forward and backward . they do n't have a button to make them spin .

they look at the new boy again . he is still spinning his truck and laughing . he does n't want to share or make friends .

tom and sam decide to ignore him . they say to each other , " we do n't need his truck . we have our own trucks . and we have each other . we are still friends . "

they smile and hug . then they go back to playing with their trucks . they make noises and drive their trucks on the grass . they have fun . they are happy . sara and ben like to play with model cars . they have many cars of different colors and sizes . they can attach wheels , doors and stickers to make their cars look cool . they are very creative .

one day , sara and ben decide to make a big model car together . they find a big cardboard box and cut out windows and a windshield . they attach four plastic plates as wheels and a paper plate as a steering wheel . they paint the box red and add some stickers .

" wow , our car is awesome ! " sara says . " let 's go for a ride ! "

" ok , but i want to be the driver ! " ben says .

" no , i want to be the driver ! " sara says .

they both grab the paper plate and pull hard . they start to argue and shout .

" let go , it 's my turn ! "

" no , it 's mine , you had it yesterday ! "

they pull so hard that the paper plate rips in half . they both fall back and drop their pieces . they look at their car and see that the windshield is torn and the stickers are peeling off .

they feel sad and sorry . they look at each other and say :

" i 'm sorry , i was mean . "

" me too , i was selfish . "

they hug and make up . they decide to share the car and take turns driving . they fix the windshield and the stickers . they smile and hop in their car .

" ready , set , go ! " they say together .

they push their car around the room and pretend to go on adventures . they have fun and are happy . they are good friends . jazz was a cat who loved to play with his toys . he had a ball , a mouse , and a feather that he chased around the house . he was very happy and excited when his human came home from work and gave him a hug and a treat .

one day , jazz saw a new toy on the table . it was shiny and round and had a string . jazz was curious and wanted to play with it . he jumped on the table and pawed at the toy . it made a funny noise and moved . jazz was scared and ran away .

" jazz , come here ! " his human called . " that 's not a toy , that 's my necklace . it 's very special to me . i remember when my mom gave it to me for my birthday . it 's very pretty and i love it . please do n't play with it , okay ? "

jazz felt sorry and came back to his human . he rubbed his head against her hand and purred . he did not want to make her sad or angry . he loved her very much .

" i 'm sorry , jazz , " his human said . " i know you were just curious . you 're a good cat and i forgive you . but you have to be careful with things that are not yours . here , let me give you your feather . you can play with that instead . it 's your favorite , right ? "

jazz nodded and took the feather . he was happy and excited again . he forgot about the necklace and played with his feather . he had a lot of fun and his human smiled and watched him . they were both happy and loved each other . tom and lily were playing in the park . they saw a big tree with many apples . they wanted to pick some apples , but the tree was too high .

" look , there is a ladder ! " tom said . he pointed to a wooden ladder leaning on the tree . " let 's use it to get some apples ! "

lily was scared . she did not like the ladder . it looked old and weird . it had many cracks and holes . " i do n't want to use the ladder , tom . it might break . it is not safe . "

tom did not listen to lily . he wanted the apples . he climbed the ladder . he reached for an apple . but then , the ladder snapped . tom fell down . he hurt his arm and leg . he cried .

lily ran to tom . she hugged him . she said , " i 'm sorry , tom . are you okay ? "

tom was in pain . he said , " no , i 'm not okay . i was silly . i should have listened to you . you were right . the ladder was not safe . "

lily saw a man walking by . he had a basket of apples . he saw tom and lily . he felt sorry for them . he said , " hello , kids . do you want some apples ? i have plenty . i picked them from another tree . it is safer and nicer . you can have some if you want . "

tom and lily looked at the man . he smiled . he offered them some apples . they said , " thank you , sir . you are very kind . "

the man said , " you 're welcome , kids . but remember , be careful when you play . and listen to your friends . they might know better than you . "

tom and lily learned a lesson . they thanked the man again . they ate the apples . they were sweet and juicy . they felt better . they went home . they told their mom what happened . she was glad they were okay . she hugged them . she said , " i love you , tom and lily . you are good kids . but next time , be more careful , okay ? "

tom and lily said , " okay , mom . we love you too . we will be more careful . " they smiled . they were happy . they had a good day . lily and ben are friends . they like to play with blocks and dolls . one day , they have a problem . lily wants to build a big tower with the blocks , but ben wants to make a train . they both grab the same block and pull .

" mine ! " lily says .

" no , mine ! " ben says .

they pull harder and harder . the block breaks in two . lily and ben are very sad . they drop the pieces and start to cry .

they are frustrated . they do n't want to play anymore .

a teacher sees them and comes to help . she picks up the pieces and gives one to each child .

" look , you can still play with the blocks . you can make something new . why do n't you share and work together ? " she says .

lily and ben look at each other . they wipe their tears and nod . they say sorry to each other .

they start to build a new thing with the blocks . they use the broken piece as a bridge . they make a train that goes over the bridge . they also make a tower that has a flag on top .

they are happy . they smile and laugh . they hug each other .

they are friends . they like to play with blocks and dolls . sara loves to play dress - up with her costumes . she has a fairy costume , a pirate costume , a princess costume and a doctor costume . she likes to pretend she is different people and have fun .

one day , she wants to wear her fairy costume , but she sees a big rip in the wing . she is sad and cries . she shows her mom the rip and asks if she can fix it .

" mom , can you repair my fairy costume ? it has a rip and i want to play with it , " sara says .

mom looks at the rip and smiles . she says , " do n't worry , sara . i can repair your fairy costume . it will be easy . i just need some thread and a needle . you can help me if you want . "

sara nods and wipes her tears . she says , " yes , i want to help you , mom . thank you for repairing my fairy costume . "

mom and sara go to the sewing box and find some thread and a needle . mom shows sara how to thread the needle and how to stitch the rip . sara watches and tries to do the same . they work together until the rip is gone .

mom says , " there , we did it . your fairy costume is repaired . you can wear it now and play with it . "

sara hugs mom and says , " thank you , mom . you are the best . my fairy costume is pretty again . i love it . "

sara puts on her fairy costume and flaps her wings . she feels happy and says , " i am a fairy . i can fly and do magic . watch me , mom . "

mom watches sara and claps . she says , " you are a pretty fairy , sara . you can fly and do magic . i am proud of you . "

sara smiles and says , " thank you , mom . i love you . "

they hug and play together . sara has fun with her fairy costume . she is glad mom repaired it . one day , a modest duck went to the pond to swim and play . he liked the water and the sun , but he did not like to show off or brag . he was happy with his feathers and his quack , and he did not want to bother anyone .

but there was another duck at the pond , who was not modest at all . he was loud and rude , and he always wanted to be the best . he had shiny feathers and a loud quack , and he liked to make fun of the other ducks .

" look at me , i am the fastest duck in the pond ! " he said . " no one can catch me or beat me . you are all slow and boring . especially you , modest duck . you are so plain and dull . why do n't you run away and hide ? "

the modest duck felt sad and hurt by the mean duck 's words . he did not want to fight or argue , but he also did not want to run away . he wanted to stand up for himself and his friends .

so he said , " i may not be the fastest duck , but i am not afraid of you . you are not the best , you are just the meanest . you should be nice and kind , not loud and rude . why do n't you run away and learn some manners ? "

the mean duck was surprised and angry by the modest duck 's words . he did not like to be challenged or told what to do . he wanted to show the modest duck who was the boss .

so he said , " how dare you talk to me like that , modest duck ? you are so weak and silly . i will show you who is the boss . i will chase you and bite you and make you run away . "

and he ran towards the modest duck , with his wings flapping and his beak snapping .

but the modest duck was not weak or silly . he was brave and smart . he knew the pond and the plants and the rocks . he knew how to swim and dodge and hide .

and he ran away from the mean duck , with his feet splashing and his quack laughing .

he ran behind a reed , and the mean duck missed him . he ran under a lily , and the mean duck lost him . he ran around a rock , and the mean duck crashed into it .

the mean duck was tired and sore and confused . he could not catch or beat the modest duck . he realized he was not the fastest or the best . he was just the meanest and the worst .

he felt ashamed and sorry for his words and actions . he wished he could be nice and kind , like the modest duck .

so he said , " i am sorry , modest duck . you are not plain and dull . you are brave and smart . you are a good duck and a good friend . can you forgive me and teach me how to be modest ? "

the modest duck heard the mean duck 's words . he saw the mean duck 's face . he felt the mean duck 's change .

and he said , " i forgive you , mean duck . you are not weak and silly . you are strong and honest . you can be a good duck and a good friend . i can teach you how to be modest . "

and he ran towards the mean duck , with his wings open and his quack friendly .

and they ran together to the pond , to swim and play and learn . they became friends and shared their feathers and their quacks . they were happy and modest , and they did not bother anyone . one day , a boy named tom went to the park with his mom . he saw a big monkey on a tree . he wanted to play with the monkey , so he jogged to the tree and said , " hello , monkey ! can i be your friend ? "

the monkey looked at tom and said , " no , you ca n't . you are too small and slow . i only play with big and fast animals . go away , little boy ! "

tom felt sad and hurt . he jogged back to his mom and told her what the monkey said . his mom hugged him and said , " do n't listen to the monkey , tom . he is not nice . he is rude and mean . you are a good boy , and you can make many friends who are kind and fun . size and speed do n't matter . what matters is your heart and your smile . "

tom smiled and said , " thank you , mom . you are right . i do n't need the monkey . i have you and other friends who love me . "

just then , he saw a girl his age playing with a ball . he jogged to her and said , " hello , i 'm tom . can i play with you ? "

the girl smiled and said , " sure , i 'm anna . i like your shirt . it has a star on it . "

tom and anna played with the ball and had a lot of fun . they became friends and shared their snacks . the monkey watched them from the tree and felt lonely and jealous . he wished he had been nicer to tom and learned to share and care .

the moral of the story is : do n't judge others by their appearance . be kind and friendly to everyone . you never know who might become your friend . ben and mia liked to play with water . they had a big spray bottle that they filled with water . they took turns to spray each other and laugh . sometimes they sprayed the plants and the birds too .

one day , they saw a big building with many colors and shapes . it was a temple . they wanted to see what was inside . they walked to the door and peeked . they saw people praying and singing . they saw statues and candles and flowers .

they were curious , but they were also respectful . they did not spray the people or the statues or the candles or the flowers . they only sprayed each other and laughed quietly . they did not want to disturb the temple .

the people in the temple saw them and smiled . they were happy to see the children having fun . they invited them to join them and learn about the temple . ben and mia agreed . they were eager to learn new things .

they left their spray bottle outside the door . they knew it was safe there . they knew they could come back and play with it later . they had a dependable spray bottle . it was their favorite toy . tim and kim are twins . they like to play with their toys . but sometimes they fight over them . one day , they both want the same tap . the tap is light and makes funny sounds when you turn it .

tim says , " i saw the tap first . it is mine . " kim says , " no , i want the tap . it is mine . " they pull the tap from each other . the tap breaks . they hear a loud bang . they see water coming out of the tap . they are scared .

mom hears the noise . she runs to the room . she sees the water and the broken tap . she is angry . she says , " what did you do ? you broke the tap . you made a mess . you are naughty . " she sends them to their beds . she says , " you have to say sorry and share your toys . or you will have no toys . "

tim and kim feel bad . they do not like to make mom angry . they do not like to break the tap . they do not like to go to bed . they say sorry to each other . they say sorry to mom . they hug and kiss . they promise to share their toys . mom is happy . she says , " i love you . you are good . " she gives them a new tap . the tap is light and makes funny sounds when you turn it . tim and kim are happy . they play with the tap together . they do not fight . they are friends . lily and ben were playing in the park . they liked to swing , slide and run . but today , it was very hot and sunny . they felt weak and thirsty .

" can we go home , mom ? " lily asked . " i want some water and a nap . "

" not yet , sweetie , " mom said . " we have to wait for dad . he is coming soon . "

lily and ben sat on a bench under a big tree . they saw a man selling ice cream . they wanted some , but mom said no . she said ice cream was not good for them when they were weak .

" look , mom , look ! " ben said . he pointed to a palm tree near the ice cream man . " what is that ? it has big green leaves and a long brown trunk . "

" that is a palm tree , ben , " mom said . " it grows in warm places . it has fruits called dates . they are sweet and chewy . "

" can we have some dates , mom ? " lily asked . " maybe they will make us strong . "

mom smiled . she walked to the palm tree and picked some dates . she gave one to lily and one to ben . they bit into them and felt the juice in their mouths .

" mmm , these are good , mom , " lily said . " thank you . "

" you 're welcome , my loves , " mom said . " now , let 's remain here and eat our dates . dad will be here soon . then we can go home and have some water and a nap . " tom liked to help his mom bake cakes . he liked to watch the mixer go round and round and make the batter smooth and fluffy . he liked to lick the spoon and taste the sweet and yummy cake mix .

one day , his mom asked him to get the mixer from the cupboard . tom was happy and ran to the cupboard . he saw the mixer on the shelf and reached for it . but he was too short and could not grab it . he tried to jump and stretch , but he still could not get it .

he saw a chair nearby and had an idea . he pushed the chair to the cupboard and climbed on it . he was now tall enough to reach the mixer . he smiled and grabbed the handle . but he did not see the cord that was hanging from the shelf . he pulled the mixer and the cord came with it . the cord got tangled around his arm and made him lose his balance . he fell off the chair and the mixer fell on the floor .

tom was scared and hurt . he cried and called for his mom . his mom heard him and ran to him . she saw him on the floor with the mixer and the cord . she was worried and hugged him . she checked him for any cuts or bruises . she saw that he was not badly hurt , but he was very sad .

she said , " i 'm sorry , tom . you were trying to help me , but you had an accident . it 's okay , accidents happen sometimes . you are a brave and good boy . i love you very much . "

she kissed him and helped him up . she picked up the mixer and the cord and put them away . she said , " let 's go to the kitchen and bake a cake together . you can help me with the eggs and the flour and the sugar . and you can twist the knob to turn on the oven . how does that sound ? "

tom nodded and smiled . he said , " i love you , mom . and i love cake . "

they went to the kitchen and baked a cake together . they had fun and forgot about the accident . they ate the cake and it was delicious . tom was happy and so was his mom . tim and lily liked to play with puzzles . they had many puzzles with different pictures . some had animals , some had cars , some had flowers . they liked to find the pieces that matched and make the picture complete .

one day , they found a new puzzle in their toy box . it was a big puzzle with many pieces . the picture was of a castle with a dragon and a princess . tim and lily were excited . they wanted to make the castle and see the dragon .

they started to put the pieces together on the floor . they found the corners and the edges first . then they looked for the pieces with the castle walls and the towers . they worked hard and had fun .

" look , lily , i found the dragon ! " tim said . he held up a piece with a green and red dragon . it had big teeth and wings . " it looks scary ! "

" wow , tim , it does look scary ! " lily said . she held up a piece with a princess . she had a pink dress and a crown . " but look , i found the princess ! she looks nice ! "

" maybe the princess can make the dragon nice too , " tim said . he put the dragon piece next to the princess piece . " maybe they can be friends . "

" i do n't know , tim , " lily said . " do you think dragons can be friends with princesses ? "

" i believe they can , " tim said . " if they are kind and share and say sorry . just like us . "

lily smiled . she liked tim 's idea . she believed it too . they finished the puzzle and admired their work . they saw the castle , the dragon , and the princess . they looked happy and regular .

" let 's play with the puzzle , " tim said . " you can be the princess and i can be the dragon . "

" ok , tim , " lily said . " but you have to be a nice dragon , ok ? "

" ok , lily , " tim said . " i will be a nice dragon . and you have to be a nice princess , ok ? "

" ok , tim , " lily said . " i will be a nice princess . and we can have fun . "

they played with the puzzle and had fun . they made up stories and adventures . they were kind and shared and said sorry . they were friends . lily liked to play with her dolls in her room . she had many dolls , but her favorite was anna . anna had long hair and a blue dress . lily liked to brush anna 's hair and make her look pretty .

one day , lily found a mirror in her closet . it was a big mirror with a golden frame . lily had never seen it before . she wondered who put it there . she thought it was mysterious . she decided to take the mirror out and put it on the floor .

