they smiled and pulled the train together . they had fun and made new noises . they were happy and forgot their anger . they had a new friend and a new adventure . they liked sundays . sara was a brave girl who liked to help her mom . one day , her mom was very sad because her favorite tray was broken . the tray had pretty flowers and birds on it , and her mom used it to serve tea and cookies . sara wanted to make her mom happy again , so she had an idea .

