ben and mia enjoy playing with the car and the truck . they trade them again and again . they make noises and stories . they have fun . they are good friends . lila and max are friends . they like to play at the beach . they have a big towel to seat on . they also have a bucket and a shovel to make sand castles .

one day , a new girl comes to the beach . her name is mia . she has a pink towel and a pink bucket and a pink shovel . she seats next to lila and max . she says , " hi , i 'm mia . can i play with you ? "

