sam looked at the goose . it was still busy , swimming and honking and flapping its wings . he felt sorry for the goose and for himself . he said , " sorry , goose . i wo n't touch you again . you are very pretty , but not very friendly . " lily was a small girl who liked to play with her toys . she had a doll , a ball , a car and a coat . she loved her coat . it was red and soft and warm . she wore it every day , even when it was not cold .

