mom did not know what to do . she had to go to work soon . she had no time to clean up or to buy milk . she felt uncomfortable and stressed . she wished tommy would stop complaining and be a good boy . she wished she had some milk . lily was a little girl who liked to dream . every night , she dreamed of being a sailor on a big boat . she dreamed of seeing the sea , the fish , the birds , and the stars . she dreamed of having adventures and making friends .

