in her dream , she was happy and free . she smiled and waved at tom , who was stuck on the shore with his small boat . she said , " i 'm not too little or too silly to be a sailor . i 'm a dreamer , and dreams can come true . " lily liked to play with her dolls . she had many dolls , but her favorite was anna . anna had long hair and a pretty dress . lily liked to brush anna 's hair and make her look nice .

