lily , anna , and elsa played massage for a long time . they massaged each other 's hair and said nice things to each other . they felt happy and calm . they were a happy family of dolls and friends . lily and ben were having lunch with their mom and dad . they liked to eat sandwiches and fruit and drink juice . mom and dad told them to use napkins to wipe their mouths and hands . napkins are soft and white and help to keep things clean .

but lily and ben did not listen . they thought napkins were boring and silly . they threw their napkins on the floor and laughed . they made a big mess on the table and on their clothes . they were not quiet at all . they were loud and rude .

