mom and dad smiled and hugged lily and ben back . they said they loved them too and they were proud of them for learning their lesson . they said that napkins are not boring and silly , but helpful and nice . they said that being quiet and kind is better than being loud and rude . they said that lunch is more fun when everyone is happy and clean . tim and kim are twins . they like to play in the park . they see a big rail . it is shiny and hard . they want to climb on it .

