a lady sees them . she is kind . she comes to help . she says , " stop crying . stop fighting . you are twins . you should be nice to each other . the rail is not for playing . it is for trains . it is dangerous . come with me . i have some band - aids and cookies . you can share them and be friends again . "

tim and kim listen to the lady . they say sorry to each other . they hug . they follow the lady . they get some band - aids and cookies . they feel better . they are happy . they thank the lady . they learn a lesson . they do not play on the rail again . anna and ben were twins who loved to go to the harbor with their dad . they liked to see the big boats and the fish and the birds . sometimes they would help their dad sell fish at his stall . they always had fun at the harbor .

