when they got to the theater , they found their seats and waited for the show to start . the lights went down and the music played . then , a man came on the stage . he had a big smile and a shiny cane . he said , " hello , everyone ! i am mr. cane , and i am here to entertain you with my magic cane . are you ready to have some fun ? " the audience said , " yes ! " and clapped their hands .

