the reindeer laughs and nuzzles them . he is happy . he likes to play and win . he likes sam and mia . they are his new friends . anna loves kittens . she has a big book with many pictures of kittens . she likes to look at the book and say the names of the kittens . she likes the black kitten , the white kitten , the orange kitten , and the striped kitten . but her favorite kitten is the one with spots . she thinks it is very unique .

