the kitten purrs and rubs its head on anna 's cheek . it likes anna . it likes the book . it likes being unique . anna and the kitten become friends . anna 's mom sees them and smiles . she thinks they are very cute . she lets anna take the kitten home . anna and the kitten are very happy . they have a lot of fun together . they read the book , play with toys , and nap on the couch . they are very unique . tim and sam are brothers . they like to play with cars and balls . but they do not like to share . one day , they have a big fight over a red car . tim wants the car , but sam has it first .

