they dug a hole in the sand and put some shells inside . " this is our secret stash ! " mia said . " we have to hide it from the bad guys ! "

they covered the hole with more sand and a big leaf . then they heard a loud noise . it was their mom , calling them for lunch .

" come on , kids , it 's time to eat ! " she said . " you can play more later ! "

ben and mia ran back to the ship . they grabbed their toys and put them inside . they wanted to keep them safe .

