they put zoomy next to the new car and made them zoom together . they had twice as much fun and joy . they learned that new things are not always better than old things , and that they should be grateful for what they have . they also learned that sharing is caring and that friends are forever . lily and ben were at the zoo with their mom . they liked to see the animals and learn their names . they saw lions , monkeys , bears , and many more . but their favorite animal was the elephant .

