they hug and say sorry . they decide to play something else . they look for a ball or a swing . they do not touch the powder again . they are good friends . they are successful . lily was a chubby bunny who loved to eat carrots . she ate so many carrots that she did not have room for anything else . she did not like to share her carrots with her friends , and she did not like to play with them either . she just wanted to eat and eat and eat .

