she hoped her uncle would get it . she hoped he would open it . she hoped he would see her sun . she hoped he would smile and laugh . she hoped he would paint with her again . she hoped he would be gentle with her . she hoped he would love her . lily and ben were playing in their room . they had many toys , but they liked to play with the pillows best . they made a big fort with the pillows and pretended to be kings and queens .

