they play together with the car . they become friends . they find something better than a toy . they find each other . lily and tom were twins who liked to play with their toys . one day , they found a big cloth in the closet . it was soft and colorful and had many shapes on it . they decided to use it as a blanket for their dolls and stuffed animals .

