they finished sewing the cloth . they looked at it and smiled . it was not as good as before , but it was still soft and colorful and had many shapes on it . they learned to be gentle and kind with their things and with each other . they decided to use the cloth as a scarf and wrapped it around their necks . they felt warm and happy . tom and lily were playing catch with a ball in the park . they liked to throw the ball high and far and run after it . sometimes they missed the ball and it rolled away . then they had to chase it before someone else took it .

one time , tom threw the ball very hard and it flew over a fence . lily ran to the fence and saw a big dog on the other side . the dog had the ball in its mouth and was growling . lily was scared and called tom .

