the doctor checked lily 's stomach . he said she had a bruise , but it was not bad . he gave her a band - aid and a sticker . he told her to be more careful and not to run on the floor with toys . lily said she was sorry and thanked him . she learned her lesson . she quit being careless and started to put away her toys . she did not want to hurt her stomach again . she wanted to play safely and happily . sara and tom were playing with blocks . they wanted to make a big tower . sara had a red block . tom had a blue block . they tried to put their blocks on top of each other , but they did not fit . sara said , " my block is better . it is red like fire . fire is hot and strong . your block is bad . it is blue like water . water is cold and weak . " tom said , " no , my block is better . it is blue like the sky . the sky is high and wide . your block is bad . it is red like blood . blood is scary and ouchy . " they both were stubborn . they did not want to share or trade their blocks .

they pushed and pulled their blocks . they made loud noises . they made the tower fall down . the blocks went everywhere . some blocks hit sara and tom . they both cried . they both felt sorry . they both said , " i 'm sorry . i was mean . i like your block . can we be friends ? " they hugged each other . they picked up their blocks . they decided to make a new tower . they used both red and blue blocks . they made the tower fit . they made the tower beautiful . they were happy . they learned to play nice . lily and max were going on vacation with mom and dad . they were eager to see the big blue sea and the yellow sand . they packed their bags with toys , books , and clothes . they said goodbye to their dog , spot , and got in the car .

