one day , a new girl comes to his school . her name is mia . she is very thin and has no snacks . she sits next to tim in class . tim does not like her . he thinks she is too quiet and boring .

at lunch time , tim takes out his snacks and starts to eat . he has cookies , chips , candy , and juice . he sees mia sitting alone with a sandwich and water . he thinks she is very poor and sad . he feels a little sorry for her .

he decides to offer her some of his snacks . he thinks she will be happy and grateful . he walks over to her and says , " hey , do you want some of my snacks ? i have a lot . you can have some . "

mia looks at him and smiles . she says , " thank you , but no thank you . i do n't like snacks . they are too sweet and salty . they make me sick . i like my sandwich and water . they are healthy and good for me . "

tim is shocked and angry . he thinks she is rude and stupid . he says , " fine , suit yourself . you do n't know what you are missing . snacks are the best . you are the worst . " he walks away and eats his snacks by himself .

the next day , tim feels very sick . he has a stomach ache and a headache . he ca n't go to school . he stays in bed and cries . he thinks he ate too many snacks . he wishes he had a sandwich and water . he thinks of mia and wonders if she is at school . he feels a little sorry for himself . tom and lily want to give mom a gift for her birthday . they find a big box and some paper with flowers . they also find a ribbon and a card .

they put the gift in the box and try to wrap it with the paper . but the paper is too big and they have to cut it . they use scissors and be careful . they tape the paper around the box and make it look nice . then they tie the ribbon on top and make a bow . they write " happy birthday mom " on the card and stick it on the box .

they are very proud of their gift . they want to show mom how much they love her . they run to the living room where mom is reading a book . they shout " surprise ! " and give her the box . mom is very happy and hugs them . she opens the box and sees a mug with their pictures on it . she says " thank you , tom and lily , this is the best gift ever ! "

tom and lily smile and say " you 're welcome , mom , we made it for you ! " they are glad that mom likes their gift . they sit with her and drink some juice from the mug . they have a fun and cozy time together . they love mom and mom loves them . ben and lily were twins who liked to play with their toys . but sometimes they fought over who got to play with what . one day , they saw a shiny bottle on the table . it was their mom 's wine . they wanted to see what was inside .

