their mom heard the noise and came to see what happened . she was very angry and sad . she said , " what did you do ? this was my special wine . it was a gift from your grandma . you broke it and wasted it . you are very naughty and careless . go to your room and shut the door . you are in big trouble . "

ben and lily felt sorry and scared . they ran to their room and shut the door . they cried and hugged each other . they said , " we are sorry , mom . we did n't mean to break your wine . we were just curious . we love you and grandma . please forgive us . "

they learned a lesson that day . they learned to respect their mom 's things and not to touch what was not theirs . they also learned to share their toys and not to fight . they realized that being kind and gentle was better than being harsh and greedy . they hoped that their mom would forgive them and love them again . tommy was sad . he missed his mom and dad . they went away for a long time . he stayed with his grandma and grandpa . they were nice , but they were not his mom and dad .

one day , tommy heard a loud noise outside . he ran to the window . he saw a big car with a lot of bags on it . he looked closer . he recognized the car . it was his mom and dad 's car . he was so happy . he jumped up and down . he shouted , " mom ! dad ! "

he ran to the door . he opened it . he saw his mom and dad get out of the car . they smiled . they saw him . they ran to him . they hugged him and kissed him . they said , " we missed you so much , tommy . we are back . we love you . "

tommy was not sad anymore . he was very happy . he hugged them and kissed them back . he said , " i missed you too , mom and dad . i love you . " he went inside with them . he showed them his toys and his drawings . he told them what he did with his grandma and grandpa . he was glad they were home . he felt safe and warm . he was a happy boy . tom and lily were playing in the garden with their water guns . they liked to soak each other and laugh . they also liked to soak their dog , spot , who was harmless and friendly . spot liked to chase them and shake his wet fur .

