" okay , mom . thank you , mom , " tom and lily said , smiling . they ran to the shed and got some towels . they dried themselves and their dog . then they went inside and had lunch . and maybe watched some television later . lily liked to sing songs . she sang when she woke up , when she ate , when she played and when she went to bed . she sang loud and happy . she sang about the sun , the moon , the stars and the flowers . she sang about her toys , her friends , her family and her dreams .

but her brother max did not like her songs . he said they were too noisy and silly . he said they hurt his ears and his head . he said they made him angry and sad . he said she should stop singing and be quiet . he said he was older and smarter and he knew better .

one day , max had a plan . he took lily 's yellow hat , her favorite hat , and hid it under his bed . he said he would only give it back if she promised to never sing again . lily was very sad and scared . she loved her hat and she loved to sing . she did not know what to do .

