lily and max listened to mom . they said sorry and hugged each other . max gave back lily 's yellow hat . lily thanked him and put it on . she said she would sing softly and not too often . max said he would listen sometimes and not be mean . they smiled and played together . they learned to be happy and kind . mom was proud and happy . she sang a song with them . they all sang loud and happy . lily was a curious girl who liked to explore . one day , she saw a big puddle in the park . she wanted to know what it felt like to splash in it . she ran to the puddle and jumped in with both feet . she laughed as the water splashed on her legs and shoes .

but she did not see that her scarf was dragging behind her . her scarf dipped into the puddle and got very wet . it soaked up the water like a sponge . lily did not notice until she felt something heavy and cold around her neck . she pulled on her scarf and saw that it was dripping with water .

she was surprised and a little sad . she liked her scarf . it was pink and soft and warm . she did not want it to be wet and cold and heavy . she wondered if it would ever be dry and fluffy again . she took off her scarf and wrung out the water . she looked for a sunny spot to lay it down .

she found a bench near a flower bed . she spread her scarf on the bench and hoped that the sun would dry it soon . she decided to wait and watch her scarf . she was curious to see how it would change . she hoped it would be pink and soft and warm again . she smiled and hummed a song . she was happy to have a scarf and a puddle and a sunny day . one day , lily and tom were playing hide and seek in the garden . lily was the seeker and tom was the hider . tom ran behind a big bush and found a hole in the fence . he crawled through the hole and saw a new place . it was a field with many flowers and trees . he saw something shiny under a leaf . he picked it up and saw that it was a button . it was an enormous button , bigger than his hand . it was red and shiny and had four holes .

tom was very happy with his find . he thought it was a treasure . he wanted to show it to lily , but he also wanted to win the game . he decided to hide the button under his shirt and go back to the garden . he crawled through the hole again and ran to another bush . he waited for lily to find him .

lily was looking for tom everywhere . she looked under the table , behind the swing , in the shed , but she could not find him . she was getting tired and bored . she wondered where tom was hiding . she decided to look in the field behind the fence . she saw the hole and went through it . she saw the flowers and the trees and the button . she recognized the button . it was her grandma 's button . she had lost it yesterday when she was playing with her grandma 's coat . she was very sad because her grandma loved that button . it was a gift from her grandpa .

lily picked up the button and hugged it . she was very happy to find it . she wanted to thank tom for finding it for her . she ran back to the garden , holding the button . she saw tom hiding behind a bush . she shouted , " i found you , tom ! and i found my grandma 's button ! thank you , thank you , thank you ! "

