the tree is hollow . there is a cozy nest of pillows and blankets . there are books and crayons and puzzles . there are also two teddy bears . one is blue and one is pink . tom and lily smile . they hug the teddy bears . they say thank you to mom and dad .

tom and lily play in the tree . they share the toys . they read and draw and solve puzzles . they are quiet and happy . they feel a deep peace in their hearts . they do not fight anymore . mom and dad are proud . they watch them from the window . they say they love them . tom and lily were playing with their toys in the living room . they had a lot of fun making noises and pretending to be animals . tom was a lion and lily was a zebra . they chased each other around the couch and the table .

