tom and lily looked at her with big eyes . they knew they were in trouble . they did not say anything . they hoped their mom would not be too mad at them . they learned their lesson . they would never drink mom 's tea again . tom is a boy who likes to play with his toys . he has a car , a ball , a bear and a tap . the tap is his favorite toy . he likes to turn it on and off and watch the water come out . he thinks the water is magic .

one day , tom is playing with his tap in the garden . he turns it on and off and on and off . he laughs and splashes the water . he sees a rainbow in the water . he thinks the rainbow is pretty . he wants to touch it .

