he runs after the frog . the frog hops away . tom follows the frog . he tries to catch it . he thinks the frog is his new friend . he forgets about the tap and the rainbow . he has a new game . he is happy . lisa likes to play with her dolls . she has many dolls with different clothes and names . she pretends they are her friends and talks to them . sometimes she makes them have tea parties or go to school .

