one day , lily saw a big box in the living room . she asked her mom , " what is in the box ? " her mom said , " it is a surprise for dad . he is coming home soon from work . do you want to help me open it ? " lily nodded and ran to the box .

they opened the box and saw a new armchair . it was blue and soft and had a pillow . lily 's mom said , " this is a gift for dad . he works very hard and he likes to sit and read in the armchair . he will love this one . it is very comfortable . "

