ben and lily nodded . they still missed the kite , but they felt a little better . they followed mom to the car . they hoped the kite was happy too . anna likes to design things . she draws with crayons and cuts with scissors . she makes cards and hats and dolls . she is very good at design .

one day , anna finds a poppy in the garden . a poppy is a red flower with a black middle . anna thinks it is very pretty . she wants to design something with it . she picks the poppy and takes it to her room .

she puts the poppy on a card and glues it . she thinks it looks nice . she wants to show it to her mom . she runs to the kitchen with the card .

but when she gets there , she sees that the poppy is not red anymore . it is brown and dry . the petals are falling off . the poppy is dead . anna is very upset . she starts to cry .

mom hears anna and comes to see what is wrong . she sees the card and the poppy . she hugs anna and says , " i 'm sorry , sweetie . poppies are very delicate . they need water and sun to stay alive . when you pick them , they die quickly . you ca n't design with them . "

