they hold hands and walk to the garden . they look for flowers that they can design with . they have fun and make beautiful things . anna is happy again . lily and tom were friends who liked to play in the garden . they had a lot of fun with the flowers , the bugs and the swing . one day , they saw a big basket of apples on the porch . they were red and shiny and looked very yummy .

