" we have the best mom and the best garden in the world ! " tom was a bad man . he had a big mustache and a big car . he liked to speed on the road and make loud noises . he did not care about other people or animals . he only cared about himself .

one day , tom saw a little dog on the road . the dog was lost and scared . tom did not stop to help the dog . he wanted to speed and have fun . he laughed and drove faster . he did not see the big truck coming from the other side .

the truck driver saw tom and the dog . he was a good man . he loved animals . he tried to slow down and honk his horn . he wanted to warn tom and save the dog . but it was too late . tom was going too fast . he could not stop or turn . he crashed into the truck with a big bang .

the truck driver and the dog were okay . they had some bumps and bruises , but they were alive . the truck driver got out of his truck and ran to the dog . he hugged the dog and said , " do n't worry , little one . you are safe now . i will take you home and be your friend . "

tom was not okay . he was hurt and trapped in his car . he could not move or speak . he could only see his big mustache and his big car . he could only hear his loud noises and his laugh . he could only feel his pain and his fear . he wished he had stopped to help the dog . he wished he had been a good man . but it was too late . he had speeded and he had paid . lily and ben are twins . they like to play with toys . but they do not like to share . they always want the same toy . they are competitive .

one day , mom gives them a big box . she says it is a space ship . they can go to the moon and the stars . lily and ben are happy . they want to play with the space ship .

but they do not agree on how to play . lily wants to be the captain . she wants to press the buttons and make the noises . ben wants to be the captain too . he wants to steer the ship and look out the window . they start to fight . they pull and push and yell .

mom hears them . she is not happy . she says they have to stop fighting . she says they have to take turns . she says they have to give each other space . she says they have to be nice .

lily and ben do not listen . they keep fighting . they do not see the cat . the cat is curious . the cat jumps on the box . the box breaks . the space ship is gone .

lily and ben are sad . they cry . they wish they had listened to mom . they wish they had shared . they wish they had given each other space . they hug and say sorry . they decide to play something else . they are not competitive anymore . here is one possible story , but there are many other ways to write it .

anna and ben are friends . they like to play in the park . one day , they see a big brown pie on a table . it smells good . they want to eat it .

" let 's have some pie , " anna says .

" no , we ca n't , " ben says . " it is not ours . it is for someone else . "

" but i am hungry , " anna says . " and it looks yummy . "

she runs to the table and takes a big bite of the pie . ben follows her and tries to stop her .

" stop , anna , stop ! " he says . " you are being bad . you are taking what is not yours . "

but anna does not listen . she eats more and more of the pie . she makes a mess . she gets pie on her face and her clothes .

then , they hear a voice .

" hey , what are you doing ? " the voice says . " that is my pie . i made it for my grandma . she is sick and i wanted to make her happy . "

anna and ben look up . they see a boy standing by the table . he looks angry and sad . he is holding a basket and a card .

anna and ben feel sorry . they know they did something wrong . they say sorry to the boy .

" we are sorry , " they say . " we did not know . we were hungry and the pie looked good . we are very sorry . "

the boy looks at them . he sees the pie on their faces and clothes . he sees the hole in his pie . he feels bad for his grandma . but he also feels sorry for anna and ben . he knows they are just kids .

he says , " it 's okay . i forgive you . but you should not take things that are not yours . it is not nice . and you should not waste food . it is not good . "

he gives them a napkin and helps them clean up . he says , " do you want to help me make another pie for my grandma ? i have some more ingredients in my basket . we can share it with her . maybe she will feel better . "

anna and ben nod . they say , " yes , please . we want to help . we want to make your grandma happy . "

they follow the boy to his house . they help him make another pie . they make it big and brown and yummy . they write a card for his grandma . they say , " we are sorry for eating your pie . we hope you like this one . we hope you get well soon . we are your new friends , anna and ben . "

they take the pie and the card to his grandma . she is lying in bed . she looks tired and pale . but when she sees the pie and the card , she smiles . she says , " thank you , thank you . you are very kind . you made my day . come , sit with me . let 's have some pie together . "

they sit with her and have some pie . they talk and laugh . they become friends . they learn a lesson . they are happy . tom has a big white dog . his dog is very soft and thick . he likes to hug his dog and play with him . his dog is his best friend .

one day , tom goes to the park with his dog . he sees a girl with a red ball . the girl is sad . she says she lost her dog . she has no one to play with . tom feels sorry for the girl .

tom has an idea . he says to the girl , " do you want to play with my dog ? i can lend him to you for a while . he is very nice and fun . he likes to chase balls and run around . " the girl smiles . she says , " thank you , tom . that is very kind of you . i would love to play with your dog . "

tom and the girl play with the dog and the ball . they have a lot of fun . the dog is happy too . he likes to make new friends . he wags his tail and barks .

after a while , the girl says , " tom , i have to go home now . thank you for lending me your dog . he is the best dog ever . you are a good friend . " tom says , " you are welcome . i am glad you had fun . maybe we can play again another day . " the girl says , " yes , that would be nice . bye , tom . bye , dog . " she waves and leaves .

tom hugs his dog and says , " you are a good dog . you made the girl happy . i am proud of you . " the dog licks tom 's face and says , " woof , woof . " they go home together . they are happy . tim and jen were playing with magnets in their room . they liked to stick them on the fridge , the door , and the toys . they made funny shapes and noises with them .

