he unlocked the door and hugged tim and jen . they were still scared , but they forgave sam . they knew he was their brother and he loved them . they hugged him back and said , " it 's okay , sam . we love you too . but do n't scare us again . it 's not nice . "

they went back to playing with their magnets , and sam joined them . he helped them make more cars and other things . they had fun together , and they were happy . they learned to be honest and kind with each other . anna and ben are friends . they like to play together . one day , anna wants to play with ben at his house . she walks to his door and knocks .

