they watch the butterfly . they follow it with their eyes . they wonder where it will go .

they are happy . they are friends . they are proud . sara and ben like to play in the snow . they make snowmen and snowballs and snow forts . they have fun and laugh a lot . but sara has a secret . she has a new scarf that is very pretty and soft . she does not want ben to see it or touch it .

