but the snowball hits sara 's coat and makes her fall . her coat opens and her scarf comes out . ben sees the scarf and thinks it is very pretty and soft . he wants to touch it and see how it feels . he does not know it is sara 's secret .

he runs to sara and picks up the scarf . he says , " wow , what a nice scarf ! can i try it on ? " he does not wait for sara to answer . he puts the scarf around his neck and smiles . he thinks he looks good .

sara is angry and sad . she sees ben with her scarf and feels like he stole it . she does not want him to have it . she wants it back . she gets up and runs to ben . she says , " give me my scarf ! it is mine ! you ca n't have it ! " she does not ask nicely . she pulls the scarf from ben 's neck and tries to take it .

but ben does not let go . he likes the scarf and wants to keep it . he says , " no , it is mine ! you ca n't have it ! " he does not share . he pulls the scarf from sara 's hands and tries to keep it .

they both pull and pull and pull . the scarf is not strong . it ca n't take the pulling . it starts to tear . it makes a loud sound . they both hear it and stop . they look at the scarf and see what they did . they see a big hole in the middle . they see the threads coming out . they see the pretty and soft scarf is ruined .

they both feel bad . they both feel sorry . they both wish they did not pull . they both wish they did not fight . they both wish they were nice .

they look at each other and say , " i 'm sorry . " they mean it . they hug and make up . they decide to share the scarf and fix the hole . they decide to be friends and have fun . they learn a lesson . they are happy . ben likes to dive in the pool . he likes to feel the water on his face and body . he likes to see the bubbles and the fish . he likes to play with his friends and his toys .

one day , ben sees a shiny thing at the bottom of the pool . he thinks it is a coin or a ring . he wants to get it and show it to his mom . he dives deep and reaches for the shiny thing .

but the shiny thing is not a coin or a ring . it is a razor . it is sharp and it cuts ben 's hand . ben feels a lot of pain and he cries . he lets go of the razor and swims up to the surface . he sees blood in the water and he is scared .

his mom hears him cry and runs to him . she sees his hand and she is worried . she wraps his hand in a towel and hugs him . she tells him he is brave and she loves him . she takes him to the doctor to fix his hand .

the doctor is nice and gentle . he cleans ben 's hand and puts a bandage on it . he gives ben a sticker and a candy . he tells ben to be careful and not to touch razors . he says razors are for grown - ups and they are dangerous .

ben nods and says he is sorry . he says he will not dive for shiny things anymore . he says he will only dive for fish and toys . he says he does not like razors . he says they are bitter and they hurt . he says he likes candy and stickers . he says they are sweet and they make him happy . anna and ben love to ride the bus with mom . they sit by the window and look at the cars and trees and people . mom gives them each a ticket to hold . the ticket is bright and has numbers and letters on it .

when the bus stops at their place , mom says , " time to get off . give me your tickets . " anna and ben remove their tickets from their hands and give them to mom . mom puts them in her pocket . they say thank you to the bus driver and get off the bus .

they walk to the park and see a big slide and a swing and a sandbox . anna and ben run to the slide and take turns going down . they laugh and have fun . mom watches them and smiles . she is happy they have their tickets . they are good for another ride . anna and ben like to play in the garden . they dig in the soil with their hands and find worms and stones . they make a big pile of soil and pretend it is a mountain . they laugh and have fun .

one day , they hear a noise in the soil . it sounds like a small voice . they listen very carefully and hear it again . " hello , hello , can you hear me ? " the voice says . anna and ben are curious . they dig more and more until they see a tiny fairy . she has wings and a dress and a wand . she is cheerful and friendly .

