flora smiles and waves her wand . she says some magic words and then a lot of flowers and butterflies and birds appear in the garden . they are all alive and can talk and play . anna and ben are delighted . they thank flora and hug her . they make new friends and play with them in the garden . they are very cheerful and grateful . they never forget flora and the magic soil . tim and sam are friends . they like to play with cars and balls . but today , they have a fight . tim wants the red car and sam wants the blue car . they both say , " mine ! " and pull the cars hard .

" stop it ! " says mom . " you have to share . you can take turns with the cars . " but tim and sam do not listen . they keep pulling the cars and yelling . they are rude .

then , tim pulls the blue car so hard that it hits sam 's head . sam cries and drops the red car . tim grabs the red car and runs away . sam runs after him and tries to get the red car back .

mom sees them and is angry . she takes the cars away and puts them in a box . she says , " no more cars for you today . you have to say sorry to each other and be nice . fighting is bad . "

tim and sam feel sad . they do not like to fight . they say sorry to each other and hug . they say , " we are friends . we do not want to be rude . " mom smiles and gives them a cookie . she says , " that 's better . now you can play with something else . how about the blocks ? " tim and sam nod and go to play with the blocks . they are happy . tom and lily like to play in the park . they like to swing , slide and run . one day , they see a big dog in the park . the dog is black and has sharp teeth . it barks loud and runs fast .

