they wished they had never counted the apples . they wished they had never seen the dog . they wished they had a different snack . they wished they had a different story . sam liked to play with his toy rocket . he pretended it could fly to space and see new things . he made zoom and blast sounds with his mouth . he put his rocket on the floor and ran around it .

